ies',14,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 11:45:17','2026-05-07 11:45:17'),(17,'Plumbing & Pumps','plumbing-pumps',NULL,NULL,'categories/xPZDsrJhHhDdhdAC8PGUQA4V33Aipun9MMxkjh8Z.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,9,'2026-05-07 11:59:25','2026-05-27 13:25:38'),(18,'Bathtubs & Showers','bathtubs-showers',17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:02:06','2026-05-07 12:02:06'),(19,'Modular Acoustic Screens','modular-acoustic-screens',4,'Modular acoustic screens help reduce noise levels in indoor construction sites and other industrial facilities. Screens are suspended from a reliable tubular frame, and adjacent screens can velcro together. Various sizes are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:02:54','2026-05-07 12:02:54'),(20,'Reflective Insulation & Vapor Barrier','reflective-insulation-vapor-barrier',4,'Reflective insulation and vapor barriers are designed for residential, post-frame, light gauge steel and commercial insulation applications. The reflective insulation is engineered to increase energy efficiency and most models are bird',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:03:49','2026-05-07 12:03:49'),(21,'Underslab Concrete Insulation & Vapor Barrier','underslab-concrete-insulation-vapor-barrier',4,'Underslab concrete insulation and vapor barriers provide protection against concrete cracking, energy and heat loss, and mold damage. It forms an impermeable membrane under concrete slabs to prevent soil moisture and gas',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:05:06','2026-05-07 12:05:06'),(22,'Adhesives, Sealants & Tape','adhesives-sealants-tape',12,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:07:01','2026-05-07 12:07:24'),(23,'Lighting & Electrical','lighting-electrical',NULL,NULL,'categories/OZmevQHCtJ2DQO6RaZLTaBdeXf36WDWEw61DBaeG.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,15,'2026-05-07 12:07:14','2026-05-27 13:33:22'),(24,'Batteries','batteries',23,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:07:53','2026-05-07 12:07:53'),(25,'Adhesive & Tape Dispensers','adhesive-tape-dispensers',22,'Adhesive and tape dispensers are tools that help with efficient repair, packaging, and sealing projects. Adhesive guns come in a variety of types, including heat guns, glue guns, caulk guns, sealant guns, glue gun parts and epoxy dispensers, and are designed to handle tough tasks. Dispensers make it easier to apply adhesive tape, which is essential in shipping, packaging, and office environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:08:16','2026-05-07 12:08:16'),(26,'Battery Chargers','battery-chargers',24,'Battery chargers are devices designed to replenish the energy stored in rechargeable batteries, ensuring they remain operational and ready for use. They provide a reliable and continuous power source for various electronic devices, including tools, vehicles, emergency equipment, and portable electronics. Portable battery chargers are compact and lightweight, allowing users to easily transport them for on-the-go charging. They are ideal for commercial use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:08:23','2026-05-08 11:42:50'),(27,'Heat Guns','heat-guns',25,'Heat Guns are powerful tools designed to provide high-performance heating for tasks such as adhesive tape dispensing, bending plastics, thawing pipes, and shrink wrapping. With heavy duty construction, industrial heat guns are ideal for professional use in areas requiring precision and control. The ergonomic handle on commercial heat guns provide users with a comfortable grip during long durations of use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:09:21','2026-05-07 12:09:21'),(28,'Raw Materials','raw-materials',NULL,NULL,'categories/8kDM893YRyOy7UcHYENp9HqaxuJQKwsBXMbtpAz9.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,21,'2026-05-07 12:10:47','2026-05-27 13:39:32'),(29,'Safety & Security','safety-security',NULL,NULL,'categories/03ZEhA1WKcZw2Y9oKAbc08SqQRL46QtzyzoSWL1U.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,2,'2026-05-07 12