-07 12:25:58','2026-05-07 12:25:58'),(59,'Outdoor Showers','outdoor-showers',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:26:09','2026-05-07 12:26:09'),(60,'Generators, Inverters & PDUs','generators-inverters-pdus',23,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:26:36','2026-05-07 12:26:36'),(61,'Headlamps & Wearable Lights','headlamps-wearable-lights',23,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:27:39','2026-05-07 12:27:39'),(62,'Indoor Lighting Fixtures','indoor-lighting-fixtures',23,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:27:57','2026-05-07 12:27:57'),(63,'Jobsite & Portable Lighting','jobsite-portable-lighting',23,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:28:28','2026-05-07 12:28:28'),(64,'Light Bulbs & Lamps','light-bulbs-lamps',23,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:28:47','2026-05-07 12:28:47'),(65,'Outdoor Lighting Fixtures','outdoor-lighting-fixtures',23,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:29:07','2026-05-07 12:29:07'),(66,'Surge Protectors & Extension Cords','surge-protectors-extension-cords',23,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:29:29','2026-05-07 12:29:29'),(68,'Shower & Tub Doors','shower-tub-doors',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:30:14','2026-05-07 12:30:14'),(69,'Shower Bases','shower-bases',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:30:39','2026-05-07 12:30:39'),(72,'Shower Enclosures','shower-enclosures',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:31:52','2026-05-07 12:31:52'),(73,'Shower Kits','shower-kits',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:32:29','2026-05-07 12:32:29'),(74,'Switches, Receptacles & Sensors','switches-receptacles-sensors',23,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:32:53','2026-05-07 12:32:53'),(75,'Shower Pan Liners','shower-pan-liners',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:33:05','2026-05-07 12:33:05'),(76,'Transformers & UPS','transformers-ups',23,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:33:14','2026-05-07 12:33:14'),(77,'Wire & Cable','wire-cable',23,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:33:37','2026-05-07 12:33:37'),(78,'Shower Panels & Units','shower-panels-units',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:33:50','2026-05-07 12:33:50'),(79,'Wiring Devices','wiring-devices',23,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:34:16','2026-05-07 12:34:16'),(80,'Shower Parts & Accessories','shower-parts-accessories',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:34:22','2026-05-07 12:34:22'),(81,'Steam Generator Kits & Parts','steam-generator-kits-parts',18,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:34:40','2026-05-07 12:34:40'),(82,'Drains','drains',35,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:35:40','2026-05-07 12:35:40'),(83,'Consumer Batteries','consumer-batteries',24,'Consumer batteries are portable power sources commonly used in a wide range of electronic devices for both household and personal use. They are designed for single use and come in different chemistries to suit different devices and power requirements. Consumer battery types include 3V batteries, 9V batteries, AA, AAA, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:35:55','2026-05-08 11:43:47'),(84,'Enclosed Grease Tanks','enclosed-grease-tanks',35,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:35:59','2026-05-07 12:35:59'),(85,'Garbage Disposers','garbage-disposers',35,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:36:11','2026-05-07 12:36:11'),(86,'Electric Vehicle Charging Stations','electric-vehicle-charging-stations',24,'Electric vehicle charging stations provide a convenient and efficient means to recharge electric cars and other plug-in vehicles. With options such as wall-mounted chargers, pedestal chargers, and multi-unit charging stations, the range caters to different charging needs. EV charging stations feature user-friendly interfaces, quick charging capabilities, and compatibility with different EV models. Charging stations are suitable for various environments, including commercial, industrial, and public spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:36:13','2026-05-08 11:44:21'),(87,'Power Tool Batteries','power-tool-batteries',24,'Power tool batteries are rechargeable units specifically designed to power cordless tools. They feature quick charging, extended runtime, and lightweight construction, providing efficient power delivery for prolonged tool operation. Their portability allows users to work in remote locations without access to electrical outlets, offering uninterrupted power to cordless tools, enhancing productivity, and enabling efficient completion of tasks. They are ideal for construction sites, workshops, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:36:35','2026-05-08 12:25:06'),(89,'Grease Traps & Interceptors','grease-traps-interceptors',35,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:37:35','2026-05-07 12:37:35'),(90,'Sealed Lead Acid Batteries','sealed-lead-acid-batteries',24,'Sealed Lead Acid (SLA) batteries are rechargeable energy storage devices characterized by their enclosed design, preventing the escape of electrolytes. They feature lead plates immersed in an electrolyte solution, sealed within a maintenance-free, leak-proof casing. SLA batteries are known for their reliability, durability, and versatility. They are available in various sizes and capacities, suitable for applications ranging from small electronic devices to large backup power systems.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:38:13','2026-05-08 12:25:52'),(91,'Special Purpose Batteries','special-purpose-batteries',24,'Special-purpose batteries are designed for specific applications with distinct power demands that go beyond what standard consumer batteries can provide. They are characterized by their specialized chemistries, configurations, and performance capabilities tailored to meet the demands of niche devices and equipment. Special-purpose batteries include alarm system batteries, exit sign batteries, medical batteries, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:38:29','2026-05-08 12:26:23'),(92,'Drinking Fountain & Cooler Filters','drinking-fountain-cooler-filters',38,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:38:41','2026-05-07 12:38:41'),(93,'UPS Replacement Batteries','ups-replacement-batteries',24,'UPS replacement batteries are designed to provide reliable backup power for uninterruptible power supply (UPS) systems. With a focus on long-lasting performance, UPS batteries ensure continuous power during outages. Ideal for data centers, businesses, and critical systems, UPS replacement batteries contribute to constant operations and protection against power disruptions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:38:48','2026-05-08 12:26:59'),(94,'Drinking Fountain & Cooler Parts','drinking-fountain-cooler-parts',38,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:39:02','2026-05-07 12:39:02'),(95,'Vehicle Batteries','vehicle-batteries',24,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:39:14','2026-05-07 12:39:14'),(96,'Indoor Drinking Fountains & Bottle Fillers','indoor-drinking-fountains-bottle-fillers',38,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:39:24','2026-05-07 12:39:24'),(97,'Caulk & Sealant Guns','caulk-sealant-guns',25,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:39:26','2026-05-07 12:39:26'),(98,'Wheelchair Batteries','wheelchair-batteries',24,'Wheelchair batteries provide a dependable, long-lasting power source for electric wheelchairs and mobility scooters. They are rechargeable and typically have safety features such as short circuit protection to prevent accidents. Wheelchair batteries are ideal for medical supply stores or any healthcare facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:39:40','2026-05-08 12:27:49'),(99,'Outdoor Drinking Fountains & Bottle Fillers','outdoor-drinking-fountains-bottle-fillers',38,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:39:53','2026-05-07 12:39:53'),(100,'Water Coolers','water-coolers',38,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:40:14','2026-05-07 12:40:14'),(101,'Cable Carriers','cable-carriers',54,'Cable management products organize and protect cords from everyday wear and tear, while reducing clutter and tripping hazards. Available in a variety of styles and finishes to ensure setup is safe, efficient, and matches the workspace design. Cord covers, floor cord covers, and electrical cord covers provide cable management solutions suitable for offices, schools, studios, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:40:23','2026-05-08 12:28:47'),(102,'Cable Protectors & Cord Covers','cable-protectors-cord-covers',54,'Cable management solutions help maintain a safe and organized workspace. Cable ties, wiring troughs, and strain relief grips ensure cables are properly secured and protected. Cable protectors help prevent trip hazards, equipment damage, and cable wear and tear, promoting safety and prolonging cable life.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:40:39','2026-05-08 12:30:12'),(103,'Glue Guns','glue-guns',25,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:40:52','2026-05-07 12:41:20'),(104,'Cable Staples','cable-staples',54,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:41:04','2026-05-07 12:41:04'),(105,'Bathroom Sink Faucets','bathroom-sink-faucets',39,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:41:17','2026-05-07 12:41:17'),(106,'Faucet Parts & Aerators','faucet-parts-aerators',39,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:41:36','2026-05-07 12:41:36'),(107,'Cable Tie Tools','cable-tie-tools',54,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:41:39','2026-05-07 12:41:39'),(108,'Food Service Faucets','food-service-faucets',39,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,