3','2026-05-07 12:53:23'),(163,'Power Distribution Units','power-distribution-units',60,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:53:23','2026-05-07 12:53:23'),(164,'Vibration Eliminators','vibration-eliminators',42,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:53:41','2026-05-07 12:53:41'),(165,'Power Inverters','power-inverters',60,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:53:42','2026-05-07 12:53:42'),(166,'Marking & Warning Tape','marking-warning-tape',161,'Marking and warning tape is an indispensable tool for creating clear demarcation lines and highlighting potential hazards in various environments. Easily apply warning tape to surfaces with a tape applicator, or simply unroll to apply to surfaces. Marking tape provides visual safety signals through bright colors and/or clear safety messaging. Tape is constructed of durable materials that can withstand wear and features a strong adhesive backing for a secure bond.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:53:50','2026-05-07 12:53:50'),(167,'PTO Generators','pto-generators',60,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:53:58','2026-05-07 12:53:58'),(168,'Water & Gas Supply Hoses','water-gas-supply-hoses',42,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:54:02','2026-05-07 12:54:02'),(169,'Solar Charge Controllers','solar-charge-controllers',60,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:54:44','2026-05-07 12:54:44'),(170,'Standby Generators','standby-generators',60,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:56:34','2026-05-07 12:56:34'),(171,'Towable Generators','towable-generators',60,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:56:50','2026-05-07 12:56:50'),(172,'Drain Parts & Accessories','drain-parts-accessories',43,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 12:57:36','2026-05-07 12:57:36'),(177,'Masking & Painters Tape','masking-painters-tape',161,'Masking tape and painter\'s tape are essential for precision in painting, construction, and remodeling projects. Blue painter’s tape is specially designed to create sharp paint lines and removes cleanly without residue, making it ideal for walls, trim, and delicate surfaces. General-purpose masking tape offers reliable adhesion for labeling, bundling, and temporary surface protection. Both types are easy to apply and remove, providing a professional finish in a wide range of applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 13:00:56','2026-05-07 13:00:56'),(178,'Anti Slip Tape','anti-slip-tape',161,'Anti slip tape is ideal for high-traffic areas, ramps, stairs, and more. The tape provides a reliable non-slip surface, reducing the risk of accidents. The tape is designed for workplaces, commercial spaces, and residential areas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 13:01:42','2026-05-07 13:01:42'),(179,'Foil Tape','foil-tape',161,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 13:02:22','2026-05-07 13:02:22'),(180,'Electrical Tape','electrical-tape',161,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 13:02:51','2026-05-07 13:02:51'),(181,'Duct Tape','duct-tape',161,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 13:03:55','2026-05-07 13:03:55'),(182,'Gaffer Tape','gaffer-tape',161,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 13:04:41','2026-05-07 13:04:41'),(183,'Carpet & Seam Tape','carpet-seam-tape',161,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 13:05:10','2026-05-07 13:05:10'),(184,'Weather Strip Tape','weather-strip-tape',161,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 13:06:01','2026-05-07 13:06:01'),(185,'Transfer Tape','transfer-tape',161,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 13:06:41','2026-05-07 13:06:41'),(186,'Bay Lights','bay-lights',62,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 13:07:02','2026-05-07 13:07:02'),(187,'Decorative Lighting','decorative-lighting',62,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 13:07:19','2026-05-07 13:07:19'),(188,'ESD Tape','esd-tape