ars, pipes, lumber, and tubes. They feature heavy-duty casters for easy maneuverability and are made from durable materials to withstand large load capacities. Bar trucks are unique storage solutions ideal for use in manufacturing and construction environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 16:24:50','2026-05-07 16:24:50'),(365,'Circuit Breakers','circuit-breakers',79,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 16:26:58','2026-05-07 16:26:58'),(366,'Contactor Panels','contactor-panels',79,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 16:27:39','2026-05-07 16:27:39'),(367,'Contactors','contactors',79,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 16:28:04','2026-05-07 16:28:04'),(369,'Fuses','fuses',79,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 16:29:27','2026-05-07 16:29:27'),(371,'Relays & Sequencers','relays-sequencers',79,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 16:29:50','2026-05-07 16:29:50'),(372,'Strut Channels','strut-channels',79,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 16:31:21','2026-05-07 16:31:21'),(373,'Wire Clips & Clamps','wire-clips-clamps',79,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 16:31:43','2026-05-07 16:31:43'),(374,'Vinyl Basket Trucks','vinyl-basket-trucks',3,'Vinyl Basket Trucks are a practical solution designed to easily transport large quantities throughout your facility. Constructed from durable vinyl, these puncture-resistant basket trucks are easy to clean and maneuver smoothly across surfaces on casters. These trucks are ideal for commercial laundry collection, mail distribution, material handling, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 16:32:32','2026-05-07 16:34:24'),(375,'Wire Connectors','wire-connectors',79,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 16:32:37','2026-05-07 16:32:37'),(376,'UPS Replacement Batteries','ups-replacement-batteries-1',76,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 16:33:00','2026-05-07 16:33:00'),(377,'Electrical Tape','electrical-tape-1',79,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 16:33:25','2026-05-07 16:33:25'),(378,'Vinyl Bulk Basket Trucks','vinyl-bulk-basket-trucks',374,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 16:38:13','2026-05-07 16:38:13'),(379,'Antimicrobial Vinyl Bulk Basket Trucks','antimicrobial-vinyl-bulk-basket-trucks',374,'The Antimicrobial Vinyl Bulk Basket Trucks are versatile, durable material handling trucks with a black vinyl reinforced top rim and reinforced handles. The basket trucks offer antimicrobial protection, and the vinyl liner is sewn and riveted for superior strength and durability with PVC topping surrounding the upper edge. They have an oversize work-order pocket, and ship assembled.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 16:39:51','2026-05-07 16:39:51'),(380,'Vinyl Elevated Bulk Basket Trucks','vinyl-elevated-bulk-basket-trucks',374,'Elevated Bulk Basket Trucks are designed for easier transportation with less back strain. With a high-capacity design, reinforced bases, and wire mesh sides, these trucks can hold heavy loads of materials. Vinyl offers a smooth, easy-to-clean, puncture resistant liner. The elevated design reduces bending and lifting while making it easy to unload contents.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 16:40:38','2026-05-07 16:40:38'),(381,'Vinyl Basket Trucks with PVC Hinged Lid','vinyl-basket-trucks-with-pvc-hinged-lid',374,'Bulk Basket Trucks with PVC Hinged Tops offer secure material handling. These trucks have a puncture-resistant vinyl liner attached to a steel wire frame and a black PVC lid with heavy duty hinges and hasps. These carts are ideal for linen storage, sports equipment, and more. They feature non-marking poly casters for easy maneuvering and also nest together for storage and shipping.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 16:50:46','2026-05-07 16:52:05'),(382,'Vinyl Bulk Basket Trucks with Bumpers','vinyl-bulk-basket-trucks-with-bumpers',374,'Vinyl Bulk Basket Trucks with Bumpers are durable and versatile material handling trucks with a vinyl-coated nylon body that\'s flame retardant, mold, mildew, UV, and tear-resistant. The basket trucks also feature bumpers that protect walls and doorways and reinforced handles for easy maneuverability. Available in various colors and sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 16:50:57','2026-05-07 16:51:30'),(383,'Antimicrobial Vinyl Bulk Basket Trucks with Bumpers','antimicrobial-vinyl-bulk-basket-trucks-with-bumpers',374,'Antimicrobial Bulk Basket Trucks with Bumpers help protect employees, customers and facilities. An antimicrobial additive is incorporated into the vinyl material and top rim bumper to provide microbe inhibiting properties for the life of the product. The flame retardant vinyl liner is resistant to mold, mildew, UV and tearing. Multiple units nest easily for convenient storage.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 16:52:29','2026-05-07 16:52:29'),(384,'Vinyl Shippable Bulk Basket Trucks','vinyl-shippable-bulk-basket-trucks',374,'Vinyl UPS & Fedexable Bulk Basket Trucks are made with vinyl-coated nylon bodies, suitable for shipping via UPS and FedEx. These commercial grade trucks are flame retardant as well as mold, mildew, and tear-resistant. Basket Trucks include swivel casters and reinforced handles for easy handling and mobility. Ships knocked down for freight savings and easy assembly.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 16:54:34','2026-05-07 16:54:34'),(385,'Antimicrobial Vinyl Shippable Bulk Basket Trucks','antimicrobial-vinyl-shippable-bulk-basket-trucks',374,'Antimicrobial Vinyl UPS & FedEx-able Bulk Basket Trucks offer a solution for safe material handling, with a seamless, vinyl body that inhibits bacterial growth. The trucks are durable, lightweight and easy to maneuver, with a range of capacities. The vinyl exterior is also mold, mildew, and UV resistant. Available in different colors. Ships knocked down for freight savings and easy assembly.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 16:54:37','2026-05-07 16:54:37'),(386,'Vinyl Bulk Basket Truck With Split Compartment','vinyl-bulk-basket-truck-with-split-compartment',374,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 16:54:43','2026-05-07 16:54:43'),(387,'Basket Truck Accessories','basket-truck-accessories',374,'Basket Truck Accessories feature various add-ons and replacement parts to enhance or repair basket trucks, including replacement casters, frames, and liners. You\'ll also find accessories such as organizers, covers, and vinyl hoods to help protect and organize the truck\'s contents.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 16:55:35','2026-05-07 16:55:35'),(388,'Canvas Basket Trucks','canvas-basket-trucks',3,'Canvas Basket Trucks are a practical solution designed to easily store and transport bulk materials throughout your facility. Constructed from durable canvas, these basket trucks are resistant to weather, water, & abrasions, making them an ideal choice for hotels, locker rooms, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 17:11:14','2026-05-07 17:15:50'),(389,'Canvas Bulk Basket Trucks','canvas-bulk-basket-trucks',388,'Canvas Bulk Basket Trucks are built to conveniently store and transport supplies in different facilities. Trucks are constructed with heavyweight cotton canvas and treated for water resistance. Also are reinforced with a seam-welded steel frame, vinyl-reinforced wear points, and a black vinyl-reinforced top rim. Available in different sizes with the option of a wire or hardwood base.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 17:16:33','2026-05-07 17:16:33'),(390,'Canvas Shippable Hamper Trucks with Lockable Lid','canvas-shippable-hamper-trucks-with-lockable-lid',388,'Canvas Shippable Hamper Trucks with Lockable Lids are weather and water-resistant with reinforced critical wear points and feature a lockable wood lid for security. The trucks have Kiln-dried hardwood base along with a welded spring steel frame for years of service. The four 4\" rubber swivel casters make transportation easy.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 17:17:16','2026-05-07 17:17:16'),(391,'Canvas Elevated Bulk Basket Trucks','canvas-elevated-bulk-basket-trucks',388,'Canvas Elevated Basket Trucks are designed for easier transportation with less back strain. With a high-capacity design, reinforced bases, and wire mesh sides, these trucks can hold heavy loads of materials. Trucks are weather and water resistant and all critical wear points are reinforced for extra strength. The elevated design reduces bending and lifting while making it easy to unload contents.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-07 17:18:02','2026-05-07 17:18:02'),(392,'Water Jetters & Accessories','water-jetters-accessories',342,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:07:43','2026-05-08 09:07:43'),(393,'Pipe & Drain Openers','pipe-drain-openers',342,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:08:10','2026-05-08 09:08:10'),(394,'Pipe Locator & Inspection Tools','pipe-locator-inspection-tools',342,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:08:41','2026-05-08 09:08:41'),(395,'Pipe Pressing Tools','pipe-pressing-tools',342,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:09:21','2026-05-08 09:09:21'),(396,'Pipe Threading Machines','pipe-threading-machines',342,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:09:53','2026-05-08 09:09:53'),(397,'Roll Groovers','roll-groovers',342,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:10:30','2026-05-08 09:10:30'),(398,'Machine Dies & Die Heads','machine-dies-die-heads',342,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:10:55','2026-05-08 09:10:55'),(399,'Box Trucks','box-trucks',2,'Box trucks are specifically engineered to store and transport heavy, bulky items or materials in large quantities. With their sturdy four-wall construction and extra-deep containers, they have the capacity to accommodate substantial loads. Additionally, their durable swivel casters ensure smooth movement and mobility within the facility, enhancing efficiency.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:45:58','2026-05-08 10:02:17'),(400,'Plastic Box Trucks','plastic-box-trucks',399,'Plastic Box Trucks are an efficient solution for transporting materials throughout warehouses, factories, food processing facilities, and more. Featuring a durable construction for long-lasting use, these leak-proof box trucks are easy to clean and roll smoothly throughout your facility on casters, even when fully loaded.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:47:25','2026-05-08 09:47:25'),(401,'Plastic Bulk Box Trucks','plastic-bulk-box-trucks',400,'Plastic bulk box trucks are an efficient and durable material handling solution for warehouses, factories, or any other industrial or commercial settings. With their sturdy construction, these trucks can handle weight capacities of up to 1,200 lbs. The smooth-rolling wheels make these bulk box trucks easy to maneuver, even when fully loaded.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:51:21','2026-05-08 09:51:21'),(402,'Plastic Easy Access Box Trucks','plastic-easy-access-box-trucks',400,'Plastic easy access box trucks are the perfect solution for bulk handling in your facility. Seamless, one-piece rotational molded polymer body has a snag-free interior for easy cleaning, and won\'t dent, corrode or absorb moisture. The trucks feature an easy-access opening that allows for quick and effortless loading and unloading.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:51:26','2026-05-08 09:51:26'),(403,'Plastic Box Trucks with Bumpers','plastic-box-trucks-with-bumpers',400,'These plastic bumper trucks are designed for heavy-duty use. The durable vinyl bumpers protect walls and equipment during transportation. These trucks are made of tough polyethylene material that resists rust, dents, and scratches, and is easy to clean. Its lightweight design makes it easy to maneuver, and is ideal for use in warehouses, factories, and other industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:51:33','2026-05-08 09:51:33'),(404,'Elevated Plastic Box Trucks','elevated-plastic-box-trucks',400,'These box trucks feature an ergonomically correct elevated platform height that helps reduce fatigue associated with bending or reaching to retrieve loads. The polyethylene construction allows for easy cleaning and enhanced durability. This box truck is attached to a powder coated steel frame for extra strength in industrial work environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:51:40','2026-05-08 09:51:40'),(405,'USDA Approved Plastic Box Trucks with Capped Drain','usda-approved-plastic-box-trucks-with-capped-drain',400,'These plastic box trucks are ideal for transporting a variety of items. They feature both twelve and six bushel capacities and can hold up to 760 lbs. These trucks are constructed with USDA approved polyethylene material, making it ideal for use in food processing and handling applications. The material is lightweight, durable, and easy to clean, ensuring long-lasting use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:51:48','2026-05-08 09:51:48'),(406,'Steel Box Trucks','steel-box-trucks',399,'Steel Box Trucks are an ideal solution for transporting bulky materials and heavy components throughout your facility. Constructed from heavy-duty steel for long-lasting durability, these box trucks have impressive weight capacities and are equipped with smooth-rolling casters for easy maneuverability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:52:44','2026-05-08 09:52:44'),(407,'Raw Materials','raw-materials-1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,100,'2026-05-08 09:53:15','2026-05-08 09:53:15'),(408,'Clamping & Positioning','clamping-positioning',33,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:54:36','2026-05-08 09:54:36'),(409,'Drilling & Hole Making','drilling-hole-making',33,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:55:52','2026-05-08 09:55:52'),(410,'Dust Collectors','dust-collectors',33,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:56:09','2026-05-08 09:56:09'),(411,'Steel Box Trucks with Expanded Metal Sides','steel-box-trucks-with-expanded-metal-sides',406,'Steel box trucks with expanded metal sides are a sturdy and reliable option for transporting materials. The expanded metal sides provide visibility while still containing the cargo. The steel construction ensures durability, while the smooth casters allow for easy transport. Available in various sizes and weight capacities, these box trucks are an efficient solution for all industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:56:21','2026-05-08 09:56:21'),(412,'Machine Hardware','machine-hardware',33,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:56:28','2026-05-08 09:56:28'),(413,'Steel Elevated Box Trucks with Solid Sides','steel-elevated-box-trucks-with-solid-sides',406,'Raised platform box truck are an ideal solution for moving heavy loads with ease. With its sturdy design, these box trucks can carry up to 2000 lbs of material efficiently. They are equipped with solid sides to prevent items from falling off during transport, while raised platforms allow for easy loading and unloading. All-welded construction ships fully assembled and ready for immediate use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:56:29','2026-05-08 09:56:29'),(414,'Steel Flat Shelf Stock & Utility Carts','steel-flat-shelf-stock-utility-carts',406,'Steel Stock & Shelf Trucks move items quickly and efficiently. Our heavy duty utility carts have structural angled corners, up to three shelves, and lengths ranging between twenty four and thirty six inches for simple transport of heavy equipment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:56:37','2026-05-08 09:56:37'),(415,'Machine Keys','machine-keys',33,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:56:43','2026-05-08 09:56:43'),(416,'Steel Elevated Box Trucks with Expanded Metal Sides','steel-elevated-box-trucks-with-expanded-metal-sides',406,'These raised platform box trucks with expanded metal sides are perfect for transporting large loads up to 2000 lbs. The expanded sides allow for easy access and visibility of the cargo. These trucks are available in multiple lengths, widths, and heights to hold a variety of items, and the sturdy all-welded construction ensures safe transportation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:56:52','2026-05-08 09:56:52'),(417,'Steel Easy Access Box Trucks','steel-easy-access-box-trucks',406,'These steel box trucks have weight capacities of 3600 lbs and are available in multiple lengths, heights, and widths. The front panel is open, providing full access to contents. The heavy-duty steel construction ensures durability and strength, making it ideal for heavy-duty use in various industrial applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:56:55','2026-05-08 09:56:55'),(418,'Machinery','machinery',33,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:57:12','2026-05-08 09:57:12'),(419,'Metalworking Fluids','metalworking-fluids',33,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:57:32','2026-05-08 09:57:32'),(420,'Milling','milling',33,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:57:49','2026-05-08 09:57:49'),(421,'Mounts, Pads & Vibration Dampers','mounts-pads-vibration-dampers',33,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:58:06','2026-05-08 09:58:06'),(422,'Parts Cleaning & Treating','parts-cleaning-treating',33,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:58:23','2026-05-08 09:58:23'),(423,'Threading','threading',33,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:58:38','2026-05-08 09:58:38'),(425,'Ceramic','ceramic',28,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:58:46','2026-05-08 09:58:46'),(426,'Tool Holders','tool-holders',33,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:58:52','2026-05-08 09:58:52'),(427,'Composites','composites',28,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:59:03','2026-05-08 09:59:03'),(428,'Turning & Boring','turning-boring',33,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:59:06','2026-05-08 09:59:06'),(429,'Steel Hopper Box Trucks','steel-hopper-box-trucks',406,'This heavy-duty steel push cart hopper is perfect for transporting large quantities of materials efficiently. With a generous size of up to 40\" x 48\" x 24\" and a weight capacity of up to 4000 lbs, this steel hopper box truck can easily handle heavy loads. These hopper box trucks feature a convenient handle for easy pushing and pulling, as well as a secure locking brake.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:59:31','2026-05-08 09:59:31'),(430,'Stainless Steel Box Trucks','stainless-steel-box-trucks',406,'Stainless steel box trucks are designed to transport bulk items with sanitation in mind. Made with a durable stainless steel material, these box trucks can hold up to 1100 lbs of weight with ease. The easy-to-clean surfaces of the stainless steel make it ideal for use in food processing and healthcare facilities where hygiene is a top priority.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:59:35','2026-05-08 09:59:35'),(431,'Steel Box Trucks with Solid Sides','steel-box-trucks-with-solid-sides',406,'These steel box trucks are ideal for transporting materials safely in a warehouse or industrial setting. Constructed with durable steel, these box trucks are built to withstand tough work environments and can hold up to 2,000 lbs of weight. Steel box trucks provide space for large items, while the solid sides ensure that contents stay secure during transport.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:59:38','2026-05-08 09:59:38'),(432,'Steel Box Trucks with Drop Gate','steel-box-trucks-with-drop-gate',406,'Our steel box trucks are an ideal solution for storing and transporting heavy-duty items. These box trucks feature a steel construction allowing for a range of weight capacities depending on the model. These trucks come equipped with a front drop-gate with spring latches that provide easy access to your items.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:59:41','2026-05-08 09:59:41'),(433,'Felt','felt',28,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 09:59:51','2026-05-08 09:59:51'),(434,'Hopper Trucks','hopper-trucks',2,'Hopper trucks are heavy-duty material handling carts designed for efficient transportation and disposal of bulk materials or waste. Designed with a convenient cutaway opening that offers easy access for loading and unloading. Bulk transport trucks are constructed of durable materials and feature sturdy casters for additional support and optimal maneuverability around tight corners. Hopper trucks are ideal for material handling in warehouses, production facilities, hotels, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:15:34','2026-05-08 10:15:34'),(435,'Graphite','graphite',28,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:16:40','2026-05-08 10:16:40'),(436,'Foam','foam',28,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:17:27','2026-05-08 10:17:27'),(437,'Metals','metals',28,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:18:15','2026-05-08 10:18:15'),(438,'Plastic Hopper Bulk Trucks','plastic-hopper-bulk-trucks',434,'Plastic hopper bulk trucks are durable and designed to carry heavy-duty loads. These linen carts are ideal for commercial laundry applications. The tub has all swivel casters for easy maneuverability and a powder-coated steel frame for lasting durability. Various colors are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:18:41','2026-05-08 10:18:41'),(439,'Hopper Front Bulk Wire Trucks','hopper-front-bulk-wire-trucks',434,'Hopper front bulk wire trucks are ideal for bulk material handling. Wire trucks are lined with vinyl that is mold, mildew, and tear resistant for long lasting durability. Heavy duty polyurethane casters provide additional support and allow the truck to move smoothly. Various colors are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:18:45','2026-05-08 10:18:45'),(440,'Hopper Front Plastic Security Bulk Trucks','hopper-front-plastic-security-bulk-trucks',434,'Hopper front plastic bulk trucks help protect materials in need of frequent loading and unloading. The security bulk truck\'s polyethylene construction withstands indoor or outdoor conditions. Unit wheel casters provide easy steering control, and some bulk trucks have optional spring lift platforms available to enhance loading speed and safety performance. Available in various sizes and styles.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:18:49','2026-05-08 10:18:49'),(441,'Hopper Front Plastic Bulk Trucks','hopper-front-plastic-bulk-trucks',434,'Hopper front bulk trucks provide a lightweight yet durable solution for transporting materials. Bulk trucks have a convenient cutaway opening that offers easy access for loading and unloading. Rust-resistant steel dolly base provides long-lasting durability. Hopper front bulk trucks are available in various colors and sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:18:53','2026-05-08 10:18:53'),(442,'Plastics','plastics',28,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:19:25','2026-05-08 10:19:25'),(443,'Rubber','rubber',407,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:19:56','2026-05-08 10:19:56'),(444,'Laundry Carts','laundry-carts',2,'Laundry carts are containers designed to efficiently collect, transport, and sort soiled linens, garments, or other laundry items. They feature casters for easy maneuverability, ergonomic handles for comfortable pushing or pulling, and durable construction. Laundry carts are commonly utilized in hotels, hospitals, laundromats, and other commercial settings with high laundry volume.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:20:04','2026-05-08 10:20:04'),(445,'Wire Laundry Carts with Double Garment Hangers','wire-laundry-carts-with-double-garment-hangers',444,'Wire Laundry Carts with Double Garment Hanger boast high-load capacities and resistance to breakage thanks to their sturdy steel construction. These wire laundry containers are equipped with a double-pole rack to provide hanging space for drying garments. The wheeled bases make these wire laundry bins easy to maneuver, and the bumper along the top edge helps prevent damage to walls and equipment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:23:51','2026-05-08 10:23:51'),(446,'Wire Laundry Carts with Single Garment Hanger','wire-laundry-carts-with-single-garment-hanger',444,'Wire Laundry Carts with Single Garment Hanger are built from sturdy steel to withstand breakage and hold heavy loads of clothing and laundry supplies. These wire laundry containers are equipped with a single-pole rack to provide hanging space for drying garments. The wheeled bases promote smooth, simple maneuverability, and the bumper along the top edge helps prevent damage to walls and equipment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:23:54','2026-05-08 10:23:54'),(447,'Wire Laundry Carts','wire-laundry-carts',444,'Wire Laundry Carts feature sturdy construction to hold heavy loads of clothing and laundry supplies. The steel material stands up against breakage, providing a durable alternative to fabric carts, and the bumper along the top edge helps prevent damage to walls and doorways during transport. The wheeled bases promote simple mobility, and the open wire design helps prevent dust and debris buildup.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:23:57','2026-05-08 10:23:57'),(448,'Fabric Laundry Carts','fabric-laundry-carts',444,'Fabric Laundry Carts are crafted with a durable liner material, such as canvas or vinyl, to hold strong against high-capacity laundry loads. The fabric expands to fit bulky items, making these laundry containers a great alternative to wire carts, and the sturdy base helps prevent the bottom from sagging. The wheeled bases roll smoothly to enable simple transport from room to room.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:24:01','2026-05-08 10:24:01'),(449,'Bins, Totes, & Containers','bins-totes-containers',34,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:24:47','2026-05-08 10:24:47'),(450,'Liners & Caps','liners-caps',2,'Liners and Caps are essential accessories for bins and carts used in various material handling applications. Liners are made from durable materials to provide a protective barrier for bins, while caps secure the contents of bins, ensuring safe transport of items.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:25:03','2026-05-08 10:25:03'),(451,'Box Dumpers','box-dumpers',34,'Box dumpers are designed to simplify the process of handling and disposing of heavy loads of waste, debris, and bulk materials. Made of heavy-gauge steel construction and motorized controls, box dumpers control the loading and unloading of material with precision. Box dumpers help to prevent the strain or injury to personnel by alleviating the lifting and lowering of heavy items.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:25:05','2026-05-13 10:51:53'),(452,'Bulk & Tilt Trucks','bulk-tilt-trucks-1',34,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:25:21','2026-05-08 10:25:21'),(453,'Casters & Wheels','casters-wheels',34,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:25:37','2026-05-08 10:25:37'),(454,'Conveyors','conveyors',34,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:25:53','2026-05-08 10:25:53'),(455,'Cranes & Hoists','cranes-hoists',34,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:26:08','2026-05-08 10:26:08'),(456,'Dock Equipment','dock-equipment',34,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:26:26','2026-05-08 10:26:26'),(457,'Drum Handling Equipment','drum-handling-equipment',34,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:26:41','2026-05-08 10:26:41'),(458,'Forklifts & Attachments','forklifts-attachments',34,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:26:56','2026-05-08 10:26:56'),(459,'Ladders & Lifts','ladders-lifts',34,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:27:14','2026-05-08 10:27:14'),(460,'Lift Tables','lift-tables',34,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:27:29','2026-05-08 10:27:29'),(461,'Mezzanines & Modular Structures','mezzanines-modular-structures',34,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:27:55','2026-05-08 10:27:55'),(462,'Dandux Vinyl Liners for Bulk Basket Trucks','dandux-vinyl-liners-for-bulk-basket-trucks',450,'Dandux vinyl liners for bulk basket trucks are designed to provide reliable protection for bulk basket trucks. Made with durable tear-resistant vinyl material, these basket truck replacement liners offer a barrier against damage and contamination. Vinyl liners are easy to install, remove, and clean and are available in numerous bushel capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:28:17','2026-05-08 10:28:17'),(463,'H.G. Maybeck Nylon Hamper Basket Liners','hg-maybeck-nylon-hamper-basket-liners',450,'H.G. Maybeck nylon hamper basket liners are designed to prolong the life of commercial laundry carts by providing a protective barrier between the basket and stored contents. Made with lightweight, easy-to-clean nylon, these hamper liners create a barrier that protects against dirt and contamination. Nylon liners for hampers are available in numerous bushel capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:28:22','2026-05-08 10:28:22'),(464,'Global Industrial™ Canvas Bulk Basket Truck Liners','global-industrial-canvas-bulk-basket-truck-liners',450,'Our canvas bulk basket truck liners provide a protective barrier for bulk basket trucks and the contents inside. Made from heavyweight canvas, these truck liners offer maximum abrasion resistance and are water-repellent to prevent damage. These easy-to-install liners are specifically designed to fit Global Industrial bulk trucks. Available in numerous bushel capacities and sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:28:26','2026-05-08 10:28:26'),(465,'Global Industrial™ Vinyl Bulk Basket Truck Liners','global-industrial-vinyl-bulk-basket-truck-liners',450,'Vinyl bulk basket truck liners are designed to create a reliable protective barrier specifically for our bulk basket trucks. Made with high-quality puncture-resistant vinyl, these truck liners are easy to install, remove, and clean. Our basket truck replacement liners are available in numerous bushel capacities and colors, ideal for material handling in hospitality, retail, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:28:30','2026-05-08 10:28:30'),(466,'Global Industrial™ Gaylord & Tote Bin Liners','global-industrial-gaylord-tote-bin-liners',450,'Our Gaylord and tote bin liners create a protective lining to keep boxes, bins, and other containers clean. Made with lightweight but durable polyethylene, these translucent box liners feature a gusseted design to fit the container\'s shape. They keep bins clean and protect the contents inside from contaminants. Gaylord liners are available in various sizes to fit a wide range of containers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:28:35','2026-05-08 10:28:35'),(467,'H.G. Maybeck Vinyl Hamper Basket Caps','hg-maybeck-vinyl-hamper-basket-caps',450,'H.G. Maybeck vinyl hamper basket caps are convenient and reliable coverings designed for commercial laundry bins and hamper baskets. Made with heavy-duty vinyl, these hamper covers feature an elastic band rim to provide a snug and secure fit, ensuring maximum protection of hamper contents. Basket caps are available in numerous bushel capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:31:18','2026-05-08 10:31:18'),(468,'Royal Basket Trucks® Poly Hinged Lids','royal-basket-trucks-poly-hinged-lids',450,'Royal Basket Trucks® poly hinged lids provide a convenient protective solution for truck storage. These hinged lids are designed specifically to fit Royal Basket Trucks® brand poly trucks and liners. Made with durable, corrosion-resistant polyethylene, these lids can conceal and protect truck contents during storage and transportation. The hinged design allows easy access to stored contents.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:31:21','2026-05-08 10:31:21'),(469,'H.G. Maybeck Nylon Hamper Basket Caps','hg-maybeck-nylon-hamper-basket-caps',450,'H.G. Maybeck nylon hamper basket caps are designed to provide a protective covering for commercial or industrial laundry bins. Made with lightweight yet durable and easy-to-clean nylon, these hamper covers feature an elastic band for a snug fit on top of laundry carts. Basket caps protect hamper contents from dust, dirt, and other contaminants. Available in numerous bushel capacities and sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:31:24','2026-05-08 10:31:24'),(470,'R&B Wire Products Wire Elastic Soft Cover For Vinyl Basket Trucks & Poly Trucks','rb-wire-products-wire-elastic-soft-cover-for-vinyl-basket-trucks-poly-trucks',450,'These wire elastic soft covers for vinyl basket trucks and poly trucks from R&B Wire Products provide a versatile solution for industrial storage needs. Covers are made with flame-retardant, antimicrobial vinyl and feature an elastic shock-cord rim for a secure fit. These vinyl covers keep contents inside and covered during storage and transportation. Available in numerous bushel capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:31:27','2026-05-08 10:31:27'),(471,'Dandux Covers for Vinyl or Canvas Bulk Trucks','dandux-covers-for-vinyl-or-canvas-bulk-trucks',450,'These Dandux covers are designed specifically to be used with vinyl or canvas bulk trucks. Made with high-quality nylon, these bulk truck covers provide reliable protection against dust, debris, and other external elements to keep contents clean, dry, and safe. Nylon covers come in various sizes and feature an elastic band for a snug and secure fit. Available in numerous bushel capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:31:31','2026-05-08 10:31:31'),(472,'Royal Basket Trucks® Liners','royal-basket-trucks-liners',450,'Royal Basket Trucks® liners provide a protective barrier to keep truck contents secure and undamaged. Made with durable polyethylene, these cart liners feature smooth rounded corners and a leak-proof design for maximum protection and durability. Poly liners are available in numerous bushel capacities and sizes, and are ideal for any industrial or commercial material handling job.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:31:35','2026-05-08 10:31:35'),(473,'Recycling Trucks','recycling-trucks',2,'Recycling trucks simplify the transport process of recyclable materials. They can be maneuvered easily in indoor and outdoor settings such as schools, office buildings, warehouses, and other commercial spaces. Strong plastic construction makes the trucks easy to clean and maintain while also holding up against daily use. Durable swivel casters and wheels increase mobility and move waste to dumpsters with ease. Large width, height, length, and weight capacity amounts can accommodate all volumes and sizes of materials.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:32:47','2026-05-08 10:32:47'),(474,'Pallet Trucks & Jacks','pallet-trucks-jacks',34,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:33:35','2026-05-08 10:33:35'),(475,'Self Dumping Hoppers & Loaders','self-dumping-hoppers-loaders',34,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:33:54','2026-05-08 10:33:54'),(476,'Shelving','shelving',34,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:34:13','2026-05-08 10:34:13'),(477,'Recycling Plastic Box Trucks','recycling-plastic-box-trucks',473,'Recycling Plastic Box Trucks are designed for efficient material handling and transport of bulky items. Ideal for outdoor areas, they collect, store, and transport recycling material. These recycling plastic box trucks feature optional lids, leak-proof construction, easy-to-clean smooth walls, and a nestable design for space-saving storage.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:34:16','2026-05-08 10:34:16'),(478,'Mobile Recycling Tilt Trucks','mobile-recycling-tilt-trucks',473,'Optimize waste management with our Mobile Recycling Tilt Trucks. Available in various sizes, these durable recycling tilt trucks efficiently collect and dispose of waste. Effortless dumping is guaranteed with smooth-riding wheels, a tilting mechanism, and a resilient polyethylene body. Ensure secure handling with convenient push and lift handles, and integrated trash bag hooks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:34:19','2026-05-08 10:34:19'),(479,'Spring Lifts','spring-lifts',2,'Spring Lifts are essential accessories for bins and carts used in various material handling applications. Spring lifts are mechanisms that promote the ergonomic loading and unloading of materials in bins and box trucks. These accessories are ideal for industrial facilities, warehouses, and manufacturing settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:35:17','2026-05-08 10:35:17'),(480,'Exam & Patient Room Supplies','exam-patient-room-supplies',46,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:35:38','2026-05-08 10:35:38'),(481,'First Aid & Wound Treatment','first-aid-wound-treatment',46,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:36:01','2026-05-08 10:36:01'),(482,'Lab Equipment & Instruments','lab-equipment-instruments',46,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:36:21','2026-05-08 10:36:21'),(483,'Lab Heating & Cooling','lab-heating-cooling',46,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:36:38','2026-05-08 10:36:38'),(484,'Lab Storage & Bench Protection','lab-storage-bench-protection',46,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:36:55','2026-05-08 10:36:55'),(485,'Shims & Shim Stock','shims-shim-stock',407,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:37:04','2026-05-08 10:37:04'),(486,'Labware & Utensils','labware-utensils',46,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:37:09','2026-05-08 10:37:09'),(487,'Medical & Laboratory Cold Storage','medical-laboratory-cold-storage',46,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:37:26','2026-05-08 10:37:26'),(488,'Medical Cabinets','medical-cabinets',46,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:37:51','2026-05-08 10:37:51'),(489,'Medical Chart & File Holders','medical-chart-file-holders',46,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:38:09','2026-05-08 10:38:09'),(490,'Medical Devices & Instruments','medical-devices-instruments',46,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:38:25','2026-05-08 10:38:25'),(491,'Dandux Spring Lift Platforms for Plastic Box Trucks','dandux-spring-lift-platforms-for-plastic-box-trucks',479,'Dandux spring lift platforms for plastic box trucks are ergonomically designed, increasing the efficiency of plastic box trucks in commercial work settings. These lift platforms feature a spring lift mechanism, making it easier to load and unload trucks. With a powder-coated steel frame covered in vinyl-coated nylon, these spring lift platforms are built for long-lasting durability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:38:34','2026-05-08 10:38:34'),(492,'Dandux Spring Lift Platforms for Hopper Front Plastic Bulk Trucks','dandux-spring-lift-platforms-for-hopper-front-plastic-bulk-trucks',479,'Dandux spring lift platforms for hopper-front plastic bulk trucks ergonomically designed to streamline material handling operations, specifically for bulk trucks with hopper fronts. These platforms feature a spring lift mechanism for easy loading and unloading. Platforms are made of steel covered in vinyl-coated nylon for long-lasting durability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:38:36','2026-05-08 10:38:36'),(493,'Patient Support & Immobilization','patient-support-immobilization',46,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:38:40','2026-05-08 10:38:40'),(494,'Royal Basket Trucks® Spring Lift Platforms for Canvas & Vinyl Bulk Trucks','royal-basket-trucks-spring-lift-platforms-for-canvas-vinyl-bulk-trucks',479,'Royal Basket Trucks® spring lift platforms for canvas and vinyl bulk trucks are ergonomically designed for material handling in commercial and industrial settings. The vinyl-covered steel wire platform attaches to trucks via powder-coated steel hooks and has vinyl-covered springs that power the lift mechanism, simplifying the loading and unloading process. Various sizes are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:38:40','2026-05-08 10:38:40'),(495,'Dandux Spring Lift Platforms for Canvas & Vinyl Bulk Trucks','dandux-spring-lift-platforms-for-canvas-vinyl-bulk-trucks',479,'Dandux spring lift platforms for canvas and vinyl bulk trucks provide a convenient solution to improve efficiency with material handling tasks. These ergonomically designed platform lifts keep materials moving as trucks are unloaded, eliminating the need for repetitive bending and leaning. Dandux lifts feature a vinyl-coated spring steel frame and rust-resistant steel springs with S-hooks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:38:44','2026-05-08 10:38:44'),(496,'Global Industrial™ Spring Lift Platforms for Plastic Bulk Box Trucks','global-industrial-spring-lift-platforms-for-plastic-bulk-box-trucks',479,'These spring lift platforms are designed specifically for use with plastic bulk box trucks. Available in numerous bushel capacities and sizes, these platform lifts are ergonomically designed, providing an efficient way to keep material moving towards the top of truck as the product is removed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:38:47','2026-05-08 10:38:47'),(497,'Physical Therapy','physical-therapy',46,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:39:03','2026-05-08 10:39:03'),(498,'PPE & Hand Sanitizer','ppe-hand-sanitizer',46,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:39:21','2026-05-08 10:39:21'),(499,'Stainless Steel Work Tables','stainless-steel-work-tables',46,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:39:36','2026-05-08 10:39:36'),(500,'Wheelchairs & Physical Aids','wheelchairs-physical-aids',46,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:39:54','2026-05-08 10:39:54'),(501,'Tilt Trucks','tilt-trucks',2,'Tilt trucks are heavy-duty carts used to collect, transport, and dump bulk materials across industrial and commercial sites. Their molded bodies resist dents and corrosion, while ergonomic handles and casters help reduce strain and keep workflows moving. From warehouses and manufacturing floors to hospitality, healthcare, and sanitation, tilt trucks are suitable for transporting recyclables, food waste, construction debris and more. Some models include reinforced bases, tow bars, or forklift pockets for longer runs and faster loading into compactors or vehicles.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:42:01','2026-05-08 10:42:01'),(502,'Accessories for Tilt Trucks','accessories-for-tilt-trucks',501,'Tilt truck accessories can elevate your tilt truck experience. Some featured tilt truck accessories include lids, frames, and handles for manual push trucks; chargers and battery packs can boost your powered tilt trucks. Vinyl caddy bags install easy-to-carry cleaning supplies. Find the accessories that are right for you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:48:05','2026-05-08 10:48:05'),(503,'Powered Tilt Trucks','powered-tilt-trucks',501,'Powered tilt trucks provide an automated solution for moving bulkier loads of up to 1500 lbs safely, preventing employee strain or injury. These electric tilt trucks go a max speed of 3 mph in forward and reverse directions and feature a propulsion system with automatic braking capabilities. Made with industrial polyethylene, our motorized tilt trucks won’t dent, crack or corrode over time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:48:08','2026-05-08 10:48:08'),(504,'Hopper Tilt Trucks','hopper-tilt-trucks',501,'Hopper Tilt Trucks are designed for containing and collecting industrial waste products for disposal. Low profile tilt trucks feature a tapered scoop side for easy use and unloading of waste while steel tilt trucks are ideal for bulkier waste management or sanitation applications. All hopper tilt trucks have an all-welded steel construction with a powder coated finish for corrosion resistance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:48:12','2026-05-08 10:48:12'),(505,'Forkliftable & Towable Tilt Trucks','forkliftable-towable-tilt-trucks',501,'Forkliftable tilt trucks have reinforced channels and molded fork pockets built into the base for safe lifting and transport by forklift. Towable tilt trucks are built for large-scale material movement over longer distances, such as campuses, plants, or outdoor waste routes. Both forkliftable and towable tilt trucks can withstand heavy, frequent loads in demanding applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:48:15','2026-05-08 10:48:15'),(506,'Light Duty Tilt Trucks','light-duty-tilt-trucks',501,'With weight capacities between 450-825 lbs, Light Duty Tilt Trucks can handle industrial waste products efficiently. With a capacity range of 3/4 -1 cubic yards, the durable, seamless polyethylene build of these tilt trucks guarantees no rust, corrosion, or leaks. The ergonomic design of the steer handle provides comfort while in use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:48:19','2026-05-08 10:48:19'),(507,'Extra Heavy Duty Tilt Trucks','extra-heavy-duty-tilt-trucks',501,'Extra Heavy Duty Tilt Trucks have impressive weight capacities from 2100 to 2750 lbs. With capacities between 1 and 2-1/2 cubic yards, these trucks include upper and lower steel extended support rails, a steel chassis, and a steel impact nose plate for added strength. The rugged polyethylene build is made for transporting and dumping bulky materials with rubber load wheels and swivel casters.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:48:22','2026-05-08 10:48:22'),(508,'Heavy Duty Tilt Trucks','heavy-duty-tilt-trucks',501,'Heavy Duty Tilt Trucks have weight capacities between 1250-2000 lbs and feature a seamless polyethylene body secured to a strong tubular steel chassis to withstand high load capacities and transport bulky items. With capacities from 1/2 to 2-1/2 cubic yards, the rubber load wheels and swivel casters provide unit maneuverability and surface protection.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:48:25','2026-05-08 10:48:25'),(509,'Standard Duty Tilt Trucks','standard-duty-tilt-trucks',501,'Standard tilt trucks support everyday material handling in indoor environments such as janitorial, maintenance, and light industrial areas. With weight capacities between 850-1200 lbs, their seamless, rotational molded bodies are leak-resistant and easy to clean, and swivel casters make it simple to maneuver through tight aisles and doorways.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:48:29','2026-05-08 10:48:29'),(510,'Tub Carts','tub-carts',2,'Tub carts are mobile containers featuring a sturdy tub-shaped design constructed from durable materials, ensuring the safe storage of goods and supplies. Equipped with wheels and handles for effortless maneuverability, they are available in various sizes to suit different needs. Tub carts serve a multitude of purposes in commercial spaces, educational institutions, healthcare facilities, and home improvement tasks, facilitating organized and swift transportation of items and equipment with ease and efficiency.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:49:54','2026-05-08 10:49:54'),(511,'Poly Tub Lids','poly-tub-lids',510,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:53:11','2026-05-08 10:53:11'),(512,'Poly Tubs','poly-tubs',510,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:53:13','2026-05-08 10:53:13'),(513,'Bulk Movers Without Tubs','bulk-movers-without-tubs',510,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:53:16','2026-05-08 10:53:16'),(514,'Elevated Sorting Cart','elevated-sorting-cart',510,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:53:19','2026-05-08 10:53:19'),(515,'Tub Carts with Scale','tub-carts-with-scale',510,'Poly scale carts are ideal for weighing linens, parts, packages, and more. The digital scale has an auto shut-off and can support up to 250 lbs. Support arms hold the tub in place, and it can easily be removed. Polyurethane casters allow for easy maneuvering. Royal basket trucks are available in various sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:53:21','2026-05-08 10:53:21'),(516,'Bulk Movers With Tubs','bulk-movers-with-tubs',510,'Bulk movers with tubs are designed for transporting a variety of items in food preparation, packing and storage applications. Tubs are removable and easy to clean. The base maneuvers smoothly on four polyurethane swivel casters. Lids for the tubs are also available and sold separately. Bulk movers are available in a wide range of sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:53:25','2026-05-08 10:53:25'),(517,'Cart & Truck Accessories','cart-truck-accessories',1,'We proudly offer a variety of high-quality accessories designed to enhance the functionality and versatility of your commercial carts and trucks. From replacement wheels and casters to bulk truck liners and forklift accessories, utility cart with drawer look no further for anything and everything you need to optimize the performance of your dollies, hand trucks, utility, carts, and pallet trucks. Whether you\'re looking to increase mobility, organize your tools and equipment, or protect your cargo, we have the durable and practical products you need to maximize the efficiency and effectiveness of your carts and trucks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:55:05','2026-05-08 10:55:05'),(518,'Bearings','bearings',48,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:56:45','2026-05-08 10:56:45'),(519,'Bushings','bushings',48,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:57:05','2026-05-08 10:57:05'),(520,'Couplings & Shaft Collars','couplings-shaft-collars',48,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:57:25','2026-05-08 10:57:25'),(521,'Couplings & Shaft Collars','couplings-shaft-collars-1',48,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:57:36','2026-05-08 10:57:36'),(522,'Cart & Truck Casters','cart-truck-casters',517,'Cart & Truck Casters are reliable components that keep material handling equipment rolling smoothly. Designed for various applications, including carts, trucks, and dollies, they ensure ease of movement and maneuverability in multiple environments. Cart and Truck Casters provide the durability and performance needed to maintain material handling equipment, whether swivel, rigid, or brake casters are required.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:57:56','2026-05-08 10:57:56'),(523,'Gas Engines','gas-engines',48,'Gas engines deliver exceptional power output while ensuring durability and longevity. With advanced features like low emissions, fuel efficiency, and easy maintenance, gas engines provide a cost-effective solution for power requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 10:57:58','2026-05-21 14:55:38'),(524,'Platform Truck Casters','platform-truck-casters',522,'Enhance the mobility of material handling equipment with our reliable Platform Truck Casters. Built to withstand demanding environments, these heavy duty casters have a high weight capacity and steel plate for lasting performance. Individual rigid and swivel casters are sold alongside platform truck caster kits that have four swivel and two rigid casters. Choose from a variety of wheel diameters.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:02:13','2026-05-08 11:07:49'),(525,'Ceramic Sheets','ceramic-sheets',425,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:02:37','2026-05-08 11:02:37'),(526,'Bulk Truck Casters','bulk-truck-casters',522,'Bulk Truck Casters are specifically designed to support and allow easy maneuverability of large carts, trucks, and other material handling equipment. These industrial casters have a durable construction and can be used to transport heavy loads even on rougher surfaces. Rigid and swivel replacement bulk casters are sold individually or in caster kits with two of each for efficient truck mobility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:03:59','2026-05-08 11:03:59'),(527,'Shelving Unit Casters','shelving-unit-casters',522,'Improve the mobility of your shelving systems with our heavy duty Shelving Unit Casters. These shelving casters are designed to seamlessly integrate with a wide range of shelving systems and are easy to install. The durable polymer build makes our casters for shelving units suitable for wet, humid, and/or dry environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:04:03','2026-05-08 11:04:03'),(528,'Composite Bar Stock','composite-bar-stock',427,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:04:05','2026-05-08 11:04:05'),(529,'Tilt Truck Casters','tilt-truck-casters',522,'Enhance the mobility and maneuverability of your tilt truck with high-quality Tilt Truck Casters. These commercial casters can withstand heavy loads, and feature polyurethane wheels that swivel for 360° mobility. Choose from a range of options for your tilt truck, including replacement wheels and casters.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:04:06','2026-05-08 11:04:06'),(530,'Self-Dumping Hopper Casters','self-dumping-hopper-casters',522,'Self-Dumping Hopper Casters provide reliable and smooth mobility for hoppers. These heavy duty casters for hoppers have a high weight capacity per set to make transporting large loads easy. Our casters for self-dumping hoppers come in sets of two swivel and two rigid for easy maneuvering. Wheel diameter and additional dimensions vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:04:09','2026-05-08 11:04:09'),(531,'Service & Utility Cart Casters','service-utility-cart-casters',522,'Equip your carts with our Service & Utility Cart Casters for smooth and efficient transportation. Designed to withstand heavy use, our industrial cart casters can easily support large loads. The steel plate and polyurethane wheels make these utility casters suitable for wet or dry industrial environments. Replacement casters for carts are sold alongside our kits.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:04:12','2026-05-08 11:04:12'),(532,'Scissor Table Casters','scissor-table-casters',522,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:12:49','2026-05-08 11:12:49'),(533,'Hand Truck Casters','hand-truck-casters',522,'Engineered for durability and smooth operation, Hand Truck Casters ensure effortless transportation in commercial environments. With their sturdy construction, these casters for hand trucks can support heavy loads. Hand truck casters are easy to install and replacement units are available to provide your hand trucks with lasting mobility. Wheel diameter varies per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:12:53','2026-05-08 11:12:53'),(534,'Dolly Casters','dolly-casters',522,'Dolly Casters are designed to enhance the mobility of standard dolly units. These casters provide smooth, effortless movement that allows you to transport heavy loads with ease. Many caster types are offered, including all-terrain swivel casters for rough surfaces. Our heavy duty dolly casters come in different wheel diameters for varying levels of stability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:12:57','2026-05-08 11:12:57'),(535,'Dolly Parts & Accessories','dolly-parts-accessories',517,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:14:27','2026-05-08 11:14:27'),(536,'Dolly Bars','dolly-bars',535,'The dolly bar transforms a dolly into a platform truck. These dolly handles can easily be attached to various dollies, and most have a heat treated powder coat to ensure lasting durability. Various styles of dolly bars are available to help meet any commercial or industrial hauling needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:15:19','2026-05-08 11:15:19'),(537,'Forklift Accessories','forklift-accessories',517,'Forklift attachments are each designed to handle specific tasks and improve forklift functionality. They include fork extensions, hoppers, loaders, cranes, hooks, clamps, dumpers, brooms, and more. Accessories enhance the usability of forklifts and range from safety lights and mirrors to tool holders and carts, all of which are built to withstand the rigorous demands of industrial use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:42:21','2026-05-08 11:42:21'),(538,'Forklift Lights','forklift-lights',537,'Forklift lights prevent injury and provide safety signals to those working in an industrial factory or facility. Forklift warning lights alert pedestrians and other facility vehicles of the presence of the machine to which it’s attached. Lights help ensure that machinery meets OSHA requirements. The forklift light provides visual safety alerts in any industrial or commercial space.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:43:28','2026-05-08 11:43:28'),(539,'Forklift Arc Beam Boundary Warning Lights','forklift-arc-beam-boundary-warning-lights',538,'Forklift Arc Beam Boundary Warning Lights project a bright red, U-shaped perimeter beam on the floor to visually alert machine operators that a forklift nearby is in operation. Safety warning spotlights securely attach to the rear of forklifts or other vehicles and utilize the vehicle’s electric power for operation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:50:05','2026-05-08 11:50:05'),(540,'Forklift Strobe Lights','forklift-strobe-lights',538,'These LED forklift strobe lights are designed to increase the visibility of forklifts in low-light conditions and prevent accidents. The forklift strobe lights are permanently mounted and models operate in various voltages. These lights are made with high-quality materials and are suitable for use in harsh industrial environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:50:08','2026-05-08 11:50:08'),(541,'Forklift Spotlight Warning Lights','forklift-spotlight-warning-lights',538,'Forklift pedestrian safety warning spotlights provide a bright warning signal from the forklift to alert pedestrians and other vehicles of its presence. They come in a variety of sizes, colors and styles and are powered by electricity. They can be mounted on the forklift or on the ceiling. They are weather-resistant and easy to install. Ideal for warehouses, factories, and other industrial areas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:50:11','2026-05-08 11:50:11'),(542,'Forklift Side Boundary Warning Lights','forklift-side-boundary-warning-lights',538,'Forklift Side Boundary Warning Lights project a bright red beam on the floor to visually indicate the safe distance from the forklift for pedestrians. These LED safety warning lights are powered by the vehicle’s electrical system and mount to the side of a forklift or other industrial vehicle.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:50:14','2026-05-08 11:50:14'),(543,'Forklift Arrow Warning Lights','forklift-arrow-warning-lights',538,'Forklift arrow lights provide visibility and direction when operating forklifts. These lights mount to the overhead guard and project a bright beam of light to indicate the direction of travel. They are weatherproof and come in a variety of shapes and sizes to fit your application. The safety warning spotlights help prevent personnel and pedestrian collisions in warehouses, docks, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:50:56','2026-05-08 11:50:56'),(544,'Forklift Seats & Seat Belts','forklift-seats-seat-belts',537,'Forklift seats provide added operator comfort and productivity when operating a forklift. The forklift seats are made of vinyl, offer an adjustable backrest and headrest, and include a durable suspension system for shock absorption. The ergonomic seats are designed to fit most forklift models, providing a smooth ride while reducing operator fatigue.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:52:39','2026-05-08 11:52:39'),(545,'Replacement Forklift Seat Belts & Accessories','replacement-forklift-seat-belts-accessories',544,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:54:17','2026-05-08 11:54:17'),(546,'Replacement Forklift Seats','replacement-forklift-seats',544,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 11:54:19','2026-05-08 11:54:19'),(547,'Forklift Checklist Logs & Caddies','forklift-checklist-logs-caddies',537,'Checklist logs and caddies are essential for keeping a physical record of machine maintenance, inspection, and usage. Log books comply with safety regulations and standards, ensuring employees in industrial and manufacturing facilities are safe from equipment failure and accidents. They are user-friendly and available in different formats.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:04:40','2026-05-08 12:04:40'),(548,'Checklist Logs & Caddies Accessories','checklist-logs-caddies-accessories',547,'Boasting magnetic and clip-on designs, Checklist Logs and Caddies Accessories for forklifts and warehouse machinery provide a convenient place to store log books, small parts and accessories, giving forklift or vehicle operators quick access to important equipment information and stored supplies.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:07:11','2026-05-08 12:07:11'),(549,'Log Books','log-books',547,'Designed with itemized rows and boxes to ensure important data is collected to promote safety, Log Books are used to maintain a complete maintenance history of forklifts and vehicles. They contain hundreds of checklists that allow forklift or vehicle operators to record their daily inspections as required by OSHA before each shift begins.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:07:15','2026-05-08 12:07:15'),(550,'Caddies','caddies',547,'Designed to help meet OSHA compliance for pre-operational inspections, Checklist Caddies for industrial machines and vehicles come with itemized forms for forklift or vehicle operators to maintain a daily record to meet OSHA forklift inspection requirements. Multiple sets of carbonless forms create two copies of checklists, and the bright yellow container provides a constant reminder to inspect.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:07:18','2026-05-08 12:07:18'),(551,'Checklists','checklists',547,'Designed with itemized lines and boxes for specific machines and their individual parts, Checklists allow plant managers and machine operators to keep detailed records of maintenance, inspections, and operation made on warehouse machinery and equipment. They provide a complete overview of equipment status to promote a safe work environment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:07:21','2026-05-08 12:07:21'),(552,'Forklift Jacks & Stands','forklift-jacks-stands',537,'Forklift Jacks & Lifts are designed to provide stability and strength to lift and support forklifts during repairs and maintenance operations. Engineered for durability, heavy duty jacks ensure a secure foundation for forklift fleets, enhancing operational safety. Suitable for various forklift models, these forklift jacks are a versatile solution for industrial settings, including warehouses and workshops.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:09:57','2026-05-08 12:09:57'),(553,'Hydraulic Forklift Truck Jacks','hydraulic-forklift-truck-jacks',552,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:11:06','2026-05-08 12:11:06'),(554,'Forklift Jack Stands','forklift-jack-stands',552,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:11:37','2026-05-08 12:11:37'),(555,'Forklift Covers & Enclosures','forklift-covers-enclosures',537,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:12:27','2026-05-08 12:12:27'),(556,'Forklift Windshields','forklift-windshields',555,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:13:40','2026-05-08 12:13:40'),(557,'Forklift Canopies & Covers','forklift-canopies-covers',555,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:13:44','2026-05-08 12:13:44'),(558,'Forklift Chargers & Connectors','forklift-chargers-connectors',537,'Forklift chargers and connectors are ideal for ensuring rapid charging for a forklift. Available a variety of voltage compatibilities and amperage levels. The forklift battery chargers and connectors can easily connect to various forklift models with the interchangeable connectors. The forklift chargers and connectors are built to endure industrial conditions in any commercial factory or facility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:15:23','2026-05-08 12:15:23'),(559,'Forklift Battery Dissipators','forklift-battery-dissipators',558,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:18:17','2026-05-08 12:18:17'),(560,'Forklift DIN Battery Connectors','forklift-din-battery-connectors',558,'Available in a variety of amperage and voltage levels in male and female connector types, Forklift DIN Battery Connectors help to provide a secure coupling between an industrial vehicle or forklift battery and its electrical system for safe, reliable operation in industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:18:20','2026-05-08 12:18:20'),(561,'Forklift Electronic Code Switches','forklift-electronic-code-switches',558,'Provide secure access to forklifts and other industrial equipment with Forklift Electronic Code Switches that are designed with a multi-digit keypad that can be programmed with a custom code, allowing only authorized personnel to operate the machine. Some models accept multiple codes to accommodate different users and maintain a log of vehicle operators.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:18:24','2026-05-08 12:18:24'),(562,'Replacement Forklift Battery Chargers','replacement-forklift-battery-chargers',558,'Offered in a range of voltage & amperage levels to accommodate various equipment, Replacement Forklift Battery Chargers allow forklift operators to keep forklift batteries fully charged, helping to ensure the vehicles are fully operational throughout the shift, with safety features like 3-second delay and automatic shutoff on select models that promote safe use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:18:27','2026-05-08 12:18:27'),(563,'Forklift Plug & Socket Connectors','forklift-plug-socket-connectors',558,'Available in multiple options to suit a variety of voltage and amperage levels, Forklift Plug and Socket Connectors provide a simple but secure connection between a forklift battery & electrical system to ensure dependable power. Self-cleaning contacts help reduce the risk of arcing, and flared, heat-treated barrels allow for consistent contact.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:18:31','2026-05-08 12:18:31'),(564,'Forklift Bumpers & Guards','forklift-bumpers-guards',537,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:19:26','2026-05-08 12:19:26'),(565,'Forklift Mirrors','forklift-mirrors',537,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:20:14','2026-05-08 12:20:14'),(566,'Bolt On Forklift Safety Mirrors','bolt-on-forklift-safety-mirrors',565,'Featuring a bolt-on design for secure attachment to the vertical or horizontal bars of a vehicle, Bolt On Forklift Safety Mirrors are designed for use with forklifts and other industrial vehicles to help improve the driver’s field of view, and they can be adjusted to give drivers of all sizes for clear visibility of their surroundings to promote safety.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:21:35','2026-05-08 12:21:35'),(567,'Magnetic Forklift Safety Mirrors','magnetic-forklift-safety-mirrors',565,'Outfitted with a magnetic base for strong, secure attachment to ferrous metal surfaces, Magnetic Forklift Safety Mirrors attach to forklifts and other industrial vehicles to enhance visibility and promote driver and pedestrian safety. The magnets allow the mirrors to be removed or repositioned to help eliminate blind spots from the rear and side of the vehicle or to move from one vehicle to another.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:21:39','2026-05-08 12:21:39'),(568,'Composite Bar Stock','composite-bar-stock-1',427,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:22:08','2026-05-08 12:22:08'),(569,'Forklift Alarms','forklift-alarms',537,'Forklift backup alarms provide an audible warning to alert workers and pedestrians of approaching forklifts, making them essential safety features for warehouses and loading docks. These alarms have a durable design, come in various decibel levels, and can be installed on any forklift model for added safety. Ensure the safety of your workers and prevent accidents with forklift backup alarms.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:23:27','2026-05-08 12:23:27'),(570,'Ideal Warehouse Forklift Ergo Back Up Handles with Horns','ideal-warehouse-forklift-ergo-back-up-handles-with-horns',569,'The Ideal Warehouse Forklift Ergo Back-Up Handles are designed to enhance forklift driver ergonomics and reduce back strain. Placed inside the overhead guard, these forklift handles ensure that the operator\'s hand remains within the forklift at all times, offering a secure grip while reversing. Additionally, the handles improve the comfort by providing a resting place for the hand.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:25:10','2026-05-08 12:25:10'),(571,'Safe-T-Alert® Forklift Backup Alarms','safe-t-alert-forklift-backup-alarms',569,'Safe-T-Alert® Forklift Backup Alarms emit loud, beeping sounds to alert warehouse and factory workers that a nearby forklift is backing up. Universal mounting brackets enable simple and secure attachment to a variety of industrial vehicles.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:25:13','2026-05-08 12:25:13'),(572,'Global Industrial™ Forklift Backup Alarm','global-industrial-forklift-backup-alarm',569,'Global Industrial™ Forklift Backup Alarms help keep warehouse workers safe by audibly alerting them to nearby forklifts backing up. This reverse alarm activates automatically when put into reverse gear and produces a loud 107 dB beeping sound that ensures personnel can hear it, even in loud environments. They feature a bolt-mount design for secure attachment to forklifts & industrial vehicles.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:25:16','2026-05-08 12:25:16'),(573,'Forklift Tanks','forklift-tanks',537,'Forklift Tanks are specialized containers designed to store and supply fuel for forklifts and other material-handling equipment. High-quality steel and aluminum construction ensure durability and resistance and protect the tank from damage. Different collar diameters and water weight capacity amounts allow the tanks to fit onto any forklift trucks of all sizes, promoting efficiency. Forklift tanks can be used in various industrial environments, including construction sites, warehouses, manufacturing facilities, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:26:10','2026-05-08 12:26:10'),(574,'Manchester Forklift LPG Tanks','manchester-forklift-lpg-tanks',573,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:26:50','2026-05-08 12:26:50'),(575,'Worthington Forklift LPG Tanks','worthington-forklift-lpg-tanks',573,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:27:14','2026-05-08 12:27:14'),(576,'Attachable Forklift Fans','attachable-forklift-fans',537,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:28:02','2026-05-08 12:28:02'),(577,'Magnetic Forklift Fans','magnetic-forklift-fans',576,'Equipped with powerful magnets for secure, convenient mounting to an overhead guard, Magnetic Forklift Fans can be attached to industrial vehicles and forklifts to help keep warehouse workers cool and comfortable during their shift. They draw DC power from the vehicle’s on-board electrical system when properly setup.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:28:43','2026-05-08 12:28:43'),(578,'Bolt On Forklift Fans','bolt-on-forklift-fans',576,'Designed to plug directly into a vehicle’s 12V DC auxillary power socket for consistent current, Bolt On Forklift Fans provide a permanently-mounted source of airflow to help keep warehouse workers cool and comfortable while driving forklifts and other industrial vehicles. The bolt-on design enables secure, permanent placement on the dash or side panel and the durable steel construction delivers durability & strength.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:29:06','2026-05-08 12:29:06'),(579,'Forklift Mats','forklift-mats',537,'Crafted with a raised surface pattern to efficiently remove dirt and moisture from wheels, Forklift Mats help maintain a clean, dry, and safe work floor in warehouses, factories, and other industrial facilities. The adhesive system used helps prevent the mats from shifting or moving as forklifts enter or exit the building, and the durable construction allows it to withstand daily heavy-duty use and hold up over time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:29:51','2026-05-08 12:29:51'),(580,'Safety Forklift Mats','safety-forklift-mats',579,'Safety Forklift Mats are essential for creating a safe work environment when lift trucks enter and exit buildings to and from the outside. They are designed to effectively remove moisture and dirt from forklift wheels to improve safety. These forklift floor mats feature an adhesive taping system to keep mats from moving, and a polypropylene carpet that is fast drying and easy to clean.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:30:20','2026-05-08 12:30:20'),(581,'Composite Rod Stock','composite-rod-stock',427,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:30:54','2026-05-08 12:30:54'),(582,'Composite Sheet Stock','composite-sheet-stock',427,'Sheet stock can be used as an electrical insulator, or to help manufacture different structural components. They are lightweight, resistant to heat and have superior strength which ensures lasting durability. Sheet stock is ideal for any electrical, mechanical or aerospace aplications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:31:34','2026-05-08 12:31:34'),(583,'Round Tube Stock','round-tube-stock',427,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:32:22','2026-05-08 12:32:22'),(584,'Felt Rolls','felt-rolls',433,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:34:06','2026-05-08 12:34:06'),(585,'Felt Sheets','felt-sheets',433,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:34:20','2026-05-08 12:34:20'),(586,'Felt Strips','felt-strips',433,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:34:50','2026-05-08 12:34:50'),(587,'Foam Cords','foam-cords',436,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:44:34','2026-05-08 12:44:34'),(588,'Multipurpose Neoprene Foam Cords','multipurpose-neoprene-foam-cords',587,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:45:11','2026-05-08 12:45:11'),(589,'Hand Truck Parts & Accessories','hand-truck-parts-accessories',517,'Hand truck parts and accessories improve hand truck performance and durability as well as extending the life. They include wheels, handles, noseplates, replacement parts, and other accessories that are easy to use and highly durable. Users can customize hand trucks to their specific requirements, resulting in efficient material handling. Hand trucks and components are suitable for use in warehouses, distribution centers, and other material handling settings and contribute to the smooth movement of goods, optimizing hand truck functionality.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:45:14','2026-05-08 12:45:14'),(590,'High Temperature Silicone Foam Cords','high-temperature-silicone-foam-cords',587,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:47:34','2026-05-08 12:47:34'),(591,'Oil-Resistant Buna-N Foam Cords','oil-resistant-buna-n-foam-cords',587,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:49:17','2026-05-08 12:49:17'),(592,'New Age Hand Truck Parts & Accessories','new-age-hand-truck-parts-accessories',589,'New Age Hand Truck Parts and Accessories offer warehouse workers and other factory employees improved performance & comfort when using hand trucks. Wheel kits and other hand truck replacement parts allow old or worn-out components to be swapped out to promote long-term utility, and hand truck accessories like pallet attachments provide even-load distribution for items that extend past the toe plate.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:49:57','2026-05-08 12:49:57'),(593,'Vestil Hand Truck Parts & Accessories','vestil-hand-truck-parts-accessories',589,'Made with durable steel to hold strong over time, Vestil Hand Truck Parts and Accessories improve efficiency when loading and transporting heavy items, and include items like tie-down attachments that help secure loads in place to help prevent them from moving around in transit.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:49:59','2026-05-08 12:49:59'),(594,'Wesco® Hand Truck Parts & Accessories','wesco-hand-truck-parts-accessories',589,'Designed to improve their efficiency, Wesco Hand Truck Parts and Accessories such as toe plates & decks are built to accommodate loads of varying shapes and sizes, while heavy-duty straps secure boxes and other cargo in place during transport. Optional stair climbers can be attached to assist when moving up and down staircases.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:50:02','2026-05-08 12:50:02'),(595,'Magliner® Hand Truck Parts & Accessories','magliner-hand-truck-parts-accessories',589,'Magliner Hand Truck Parts and Accessories are designed to improve efficiency when loading and transporting bulky items and include stair climber attachments to keep the hand truck stable while navigating flights of stairs and ratchet straps that can be added to secure loads. Replacement parts like wheels, axles, and frames help extend the hand truck’s life.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:50:05','2026-05-08 12:50:05'),(596,'Global Industrial™ Hand Truck Parts & Accessories','global-industrial-hand-truck-parts-accessories',589,'Global Industrial Hand Truck Parts and Accessories allow warehouse workers to modify hand trucks to enhance functionality or replace worn components and extend its service life. Accessories like decks or nose plate extensions provide versatility to accommodate loads of different shapes and sizes, while replacement wheels help ensure smooth rolling during transport.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:50:08','2026-05-08 12:50:08'),(597,'Graphite Rods','graphite-rods',435,'Graphite rods are crucial for a wide range of industrial applications, offering exceptional heat resistance, electrical conductivity, and durability. These rods are ideal for high-temperature environments, electrical systems, and chemical processes. Whether used in foundries, laboratories, or machining applications, graphite rods provide the strength and stability needed to withstand extreme conditions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:50:27','2026-05-08 12:50:27'),(598,'Graphite Sheets','graphite-sheets',435,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:50:58','2026-05-08 12:50:58'),(599,'Compressible Graphite Sheets','compressible-graphite-sheets',598,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:51:29','2026-05-08 12:51:29'),(601,'Aluminum','aluminum',437,'Aluminum bar stock is used to fabricate a range of products across many industries. It is lightweight and corrosion resistant for long lasting durability. Aluminum stock is versatile and conductive making it ideal for the automotive industry, construction sites, manufacturing plants, and other industrial workplaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:53:04','2026-05-08 12:53:04'),(602,'Bushings','bushings-1',48,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:53:14','2026-05-08 12:53:14'),(603,'Couplings & Shaft Collars','couplings-shaft-collars-2',48,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:53:30','2026-05-08 12:53:30'),(605,'B & P Manufacturing Hand Truck Parts & Accessories','b-p-manufacturing-hand-truck-parts-accessories',589,'B&P Manufacturing Hand Truck Parts and Accessories are designed to improve the functionality and performance of hand trucks when loading and moving heavy objects. Hand truck accessories, such as snap-on decks, are quick & easy to attach, giving user a flush surface to support bulky or oddly-shaped items when transporting cargo when in the truck or platform positions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:53:56','2026-05-08 12:53:56'),(606,'Valley Craft® Hand Truck Parts & Accessories','valley-craft-hand-truck-parts-accessories',589,'Help improve the load-carrying capabilities of select hand cart models with Valley Craft Hand Truck Parts and Accessories, including flat and transmission forks that can be affixed to hand carts to support bulky heavyweight loads and can be folded out of the way when not in use for compact storage.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:54:00','2026-05-08 12:54:00'),(607,'Gearboxes & Speed Reducers','gearboxes-speed-reducers',48,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:54:01','2026-05-08 12:54:01'),(608,'Justrite® Hand Truck Parts & Accessories','justrite-hand-truck-parts-accessories',589,'Justrite Hand Truck Parts and Accessories are suitable for use with gas cylinder hand trucks to help improve functionality and storage. Accessories, like a tool tray, securely attach to hand trucks and conveniently hold tools & supplies while ensuring they are easily accessible, and locking posts provide stability for gas cylinders of various diameters.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:54:03','2026-05-08 12:54:03'),(609,'Morse® Hand Truck Parts & Accessories','morse-hand-truck-parts-accessories',589,'Compatible with select drum cradle trucks, Morse Hand Truck Parts and Accessories are designed to facilitate the loading and unloading of industrial drums, with accessories like tipping levers that give workers the leverage needed to transition drums from the upright to cradle position, and drip pan attachments to protect floors from spills from cradled drums.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:54:07','2026-05-08 12:54:07'),(610,'RefrigiWear® Hand Truck Parts & Accessories','refrigiwear-hand-truck-parts-accessories',589,'RefrigiWear Hand Truck Parts and Accessories attach securely to help enhance functionality when transporting items. Available accessories include an insulated pouch with quick-release clasps for simple, stable connection to a hand truck, allowing users to easily carry loose objects or food items while leaving the frame and toe plate free for boxes and bulky cargo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:54:12','2026-05-08 12:54:12'),(611,'Gearing','gearing',48,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:54:22','2026-05-08 12:54:22'),(612,'Hydraulics','hydraulics',48,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:54:41','2026-05-08 12:54:41'),(613,'Industrial Lubricants','industrial-lubricants',48,'Lubricants are designed to reduce friction, wear, and corrosion, ensuring smooth and efficient operation in various industrial settings. With high-quality formulations, industrial lubricants offer exceptional protection and performance, extending the lifespan of your equipment. From oils to greases, they are designed to meet specific industrial needs, whether in manufacturing, automotive, or heavy machinery.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100