ers stabilize and secure cargo during use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:58:26','2026-05-08 12:58:26'),(631,'Global Industrial™ Lift Truck Parts','global-industrial-lift-truck-parts',617,'Offered in variety of options to fit specific models and styles of lift trucks, Global Industrial Lift Truck Parts, such as optional platforms and lift booms, are forklift accessories designed to ensure efficient movement and lifting of heavy-duty loads in warehouse settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:58:30','2026-05-08 12:58:30'),(632,'Bags & Cases','bags-cases',50,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:58:44','2026-05-08 12:58:44'),(633,'JET® Lift Truck Parts','jet-lift-truck-parts',617,'Designed for a variety of lift trucks and hydraulic stackers, JET Lift Truck Parts are replacement forklift parts that help warehouse workers maintain the functionality of industrial equipment. Parts such as chain wheels, spring pins, axles, rollers, adjustment screws, and more allow machine operators to replace worn or broken components to help extend the vehicle’s life.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:59:06','2026-05-08 12:59:06'),(634,'Basic Supplies','basic-supplies',50,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:59:10','2026-05-08 12:59:10'),(635,'Binders & Covers','binders-covers',50,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:59:26','2026-05-08 12:59:26'),(636,'Boards & Easels','boards-easels-1',50,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:59:41','2026-05-08 12:59:41'),(637,'Calendars & Planners','calendars-planners',50,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 12:59:56','2026-05-08 12:59:56'),(638,'Computers & Electronics','computers-electronics',50,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:00:13','2026-05-08 13:00:13'),(639,'Educational Materials','educational-materials',50,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:00:36','2026-05-08 13:00:36'),(640,'Folders & Filing','folders-filing',50,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:01:03','2026-05-08 13:01:03'),(641,'Ink & Toner','ink-toner',50,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:01:31','2026-05-08 13:01:31'),(642,'Labels & Label Makers','labels-label-makers',50,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:01:47','2026-05-08 13:01:47'),(643,'Liners & Caps','liners-caps-1',517,'Liners and Caps are essential accessories for bins and carts used in various material handling applications. Liners are made from durable materials to provide a protective barrier for bins, while caps secure the contents of bins, ensuring safe transport of items.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:02:17','2026-05-08 13:02:17'),(644,'Office Furniture','office-furniture',50,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:02:57','2026-05-08 13:02:57'),(645,'Office Machines','office-machines',50,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:03:12','2026-05-08 13:03:12'),(646,'Paper','paper',50,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:03:31','2026-05-08 13:03:31'),(647,'Phones','phones',50,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:03:54','2026-05-08 13:03:54'),(648,'Bag Sealers','bag-sealers',51,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:04:39','2026-05-08 13:04:39'),(649,'Bags & Covers','bags-covers',51,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:04:56','2026-05-08 13:04:56'),(650,'Carton Sealing Machines','carton-sealing-machines',51,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:05:19','2026-05-08 13:05:19'),(651,'Dandux Vinyl Liners for Bulk Basket Trucks','dandux-vinyl-liners-for-bulk-basket-trucks-1',450,'Dandux vinyl liners for bulk basket trucks are designed to provide reliable protection for bulk basket trucks. Made with durable tear-resistant vinyl material, these basket truck replacement liners offer a barrier against damage and contamination. Vinyl liners are easy to install, remove, and clean and are available in numerous bushel capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:06:18','2026-05-08 13:06:18'),(652,'H.G. Maybeck Nylon Hamper Basket Liners','hg-maybeck-nylon-hamper-basket-liners-1',450,'H.G. Maybeck nylon hamper basket liners are designed to prolong the life of commercial laundry carts by providing a protective barrier between the basket and stored contents. Made with lightweight, easy-to-clean nylon, these hamper liners create a barrier that protects against dirt and contamination. Nylon liners for hampers are available in numerous bushel capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:06:22','2026-05-08 13:06:22'),(653,'Global Industrial™ Canvas Bulk Basket Truck Liners','global-industrial-canvas-bulk-basket-truck-liners-1',450,'Our canvas bulk basket truck liners provide a protective barrier for bulk basket trucks and the contents inside. Made from heavyweight canvas, these truck liners offer maximum abrasion resistance and are water-repellent to prevent damage. These easy-to-install liners are specifically designed to fit Global Industrial bulk trucks. Available in numerous bushel capacities and sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:06:25','2026-05-08 13:06:25'),(654,'Global Industrial™ Vinyl Bulk Basket Truck Liners','global-industrial-vinyl-bulk-basket-truck-liners-1',450,'Vinyl bulk basket truck liners are designed to create a reliable protective barrier specifically for our bulk basket trucks. Made with high-quality puncture-resistant vinyl, these truck liners are easy to install, remove, and clean. Our basket truck replacement liners are available in numerous bushel capacities and colors, ideal for material handling in hospitality, retail, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:06:30','2026-05-08 13:06:30'),(655,'Global Industrial™ Gaylord & Tote Bin Liners','global-industrial-gaylord-tote-bin-liners-1',450,'Our Gaylord and tote bin liners create a protective lining to keep boxes, bins, and other containers clean. Made with lightweight but durable polyethylene, these translucent box liners feature a gusseted design to fit the container\'s shape. They keep bins clean and protect the contents inside from contaminants. Gaylord liners are available in various sizes to fit a wide range of containers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:06:33','2026-05-08 13:06:33'),(656,'Carton Sealing Machines','carton-sealing-machines-1',51,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:07:13','2026-05-08 13:07:13'),(657,'Corrugated Boxes & Cartons','corrugated-boxes-cartons',51,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:08:33','2026-05-08 13:08:33'),(658,'Envelopes & Mailers','envelopes-mailers',51,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:08:49','2026-05-08 13:08:49'),(659,'Labels & Barcode Supplies','labels-barcode-supplies',51,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:10:07','2026-05-08 13:10:07'),(660,'Office & Packing Tape','office-packing-tape-1',51,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:10:26','2026-05-08 13:10:26'),(661,'Packing Workbenches','packing-workbenches',51,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:10:39','2026-05-08 13:10:39'),(662,'H.G. Maybeck Vinyl Hamper Basket Caps','hg-maybeck-vinyl-hamper-basket-caps-1',450,'H.G. Maybeck vinyl hamper basket caps are convenient and reliable coverings designed for commercial laundry bins and hamper baskets. Made with heavy-duty vinyl, these hamper covers feature an elastic band rim to provide a snug and secure fit, ensuring maximum protection of hamper contents. Basket caps are available in numerous bushel capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:10:44','2026-05-08 13:10:44'),(663,'Royal Basket Trucks® Poly Hinged Lids','royal-basket-trucks-poly-hinged-lids-1',450,'Royal Basket Trucks® poly hinged lids provide a convenient protective solution for truck storage. These hinged lids are designed specifically to fit Royal Basket Trucks® brand poly trucks and liners. Made with durable, corrosion-resistant polyethylene, these lids can conceal and protect truck contents during storage and transportation. The hinged design allows easy access to stored contents.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:10:47','2026-05-08 13:10:47'),(664,'H.G. Maybeck Nylon Hamper Basket Caps','hg-maybeck-nylon-hamper-basket-caps-1',450,'H.G. Maybeck nylon hamper basket caps are designed to provide a protective covering for commercial or industrial laundry bins. Made with lightweight yet durable and easy-to-clean nylon, these hamper covers feature an elastic band for a snug fit on top of laundry carts. Basket caps protect hamper contents from dust, dirt, and other contaminants. Available in numerous bushel capacities and sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:10:50','2026-05-08 13:10:50'),(665,'R&B Wire Products Wire Elastic Soft Cover For Vinyl Basket Trucks & Poly Trucks','rb-wire-products-wire-elastic-soft-cover-for-vinyl-basket-trucks-poly-trucks-1',450,'These wire elastic soft covers for vinyl basket trucks and poly trucks from R&B Wire Products provide a versatile solution for industrial storage needs. Covers are made with flame-retardant, antimicrobial vinyl and feature an elastic shock-cord rim for a secure fit. These vinyl covers keep contents inside and covered during storage and transportation. Available in numerous bushel capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:10:53','2026-05-08 13:10:53'),(666,'Pallets','pallets',51,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:10:53','2026-05-08 13:10:53'),(667,'Dandux Covers for Vinyl or Canvas Bulk Trucks','dandux-covers-for-vinyl-or-canvas-bulk-trucks-1',450,'These Dandux covers are designed specifically to be used with vinyl or canvas bulk trucks. Made with high-quality nylon, these bulk truck covers provide reliable protection against dust, debris, and other external elements to keep contents clean, dry, and safe. Nylon covers come in various sizes and feature an elastic band for a snug and secure fit. Available in numerous bushel capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:10:56','2026-05-08 13:10:56'),(668,'Royal Basket Trucks® Liners','royal-basket-trucks-liners-1',450,'Royal Basket Trucks® liners provide a protective barrier to keep truck contents secure and undamaged. Made with durable polyethylene, these cart liners feature smooth rounded corners and a leak-proof design for maximum protection and durability. Poly liners are available in numerous bushel capacities and sizes, and are ideal for any industrial or commercial material handling job.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:11:03','2026-05-08 13:11:03'),(669,'Protective Packaging','protective-packaging',51,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:11:12','2026-05-08 13:11:12'),(670,'Shipping Crates','shipping-crates',51,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:11:34','2026-05-08 13:11:34'),(671,'Strapping Equipment & Supplies','strapping-equipment-supplies',51,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:12:09','2026-05-08 13:12:09'),(672,'Pallet Jack Replacement Parts & Accessories','pallet-jack-replacement-parts-accessories',517,'Pallet jack truck replacement parts and accessories are components and add-ons designed to enhance the functionality, durability, and safety of pallet jacks. Parts and accessories include replacement wheels, handles, steering wheels, forks, toe guards, and more. They are constructed from high-quality materials to withstand the rigors of daily use. Pallet truck parts and accessories are typically used in warehouses, distribution centers, manufacturing facilities, and retail stores where pallet jacks are essential for loading and unloading goods and materials.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:12:39','2026-05-08 13:12:39'),(673,'Stretch & Shrink Wrap','stretch-shrink-wrap',51,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:12:39','2026-05-08 13:12:39'),(674,'Pallet Jack Wheels & Wheel Kits','pallet-jack-wheels-wheel-kits',672,'Wheel and wheel kits are essential components for material handling equipment such as pallet jacks. Pallet jack load wheels are designed to ensure smooth movement and long-lasting durability, helping to maintain the efficiency of pallet jacks. Wheel kits are tailored to match specific equipment needs, ensuring reliable and efficient operation to withstand the demands of daily operations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:15:59','2026-05-08 13:15:59'),(675,'Caster Wheels & Assemblies','caster-wheels-assemblies',674,'Achieve optimal maneuverability and stability with our Caster Wheels & Assemblies. These heavy duty caster wheels have a polyurethane build for lasting durability, and fit most pallet jacks. Our caster wheel assembly sets come complete with wheels, mounting brackets, and a swivel mechanism for 360° wheel rotation. Choose from various wheel styles and sizes to suit your specific application needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:20:03','2026-05-08 13:20:03'),(676,'Drive Tires & Assemblies','drive-tires-assemblies',674,'Pallet truck drive tires & assemblies are durable, ergonomic replacement parts offering strong traction and load-bearing capacities. Our drive tires come in various materials, including polyurethane and rubber to resist wear & tear. Drive tire assemblies feature necessary installation hardware. Choose from our expansive selection of drive tires & assemblies for your specific application needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:20:06','2026-05-08 13:20:06'),(677,'Steer Wheels & Assemblies','steer-wheels-assemblies',674,'Our Steer Wheels & Assemblies replace worn pallet truck parts to ensure precise control of material handling equipment. Made using high quality polyurethane, these pallet truck steer wheels can withstand the weight of the heavy loads being transported. Steer wheel assemblies come equipped with the necessary installation parts. Replacement steer wheels & assemblies are offered in various sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:20:08','2026-05-08 13:20:08'),(678,'Load Wheel Kits for Manual Pallet Jacks','load-wheel-kits-for-manual-pallet-jacks',674,'Our Load Wheel Kits for Manual Pallet Jacks are a cost effective option for material handling equipment wheel replacement and repair. These pallet jack load wheel kits feature standard, heavy duty wheels and fasteners for easy installation. Our replacement load wheels have a nylon and polyurethane build, and are compatible with most pallet jacks. Parts are shipped in an easy to store compact box.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:20:11','2026-05-08 13:20:11'),(679,'Complete Wheel Kits for Manual Pallet Jacks','complete-wheel-kits-for-manual-pallet-jacks',674,'Complete Wheel Kits for Manual Pallet Jacks are a cost effective, time-saving option for pallet jack wheel repairs and replacements. Our complete wheel kits for pallet jacks include load wheels, steer wheels, bearings, axels, and all other necessary installation hardware. These manual pallet jack kits are offered for use with various brands, makes, and models.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:20:17','2026-05-08 13:20:17'),(680,'Load Wheel Kits for Electric Pallet Jacks','load-wheel-kits-for-electric-pallet-jacks',674,'Optimize the performance of your electric pallet jacks with our load wheel kits. These load wheel kits for electric pallet jacks are an economical and efficient replacement solution for worn or damaged wheels. Kits include durable polyurethane wheels, axles, bearings, and fasteners for easy installation. Electric pallet jack wheel kits are compatible for use with various brands and models.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:20:20','2026-05-08 13:20:20'),(681,'Load Wheels & Assemblies','load-wheels-assemblies',674,'Load Wheels & Assemblies replace worn or damaged wheels on your material handling equipment. Built with heavy duty polyurethane, these load wheels for pallet jacks ensure long lasting use. Our load wheel assembly pieces allow for easy installation to get your machines operating again quickly. Various load wheel options offered for excellent load-bearing capacity and resistance to wear.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 13:20:23','2026-05-08 13:20:23'),(682,'Tape Dispensers','tape-dispensers',51,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 14:14:02','2026-05-08 14:14:02'),(683,'Tape Dispensers','tape-dispensers-1',51,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 14:22:04','2026-05-08 14:22:04'),(684,'Wrapping Equipment','wrapping-equipment',51,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 14:22:21','2026-05-08 14:22:21'),(685,'Pallet Jack Accessories & Attachments','pallet-jack-accessories-attachments',672,'Pallet truck accessories and attachments enhance the functionality and versatility of pallet trucks. The attachments are easy to install and are made of solid materials like steel, plastic, and rubber to ensure durability. Pallet truck attachments increase safety, efficiency, and convenience in warehouses, manufacturing facilities, construction zones, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 14:24:06','2026-05-08 14:24:06'),(686,'Clamps & Components','clamps-components',408,'Clamps and components are essential positioning tools used to secure workpieces and tools in machining applications. Our items range from hold down clamps, to fixturing clamps, clamping U-bolts, clamp kits, and other clamp components to ensure secure and precise workholding in demanding industrial settings. Clamp components offer precise positioning, anchoring, or joining of two separate components and help to improve safety, efficiency, and accuracy during machining and woodworking.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 14:24:18','2026-05-08 14:24:18'),(687,'Fixturing Mounts & Stands','fixturing-mounts-stands',408,'Fixturing mounts and stands are designed to hold and position workpieces securely during machining, welding, assembly, or inspection. By providing a stable and repeatable setup, fixturing mounts and stands help reduce the risk of human error during machining, welding, or assembly, contributing to improved product quality. Choose from a variety of workholding tools like rotary tables, magnetic chucks, vacuum chucks, collet fixtures, and fixture adapters. They are ideal for use in manufacturing, aerospace, automotive, and electronics.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 14:24:54','2026-05-08 14:25:40'),(688,'Lathe Chucks & Accessories','lathe-chucks-accessories',408,'Lathe chucks and accessories are essential tools for lathe machining processes. They include precision chucks that securely hold workpieces during turning operations and accessories like jaws and keys to improve lathe functionality. Lathe chucks are crucial for precisely shaping metals in advanced machining environments, making them suitable for workshops, manufacturing, and settings that require accurate lathe operations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 14:26:19','2026-05-08 14:26:19'),(689,'Pallet Jack Truck Attachements','pallet-jack-truck-attachements',685,'Our pallet jack truck attachments are accessories designed to enhance the functionality of pallet jacks in warehouses, factories, loading docks, and similar work settings. We offer a range of accessories to allow pallet trucks to to streamline material handling for rough terrain electric pallet trucks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 14:26:29','2026-05-08 14:26:29'),(690,'Pallet Jack Truck Additional Storage','pallet-jack-truck-additional-storage',685,'Our pallet jack truck additional storage accessories provide a convenient solution for optimizing and organizing workspace around pallet jacks. These storage caddies attach to pallet jacks, creating a portable workstation that includes storage compartments, pen trays, cup holders, and tool pockets. Made from durable materials, these caddies are built to withstand demanding industrial environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 14:26:31','2026-05-08 14:26:31'),(691,'Pallet Jack Truck Chocks','pallet-jack-truck-chocks',685,'Our pallet jack truck chocks provide reliable stability and safety for pallet jack trucks in warehouses and other industrial facilities. Made with durable rubber, the pallet jack chock ensures proper positioning and secures pallet jocks and skid trucks to prevent movement during loading and unloading. Available in various sizes, these wheel chocks are essential accessories for avoiding accidents.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 14:26:35','2026-05-08 14:26:35'),(692,'Pallet Jack Truck Toe Guard Protector','pallet-jack-truck-toe-guard-protector',685,'Pallet jack truck toe guard protectors are essential safety accessories for industrial facilities that use pallet jacks. Designed to protect toes and feet from potential hazards, these self-adjusting protectors provide a barrier between manual pallet jacks and operators. Constructed with durable steel, these toe guard protectors are easy to install and built to withstand heavy-duty use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 14:26:38','2026-05-08 14:26:38'),(693,'Machine Vises','machine-vises',408,'Machine vises are essential machining and metalworking tools designed to securely hold workpieces in place during various machining operations. They feature a quick-action mechanism, enabling rapid clamping and releasing of workpieces, reducing setup time and improving overall efficiency. Vises come with various jaw options, including smooth, serrated, or grooved jaws, providing flexibility to accommodate different workpiece shapes and materials. They are ideal for milling operations, drilling tasks, and grinding applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 14:27:03','2026-05-08 14:27:03'),(695,'Carbide Blanks','carbide-blanks',437,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 15:04:59','2026-05-08 15:04:59'),(696,'Unground Carbide Blanks','unground-carbide-blanks',695,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 15:05:43','2026-05-08 15:05:43'),(697,'Rectangular Strip Carbide Blanks','rectangular-strip-carbide-blanks',695,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 15:06:06','2026-05-08 15:06:06'),(698,'Drill Rods','drill-rods',437,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 15:06:51','2026-05-08 15:06:51'),(699,'Oil Hardening Drill Rod','oil-hardening-drill-rod',698,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 15:07:54','2026-05-08 15:07:54'),(700,'Air Hardening Drill Rod','air-hardening-drill-rod',698,'Air-hardening drill rods provide increased wear resistance in a variety of metalworking applications. Most models are made of steel for lasting durability and can be heat treated in most tool room furnaces. Drill rods are available in many sizes to meet various job requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 15:08:37','2026-05-08 15:08:37'),(701,'Water Hardening Drill Rod','water-hardening-drill-rod',698,'Water-hardening drill rods are used for achieving maximum torsion impact strength with tool and machine operations. These drill rods are made from commercial-grade steel and polished for long-lasting durability. Some models feature color-coded ends. Drill rods are available in various sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 15:09:20','2026-05-08 15:09:20'),(702,'Flat Stock','flat-stock',437,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 15:10:45','2026-05-08 15:10:45'),(703,'Oil Hardening Ground Flat Stock','oil-hardening-ground-flat-stock',702,'Oil-hardening ground flat stock can be used for tools, dies, punches, stripper plates, and general precision machine parts. Made from durable steel, these units will provide long-lasting durability. The oil-hardening tool steel maintains high abrasion and wear resistance and is ready for toolroom use. Ground flat stock is available in various sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 15:13:12','2026-05-08 15:13:12'),(704,'Air Hardening Flat Stock','air-hardening-flat-stock',702,'Air-hardening flat stocks offer high wear resistance and are used for punches and dies that stamp silicone, stainless steel, and other abrasive materials. This air-hardening flat stock offers high wear resistance to a wide variety of materials and is designed for long-lasting durability and dependability. A wide range of sizes is available to meet most metalworking job requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 15:13:48','2026-05-08 15:13:48'),(705,'Low Carbon Flat Stock','low-carbon-flat-stock',702,'Low carbon flat stock is a true free machining steel and provides lasting durability and dependability. The flat stock\'s free machining characteristics provide a longer cutting tool life, better finish, faster production, and lower machining costs. A wide selection of widths and thicknesses are available to meet any metal working job requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 15:14:56','2026-05-08 15:14:56'),(706,'Key Stock','key-stock',437,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 15:17:09','2026-05-08 15:17:09'),(707,'Stainless Steel Tool Wrap','stainless-steel-tool-wrap',437,'Stainless steel tool wraps create airtight envelopes around parts and can be used in furnaces up to 2,000 degrees Fahrenheit. Tool wrap can be cut, folded and crease sealed with ease. The cut-to-fit foil protects from scale and oxide buildup during heat treatment. Tool wrap roll sizes vary. A seam roller tool is also available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 15:18:35','2026-05-08 15:18:35'),(708,'Steel Sheets','steel-sheets',437,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 15:21:12','2026-05-08 15:21:12'),(709,'Aluminum & Steel Sheets','aluminum-steel-sheets',708,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 15:21:39','2026-05-08 15:21:39'),(710,'Steel Wire','steel-wire',437,'Steel wire provides a robust, durable, and malleable solution for numerous tasks, offering structural support, conductivity, and flexibility in various applications. The steel wire is available in multiple grades and sizes, allowing users to choose the right type for specific needs. Despite its strength, steel wire maintains a degree of malleability, allowing it to be easily bent, twisted, or formed to suit particular requirements. The wire is ideal for various industries, including construction, manufacturing, fabrication, and electrical.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 15:25:46','2026-05-08 15:25:46'),(711,'Stainless Steel Wire','stainless-steel-wire',710,'Stainless steel wires are used for wiring applications requiring durable materials. Most models are spring tempered and made from full hard, 300 series stainless steel for long lasting dependability. Spring wires also have excellent corrosion resistant qualities and a smooth finish. Coil size and features vary per unit.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 15:30:21','2026-05-08 15:30:21'),(712,'Music Wire','music-wire',710,'Music wires are ideal for binding, ceramic cutting, wire forms, and a variety of industrial uses. Wires are spring tempered and made from high carbon steel alloy for long-lasting durability. Most units also feature high tensile strength and high fatigue resistance. Many sizes are available. Specific features vary per unit.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 15:30:55','2026-05-08 15:30:55'),(713,'Pallet Truck Hardware','pallet-truck-hardware',672,'Replacement hardware helps with the ongoing functionality, maintenance, and repair of pallet trucks in warehouses, distribution centers, and more. From crucial parts like batteries and handles to small, critical components like wheels, bearings, and pins, pallet truck parts are crafted for durability and longevity. Pallet jack hardware parts are designed to be compatible with a wide range of pallet trucks to minimize downtime and optimize material handling operations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 15:45:08','2026-05-08 15:45:08'),(714,'Covers','covers',713,'Pallet truck covers protect motors from damage and extend their lifespan. Made with durable polyethylene, these protective motor covers provide a secure enclosure around the motor to keep out dust and debris, while shielding it from impact. Our motor covers are a cost effective way to keep your equipment in pristine condition and reduce maintenance and repair time from accidental damage.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 16:17:02','2026-05-08 16:17:02'),(715,'Connectors','connectors',713,'Pallet truck connectors ensure secure and reliable junction between various components of your machine handling equipment. Our battery connectors provide a tight and dependable connection for proper power functioning. These high quality pallet truck connectors are compatible with most models and are available in a variety of options to meet your specific requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 16:17:05','2026-05-08 16:17:05'),(716,'Buttons & Switches','buttons-switches',713,'Our Buttons & Switches replacement hardware helps to maintain the proper functioning for pallet trucks. From dead man switches, reverse buttons, and ignition switches, these heavy duty parts are designed for precise operation, allowing for efficient and reliable equipment control. Choose from our range of industrial switches and buttons to find the right parts for your specific application.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 16:17:08','2026-05-08 16:17:08'),(717,'Risers & Riser Assemblies','risers-riser-assemblies',713,'Risers & Risers Assemblies are made to adjust the height of pallet trucks to accommodate specific requirements or improve ergonomics in material handling applications. These pallet truck & equipment risers allow for easier loading, unloading, and transportation of goods. Our pallet truck parts are compatible with most models and brands, and can be easily installed, ensuring broad applicability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 16:17:10','2026-05-08 16:17:10'),(718,'Miscellaneous Hardware','miscellaneous-hardware',713,'Find all the essential hardware components you need for your pallet truck. Our wide collection of miscellaneous, industrial hardware ensures you have the right parts to keep your equipment in optimal working condition. With their durable construction and precise fit, these industrial hardware parts offer reliability and longevity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 16:17:13','2026-05-08 16:17:13'),(719,'Handles & Handle Assemblies','handles-handle-assemblies',713,'Upgrade the functionality and ergonomics of your pallet jacks with our high-quality handles & handle assemblies. Designed for comfortable grip and easy maneuverability, these pallet jack handles ensure efficient, user-friendly operation. Whether you need pallet jack handle replacements or complete handle assemblies, we offer a variety of handle & handle assemblies to suit your equipment needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 16:17:16','2026-05-08 16:17:16'),(720,'Batteries & Chargers for Electric Pallet Jack Trucks','batteries-chargers-for-electric-pallet-jack-trucks',713,'Our replacement batteries for electric pallet jack trucks ensure uninterrupted operation and maximum efficiency. These electric pallet truck batteries are available in various voltages and capacities to meet the specific power requirements of your material handling equipment. A rechargeable battery pack is also offered so your pallet truck battery never runs out of power.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 16:17:18','2026-05-08 16:17:18'),(721,'Pumps & Pump Hardware','pumps-pump-hardware',713,'Replace worn out pumps and parts with this selection of Pumps & Pump Hardware. Hydraulic pumps are integral parts in the lifting and lowering of heavy loads with pallet jack trucks. These industrial pumps need regular maintenance to ensure optimal performance. Our replacement pumps & pump hardware provide the tools and pieces of equipment needed to keep your commercial equipment running smoothly.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 16:17:21','2026-05-08 16:17:21'),(722,'Shafts','shafts',713,'Pallet truck shafts allow these material handling machines to operate smoothly and efficiently. Shafts transmit power and rotational motion between various parts and assemblies for seamless operation. Made from high-quality, durable steel, our replacement shafts for your pallet trucks are available in various sizes and styles to keep your equipment running.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 16:55:03','2026-05-08 16:55:03'),(723,'Bushings','bushings-2',713,'This selection of replacement bushings enhances the longevity of your commercial equipment. Bushings provide a smooth and efficient equipment operation by reducing friction and wear between moving parts. These bushing parts also help absorb vibrations and reduce noise for quiet operation. Our industrial bushings come in various shapes, sizes, and materials to suit different applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 16:55:06','2026-05-08 16:55:06'),(724,'Bars','bars',713,'Pallet truck bars are critical hardware pieces designed to increase the durability and lifespan of your machines while ensuring safe and efficient operation. Our pallet truck bar selection features heavy-duty threaded and tension bars that offer additional support and stability. Whether you need replacement or reinforcement bars, we offer various sizes for your specific needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 16:55:10','2026-05-08 16:55:10'),(725,'Pins','pins',713,'Our replacement hardware pins keep heavy duty pallet jacks and other material handling equipment operating smoothly. These industrial pins are made to fasten various components together, offering stability and preventing unintended disassembly. A wide range of pins are offered in various sizes & styles, including cotter pins, clevis pins, or other types of pins, to fit your specific requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 16:55:14','2026-05-08 16:55:14'),(726,'Fuses & Fuse Holders','fuses-fuse-holders',713,'Fuse & Fuse holders are critical components of pallet truck hardware, ensuring maximal electrical safety and proper power conductivity. These fuse holders are designed to interrupt the flow of electrical current in case of excessive current or voltage, safeguarding your equipment from damage and ensuring operator safety. We carry a wide range of pallet truck fuses & fuse holders with varying amps.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 16:55:17','2026-05-08 16:55:17'),(727,'Ground Static Straps','ground-static-straps',713,'Ground Static Straps are made to dissipate static electricity and ground potential charges while using electric material handling equipment. These static ground straps are flexible, adjustable, and have heavy-duty steel ratcheting buckles. Our grounding straps are compatible with most pallet trucks and have a durable build and grounding capabilities to provide safety in static-sensitive settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 16:55:21','2026-05-08 16:55:21'),(728,'Rods','rods',713,'Our replacement rods for pallet trucks help maintain the structural integrity and functionality of these material handling machines. Rods connect the pallet truck\'s wheels to its swivel arm to ensure smooth operation and support a high load-bearing capacity. Whether you need replacement rods or additional rods for custom applications, we offer various styles and sizes to suit your specific needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 16:55:24','2026-05-08 16:55:24'),(729,'Axles','axles',713,'Ensure well-functioning material handling operations with our industrial axle replacement parts. All of our commercial axles are made from high quality, durable materials to withstand tough handling conditions with pallet trucks. Available in a wide range of axles these parts provide the support and structural integrity needed for efficient transportation operations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-08 16:55:28','2026-05-08 16:55:28'),(730,'Vise Accessories','vise-accessories',408,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:26:37','2026-05-11 09:26:37'),(731,'Annular Cutters','annular-cutters',409,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:27:11','2026-05-11 09:27:11'),(732,'Broaches','broaches',409,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:27:41','2026-05-11 09:27:41'),(733,'Counterbores','counterbores',409,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:28:08','2026-05-11 09:28:08'),(734,'Counterbores','counterbores-1',409,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:28:53','2026-05-11 09:28:53'),(735,'Countersinks','countersinks',409,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:29:18','2026-05-11 09:29:18'),(736,'Ball Stock','ball-stock',442,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:30:04','2026-05-11 09:30:04'),(737,'Deburring Tools','deburring-tools-1',409,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:31:26','2026-05-11 09:31:26'),(738,'Deburring Tools','deburring-tools-2',409,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:32:32','2026-05-11 09:32:32'),(739,'Drill Bits','drill-bits',409,'Drill bits are designed to create holes in various materials, including wood, metal, plastic, and masonry. They are versatile and can be used with various drilling tools, including hand drills, cordless drills, and drill presses. Whether Screw Machine Drills, Jobber Length Drills, Extended Length, or Reduced Shank Drills, Drill bits come in various sizes, specified by their diameter and are ideal for commercial or industrial use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:33:01','2026-05-11 09:33:01'),(740,'Film Stock','film-stock',442,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:33:15','2026-05-11 09:33:15'),(741,'Plastic Angle Stock','plastic-angle-stock',442,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:37:30','2026-05-11 09:37:30'),(742,'GPO-3 Sheets, Channels and Rods','gpo-3-sheets-channels-and-rods',741,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:37:50','2026-05-11 09:37:50'),(743,'90 Degree PVC Plastic Angles','90-degree-pvc-plastic-angles',741,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:38:30','2026-05-11 09:38:30'),(744,'Drill Bushings','drill-bushings',409,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:38:51','2026-05-11 09:38:51'),(745,'90 Degree Polycarbonate Plastic Angles','90-degree-polycarbonate-plastic-angles',741,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:39:05','2026-05-11 09:39:05'),(746,'Shelf Truck Accessories','shelf-truck-accessories',517,'Shelf truck accessories, typically additional shelves, are supplemental components designed to enhance the versatility and functionality of shelf trucks or utility carts. They are constructed of durable materials, including steel or plastic, for long-lasting dependability and feature easy installation and adjustable configurations, allowing users to adapt the cart to specific storage or transportation needs. Shelf truck accessories are commonly used in warehouses, distribution centers, and manufacturing facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:39:59','2026-05-11 09:39:59'),(747,'Plastic Bar Stock','plastic-bar-stock',442,'Bar stock is a versatile raw material that can be used to manufacture structural components in various industries. It features easy machinability and is wear and moisture-resistant for years of long-lasting use. Bar stock is durable and reliable making it ideal for the automotive industry and any manufacturing