essential to enhance the performance and efficiency of dust collectors and air filtration systems. Available in various configurations, these accessories include filters, hoses, and attachments. They are crucial for optimizing dust collection, maintaining air quality, and ensuring a safe working environment. Dust collection accessories minimize health hazards and control airborne particles in woodworking facilities, workshops, and industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:45:23','2026-05-11 09:45:23'),(756,'Furniture Grade PVC Pipes','furniture-grade-pvc-pipes',752,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:45:30','2026-05-11 09:45:30'),(757,'Dust Collection Systems','dust-collection-systems',410,'Dust Collection Systems remove airborne dust and debris, creating a healthier and safer environment for woodworking and industrial processes. The efficient filtration technology captures particles at the source, preventing airborne contaminants which promotes a cleaner work environment, and ensures equipment continually runs smooth. Dust collection systems include features like remote control operation, quick-release filters, and easy-to-empty collection bags for ease of use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:46:10','2026-05-11 09:46:10'),(758,'Dust Extraction Vacuums','dust-extraction-vacuums',410,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:46:53','2026-05-11 09:46:53'),(759,'Woodworking Air Filtration Systems','woodworking-air-filtration-systems',410,'Equipped with a filter that traps particles and dust, Woodworking Air Filtration Systems help improve the air quality in garages & workshops and promote a safe environment when cutting, sanding, and shaping wood. Built-in blowers or fans circulate air and removes airborne contaminants to enhance visibility and reduce skin or respiratory irritation. The systems are available in a selection of horsepower and airflow ratings, as well as particle size ratings, to suit a wide range of workshop sizes and woodworking projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:47:41','2026-05-11 09:47:41'),(760,'Plastic Rod Stock','plastic-rod-stock',442,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:48:17','2026-05-11 09:48:17'),(761,'Plastic Sheet Stock','plastic-sheet-stock',442,'Plastic sheet stock is a versatile building material designed for various applications in construction, manufacturing, and more. It is a durable, flexible, and easily customizable material for creating surfaces, barriers, and structures in various settings. The sheet stock is highly versatile and adaptable for multiple applications, including signage, cladding, protective barriers, machine guards, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:49:57','2026-05-11 09:49:57'),(762,'Valley Craft® Shelf Truck Accessories','valley-craft-shelf-truck-accessories',746,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:50:51','2026-05-11 09:50:51'),(763,'Little Giant® Shelf Truck Adjustable Shelves','little-giant-shelf-truck-adjustable-shelves',746,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:50:54','2026-05-11 09:50:54'),(764,'Nashville Wire Shelf Truck Adjustable Shelves','nashville-wire-shelf-truck-adjustable-shelves',746,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:51:04','2026-05-11 09:51:54'),(765,'Global Industrial® Shelf Truck Adjustable Shelves','global-industrial-shelf-truck-adjustable-shelves',746,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:51:12','2026-05-11 09:51:12'),(766,'UHMW Polyethylene Plastic Sheets, Bars, and Rods','uhmw-polyethylene-plastic-sheets-bars-and-rods',761,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:51:50','2026-05-11 09:51:50'),(767,'HDPE Plastic Sheets and Bars','hdpe-plastic-sheets-and-bars',761,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:53:10','2026-05-11 09:53:10'),(768,'Polycarbonate Plastic Sheets and Bars','polycarbonate-plastic-sheets-and-bars',761,NULL,NULL,NU