zes are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:59:35','2026-05-11 09:59:35'),(782,'Dandux Spring Lift Platforms for Canvas & Vinyl Bulk Trucks','dandux-spring-lift-platforms-for-canvas-vinyl-bulk-trucks-1',769,'Dandux spring lift platforms for canvas and vinyl bulk trucks provide a convenient solution to improve efficiency with material handling tasks. These ergonomically designed platform lifts keep materials moving as trucks are unloaded, eliminating the need for repetitive bending and leaning. Dandux lifts feature a vinyl-coated spring steel frame and rust-resistant steel springs with S-hooks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:59:39','2026-05-11 09:59:39'),(783,'Global Industrial™ Spring Lift Platforms for Plastic Bulk Box Trucks','global-industrial-spring-lift-platforms-for-plastic-bulk-box-trucks-1',769,'These spring lift platforms are designed specifically for use with plastic bulk box trucks. Available in numerous bushel capacities and sizes, these platform lifts are ergonomically designed, providing an efficient way to keep material moving towards the top of truck as the product is removed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 09:59:45','2026-05-11 09:59:45'),(784,'GPO-3 Sheets, Channels and Rods','gpo-3-sheets-channels-and-rods-1',761,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:00:51','2026-05-11 10:00:51'),(785,'Truck Couplers','truck-couplers',517,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:01:04','2026-05-11 10:01:04'),(786,'Darnell-Rose Truck Couplers','darnell-rose-truck-couplers',785,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:01:33','2026-05-11 10:01:33'),(787,'Marine Board Sheets','marine-board-sheets',761,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:01:48','2026-05-11 10:01:48'),(788,'Kapton Sheets, Films, and Tapes','kapton-sheets-films-and-tapes',761,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:02:11','2026-05-11 10:02:11'),(789,'Polypropylene Plastic Sheets, 