s. They serve the purpose of optimizing material handling and transportation tasks. The accessories include attachment points or coupling systems that allow for the secure connection of trailers, carts, or other materials to be transported.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:12:04','2026-05-11 10:12:04'),(814,'Utility Vehicle Replacement Parts','utility-vehicle-replacement-parts',809,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:12:08','2026-05-11 10:12:08'),(815,'Utility Vehicle Accessories','utility-vehicle-accessories',809,'Utility vehicle accessories are designed to improve the maneuverability of utility vehicles, making them more adaptable to different work environments. Various accessories include tow hitches, ladders, and more. The accessories are engineered to be compatible with a wide range of utility vehicles, ensuring seamless integration and functionality for commercial and industrial environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:12:13','2026-05-11 10:12:13'),(816,'Masked Extruded Acrylic Sheets','masked-extruded-acrylic-sheets',761,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:13:25','2026-05-11 10:13:25'),(817,'Acetal Plastic Rods','acetal-plastic-rods',761,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:14:57','2026-05-11 10:14:57'),(818,'Natural Canvas CE Phenolic Rods','natural-canvas-ce-phenolic-rods',761,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:15:22','2026-05-11 10:15:22'),(819,'Masked Lucite Sheets','masked-lucite-sheets',761,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:15:51','2026-05-11 10:15:51'),(820,'Dollies','dollies',1,'Global Industrial\'s dollies are an essential tool for any warehouse or facility, providing an efficient and convenient way to transport heavy items. From machine skates and pallet dollies to drum dollies and furniture dollies, each product is designed with durability and strength in mind, ensuring that items are moved safely and securely. Our dollies are also equipped with features such as non-slip surfaces and locking brakes for added safety. Browse our selection today and find the perfect dolly to improve your workplace efficiency.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:16:08','2026-05-11 10:16:08'),(821,'Oil Filled Nylon','oil-filled-nylon',761,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:16:34','2026-05-11 10:16:34'),(822,'Brake Dollies','brake-dollies',820,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:17:03','2026-05-11 10:17:03'),(823,'PFA','pfa',761,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:17:37','2026-05-11 10:17:37'),(824,'Hand Knobs','hand-knobs',412,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:18:59','2026-05-11 10:18:59'),(825,'Handwheels','handwheels',412,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:19:29','2026-05-11 10:19:29'),(826,'Brake Dolly','brake-dolly',822,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:20:16','2026-05-11 10:20:16'),(827,'Natural Canvas C Phenolic Sheets','natural-canvas-c-phenolic-sheets',761,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:21:11','2026-05-11 10:21:11'),(828,'Dolly Parts & Accessories','dolly-parts-accessories-1',820,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:21:24','2026-05-11 10:21:24'),(829,'Dolly Bars','dolly-bars-1',828,'The dolly bar transforms a dolly into a platform truck. These dolly handles can easily be attached to various dollies, and most have a heat treated powder coat to ensure lasting durability. Various styles of dolly bars are available to help meet any commercial or industrial hauling needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:23:31','2026-05-11 10:23:31'),(830,'Polycarbonate Plastic Films','polycarbonate-plastic-films',761,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:23:57','2026-05-11 10:23:57'),(831,'Knobs','knobs',412,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:24:29','2026-05-11 10:24:29'),(832,'PET Sheets, Rods, and Tubes','pet-sheets-rods-and-tubes',761,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:24:42','2026-05-11 10:24:42'),(833,'Machine Handles','machine-handles',412,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:26:11','2026-05-11 10:26:11'),(834,'Plungers','plungers',412,'Plungers are tools utilized in plumbing and mechanical tasks to create seals and apply pressure. They feature ergonomic handles and rubber suction cups or flanges that generate a vacuum to dislodge blockages or exert pressure for clamping or indexing needs. Plungers are constructed with sturdy materials and flexible components for sealing on various surfaces. They are widely used for unclogging drains and toilets in both residential and industrial environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:30:26','2026-05-11 10:30:26'),(835,'Drum Dollies','drum-dollies',820,'Drum dollies are specialized material handling devices designed to transport and maneuver heavy drums easily and safely. They feature casters for smooth mobility, a sturdy frame capable of holding heavy load sizes, and some models feature ergonomic handles for comfortable pushing or pulling. Drum dollies are commonly used in industrial settings such as warehouses, manufacturing facilities, and distribution centers where drums containing liquids, chemicals, or other materials need to be moved efficiently and safely.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:30:37','2026-05-11 10:30:37'),(836,'Machine Keys','machine-keys-1',33,'Machine Keys, or Key Stocks, are embedded into a keyway in order to transmit torque from shafts to components. They secure components to the shaft through the keyway. Machine Keys come in different styles like Woodruff Keys and Rounded Machine Keys.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:31:13','2026-05-11 10:31:13'),(837,'CNC Machines','cnc-machines',418,'CNC Machines feature a computer with factory-installed software to control machinery that is capable of cutting, shaping, and finishing a variety of materials, such as metal, wood, and plastic, with minimal human input. The automated machine completes complex, multi-step processes with precision and repeatability to boost productivity, and they are available in various styles to suit a range of tasks, including milling, roll bending, and press braking.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:32:06','2026-05-11 10:32:06'),(838,'Drill Presses & Tapping Machines','drill-presses-tapping-machines',418,'Drill presses are precision machining tools designed for accurately drilling holes into various materials. Single-spindle drill presses capable of drilling through light- to heavy-duty materials, tapping arms for precise dynamic measurements, and radial drills for large-scale, accurate drilling projects all assist in high-performance drilling. Drill presses feature adjustable speed settings, depth stops, and tilting tables, offering versatility for various drilling requirements and are used in metalworking, woodworking, and manufacturing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:33:25','2026-05-11 10:33:25'),(839,'Grinding, Buffing, & Sharpening Machines','grinding-buffing-sharpening-machines',418,'Grinders & Buffers are powerful machining tools designed for shaping, sharpening, or polishing various materials. They feature motor-driven abrasive wheels that rotate at high speeds, enabling the removal of material with precision and efficiency. Grinders & Buffers are commonly used in metalworking, woodworking, fabrication, and construction industries for tasks like shaping metal, sharpening tools, removing burrs, or smoothing welds.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:34:10','2026-05-11 10:34:10'),(840,'Elevated Height Drum Dollies','elevated-height-drum-dollies',835,'Elevated height drum dollies elevate drums and pails offering improved ergonomic positioning for less fatigue and strain. They feature a welded tubular frame for extra strength, cradle uprights with vinyl sleeves to firmly grip the pail, and 4 swivel casters for optimal maneuverability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:34:38','2026-05-11 10:34:38'),(841,'Stainless Steel Drum Dollies','stainless-steel-drum-dollies',835,'Stainless steel drum dollies are the perfect solution for handling and transporting your heavy drums. They feature a durable all-welded stainless steel construction as well as swivel casters for easy maneuverability. Choose from several models of stainless steel drum dollies available in a variety of capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:34:41','2026-05-11 10:34:41'),(842,'Plastic Drum Dollies','plastic-drum-dollies',835,'Plastic drum dollies increase portability and flexibility, allowing for easy transportation of drums with no lifting. Our plastic dollies feature a highly durable construction, and multiple casters for maximum stability and easy maneuverability. These drum dollies are compatible with various drums.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:34:44','2026-05-11 10:34:44'),(843,'Drum Spill Dollies & Carts','drum-spill-dollies-carts',835,'Protect yourself from accidental spills and leaks with our drum spill dollies and carts. These dollies feature heavy duty corrosion resistant construction for long lasting durability. Our drum spill dollies feature swivel casters and an ergonomically designed push-pull handle for optimal maneuverability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:34:47','2026-05-11 10:34:47'),(844,'Steel Drum Dollies','steel-drum-dollies',835,'Our drum dollies are constructed of highly durable steel, ensuring strength and longevity in demanding industrial environments. These steel dollies feature sturdy casters that allow for smooth and effortless movement, and some models come equipped with ergonomic handles for ease of use. Our dollies are available in a variety of colors, weight capacities, and drum size compatibilities',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:34:49','2026-05-11 10:34:49'),(845,'Lathes','lathes',418,'Lathes are machinery designed to shape wood or metal materials accurately by performing professional-grade turns and cuts. Bench lathes can be mounted to workbenches for easy access; some lathe machines are pre-mounted to cabinet stands for minimal assembly. Lathes are ideal for use in manufacturing facilities and wood and machine shops to achieve precise, consistent metal- and woodworking results.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:34:50','2026-05-11 10:34:50'),(846,'Machine Shields','machine-shields',418,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:35:26','2026-05-11 10:35:26'),(847,'Machine Stands','machine-stands',418,'Constructed with a sturdy base for strength and stability, Machine Stands provide a secure platform to enhance precision & performance for metalworking machinery, including bench grinders, rollers, lathes, milling machines, and more. They are compatible with select makes and models of equipment to accommodate specific applications. Adjustable-height stands improve worker comfort & reduces fatigue during long shifts.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:36:01','2026-05-11 10:36:01'),(848,'Machinery Parts & Accessories','machinery-parts-accessories',418,'Parts and accessories for machinery encompass a diverse range of components designed to enhance, maintain, or customize equipment. This includes oil level gauges, belt motors, dust covers, water tanks, and more. Machinery parts and accessories are crafted with precision and durability, ensuring optimal performance and compatibility with different models. They are typically used in manufacturing, machining, and other industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:36:37','2026-05-11 10:36:37'),(849,'Marking Machines','marking-machines',418,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:37:32','2026-05-11 10:37:32'),(850,'PEEK Plastic Sheets and Bars','peek-plastic-sheets-and-bars',761,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:37:32','2026-05-11 10:37:32'),(851,'Low-Profile Drum Dollies','low-profile-drum-dollies',835,'Low-profile drum dolly trucks are ideal for transporting drums in industrial settings. They have a tubular steel T-handle that allows easy maneuvering through narrow hallways and elevators. Our drum dolly trucks feature 3 casters for easy mobility around tight corners and offer easy loading and unloading of drums.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:37:38','2026-05-11 10:37:38'),(852,'Keg Transport Dollies','keg-transport-dollies',835,'Keg dollies help ease manual lifting by offering a mobile solution for transferring kegs during the loading and unloading process. They have a compact, low profile design with a sunken bottom which diminishes jostling during transportation throughout your commercial business. Our keg dollies feature a durable steel construction that provides long lasting endurance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:37:39','2026-05-11 10:37:39'),(853,'Double Drum Dollies','double-drum-dollies',835,'Double drum dollies are a heavy-duty transport solution for large drums. These drum dollies feature a lipped edge for increased stability, a powder coat finish to resist corrosion, and casters for easy mobility. They are available in a variety of colors, weight capacities, and gallon drum size accommodations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:37:43','2026-05-11 10:37:43'),(854,'Tilting Drum Dollies','tilting-drum-dollies',835,'Tilting drum dollies allow the user to tilt the drum 10° for better liquid extraction when utilizing drum pumps or similar devices. They are compatible with a variety of drum types, and feature a pull strap with a hook for easy portability. Our tilting drum dollies are durable and come equipped with swivel casters for easy mobility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:37:45','2026-05-11 10:37:45'),(855,'Cross Style Steel Drum Dollies','cross-style-steel-drum-dollies',835,'Cross-style steel drum dollies are built for long-lasting durability to transport heavy drums. They feature a powder coat finish making them corrosion-resistant even in wet environments, and casters for easy mobility. The steel frame and load-stabilizing lip on these drum dollies provides structural strength to transport drums with rounded or square corners.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:37:49','2026-05-11 10:37:49'),(856,'Metal Cutting & Forming Machines','metal-cutting-forming-machines',418,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:37:50','2026-05-11 10:37:50'),(857,'Milling Machines','milling-machines',418,'Milling machines are powerful machining tools designed for precision metal cutting, shaping, and drilling operations. They feature durable construction, adjustable speed controls, cutting depth adjustments, and versatile work holding options, allowing for a wide range of machining tasks. Milling machines are commonly used in workshops, production facilities, and toolrooms to fabricate parts for aerospace, automotive, and general machinery applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:38:16','2026-05-11 10:38:16'),(858,'Sanding Machines','sanding-machines',418,'Suitable for workshops and factory environments, Sanding Machines use an abrasive belt or disc to smooth wooden, metal, and plastic surfaces, when shaping or preparing them for finishing. Available in a variety of horsepower, voltage, and amperage ratings, power sanders are used in a range of construction & renovation tasks, and they come in single-phase and 3-phase options to handle both small-scale and heavy-duty projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:38:51','2026-05-11 10:38:51'),(859,'Furniture Dollies','furniture-dollies',820,'Furniture dollies are essential heavy moving equipment for offices, warehouses, and factories, making transport easy. These furniture moving aids are constructed of highly durable materials, like steel or aluminum, that allow for moving large, heavy pieces such as couches, desks, or tables. Furniture dollies feature multiple durable swivel casters for optimal stability and maneuverability, and some models come equipped with ergonomic handles for easy mobility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:39:05','2026-05-11 10:39:05'),(860,'Saw Machines','saw-machines',418,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:39:23','2026-05-11 10:39:23'),(861,'Blackeners','blackeners',419,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:40:27','2026-05-11 10:40:27'),(862,'Glass Filled Cast Nylon Sheets, Tubes and Rods','glass-filled-cast-nylon-sheets-tubes-and-rods',761,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:41:08','2026-05-11 10:41:08'),(863,'Coolant','coolant',419,'Coolant keeps machines operating at the proper temperature and prevents them from overheating. Synthetic coolant is designed to resist rust and corrosion to keep machines running smoothly for longer periods of time. Band saw fluids keep blades sharp and and able to maintain high speeds. Ideal for any machining or metalworking applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:41:26','2026-05-11 10:41:26'),(864,'Coolant Systems','coolant-systems',419,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:41:52','2026-05-11 10:41:52'),(865,'Table & Sheet Wheeler','table-sheet-wheeler',859,'Table and sheet wheelers are versatile tools designed to simplify the transportation of large and bulky items, like tables and sheets of material. These movers feature two rigid wheels and a broad platform that rolls under bulky items for easy rolling around workspaces. These wheelers are ideal for moving folding tables, sheets of plywood, doors, office partition panels, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:42:25','2026-05-11 10:42:25'),(866,'Furniture Leg Dollies','furniture-leg-dollies',859,'These furniture dollies are ideal solutions for moving furniture with legs. Made with durable and scratch-resistant steel, these dollies are designed to be placed under each furniture leg to provide an easy and safe way to rearrange or move heavy items. Furniture leg dollies have a center cup to securely hold legs in place and non-slip foam discs to prevent damage. Weight capacities vary',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:42:28','2026-05-11 10:42:28'),(867,'Desk & Cabinet Corner Mover Dollies','desk-cabinet-corner-mover-dollies',859,'These desk and cabinet mover dollies are specifically designed for moving furniture away from or into corners and other tight spaces. Corner mover dollies feature a low-profile design that allows them to fit snugly into corners and provide stable support while maneuvering cabinets, desks, and other equipment. Our durable desk and cabinet mover dollies easily distribute weight for smooth movements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:42:31','2026-05-11 10:42:31'),(868,'File Cabinet Mover Dollies','file-cabinet-mover-dollies',859,'Our file cabinet mover dollies are designed to streamline the process of moving heavy file cabinets. Constructed with heavy-duty metals like steel and equipped with smooth-rolling casters, these file cabinet dollies provide a secure yet mobile platform for transporting cabinets around offices and other workspaces. Dollies come in various sizes to accommodate a range of file cabinet sizes',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:42:37','2026-05-11 10:42:37'),(869,'File Cabinet Mover Dollies','file-cabinet-mover-dollies-1',859,'Our file cabinet mover dollies are designed to streamline the process of moving heavy file cabinets. Constructed with heavy-duty metals like steel and equipped with smooth-rolling casters, these file cabinet dollies provide a secure yet mobile platform for transporting cabinets around offices and other workspaces. Dollies come in various sizes to accommodate a range of file cabinet sizes',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:42:37','2026-05-11 10:42:37'),(870,'Desk Lifts & Mover Dollies','desk-lifts-mover-dollies',859,'Our desk lifts and mover dollies are designed specifically to simplify the process of lifting and relocating desks. These steel desk lifters allow users to quickly and safely move desks, tables, and other work surfaces without having to remove drawers or contents. Desk lift mechanisms have various lift frame options and a range of weight capacities. These are ideal for offices, schools, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:42:41','2026-05-11 10:42:41'),(871,'Furniture Moving Dollies','furniture-moving-dollies',859,'Furniture-moving dollies make it easier to move heavy items in various settings. Made with durable materials like steel and aluminum, these heavy-duty furniture dollies safely and securely move cabinets, furniture, equipment, and other bulky items to prevent strain and injury. Polyurethane casters allow smooth rolling. Hand-operated ratchet or hydraulic furniture dollies are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:42:46','2026-05-11 10:42:46'),(872,'Corrosion Inhibitors','corrosion-inhibitors',419,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:42:47','2026-05-11 10:42:47'),(873,'Cutting Oils & Lubricants','cutting-oils-lubricants',419,'Cutting oils are used in machining processes to reduce heat generated during cutting, milling, drilling, and other metalworking operations. They act as a coolant, preventing excessive heat buildup. Lubricants act as a sealant and barrier, protecting against moisture, dust, and contaminants that could compromise the performance of machinery. Cutting oils and lubricants are ideal for commercial or industrial machinery projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:43:23','2026-05-11 10:43:50'),(874,'Hand Trucks','hand-trucks',820,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:43:36','2026-05-11 10:43:36'),(875,'Appliance Hand Trucks','appliance-hand-trucks',874,'Appliance hand trucks are specialized hand trucks designed to transport heavy appliances with ease and safety. They feature a sturdy steel frame with reinforced joints and braces to support the heavy weight and pneumatic wheels that provide maneuverability. Their low-profile platform allows for easy loading and unloading and ergonomic handle allows for seamless maneuvering. Ideal in transporting refrigerators, vending machines, stoves, freezers, dryers, and other large commercial or residential appliances.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:44:21','2026-05-11 10:44:21'),(876,'Cutting Tool Cleaners','cutting-tool-cleaners',419,'Cutting tool cleaners are solutions designed to maintain tools used in machining processes. They remove built-up residues, such as metal chips, oils, and other contaminants. Cleaners also feature anti-corrosion properties to protect cutting tools and ensure years of long-lasting use. They are ideal for machine shops, metal fabrication facilities, and manufacturing plants.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:44:36','2026-05-11 10:44:36'),(877,'PEI Plastics Sheets & Bars','pei-plastics-sheets-bars',761,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:45:02','2026-05-11 10:45:02'),(878,'Hand Cleaners','hand-cleaners',419,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:45:10','2026-05-11 10:45:10'),(879,'Welding Chemicals','welding-chemicals',419,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:45:41','2026-05-11 10:45:41'),(880,'Appliance Hand Truck Accessories','appliance-hand-truck-accessories',875,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:46:15','2026-05-11 10:46:15'),(881,'Auto-Rewind Ratchet Appliance Hand Trucks','auto-rewind-ratchet-appliance-hand-trucks',875,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:46:18','2026-05-11 10:46:18'),(882,'Vending Machine Trucks','vending-machine-trucks',875,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:46:20','2026-05-11 10:46:20'),(883,'Appliance Hand Trucks','appliance-hand-trucks-1',875,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:46:22','2026-05-11 10:46:22'),(884,'Stair Climbing Appliance Trucks','stair-climbing-appliance-trucks',875,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:46:24','2026-05-11 10:46:24'),(885,'End Mills','end-mills',420,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:46:59','2026-05-11 10:46:59'),(886,'Milling Cutters','milling-cutters',420,'Milling cutter tools are meticulously designed to remove material from a workpiece, shaping it into the desired form. Milling cutters are crafted from high-quality materials to ensure durability and longevity in demanding machining operations. Choose from angle cutters, concave radius cutters, keyseat cutters, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:47:36','2026-05-11 10:48:08'),(887,'Convertible Hand Trucks','convertible-hand-trucks',874,'Convertible folding hand trucks are designed to transport heavy loads around the workplace. They feature a convertible design that allows them to transform from a traditional upright hand truck into a horizontal platform truck or a combination of both. This flexibility allows for adaptability for different load sizes and shapes, maximizing efficiency and reducing the need for multiple specialized carts. Convertible hand trucks are ideal for warehouses, garden centers, manufacturing facilities, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:48:04','2026-05-11 10:48:04'),(888,'Milling Saws','milling-saws',420,'Milling saws are cutting tools specifically designed for use in milling operations to create precise and intricate cuts in various materials. They come equipped with sharp teeth arranged around a rotating blade, allowing for efficient material removal during milling. Milling saws come in multiple configurations, including jeweler\'s saws, sitting saws, and slotting saws. They are constructed of durable materials that can withstand the rigors of milling operations and ensure long-term performance in manufacturing, metalworking, or woodworking.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:48:44','2026-05-11 10:48:44'),(889,'Anti Skid Feet','anti-skid-feet',421,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:49:44','2026-05-11 10:49:44'),(890,'Compression & Shear Mounts','compression-shear-mounts',421,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:50:08','2026-05-11 10:50:08'),(891,'Furniture & Appliance Feet','furniture-appliance-feet',421,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:50:35','2026-05-11 10:50:35'),(892,'Hanger Mounts','hanger-mounts',421,'Hanger Mounts are designed to minimize noise and prevent transmission of vibrations in industrial settings, offering a reliable solution for machinery and equipment support. Explore vibration-isolating hanger mounts including spring mounts, spring hangers, anti vibration hangers, and more. Easy to install and suitable for a variety of applications, hanger mounts provide a cost-effective solution for improving workplace conditions and prolonging the lifespan of equipment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:51:08','2026-05-11 10:51:08'),(893,'Steel 3-in-1 Convertible Hand Trucks','steel-3-in-1-convertible-hand-trucks',887,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:51:16','2026-05-11 10:51:16'),(894,'Aluminum 3-in-1 Convertible Hand Trucks','aluminum-3-in-1-convertible-hand-trucks',887,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:51:20','2026-05-11 10:51:20'),(895,'Folding Hand Trucks','folding-hand-trucks',887,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:51:25','2026-05-11 10:51:25'),(896,'Steel 2-in-1 Convertible Hand Trucks','steel-2-in-1-convertible-hand-trucks',887,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:51:26','2026-05-11 10:51:26'),(897,'Aluminum 2-in-1 Convertible Hand Trucks','aluminum-2-in-1-convertible-hand-trucks',887,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:51:29','2026-05-11 10:51:29'),(898,'Leveling & Toggle Pads','leveling-toggle-pads',421,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:51:47','2026-05-11 10:51:47'),(899,'Machine Leveling Mounts','machine-leveling-mounts',421,'Machine leveling mounts are specialized components used to level and stabilize machinery and equipment. They are designed to absorb vibrations, dampen noise, and provide stability by compensating for uneven surfaces or floor irregularities. Machine leveling mounts consist of a base plate, leveling bolt, and a spring element that isolates the machine from external vibrations and shocks. They are ideal for manufacturing plants, machine shops, production facilities, and laboratories for installing heavy or sensitive machinery and equipment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:52:21','2026-05-11 10:52:21'),(900,'Spring Floor Mounts','spring-floor-mounts',421,'Spring floor mounts are an ideal anti-vibration solution for applications that involve any level of vibrations and shock. They use shear springs and metal components to impart vibration control and reduce noise. Spring floor mounts are used widely in mechanical and electronic enclosures, pumps, HVAC, and other equipment. They\'re simple to install and remove and are available in various sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:53:00','2026-05-11 10:53:00'),(901,'Nylon 2-in-1 Convertible Hand Trucks','nylon-2-in-1-convertible-hand-trucks',887,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:53:20','2026-05-11 10:53:20'),(902,'Battery Powered Convertible Hand Trucks','battery-powered-convertible-hand-trucks',887,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:53:24','2026-05-11 10:53:24'),(903,'Multi-Function Convertible Hand Trucks','multi-function-convertible-hand-trucks',887,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:53:28','2026-05-11 10:53:28'),(904,'Steel 4-in-1 Convertible Hand Trucks','steel-4-in-1-convertible-hand-trucks',887,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:53:33','2026-05-11 10:53:33'),(905,'Surface Protectors','surface-protectors',421,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:53:37','2026-05-11 10:53:37'),(906,'Vibration Pads','vibration-pads',421,'Vibration pads minimize noise and offer shock reduction in equipment and heavy machinery. Made from resilient materials and featuring a non-slip surface, vibration pads provide effective isolation and shock absorption, prolonging the lifespan of equipment and improving operator comfort. Vibration pads are suitable for use with washing machines, air compressors, and other heavy machinery in residential, commercial, or industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:54:13','2026-05-11 10:54:13'),(907,'Coolant Systems','coolant-systems-1',422,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:55:10','2026-05-11 10:55:10'),(908,'Dust Collectors','dust-collectors-1',422,'Dust collectors capture and filter airborne dust, particulates, and contaminants generated during machining, parts cleaning, treating, or other processes. By removing harmful particles from the air, dust collectors contribute to workplace safety, equipment longevity, and compliance with environmental regulations. They are ideal for metalworking, woodworking, and other manufacturing processes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:56:00','2026-05-11 10:56:00'),(909,'Machine Cleaning Tools','machine-cleaning-tools',422,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:56:37','2026-05-11 10:56:37'),(910,'Parts Cleaners','parts-cleaners',422,'Parts cleaners are efficient tools utilized for component cleaning tasks. Available in various types, including immersion ultrasonic cleaners, benchtop ultrasonic cleaners, steam cleaners, parts washers, and degreasers, each serves a specific purpose. Immersion ultrasonic cleaners utilize ultrasonic waves for thorough cleaning, while washers/degreasers are effective for removing contaminants. Widely employed in industrial and commercial settings, parts cleaners provide practical solutions for cleaning needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:57:23','2026-05-11 10:57:23'),(911,'Parts Washing Baskets','parts-washing-baskets',422,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:58:02','2026-05-11 10:58:02'),(912,'Chasers','chasers',423,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 10:58:50','2026-05-11 10:58:50'),(913,'Die & Tap Sets','die-tap-sets',423,'Die and tap sets are tools used in metalworking to create threads on screws, bolts, and other fasteners. They are used for repairing or restoring threads on damaged or worn-out bolts, screws, and other threaded components. The sets serve specific purposes in the machining and fabricating threaded components in industrial and commercial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:00:00','2026-05-11 11:00:00'),(914,'Die Adapters & Holders','die-adapters-holders',423,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:00:56','2026-05-11 11:00:56'),(915,'Tube Stock','tube-stock',442,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:00:57','2026-05-11 11:00:57'),(916,'Cylinder Hand Trucks','cylinder-hand-trucks',874,'Cylinder hand trucks are designed to safely and efficiently transport cylinder tanks in commercial and industrial settings. With frames made from heavy-duty materials like steel and rubber, these hand trucks, carts, and dollies securely hold tanks and containers with cylindrical shapes. They are either motorized or manual and have wheels that make it easy to move cylinders between different workspaces. Cylinder hand trucks are ideal in settings where moving heavy capacity drums, tanks, and barrels are key.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:01:04','2026-05-11 11:01:04'),(917,'Dies','dies',423,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:01:19','2026-05-11 11:01:19'),(918,'Drill & Tap Sets','drill-tap-sets',423,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:01:55','2026-05-11 11:01:55'),(919,'Tap Extractors','tap-extractors',423,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:02:29','2026-05-11 11:02:29'),(920,'Tapping Tools','tapping-tools',423,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:02:58','2026-05-11 11:02:58'),(921,'Taps','taps',423,'Taps are cutting tools that create threads in materials like metal, plastic, or wood. They have ridges along their shafts that cut into the material when turned. Taps come in different designs and sizes for varying thread sizes and pitches, with straight or spiral flutes. They are made from high-speed steel or carbide for durability and sharpness, and are commonly used in machining, metalworking, plumbing, automotive repair, and woodworking.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:03:33','2026-05-11 11:03:33'),(922,'Cylinder Transport Dollies','cylinder-transport-dollies',916,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:04:25','2026-05-11 11:04:25'),(923,'Hand Operated Water Heater Tank Lift Truck','hand-operated-water-heater-tank-lift-truck',916,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:04:29','2026-05-11 11:04:29'),(924,'Cylinder Cart','cylinder-cart',916,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:04:33','2026-05-11 11:04:33'),(925,'Cylinder Lifters','cylinder-lifters',916,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:04:37','2026-05-11 11:04:37'),(926,'Motorized Dewar Cylinder Tank Cart','motorized-dewar-cylinder-tank-cart',916,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:04:41','2026-05-11 11:04:41'),(927,'Welding Cylinder & Torch Carts','welding-cylinder-torch-carts',916,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:04:44','2026-05-11 11:04:44'),(928,'Cylinder Hand Trucks','cylinder-hand-trucks-1',916,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:04:47','2026-05-11 11:04:47'),(929,'High-Pressure Cylinder Retention Bar for Motorized Dewar Cylinder Tank Carts','high-pressure-cylinder-retention-bar-for-motorized-dewar-cylinder-tank-carts',916,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:07:10','2026-05-11 11:07:10'),(930,'Foot Kick Cylinder Hand Trucks','foot-kick-cylinder-hand-trucks',916,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:07:13','2026-05-11 11:07:13'),(931,'Portable Cylinder Lifters','portable-cylinder-lifters',916,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:07:17','2026-05-11 11:07:17'),(932,'Hydraulic Cylinder Pedalift','hydraulic-cylinder-pedalift',916,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:07:20','2026-05-11 11:07:20'),(933,'Manual Cylinder Lifters','manual-cylinder-lifters',916,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:07:24','2026-05-11 11:07:24'),(934,'Drum Trucks & Cradles','drum-trucks-cradles',874,'Drum trucks and cradles are designed to transport drums around industrial facilities. They feature multiple wheels for stability and maneuverability,and ergonomic handles with grips that make moving drums and barrels easier. Drum trucks and cradles are ideal for drum handling in warehouses, factories, laboratories, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:09:28','2026-05-11 11:09:28'),(935,'Drum Dolly Truck','drum-dolly-truck',934,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:12:10','2026-05-11 11:12:10'),(936,'2-Wheel Drum Trucks for Steel Drums','2-wheel-drum-trucks-for-steel-drums',934,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:12:13','2026-05-11 11:12:13'),(937,'Drum Trucks for Poly & Fiber Drums','drum-trucks-for-poly-fiber-drums',934,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:12:16','2026-05-11 11:12:16'),(938,'Low-Profile Drum Caddies','low-profile-drum-caddies',934,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:12:20','2026-05-11 11:12:20'),(939,'Heavy Duty Drum Cradles','heavy-duty-drum-cradles',934,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:12:23','2026-05-11 11:12:23'),(940,'Heavy Duty Powered Drum Trucks','heavy-duty-powered-drum-trucks',934,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:12:27','2026-05-11 11:12:27'),(941,'4-Wheel Drum Trucks for Steel Drums','4-wheel-drum-trucks-for-steel-drums',934,'4-Wheel Drum Trucks are designed for heavy-duty drum transportation. With sturdy construction and four-wheel stability, these trucks ensure easy maneuverability and can handle the heaviest loads. They securely hold drums with specific cradles and have adjustable features for various sizes. Safety features like brakes and grips provide control and stability for safe steel drum transportation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:12:30','2026-05-11 11:12:30'),(942,'4-Wheel Drum Trucks for Plastic Drums','4-wheel-drum-trucks-for-plastic-drums',934,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:15:14','2026-05-11 11:15:14'),(943,'2-Wheel Drum Trucks for Plastic Drums','2-wheel-drum-trucks-for-plastic-drums',934,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:15:17','2026-05-11 11:15:17'),(944,'Knock-Down Drum Truck','knock-down-drum-truck',934,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:15:19','2026-05-11 11:15:19'),(945,'4 Wheel Drum Cart','4-wheel-drum-cart',934,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:15:23','2026-05-11 11:15:23'),(946,'Hand Truck Wheels','hand-truck-wheels',874,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:18:01','2026-05-11 11:18:01'),(947,'Hand Truck Parts & Accessories','hand-truck-parts-accessories-1',874,'Hand truck parts and accessories improve hand truck performance and durability as well as extending the life. They include wheels, handles, noseplates, replacement parts, and other accessories that are easy to use and highly durable. Users can customize hand trucks to their specific requirements, resulting in efficient material handling. Hand trucks and components are suitable for use in warehouses, distribution centers, and other material handling settings and contribute to the smooth movement of goods, optimizing hand truck functionality.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:18:04','2026-05-11 11:18:04'),(948,'General Purpose Hand Trucks','general-purpose-hand-trucks',874,'Hand trucks are high-strength material handling equipment designed to transport heavy or bulky items. They feature a sturdy metal frame to support large loads and have durable wheels that provide stability and easy maneuverability when navigating uneven surfaces. Designed with a base noseplate to accept bulky loads and ergonomic, anti-slip grip handle for easy maneuvering. Hand trucks can move a range of load sizes helping to reduce worker fatigue and the risk of injury. Used in warehouses, factories, retail, and distribution centers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:18:08','2026-05-11 11:18:08'),(949,'HVAC Hand Trucks','hvac-hand-trucks',948,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:22:04','2026-05-11 11:22:04'),(950,'Motorized Hand Trucks','motorized-hand-trucks',948,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:22:08','2026-05-11 11:22:08'),(951,'Delivery Hand Trucks','delivery-hand-trucks',948,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:22:11','2026-05-11 11:22:11'),(952,'Steel Hand Trucks','steel-hand-trucks',948,'Steel Hand Trucks are designed to tackle heavy duty loads in industrial material handling applications. The rugged steel construction provides exceptional strength and lasting durability, while the powder coat finish offers resistance to corrosion. Each heavy duty steel hand truck comes equipped with ergonomic handles and sturdy wheels to offer smooth maneuverability. Dimensions vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:22:15','2026-05-11 11:22:15'),(953,'Stair Climbing Hand Trucks','stair-climbing-hand-trucks',948,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:22:17','2026-05-11 11:22:17'),(954,'Aluminum Hand Trucks','aluminum-hand-trucks',948,'Aluminum hand trucks are designed to provide material handling solutions in commercial applications. Lightweight and durable, each aluminum hand truck dolly is perfect for transporting various goods and is built for years of service. Our heavy-duty aluminum hand trucks come equipped with durable wheels and assemble easily. Various dimensions, wheel types, and weight capacities are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:22:21','2026-05-11 11:22:21'),(955,'Four Wheel Warehouse Hand Trucks','four-wheel-warehouse-hand-trucks',948,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:25:50','2026-05-11 11:25:50'),(956,'All-Terrain Hand Trucks','all-terrain-hand-trucks',948,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:25:53','2026-05-11 11:25:53'),(957,'Reinforced Nose Hand Trucks','reinforced-nose-hand-trucks',948,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:25:56','2026-05-11 11:25:56'),(958,'Casino Hand Trucks','casino-hand-trucks',948,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:25:59','2026-05-11 11:25:59'),(959,'Shovel Nose Hand Trucks','shovel-nose-hand-trucks',948,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:26:04','2026-05-11 11:26:04'),(960,'Beverage Distribution Hand Trucks','beverage-distribution-hand-trucks',948,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:26:08','2026-05-11 11:26:08'),(961,'Mini Pallet Fork Hand Trucks','mini-pallet-fork-hand-trucks',948,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:26:13','2026-05-11 11:26:13'),(962,'Luggage Hand Truck','luggage-hand-truck',948,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:33:27','2026-05-11 11:33:27'),(963,'Steel Hand Trucks','steel-hand-trucks-1',948,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:33:31','2026-05-11 11:33:31'),(964,'Foot Kick Hand Trucks','foot-kick-hand-trucks',948,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:33:33','2026-05-11 11:33:33'),(965,'Nursery and Brick Hand Trucks','nursery-and-brick-hand-trucks',948,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:33:38','2026-05-11 11:33:38'),(966,'RefrigiWear® Hand Truck Parts & Accessories','refrigiwear-hand-truck-parts-accessories-1',947,'RefrigiWear Hand Truck Parts and Accessories attach securely to help enhance functionality when transporting items. Available accessories include an insulated pouch with quick-release clasps for simple, stable connection to a hand truck, allowing users to easily carry loose objects or food items while leaving the frame and toe plate free for boxes and bulky cargo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:38:11','2026-05-11 11:38:11'),(967,'New Age Hand Truck Parts & Accessories','new-age-hand-truck-parts-accessories-1',947,'New Age Hand Truck Parts and Accessories offer warehouse workers and other factory employees improved performance & comfort when using hand trucks. Wheel kits and other hand truck replacement parts allow old or worn-out components to be swapped out to promote long-term utility, and hand truck accessories like pallet attachments provide even-load distribution for items that extend past the toe plate.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:38:15','2026-05-11 11:38:15'),(968,'Vestil Hand Truck Parts & Accessories','vestil-hand-truck-parts-accessories-1',947,'Made with durable steel to hold strong over time, Vestil Hand Truck Parts and Accessories improve efficiency when loading and transporting heavy items, and include items like tie-down attachments that help secure loads in place to help prevent them from moving around in transit.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:38:18','2026-05-11 11:38:18'),(969,'Wesco® Hand Truck Parts & Accessories','wesco-hand-truck-parts-accessories-1',947,'Designed to improve their efficiency, Wesco Hand Truck Parts and Accessories such as toe plates & decks are built to accommodate loads of varying shapes and sizes, while heavy-duty straps secure boxes and other cargo in place during transport. Optional stair climbers can be attached to assist when moving up and down staircases.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:38:21','2026-05-11 11:38:21'),(970,'Magliner® Hand Truck Parts & Accessories','magliner-hand-truck-parts-accessories-1',947,'Magliner Hand Truck Parts and Accessories are designed to improve efficiency when loading and transporting bulky items and include stair climber attachments to keep the hand truck stable while navigating flights of stairs and ratchet straps that can be added to secure loads. Replacement parts like wheels, axles, and frames help extend the hand truck’s life.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:38:25','2026-05-11 11:38:25'),(971,'Global Industrial™ Hand Truck Parts & Accessories','global-industrial-hand-truck-parts-accessories-1',947,'Global Industrial Hand Truck Parts and Accessories allow warehouse workers to modify hand trucks to enhance functionality or replace worn components and extend its service life. Accessories like decks or nose plate extensions provide versatility to accommodate loads of different shapes and sizes, while replacement wheels help ensure smooth rolling during transport.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:38:28','2026-05-11 11:38:28'),(972,'B & P Manufacturing Hand Truck Parts & Accessories','b-p-manufacturing-hand-truck-parts-accessories-1',947,'B&P Manufacturing Hand Truck Parts and Accessories are designed to improve the functionality and performance of hand trucks when loading and moving heavy objects. Hand truck accessories, such as snap-on decks, are quick & easy to attach, giving user a flush surface to support bulky or oddly-shaped items when transporting cargo when in the truck or platform positions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:42:05','2026-05-11 11:42:05'),(973,'Valley Craft® Hand Truck Parts & Accessories','valley-craft-hand-truck-parts-accessories-1',947,'Help improve the load-carrying capabilities of select hand cart models with Valley Craft Hand Truck Parts and Accessories, including flat and transmission forks that can be affixed to hand carts to support bulky heavyweight loads and can be folded out of the way when not in use for compact storage.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:42:09','2026-05-11 11:42:09'),(974,'Justrite® Hand Truck Parts & Accessories','justrite-hand-truck-parts-accessories-1',947,'Justrite Hand Truck Parts and Accessories are suitable for use with gas cylinder hand trucks to help improve functionality and storage. Accessories, like a tool tray, securely attach to hand trucks and conveniently hold tools & supplies while ensuring they are easily accessible, and locking posts provide stability for gas cylinders of various diameters.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:42:12','2026-05-11 11:42:12'),(975,'Morse® Hand Truck Parts & Accessories','morse-hand-truck-parts-accessories-1',947,'Compatible with select drum cradle trucks, Morse Hand Truck Parts and Accessories are designed to facilitate the loading and unloading of industrial drums, with accessories like tipping levers that give workers the leverage needed to transition drums from the upright to cradle position, and drip pan attachments to protect floors from spills from cradled drums.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:42:15','2026-05-11 11:42:15'),(976,'Rubber Cords','rubber-cords',443,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:44:12','2026-05-11 11:44:12'),(977,'High Temperature Silicone Rubber Cords','high-temperature-silicone-rubber-cords',976,'High temperature silicone rubber cords are used to fill gaps, channels, and make custom seals. These cords are harder than standard viton and can be used in high pressure or wear applications. The heavy duty construction will provide lasting durability and dependability. Silicone rubber cords are available in many sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:44:47','2026-05-11 11:44:47'),(978,'Milwaukee Hand Truck Wheels','milwaukee-hand-truck-wheels',946,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:45:27','2026-05-11 11:45:27'),(979,'Marathon Industries Hand Truck Wheels','marathon-industries-hand-truck-wheels',946,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:45:32','2026-05-11 11:45:32'),(980,'Oil Resistant Buna-N Rubber Cords','oil-resistant-buna-n-rubber-cords',976,'Buna-N rubber cords are resistant to oils, fuels, and water making them ideal for a wide variety of applications. These rubber cords can be used to fill gaps or channels, and to make custom seals. The durable design will provide long lasting dependability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:45:37','2026-05-11 11:45:37'),(981,'Martin Wheel Hand Truck Wheels','martin-wheel-hand-truck-wheels',946,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:45:37','2026-05-11 11:45:37'),(982,'Magliner® Hand Truck Wheels','magliner-hand-truck-wheels',946,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:45:41','2026-05-11 11:45:41'),(983,'Global Industrial™ Hand Truck Wheels','global-industrial-hand-truck-wheels',946,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:45:44','2026-05-11 11:45:44'),(984,'Rubber Rolls','rubber-rolls',443,'Rubber rolls act as a protective layer, protecting floors and surfaces from damage caused by heavy equipment, high-impact activities, or foot traffic. They are designed to absorb shock and impact, making them ideal for use in areas where equipment or heavy objects are moved frequently or risk falling. Rubber rolls come in different thicknesses to accommodate various levels of impact resistance and load-bearing requirements. They are ideal for use in various applications, including gym flooring, industrial flooring, commercial spaces, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:47:17','2026-05-11 11:47:17'),(985,'Lever Dollies','lever-dollies',820,'Lever dollies are specialized material handling equipment designed to simplify the movement and transportation of heavy or bulky items. They feature swivel casters that allow easy maneuverability, allowing users to navigate through tight spaces and corners. Lever dollies are ideal for moving heavy items within warehouses, manufacturing settings, and retail establishments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:47:38','2026-05-11 11:47:38'),(986,'Oil Resistant Buna-N Rubber','oil-resistant-buna-n-rubber',984,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:47:47','2026-05-11 11:47:47'),(987,'Ultra Strength Neoprene Rubber','ultra-strength-neoprene-rubber',984,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:48:08','2026-05-11 11:48:08'),(988,'Abrasion Resistant SBR Rubber Sheets and Strips','abrasion-resistant-sbr-rubber-sheets-and-strips',984,'Rubber sheets are flexible, thin materials made of rubber compounds known for their elasticity, durability, and resistance to environmental conditions. They are easy to cut or mold in order to fit specific size requirements. Heavy-duty sheets are resistant to tearing, impact, and the effects of various chemicals. Rubber sheets are ideal for gaskets and seals, industrial belting, flooring, vibration isolation, electrical installation, and construction.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:48:28','2026-05-11 11:56:51'),(989,'High Temperature FDA Silicone Rubber','high-temperature-fda-silicone-rubber',984,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:48:51','2026-05-11 11:48:51'),(990,'Multipurpose Neoprene Rubber','multipurpose-neoprene-rubber',984,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:49:11','2026-05-11 11:49:11'),(991,'Fabric Reinforced Neoprene Rubber','fabric-reinforced-neoprene-rubber',984,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:49:31','2026-05-11 11:49:31'),(992,'Braided Silicone Tubes','braided-silicone-tubes',984,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:49:56','2026-05-11 11:49:56'),(993,'High Strength Abrasion Resistant SBR Rubber','high-strength-abrasion-resistant-sbr-rubber',984,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:50:18','2026-05-11 11:50:18'),(994,'Textured Multipurpose Neoprene Rubber','textured-multipurpose-neoprene-rubber',984,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:50:38','2026-05-11 11:50:38'),(995,'FDA Multipurpose Neoprene Rubber Sheets and Strips','fda-multipurpose-neoprene-rubber-sheets-and-strips',984,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:50:58','2026-05-11 11:50:58'),(996,'Ultra Strength Oil Resistant Buna-N Rubber','ultra-strength-oil-resistant-buna-n-rubber',984,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:51:20','2026-05-11 11:51:20'),(997,'Weather Resistant EPDM Rubber','weather-resistant-epdm-rubber',984,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:51:37','2026-05-11 11:51:37'),(998,'High Temperature Silicone Rubber Tubes','high-temperature-silicone-rubber-tubes',984,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:52:28','2026-05-11 11:52:28'),(999,'Fiberglass Fabric-Reinforced Silicone Rubber','fiberglass-fabric-reinforced-silicone-rubber',984,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:52:49','2026-05-11 11:52:49'),(1000,'High Strength Multipurpose Neoprene Rubber Sheets and Strips','high-strength-multipurpose-neoprene-rubber-sheets-and-strips',984,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:53:11','2026-05-11 11:53:11'),(1001,'Lever Dollies with Wood Handles','lever-dollies-with-wood-handles',985,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:53:14','2026-05-11 11:53:14'),(1002,'Lever Dollies with Steel Handles','lever-dollies-with-steel-handles',985,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:53:18','2026-05-11 11:53:18'),(1003,'Elastic Natural Rubber','elastic-natural-rubber',984,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:53:36','2026-05-11 11:53:36'),(1004,'Fabric-Reinforced Oil Resistant Buna-N Rubber','fabric-reinforced-oil-resistant-buna-n-rubber',984,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:54:07','2026-05-11 11:54:07'),(1005,'Chemical Resistant Viton Rubber','chemical-resistant-viton-rubber',984,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:54:30','2026-05-11 11:54:30'),(1006,'Machine Skates & Dollies','machine-skates-dollies',820,'Machine skates & dollies transport heavy machinery and equipment easily around a facility. Designed for commercial and industrial environments, machine skates offer heavy-duty load capacities and durable construction. Heavy-duty casters make these machinery skates mobile so that workers can easily transport and maneuver equipment around warehouses, lessening the chance of workplace injuries.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:54:31','2026-05-11 11:54:31'),(1007,'FDA Oil Resistant Buna-N Rubber','fda-oil-resistant-buna-n-rubber',984,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:54:52','2026-05-11 11:54:52'),(1008,'Oil Resistant Buna-N Rubber Sheets and Strips','oil-resistant-buna-n-rubber-sheets-and-strips',984,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:55:22','2026-05-11 11:55:22'),(1009,'Rubber Sheets','rubber-sheets',443,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:56:23','2026-05-11 11:56:23'),(1010,'Multipurpose Neoprene Rubber','multipurpose-neoprene-rubber-1',1009,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:57:55','2026-05-11 11:57:55'),(1011,'High Temperature FDA Silicone Rubber','high-temperature-fda-silicone-rubber-1',1009,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:58:25','2026-05-11 11:58:25'),(1012,'EPDM Rubber','epdm-rubber',1009,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:58:48','2026-05-11 11:58:48'),(1013,'Rubber-Cal SBR 65A Rubber Sheets','rubber-cal-sbr-65a-rubber-sheets',1009,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:59:08','2026-05-11 11:59:08'),(1014,'Propel Dollies','propel-dollies',1006,'Propel dollies offer convenient and efficient movement of heavy loads without the need for strenuous manual lifting. Available in a range of sizes and configurations, these equipment dollies are equipped with phenolic wheels for smooth movements and effortless maneuverability. We offer both non-tilt models for straightforward movement and tilt models for precise positioning.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:59:19','2026-05-11 11:59:19'),(1015,'Equipment Moving Dollies','equipment-moving-dollies',1006,'Equipment-moving dollies help simplify the transportation of heavy-duty machinery and equipment in manufacturing facilities, garages, warehouses, and other industrial settings. With high weight capacities, these heavy equipment moving dollies provide a cost-effective alternative to forklifts and overhead cranes. Rugged steel construction and durable wheels offer easy and safe maneuverability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:59:22','2026-05-11 11:59:22'),(1016,'Hydraulic Machine Roller Dollies','hydraulic-machine-roller-dollies',1006,'Hydraulic machine roller dollies combine the benefits of hydraulic lifts and roller dollies into one convenient transportation solution. These machinery dollies feature a hydraulic system that allows for controlled lifting and lowering of heavy loads, ensuring precise positioning. With a range of high weight capacities, these hydraulic dollies provide reliable support for different machine sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:59:25','2026-05-11 11:59:25'),(1017,'Machinery Skates','machinery-skates',1006,'Our machinery skates facilitate the movement of heavy machinery in industrial work settings. Available in various configurations to meet different needs, these machinery-moving skates feature rollers that provide smooth transportation across flat surfaces. Fixed, adjustable, and steerable machine skates are available with a range of high weight capacities for use in workshops, garages, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:59:28','2026-05-11 11:59:28'),(1018,'Fabric Reinforced Abrasion Resistant SBR Rubber','fabric-reinforced-abrasion-resistant-sbr-rubber',1009,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:59:32','2026-05-11 11:59:32'),(1019,'Container Dollies','container-dollies',1006,'Container dollies are designed specifically for transporting containers for shipping or storage purposes. These dollies feature robust construction and high weight capacities, and are equipped with heavy-duty wheels for smooth rolling and effortless maneuverability across various surfaces. Container dollies are ideal for warehouses, workshops, shipping facilities, and similar settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:59:32','2026-05-11 11:59:32'),(1020,'Machine Transport Roller Dollies','machine-transport-roller-dollies',1006,'Our machine transport roller dollies effortlessly transport heavy machinery and equipment using a durable roller system. These machine dollies feature a central load-bearing plate and several rollers that provide stability and smooth transport. Available in various weight capacities, these roller dollies are ideal tools for workshops, warehouses, and other industrial settings with heavy machinery.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:59:41','2026-05-11 11:59:41'),(1021,'Rotating Multi-Directional Machine Dollies','rotating-multi-directional-machine-dollies',1006,'Our rotating multi-directional machine dollies are engineered to maneuver heavy machinery in any direction, even in confined spaces. These rotating machine dollies feature swivel rollers that allow precise positioning and easy navigation. Heavy-duty machine dollies have varying high-weight capacities. More than one dolly can be used to maneuver a single load. Some dollies have a push/pull handle.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:59:44','2026-05-11 11:59:44'),(1022,'Material Handling Cup Dollies','material-handling-cup-dollies',1006,'Our material-handling cup dollies are designed to easily and safely transport materials in demanding industrial settings. Made with heavy-duty metals or plastics, these cup dollies have durable wheels for superior stability and maneuverability. We offer material-handling dollies that can withstand abusive or shock-load applications and aren\'t impacted by extreme temperatures, oils, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:59:47','2026-05-11 11:59:47'),(1023,'Chemical Resistant Viton Rubber','chemical-resistant-viton-rubber-1',1009,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 11:59:57','2026-05-11 11:59:57'),(1024,'Oil Resistant Buna-N Rubber','oil-resistant-buna-n-rubber-1',1009,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:00:23','2026-05-11 12:00:23'),(1025,'Open Deck Dollies','open-deck-dollies',820,'Open deck dollies transport heavy loads such as freestanding equipment or parts or bulky containers like boxes, crates, or shipping containers. Engineered to lessen workplace injuries, Dollies optimize material handling with its sturdy wheels for ergonomic mobility and transport control. Its open gap in the middle of the deck prevents debris from accumulating and allows it to be carried or hung when not in use. Made from durable metal such as steel, plastic, or wood, Open-deck Dollies are integral to easily and efficiently move heavy loads.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:12:46','2026-05-11 12:12:46'),(1026,'Metal Detectable FDA Silicone Rubber Rolls, Strips & Sheets','metal-detectable-fda-silicone-rubber-rolls-strips-sheets',1009,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:22:14','2026-05-11 12:22:14'),(1027,'High Temperature Silicone Rubber Sheets and Strips','high-temperature-silicone-rubber-sheets-and-strips',1009,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:22:39','2026-05-11 12:22:39'),(1028,'Ultra Strength Neoprene Rubber','ultra-strength-neoprene-rubber-1',1009,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:34:54','2026-05-11 12:34:54'),(1029,'Weather Resistant EPDM Rubber','weather-resistant-epdm-rubber-1',1009,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:35:39','2026-05-11 12:35:39'),(1030,'Ultra Strength Oil Resistant Buna-N Rubber','ultra-strength-oil-resistant-buna-n-rubber-1',1009,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:36:14','2026-05-11 12:36:14'),(1031,'Abrasion Resistant Polyurethane','abrasion-resistant-polyurethane',1009,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:36:44','2026-05-11 12:36:44'),(1032,'Abrasion Resistant Polyurethane','abrasion-resistant-polyurethane-1',1009,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:38:45','2026-05-11 12:38:45'),(1033,'High Strength Multipurpose Neoprene Rubber Sheets and Strips','high-strength-multipurpose-neoprene-rubber-sheets-and-strips-1',1009,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:39:22','2026-05-11 12:39:22'),(1034,'Hardwood Open Deck Dollies','hardwood-open-deck-dollies',1025,'Hardwood Open Deck Dollies have heavy duty swivel casters to provide convenient and easy load transportation. The poplar hardwood construction offers lasting durability and dependability. Select hardwood open deck dolly models have raised ends for additional load security.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:39:40','2026-05-11 12:39:40'),(1035,'Steel Open Deck Dollies','steel-open-deck-dollies',1025,'Move machinery, heavy cases, and cartons with our Steel Open Deck Dollies built to transport heavy loads in commercial areas. The open deck design provides convenient loading and unloading of materials. With durable steel and featuring rugged swivel casters, these steel dollies offer reliable performance, lasting durability, and can withstand various weight capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:39:43','2026-05-11 12:39:43'),(1036,'Plastic Convertible Dollies','plastic-convertible-dollies',1025,'Plastic Convertible Dollies are versatile material handling solutions. The convertible dollies can switch between a flat pan