cratch-free transportation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:50:36','2026-05-11 12:50:36'),(1057,'All Terrain Dollies','all-terrain-dollies',1025,'All-Terrain Dollies are rugged platforms with oversized wheels for transporting heavy loads in industrial settings. They feature a durable steel frame with adjustable plate barriers and mechanical or manual pulling straps. These all-terrain dollies are heavy-duty and versatile, making them ideal for warehouses, manufacturing plants, workshops, and construction sites.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:50:44','2026-05-11 12:50:44'),(1058,'Aluminum Open Deck Dollies','aluminum-open-deck-dollies',1025,'Aluminum open deck dollies provide lightweight and robust material handling. With heavy-duty all-welded aluminum tubing and four casters, these aluminum dollies are ideal for various industrial applications. The open deck design allows for effortless loading and unloading. Select models have ergonomic handles to reduce operator fatigue. Dimensions vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:50:51','2026-05-11 12:50:51'),(1059,'Hardwood Open Deck Dollies with Rubber Padded Deck Ends','hardwood-open-deck-dollies-with-rubber-padded-deck-ends',1025,'Hardwood Open Deck Dollies with Rubber Padded Deck Ends provide reliable and secure transportation for heavy loads. The hardwood build ensures durability and strength, while the rubber-padded deck ends offer load stability, grip and abrasion resistance. These hardwood dollies have four swivel casters for ergonomic mobility and transport control.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:50:56','2026-05-11 12:50:56'),(1060,'Steel Adjustable Open Deck Dollies','steel-adjustable-open-deck-dollies',1025,'Steel Adjustable Open Deck Dollies have expandable bases to allow equipment of different sizes and capacities to be used with the mobile base. With a welded steel build and swivel casters, these adjustable dollies ensure durability and easy maneuverability in commercial settings. Some models have braking casters for temporary, stationary load storage. Weight capacities and sizes vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:51:01','2026-05-11 12:51:01'),(1061,'Metal Detectable FDA Buna-N Rubber Rolls, Strips & Sheets','metal-detectable-fda-buna-n-rubber-rolls-strips-sheets-1',1054,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:51:06','2026-05-11 12:51:06'),(1062,'Ultra Strength Neoprene Rubber','ultra-strength-neoprene-rubber-2',1054,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:51:31','2026-05-11 12:51:31'),(1063,'High Strength Multipurpose Neoprene Rubber Sheets and Strips','high-strength-multipurpose-neoprene-rubber-sheets-and-strips-2',1054,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:52:22','2026-05-11 12:52:22'),(1064,'High Temperature Silicone Rubber Sheets and Strips','high-temperature-silicone-rubber-sheets-and-strips-1',1054,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:53:41','2026-05-11 12:53:41'),(1065,'High Temperature FDA Silicone Rubber','high-temperature-fda-silicone-rubber-2',1054,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:54:11','2026-05-11 12:54:11'),(1066,'Multipurpose Neoprene Rubber','multipurpose-neoprene-rubber-2',1054,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:54:45','2026-05-11 12:54:45'),(1067,'Pallet Dollies','pallet-dollies',820,'Pallet dollies are low-profile, wheeled platforms that move palletized goods quickly and safely without relying on forklifts. Available in different deck styles and caster configurations, they navigate tight, high-traffic areas to reduce congestion and physical strain for operators. They’re widely used in warehouses, distribution centers, food service operations, and retail environments that manage frequent restocking or bulk shipments. Pallet dollies complement or replace traditional pallet jacks when agility and space efficiency are priorities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 12:59:14','2026-05-11 12:59:14'),(1068,'Wheel Dollies','wheel-dollies',820,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:00:43','2026-05-11 13:00:43'),(1069,'Vehicle Dollies','vehicle-dollies',820,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:00:47','2026-05-11 13:00:47'),(1070,'Solid Deck Dollies','solid-deck-dollies',820,'Solid deck dollies streamline transporting heavy or bulky items, allowing efficient movement across flat surfaces. The dollies are equipped with swivel casters for easy maneuverability, providing flexibility in navigating tight spaces and ensuring smooth transportation. The solid deck dollies are ideal for various spaces, including warehouse operations, retail environments, and manufacturing facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:00:51','2026-05-11 13:00:51'),(1071,'Open Deck Fixed Height Pallet & Container Transporters','open-deck-fixed-height-pallet-container-transporters',1067,'Open Deck Fixed Height Pallet & Container Transporters are reliable tools for transporting pallets and containers in warehouse settings. They feature a fixed-height platform with a raised deck to lessen bending and back strain, making them well-suited for material handling operations. The open-deck design provides simplicity and stability for warehouse staff and logistics professionals',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:04:50','2026-05-11 13:04:50'),(1072,'Solid Deck Caster Style Pallet Dollies','solid-deck-caster-style-pallet-dollies',1067,'Solid Deck Caster Style Pallet Dollies offer a stable platform for transporting palletized loads with a sturdy deck for increased strength and durability. These solid-deck pallet dollies feature caster wheels that provide smooth mobility, enabling efficient transportation of goods in warehouse and industrial settings while maintaining stability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:04:54','2026-05-11 13:04:54'),(1073,'Open Deck Caster Style Pallet Dollies','open-deck-caster-style-pallet-dollies',1067,'Open Deck Caster Style Pallet Dollies offer an open-deck design with caster wheels, facilitating palletized goods’ smooth and maneuverable transportation. These open-deck dollies are designed for easy use in warehouses and storage. They streamline material handling for staff and logistics professionals, improving work efficiency.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:04:57','2026-05-11 13:04:57'),(1074,'Open Deck Adjustable Height Pallet & Container Transporters','open-deck-adjustable-height-pallet-container-transporters',1067,'Open Deck Adjustable Height Pallet & Container Transporters provide greater mobility for pallets and crates, reducing the need for forklift trucks. The adjustable-height feature accommodates different load sizes, making these open-deck models ideal for material handling in the warehouse and manufacturing industry. These transporters are flexible and cater to logistics and production needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:05:00','2026-05-11 13:05:00'),(1075,'Solid Deck Fixed Height Pallet & Container Transporters','solid-deck-fixed-height-pallet-container-transporters',1067,'Solid Deck Fixed Height Pallet & Container Transporters offer a stable and fixed-height platform for efficiently moving pallets and containers. Built with a solid-deck construction, they ensure durability and reliability for material handling tasks. Ideal for industrial settings, warehouse use, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:05:03','2026-05-11 13:05:03'),(1076,'Roller Style Aluminum Pallet Dollies','roller-style-aluminum-pallet-dollies',1067,'Designed for heavy and bulky loads, these Roller Style Aluminum Pallet Dollies feature durable, lightweight construction with high-capacity steel rollers for smooth maneuverability. Each roller-style model includes non-marring plate caster wheels, ensuring steady support without floor scratches. Ideal for warehouses, factories, and retail spaces, they are also easy to store when not in use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:05:06','2026-05-11 13:05:06'),(1077,'Solid Deck Adjustable Height Pallet & Container Transporters','solid-deck-adjustable-height-pallet-container-transporters',1067,'Solid Deck Adjustable Height Pallet & Container Transporters reduce forklift truck reliance by offering mobility for pallets and crates. They efficiently handle various loads, making them suitable for warehouse and industrial environments. Ideal for logistics professionals and manufacturing personnel, these adjustable-height models provide a dependable solution for versatile material transport.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:05:09','2026-05-11 13:05:09'),(1078,'Pallet Dollies with Double End Racks','pallet-dollies-with-double-end-racks',1067,'Pallet Dollies with Double End Racks are ideal for transporting and moving heavy pallets. These dollies have rolling casters and double-end access racks and can support large-weight capacities. They can easily maneuver through narrow doorways and aisles and can be conveniently stored away when not in use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:07:42','2026-05-11 13:07:42'),(1079,'Pallet Rack Dolly','pallet-rack-dolly',1067,'Pallet Rack Dollies efficiently transport palletized goods in warehouses or storage facilities. With robust construction, they provide sturdy support for pallets, ensuring ease of maneuverability and streamlining material handling processes. Suitable for warehouse and logistics professionals, these specialty dollies are commonly used in storage and distribution centers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:07:45','2026-05-11 13:07:45'),(1080,'6-Wheel Wood Solid Deck Dolly','6-wheel-wood-solid-deck-dolly',1070,'Our six-wheel wood dollies are capable of moving heavy loads with ease in warehouses, workshops, and other industrial work settings. The solid wood deck of the dolly offers a sturdy and stable platform for secure item placement while the six wheels ensure smooth, efficient maneuverability. These six-wheel dollies come in various sizes to accommodate a range of bulky, oversized items.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:11:31','2026-05-11 13:11:31'),(1081,'Aluminum Solid Deck Dollies','aluminum-solid-deck-dollies',1070,'Aluminum solid deck dollies are lightweight solutions for transporting various items that don\'t sacrifice durability. These aluminum dollies are corrosion-resistant, offering long-lasting dependability in demanding environments. The solid-deck design provides a stable surface for secure item placement while sturdy wheels allow smooth movement. Various sizes and weight capacities are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:11:34','2026-05-11 13:11:34'),(1082,'Low Profile Steel Solid Deck Dolly','low-profile-steel-solid-deck-dolly',1070,'These steel low-profile dollies are designed to provide easy and efficient transportation while minimizing clearance height. Made with rugged steel for durability, these solid-deck dollies feature a low-profile design that allows for easy unloading and loading of heavy items, even in tight spaces or low-clearance areas. The solid steel deck offers a stable surface that keeps loads secure.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:11:36','2026-05-11 13:11:36'),(1083,'Rubber Padded Hardwood Solid Deck Dollies','rubber-padded-hardwood-solid-deck-dollies',1070,'Rubber-padded hardwood dollies offer a combination of durability and protection during transportation. These dollies have a solid hardwood deck that offers a sturdy base to securely hold items. The decks feature rubber padding that adds an extra layer of protective cushioning, and prevents slippage during transportation. Various sizes and weight capacities are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:11:39','2026-05-11 13:11:39'),(1084,'Steel Solid Deck Dollies','steel-solid-deck-dollies',1070,'These steel dollies provide a robust and durable solution for heavy-duty transportation needs in warehouses, workshops, and other industrial environments. Constructed with strong steel frames, these dollies offer exceptional strength and load-bearing capacity. They feature a solid deck design that provides security and keeps items secure during transport. Various sizes are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:11:42','2026-05-11 13:11:42'),(1085,'Hardwood Solid Deck Dollies','hardwood-solid-deck-dollies',1070,'Our hardwood dollies offer a reliable, sturdy solution for moving heavy loads. Made with smoothly finished, seasoned hardwood, these solid deck dollies ensure stability and prevent small items from falling through the surface. Hardwood dollies are available in various sizes and have a range of high weight capacities suitable for applications in workshops, warehouses, and other industrial spaces',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:11:45','2026-05-11 13:11:45'),(1086,'Stainless Steel Stacking Stool Dolly','stainless-steel-stacking-stool-dolly',1070,'These stainless steel dollies are designed specifically to move and store stacking stools and chairs. Stainless steel dollies are built to withstand heavy use and resist corrosion. They feature a spacious design that can accommodate multiple stacking stools or chairs, allowing for easy transportation and compact storage. Stacking chair dollies are ideal for schools, offices, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:13:30','2026-05-11 13:13:30'),(1087,'Carpeted Hardwood Solid Deck Dollies','carpeted-hardwood-solid-deck-dollies',1070,'Our carpeted hardwood dollies combine the durability of hardwood with the added benefit of carpet into one convenient transportation solution. Designed with a solid deck, these carpeted dollies provide a sturdy and reliable platform for transporting heavy loads. The carpet offers cushioning and protection to prevent scratches or damage during transportation. Size and weight capacity vary by model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:13:33','2026-05-11 13:13:33'),(1088,'Plastic Interlocking Solid Deck Dollies','plastic-interlocking-solid-deck-dollies',1070,'Plastic interlocking dollies offer a versatile and convenient solution for transporting lighter loads in offices, schools, stores, and similar environments. These plastic dollies feature an interlocking design for easy connection and secure stacking. The solid deck surface provides a lightweight yet durable platform to keep items stable and secure during transportation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:13:36','2026-05-11 13:13:36'),(1089,'Lifting Wheel Dollies','lifting-wheel-dollies',1069,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:14:08','2026-05-11 13:14:08'),(1090,'Soft Temperature Silicone Rubber Sheets and Strips','soft-temperature-silicone-rubber-sheets-and-strips-1',1054,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:16:08','2026-05-11 13:16:08'),(1091,'Drum Lifters & Dumpers','drum-lifters-dumpers',1,'Drum lifters and dumpers make it easier to lift, transport, place, and dump heavy, industrial drums. Constructed of high-quality steel for long-lasting durability, drum lifters and dumpers can lift a wide range of weight capacities. Its ergonomic handles and durable rolling wheels allow for easy handling and mobility. They are ideal for use in warehouses, stock rooms, manufacturing production floors, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:16:22','2026-05-11 13:16:22'),(1092,'Ultra Strength Oil Resistant Buna-N Rubber','ultra-strength-oil-resistant-buna-n-rubber-2',1054,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:19:15','2026-05-11 13:19:15'),(1093,'Oil Resistant Buna-N Rubber Sheets and Strips','oil-resistant-buna-n-rubber-sheets-and-strips-2',1054,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:19:41','2026-05-11 13:19:41'),(1094,'Chemical Resistant Viton Rubber','chemical-resistant-viton-rubber-2',1054,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:19:58','2026-05-11 13:19:58'),(1095,'EPDM Rubber','epdm-rubber-1',1054,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:20:19','2026-05-11 13:20:19'),(1096,'Weather Resistant EPDM Rubber','weather-resistant-epdm-rubber-2',1054,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:20:52','2026-05-11 13:20:52'),(1097,'FDA Multipurpose Neoprene Rubber Sheets and Strips','fda-multipurpose-neoprene-rubber-sheets-and-strips-2',1054,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:21:14','2026-05-11 13:21:14'),(1098,'Oil Resistant Buna-N Rubber','oil-resistant-buna-n-rubber-2',1054,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:21:34','2026-05-11 13:21:34'),(1099,'Oil Resistant Buna-N Rubber','oil-resistant-buna-n-rubber-3',1054,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:22:45','2026-05-11 13:22:45'),(1100,'Metal Detectable FDA Silicone Rubber Rolls, Strips & Sheets','metal-detectable-fda-silicone-rubber-rolls-strips-sheets-1',1054,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:23:11','2026-05-11 13:23:11'),(1101,'High Strength Oil Resistant Buna-N Rubber','high-strength-oil-resistant-buna-n-rubber-1',1054,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:29:30','2026-05-11 13:29:30'),(1102,'FDA Oil Resistant Buna-N Rubber','fda-oil-resistant-buna-n-rubber-1',1054,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:29:53','2026-05-11 13:29:53'),(1103,'Collet Chucks','collet-chucks',426,'Collet chucks are specialized holding devices used in machining to secure and accurately position workpieces. They provide superior grip and runout accuracy for routers, mills, and lathes. They allow for quick and efficient tool changes and the tapered inner surface allows for a secure and concentric grip. Collet chucks are commonly used in CNC machining, metalworking, woodworking, and electronics manufacturing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:30:23','2026-05-11 13:30:23'),(1104,'Abrasion Resistant Polyurethane','abrasion-resistant-polyurethane-2',1054,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 13:30:27','2026-05-11 13:30:27'),(1105,'Arbor & Ring Shims','arbor-ring-shims',485,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 14:03:37','2026-05-11 14:03:37'),(1106,'Shim/Support Rings','shimsupport-rings',1105,'Shim and Support Rings ensure reliable support and alignment in industrial applications. They provide stability and resist deformation under heavy loads. With precise dimensions and smooth surfaces, they enable proper alignment, reduce friction, and enhance efficiency. Available in various styles and sizes, these rings have standard diameters for precise spacing of bearing races, shafts, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 14:04:50','2026-05-11 14:04:50'),(1107,'Stainless Steel Abor Shims','stainless-steel-abor-shims',1105,'Stainless Steel Arbor Shims create precise fits and close tolerances between surfaces in various applications. With precise thickness and continuous fit, they provide centrifugal force and resist corrosion. Arbor shims ensure proper alignment of bearings and shafts, making them ideal for diverse environments. Durable, easy to install, and flexible for an exact fit in any application.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 14:06:19','2026-05-11 14:06:19'),(1108,'Laminated Stainless Steel Arbor Shim','laminated-stainless-steel-arbor-shim',1105,'Laminated Stainless Steel Arbor Shims deliver exceptional strength and corrosion resistance. With precise thicknesses and excellent tolerance levels, they provide accurate alignment and optimal performance. Available in various sizes and shapes, these rust-resistant shims provides accuracy and longevity. Ideal for bearings and turbine seating in demanding industrial environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 14:07:21','2026-05-11 14:07:21'),(1109,'Plastic Color Coded Arbor Shim','plastic-color-coded-arbor-shim',1105,'Plastic Color Coded Arbor Shims offer a quick and easy way to identify bearing clearance. Each plastic arbor shim is color coded for thickness and size. Made of durable polypropylene, they provide a lightweight alternative to metal. Ideal for bearings, gears, and more. Uses include stabilizing parts, correcting alignment, and acting as spacers. Ideal for automotive, industrial, and machine shops.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 14:09:29','2026-05-11 14:09:29'),(1110,'Steel Arbor Spacer','steel-arbor-spacer',1105,'Steel Arbor Spacers are an essential, durable component for precise spacing and alignment in industrial applications. These steel spacers are made from steel to resist deformation for long-lasting performance. With precise dimensions and smooth surfaces, each steel spacer accurately positions components and reduces vibration.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 14:10:15','2026-05-11 14:10:15'),(1111,'Laminated Brass Arbor Shims','laminated-brass-arbor-shims',1105,'Laminated Brass Arbor Shims provide excellent stability and reliable performance. Engineered for demanding applications, they enhance strength, durability, and corrosion resistance. These shims offer precise thicknesses to effortlessly adjust and align components. Ideal for machine applications, they come in various diameters and thicknesses to secure bearings, gears, and other mechanical parts.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 14:10:50','2026-05-11 14:10:50'),(1112,'Drum Dumpers','drum-dumpers',1091,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 14:22:30','2026-05-11 14:22:30'),(1113,'Hydraulic Drum Lifting Jacks','hydraulic-drum-lifting-jacks',1091,'Portable hydraulic drum lifting jacks are high-performance pumps that can raise and lower heavy barrels with ease. The strong steel frame and fork provide lasting durability and drum support. Some models have a mechanism to place the drum where it\'s needed to eliminate strain and injuries from manually lifting. Weight capacity and size vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 14:22:32','2026-05-11 14:22:32'),(1114,'Powered Drum Lifting Trucks','powered-drum-lifting-trucks',1091,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 14:22:36','2026-05-11 14:22:36'),(1115,'Manual Drum Lift & Tilt Trucks','manual-drum-lift-tilt-trucks',1091,'Manually operated tilting drum lifters and transporters allow for even and efficient material handling. The units are made of a rigid steel construction that is designed to support heavy duty drums and barrels ensuring years of reliable service. Most models have curved arms that wrap around the drum and lock it into position. Drum lifters are available in various sizes and weight capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 14:22:39','2026-05-11 14:22:39'),(1116,'Drum Lifters & Transporters','drum-lifters-transporters',1091,'Drum lifters & transporters easily handle and move heavy-duty items. Most lifters have a positive clamping mechanism that grips the drum rim for secure material handling. Ergonomic handles & smooth rolling wheels allow precise steering and mobility. Steel body construction provides lasting durability. Drum handlers are available in a wide range of weight capacities. Other features vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 14:22:42','2026-05-11 14:22:42'),(1117,'Drum Lifter & Dumper Accessories','drum-lifter-dumper-accessories',1091,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 14:25:42','2026-05-11 14:25:42'),(1118,'Roll Lifters & Transporters','roll-lifters-transporters',1091,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 14:25:46','2026-05-11 14:25:46'),(1119,'DC & AC Powered Drum Lifting Trucks','dc-ac-powered-drum-lifting-trucks',1091,'DC & AC powered drum lifting trucks allow convenient drum transport for many applications. These drum lift trucks are constructed of steel for lasting durability and are easy to maneuver. Units reduce operator fatigue and can minimize the risk of injury. Available in various sizes and can support many size drums.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 14:25:49','2026-05-11 14:25:49'),(1120,'Multi-Purpose Tote Dumper Lift Trucks','multi-purpose-tote-dumper-lift-trucks',1091,'Multi-purpose tote dumper lift trucks collect, transport, and dump materials while saving time and reducing work-related injuries. These lift trucks allow one person to easily and safely empty large loads. Most models have a floor lock for stationary positioning. Other specifications and dimensions vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 14:25:51','2026-05-11 14:25:51'),(1121,'Pail Lifters & Transportaters','pail-lifters-transportaters',1091,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 14:25:54','2026-05-11 14:25:54'),(1122,'Air Powered Drum Lifting Trucks','air-powered-drum-lifting-trucks',1091,'Air-powered drum lifting trucks can tilt and drain drums with controlled pouring for efficient material handling. The strong steel construction allows for lasting durability and a high load capacity. Most drum lift trucks have a wheel base that provides optimum mobility around the work area. Other features vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 14:25:58','2026-05-11 14:25:58'),(1123,'Forklifts & Attachments','forklifts-attachments-1',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-11 16:05:31','2026-05-11 16:05:31'),(1124,'Battery Transporters','battery-transporters',1123,'Battery transporters enable a single person to load, move, and unload heavy forklift batteries into forklifts. Utilizing steel rollers, heavy-duty forklift battery transfer carts facilitate an easy and smooth transferring of a battery into the forklift. Designed to transport heavy batteries in industrial settings, forklift battery transfer platforms enhance operational safety and contribute to a more efficient material handling process.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:06:22','2026-05-12 10:06:22'),(1125,'Forklift Battery Transfer Cart','forklift-battery-transfer-cart',1124,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:07:12','2026-05-12 10:07:12'),(1126,'Forklift Battery Transfer Platform','forklift-battery-transfer-platform',1124,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:07:16','2026-05-12 10:07:16'),(1127,'Brooms & Scrapers','brooms-scrapers',1123,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:08:39','2026-05-12 10:08:39'),(1128,'Magnetic Bar Sweeper Broom Attachment','magnetic-bar-sweeper-broom-attachment',1127,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:10:12','2026-05-12 10:10:12'),(1129,'Forklift Truck Floor Scraper','forklift-truck-floor-scraper',1127,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:10:16','2026-05-12 10:10:16'),(1130,'Forklift Brooms & Sweepers','forklift-brooms-sweepers',1127,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:10:19','2026-05-12 10:10:19'),(1131,'Carpet Poles & Coil Rams','carpet-poles-coil-rams',1123,'Carpet poles and coil rams are forklift attachments that give the machines the ability to safely lift cylindrical loads such as carpet, steel coils, wire spools, and more. They are made of solid steel materials and can handle high-weight capacities with ease. Different lengths and diameters ensure the attachments can efficiently lift loads of all sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:12:37','2026-05-12 10:12:37'),(1132,'Forklift Coil Rams','forklift-coil-rams',1131,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:14:05','2026-05-12 10:14:05'),(1133,'Forklift Rug Rams Carpet Poles','forklift-rug-rams-carpet-poles',1131,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:14:11','2026-05-12 10:14:11'),(1134,'Cranes & Hooks','cranes-hooks',1123,'Forklift cranes and hooks are designed to safely lift and position heavy items. Built with longevity in mind, they feature durable construction and high weight capacities to lift even the heaviest loads with ease. Boom cranes and hooks are ideal for warehouse and manufacturing environments and can be easily mounted onto trucks or forklifts.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:15:04','2026-05-12 10:15:04'),(1135,'Lifting Beams & Hooks','lifting-beams-hooks',1134,'Lifting Beams and Hooks connect to the forks of forklifts, allowing for quick conversion into a heavy-duty lifting device. This enables the lifting, lowering, and moving of heavy objects in warehouses, construction sites, and factory environments. These forklift attachments utilize wing screws and a safety chain for simple, secure attachment to the forklift mast. Additionally, the all-welded steel construction with a durable powder-coat finish means these forklift beams and hooks are built to withstand the rigors of industrial use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:16:55','2026-05-12 10:16:55'),(1136,'Boom Cranes','boom-cranes',1134,'Boom Cranes are forklift attachments that quickly convert a forklift to a mobile crane in warehouses, construction sites, and other industrial settings. Utilizing a long, extendable arm known as a boom, these forklift cranes boast high-capacity load weights and extended reach for heavy-duty lifting and efficient movement of loads. The fork pockets slip over the forks of a counter-balanced lift truck for simple attachment, and a safety chain connects the boom to the truck mast for security & safety.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:16:59','2026-05-12 10:16:59'),(1137,'Non-Telescoping Forklift Boom Cranes','non-telescoping-forklift-boom-cranes',1136,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:20:46','2026-05-12 10:20:46'),(1138,'Powered Forklift Jib Boom Crane','powered-forklift-jib-boom-crane',1136,'Our powered forklift jib boom cranes combine the reach of a forklift boom with the precise lifting of a hoist. They can attach to forklifts for easy mobility and the boom can lift a range of weight capacities. These jib boom cranes are perfect for loading and unloading large items from trucks, warehouses, and storage areas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:20:49','2026-05-12 10:20:49'),(1139,'High Rise Forklift Jib Boom Cranes','high-rise-forklift-jib-boom-cranes',1136,'High rise forklift jib boom cranes are ideal for lifting and handling heavy materials. They provide a safe, adjustable, and secure way to work with a range of load capacities and are compatible with most forklifts. These high rise jib boom cranes offer a taller height for applications requiring additional reach. They are a great addition to any warehouse or industrial setting.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:20:53','2026-05-12 10:20:53'),(1140,'Shorty Forklift Jib Boom Cranes','shorty-forklift-jib-boom-cranes',1136,'Shorty forklift jib boom cranes are designed for lifting heavy items in tight, restricted spaces. These jib boom cranes have a range of capacities, and are compatible for mounting onto forklifts. They are made of a heavy duty welded steel that has a durable chip-resistant enamel finish.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:20:57','2026-05-12 10:20:57'),(1141,'Adjustable Pivoting Forklift Jib Boom Cranes','adjustable-pivoting-forklift-jib-boom-cranes',1136,'Adjustable pivoting forklift jib boom cranes are ideal for lifting heavy items in industrial spaces. They quickly and easily convert your forklift into a mobile pivoting boom lift. These jib boom cranes are capable of lifting a range of weight capacities, depending on the model, and can extend in numerous heights.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:21:02','2026-05-12 10:21:02'),(1142,'Telescoping Forklift Jib Boom Cranes','telescoping-forklift-jib-boom-cranes',1136,'Forklift telescoping jib boom cranes are the ideal solution for loading or moving heavy materials. These cranes are made from durable steel and are designed to easily attach to the forks of your lift truck. Our jib boom cranes feature an adjustable boom to reach varying heights, depending on the model, and a range of weight capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:21:06','2026-05-12 10:21:06'),(1143,'Hook Plates','hook-plates',1135,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:25:59','2026-05-12 10:25:59'),(1144,'Hook Attachments for Lift Trucks','hook-attachments-for-lift-trucks',1135,'Hook attachments for lift trucks are perfect for securely lifting and transporting heavy items. They feature a durable steel construction and some models also come equipped with a hand crank winch for added support. Our hook attachments are perfect for any warehouse, shop, or industrial environment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:26:01','2026-05-12 10:26:01'),(1145,'Forklift & Hoist LP Tank Lifter','forklift-hoist-lp-tank-lifter',1135,'Our LP tank lift is a great addition to any manufacturing and maintenance facility. The tank lifter is constructed of powder coated steel for supreme strength and durability throughout daily use. The lifter is easy to use by simply attaching to a lifting device using a centrally located chain/hook opening.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:26:05','2026-05-12 10:26:05'),(1146,'Forklift Lifting Beams','forklift-lifting-beams',1135,'Forklift lifting beams feature durable steel construction making them perfect for use in warehouses and industrial environments. These lifting beams are a vibrant yellow for high visibility, and can hold varying load capacities, depending on the model. They help reduce strain and make lifting and moving loads easier and safer.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:26:08','2026-05-12 10:26:08'),(1147,'Forklift & Hoist Bulk Bag Lifters','forklift-hoist-bulk-bag-lifters',1135,'Hoist and forklift bulk bag lifters make it easy to move and lift large bags in warehouses, industrial facilities, and construction sites. These durable forklift bulk bag lifters eliminate workplace hazards and injuries associated with packing and unpacking bulk bags. This Forklift or Hoist attachment reduces labor costs, injury related claims, and increases productivity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:26:12','2026-05-12 10:26:12'),(1148,'Swivel Hook Forklift Hook Attachments','swivel-hook-forklift-hook-attachments',1135,'Convert your forklift into a mobile crane in seconds with a swivel hook forklift attachment from Global Industrial. They are perfect for safely and securely lifting heavy loads and feature a 360-degree swivel rotation. With their all-welded steel construction, they are capable of lifting a range of capacities, depending on the model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:26:18','2026-05-12 10:26:18'),(1149,'Cylinder Racks','cylinder-racks',1123,'Cylinder Racks provide a safe and convenient solution for handling, storing, and transporting gas cylinders. Cylinder management is made more flexible with varying sizes and quantities available. Cylinder storage racks comply with safety regulations, ensuring upright storage of gas cylinders to minimize accidents and prevent damage. Cylinder Racks can significantly enhance safety and operational efficiency in gas cylinder handling, whether utilized in a warehouse, manufacturing facility, or forklift.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:28:02','2026-05-12 10:28:02'),(1150,'Gas Cylinder Racks','gas-cylinder-racks',1149,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:32:52','2026-05-12 10:32:52'),(1151,'Forkliftable Cylinder Pallet Stands','forkliftable-cylinder-pallet-stands',1149,'Forkliftable Cylinder Pallet Stands facilitate the transport of gas cylinders with a forklift or other industrial vehicle in warehouse environments. They have an end-loaded orientation to simplify loading and unloading on smaller truck beds, and they store multiple gas cylinders in the upright position to prevent them from falling over and damaging the sensitive cylinder valve.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:32:56','2026-05-12 10:32:56'),(1152,'Forkliftable Cylinder Caddies','forkliftable-cylinder-caddies',1149,'Forkliftable Cylinder Caddies allow forklift operators to securely transport gas cylinders using a forklift. Cylinders can be rolled onto the caddie at floor level to eliminate the need for lifting during loading and unloading, and the hinged retainer bars hold multiple gas cylinders in the upright position to prevent them from falling over and causing damage to the sensitive valve.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:33:00','2026-05-12 10:33:00'),(1153,'Dumpers','dumpers',1123,'Dumpers are designed to enhance the efficiency of forklift operations, making waste disposal and material transfer a breeze. They are ideal for industries that require consistent material handling and disposal, such as manufacturing, construction, and waste management. Dumpers help save time and reduce work-related injuries caused by lifting and dumping heavy waste containers. The adjustable attachment design of the dumpers provides compatibility with various forklift models and fork sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:43:10','2026-05-12 10:43:10'),(1154,'Forklift Mount Dumpster Mover','forklift-mount-dumpster-mover',1153,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:45:41','2026-05-12 10:45:41'),(1155,'Truck Powered Crate Turner & Dumper','truck-powered-crate-turner-dumper',1153,'Our Truck Powered Crate Turner & Dumper makes crate handling convenient, no matter the size or weight of your load. The turner is equipped with two easily accessible fork pockets and includes a smooth paint finish. Heavy duty steel construction and integrated safety measures make it reliable and safe to use. It is the ideal addition to any industrial material handling environment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:45:46','2026-05-12 10:45:46'),(1156,'Forklift Mount Trash Can Dumpers','forklift-mount-trash-can-dumpers',1153,'Forklift Mount Trash Can Dumpers are the ultimate solution for effortless garbage disposal. These dumpers allow you to lift and dispose of waste without leaving the comfort of your forklift seat. They are designed to eliminate the need for complicated moving parts, help save time, and maximize safety. Say goodbye to the challenges of manual lifting with our Forklift Mount Trash Can Dumpers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:45:52','2026-05-12 10:45:52'),(1157,'Forklift Mount Tilting Drum Dumpers','forklift-mount-tilting-drum-dumpers',1153,'Forklift Mount Tilting Drum Dumpers make handling drums and barrels safe and convenient. These dumpers are designed to provide a reliable grip for efficiently lifting and tilting drums, making them suitable for a wide range of steel drum lifting applications. They allow you to control the pouring process and can carry various drum weight capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:45:56','2026-05-12 10:45:56'),(1158,'Forklift Accessories','forklift-accessories-1',1123,'Forklift attachments are each designed to handle specific tasks and improve forklift functionality. They include fork extensions, hoppers, loaders, cranes, hooks, clamps, dumpers, brooms, and more. Accessories enhance the usability of forklifts and range from safety lights and mirrors to tool holders and carts, all of which are built to withstand the rigorous demands of industrial use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 10:46:57','2026-05-12 10:46:57'),(1159,'Forklift Platforms & Personnel Lifts','forklift-platforms-personnel-lifts',1123,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:08:40','2026-05-12 11:08:40'),(1160,'Forklift Loading Platforms','forklift-loading-platforms',1159,'Forklift Loading Platforms feature pockets that slide over forklift forks and are held firmly in place with a safety chain, helping warehouse workers load and unload cargo using a forklift when no dock bay is available. A built-in ramp facilitates the loading of equipment, and it locks vertically to contain items during lifting and lowering.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:11:25','2026-05-12 11:11:25'),(1161,'Forklift Personnel Baskets','forklift-personnel-baskets',1159,'Made from durable steel for strength and painted in high-visibility safety yellow, Forklift Personnel Baskets are attachments designed to allow warehouse employees to be lifted to reach overhead areas. The access door opens inward to stay out of the way of passing pedestrians and has a spring-loaded self-closure to keep occupants safe & secure.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:11:28','2026-05-12 11:11:28'),(1162,'Forklift Maintenance Platforms','forklift-maintenance-platforms',1159,'Designed to fit a range of fork openings and offered in various load capacity options to support multiple personnel, tools, and other equipment, Forklift Maintenance Platforms are attachments that allow maintenance workers and employees to safely reach overhead areas. The foldable design of the platform provides space-saving storage between uses.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:11:32','2026-05-12 11:11:32'),(1163,'Forklifts','forklifts',1123,'Forklifts are designed to lift and transport palletized cargo around any facility, factory, or commercial building. Commercial forklifts are built for heavy duty lifting and precise maneuverability of heavy loads. With various front load capacities and raising heights, forklift machines are ideal for any commercial and industrial application.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:12:34','2026-05-12 11:12:34'),(1164,'Electric Forklifts','electric-forklifts',1163,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:13:14','2026-05-12 11:13:14'),(1165,'Forks & Extensions','forks-extensions',1123,'Forklift fork extensions are designed to improve load stability and provide extra support for lifting large objects. Forklift extensions are installed onto existing forks to increase forklift capacity to accommodate oversize loads. Fork extensions are available in a variety of sizes and materials for a range of applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:14:16','2026-05-12 11:14:16'),(1166,'Weighing Forks With Printers','weighing-forks-with-printers',1165,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:17:29','2026-05-12 11:17:29'),(1167,'Weighing Forks','weighing-forks',1165,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:17:32','2026-05-12 11:17:32'),(1168,'Fork Protectors','fork-protectors',1165,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:17:36','2026-05-12 11:17:36'),(1169,'Fork Extension Storage Racks','fork-extension-storage-racks',1165,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:17:45','2026-05-12 11:17:45'),(1170,'Forklift Replacement Forks','forklift-replacement-forks',1165,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:17:48','2026-05-12 11:17:48'),(1171,'Forklift Fork Accessories','forklift-fork-accessories',1165,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:17:50','2026-05-12 11:17:50'),(1172,'Forklift Fork Extensions','forklift-fork-extensions',1165,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:17:54','2026-05-12 11:17:54'),(1173,'Pallet Pullers','pallet-pullers',1123,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:19:12','2026-05-12 11:19:12'),(1174,'Vestil Pallet Pullers','vestil-pallet-pullers',1173,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:20:11','2026-05-12 11:20:11'),(1175,'Global Industrial™ Double Scissor Pallet, Skid & Crate Puller','global-industrial-double-scissor-pallet-skid-crate-puller',1173,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:20:15','2026-05-12 11:20:15'),(1176,'Self Dumping Hoppers & Loaders','self-dumping-hoppers-loaders-1',1123,'Self Dumping Hoppers & Loaders are a great way to move large, heavy items or bulk material from one place to another in construction or material handling settings. They are made of highly durable materials that can be easily cleaned and maintained for long lasting dependability. Industrial hoppers and loaders conveniently attach to forklifts for ease of use, or come equipped with casters for effortless maneuverability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:22:06','2026-05-12 11:22:06'),(1177,'Self Dumping Hoppers','self-dumping-hoppers',1176,'Self-dumping hoppers are essential for waste disposal, scrap collection, and bulk material transport in warehouses, construction sites, and manufacturing facilities. Designed for use with forklifts, these hoppers allow for safe, controlled dumping with minimal effort, improving workplace efficiency and safety. Features durable steel construction and automatic release mechanisms for easy operation. Whether managing industrial waste or transporting heavy materials, self-dumping hoppers provide a reliable, time-saving solution for material handling needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:23:08','2026-05-12 11:23:08'),(1178,'Hydraulic Powered Steel Self-Dumping Hoppers','hydraulic-powered-steel-self-dumping-hoppers',1177,'These hydraulic self dumping hoppers are made of heavy gauge steel to provide long lasting durability. The operator has complete control during the whole dumping and retracting process, so they never have to leave the cab. The capacities of our heavy duty self dumping hoppers range from 2000 to 6000 lbs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:30:41','2026-05-12 11:30:41'),(1179,'Steel Low-Profile Self-Dumping Forklift Hoppers','steel-low-profile-self-dumping-forklift-hoppers',1177,'The low-profile design on our self dumping steel forklift hoppers allows for easy forklift operator access. They are made with a reinforced steel base and welds which provide strength and dependability. Capacities range from 2000 to 6000 lbs depending on the model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:30:45','2026-05-12 11:30:45'),(1180,'Stainless Steel Self-Dumping Forklift Hoppers','stainless-steel-self-dumping-forklift-hoppers',1177,'Stainless-Steel Self-Dumping Forklift Hoppers are made of stainless steel for strength and easy maintenance in factories and warehouses, and continuous welding helps keep loose materials contained during transport. When attached to a forklift and loaded, these balanced, self-dumping hoppers roll forward and completely dump bulk goods before automatically returning to the upright, locked position.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:30:49','2026-05-12 11:30:49'),(1181,'Plastic Self-Dumping Forklift Hoppers','plastic-self-dumping-forklift-hoppers',1177,'Self dumping plastic forklift hoppers are made of polyethylene for long lasting durability. They are easily cleaned with high-pressure water or steam, and are resistant to rust, dents, and corrosion. Our plastic forklift hoppers can tilt 40° below horizontal in order to dump its\' entire contents. Capacities range from 750 to 1500 lbs depending on the model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:30:53','2026-05-12 11:30:53'),(1182,'Steel Self-Dumping Forklift Hoppers with Bump Release','steel-self-dumping-forklift-hoppers-with-bump-release',1177,'Bump release hoppers are forklift compatible for easy mobility. Our self-dumping hoppers are innovative and automatically dump on contact with the roll-off container. The bump release hoppers are made of steel providing long lasting durability. Capacities range from 2000 to 7000 lbs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:30:57','2026-05-12 11:30:57'),(1183,'Steel Self-Dumping Forklift Hoppers','steel-self-dumping-forklift-hoppers',1177,'Steel Self-Dumping Forklift Hoppers are made of heavy-gauge steel for strength & easy maintenance, with continuous welding to keep loose dry or liquid materials contained during transport. When attached to a forklift and loaded, these balanced, self-dumping hoppers roll forward, dump bulk goods, and reset automatically. Available in a variety of load & volume capacities, and colors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:31:03','2026-05-12 11:31:03'),(1184,'Self Dumping Hoppers Accessories','self-dumping-hoppers-accessories',1177,'Self-Dumping Hoppers Accessories add functionality and longevity to self-dumping forklift hoppers. Hinged lids help keep materials contained in the forklift hopper and are easy to open when it’s time to add to the load, while replacement hardware and bases extend the life of the equipment. Crane lifting lugs and pallet truck lifting legs can be installed on the hopper to increase mobility options.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:38:47','2026-05-12 11:38:47'),(1185,'Open Sided Self-Dumping Hoppers','open-sided-self-dumping-hoppers',1177,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:38:52','2026-05-12 11:38:52'),(1186,'Hooded Self-Dumping Hoppers','hooded-self-dumping-hoppers',1177,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:38:56','2026-05-12 11:38:56'),(1187,'Front Dump Self-Dumping Hoppers','front-dump-self-dumping-hoppers',1177,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:39:00','2026-05-12 11:39:00'),(1188,'Dust Collection Self-Dumping Hoppers','dust-collection-self-dumping-hoppers',1177,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:39:04','2026-05-12 11:39:04'),(1189,'Steel Self-Dumping Hoppers with Drop-Down Ramp','steel-self-dumping-hoppers-with-drop-down-ramp',1177,'Self-dumping steel hoppers with a drop-down ramp are designed to streamline the process of transporting bulk materials, scrap, and waste within a facility. The steel hoppers are tailored for use with forklifts, allowing for easy lifting and dumping of materials. They serve a wide range of applications, from manufacturing and construction sites to warehouses.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:39:08','2026-05-12 11:39:08'),(1190,'Loaders & Dumpers','loaders-dumpers',1176,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:39:54','2026-05-12 11:39:54'),(1191,'Portable Hoppers','portable-hoppers',1190,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:42:28','2026-05-12 11:42:28'),(1192,'Open Sided Hoppers','open-sided-hoppers',1190,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:42:30','2026-05-12 11:42:30'),(1193,'Chip & Waste Trucks','chip-waste-trucks',1190,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:42:34','2026-05-12 11:42:34'),(1194,'Triple-Bin Recycling Hoppers','triple-bin-recycling-hoppers',1190,'Our recycling hoppers have a unique 3 bin design making it easy to separate recyclable items in your commercial space. They feature a forkliftable base, making for easy item disposal once they\'re full. Each bin in our triple bin recycling hopper is a different color making it ideal for product identification.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:42:37','2026-05-12 11:42:37'),(1195,'EZ Dump Auto-Lock Mobile Hoppers','ez-dump-auto-lock-mobile-hoppers',1190,'EZ Dump Auto-Lock Mobile Hoppers are heavy-duty dump hoppers made of solid 14-gauge steel for long lasting durability and dependability. These mobile hoppers are watertight, and can hold 2000 lbs making them ideal on any industrial site. They come equipped with 4 casters, 2 fixed and 2 swivel, and have a tapered front to help initiate dumping.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:42:41','2026-05-12 11:42:41'),(1196,'Forklift Front End Loaders & Dumpers','forklift-front-end-loaders-dumpers',1190,'Our forklift front end loader & dumper is made with strong 3/16\" thick steel ideal for moving heavy debris. They are reinforced with leak-proof welds making them suitable for snow, salt, dirt, and more. Weight capacity for our forklift dumpers and loaders is 4000 lbs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:42:45','2026-05-12 11:42:45'),(1197,'Tow Equipment','tow-equipment',1123,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:43:57','2026-05-12 11:43:57'),(1198,'Forklift Hitch Attachments','forklift-hitch-attachments',1197,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:54:56','2026-05-12 11:54:56'),(1199,'Forklift Tow Balls','forklift-tow-balls',1197,'With multiple ball diameter options to accommodate a range of hitch sizes, Forklift Tow Balls are designed to temporarily convert a forklift into a tow truck for moving trailers and other portable equipment. Available in a variety of weight capacities, tow balls are made from welded steel for strength and to support heavy-duty loads with a corrosion-resistant powder coat finish.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:54:59','2026-05-12 11:54:59'),(1200,'Trailer Spotters','trailer-spotters',1197,'Built to exceed ASME B30.20 and OSHA regulations in various load capacities, Trailer Spotters are forklift accessories that securely connect to a trailer, enabling the transport of heavy-duty loads that forklifts aren’t typically designed for. They are made of steel for strength & durability with a bright yellow powder coat finish that helps ensure trailer spotters remain clearly visible.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:55:03','2026-05-12 11:55:03'),(1201,'Forklift Tow Bases','forklift-tow-bases',1197,'Designed to attach to forklift forks, Forklift Tow Bases convert the forklift into a tow truck to facilitate the movement of trailers and other mobile industrial equipment. The openings easily slip over forks, and integrated safety pins to secure the base firmly in place. Durable, all-welded steel construction features a powder-coat finish for protection against rust & corrosion.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:55:08','2026-05-12 11:55:08'),(1202,'Hand Trucks','hand-trucks-1',1,'Global Industrial offers a range of hand trucks with various weight capacities, handle styles, wheel types, and materials. Browse through different categories of hand trucks such as convertible hand trucks, hand drum trucks that can transport barrel drums, cylinder hand trucks to transport liquid or gas cylinders, and more. We are a one-stop shop for commercial and industrial businesses looking for reliable and efficient specialty hand trucks to transport heavy loads.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 11:57:12','2026-05-12 11:57:12'),(1203,'Industrial Bicycles','industrial-bicycles',1,'Industrial bicycles and tricycles are a reliable and quick way to transport lightweight goods & materials as well as personnel around large warehouse operations, distribution centers, and manufacturing facilities. Equipped with durable wheel axles and bearings, industrial bikes minimize resistance and offers smooth rides. Durable frames, brakes, and bike handles offer stability, safety, and maneuverability to the rider. Industrial bicycles offer a low-cost and healthier option to motorized vehicles.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 12:39:39','2026-05-12 12:39:39'),(1204,'Crowd Control','crowd-control',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 12:43:27','2026-05-12 12:43:27'),(1205,'Eyewash Stations & Showers','eyewash-stations-showers',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 12:43:55','2026-05-12 12:43:55'),(1208,'Fall Protection','fall-protection-2',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 12:45:01','2026-05-12 12:45:01'),(1209,'Gloves & Sleeves','gloves-sleeves',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 12:45:23','2026-05-12 12:45:23'),(1210,'Gloves & Sleeves','gloves-sleeves-1',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 12:45:48','2026-05-12 12:45:48'),(1211,'Baskets And Boxes For Industrial Bicycles & Tricycles','baskets-and-boxes-for-industrial-bicycles-tricycles',1203,'Boxes and baskets for industrial bicycles/tricycles easily support and move heavy-duty cargo. Baskets are easy to hook on and most are made using chrome plated steel wire for lasting durability. Bicycle boxes provide a storage area to help keep items safe during transport. Specific features and dimensions of bicycle boxes and baskets vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 12:57:50','2026-05-12 12:57:50'),(1212,'Husky Bike Parts','husky-bike-parts',1203,'Keep your Husky bike in top shape with a wide selection of bike parts including rear axles, handlebar grips, bike tubes, and more. Coaster brakes and brake cables are also available and come complete with hardware. Specific dimensions and features vary per unit.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 12:57:54','2026-05-12 12:57:54'),(1213,'Front Loader Tricycles','front-loader-tricycles',1203,'Front loader tricycles are ideal for hauling heavy loads of materials, tools, and equipment. The 3-wheel design provides increased stability and many feature an adjustable cushioned seat. The size and weight capacity of the front platform may vary per model. Front-load tricycles are available in many colors and sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 12:57:57','2026-05-12 12:57:57'),(1214,'Industrial Bicycles','industrial-bicycles-1',1203,'Industrial bicycles are ideal for various work applications and are built for everyday use. Most models feature a durable welded steel frame, comfort grip handles, an adjustable seat, and coaster brakes. Baskets are also available separately to help transport items. Industrial bikes come in a variety of sizes and colors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 12:58:00','2026-05-12 12:58:00'),(1215,'Adaptable Tricycles','adaptable-tricycles',1203,'Adaptable tricycles are ideal for companies that require a quick response to changing conditions such as maintenance, repair, troubleshooting, and security. Most models feature dual coaster brakes and a durable welded steel frame. Other features include a cushioned seat, comfort handle grips, and front fenders. Speed capabilities and other specifications vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 12:58:03','2026-05-12 12:58:03'),(1216,'Industrial Tricycles','industrial-tricycles',1203,'Industrial tricycles are ideal for transporting materials across warehouses, factories, and other industrial spaces. The tricycles feature a heavy-duty steel frame with a corrosion-resistant finish. The 24\" pneumatic wheels ensure a smooth ride, while the ergonomic handlebar provides easy maneuverability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 12:58:06','2026-05-12 12:58:06'),(1217,'Pallet Jacks & Trucks','pallet-jacks-trucks',1,'Browse a wide selection of high-quality pallet trucks and jacks at Global Industrial to enhance your material handling efficiency. Our collection includes durable manual, electric, and heavy-duty pallet jacks designed to improve productivity in warehouses, factories, and retail environments. Whether you need a standard pallet truck or specialized options for lifting, moving, and positioning heavy loads, we have the right equipment to meet your needs. Shop now for top brands and competitive pricing on pallet trucks & jacks and enjoy fast shipping and exceptional customer service.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 15:24:40','2026-05-12 15:24:40'),(1218,'All Terrain Pallet Jack Trucks','all-terrain-pallet-jack-trucks',1217,'All Terrain Pallet Jack Trucks are designed to raise and lower loads for quick material handling operations on outdoor and indoor surfaces. The ergonomics handle operations have forward/reverse speeds, lift/lower controls, and emergency reverse-function. Dimensions and power types vary per model. Our versatile pallet trucks roll smoothly over uneven surfaces and can hold loads up to 4000 lbs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 15:25:48','2026-05-12 15:25:48'),(1219,'Gas Powered All Terrain Pallet Jack Trucks','gas-powered-all-terrain-pallet-jack-trucks',1218,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 15:27:03','2026-05-12 15:27:03'),(1220,'Electric Powered All Terrain Pallet Jack Trucks','electric-powered-all-terrain-pallet-jack-trucks',1218,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 15:27:03','2026-05-12 15:27:03'),(1221,'Manual All Terrain Pallet Jack Trucks','manual-all-terrain-pallet-jack-trucks',1218,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 15:27:08','2026-05-12 15:27:08'),(1222,'Guards, Protectors, & Railings','guards-protectors-railings',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 15:49:42','2026-05-12 15:49:42'),(1223,'Galvanized & Stainless Steel Pallet Jack Trucks','galvanized-stainless-steel-pallet-jack-trucks',1217,'The same great features of a standard pallet jacks, but made of stainless steel or galvanized steel. Clean environment pallet jacks are specifically designed for corrosive or extremely wet environments and ideal for use in the foodservice industry, laboratories, and clean rooms. Available in a range of weight capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 16:12:54','2026-05-12 16:12:54'),(1224,'Galvanized Pallet Jack Trucks','galvanized-pallet-jack-trucks',1223,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 16:13:43','2026-05-12 16:13:43'),(1225,'Stainless Steel Pallet Jack Trucks','stainless-steel-pallet-jack-trucks',1223,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 16:13:46','2026-05-12 16:13:46'),(1226,'High-Lift Pallet Jack Trucks','high-lift-pallet-jack-trucks',1217,'High-Lift Pallet Jack Trucks provide efficient and operator-safe material handling for commercial and industrial applications. With a wide service range, items both large and small can be loaded and unloaded at a height that best fits the user\'s preference. There are various power types available including electric high lift pallet jacks. Load capacities range from 1100-3300 lbs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-12 16:27:05','2026-05-12 16:27:05'),(1227,'Collets','collets',426,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:03:08','2026-05-13 10:03:08'),(1228,'Drill Arbors & Chucks','drill-arbors-chucks',426,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:05:52','2026-05-13 10:05:52'),(1229,'Lathe Tool Posts & Holders','lathe-tool-posts-holders',426,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:08:09','2026-05-13 10:08:09'),(1230,'Barricade & Flagging Tape','barricade-flagging-tape',1204,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:37:05','2026-05-13 10:44:04'),(1231,'Fire Protection','fire-protection',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:38:51','2026-05-13 10:38:51'),(1232,'Fire Protection','fire-protection-1',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:39:07','2026-05-13 10:39:07'),(1233,'Gloves & Sleeves','gloves-sleeves-2',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:39:34','2026-05-13 10:39:34'),(1234,'Guards, Protectors, & Railings','guards-protectors-railings-1',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:39:56','2026-05-13 10:39:56'),(1235,'Guards, Protectors, & Railings','guards-protectors-railings-2',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:40:18','2026-05-13 10:40:18'),(1236,'Protective Clothing & Workwear','protective-clothing-workwear',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:40:41','2026-05-13 10:40:41'),(1237,'Safety Cabinets','safety-cabinets',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:41:13','2026-05-13 10:41:13'),(1238,'Safety Cans','safety-cans',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:41:36','2026-05-13 10:41:36'),(1239,'Safety Signs & Tags','safety-signs-tags',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:41:59','2026-05-13 10:41:59'),(1240,'Machine Tool Arbors','machine-tool-arbors',NULL,NULL,'categories/hidajIK4zpDogqp57Rewr9OKDxYCh20YMhX7Hbzv.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:42:06','2026-05-13 14:22:28'),(1241,'Security','security',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:42:25','2026-05-13 10:42:25'),(1242,'Morse Taper Sleeves & Sockets','morse-taper-sleeves-sockets',NULL,NULL,'categories/hiGJtifcHQgDihstuw6MZKv7x12E8wzFkLP9yJjp.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:42:35','2026-05-13 14:21:18'),(1243,'Spill Control','spill-control',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:42:47','2026-05-13 10:42:47'),(1244,'Traffic & Parking Lot Safety','traffic-parking-lot-safety',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:43:11','2026-05-13 10:43:11'),(1245,'Rotary Tool Holders','rotary-tool-holders',NULL,NULL,'categories/tdL6Cq1KHJ7OlKJLz1J0L31QbjrZJlCkbpZfb1wR.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:43:55','2026-05-13 14:20:52'),(1246,'Tapping Heads & Holders','tapping-heads-holders',426,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:44:29','2026-05-13 10:45:02'),(1247,'Tool Holder Bushings','tool-holder-bushings',426,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:45:32','2026-05-13 10:45:32'),(1248,'Tool Bits','tool-bits',428,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:46:08','2026-05-13 10:46:08'),(1249,'Baskets & Organizers','baskets-organizers',449,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:46:54','2026-05-13 10:46:54'),(1250,'Manual Single Fork High-Lift Pallet Jack Trucks','manual-single-fork-high-lift-pallet-jack-trucks',1226,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:47:02','2026-05-13 10:47:02'),(1251,'Electric Powered High-Lift Stainless Steel Pallet Jack Trucks','electric-powered-high-lift-stainless-steel-pallet-jack-trucks',1226,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:47:04','2026-05-13 10:47:04'),(1252,'Manual High-Lift Stainless Steel Pallet Jack Trucks','manual-high-lift-stainless-steel-pallet-jack-trucks',1226,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:47:10','2026-05-13 10:47:10'),(1253,'Foot Operated High-Lift Pallet Jack Trucks','foot-operated-high-lift-pallet-jack-trucks',1226,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:47:10','2026-05-13 10:47:10'),(1254,'Manual High-Lift Pallet Jack Trucks','manual-high-lift-pallet-jack-trucks',1226,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:47:13','2026-05-13 10:47:13'),(1255,'Electric Powered High-Lift Pallet Jack Trucks','electric-powered-high-lift-pallet-jack-trucks',1226,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:47:16','2026-05-13 10:47:16'),(1256,'Bins','bins',449,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:47:23','2026-05-13 10:47:23'),(1257,'Bins, Totes, & Container Accessories','bins-totes-container-accessories',449,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:47:48','2026-05-13 10:47:48'),(1258,'Manual Pallet Jacks & Trucks','manual-pallet-jacks-trucks',1217,'Designed with high weight capacities to lift and move heavy loads in factories and warehouses, Manual Pallet Jacks and Trucks are most commonly equipped with two forks that stabilize pallets during transport. Manual pallet trucks feature hand-operated controls and a lever allowing palletized loads to be raised and lowered with ease, and smooth-rolling wheels on the base and forks promote simple maneuverability throughout a facility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:48:06','2026-05-13 10:48:38'),(1259,'Bulk Containers','bulk-containers',449,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:48:09','2026-05-13 10:48:09'),(1260,'Dividable Containers & Boxes','dividable-containers-boxes',449,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:48:34','2026-05-13 10:48:34'),(1261,'ESD Storage','esd-storage',449,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:48:55','2026-05-13 10:48:55'),(1262,'Liquid Storage Containers','liquid-storage-containers',449,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:49:16','2026-05-13 10:49:16'),(1263,'Outdoor Storage','outdoor-storage',449,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:49:40','2026-05-13 10:49:40'),(1264,'Protective Cases','protective-cases',449,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:50:02','2026-05-13 10:50:02'),(1265,'Small Parts Storage & Caddies','small-parts-storage-caddies',449,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:50:21','2026-05-13 10:50:21'),(1266,'Storage Totes','storage-totes',449,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:50:41','2026-05-13 10:50:41'),(1267,'Trays','trays',449,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:51:02','2026-05-13 10:51:02'),(1268,'Basket Trucks','basket-trucks-1',2,'Basket trucks are designed to transport large quantities in manufacturing, hospitality, and other commercial operations. Basket trucks are durable, and are constructed using various materials, including vinyl and canvas. Elevated bulk basket trucks assist in transporting bulk items efficiently with less strain on workers. Shipping hamper trucks include a lockable wooden lid. Heavy-duty casters allow for ease of movement.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 10:52:48','2026-05-13 10:52:48'),(1269,'Quick Lift Pallet Jack Trucks','quick-lift-pallet-jack-trucks',1258,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:07:11','2026-05-13 11:07:11'),(1270,'Adjustable Fork Width Pallet Jack Trucks','adjustable-fork-width-pallet-jack-trucks',1258,'Adjustable-width fork pallet jacks allow greater maneuverability by simply loosening and resetting the front and rear adjusting bolts. Ergonomic rubber coated handle improves grip and has a 3-position fingertip control (raise, lower, neutral). Jacks roll smoothly on polyurethane load and entry wheels for easy pallet entry and exit. Adjustable fork tie rods help keeps proper alignment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:07:11','2026-05-13 11:07:11'),(1271,'Low Profile Pallet Jack Trucks','low-profile-pallet-jack-trucks',1258,'Low profile pallet jack trucks, also known as Lowboy pallet jacks, are designed to slide easily into the fork pockets of pallets and skids that have low clearance openings. With lowered heights as low as 1-1/2” and wide range of weight capacities, low-profile pallet jacks move heavy loads with little ground clearance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:07:14','2026-05-13 11:07:14'),(1272,'Extra Long Forks Pallet Jack Trucks','extra-long-forks-pallet-jack-trucks',1258,'With fork lengths up to 98 inches, moving loads on extended length pallets has never been easier. Extra Long Fork Pallet Jack Trucks are designed specifically to reach under and support specialized, extended length pallets. These pallet jacks offer a 3-position fingertip control (raise, lower, neutral).',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:07:17','2026-05-13 11:07:17'),(1273,'High Capacity Pallet Jack Trucks','high-capacity-pallet-jack-trucks',1258,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:07:20','2026-05-13 11:07:20'),(1274,'Standard Duty Pallet Jack Trucks','standard-duty-pallet-jack-trucks',1258,'Standard Pallet Jack Trucks feature a reinforced steel frame to support heavy commercial inventory. With a 190° steering arc and a 5500 lb weight capacity, these pallet jacks offer smooth, safe material handling.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:07:23','2026-05-13 11:07:23'),(1275,'Printed Barricade Tapes','printed-barricade-tapes',1230,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:08:23','2026-05-13 11:08:23'),(1276,'Flagging Tape','flagging-tape',1230,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:08:48','2026-05-13 11:08:48'),(1277,'Webbed Barrier Tape','webbed-barrier-tape',1230,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:09:15','2026-05-13 11:09:15'),(1278,'Adjustable Fork Width Pallet Jack Trucks','adjustable-fork-width-pallet-jack-trucks-1',1258,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:10:11','2026-05-13 11:10:11'),(1279,'4 Way Entry Pallet Jack Trucks','4-way-entry-pallet-jack-trucks',1258,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:10:28','2026-05-13 11:10:28'),(1280,'Dual-Direction Pallet Jack Trucks','dual-direction-pallet-jack-trucks',1258,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:10:32','2026-05-13 11:10:32'),(1281,'Single Fork Lift Pallet Jack Trucks','single-fork-lift-pallet-jack-trucks',1258,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:10:33','2026-05-13 11:10:33'),(1282,'Barrier Ropes & Chains','barrier-ropes-chains',1204,'Barrier Ropes and Chains are used for crowd control in public spaces and events. They are commonly used in airports, theaters, and stadiums for visible and effective crowd management. The durable construction and easy setup of rope barriers make them necessary for professionals who need a reliable crowd control solution in high-traffic environments where safety and orderly flow are crucial.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:10:34','2026-05-13 12:38:10'),(1283,'Foldable Forks Pallet Jack Trucks','foldable-forks-pallet-jack-trucks',1258,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:10:39','2026-05-13 11:10:39'),(1284,'Roll Moving Pallet Jack Trucks','roll-moving-pallet-jack-trucks',1258,'Roll Moving Pallet Jack Trucks are designed to move rolls of steel, aluminum or paper and reels of wire. These industrial pallet jacks easily transport and elevate rolls of material. With a wide service range, reels can be rolled onto the forks for transport throughout the workplace. With 3-stage fingertip control, these industrial pallet jacks provide smooth handling for various roll sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:10:41','2026-05-13 11:10:41'),(1285,'Narrow Forks Pallet Jack Trucks','narrow-forks-pallet-jack-trucks',1258,'Narrow fork pallet jack trucks provide maneuverability and flexibility when moving loads in and out of narrow aisles with ease, safety. These pallet jacks have a shorter width across the forks than a standard pallet jack. Available in a variety of widths to fit smaller sized pallets in and out of tight spaces. Available in a range of weight capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:10:44','2026-05-13 11:10:44'),(1286,'Crowd Control Barricades','crowd-control-barricades',1204,'Crowd control barricades are a robust, sturdy solution for crowd and traffic management. The barriers ensure order at events, construction sites, and more. The barricades are easy to set up and store, allowing for use in any crowd management need. The barricades are portable, allowing for transporation and setup in any location. The crowd control barricades come in a variety of materials including metal, plastic, and galvanized steel.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:11:06','2026-05-13 12:41:42'),(1287,'Electronic Queuing Systems','electronic-queuing-systems',1204,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:11:33','2026-05-13 11:11:33'),(1288,'Pallet & Container Tilters','pallet-container-tilters',1217,'Pallet & Container Tilters with ergonomic access can move containers safely with one piece of equipment. Powered for efficient mobility, these container tilters operate from 0-90°angles for better access. These mobile pallet tilters are made with durable steel for long-lasting performance, and their compact design allows for easy storage. Weight capacities vary per model from 2,000-6,000 lbs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:11:58','2026-05-13 11:11:58'),(1289,'Manual Pallet & Container Tilters','manual-pallet-container-tilters',1288,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:13:02','2026-05-13 11:13:02'),(1290,'Electric Powered Pallet & Container Tilters','electric-powered-pallet-container-tilters',1288,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:13:11','2026-05-13 11:13:11'),(1291,'Pedestrian Safety Barrier Accessories','pedestrian-safety-barrier-accessories',1204,'Pedestrian Barrier Parts & Accessories are essential components that enhance the functionality of pedestrian barriers, creating effective crowd control solutions in various settings. The accessories can warn or inform pedestrians, or make existing barriers more structurally sound. Pedestrian Barrier Parts & Accessories are versatile and be used in construction sites, sporting events, retail spaces, and museums.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:14:43','2026-05-13 11:14:43'),(1292,'Retractable Belt Barriers','retractable-belt-barriers',1204,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:16:28','2026-05-13 11:16:28'),(1293,'Box Trucks','box-trucks-1',2,'Box trucks are specifically engineered to store and transport heavy, bulky items or materials in large quantities. With their sturdy four-wall construction and extra-deep containers, they have the capacity to accommodate substantial loads. Additionally, their durable swivel casters ensure smooth movement and mobility within the facility, enhancing efficiency.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:17:32','2026-05-13 11:17:32'),(1294,'Stanchion Carts','stanchion-carts',1204,'Stanchion carts are specialized carts designed to transport and store stanchions, posts, and related crowd control equipment efficiently. The carts are ideal for streamlining crowd management systems\' setup, teardown, and storage. Stanchion carts are equipped with wheels or casters, offering easy mobility and maneuverability. They are used in various settings, including stadiums, convention centers, theaters, and arenas, facilitating smooth crowd management during events.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:18:33','2026-05-13 13:25:20'),(1295,'Pallet Jack Scale Trucks','pallet-jack-scale-trucks',1217,'Pallet jack scale trucks combine the functionality of a pallet jack with the convenience of an integrated scale. Efficient and versatile, these material handling solutions provide accurate weight measurements while transporting loads. These pallet jack trucks are made with heavy-duty materials like steel and feature ergonomic handles for smooth maneuvering. Weight capacities vary by model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:23:21','2026-05-13 11:23:21'),(1296,'Manual Stainless Steel Pallet Jack Scale Trucks','manual-stainless-steel-pallet-jack-scale-trucks',1295,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:31:27','2026-05-13 11:31:27'),(1297,'Electric Powered Pallet Jack Scale Trucks','electric-powered-pallet-jack-scale-trucks',1295,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:31:30','2026-05-13 11:31:30'),(1298,'Manual Pallet Jack Scale Trucks','manual-pallet-jack-scale-trucks',1295,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:31:34','2026-05-13 11:31:34'),(1299,'Powered Pallet Jacks & Trucks','powered-pallet-jacks-trucks',1217,'Self-Propelled Electric Pallet Jack Trucks can move loads in seconds to increase productivity and worker safety. These electric powered pallet jacks are built with heavy duty steel for long lasting durability. Various types of automated pallet jacks are available so you can easily lift and lower loads with the push of a button. Various self-propelled pallet jack models available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:50:08','2026-05-13 11:50:08'),(1300,'Lead Acid Powered Single Fork Pallet Jack Trucks','lead-acid-powered-single-fork-pallet-jack-trucks',1299,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:52:01','2026-05-13 11:52:01'),(1301,'Ride-On Lithium Powered Pallet Jack Trucks','ride-on-lithium-powered-pallet-jack-trucks',1299,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:52:01','2026-05-13 11:52:01'),(1302,'Ride-On Lead Acid Powered Pallet Jack Trucks','ride-on-lead-acid-powered-pallet-jack-trucks',1299,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:52:05','2026-05-13 11:52:05'),(1303,'Lead Acid Powered Pallet Jack Trucks','lead-acid-powered-pallet-jack-trucks',1299,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:52:11','2026-05-13 11:52:11'),(1304,'Lithium Powered Pallet Jack Trucks','lithium-powered-pallet-jack-trucks',1299,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:52:13','2026-05-13 11:52:13'),(1305,'Panel Carts & Trucks','panel-carts-trucks',1,'Panel carts & trucks are designed to transport large panels and drywall sheets in commercial and industrial work sites, improving material handling operations. Panel trucks feature heavy duty construction, ensuring long lasting performance. The industrial casters move with ease to provide efficient maneuvering and material transport. The ergonomic handles and overall product design ensure user comfort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:54:32','2026-05-13 11:54:32'),(1306,'Cardboard Box Trucks with Adjustable Dividers','cardboard-box-trucks-with-adjustable-dividers',1305,'Transport empty cardboard boxes or any flat material with our Cardboard box trucks. These box trucks include adjustable dividers that make stacking and storing items efficient. Equipped with casters, these commercial grade trucks feature polyurethane wheels and steel construction. The webbed dividers are adjustable to fit a number of box sizes, allowing flexibility and making maneuvering easier.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:59:07','2026-05-13 11:59:07'),(1307,'A-Frame Sheet & Panel Trucks','a-frame-sheet-panel-trucks',1305,'A-Frame Panel Trucks make it easy to transport large, bulky items such as drywall, plywood, and other sheet materials. Constructed with heavy-duty steel frames and an A-frame design, these panel trucks can be loaded from both sides and still leave room between uprights to transport additional materials. Retaining lips on both sides of the base keep loads secure.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:59:10','2026-05-13 11:59:10'),(1308,'Panel Cart Dollies','panel-cart-dollies',1305,'Panel cart dollies are designed to easily transport and manueuvre large, flat material or sheets and panels. These durable, heavy-duty panel carts can be easily moved and transported, with features like rigid steel frames and polyurethane, foam filled, and rubber tires for smooth rolling.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:59:14','2026-05-13 11:59:14'),(1309,'Panel, Sheet and Lumber Trucks','panel-sheet-and-lumber-trucks',1305,'Panel, sheet, and lumber trucks make moving bulky materials such as plywood, sheet materials, lumber, and pipe easy and effortless. Features include heavy-duty steel frames, casters, and wheels constructed from polyurethane or rubber. These panel, sheet, and lumber trucks are ideal for construction, manufacturing and storage applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:59:17','2026-05-13 11:59:17'),(1310,'Drywall Trucks','drywall-trucks',1305,'Drywall Trucks feature adjustable center shelves designed to handle large drywall, paneling, sheet rock, plywood, and other bulky materials with ease. Each truck features 4-swivel polyurethane or rubber casters. Durable steel construction ensures long lasting use. Available in a range of weight capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:59:19','2026-05-13 11:59:19'),(1311,'Adjustable Panel & Sheet Mover Trucks','adjustable-panel-sheet-mover-trucks',1305,'Adjustable panel and sheet mover trucks provide moving solutions for large items like drywall, plywood, and cabinets. The adjustable panel lengths and heights accommodate items in different sizes. Rugged steel construction is built to last for long term use. The rubber, pneumatic, and polyurethane wheels offer smooth movement across multiple surfaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 11:59:23','2026-05-13 11:59:23'),(1312,'Mat Rack Trucks','mat-rack-trucks',1305,'Mat Rack Trucks are mobile carts designed to transport and store solid and perforated mats securely. They offer smooth mobility with swivel casters and are backed by a lifetime guarantee against rust and corrosion. These carts provide a reliable solution for organized mat transportation and storage in various settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:03:26','2026-05-13 12:03:26'),(1313,'Mattress Moving Truck','mattress-moving-truck',1305,'Mattress Moving Trucks are designed to conveniently move and transport heavy mattresses. These sturdy trucks help shift mattresses with ease, and feature four rubber wheels that offer superior maneuverability and control. Constructed of steel, each truck is guaranteed to last through heavy-duty use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:03:29','2026-05-13 12:03:29'),(1314,'Dumpster Dollies','dumpster-dollies',1305,'Dumpster dollies and carts are designed to be tough and dependable. Designed to fit universally on most city-issued or industrial bins, these dollies can hold various weight capacities and include casters for mobility. These dumpster carts make waste transport easier and more efficient.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:03:31','2026-05-13 12:03:31'),(1315,'Adjustable Sheet & Panel Trucks with Perforated Deck','adjustable-sheet-panel-trucks-with-perforated-deck',1305,'Adjustable sheet and panel trucks with perforated decks are ideal for transporting lightweight panels and sheet materials. The adjustable frame and perforated platform makes transporting items easy and safe. Made from durable and lightweight materials, these sheet and panel trucks are perfect for commercial and industrial applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:03:35','2026-05-13 12:03:35'),(1316,'Wallboard Lift Trucks','wallboard-lift-trucks',1305,'Wallboard lift trucks are specifically designed to move and lift wallboard, drywall and paneling. They feature all-steel construction and are adjustable, allowing them to be easily be transported to and from jobsites. These wallboard lift trucks are simple to maneuver and built for durability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:03:38','2026-05-13 12:03:38'),(1317,'Plate & Slab Cradle Dollies','plate-slab-cradle-dollies',1305,'These plate and slab cradle dollies are ideal solutions for transporting large plates, slabs, and other heavy items. Dollies have twin handle holes for easy carrying and offer place to hook a strap if required (strap not included). They are constructed from heavy gauge steel with varying load capacities for industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:03:42','2026-05-13 12:03:42'),(1318,'Stanchion Posts & Ground Poles','stanchion-posts-ground-poles',1204,'Stanchion posts and ground poles play a vital role in crowd control and traffic management to create an organized and secure space. Heavy duty ground poles and stanchion posts are designed to withstand demanding conditions. Their heavy-duty construction ensures longevity and stability, making them a valuable asset in establishing clear pathways and boundaries in various environments including warehouses, event spaces, and other large areas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:12:06','2026-05-13 12:12:06'),(1319,'Turnstiles','turnstiles',1204,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:12:41','2026-05-13 12:12:41'),(1320,'Vehicles & Tuggers','vehicles-tuggers',1,'Vehicles and Tuggers are designed to efficiently move heavy loads or personnel inside or outside commercial or industrial premises. Commercial Vehicles transport workers and equipment safely throughout multiple points in and around the building. Tuggers are designed to pull a variety of carts safely and efficiently as well as reduce worker stress or strain injuries associated with repetitive pushing and/or pulling.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:25:40','2026-05-13 12:25:40'),(1321,'Utility Carts','utility-carts',1,'Global Industrial offers a diverse selection of utility carts, including platform carts, service carts, stock carts, wire carts, and more. These carts are made from high-quality materials such as steel, aluminum, and plastic, ensuring durability and longevity in demanding work environments. Whether you need to simplify the transportation of inventory, stocking of merchandise, or picking of materials throughout your facility, Global Industrial\'s Utility Carts are versatile and adaptable to meet different needs in warehouses, healthcare facilities, schools, hospitality settings, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:25:42','2026-05-13 12:25:42'),(1322,'Stackers','stackers',1,'Stackers are essential tools for lifting, transporting, and stacking palletized loads easily and precisely. Essential for warehouse management, stackers are mobile with durable caster wheels and can maneuver loads into higher locations within a small area. Battery-powered stackers easily raise and lower loads while manual pallet stackers provide a cost-effective solution for smaller operations, offering manual hydraulic pump or winch-operated lifting mechanisms. Ideal for commercial or industrial use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:25:45','2026-05-13 12:25:45'),(1323,'Special Purpose Carts & Trucks','special-purpose-carts-trucks',1,'We are your top online retailer of special-purpose carts and trucks, offering a wide range of products designed to meet the needs of various industries and applications. Shop our wide selection of A/V carts, janitorial carts, mobile computer carts and workstations, bin carts, and more. It doesn\'t stop there; we also offer specialty carts for specific purposes, such as mail carts, foodservice carts, drywall carts, tool carts, and medical carts. All models are built to last, providing reliable performance and durability to get the job done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:25:49','2026-05-13 12:25:49'),(1324,'Shelf Trucks','shelf-trucks',1,'Global Industrial\'s shelf trucks offer a versatile solution for transporting, storing, and organizing materials in various environments, including warehouses, manufacturing facilities, and distribution centers. With a wide selection of sizes and configurations, these mobile shelving units and storage units are designed to accommodate a variety of storage needs. Each shelf truck is constructed with durable materials such as heavy-duty steel or aluminum, ensuring long-lasting use in demanding work environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:25:53','2026-05-13 12:25:53'),(1325,'Platform Trucks','platform-trucks',1,'Built for durability and efficiency, these platform trucks offer a sturdy platform bed, smooth maneuverability, and a maximum load capacity to move equipment, materials, or inventory. Experience effortless transportation of goods and increased productivity with our reliable platform trucks. Whether you\'re looking to streamline material handling in your warehouse, improve efficiency in your distribution center, or take the burden off workers by reducing the need to manually move heavy items, Global Industrial\'s platform trucks offer a practical and effective solution.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:25:57','2026-05-13 12:25:57'),(1326,'Platform Lift Trucks','platform-lift-trucks',1,'Platform lift trucks are designed to raise, move, and position heavy loads safely and efficiently. Available in both manual and battery-powered models, they improve ergonomics by reducing repetitive lifting and lowering injury risk. These trucks are ideal for tight or organized spaces—stockrooms, labs, warehouses, and office storage areas—where vertical movement and precise positioning matter. From compact folding units to high-capacity powered models, each style supports different workflows and surfaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:26:00','2026-05-13 12:26:00'),(1327,'Folding Battery Powered Lift Trucks','folding-battery-powered-lift-trucks',1326,'Folding battery powered lift trucks combine powered lifting with a compact frame that folds for easy storage and transport. They’re a convenient solution for maintenance teams, mobile technicians, and facilities where space is at a premium.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:29:18','2026-05-13 12:29:18'),(1328,'Hand Winch Lift Trucks','hand-winch-lift-trucks',1326,'Hand winch lift trucks use a manual crank for precise, fully mechanical height control. They’re dependable in areas without power access or where electrical equipment is restricted, providing steady lifting for mid-weight loads.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:29:20','2026-05-13 12:29:20'),(1329,'Battery Powered Lift Trucks','battery-powered-lift-trucks',1326,'Battery powered lift trucks handle high-volume lifting with minimal effort. Their electric lift system reduces fatigue, supports repetitive loading and unloading, and offers quiet, efficient operation in busy industrial or commercial environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:29:24','2026-05-13 12:29:24'),(1330,'Foot Pump Lift Trucks','foot-pump-lift-trucks',1326,'Foot pump lift trucks use a hydraulic foot pedal, so operators can keep both hands on the handle while raising loads. They’re well-suited for medium-duty industrial settings that require frequent lifting with smooth, controlled height adjustment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:29:28','2026-05-13 12:29:28'),(1331,'Office Lift Trucks','office-lift-trucks',1326,'Office & lab lift trucks are built for controlled environments where cleanliness and precision are critical. Slim profiles and non-marking wheels help protect sensitive flooring and equipment in labs, medical offices, and IT spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:29:35','2026-05-13 12:29:35'),(1332,'Flatbed Platform Trucks','flatbed-platform-trucks',1325,'Flatbed platform trucks efficiently move inventory and equipment within a facility, featuring a sturdy, flat platform designed for easy loading and transportation of bulky cargo. Enhanced with durable casters, these trucks ensure seamless maneuverability. Equipped with an ergonomic handle, operators can effortlessly push or pull them. Available in various decking materials such as heavy-duty steel for high-capacity loads, resilient plastic resistant to rust, dents, and scratches, and corrosion-resistant aluminum, offering a lightweight alternative.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:38:30','2026-05-13 12:39:05'),(1333,'Barrier Ropes','barrier-ropes',1282,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:38:51','2026-05-13 12:38:51'),(1334,'Plastic Stanchion Chains','plastic-stanchion-chains',1282,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:39:23','2026-05-13 12:39:23'),(1335,'Chain Carabiners & Connecting Links','chain-carabiners-connecting-links',1282,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:39:55','2026-05-13 12:39:55'),(1336,'Steel Flatbed Platform Trucks','steel-flatbed-platform-trucks',1332,'Steel deck platform trucks offer exceptional strength and durability for heavy-duty material handling. Built to support large loads, these trucks are ideal for industrial, warehouse, and manufacturing environments. The steel deck provides a solid, stable surface, resistant to wear and tear, while the rugged construction ensures long-lasting performance. Perfect for handling bulk materials, these trucks optimize efficiency in demanding settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:39:59','2026-05-13 12:39:59'),(1337,'Plastic Chain Kits','plastic-chain-kits',1282,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:40:23','2026-05-13 12:40:23'),(1338,'Plastic Chain Pails & Reels','plastic-chain-pails-reels',1282,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:40:50','2026-05-13 12:40:50'),(1339,'Metal Crowd Control Barriers','metal-crowd-control-barriers',1286,'Our metal crowd control barriers offer a robust, sturdy solution for crowd management. Made with heavy-duty metals like steel, these crowd control barriers are designed to control crowds and enhance safety at festivals, concerts, and similar settings with heavy congestion. Safety barriers feature heavy-duty feet for stability and an interlocking design for a more customizable security solution.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:43:04','2026-05-13 12:43:04'),(1340,'Extendable Mobile Barriers','extendable-mobile-barriers',1286,'Extendable Mobile Barriers assist in crowd control, temporary barricading, and restricted area management. These durable barries are extendable, allowing for flexible configuration, adapting to different spaces and requirements. The addition of reflective stripes enhances visibility, making it highly effective in low-light conditions or during nighttime operations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:44:11','2026-05-13 12:44:11'),(1341,'3 Sided Steel Deck Platform Truck','3-sided-steel-deck-platform-truck',1336,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:45:33','2026-05-13 12:45:33'),(1342,'Steel Deck Platform Trucks with Scales','steel-deck-platform-trucks-with-scales',1336,'Steel deck platform trucks with scales are versatile and efficient tools for transporting heavy loads while accurately measuring their weight. The trucks feature durable steel decks and sturdy construction for long-lasting use. The integrated scale system allows for precise weight readings, making them ideal for industries such as warehousing, manufacturing, and distribution.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:45:36','2026-05-13 12:45:36'),(1343,'Double Handle Steel Deck Platform Trucks','double-handle-steel-deck-platform-trucks',1336,'Our steel deck platform trucks are perfect for moving large loads around your industrial space. Weight capacity is a maximum of 3600 lbs. They feature dual handles making it easier for multiple people to move those heavy loads around. They come in various lengths ranging from 35\" to 75\".',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:45:39','2026-05-13 12:45:39'),(1344,'Steel Deck Platform Trucks with Ergonomic Handle','steel-deck-platform-trucks-with-ergonomic-handle',1336,'Our steel deck platform trucks are designed to make material handling tasks easier and more comfortable. With a weight capacity of up to 2400 lbs, these steel platform trucks can handle heavy loads with ease. The ergonomic handle reduces strain on the operator\'s hands and wrists, while the four swivel casters make it easy to maneuver the truck around tight spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:45:42','2026-05-13 12:45:42'),(1345,'Folding Steel Deck Platform Trucks','folding-steel-deck-platform-trucks',1336,'Ideal for occasional light- to medium-duty use, folding platform trucks can be stored more easily when collapsed than conventional platform trucks without sacrificing strength or stability. When not in use, the handle folds down and out of the way for storage and locks into position when needed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:45:48','2026-05-13 12:45:48'),(1346,'Wire Caged Steel Deck Platform Trucks','wire-caged-steel-deck-platform-trucks',1336,'Made for moving loose materials or small boxes & bins, wire-caged platform truck options include standard- & heavy -duty weight capacities, models with open tops for fast loading & unloading, and others with lockable tops for increased security.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:45:50','2026-05-13 12:45:50'),(1347,'Interlocking Plastic Barricades','interlocking-plastic-barricades',1286,'Interlocking plastic barricades offer a versatile and customizable crowd-control solution for various applications. Constructed with durable plastic, these barricades feature an interlocking design with tamper-resistant hooks that securely connect, creating a continuous barrier. Interlocking barricades are durable yet lightweight for easy transportation and can be used both indoors and outdoors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:45:53','2026-05-13 12:45:53'),(1348,'Lipped Edge Steel Deck Platform Trucks','lipped-edge-steel-deck-platform-trucks',1336,'Lipped-edge platform trucks help to improve load retention and reduce slippage, which makes moving materials & equipment up & down inclines or ramps, steps, and curbs safer and easier. The steel deck resists corrosion, dents, and other damage, ensuring a long service life.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:45:55','2026-05-13 12:45:55'),(1349,'6-Wheel Steel Deck Platform Trucks','6-wheel-steel-deck-platform-trucks',1336,'These steel platform trucks are ideal for moving larger loads around in industrial settings. 4 of the wheels on our 6 wheel platform trucks are swivel casters for maximum maneuverability, and 2 are rigid for load support and stability. Some models come equipped with a second handle for additional manual support with large loads.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:45:57','2026-05-13 12:45:57'),(1350,'Battery Powered Motorized Steel Deck Platform Trucks','battery-powered-motorized-steel-deck-platform-trucks',1336,'Designed to move extremely heavy loads with minimal effort, these battery-powered motorized carts run clean, and are ideal for indoor use in warehouses and other material handling applications. Being self-propelled they help eliminate common injuries associated with pushing or pulling heavy loads.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:46:00','2026-05-13 12:46:00'),(1351,'High Capacity Steel Deck Platform Trucks','high-capacity-steel-deck-platform-trucks',1336,'With payload capacities of 3000-pounds and greater, these heavy-duty trucks feature all-welded heavy-gauge steel components, large wheels, and sturdy handles that make manually moving large product, equipment, and materials safer & easier.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:46:06','2026-05-13 12:46:06'),(1352,'Steel Deck Platform Trucks','steel-deck-platform-trucks',1336,'Steel deck platform trucks are durable and reliable transportation solutions for industrial settings. These trucks are designed to withstand heavy loads and frequent use, with a weight capacity ranging from 1000 to 5000 lbs. They also come equipped with 4 casters for easy maneuverability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:46:09','2026-05-13 12:46:09'),(1353,'Construction Barrier Kits','construction-barrier-kits',1286,'Our construction barrier kits are designed to provide a custom, temporary solution for establishing safe work zones. All construction barrier starter unit components are made of galvanized steel for durability, and add-on units are available to lengthen barriers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:46:45','2026-05-13 12:46:45'),(1354,'Plastic Flatbed Platform Trucks','plastic-flatbed-platform-trucks',1332,'Plastic deck platform trucks provide a lightweight, corrosion-resistant solution for material handling. Ideal for industries requiring easy cleaning and maintenance, these trucks offer durability without added weight. Their non-slip surface enhances safety, while the plastic deck resists moisture, chemicals, and rust. Suitable for various environments, they deliver reliable performance in warehouses and commercial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:47:24','2026-05-13 12:47:24'),(1355,'Foldable Safety Barricades','foldable-safety-barricades',1286,'Our foldable safety barricades provide a convenient, portable solution for crowd control. Made with lightweight yet durable plastic and fabric, these folding safety barriers are designed for easy setup, transportation, and storage. Folding barricades feature bright colors for easy visibility, even in the dark. Interlocking barricades and barriers with bilingual safety messages are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:47:33','2026-05-13 12:47:33'),(1356,'Galvanized Steel Safety Barrier Kits','galvanized-steel-safety-barrier-kits',1286,'Our galvanized steel safety barrier kits are built to provide durable and safe crowd or traffic control in demanding environments. Constructed with corrosion-resistant galvanized steel, these kits offer exceptional durability. We offer individually sold safety rails or posts that integrate seamlessly for a customized safety solution to fit specific needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:52:02','2026-05-13 12:52:02'),(1357,'Crowd Control Barrier Accessories','crowd-control-barrier-accessories',1291,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:55:14','2026-05-13 12:55:14'),(1358,'Hopper Trucks','hopper-trucks-1',2,'Hopper trucks are heavy-duty material handling carts designed for efficient transportation and disposal of bulk materials or waste. Designed with a convenient cutaway opening that offers easy access for loading and unloading. Bulk transport trucks are constructed of durable materials and feature sturdy casters for additional support and optimal maneuverability around tight corners. Hopper trucks are ideal for material handling in warehouses, production facilities, hotels, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:55:46','2026-05-13 12:55:46'),(1359,'Signs, Sign Holders & Merchandisers For Crowd Control Posts','signs-sign-holders-merchandisers-for-crowd-control-posts',1291,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:55:46','2026-05-13 12:55:46'),(1360,'Belt Barrier Accessories & Parts','belt-barrier-accessories-parts',1291,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:56:08','2026-05-13 12:56:08'),(1361,'Sign Frames','sign-frames',1291,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:56:51','2026-05-13 12:56:51'),(1362,'Stanchion Heads & Adapters','stanchion-heads-adapters',1291,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:57:50','2026-05-13 12:57:50'),(1363,'Retractable Belt Stanchions','retractable-belt-stanchions',1292,'Belt Stanchions are valuable tools for crowd control and traffic management, serving a practical purpose in guiding and organizing people and vehicles in settings such as airports, retail stores, events, construction sites, warehouses, and similar industrial environments. Retractable belt stanchions offer quick and flexible configuration while maintaining durability in high-traffic areas. They effectively direct foot traffic and create designated queues, ensuring safety and orderliness.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 12:59:00','2026-05-13 12:59:00'),(1364,'Wall Mount Retractable Belts','wall-mount-retractable-belts',1292,'Retractable wall-mount belt barriers offer a versatile and space-saving way to manage foot traffic in any commercial environment, from retail stores to airports and more. The retractable wall mount belts are equipped with a slow-retracting mechanism, enhancing safety by preventing rapid snap-back. The locking mechanism keeps the belt securely in place, preventing unauthorized access to restricted areas while allowing for quick and easy adjustments when needed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:00:03','2026-05-13 13:00:03'),(1365,'Caster Accessories','caster-accessories',453,'Suitable for use with industrial carts or machinery, Caster Accessories attach to the wheels or base of equipment to promote proper wheel alignment or prevent unwanted movement. Accessories like tie-down bars can be placed on the back or side of casters to reduce swiveling during transport, while floor locks secure to the bottom of gear to create a stable, stationary base when loading or unloading items. They are crafted from durable materials including stainless and zinc-coated steel for strength & durability in industrial environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:00:28','2026-05-13 13:00:28'),(1366,'Magnetic Belt Barriers','magnetic-belt-barriers',1364,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:00:32','2026-05-13 13:00:32'),(1367,'Plate Casters','plate-casters',453,'Plate casters are designed to be attached to the bottom of cabinets, workbenches, and other furniture for ease of portability. They are made with a variety of durable materials, including polyurethane, rubber, plastic, and steel for long-lasting dependability. Plate casters are available in a range of sizes that are able to support a range of weights in manufacturing, stock handling, hospitality, and educational settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:01:05','2026-05-13 13:01:05'),(1368,'Surface Mount Belt Barriers with Message','surface-mount-belt-barriers-with-message',1364,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:01:13','2026-05-13 13:01:13'),(1369,'Rack Mount Belt Barriers','rack-mount-belt-barriers',1364,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:01:39','2026-05-13 13:01:39'),(1370,'Special Purpose Casters','special-purpose-casters',453,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:01:39','2026-05-13 13:01:39'),(1371,'Stem Casters','stem-casters',453,'Stem casters make furniture or heavy equipment mobile and easy to maneuver. Available in threaded-neck, grip-neck, or grip-ring, they are quick to install by inserting its stem into the fixture’s predrilled holes. Casters can support heavy loads and some feature braking and locking mechanisms. Stem casters are ideal for mobilizing retail displays, industrial equipment, office furniture and other commercial applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:02:15','2026-05-13 13:02:15'),(1372,'Concealed Mount Belt Barriers','concealed-mount-belt-barriers',1364,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:02:30','2026-05-13 13:02:30'),(1373,'Tires','tires',453,'Tires are crucial for the efficient and safe movement and handling of materials. They are made from natural or synthetic rubber, along with other materials, and come in various tread patterns, sidewall constructions, and sizes. Whether for wheelbarrows, hand trucks, golf carts, trailers, or dollies, selecting the appropriate tires, wheels, and casters is essential for construction, industrial, and material handling applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:02:52','2026-05-13 13:02:52'),(1374,'Surface Mount Belt Barriers','surface-mount-belt-barriers',1364,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:03:17','2026-05-13 13:03:17'),(1375,'Wheel Accessories','wheel-accessories',453,'Wheel Accessories include a variety of hardware and replacement components to help ensure the wheels of industrial equipment and vehicles are operating efficiently. Accessories like axle hub kits and wheel bearings keep wheels rolling correctly, inner tubes ensure tires are properly inflated and additional components including lug nuts & valve stems, allow simple replacement of damaged or worn-out parts.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:03:32','2026-05-13 13:03:32'),(1376,'Wheels','wheels',453,'Wheels are cylindrical components designed for rotational movement, often attached to an axle to facilitate the mobility of various equipment and machinery. They come in diverse materials such as rubber, polyurethane, steel, or plastic, each offering specific benefits. Wheels are commonly used in material handling applications, carts, dollies, and industrial equipment, providing essential mobility for transporting goods and facilitating efficient processes in warehouses, manufacturing facilities, and distribution centers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:04:17','2026-05-13 13:04:17'),(1377,'Ball Transfer Conveyors','ball-transfer-conveyors',454,'Ball transfer conveyors are shock-absorbing, load bearing conveyor rollers with optional flange casters. These ball transfer tables allow materials to move in all directions, making them ideal for workplaces that need flexibility. Ball transfer conveyors and accessories are perfect for tight spaces, making them great for heavy-duty assembly lines and hand-held applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:05:46','2026-05-13 13:05:46'),(1378,'Belt Conveyors','belt-conveyors',454,'Belt conveyors feature a thick and continuous belt loop, powered by motorized pulleys, that efficiently convey products from point A to point B. Its sturdy frame and adjustable leg supports are constructed of durable materials for long-lasting dependability. Ideal for use in assembly, sorting and inspection.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:06:33','2026-05-13 13:06:33'),(1379,'Conveyor Accessories','conveyor-accessories',454,'Conveyor belt accessories play a crucial role in optimizing the performance and durability of conveyor systems. From rollers and tensioners to cleaners and guides, conveyor components are essential for ensuring the continual smooth operation and minimizing downtime in industrial settings. Built from high-quality materials, conveyor belt accessories offer reliable performance and are suitable for a wide range of applications, including manufacturing, distribution, and logistics.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:07:17','2026-05-13 13:07:17'),(1380,'Conveyor Chains','conveyor-chains',454,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:08:15','2026-05-13 13:08:15'),(1381,'Conveyor Support Stands','conveyor-support-stands',454,'Support stands give superior support to conveyor sections in a variety of applications. They feature adjustable height settings and have varying weight capacities, enabling customization for specific operational needs. Conveyor support stands are ideal for warehouses, distribution centers, logistics facilities, and other industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:08:46','2026-05-13 13:08:46'),(1382,'Folding Plastic Platform Trucks','folding-plastic-platform-trucks',1354,'Folding Platform Trucks provide a range of flexible and space-saving material handling solutions. These trucks can be easily folded down for compact storage when not in use, and quickly unfolded for transporting various items. They feature durable construction, large platforms, and smooth-rolling casters for easy maneuverability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:09:39','2026-05-13 13:09:39'),(1383,'Expandable & Flexible Conveyors','expandable-flexible-conveyors',454,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:09:39','2026-05-13 13:09:39'),(1384,'Structural Foam Plastic Deck Platform Trucks','structural-foam-plastic-deck-platform-trucks',1354,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:09:42','2026-05-13 13:09:42'),(1385,'Plastic Deck Platform Trucks','plastic-deck-platform-trucks',1354,'Our plastic platform trucks feature durable plastic decks that are resistant to rust, dents, and scratches, making them suitable for use in harsh environments. They feature 2 swivel and 2 rigid casters to help ease the transport of materials. Some models of our plastic platform trucks feature additional sockets to attach a second handle.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:09:45','2026-05-13 13:09:45'),(1386,'Nestable Plastic Deck Platform Trucks','nestable-plastic-deck-platform-trucks',1354,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:10:03','2026-05-13 13:10:03'),(1387,'Powered Roller Conveyors','powered-roller-conveyors',454,'Powered Roller Conveyors are engineered to seamlessly convey items using powered rollers embedded within the belt. They efficiently move materials and are automated which helps reduce manual pushing and pulling, reducing physical strain on workers and increasing productivity. Powered roller conveyors effortlessly move products along the production line, assembly areas, warehouses, distribution centers, manufacturing facilities, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:10:15','2026-05-13 13:10:15'),(1388,'Accessories for Plastic Deck Platform Trucks','accessories-for-plastic-deck-platform-trucks',1354,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:10:27','2026-05-13 13:10:27'),(1389,'Roller Conveyors','roller-conveyors',454,'Roller conveyors provide a secure and efficient method to transport boxes, totes, and other materials from one location to another in warehouses and other industrial spaces. Roller conveyors can be customized to fit any space with various lengths and widths available. Objects can be moved manually or using gravity rollers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:10:55','2026-05-13 13:10:55'),(1390,'Aluminum Flatbed Platform Trucks','aluminum-flatbed-platform-trucks',1332,'Aluminum deck platform trucks offer a lightweight yet durable solution. Ideal for warehouses, factories, and commercial settings, their corrosion-resistant aluminum construction ensures longevity. These trucks provide easy maneuverability, strength for heavy loads, and come in various deck styles like smooth or diamond tread for enhanced traction and versatility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:11:38','2026-05-13 13:11:38'),(1391,'Skate Wheel Conveyors','skate-wheel-conveyors',454,'Skate wheel conveyors support a smooth flow of lightweight materials, enhancing productivity through the use of free-rolling skate wheels. Available in rigid or flexible frames, these conveyors are designed for transporting lighter packages with flat, sturdy bottoms. Their lightweight construction ensures portability and easy reconfiguration, accommodating packages of various shapes and sizes. Skate wheel conveyors are particularly well-suited for distribution centers, warehouses, and other commercial material handling environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:12:01','2026-05-13 13:12:01'),(1392,'Vacuum Conveyors','vacuum-conveyors',454,'Vacuum powered conveyors use pressure to transport bulk materials or powders. They are designed for easy integration within existing systems and are made from durable materials to ensure years of lasting use. Vacuum conveyors help minimize dust and contamination providing a safer and cleaner working environment. They are ideal for use in manufacturing plants, chemical processing facilities, and other industrial material handling applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:12:41','2026-05-13 13:12:41'),(1393,'Accessories for Aluminum Deck Platform Trucks','accessories-for-aluminum-deck-platform-trucks',1390,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:14:45','2026-05-13 13:14:45'),(1394,'Treadplate Deck Aluminum Platform Trucks','treadplate-deck-aluminum-platform-trucks',1390,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:14:48','2026-05-13 13:14:48'),(1395,'Diamond Deck Aluminum Platform Trucks','diamond-deck-aluminum-platform-trucks',1390,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:14:51','2026-05-13 13:14:51'),(1396,'Smooth Deck Aluminum Platform Trucks','smooth-deck-aluminum-platform-trucks',1390,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:14:53','2026-05-13 13:14:53'),(1397,'Folding Aluminum Platform Trucks','folding-aluminum-platform-trucks',1390,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:14:57','2026-05-13 13:14:57'),(1398,'Wood Flatbed Platform Trucks','wood-flatbed-platform-trucks',1332,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:15:34','2026-05-13 13:15:34'),(1399,'Bridge Cranes','bridge-cranes',455,'Overhead bridge cranes are engineered for lifting and moving heavy loads with precision and control. They are ideal for facilities with limited floor space, as they optimize vertical space, allowing for efficient use of the available area. Overhead cranes play a crucial role in manufacturing and production processes, facilitating the movement of raw materials, components, and finished products.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:16:40','2026-05-13 13:16:40'),(1400,'Combination Hoists & Trolleys','combination-hoists-trolleys',455,'Combination hoists and trolleys are material handling tools that combine hoisting and horizontal movement capabilities to lift, lower, and place heavy loads in industrial applications. Electric chain hoists with trolleys have durable motors to automate the lifting and placement process, making them ideal for heavier loads. Manual chain hoists have a simple, efficient design making them easy to use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:17:32','2026-05-13 13:17:32'),(1401,'Wire Caged Wood Deck Platform Trucks','wire-caged-wood-deck-platform-trucks',1398,'Heavy-duty euro style platform trucks are an ideal option for moving materials. They have a weight capacity of up to 2400 lbs and measure 60\" x 30\". The wire sides allow for easy visibility and access to contents while the wood deck provides durability and stability. Ideal for use in warehouses, factories, and other industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:17:37','2026-05-13 13:17:37'),(1402,'Steel Bound Plywood Deck Platform Trucks','steel-bound-plywood-deck-platform-trucks',1398,'Carry heavy loads around your commercial space with ease with a steel bound plywood deck platform truck. The plywood decks are finished with a smooth lacquer and surrounded by a durable chip-resistant steel frame with an enamel finish. Our wood deck platform trucks come with 4 casters for easy mobility and some models come equipped with fittings for a secondary handle.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:17:40','2026-05-13 13:17:40'),(1403,'Dual Belt Barriers','dual-belt-barriers',1364,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:17:44','2026-05-13 13:17:44'),(1404,'Steel Bound Hardwood Deck Platform Trucks','steel-bound-hardwood-deck-platform-trucks',1398,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:17:46','2026-05-13 13:17:46'),(1405,'Hardwood Deck Platform Trucks','hardwood-deck-platform-trucks',1398,'Wood deck platform trucks are ideal for moving materials around in industrial spaces. They are made with a sturdy steel frame and features a flush, kiln-dried and sealed hardwood deck that is reinforced with cross battens for long life. Weight capacities on these platform trucks ranges from 1000 to 2400 lbs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:17:48','2026-05-13 13:17:48'),(1406,'Davit Cranes','davit-cranes',455,'Davit cranes efficiently lift and position materials in areas where a fixed crane or hoist system may not be practical. The boom arm is adjustable, enabling users to extend or retract it based on the lifting requirements and available space. Many davit cranes feature a 360-degree rotation capability, providing users with a broad range of motion and positioning options. They are ideal for construction projects, utility services, and maintenance operations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:18:29','2026-05-13 13:18:29'),(1407,'Stainless Steel Flatbed Platform Trucks','stainless-steel-flatbed-platform-trucks',1332,'Stainless steel deck platform trucks are designed for heavy-duty handling in environments requiring high hygiene standards, such as food processing and pharmaceuticals. Corrosion-resistant and easy to clean, these trucks offer superior durability and longevity. Their robust construction ensures they can handle heavy loads while maintaining performance in wet or harsh conditions, making them ideal for demanding industrial applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:18:33','2026-05-13 13:18:33'),(1408,'Hose Clamp Belt Barriers','hose-clamp-belt-barriers',1364,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:18:53','2026-05-13 13:18:53'),(1409,'Equipment Lifting Jacks','equipment-lifting-jacks',455,'Equipment lifting jacks are mechanical devices designed to lift heavy loads or equipment to a desired height. They allow workers to access the underside of equipment or machinery for inspections, repairs, or component replacement. Equipment lifting jacks are used in automotive garages, workshops, manufacturing facilities, warehouses, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:19:14','2026-05-13 13:19:14'),(1410,'Folding Stainless Steel Platform Trucks','folding-stainless-steel-platform-trucks',1407,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:19:42','2026-05-13 13:19:42'),(1411,'Stainless Steel Platform Trucks','stainless-steel-platform-trucks',1407,'Stainless steel platform trucks are a durable and reliable solution for material handling needs in a variety of settings. With a weight capacity of up to 2,500 lbs, these trucks are designed to handle heavy loads with ease. The stainless steel construction of these platform trucks provides corrosion resistance and easy cleaning, making them ideal for use in cleanroom and food service environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:19:45','2026-05-13 13:19:45'),(1412,'Gantry Cranes','gantry-cranes',455,'Gantry cranes, working in tandem with hoists or trolleys, offer a sturdy framework for lifting and transporting heavy goods and materials in warehouse and manufacturing settings. Featuring an adjustable beam, they enable precise positioning, while their durable swivel lock casters ensure effortless movement across work areas. Constructed with a heavy-duty steel frame and I-beam, gantry cranes support hoists and trolleys, ensuring stable lifting and movement of heavy loads. Their design allows for both indoor and outdoor use, making them versatile solutions for various applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:20:01','2026-05-13 13:20:01'),(1413,'Hoist Trolleys','hoist-trolleys',455,'Beam trolleys transport items and equipment efficiently along overhead beams. Constructed of heavy duty materials like steel, they are made to be durable and support large loads with high weight capacities. Different head room and beam width amounts available allow the beam trolleys to be used in many industrial or warehouse settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:20:43','2026-05-13 13:20:43'),(1414,'Stanchion Storage Carts','stanchion-storage-carts',1294,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:20:50','2026-05-13 13:20:50'),(1415,'Hoists','hoists',455,'Hoists and trolleys are useful for lifting and moving heavy loads from one location to another in any jobsite or workshop. Electric hoists have heavy-duty motors that offer reliability and increased productivity. Manual chain hoists allow full control and precision and are also lightweight and portable. Trolleys are a durable and heavy-duty option for high-weight loads. Air hoists use pneumatic motors to lift and move heavy loads with precision, flexibility, and accuracy.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:21:27','2026-05-13 13:21:27'),(1416,'Jib Cranes','jib-cranes',455,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:22:10','2026-05-13 13:22:10'),(1417,'Lifting Attachments & Accessories','lifting-attachments-accessories',455,'Lifting attachments and accessories are designed to enhance functionality and increase the lifespan of industrial cranes and hoists. Hanging scales are used for weighing and measuring loads, while hoist rings allow loads to be rotated freely. Beam clamps can be used to suspend cranes and hoists from existing beams in production environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:22:50','2026-05-13 13:22:50'),(1418,'Portable Cranes','portable-cranes',455,'Portable floor cranes are designed for lifting and maneuvering heavy loads in workshops and other industrial environments. With a compact and mobile design, floor cranes provide precision and flexibility in handling a variety of materials. Portable floor cranes are ideal for construction sites, automotive shops, and manufacturing facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:23:26','2026-05-13 13:23:26'),(1419,'Barricade Carts','barricade-carts',1294,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:24:18','2026-05-13 13:24:18'),(1420,'Dock Boards & Plates','dock-boards-plates',456,'Dock boards and plates bridge the gap between the dock and a truck bed in order to load and unload equipment easily. They feature an anti-slip textured surface, and are made from heavy-duty materials to ensure lasting durability. Dock boards and plates are portable equipment ideal for use at distribution centers, warehouses, manufacturing facilities, and any commercial loading stations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:25:29','2026-05-13 13:25:29'),(1421,'Dock Bumpers','dock-bumpers',456,'Dock bumpers are durable protective components that prevent loading docks from damage caused by impact while increasing the longevity of the loading dock. Dock bumpers cushion contact with trucks, containers and carts to prevent costly damage. They are made from durable materials like molded and extruded rubber, with some models featuring steel faces for added protection. Dock bumpers are used in shipping facilities, warehouses, and other logistics management locations that utilize high-traffic loading docks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:26:06','2026-05-13 13:26:06'),(1422,'Dock Doors','dock-doors',456,'Roll-up dock doors are designed to provide secure and efficient access to loading docks. With a space-saving and durable design, they offer quick opening and closing. Roll-up dock doors are ideal for warehouses, distribution centers, and logistics hubs, contributing to efficient loading and unloading processes and enhancing overall operations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:26:51','2026-05-13 13:26:51'),(1423,'Dock Fans','dock-fans',456,'Equipped with high-powered motors and available in a range of diameters, Dock Fans circulate air & provide airflow to cool down loading docks & trailers in commercial and industrial facilities to help employees remain comfortable. Trailer fans are designed for secure mounting near the back of trucks and come with all the required hardware for quick, simple installation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:27:30','2026-05-13 13:27:30'),(1424,'Dock Gates','dock-gates',456,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:28:01','2026-05-13 13:28:01'),(1425,'Dock Lights','dock-lights-1',456,'Dock lights illuminate loading docks, truck trailers, and workstations with ease, ensuring a well-lit and secure environment for all loading and unloading operations. Dock light heads utilize LED technology to be energy efficient. Dock lights are, also, ideal for poorly lit cargo bays.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:28:39','2026-05-13 13:28:39'),(1426,'Dock Locks & Vehicle Restraints','dock-locks-vehicle-restraints',456,'Dock locks and vehicle restraints are crucial safety devices designed to secure trucks and trailers during loading and unloading operations at docks. They provide a reliable means of preventing accidental vehicle separation, reducing the risk of accidents and injuries. Dock locks and vehicle restraints typically consist of heavy-duty components that securely engage with a truck\'s rear impact guard or ICC bar to effectively immobilize the vehicle. They are commonly used in logistics facilities, warehouses, and distribution centers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:29:17','2026-05-13 13:29:17'),(1427,'Dock Shelters, Seals, & Strip Doors','dock-shelters-seals-strip-doors',456,'Shelters and door accessories improve safety, energy efficiency, and visibility in loading docks, warehouses, and other commercial facilities. Door seals and shelters minimize exposure to outdoor elements such as rain, wind, and snow, increasing energy efficiency. Clearance bars and forklift alert systems help prevent vehicle and building damage by creating a visual and audible warning when vehicles get too close to support poles, loading docks, or walls. Integral fixtures found in warehouses, manufacturing facilities, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 13:29:56','2026-05-13 13:29:56'),(1428,'Folding Security Gates','folding-security-gates',456,'Folding security gates enhance safety and assist with crowd control at entrances and access points. These versatile gates protect against unauthorized access and effectively control people\'s movement, ensuring a secure environment in various settings, such as commercial spaces, industrial facilities, educational institutions, and public venues. They provide advanced technology and features for adaptable, reliable access control, striking a balance between convenience and protection.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:03:39','2026-05-13 14:03:39'),(1429,'Guards & Railings','guards-railings',456,'Guards and railings are bright yellow, hi-vis safety solutions for industrial settings like warehouses, loading docks, and more. Bollards, dock bumpers, clearance guards, guard rails, and machine safety shields protect equipment and machinery from collisions or impacts. This durable workplace safety equipment protects machinery, property, and personnel.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:04:30','2026-05-13 14:04:30'),(1430,'Impact Doors','impact-doors',456,'Impact Doors enhance safety and security within warehouses and industrial environments. Designed to endure heavy machinery impact, such as forklifts, they effectively reduce noise and absorb dents, bumps, and dings. While these doors excel in withstanding physical impact, they are not intended to protect against harsh weather conditions. In warehouses and factories, impact doors are protective barriers in high-traffic areas, providing durability and energy conservation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:05:15','2026-05-13 14:05:15'),(1431,'Levelers','levelers',456,'Levelers are permanent dock solutions that raise and lower with the trailer, providing a safe transition of cargo between the loading dock and the trailer. They help prevent costly equipment damage or injury and are made from heavy-duty materials to ensure long-lasting durability. Levelers are ideal for warehouses, manufacturing facilities, distribution centers, and other industrial loading spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:05:46','2026-05-13 14:05:46'),(1432,'Ramps','ramps',456,'Ramps are portable platforms that make it easy to unload and load trucks and trailers in commercial and industrial work settings. Crafted from robust materials and with their sturdy construction, Wheel riser ramps can handle the demanding requirements of various loading dock environments while bridging the gap between the loading dock and a truck, container, or another elevated surface to provide a smooth and secure transition. Many ramps feature anti-slip surfaces, ensuring maximum traction even in wet or slippery conditions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:06:18','2026-05-13 14:06:18'),(1433,'Surveillance Cameras','surveillance-cameras',456,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:06:57','2026-05-13 14:06:57'),(1434,'Tow & Recovery Straps','tow-recovery-straps',456,'Straps are designed to control and secure cargo during transportation. Whether on trucks, trailers, or shipping containers, straps play a crucial role in preventing shifting or movement. They are constructed from durable materials such as polyester, nylon, and others, ensuring reliability and longevity. Some straps, such as ratchets, come with tensioning mechanisms to tighten and secure the straps around the load effectively. They are ideal for securing loads on trucks, trailers, shipping containers, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:07:30','2026-05-13 14:07:30'),(1435,'Traffic Lights','traffic-lights',456,'Dock traffic control lights are visual signaling devices that improve safety and efficiency in loading dock areas. By providing clear communication between dock personnel and truck drivers, Dock traffic lights help to prevent accidents and injuries. They often utilize LED technology, providing high visibility in low light or adverse weather conditions. Heavy-duty loading dock traffic lights are ideal for use in warehouses, manufacturing facilities, distribution centers, and airports.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:08:08','2026-05-13 14:08:08'),(1436,'Trailer Jacks','trailer-jacks',456,'Trailer jacks help prevent semi-trailers from tipping-over when they are not connected to a tractor during loading and unloading dock operations. Trailer stabilizing jacks also assist in leveling trailers parked on uneven ground and to prevent landing gear from sinking into a soft surface. Available in ratchet, hand-crank, and hydraulic mechanisms to ensure trailer stability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:08:44','2026-05-13 14:08:44'),(1437,'Work Height Platform Trucks','work-height-platform-trucks',1325,'Work height platform trucks are specialized material handling solutions designed to provide a convenient elevated work surface along with the capability to transport goods. They are designed with swivel casters and wheels for easy maneuverability, enabling efficient navigation through crowded workspaces and narrow aisles. The platform trucks also come with integrated handles for easy steering and control. They are ideal for warehouses, workshops, and distribution centers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:08:45','2026-05-13 14:08:45'),(1438,'Wagons & Trailers','wagons-trailers',1325,'Wagon Trucks and Caster Steer Trailers are essential equipment for transporting heavy loads efficiently. Designed for durability and reliability, wagon vehicles boast heavy-duty construction and high weight capacities, perfect for industrial, agricultural, or commercial applications. With ergonomic handles and smooth-rolling wheels, wagons and caster steer trailers ensure effortless maneuverability and streamlined material handling in warehouses, farms, or construction sites.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:08:49','2026-05-13 14:08:49'),(1439,'U-Boat Platform Trucks','u-boat-platform-trucks',1325,'U-boat platform trucks are durable carts designed for transporting goods and equipment in narrow aisles, confined spaces, or hallways. The ergonomic design of integrated guardrails provide extra support while sturdy casters make maneuvering materials through warehouses and manufacturing facilities safe and efficient. U-boat platform truck models are made of heavy-duty steel, non-skid work surfaces, and construction foam for long-lasting dependability. They are used in industrial settings like warehouses and storage facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:08:52','2026-05-13 14:08:52'),(1440,'Wheel Chocks','wheel-chocks',456,'Wheel chocks prevent vehicles, trailers and other equipment from rolling inadvertently at loading docks. They are made of rubber, aluminum or steel for lasting performance. Built-in traction grippers create maximum friction between tires and surfaces to ensure safety of employees and personnel in loading docks at factories, commercial, manufacturing, and retail spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:09:30','2026-05-13 14:09:30'),(1441,'Compactors','compactors',457,'Drum Crushers & Compactors are drum handling equipment designed to provide drum waste management solutions. Drum Crushers flatten heavy-duty drums making disposal of them easier. With the use of hydraulics or pneumatic compressor plates, Drum Compactors compresses waste content within a drum. Compaction allows for the maximum storage of waste in drums in order to reduce disposal costs. Drum Crushers & Compactors together are effective drum disposal and drum volume reduction methods.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:10:21','2026-05-13 14:10:21'),(1442,'Covers & Liners','covers-liners',457,'Drum covers and liners prevent leaks, spills, and contamination by providing a secure covering for drums during storage, transport, or dispensing. They are made from heavy-duty materials and are resistant to various chemicals, acids & solvents. Drum covers and liners are ideal for use in chemical manufacturing, waste management, and the oil and gas industry.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:10:56','2026-05-13 14:10:56'),(1443,'Dispensing Hoses','dispensing-hoses',457,'IBC dispensing hoses and nozzles ensure clean and easy transfer of liquids contained in drums, containers, and IBCs. They feature flexible connections, special fittings, and also anti-static options. High performance and durability make these dispensing hoses ideal for hazardous material transfer in many industrial workspaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:11:35','2026-05-13 14:11:35'),(1444,'Drum & Barrel Storage','drum-barrel-storage',457,'Drum and barrel racks provide efficient and orderly storage in commercial and industrial liquid storage applications. Drum racks offer easy access for loading and unloading drums and 360° drum cradle support. Barrel racks with ladders and U-shaped channels are designed for added safety and support.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:12:54','2026-05-13 14:13:24'),(1445,'Accessories for U-Boat Platform Trucks','accessories-for-u-boat-platform-trucks',1439,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:13:46','2026-05-13 14:13:46'),(1446,'Steel Deck Narrow Aisle U-Boat Platform Trucks','steel-deck-narrow-aisle-u-boat-platform-trucks',1439,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:13:48','2026-05-13 14:13:48'),(1447,'Aluminum Deck Motorized U-Boat Platform Trucks','aluminum-deck-motorized-u-boat-platform-trucks',1439,'Aluminum Deck Motorized U-Boat Platform Trucks are built with a 400w motor and an automatic park brake to prioritize safety and efficiency when moving heavy loads. The swivel casters and solid pneumatic wheels along with the center-tilt allow our motorized u-boats to glide across uneven surfaces. Motorized platform trucks are shipped assembled for your convenience.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:13:53','2026-05-13 14:13:53'),(1448,'Wood Deck U-Boat Platform Trucks','wood-deck-u-boat-platform-trucks',1439,'Wood Deck U-Boat Platform Trucks are an economical option for material handling in tight spaces. The steel frame on these wood deck platform trucks offer durability and support of loads up to 1500 lbs. Twin removable handles and heavy duty swivel casters allow easy transport of oversized items. These narrow aisle platform trucks are ideal for busy commercial areas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:13:57','2026-05-13 14:13:57'),(1449,'Galvanized Steel Deck U-Boat Platform Trucks','galvanized-steel-deck-u-boat-platform-trucks',1439,'Galvanized Steel U-Boat Platform Trucks are ideal for use in damp or wet areas due to their corrosion-resistant features. The narrow aisle and six wheel design allows these platform trucks to maneuver through tight spaces and turn on their own radius. With a weight capacity of 1750 lbs and removable twin handles, these galvanized steel platform trucks can transport oversized cargo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:13:59','2026-05-13 14:13:59'),(1450,'Folding Aluminum Deck U-Boat Platform Trucks','folding-aluminum-deck-u-boat-platform-trucks',1439,'Folding Aluminum Deck U-Boat Platform Trucks are ideal for handling material in tight spaces. The all-welded, corrosion-resistant build and foldable handles with a collapsible deck makes our folding platform trucks ideal for any commercial setting. Four swivel and two rigid casters provide smooth mobility and support for heavy loads. Lifetime Limited Warranty.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:14:03','2026-05-13 14:14:03'),(1451,'Drum Dollies','drum-dollies-1',457,'Drum dollies are specialized material handling devices designed to transport and maneuver heavy drums easily and safely. They feature casters for smooth mobility, a sturdy frame capable of holding heavy load sizes, and some models feature ergonomic handles for comfortable pushing or pulling. Drum dollies are commonly used in industrial settings such as warehouses, manufacturing facilities, and distribution centers where drums containing liquids, chemicals, or other materials need to be moved efficiently and safely.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:14:04','2026-05-13 14:14:04'),(1452,'Aluminum Deck U-Boat Platform Trucks','aluminum-deck-u-boat-platform-trucks',1439,'Aluminum Deck U-Boat Platform Trucks can transport heavy loads in tight spaces. Made of lightweight aluminum, our narrow aisle u-boat trucks are durable and can carry loads of up to 1800 lbs. With six swivel casters and removable handles, the truck is able to turn on its own radius and transport oversized cargo. The aluminum u-boat platform truck has a ribbed deck for extra grip.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:14:10','2026-05-13 14:14:10'),(1453,'Steel Deck U-Boat Platform Trucks','steel-deck-u-boat-platform-trucks',1439,'Steel Deck U-Boat Platform Trucks are ideal for moving heavy loads in tight spaces. The steel build supports capacities of up to 2000 lbs and the diamond tread deck offers stability during transport. Our steel deck platform trucks have two swivel and rigid casters for mobility, and handled folds for easy storage. Industrial platform trucks are ideal for any commercial setting.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:14:14','2026-05-13 14:14:14'),(1454,'Drum Lifters & Dumpers','drum-lifters-dumpers-1',457,'Drum lifters and dumpers make it easier to lift, transport, place, and dump heavy, industrial drums. Constructed of high-quality steel for long-lasting durability, drum lifters and dumpers can lift a wide range of weight capacities. Its ergonomic handles and durable rolling wheels allow for easy handling and mobility. They are ideal for use in warehouses, stock rooms, manufacturing production floors, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:14:41','2026-05-13 14:14:41'),(1455,'Drum Mixers','drum-mixers',457,'Mixers are specialized equipment designed for blending or agitating the contents of drums, barrels, or containers efficiently. They come in various forms, including drum mixers, rollers, and tumblers. Mixers feature speed controls, powerful motors, and durable construction for long-lasting dependability. They are ideal for use in industrial and manufacturing settings where homogeneous mixing is crucial for paint blending, chemical production, or food processing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:15:18','2026-05-13 14:15:18'),(1456,'Flat Deck 3 Caster Steer Trailers','flat-deck-3-caster-steer-trailers',1438,'Flat Deck 3 Caster Trailers are versatile material handling equipment that can work independently or connected to a train of trailers. These heavy duty caster steer trailers can bear weights up to 1500 lbs. Swivel caster wheels stay under the load at all times, providing stability for unevenly distributed loads. Caster steer trailers have a reinforced gauge steel deck for long-lasting durability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:17:54','2026-05-13 14:17:54'),(1457,'Flush Deck Wagon Trucks','flush-deck-wagon-trucks',1438,'Flush Deck Wagon Trucks are built with a reinforced steel deck to support loads ranging from 2000 to 3500 lbs. Our flush deck wagons have various wheel types, including pneumatic 8 wheeler and mold-on rubber wheels. The pivoting center axle enables fifth-wheel steering, while the T-handle design allows for easy push or pull maneuverability. The vinyl hand grips permit two-person operation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:17:57','2026-05-13 14:17:57'),(1458,'Flush Deck Trailers','flush-deck-trailers',1438,'Flush Deck Trailers provide convenient material transportation for industrial applications. The 12 gauge steel deck along with pneumatic wheels support a range of load capacities for durable unit mobility. With a trailer hitch for easy towing and pivoting axles that turn front and rear pneumatic wheels in opposite directions allow these deck trailers to operate in tight spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:18:01','2026-05-13 14:18:01'),(1459,'Lip Deck Wagon Trucks','lip-deck-wagon-trucks',1438,'Lip Deck Wagon Trucks have a heavy-duty steel build, pivoting center axle, and T-handles for easy maneuvering of loads up to 3500 lbs. With fifth wheel steering, these tray deck wagons can maneuver in tight spaces. The vinyl hand grips permit two-person operation, and various wheel types are offered for different applications. Certain units have a retaining deck lip for secure transport of items.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:18:04','2026-05-13 14:18:04'),(1460,'Adjustable Steel Deck Platform Trucks with Lower Shelf','adjustable-steel-deck-platform-trucks-with-lower-shelf',1437,'Our steel platform trucks are ergonomically designed to feature an adjustable deck that varies in height making room for items on the bottom shelf. These adjustable platform trucks are made from durable all-welded steel with a powder coated finish that can withstand heavy loads. They feature 2 swivel and 2 rigid casters for mobility and retaining lip for secure storage.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:23:16','2026-05-13 14:23:16'),(1461,'Fixed Height Wood Deck Platform Trucks with Lower Shelf','fixed-height-wood-deck-platform-trucks-with-lower-shelf',1437,'Our heavy-duty fixed height wood deck platform trucks are perfect for any industrial material handling environments. Crafted with a sturdy steel frame and wood deck, these trucks weight capacity holds heavy loads. Enhancing efficiency, they come with a convenient lower shelf and non-marking wheels for easily transporting multiple items at a time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:23:20','2026-05-13 14:23:20'),(1462,'Fixed Height Wood Deck Platform Trucks','fixed-height-wood-deck-platform-trucks',1437,'Easily handle heavy-duty loads with our all-welded steel frame wood deck platform trucks. Available in various weight capacities and come equipped with 4 casters (2 swivel, 2 rigid), these trucks provide smooth mobility. Some models feature a lower shelf, and trucks also include a removable push handle, and non-marking wheels for easy maneuverability and floor protection.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:23:25','2026-05-13 14:23:25'),(1463,'Fixed Height Hardboard Platform Trucks','fixed-height-hardboard-platform-trucks',1437,'Fixed Height Hardboard Platform Trucks are reliable and convenient material handling solutions at a work height level. These all-welded fixed height trucks feature a durable hardboard platform, ergonomic removable push bar, casters, and wheels for easy and safe material transport. They are ideal for use in workstations, factories, and warehouses.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:23:26','2026-05-13 14:23:26'),(1464,'Fixed Height Steel Tray Deck Platform Trucks','fixed-height-steel-tray-deck-platform-trucks',1437,'Our steel deck platform trucks have a sturdy frame that can support heavy loads of up to 2,000 lbs, and feature a fixed-height platform with a non-slip surface to keep items in place during transport. Steel Platform trucks are available in various sizes and feature four swivel casters allowing for easy maneuverability, while the two with brakes provide stability while the truck is stationary.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:23:29','2026-05-13 14:23:29'),(1465,'Fixed Height Steel Deep Deck Platform Trucks','fixed-height-steel-deep-deck-platform-trucks',1437,'Introducing our fixed height deep deck platform trucks, built with a heavy-duty steel construction that can support heavy loads. The deep deck design offers ample space for transporting larger items. These steel deck platform trucks are equipped with 4 swivel casters, a removable push bar handle, and retaining lips that provide secure storage during travel.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:23:32','2026-05-13 14:23:32'),(1466,'Fixed Height Steel Flush Deck Platform Trucks','fixed-height-steel-flush-deck-platform-trucks',1437,'Our fixed height flush deck steel platform trucks are ideal for material handling environments and more. They sit at a comfortable 26\" deck height that reduces bending and back strain. These trucks also feature a removable push bar, 2 swivel, and 2 rigid casters for easy mobility, and have a weight capacity of up to 2000 lbs',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:23:36','2026-05-13 14:23:36'),(1467,'Fixed Height Steel Deck Platform Trucks with Lower Shelf','fixed-height-steel-deck-platform-trucks-with-lower-shelf',1437,'Fixed Height Steel Deck Platform Trucks with a Lower Shelf give you additional space for transportation. These platform trucks feature a sturdy steel deck platform and lower shelf for extra storage, with fixed-height platforms that are easy to use. They are available in various sizes and weight capacities to meet different needs, making them ideal for use in workshops, factories, and warehouses.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:23:40','2026-05-13 14:23:40'),(1468,'Drum Spill Containment','drum-spill-containment',457,'Drum spill containment is crucial for handling and managing accidental spills in workplaces. Spill containment solutions include spill pallets and skids to keep storage spaces clean, spill control trays to effectively manage liquid spills, and carts for spill response. This equipment helps prevent environmental hazards in a range of industrial settings like warehouses, garages, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:26:04','2026-05-13 14:26:04'),(1469,'Drum Trucks & Cradles','drum-trucks-cradles-1',457,'Drum trucks and cradles are designed to transport drums around industrial facilities. They feature multiple wheels for stability and maneuverability,and ergonomic handles with grips that make moving drums and barrels easier. Drum trucks and cradles are ideal for drum handling in warehouses, factories, laboratories, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:26:43','2026-05-13 14:26:43'),(1470,'Faucets & Taps','faucets-taps',457,'Faucets and taps provide a controlled and efficient means of dispensing liquid from drums quickly and securely. Drum faucets and drum taps allow the start, stop, or adjustment of flow as liquid is dispensed from the drum.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:27:21','2026-05-13 14:27:21'),(1471,'Funnels & Vents','funnels-vents',457,'Funnels & Vents are engineered to facilitate the efficient and safe filling of drums, offering a range of options such as drum funnels tailored for narrow or wide-mouth drums, as well as specialized oversized funnels and drum vents. Users can choose drum funnels based on the size and type of drum openings, ensuring a precise fit. The oversized drum funnel is particularly useful for extra-large openings, providing enhanced overflow protection. These tools find utility in various settings where accurate and safe drum filling is crucial.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:27:58','2026-05-13 14:27:58'),(1472,'Adjustable Height Wood Deck Platform Trucks','adjustable-height-wood-deck-platform-trucks',1437,'Our commercial-grade wood deck platform trucks are versatile and flexible, with adjustable height for different load sizes. They can handle heavy loads with ease and come equipped with all-welded construction, foot brakes, and casters for maneuverability. Ideal for various settings, these trucks are built to last.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:27:59','2026-05-13 14:27:59'),(1473,'Adjustable Height Wood Deck Platform Trucks with Lower Shelf','adjustable-height-wood-deck-platform-trucks-with-lower-shelf',1437,'Our work height adjustable platform trucks are made with a sturdy steel frame and topped with a smooth 1/4\" hardboard working surface. Units come with a removable push bar, and are adjustable with height ranges from 25\" to 35\" high allowing you to place your working station at a comfortable height to minimize bending and reduce back strain.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:28:02','2026-05-13 14:28:02'),(1474,'Adjustable Height Hardboard Platform Trucks','adjustable-height-hardboard-platform-trucks',1437,'Reduce bending during material handling with our Adjustable Height Hardboard Platform Trucks. Ergonomically designed, these trucks offer a range of adjustable decks. Our platform trucks feature hardboard tops capable of supporting heavy loads, a retaining lip for secure storage, a removable push bar handle, and high-quality casters/wheels.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:28:06','2026-05-13 14:28:06'),(1475,'Adjustable Height Steel Tray Deck Platform Trucks','adjustable-height-steel-tray-deck-platform-trucks',1437,'Adjustable Height Steel Tray Deck Platform Trucks feature adjustable-height platforms that can be easily raised or lowered to suit different loading and unloading tasks. Tray decks feature raised edges to keep items secure during transport. Made of sturdy steel construction, each unit includes posts, shelves, plastic shelf clips, ledges, dividers, document holder, basket, and glove holder',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:28:09','2026-05-13 14:28:09'),(1476,'Adjustable Height Steel Deep Deck Platform Trucks','adjustable-height-steel-deep-deck-platform-trucks',1437,'Our Adjustable Height Steel Deep Deck Platform Trucks provide versatile and ergonomic material handling options. These trucks come with adjustable-height platforms that can be easily raised or lowered to meet your loading needs. The deep decks are designed to securely hold larger items during transport. These trucks are all-welded for added durability and feature push bars for easy maneuvering.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:28:12','2026-05-13 14:28:12'),(1477,'Adjustable Height Steel Flush Deck Platform Trucks','adjustable-height-steel-flush-deck-platform-trucks',1437,'The Adjustable Height Steel Flush Deck Platform Trucks are designed with adjustable-height platforms and strong steel construction, making them suitable for a variety of loading and unloading tasks while ensuring safety. These trucks also come with two rigid casters for easy mobility, as well as a removable push bar for added convenience.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:28:19','2026-05-13 14:28:19'),(1478,'Grounding Wire','grounding-wire',457,'Grounding wire is designed to provide a path for electrical currents to flow to the ground in case of a fault or surge. They are made of durable, highly conductive materials in order to ensure efficient electrical flow and withstand harsh environmental conditions. Grounding wire helps to maintain safety during any residential or industrial wire installations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:28:40','2026-05-13 14:28:40'),(1479,'Level Alarms & Gauges','level-alarms-gauges',457,'Drum level alarms and gauges monitor the level of liquid content inside drums. Alarms and gauges constantly monitor and measure overfill with visual and audible signals, helping to avoid costly spills and other hazards.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 14:29:19','2026-05-13 14:29:19'),(1480,'Wire Shelf Trucks','wire-shelf-trucks',1324,'Wire shelf trucks easily store and transport parts, inventory, and supplies in a variety of settings. Various wire coatings like chrome, black epoxy, silver epoxy, zinc-plated, and more make wire rack trucks suitable for wet or dry applications. Durable casters allow wire shelving to become mobile and storage to be available wherever needed. Wire shelves are designed to maximize air and light circulation as well as visibility into contents as well as minimize dust accumulation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:39:33','2026-05-13 15:39:33'),(1481,'Steel Shelf Trucks','steel-shelf-trucks',1324,'Steel shelf trucks are mobile shelving units used to store and transport materials, equipment, supplies, and products in commercial or industrial environments. Constructed of high-quality metal for durability, steel shelf trucks contain multiple tiers of shelves making storing and transporting of large quantities of loads easy. Its durable casters enable seamless portability and mobility around the facility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:39:40','2026-05-13 15:39:40'),(1482,'Shelf Truck Accessories','shelf-truck-accessories-1',1324,'Shelf truck accessories, typically additional shelves, are supplemental components designed to enhance the versatility and functionality of shelf trucks or utility carts. They are constructed of durable materials, including steel or plastic, for long-lasting dependability and feature easy installation and adjustable configurations, allowing users to adapt the cart to specific storage or transportation needs. Shelf truck accessories are commonly used in warehouses, distribution centers, and manufacturing facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:39:43','2026-05-13 15:39:43'),(1483,'Security Carts & Trucks','security-carts-trucks',1324,'Security Carts are enclosed wire mesh carts designed for the secure transport of valuable goods and materials. Designed with durable casters, Security Carts smoothly transports cargo throughout the facility. Its wire mesh provides air circulation and keeps contents visible while its lockable doors prevent items from falling out of the truck as well as unauthorized access. Wire Security Carts are integral equipment for the efficient material handling of goods.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:39:47','2026-05-13 15:39:47'),(1484,'Plastic Shelf Trucks','plastic-shelf-trucks',1324,'Plastic shelf trucks facilitate the easy movement of goods, supplies, and materials within warehouses, distribution centers, and manufacturing facilities. The shelf trucks are equipped with casters, making them ideal mobile storage shelving solutions. The shelves have an open design, offering convenient 4-way access to items in storage.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:39:49','2026-05-13 15:39:49'),(1485,'Aluminum Shelf Trucks','aluminum-shelf-trucks',1324,'Built with smooth-rolling casters for easy mobility & maneuverability around stockrooms & facilities, Aluminum Shelf Trucks are mobile shelving units with adjustable shelves designed for the storage of tools, equipment, inventory, and more. They are made to be durable, strong, and corrosion-resistant and feature an open design that allows access to products from all 4 sides. They are available in assorted sizes and weight capacities to accommodate a wide range of applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:39:52','2026-05-13 15:39:52'),(1486,'Aluminum Packaging Trucks','aluminum-packaging-trucks',1485,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:42:07','2026-05-13 15:42:07'),(1487,'Aluminum Open Sided Shelf Trucks','aluminum-open-sided-shelf-trucks',1485,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:42:09','2026-05-13 15:42:09'),(1488,'Aluminum Forkliftable Order Picking Shelf Trucks','aluminum-forkliftable-order-picking-shelf-trucks',1485,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:42:12','2026-05-13 15:42:12'),(1489,'Camshelving® Elements Series Mobile Units','camshelving-elements-series-mobile-units',1484,'The Camshelving® Elements Series Mobile Units provide high-capacity shelving with smooth mobility. Crafted with open wire design for maximum visibility, they make loading and unloading more effiecient. These units are available in multiple lengths, widths, and heights and can be used in many commercial environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:44:32','2026-05-13 15:44:32'),(1490,'MetroMax® 4 Mobile Shelf Trucks With Microban','metromax-4-mobile-shelf-trucks-with-microban',1484,'MetroMax® 4 mobile shelf trucks provide maximum durability and performance. Constructed of heavy-duty, antimicrobial-protected materials, these trucks resist bacteria growth. With models featuring different shelf amounts, they make storage efficient and can be used in a number of work environments. Available in multiple lengths, widths, and heights.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:44:34','2026-05-13 15:44:34'),(1491,'MetroMax® Q Mobile Shelf Trucks With Microban','metromax-q-mobile-shelf-trucks-with-microban',1484,'MetroMax® Q mobile shelf trucks with Microban are an ideal transport solution for applications such as healthcare, manufacturing, assembly, and more. They feature antimicrobial product protection that inhibits the growth of bacteria, mold, and mildew. With high weight capacities and multiple sizes available, these shelf trucks provide maximum efficiency and convenience.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:44:37','2026-05-13 15:44:37'),(1492,'MetroMax® i Mobile Shelf Trucks With Microban','metromax-i-mobile-shelf-trucks-with-microban',1484,'MetroMax® i Mobile Shelf Trucks with Microban provide a compact and reliable solution for transportation and storage tasks. These shelf trucks feature durable construction with a Microban protective coating to guard against germs and bacteria. All shelf configurations come with removable polymer shelf mats. Lift-off polymer shelves cannot rust or corrode, and are NSF certified.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:44:41','2026-05-13 15:44:41'),(1493,'Steel Forkliftable Security Carts','steel-forkliftable-security-carts',1483,'Our steel forkliftable security carts are designed with heavy duty steel and a secure locking system to protect your valuable items. The trucks feature fork pockets making them forklift compatible for easy transport. Our forkliftable security trucks come equipped with 4 casters, 2 rigid and 2 swivel for easy mobility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:48:04','2026-05-13 15:48:04'),(1494,'Aluminum Security Trucks','aluminum-security-trucks',1483,'Secure your worksite and store materials with these aluminum security trucks. These security trucks feature solid hi-tensile aluminum panels that protect its contents while resisting rust. These aluminum security trucks feature a range of weight capacities and easy maneuverability due to the combination of swivel and rigid casters.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:48:07','2026-05-13 15:48:07'),(1495,'Steel Mesh Job Site Security Trucks','steel-mesh-job-site-security-trucks',1483,'Jobsite security trucks are a versatile and secure storage solution to protect materials in any work environment. They feature a heavy-duty steel construction and are equipped with a locking system to secure contents from theft and vandalism. With various weight capacities, these security trucks are the perfect transport and storage solution for outdoor or indoor jobsites.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:48:13','2026-05-13 15:48:13'),(1496,'Steel Mesh Security Trucks','steel-mesh-security-trucks',1483,'Steel mesh security trucks provide a secure storage solution for valuable tools, materials, and equipment. They feature all-welded, heavy-duty steel construction and a lockable steel mesh door for maximum security. The ergonomic handle, and variety of casters on these security trucks allows for easy maneuverability making them perfect for jobsites, warehouses, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:48:14','2026-05-13 15:48:14'),(1497,'Steel Folding Security Carts','steel-folding-security-carts',1483,'Steel folding security carts feature a heavy-duty steel construction, a powder coat finish for long lasting durability, and a unique folding design for easy storing and transport. With a range of weight capacities, these folding security trucks are ideal for jobsites, construction sites, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:48:16','2026-05-13 15:48:16'),(1498,'Wire Security Trucks','wire-security-trucks',1483,'Wire security trucks provide storage for pharmaceuticals, tools, food and more. These security trucks feature a wire-mesh design to easily see your tools and inventory, and are made with steel for long-lasting strength and durability. Our wire security storage trucks feature a range of capacities and are available in a variety of sizes and options to meet your needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:48:18','2026-05-13 15:48:18'),(1499,'Valley Craft® Shelf Truck Accessories','valley-craft-shelf-truck-accessories-1',1482,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:50:24','2026-05-13 15:50:24'),(1500,'Little Giant® Shelf Truck Adjustable Shelves','little-giant-shelf-truck-adjustable-shelves-1',1482,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:50:26','2026-05-13 15:50:26'),(1501,'Nashville Wire Shelf Truck Adjustable Shelves','nashville-wire-shelf-truck-adjustable-shelves-1',1482,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:50:29','2026-05-13 15:50:29'),(1502,'Global Industrial® Shelf Truck Adjustable Shelves','global-industrial-shelf-truck-adjustable-shelves-1',1482,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:50:32','2026-05-13 15:50:32'),(1503,'2 Side Steel Mesh Panel Shelf Trucks','2-side-steel-mesh-panel-shelf-trucks',1481,'Designed with convenience and engineered for longevity, these trucks are ideal for use in a variety of settings, from warehouses and factories to offices and schools. This shelf truck features two sturdy steel mesh panels, and two rigid and two swivel casters for easy mobility. This two-sided design offers maximum storage capacity, allowing you to transport and store more items in a single trip.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:53:49','2026-05-13 15:53:49'),(1504,'Steel Easy Adjust Boltless Shelf Trucks','steel-easy-adjust-boltless-shelf-trucks',1481,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:53:52','2026-05-13 15:53:52'),(1505,'3 Side Forkliftable Steel Mesh Panel Shelf Trucks','3-side-forkliftable-steel-mesh-panel-shelf-trucks',1481,'These industrial-strength forkliftable 3 sided steel mesh panel trucks are designed to make your workplace more efficient and organized. With a weight capacity of up to 3600 lbs, you can rely on these trucks to handle even the heaviest loads. One of the unique features of these trucks is their forklift compatibility, allowing you to easily move them around your warehouse or factory floor.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:53:54','2026-05-13 15:53:54'),(1506,'3 Side Folding Steel Shelf Trucks','3-side-folding-steel-shelf-trucks',1481,'With weight capacities ranging from 660 to 2000 lbs, this folding shelf truck is a great addition to any industrial space that requires efficient and reliable material handling. The sturdy steel shelves ensure durability and long-lasting use, while the heavy-duty casters ensure smooth and quiet operation. This truck can be easily folded for convenient storage when not in use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:53:57','2026-05-13 15:53:57'),(1507,'3 Side Steel Mesh Panel Shelf Trucks','3-side-steel-mesh-panel-shelf-trucks',1481,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:54:00','2026-05-13 15:54:00'),(1508,'Open Side Steel Shelf Trucks','open-side-steel-shelf-trucks',1481,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:54:03','2026-05-13 15:54:03'),(1509,'3 Sided Steel Mesh Shelf Trucks with Adjustable Shelves','3-sided-steel-mesh-shelf-trucks-with-adjustable-shelves',1481,'Whether you\'re moving tools, equipment, or materials, these shelf trucks are designed to make your job easier. With a 3600 weight capacity, this 3-sided steel mesh truck is the perfect solution for your heavy-duty storage and transportation needs. Equipped with adjustable shelves, this truck allows you to customize the storage space to meet your specific requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:57:42','2026-05-13 15:57:42'),(1510,'3 Side Steel Drop Shelf Trucks','3-side-steel-drop-shelf-trucks',1481,'Made from 13 gauge flattened expanded metal, this storage truck provides stability for heavy items during transport, ensuring that your materials stay safe and secure. This steel truck features a drop-shelf design that allows for easy loading and unloading of items. With a versatile design, and customizable features, this truck is the perfect solution for all your industrial needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:57:45','2026-05-13 15:57:45'),(1511,'Double Sided Steel Slope Shelf Trucks','double-sided-steel-slope-shelf-trucks',1481,'This heavy-duty truck features two sides of sloped shelving, allowing for maximum storage capacity and easy accessibility from either side. Equipped with reliable casters, this truck can move smoothly and easily across any type of flooring. Made with durable steel and built to withstand 1600 pounds of weight, this double sided truck is designed for heavy loads and constant use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:57:48','2026-05-13 15:57:48'),(1512,'3 Side Steel Slatted Frame Shelf Trucks','3-side-steel-slatted-frame-shelf-trucks',1481,'Made from high-quality steel, these slatted shelf trucks are built to withstand the toughest environments and heaviest loads. The slatted design of the shelves allows for improved ventilation and drainage, making these trucks perfect for transporting wet or damp items. Whether you\'re transporting heavy equipment or delicate items, these trucks are the perfect solution for all your handling needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:57:51','2026-05-13 15:57:51'),(1513,'Steel Order Picking Stock Shelf Trucks','steel-order-picking-stock-shelf-trucks',1481,'Designed for use in a range of industries, these heavy-duty stock trucks feature durable steel shelves with weight capacities ranging from 3000 to 3600 lbs. These trucks are built to last with four heavy-duty wheels, making them easy to maneuver in tight spaces. Featuring multiple shelves and a spacious platform, these trucks provide ample storage space for your products.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:57:54','2026-05-13 15:57:54'),(1514,'3 Side Steel Tubular Frame Shelf Trucks','3-side-steel-tubular-frame-shelf-trucks',1481,'The steel tubular frame construction ensures maximum stability and durability, allowing the truck to easily support heavy loads ranging from 1200 to 3600 lbs. Our tubular truck is reinforced and welded cross-braced frame and twin end frames have a durable enamel finish for the ultimate storage and transportation solution.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 15:58:00','2026-05-13 15:58:00'),(1515,'Zinc Plated Wire Shelf Trucks','zinc-plated-wire-shelf-trucks',1480,'Featuring a finish that protects against corrosion, Zinc Plated Wire Shelf Trucks are mobile shelving designed for heavy-duty storage and transport of industrial supplies, tools, and equipment. They are built with high weight capacities & adjustable shelves to provide sturdy support & strength, and attached casters that roll smoothly for enhanced maneuverability. The open wire shelving allows light and sprinkler penetration, as well as visibility and minimal dust accumulation, and the open design provides 4-way access to products.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 16:41:26','2026-05-13 16:41:26'),(1516,'Poly-Green Epoxy Wire Shelf Trucks','poly-green-epoxy-wire-shelf-trucks',1480,'Made with a green epoxy powder coat finish over zinc-chromate electroplating, and the NEXGard treatment, Poly-Green Epoxy Wire Shelf Trucks resist mold, mildew, and bacteria while providing mobile shelving in wet and dry industrial settings. Adjustable shelves with high weight capacities support heavy-duty loads, and attached casters allow workers to maneuver the trucks with ease. Open wire shelving provides visibility, light & sprinkler penetration, and reduced dust buildup, while the open design offers 4-way access to products.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 16:41:29','2026-05-13 16:41:29'),(1517,'Galvanized & Stainless Steel Solid Shelf Trucks','galvanized-stainless-steel-solid-shelf-trucks',1480,'Providing organized storage and convenient mobility for industrial tools and supplies, Galvanized & Stainless Steel Solid Shelf Trucks are mobile shelving with built-in wheels that roll smoothly for easy maneuverability. They feature adjustable shelves with a solid design to keep small parts from falling off and high weight capacities for heavy-duty support. They are made from galvanized or stainless steel for durability, strength, and corrosion-resistance, and the open design provides access to stored products from all 4 sides.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 16:41:32','2026-05-13 16:41:32'),(1518,'Nexelon Blue Epoxy Wire Shelf Trucks','nexelon-blue-epoxy-wire-shelf-trucks',1480,'Wire Shelf Trucks\r\nWire shelf trucks easily store and transport parts, inventory, and supplies in a variety of settings. Various wire coatings like chrome, black epoxy, silver epoxy, zinc-plated, and more make wire rack trucks suitable for wet or dry applications. Durable casters allow wire shelving to become mobile and storage to be available wherever needed. Wire shelves are designed to maximize air and light circulation as well as visibility into contents as well as minimize dust accumulation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 16:41:36','2026-05-13 16:41:36'),(1519,'Stainless Steel Wire Shelf Trucks','stainless-steel-wire-shelf-trucks',1480,'Equipped with casters that roll smoothly for effective mobility, Stainless Steel Wire Shelf Trucks are mobile shelving with adjustable shelves for high-strength storage of industrial tools, supplies, and equipment. The stainless-steel construction is built to withstand rust and corrosion, as well as extreme temperatures, for strength & durability in wet and dry environments, and the open wire shelving provides visibility and light & sprinkler penetration while reducing dust buildup. The open design allows 4-way access to stored items',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 16:41:40','2026-05-13 16:41:40'),(1520,'Black & Silver Epoxy Wire Shelf Trucks','black-silver-epoxy-wire-shelf-trucks',1480,'Built to handle wet and dry environments, Black & Silver Epoxy Wire Shelf Trucks are mobile shelving designed to store and transport tools and equipment. They are finished with a rust-inhibiting undercoat and a powder coat for longevity & durability, and adjustable shelves with high weight capacities support heavy-duty loads. Attached casters roll smoothly for easy mobility & maneuverability, and open wire shelving enhances visibility and light & sprinkler penetration while reducing dust buildup. The open design allows 4-way access to products.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 16:41:42','2026-05-13 16:41:42'),(1521,'Chrome Wire Shelf Trucks','chrome-wire-shelf-trucks',1480,'Boasting adjustable shelves for the organized storage of tools, equipment, and supplies, Chrome Wire Shelf Trucks are mobile shelving units with built-in casters that roll smoothly for simple maneuverability throughout facilities. They feature durable construction with nickel-chrome electroplating for strength and corrosion resistance in dry industrial environments. The open wire shelves enhance visibility and light and sprinkler penetration while minimizing dust accumulation, and the open design allows access to products from all 4 sides.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 16:41:46','2026-05-13 16:41:46'),(1522,'Specialty Stackers','specialty-stackers',1322,'Specialty Stackers are designed to address specific load challenges and meet unique lift requirements. Steel construction provides superior strength and durability, while wheels constructed from rubber and nylon easily glide across warehouse floors. Different height, length, and weight capacity options are ideal for warehouse, industrial, and commercial spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 16:55:52','2026-05-13 16:55:52'),(1523,'Hand Operated Stackers','hand-operated-stackers',1322,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 16:55:56','2026-05-13 16:55:56'),(1524,'Manual Counterbalanced Stackers','manual-counterbalanced-stackers',1322,'Manual Counterbalanced Stackers efficiently lift, transport, and stack loads in industrial settings. The counterbalanced design enhances maneuverability and allows the stacker to get close to the load and be used in confined spaces. Strong wheels and casters make movement easy across facility floors. For easy transport across worksites, these stackers feature a lightweight aluminum frame.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 16:56:02','2026-05-13 16:56:02'),(1525,'Manual Stackers with Adjustable Forks','manual-stackers-with-adjustable-forks',1322,'Manual Stackers with Adjustable Forks are essential for material handling applications. The foot powered hydraulic design is simple to operate and makes lifting effortless. Sturdy handles and strong polyurethane casters make maneuvering these manual stackers easy across warehouse floors. The adjustable forks can cater to different load sizes, making them versatile and efficient.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 16:56:05','2026-05-13 16:56:05'),(1526,'Manual Stackers with Adjustable Straddle','manual-stackers-with-adjustable-straddle',1322,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 16:56:09','2026-05-13 16:56:09'),(1527,'Manual Stackers with Fork Over Fixed Legs','manual-stackers-with-fork-over-fixed-legs',1322,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 16:56:14','2026-05-13 16:56:14'),(1528,'Powered-Lift/Manual-Push Counterbalance Stackers','powered-liftmanual-push-counterbalance-stackers',1322,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 16:56:20','2026-05-13 16:56:20'),(1529,'Powered Stackers with Fork Over Fixed Legs','powered-stackers-with-fork-over-fixed-legs',1322,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 16:56:23','2026-05-13 16:56:23'),(1530,'Powered Counterbalance Stackers','powered-counterbalance-stackers',1322,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 16:56:28','2026-05-13 16:56:28'),(1531,'Powered-Lift/Manual-Push Stackers','powered-liftmanual-push-stackers',1322,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 16:56:31','2026-05-13 16:56:31'),(1532,'Powered Stackers with Adjustable Straddle','powered-stackers-with-adjustable-straddle',1322,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 16:56:34','2026-05-13 16:56:34'),(1533,'Self-Propelled Stackers','self-propelled-stackers',1322,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 16:56:38','2026-05-13 16:56:38'),(1534,'Accessories for Stackers','accessories-for-stackers',1322,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 16:58:24','2026-05-13 16:58:24'),(1535,'Municipal Vehicles','municipal-vehicles',1320,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 17:01:28','2026-05-13 17:01:28'),(1536,'Tow Tractors','tow-tractors',1320,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 17:01:32','2026-05-13 17:01:32'),(1537,'Utility Vehicles','utility-vehicles',1320,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 17:01:35','2026-05-13 17:01:35'),(1538,'Burden Carriers','burden-carriers',1320,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 17:01:39','2026-05-13 17:01:39'),(1539,'Stock Chasers','stock-chasers',1320,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 17:01:42','2026-05-13 17:01:42'),(1540,'Personnel Carriers','personnel-carriers',1320,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 17:01:48','2026-05-13 17:01:48'),(1541,'Powered Tuggers','powered-tuggers',1320,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-13 17:01:48','2026-05-13 17:01:48'),(1542,'Combination Wash Stations','combination-wash-stations',1205,'Combination wash stations are comprehensive safety units designed to provide immediate response to chemical spills, eye injuries, or full-body exposure to hazardous substances. They are constructed of durable corrosion-resistant materials and feature a showerhead that delivers a large volume of water to douse the entire body and an eye wash basin or nozzles designed to gently irrigate the eyes. Ideal for any laboratories, healthcare facilities, and other industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 09:38:39','2026-05-14 09:38:39'),(1543,'Combination Emergency Shower & Eye/Face Wash Station','combination-emergency-shower-eyeface-wash-station',1542,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 09:39:32','2026-05-14 09:39:32'),(1544,'Nexel® Chrome Curbside Trucks','nexel-chrome-curbside-trucks',1521,'Nexel® Chrome Curbside Trucks make curbside delivery and item transport more efficient. They feature a durable chrome finish and steel construction that is made to last. Strong swivel casters make movement easy across all surfaces. The trucks offer 4-way access to items, making loading and distribution more efficient. Various size options allow the trucks to hold several orders at a time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 09:57:54','2026-05-14 09:57:54'),(1545,'Nexel® Chrome Quick Adjust Shelf Trucks','nexel-chrome-quick-adjust-shelf-trucks',1521,'Nexel® Chrome Quick Adjust Shelf Trucks are heavy-duty steel utility trucks with shelves that can be easily adjusted in 1\" increments. They feature unique shelf suspension hooks that allow shelves to be added or adjusted without disassembly. Strong swivel casters allow trucks to easily move across facility and warehouse floors. Multiple length, width, and height options can accommodate loads of all sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 09:57:57','2026-05-14 09:57:57'),(1546,'Nexel® Chrome Shelf Trucks with Solid Bottom','nexel-chrome-shelf-trucks-with-solid-bottom',1521,'Nexel® Chrome Shelf Trucks with Solid Bottom offer easy mobility and are perfect for transporting and storing items. The flat galvanized steel bottom provides a solid base for the heaviest loads. Smooth casters allow the trucks to be easily moved across warehouse and facility floors. These shelf trucks are a great choice for industrial and commercial applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 09:58:00','2026-05-14 09:58:00'),(1547,'Nexel® Chrome 3-sided Shelf Trucks','nexel-chrome-3-sided-shelf-trucks',1521,'The Nexel® Chrome 3-sided Shelf Trucks offer superior storage and item transportation capabilities. These trucks feature enclosed sides and backs, providing an extra level of protection for the items being moved. Heavy duty swivel casters allow for the trucks to be easily maneuvered. High weight capacities allow for heavy loads to be stored. Ideal for a wide range of commercial applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 09:58:03','2026-05-14 09:58:03'),(1548,'Nexel® Chrome ESD Shelf Trucks','nexel-chrome-esd-shelf-trucks',1521,'Nexel® Chrome ESD Shelf Trucks offer a durable, chrome electro-static dissipative construction for safe use with sensitive equipment and electronics. The open wire design allows for proper airflow and limits dust accumulation. They feature adjustable shelves and swivel rubber casters for easy maneuverability. Constructed with steel materials, these shelf trucks are designed to last.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 09:58:07','2026-05-14 09:58:07'),(1549,'Nexel® Chrome Shelf Trucks','nexel-chrome-shelf-trucks',1521,'Nexel® Chrome Shelf Trucks are ideal for storage and transportation needs. Nickel-chrome plated steel allows the trucks to be lightweight, sturdy, and resistant to rust and corrosion. The shelves are adjustable in 1\'\' increments, allowing the storage and transport of all materials. Swivel casters allow for increased maneuverability across warehouses and other commercial facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 09:58:10','2026-05-14 09:58:10'),(1550,'Edsal Chrome Shelf Trucks','edsal-chrome-shelf-trucks',1521,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:09:06','2026-05-14 10:09:06'),(1551,'Metro Chrome Wire Shelf Trucks','metro-chrome-wire-shelf-trucks',1521,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:09:09','2026-05-14 10:09:09'),(1552,'Nexel® Chrome Apparel Trucks','nexel-chrome-apparel-trucks',1521,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:09:13','2026-05-14 10:09:13'),(1553,'Quantum® Chrome Basket Trucks','quantum-chrome-basket-trucks',1521,'Quantum® Chrome Basket Trucks are versatile and practical storage and item transport solutions. Constructed from heavy-duty steel and featuring a chrome finish, these basket trucks are rust-resistant and highly durable. The sloped sides prevent items from falling during transport, while the hopper front allows for easy access to the products being stored. Great for commercial applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:09:17','2026-05-14 10:09:17'),(1554,'Nexel® Chrome Slant Shelf Trucks','nexel-chrome-slant-shelf-trucks',1521,'Nexel® Chrome Slant Shelf Trucks feature slanted shelves that provide clear visibility and easy access to stored items. Adjustable wire shelves are made of heavy-duty steel that ensures longevity and durability. They feature a rear loading design, ensuring easy stock rotation. Polyurethane casters allow the trucks to move smoothly across surfaces. Great for commercial and industrial applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:09:20','2026-05-14 10:09:20'),(1555,'Seville Black Epoxy Wire Shelf Trucks','seville-black-epoxy-wire-shelf-trucks',1520,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:12:13','2026-05-14 10:12:13'),(1556,'Nexel® Nexelate® Silver Epoxy Stock Picking Trucks','nexel-nexelate-silver-epoxy-stock-picking-trucks',1520,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:12:17','2026-05-14 10:12:17'),(1557,'Nexel® Nexelate® Silver Epoxy Wire Curbside Shelf Trucks','nexel-nexelate-silver-epoxy-wire-curbside-shelf-trucks',1520,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:12:21','2026-05-14 10:12:21'),(1558,'Nexel® Black & Silver Epoxy Extra Deep Wire Shelf Trucks with Locking Casters','nexel-black-silver-epoxy-extra-deep-wire-shelf-trucks-with-locking-casters',1520,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:12:25','2026-05-14 10:12:25'),(1559,'Nexel® Black & Silver Epoxy Extra Deep Wire Shelf Trucks','nexel-black-silver-epoxy-extra-deep-wire-shelf-trucks',1520,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:12:28','2026-05-14 10:12:28'),(1560,'Nexel® Black & Silver Epoxy Wire Shelf Trucks with Locking Casters','nexel-black-silver-epoxy-wire-shelf-trucks-with-locking-casters',1520,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:12:36','2026-05-14 10:12:36'),(1561,'Nexel® Black & Silver Epoxy Wire Shelf Trucks','nexel-black-silver-epoxy-wire-shelf-trucks',1520,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:12:40','2026-05-14 10:12:40'),(1562,'Metro Stainless Steel Wire Shelf Trucks','metro-stainless-steel-wire-shelf-trucks',1519,'Metro Stainless Steel Wire Shelf Trucks provide optimal storage and transport of supplies and materials. These shelf trucks feature an open-wire design, promoting air circulation and easy cleaning. The shelves are adjustable in 1\'\' increments, allowing various items to be stored. With durable casters the trucks can be moved easily in warehouses and facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:14:16','2026-05-14 10:14:16'),(1563,'Nexel® Stainless Steel Wire Shelf Trucks','nexel-stainless-steel-wire-shelf-trucks',1519,'Nexel® Stainless Steel Wire Shelf Trucks offer heavy-duty, high-quality storage and transport. The open wire design minimizes dust buildup, allows for proper airflow, permits sprinkler penetration, and makes cleaning simple. Our stainless steel wire shelving with wheels offers different size options and adjustable shelves to hold a wide range of items. Polyurethane swivel casters are smooth-rolling, offering easy and efficient mobility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:14:19','2026-05-14 10:14:19'),(1564,'Freeze Protected Combintion Safety Showers','freeze-protected-combintion-safety-showers',1542,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:15:05','2026-05-14 10:15:05'),(1565,'Combination Shower & Eye/Face Wash Booths','combination-shower-eyeface-wash-booths',1542,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:15:53','2026-05-14 10:15:53'),(1566,'Nexelite® Vented Plastic Mat Shelf Trucks','nexelite-vented-plastic-mat-shelf-trucks',1518,'Nexelite vented plastic mat shelf trucks feature a modular design that allows for easy removal of items for cleaning. Most shelves have a vented open grid surface that is smooth and helps increase air circulation and light penetration. Most models are NSF approved for wet or dry use and have an anti-microbial coating. Shelves are adjustable and trucks easily maneuver on polyurethane stem casters.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:16:13','2026-05-14 10:16:13'),(1567,'Nexel® Nexelon Wire Shelf Trucks','nexel-nexelon-wire-shelf-trucks',1518,'Nexel® Nexelon Wire Shelf Trucks are designed for efficient material handling. These wire shelf trucks, featuring nexelon construction, offer durability and versatility in various industrial applications. Ideal for warehouses and manufacturing environments, these nexelon wire shelf trucks provide a reliable solution for transporting goods.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:16:18','2026-05-14 10:16:18'),(1568,'Self Draining Combination Emergency Stations','self-draining-combination-emergency-stations',1542,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:17:04','2026-05-14 10:17:04'),(1569,'Metro Galvanized Steel Solid Shelf Trucks','metro-galvanized-steel-solid-shelf-trucks',1517,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:18:34','2026-05-14 10:18:34'),(1570,'Nexel® Stainless Steel Solid Shelf Trucks','nexel-stainless-steel-solid-shelf-trucks',1517,'Nexel® Stainless Steel Solid Shelf Trucks are robust and heavy-duty material handling trucks. The solid stainless steel shelves offer a smooth and sturdy surface for transporting heavy loads. Adjustable shelves allow the trucks to hold items of varying sizes. Rubber wheels move smoothly across floors of all surface types. These stainless steel mobile shelving trucks are great for industrial and commercial environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:18:38','2026-05-14 10:18:38'),(1571,'Nexel® Galvanized Solid Shelf Trucks','nexel-galvanized-solid-shelf-trucks',1517,'Nexel® Galvanized Shelf Trucks are durable and versatile material handling solutions. Made of heavy-duty galvanized wire, these carts feature rust-resistant shelves that adjust in 1\" increments, making them perfect for food service, maintenance, and industrial tasks. The open-shelf design allows for items to be easily accessed. Polyurethane swivel casters allow the carts to be moved smoothly.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:18:42','2026-05-14 10:18:42'),(1572,'Palletized Safety Eyewash Station','palletized-safety-eyewash-station',1542,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:19:31','2026-05-14 10:19:31'),(1573,'Nexel® Poly-Green® Wire Shelf Trucks','nexel-poly-green-wire-shelf-trucks',1516,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:20:02','2026-05-14 10:20:02'),(1574,'Nashville Wire Enclosed Trucks','nashville-wire-enclosed-trucks',1515,'Nashville Wire Enclosed Trucks provide secure storage and transportation for various items. They are constructed of heavy-duty steel for durability and lasting strength. The three sided design keeps items enclosed and prevents falling during transport. They are easily maneuverable with smooth swivel casters that make it simple to move heavy loads. Available in a range of weight capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:22:22','2026-05-14 10:22:22'),(1575,'Metro qwikSLOT™ Brite Zinc Wire Shelf Trucks','metro-qwikslot-brite-zinc-wire-shelf-trucks',1515,'Metro qwikSLOT™ brite zinc wire shelf trucks provide both mobility and breathability to improve industrial storage and inventory applications. Zinc plated wire shelf trucks are designed to reduce dust and debri build-up, ensuring a clean storage environment. The mobility of the metro wire shelf trucks enhance flexibility in industrial spaces, making them suitable for dynamic material handling.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:22:28','2026-05-14 10:22:28'),(1576,'Metro Super Erecta Brite Zinc Wire Shelf Trucks','metro-super-erecta-brite-zinc-wire-shelf-trucks',1515,'Metro Super Erecta Brite Zinc Wire Shelf Trucks offer a mobile storage solution for easy transport in industrial settings. These heavy-duty trucks have a rust-resistant and NSF-certified zinc-plated construction. The open wire design promotes air circulation and reduces dust buildup. The heavy-duty build allows support for high-capacity loads.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:22:31','2026-05-14 10:22:31'),(1577,'Seville Plated Wire Shelf Trucks','seville-plated-wire-shelf-trucks',1515,'Seville plated wire shelf trucks offer a mobile storage solution for industrial workspaces such as warehouses and manufacturing areas where efficient material transport is crucial. Heavy duty wire shelf trucks feature a plated wire construction to facilitate air circulation, minimizing dust. The steel construction offers corrosion resistance and is easy to clean.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:22:35','2026-05-14 10:22:35'),(1578,'Decontamination Showers','decontamination-showers',1205,'Suitable for use in medical facilities, laboratory settings, industrial environments, and other areas where dangerous contaminants may be present, Decontamination Showers effectively remove chemicals and other hazardous materials from clothing and skin. They come with a drain or collection pool to contain wastewater, and they feature a built-in tent or screen to ensure privacy during use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:28:02','2026-05-14 10:28:02'),(1579,'Portable Decontamination Showers','portable-decontamination-showers',1578,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:28:47','2026-05-14 10:28:47'),(1580,'Bin & Tote Carts','bin-tote-carts',1323,'Bin and tote carts are an efficient way to organize and transport small tools, parts, goods, inventory within bins or totes. They hold durable storage bins and totes on swivel casters for easy movement through a workspace. Made from heavy-duty materials for lasting durability, bin carts are ideal for use in healthcare settings, distribution centers, warehouses, or other environments where efficient material handling is essential.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:38:36','2026-05-14 10:38:36'),(1581,'Chair & Table Carts','chair-table-carts',1323,'Chair and table carts are designed for efficient storage and transport of chairs and tables. With a durable and mobile design, heavy duty carts facilitate setup and storage in event venues, offices, and educational institutions. Ideal for event planners and facility managers, chair and table carts offer a practical solution for organizing and moving furniture.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:38:58','2026-05-14 10:38:58'),(1582,'Foodservice Carts','foodservice-carts',1323,'Foodservice carts transport and display food, dishes, utensils, and other items in dining settings. They are made from durable materials in order to withstand repeated use and are easy to clean and disinfect. Their reliable casters and wheels brings accessibility and portability of food or dining utensils and equipment. Foodservice carts are ideal for restaurants, cafeterias, bakeries, concessions, and catering.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:39:28','2026-05-14 10:39:28'),(1583,'Instrument Carts','instrument-carts',1323,'Instrument Carts are indispensable for efficient instrument, equipment, and supply management. Crafted from robust materials such as industrial-grade plastic and sturdy metal frames, industrial instrument carts are built to withstand demanding use. Smooth-rolling casters ensure effortless mobility and easy access while ergonomic handles streamline the organization of instruments and tools. Instrument carts are ideal for facilities requiring reliable and accessible instrument transport and storage solutions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:39:51','2026-05-14 10:39:51'),(1584,'Janitorial & Housekeeping Carts','janitorial-housekeeping-carts',1323,'Janitorial & Housekeeping Carts make transporting cleaning supplies, trash, or linens simple. Carts feature heavy-duty construction and superior maneuverability through its sturdy casters; some units include lockable lids and multiple shelves for efficient organization. Standard, high-security, and compact janitorial carts are ideal cleaning equipment to tidy-up factory floors, manufacturing plants, commercial offices, hotels, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:40:20','2026-05-14 10:40:20'),(1585,'Luggage Carts','luggage-carts',1323,'Luggage carts are designed to transport luggage, baggage, and other items in various settings, such as airports, hotels, train stations, cruise terminals, and more. They typically feature a sturdy frame and platform deck constructed from durable materials that can withstand heavy loads and frequent use. Bellman carts feature large, smooth-rolling wheels that ensure easy maneuverability and smooth navigation across different surfaces, including carpeted floors and uneven terrain.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:40:45','2026-05-14 10:40:45'),(1586,'Mail & File Carts','mail-file-carts',1323,'Mail and file carts are designed to streamline mail distribution, document handling, and organization. The carts are equipped with wheel casters for easy maneuverability, allowing users to transport mail, files, or documents with minimal effort. Available in both wire and solid construction options, catering to different preferences and applications. They are ideal for corporate offices, schools, and industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:41:16','2026-05-14 10:41:16'),(1587,'Media Carts','media-carts',1323,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:41:39','2026-05-14 10:41:39'),(1588,'Medical Supply Carts','medical-supply-carts',1323,'Medical supply carts offer ample storage of devices, supplies, instruments, and equipment in hospitals, pharmacies, clinics, and other healthcare facilities. Designed for mobility, medical storage carts feature smooth casters and locking mechanisms for security. Whether for acute emergency care, bedside storage, or surgical procedures, these carts are engineered for safe storage and quick access of medical supplies and devices when needed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:42:05','2026-05-14 10:42:05'),(1589,'Pegboard & Louvered Panel Carts','pegboard-louvered-panel-carts',1323,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:42:29','2026-05-14 10:42:29'),(1590,'Shopping Baskets & Carts','shopping-baskets-carts',1323,'Shopping baskets and carts are designed to enhance the shopping experience by providing customers with a convenient way to carry their purchases while navigating through stores. They feature a durable construction for long-lasting dependability and ergonomic handles for comfortable carrying or pushing. Shopping baskets and carts are available in varying sizes to accommodate different shopping needs, making them ideal for supermarkets, department stores, convenience stores, and other retail establishments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:42:51','2026-05-14 10:42:51'),(1591,'Spill Containment Carts','spill-containment-carts',1323,'Spill containment carts are specialized mobile units designed to address and manage hazardous spills in industrial, laboratory, and commercial environments. They facilitate the safe transport and disposal of hazardous substances, ensuring compliance with safety regulations and minimizing worker exposure risks. Spill containment carts are designed to resist the corrosive effects of various chemicals, making them suitable for handling a range of hazardous substances.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:43:13','2026-05-14 10:43:13'),(1592,'Stanchion Carts','stanchion-carts-1',1323,'Stanchion carts are specialized carts designed to transport and store stanchions, posts, and related crowd control equipment efficiently. The carts are ideal for streamlining crowd management systems\' setup, teardown, and storage. Stanchion carts are equipped with wheels or casters, offering easy mobility and maneuverability. They are used in various settings, including stadiums, convention centers, theaters, and arenas, facilitating smooth crowd management during events.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:43:39','2026-05-14 10:43:39'),(1593,'Tool Carts','tool-carts',1323,'Tool carts are portable storage solutions that keep tools and small equipment organized and easily accessible wherever needed. Made with durable materials, rolling tool carts feature gliding drawers, sizable compartments, and integral shelves to optimize the way tools are stored and kept secure. Outfitted with smooth-rolling casters for easy maneuverability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:44:00','2026-05-14 10:44:00'),(1594,'Welding Carts','welding-carts',1323,'Welding carts are functional tools designed to enhance the efficiency of welding operations by organizing tools and materials. They provide ample storage space, allowing for easy transportation and access to equipment, which can improve productivity and safety on the job. Welding carts are durable and mobile, making them essential for welders who work in commercial and industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:44:21','2026-05-14 10:44:21'),(1595,'Wheelbarrows & Garden Carts','wheelbarrows-garden-carts',1323,'Wheelbarrows and garden carts provide an efficient way to transport soil, mulch, plants and more from point A to point B. Wheelbarrows and garden carts offer industrial grade heavy-duty options, as well as light-duty wheelbarrows. Wheelbarrows and garden carts help with gardening, landscaping, hauling and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:45:14','2026-05-14 10:45:14'),(1596,'Drench Hoses','drench-hoses',1205,'Drench hoses are integral parts of an emergency eyewash station or shower that provides a controlled flow of water to flush the eyes, face, or other parts of the body when a person is exposed to hazardous substances. They feature flexible hose heads for quick use and easy maneuverability. Drench hoses are ideal for use in laboratories and other workplaces where personnel could be exposed to harmful chemicals or materials.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:48:11','2026-05-14 10:48:11'),(1597,'Wall Mount Drench Hoses','wall-mount-drench-hoses',1596,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:48:48','2026-05-14 10:48:48'),(1598,'Deck Mount Drench Hoses','deck-mount-drench-hoses',1596,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:49:25','2026-05-14 10:49:25'),(1599,'Drench Showers','drench-showers',1205,'Drench showers are emergency safety fixtures designed to provide a rapid and thorough deluge of water to individuals exposed to hazardous materials or substances. They quickly and effectively rinse contaminants from the body to minimize the impact of chemical, biological, or other hazardous exposures. Drench showers are ideal for use in laboratories, industrial facilities, and educational institutions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:50:10','2026-05-14 10:50:10'),(1600,'Wall Mount Drench Showers','wall-mount-drench-showers',1599,'Drench showers are emergency safety fixtures designed to provide a rapid and thorough deluge of water to individuals exposed to hazardous materials or substances. They quickly and effectively rinse contaminants from the body to minimize the impact of chemical, biological, or other hazardous exposures. Drench showers are ideal for use in laboratories, industrial facilities, and educational institutions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:51:10','2026-05-14 10:51:10'),(1601,'Floor Mount Drench Showers','floor-mount-drench-showers',1599,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:51:50','2026-05-14 10:51:50'),(1602,'Ceiling Mount Drench Showers','ceiling-mount-drench-showers',1599,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:52:26','2026-05-14 10:52:26'),(1603,'Ring Main Mount Drench Showers','ring-main-mount-drench-showers',1599,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:52:55','2026-05-14 10:52:55'),(1604,'Multi Tier Container Stock Carts','multi-tier-container-stock-carts',1580,'Multi Tier Container Stock Carts are great for stock picking and maneuvering small parts to workstations. Made with heavy duty welded steel, our stock carts feature two to three tiers, making it easy to separate and organize bins and totes. These',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:53:23','2026-05-14 10:53:23'),(1605,'Tote Transportation Cart','tote-transportation-cart',1580,'Tote Transportation Carts ensure streamlined product handling and efficient transport in industrial environments. The sturdy steel frame, along with the push handle equipped with swivel casters, enables smooth maneuverability throughout facilities. These distribution carts are designed to accommodate attached lid containers measuring 27\"L x 16-1/2\"W x 12-1/2\"H. Containers sold separately.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:53:28','2026-05-14 10:53:28'),(1606,'Two In One Bin & Tote Carts','two-in-one-bin-tote-carts',1580,'Two In One Bin & Tote Carts offer workspace organization and material transport in industrial settings. These storage carts have a heavy duty build that withstands various weight capacities and is supported by casters that offer unit mobility. The top and bottom shelves on these carts have flip down sides to allow for various work surface configurations. Optional Bin Rail Kits are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:53:31','2026-05-14 10:53:31'),(1607,'Modular Classroom Bin Carts','modular-classroom-bin-carts',1580,'Modular Classroom Bin Carts are ideal for organizing educational materials. Each classroom storage cart is equipped with bins, a removable pegboard side panel, and lockable swivel casters that make maneuvering between classrooms easy. The durable aluminum frame ensures lasting use in schools. These mobile classroom storage cabinets have a sturdy tabletop that adds usable work and storage space',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:53:34','2026-05-14 10:53:34'),(1608,'Bin Service Carts','bin-service-carts',1580,'Bin Service Carts are an ideal storage option for material handling operations. With swivel casters, a push handle, and top shelf, these bin carts can streamline small parts storage and transport in industrial settings. Bins are made of corrosion resistant polyethylene, and the frames have a heavy gauge steel build for long lasting use. Capacities, bin quantities, and dimensions vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:53:37','2026-05-14 10:53:37'),(1609,'Bin Tower Carts','bin-tower-carts',1580,'Bin Tower Carts keep equipment and supplies organized, making them ideal for industrial parts storage. These tower storage carts have multiple pull-out bins for easy access to materials. The smooth-rolling casters effortlessly maneuver the tower storage cart throughout facilities, while the durable build ensures lasting performance. Our mobile bin storage units come in various configurations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:53:40','2026-05-14 10:53:40'),(1610,'Flip Out Bin Carts','flip-out-bin-carts',1580,'Flip Out Bin Carts are ideal for efficient & organized material handling. These versatile carts have a flip-out bin design for easy access and item retrieval. The durable build and smooth-rolling casters make these mobile parts carts perfect for industrial applications. The bins provide ample storage capacity, and we offer double-sided flip-out bin carts for increased storage capacity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:53:44','2026-05-14 10:53:44'),(1611,'Chrome Wire Carts for Dividable Grid Containers','chrome-wire-carts-for-dividable-grid-containers',1580,'Chrome Wire Carts for Dividable Grid Containers are ideal for storing parts in industrial settings. These chrome wire bin carts have an open design & adjustable slides to reduce dust build up, offer visibility, and easy access to contents. Our heavy duty chrome wire carts can hold various weight capacities and have casters for unit mobility. Carts ship unassembled and come in various heights.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:53:48','2026-05-14 10:53:48'),(1612,'Easy Access Chrome Wire Shelf Bin Carts','easy-access-chrome-wire-shelf-bin-carts',1580,'Easy Access Chrome Wire Shelf Bin Carts are perfect for parts picking and assembly operations. Our easy access storage carts feature slanted shelves that offer content visibility and promote a first in-first out rotation system. The durable steel build and swivel casters with brakes support various weight capacities. These slant shelf storage carts have a flat bottom shelf for standard storage.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:53:52','2026-05-14 10:53:52'),(1613,'Lug Tote Box Carts','lug-tote-box-carts',1580,'Lug Tote Box Carts are ideal for transporting and storing small parts, components, food, and recyclables. Our lug carts have an all-welded build with swivel casters for durability and mobility in industrial settings. Slide runners allow quick and easy bin access. Tote box carts are offered in many styles and configurations to fit a variety of bins. Bins and totes are sold separately.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:53:59','2026-05-14 10:53:59'),(1614,'Eyewash Bottles & Kits','eyewash-bottles-kits',1205,'Eyewash bottles and kits are designed to offer immediate relief in case of eye exposure to harmful substances. The eyewash bottles are compact and portable, allowing for easy storage and accessibility in various work settings. They are ideal for use in factories, manufacturing plants, and industrial facilities where workers may be exposed to chemicals, dust, or debris.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:54:42','2026-05-14 10:54:42'),(1615,'Eyewash Bottle Kits','eyewash-bottle-kits',1614,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:55:07','2026-05-14 10:55:07'),(1616,'Eyewash Bottle Mounts','eyewash-bottle-mounts',1614,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:58:15','2026-05-14 10:58:15'),(1617,'Eyewash Solution','eyewash-solution',1614,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:58:50','2026-05-14 10:58:50'),(1618,'Eyewash Stations','eyewash-stations',1205,'Eyewash stations are emergency safety devices designed to provide immediate flushing of the eyes in case of exposure to hazardous chemicals or substances. They are equipped with hands-free operation, allowing users to hold their eyes open while the water flows. Eyewash stations comply with ANSI and OSHA regulations, featuring quick activation, easy accessibility, and a steady water flow to ensure effective eye irrigation. They are ideal for laboratories, industrial facilities, workshops, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 10:59:44','2026-05-14 10:59:44'),(1619,'Wall Mount Eyewash Stations','wall-mount-eyewash-stations',1618,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:00:28','2026-05-14 11:00:28'),(1620,'Faucet Mount Eyewash Stations','faucet-mount-eyewash-stations',1618,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:01:04','2026-05-14 11:01:04'),(1621,'Pedestal Mount Eyewash Stations','pedestal-mount-eyewash-stations',1618,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:01:34','2026-05-14 11:01:34'),(1622,'Deck Mount Eyewash Stations','deck-mount-eyewash-stations',1618,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:01:58','2026-05-14 11:01:58'),(1623,'Triple-Bay Tote Racks','triple-bay-tote-racks',1580,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:02:32','2026-05-14 11:02:32'),(1624,'Tote Rack Accessories','tote-rack-accessories',1580,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:02:35','2026-05-14 11:02:35'),(1625,'Single-Bay Tote Racks','single-bay-tote-racks',1580,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:02:38','2026-05-14 11:02:38'),(1626,'Double-Bay Tote Racks','double-bay-tote-racks',1580,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:02:41','2026-05-14 11:02:41'),(1627,'Parts Carts','parts-carts',1580,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:02:44','2026-05-14 11:02:44'),(1628,'Mobile Steel Bin Unit','mobile-steel-bin-unit',1580,'Steel Mobile Bin Units offer secure, versatile, and portable storage solutions for small parts, tools, nails, and more. They feature a durable steel frame for long-lasting use, four swivel casters for peak maneuverability, and an ergonomic handle to easily move around industrial spaces. These mobile bin carts come equipped with bins that unclip from the rails for easier access and restocking.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:02:48','2026-05-14 11:02:48'),(1629,'Chrome Wire Shelf Trucks with Cross Stack Tubs & Nesting Totes','chrome-wire-shelf-trucks-with-cross-stack-tubs-nesting-totes',1580,'Chrome Wire Shelf Trucks with Cross Stack Tubs & Nesting Totes are a unique mobile storage option for bulky items. They can withstand various weight capacities and are supported by reinforced shelves with a truss perimeter and rugged swivel casters. The containers are made with corrosion-resistant, FDA approved HDPE and tubs nest when empty or can be turned 90° for cross stacking.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:02:51','2026-05-14 11:02:51'),(1630,'Wire Shelving Carts with Quickpick Double Hopper Bins','wire-shelving-carts-with-quickpick-double-hopper-bins',1580,'Wire Shelving Carts with Quickpick Double Hopper Bins efficiently store and move supplies where you need them. Our wire storage carts feature two sided hopper bins with a Quickpick design for easy access to contents, improving productivity in busy environments. With their sturdy construction and swivel casters, these mobile wire shelving carts offer reliable mobility and long-lasting performance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:02:55','2026-05-14 11:02:55'),(1631,'Organization Drawer Carts','organization-drawer-carts',1580,'Organization Drawer Carts put storage and supplies at your fingertips. These easy-to-assemble organizer drawer carts are offered in many configurations to meet storage requirements and optimize storage space in any industrial setting. The rolling casters add mobility and lock for unit stability. Drawer quantities range with additional dimensions and specifications varying per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:02:58','2026-05-14 11:02:58'),(1632,'Eyewash Stations & Showers Accessories & Parts','eyewash-stations-showers-accessories-parts',1205,'Eyewash stations and shower accessories enhance the functionality and reliability of eyewash stations and emergency showers. By replacing or improving existing aspects of the unit, the accessories and parts help to ensure the functionality of the showers and eyewash stations, keeping individuals who work in hazardous environments safe. They can be used in applications such as laboratories and industrial facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:02:58','2026-05-14 11:02:58'),(1633,'Dual Sided Sloped Shelf Bin Cart','dual-sided-sloped-shelf-bin-cart',1580,'The Sloped Shelf Bin Carts are durable carts made of welded steel, featuring sloped shelves and casters, which make them perfect for industrial storage and transportation purposes. The carts have multiple shelves on each side, providing ample space for storage. Retaining lips are included to ensure the secure placement of bins. Bins are not included with the carts.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:03:01','2026-05-14 11:03:01'),(1634,'Global Industrial™ Eyewash Stations & Showers Accessories & Parts','global-industrial-eyewash-stations-showers-accessories-parts',1632,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:04:28','2026-05-14 11:04:28'),(1635,'Bradley® Eyewash Stations & Showers Accessories & Parts','bradley-eyewash-stations-showers-accessories-parts',1632,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:04:56','2026-05-14 11:04:56'),(1636,'Guardian Equipment Eyewash Stations & Showers Accessories & Parts','guardian-equipment-eyewash-stations-showers-accessories-parts',1632,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:05:40','2026-05-14 11:05:40'),(1637,'Speakman Eyewash Stations & Showers Accessories & Parts','speakman-eyewash-stations-showers-accessories-parts',1632,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:06:10','2026-05-14 11:06:10'),(1638,'Haws® Eyewash Stations & Showers Accessories & Parts','haws-eyewash-stations-showers-accessories-parts',1632,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:06:44','2026-05-14 11:06:44'),(1639,'Bel-Art Eyewash Stations & Showers Accessories & Parts','bel-art-eyewash-stations-showers-accessories-parts',1632,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:07:11','2026-05-14 11:07:11'),(1640,'Honeywell Safety Eyewash Stations & Showers Accessories & Parts','honeywell-safety-eyewash-stations-showers-accessories-parts',1632,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:07:47','2026-05-14 11:07:47'),(1641,'Hughes® Eyewash Stations & Showers Accessories & Parts','hughes-eyewash-stations-showers-accessories-parts',1632,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:08:15','2026-05-14 11:08:15'),(1642,'ATS ShieldSafe® Eyewash Stations & Showers Accessories & Parts','ats-shieldsafe-eyewash-stations-showers-accessories-parts',1632,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:08:45','2026-05-14 11:08:45'),(1643,'Axion Advantage® Eyewash Stations & Showers Accessories & Parts','axion-advantage-eyewash-stations-showers-accessories-parts',1632,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:09:13','2026-05-14 11:09:13'),(1644,'Mixing Valves','mixing-valves-1',1205,'Mixing valves are an efficient way to safely blend hot and cold water in a tempering system. Thermostatic mixing valves combine precision and durability to provide a safe, regulated flow of tempered water blended to precise temperature requirements. Valves are ideal for commercial and industrial applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:14:44','2026-05-14 11:14:44'),(1645,'Accessories','accessories',1581,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:17:09','2026-05-14 11:17:09'),(1646,'Music Stand Carts','music-stand-carts',1581,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:17:13','2026-05-14 11:17:13'),(1647,'Multi-Use Chair Carts','multi-use-chair-carts',1581,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:17:16','2026-05-14 11:17:16'),(1648,'Chair and Table Combo Carts','chair-and-table-combo-carts',1581,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:17:18','2026-05-14 11:17:18'),(1649,'Round Table Carts','round-table-carts',1581,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:17:22','2026-05-14 11:17:22'),(1650,'Rectangle Table Carts','rectangle-table-carts',1581,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:17:26','2026-05-14 11:17:26'),(1651,'Multi-Use Table Carts','multi-use-table-carts',1581,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:17:28','2026-05-14 11:17:28'),(1652,'Folding Chair Carts','folding-chair-carts',1581,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:17:31','2026-05-14 11:17:31'),(1653,'Stacking Chair Carts','stacking-chair-carts',1581,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:17:35','2026-05-14 11:17:35'),(1654,'Lid Closers & Openers','lid-closers-openers',457,'Lid openers and closers are essential tools in material handling, specifically designed to secure and efficiently close and open drum and pail lids. Many models offer adjustable settings to accommodate different lid sizes and types, providing versatility in handling various containers. Available in manual, pneumatic, or electric versions, providing flexibility based on user preferences, the scale of operations, and power source availability. They are ideal for commercial use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:21:17','2026-05-14 11:21:17'),(1655,'Lifters & Grabs','lifters-grabs',457,'Used with forklifts, cranes, hoists, or hooks, Lifters and grabs easily and safely lift, transport, and lower heavy drums, barrels, and pails. They are made of heavy-duty materials for lasting durability and are designed to easily and securely latch onto the load in order to move it. Lifters and grabs are ideal for use in manufacturing facilities, warehouses, factories, and other industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:22:37','2026-05-14 11:22:37'),(1656,'Locks','locks',457,'Drum locks are designed to securely lock drum lids to prevent spillage, contamination, and unauthorized access to hazardous materials. They minimize the risk of accidents during drum handling, preventing spills, leaks, and other potential incidents that could harm workers or the environment. Drum locks fit a variety of drum types, sizes, and materials, providing versatility and making them ideal for manufacturing plants, warehouses, and distribution centers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:23:10','2026-05-14 11:23:10'),(1657,'Pumps','pumps-1',457,'Drum pumps safely transfer liquids from drum containers, minimizing the risk of spills. Available in various formats, including piston, siphon, and rotary, they can withstand oils, minor acids, and other fluids. Manual and electric drum pumps are best used in manufacturing, agriculture, and other industrial environments, while food-grade pumps are specially designed for use in food and beverage processing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:23:48','2026-05-14 11:23:48'),(1658,'Valve Adapters & Hardware','valve-adapters-hardware',457,'Valve adapters and hardware are essential components that enhance the functionality, versatility, and safety of IBC systems. Available in a variety of sizes and configurations, they ensure compatibility with different valve types, making them adaptable for use with a wide array of IBC models and manufacturers. Perfectly suited for commercial and industrial applications, they enhance efficiency and reliability in handling liquids and materials.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:24:23','2026-05-14 11:24:23'),(1659,'Wrenches','wrenches',457,'Drum wrenches and sockets are engineered to streamline drum handling tasks with efficiency and ease. They provide the perfect solution for tightening or loosening drum bungs. With durable construction and precision engineering, these tools ensure reliable performance and long-lasting durability, even in demanding industrial environments. Serving as indispensable tools, drum wrenches optimize all drum handling operations, contributing to enhanced workplace efficiency.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:25:10','2026-05-14 11:25:10'),(1660,'Battery Transporters','battery-transporters-1',458,'Battery transporters enable a single person to load, move, and unload heavy forklift batteries into forklifts. Utilizing steel rollers, heavy-duty forklift battery transfer carts facilitate an easy and smooth transferring of a battery into the forklift. Designed to transport heavy batteries in industrial settings, forklift battery transfer platforms enhance operational safety and contribute to a more efficient material handling process.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:27:22','2026-05-14 11:27:22'),(1661,'Brooms & Scrapers','brooms-scrapers-1',458,'Brooms and scrapers serve distinct cleaning purposes. Push brooms efficiently remove dust and debris from floors, while floor scrapers tackle stubborn materials like gum and adhesive residue, ensuring complete floor cleanliness. These versatile tools are valuable for reducing labor and equipment costs in industrial warehouses, manufacturing, construction, and commercial spaces while maintaining cleanliness and safety.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:28:14','2026-05-14 11:28:14'),(1662,'Carpet Poles & Coil Rams','carpet-poles-coil-rams-1',458,'Carpet poles and coil rams are forklift attachments that give the machines the ability to safely lift cylindrical loads such as carpet, steel coils, wire spools, and more. They are made of solid steel materials and can handle high-weight capacities with ease. Different lengths and diameters ensure the attachments can efficiently lift loads of all sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:28:58','2026-05-14 11:28:58'),(1663,'Cranes & Hooks','cranes-hooks-1',458,'Forklift cranes and hooks are designed to safely lift and position heavy items. Built with longevity in mind, they feature durable construction and high weight capacities to lift even the heaviest loads with ease. Boom cranes and hooks are ideal for warehouse and manufacturing environments and can be easily mounted onto trucks or forklifts.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:29:27','2026-05-14 11:29:27'),(1664,'Cylinder Racks','cylinder-racks-1',458,'Cylinder Racks provide a safe and convenient solution for handling, storing, and transporting gas cylinders. Cylinder management is made more flexible with varying sizes and quantities available. Cylinder storage racks comply with safety regulations, ensuring upright storage of gas cylinders to minimize accidents and prevent damage. Cylinder Racks can significantly enhance safety and operational efficiency in gas cylinder handling, whether utilized in a warehouse, manufacturing facility, or forklift.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:30:09','2026-05-14 11:30:09'),(1665,'Dumpers','dumpers-1',458,'Dumpers are designed to enhance the efficiency of forklift operations, making waste disposal and material transfer a breeze. They are ideal for industries that require consistent material handling and disposal, such as manufacturing, construction, and waste management. Dumpers help save time and reduce work-related injuries caused by lifting and dumping heavy waste containers. The adjustable attachment design of the dumpers provides compatibility with various forklift models and fork sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:30:44','2026-05-14 11:30:44'),(1666,'Forklift Accessories','forklift-accessories-2',458,'Forklift attachments are each designed to handle specific tasks and improve forklift functionality. They include fork extensions, hoppers, loaders, cranes, hooks, clamps, dumpers, brooms, and more. Accessories enhance the usability of forklifts and range from safety lights and mirrors to tool holders and carts, all of which are built to withstand the rigorous demands of industrial use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:31:20','2026-05-14 11:31:20'),(1667,'Forklift Platforms & Personnel Lifts','forklift-platforms-personnel-lifts-1',458,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:32:00','2026-05-14 11:32:00'),(1668,'Forklifts','forklifts-1',458,'Forklifts are designed to lift and transport palletized cargo around any facility, factory, or commercial building. Commercial forklifts are built for heavy duty lifting and precise maneuverability of heavy loads. With various front load capacities and raising heights, forklift machines are ideal for any commercial and industrial application.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:33:25','2026-05-14 11:33:25'),(1669,'Forks & Extensions','forks-extensions-1',458,'Forklift fork extensions are designed to improve load stability and provide extra support for lifting large objects. Forklift extensions are installed onto existing forks to increase forklift capacity to accommodate oversize loads. Fork extensions are available in a variety of sizes and materials for a range of applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:34:39','2026-05-14 11:34:39'),(1670,'Pallet Pullers','pallet-pullers-1',458,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:35:33','2026-05-14 11:35:33'),(1671,'Self Dumping Hoppers & Loaders','self-dumping-hoppers-loaders-2',458,'Self Dumping Hoppers & Loaders are a great way to move large, heavy items or bulk material from one place to another in construction or material handling settings. They are made of highly durable materials that can be easily cleaned and maintained for long lasting dependability. Industrial hoppers and loaders conveniently attach to forklifts for ease of use, or come equipped with casters for effortless maneuverability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:36:07','2026-05-14 11:36:07'),(1672,'Tow Equipment','tow-equipment-1',458,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:36:51','2026-05-14 11:36:51'),(1673,'Configurable Ladders & Platforms','configurable-ladders-platforms',459,'Configurable ladders and platforms are designed to provide safe access to elevated areas that are difficult to reach. They can be transformed into different configurations, such as A-frame ladders, extension ladders, or scaffolding depending on the needs of the user. This is essential in industries such as construction, maintenance, and warehousing, where workers need to access elevated shelves, equipment, or structures.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:40:34','2026-05-14 11:40:34'),(1674,'Crossover Ladders','crossover-ladders',459,'Crossover ladders provide a safe way for people to cross over obstacles or machinery in industrial settings. They are built with a sturdy construction and often come with handrails to enhance safety. Ladders function as elevated walkways, allowing workers to easily move across areas with potential obstacles, such as conveyors or pipes. Crossover ladders improve accessibility and provide secure pathways for workers in industrial environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:41:41','2026-05-14 11:41:41'),(1675,'Meal Delivery Carts','meal-delivery-carts',1582,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:41:59','2026-05-14 11:41:59'),(1676,'Serving Carts','serving-carts',1582,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:41:59','2026-05-14 11:41:59'),(1677,'Kitchen Carts','kitchen-carts',1582,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:42:05','2026-05-14 11:42:05'),(1678,'Beverage Carts','beverage-carts',1582,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:42:08','2026-05-14 11:42:08'),(1679,'Vending Carts','vending-carts',1582,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:42:12','2026-05-14 11:42:12'),(1680,'Food Transport Carts','food-transport-carts',1582,'Food transport carts are essential for the safe and efficient movement of food items around commercial kitchens, catering businesses, hotels, and more. These carts are specifically designed with durable materials like stainless steel or aluminum, ensuring hygiene, durability, and ease of cleaning. They accommodate different food service needs with various configurations, including enclosed or open styles. They come equipped with smooth-rolling casters offering easy maneuverability, even in tight spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:42:15','2026-05-14 11:42:15'),(1681,'Mounted Ladders','mounted-ladders',459,'Mounted ladders are versatile and practical solutions for safely and efficiently accessing elevated areas. They have integrated safety features such as handrails, safety cages, or guardrails to protect workers. Many mounted ladders are designed with a compact profile, making them suitable for use in confined spaces or areas with limited clearance. They are ideal for various applications, including warehouses, distribution sites, and industrial facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:42:17','2026-05-14 11:42:17'),(1682,'Pan Carriers & Racks','pan-carriers-racks',1582,'Pan Carriers & Racks provide efficient and organized storage solutions for your commercial foodservice needs. Sheet pan racks are designed with durable materials and heavy duty wheels to accommodate and transport large quantities of sheet pans, ensuring easy access and optimal organization in commercial kitchens.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:42:18','2026-05-14 11:42:18'),(1683,'Bus Carts','bus-carts',1582,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:42:21','2026-05-14 11:42:21'),(1684,'Tray & Utensil Carts','tray-utensil-carts',1582,'Tray and utensil carts provide reliable support for trays and utensils, making it easy to store and transport supplies efficiently. Ideal for various industries, including foodservice, rolling tray carts and utensil carts offer organization and accessibility for smooth operations and quick access to essential items.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:42:24','2026-05-14 11:42:24'),(1685,'Multi Use Ladders','multi-use-ladders',459,'Ideal for a variety of maintenance, construction, and installation tasks, Multi Use Ladders are built with multiple steps and various height options to allow workers to reach high areas. The multifunction design enables different configurations to suit changing jobsite tasks, and they come in a range of weight capacities for different uses. Combination ladders are crafted from durable, lightweight materials, such as fiberglass or aluminum, for strength and convenient handling.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:42:55','2026-05-14 11:42:55'),(1686,'Personnel Lifts','personnel-lifts',459,'Personnel lifts provide a safe and secure elevated platform for stock picking, equipment maintenance, or general access. Stock pickers give users easy access to shelves and racking systems, while scissor lifts and mobile vertical lifts make hard-to-reach areas like mezzanines and ceilings more accessible. Personnel lifts are ideal for manufacturing facilities, office buildings, schools, and other commercial buildings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:43:48','2026-05-14 11:43:48'),(1687,'Rolling Ladders','rolling-ladders',459,'Rolling ladders are mobile solutions designed for safe and efficient access to high shelves in warehouses, offices, and retail spaces. Equipped with wheels, they offer easy mobility and secure footing. Available in different heights, these ladders meet OSHA safety standards to reduce workplace accidents. Ideal for stockrooms and industrial use, rolling ladders enhance productivity while ensuring safety during elevated tasks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:44:26','2026-05-14 11:44:26'),(1688,'Safety Cage Ladders','safety-cage-ladders',459,'Safety cage ladders are specialized ladders utilized for accessing raised areas. Featuring a protective cage at the top to prevent falls and evenly spaced steps, they are constructed from durable materials like steel or aluminum. These ladders are frequently employed in buildings, factories, warehouses, and other environments where workers need to safely ascend to elevated locations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:45:19','2026-05-14 11:45:19'),(1689,'Scaffolding','scaffolding',459,'Scaffolding bases and stages provide a stable and secure platform for workers to access different heights during construction, maintenance, and repair tasks. Designed for safe elevation, they enable workers to reach overhead structures or perform tasks at varying heights with confidence. Whether on construction sites, industrial facilities, or warehouses, scaffolding bases and stages are indispensable tools for ensuring safety and efficiency in various applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:45:56','2026-05-14 11:45:56'),(1690,'Stairs','stairs',459,'Mounted stairs are OSHA and IBC compliant solutions for personnel to safely access elevated areas in a workplace. Easy to install, Stairways can be integrated with existing stable structures or as freestanding units accommodating various space layouts and entrance heights. They feature safety handrails and threaded-step surfaces to minimize slipping. Ideal for use in warehouses, manufacturing facilities and other industrial work spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:46:41','2026-05-14 11:46:41'),(1691,'Step Ladders','step-ladders',459,'Step ladders are portable, free-standing ladders constructed with durable, foldable metal frames. Designed to provide safe access to elevated heights in various settings, they feature an A-frame design for self-support. Some step ladders have steps on both sides, allowing two people to work on a task from a single ladder. Available in Type I, Type IA, and Type IAA duty ratings, industrial step ladders offer stable support for tasks such as stocking, maintenance, and repairs, ensuring worker safety in hard-to-reach spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:47:32','2026-05-14 11:47:32'),(1692,'Step Stools','step-stools',459,'Step stools are designed with 1-3 steps to provide safe and stable access to slightly-elevated heights in a workspace. They feature non-slip step surfaces to increase safety, and are typically lightweight and easy to move. Step stools and ladders are ideal for use in offices, schools, warehouses, and other commercial spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:48:13','2026-05-14 11:48:13'),(1693,'Straight & Extension Ladders','straight-extension-ladders',459,'Straight and extension ladders facilitate safe access to elevated areas such as rooftops, ceilings, shelves, and more. They are essential tools for construction projects, renovations, and building maintenance, allowing workers to reach different levels of a structure. The ladders have an extension mechanism that will enable them to extend to various heights. They also have a foldable or telescopic design for transport and easy storage when not in use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:48:53','2026-05-14 11:48:53'),(1694,'Tray And Utensil Rack Carts','tray-and-utensil-rack-carts',1684,'Tray and utensil rack carts are designed for use in cafeterias, restaurants, and other food service areas. The swivel casters make it easy to maneuver, and the trays offer ample storage for utensils, containers, napkins, and other necessary items. Utensil rack carts are available in a variety of sizes and colors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:48:57','2026-05-14 11:48:57'),(1695,'Cambro Cutler Racks - No Cart','cambro-cutler-racks-no-cart',1684,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:49:00','2026-05-14 11:49:00'),(1696,'Folding Shelf Carts','folding-shelf-carts',1684,'Folding shelf carts are ideal for room service, dessert trays, or extra storage space. These service carts fold to store easily behind doors, in between counters, or in the back of delivery vans for off-site functions. The top shelf has ergonomically shaped easy-grip handles at both ends. Carts are made from durable, lightweight aluminum with mulitple shelves and a various weight capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:49:04','2026-05-14 11:49:04'),(1697,'Fold & Store Service Table Carts','fold-store-service-table-carts',1684,'Our fold & store service table carts provide a convenient mobile workstation that folds for easy storage. Polyurethane ball-bearing casters offer easy mobility. Folding service cart features a laminated plastic top and a heavy-duty wire storage basket underneath. The cart is easy to assemble and can hold various weight capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:49:07','2026-05-14 11:49:07'),(1698,'Rubbermaid® Max System™ Plastic Tray Carts & Trucks','rubbermaid-max-system-plastic-tray-carts-trucks',1684,'Rubbermaid® plastic tray trucks can be used for food preparation or to help restock shelves. The web plastic construction is heat, chemical, and impact resistant. The open design allows easy access to contents and maximum ventilation. Spanner bars and extrusion kits are also available to customize your plastic tray cart.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:49:10','2026-05-14 11:49:10'),(1699,'Mobile Steel Pan & Tray Rack Trucks','mobile-steel-pan-tray-rack-trucks',1684,'Mobile steel pan and tray rack trucks allow easy movement of industrial materials or food service items. Tray trucks feature an angle iron construction for lasting performance and bolt-on polyurethane casters for easy mobility. Perforated or solid 16 gauge steel trays are also available and slide easily into place.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:49:17','2026-05-14 11:49:17'),(1700,'Adjustable Steel Tray Trucks','adjustable-steel-tray-trucks',1684,'Enhance your sorting and transportation experience with our adjustable steel tray trucks. Build with heavy duty gauge steel channel uprights and a sturdy square tube base frame, these trucks ensure unparalleled durability. The hook-on trays, featuring convenient integral handles, effortlessly adjust at their centers, streamlining your workflow. Various models are available for extra versatility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:49:17','2026-05-14 11:49:17'),(1701,'Nexel® Chrome Wire Tray Carts & Trucks','nexel-chrome-wire-tray-carts-trucks',1684,'Nexel® chrome wire tray carts distribute materials for manufacturing areas, food service areas, and more. Open design allows maximum air circulation while minimizing dust accumulation. These wire tray carts have rubber bumpers to help protect walls. Tray stop kits are also available to help prevent trays from sliding out.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:49:19','2026-05-14 11:49:19'),(1702,'Work Platforms','work-platforms',459,'Work Platforms elevate workers to a comfortable height and provide a stable surface for maintenance or operational tasks. With its frame, platform, and legs built from durable materials, platforms can enhance safety and ergonomic comfort in various industrial or commercial settings, including factories, warehouses, manufacturing facilities, workshops, and restaurants. Engineered with non-slip surfaces to secure footing and can be adjusted to accommodate different height preferences.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:49:37','2026-05-14 11:49:37'),(1703,'Lift Table Accessories','lift-table-accessories',460,'Lift table accessories are designed to improve the functionality and extend the lifespan of the material handling equipment. Bellow Way Covers, Portable Carts, Turret Bearings, Lift Table Covers, and Foot Controls are integral accessories designed to improve lift table operations. Replacement parts and accessories are available for various types of lift tables including scissor-lift tables, pallet carousels, and positioners. All accessories are constructed with heavy-duty materials and are designed to seamlessly integrate with lift tables.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:50:54','2026-05-14 11:50:54'),(1704,'Mobile Lift Tables','mobile-lift-tables',460,'Mobile lift tables simplify the lifting, lowering, and transportation of heavy goods. Equipped with durable casters, these tables enable operators to effortlessly maneuver heavy loads throughout the facility. Their hydraulic scissor lifts provide an ergonomic solution, promoting workplace safety by enabling the smooth raising and lowering of cargo to help prevent jobsite injuries.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:51:36','2026-05-14 11:51:36'),(1705,'Mobile Work Positioning Tables','mobile-work-positioning-tables',460,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:52:13','2026-05-14 11:52:13'),(1706,'Pallet Carousels & Positioners','pallet-carousels-positioners',460,'Pallet carousels and positioners are essential tools for efficiently and safely handling palletized loads in any warehouse or stock handling environment. They allow for smooth and controlled rotation, positioning, and elevation of pallets. Pallet carousels and positioners are built to withstand heavy loads, provide exceptional stability, enable easy access to goods, and optimize workflow in various industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:52:54','2026-05-14 11:52:54'),(1707,'Stationary Lift Tables','stationary-lift-tables',460,'Lift tables and tilt tables suit various industries designed to meet the demands of heavy-duty material handling tasks. Stationary lift tables provide a safe and efficient solution for raising, lowering, and positioning heavy loads. Whether powered manually, electrically, or by air, lift tables’ robust construction and advanced features are ideal for use across manufacturing facilities, warehouses, distribution centers, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 11:53:40','2026-05-14 11:53:40'),(1708,'Cart Accessories','cart-accessories',1683,'Upgrade your bus cart with various accessories to create more storage and help you stay organized. Bus cart silverware holders, trash bins, and single-shelf panel sets are available to help keep your cart in top condition. Accessories come in various sizes and colors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:00:18','2026-05-14 12:00:18'),(1709,'Service & Busing Utility Carts','service-busing-utility-carts',1683,'Wide selection of service & busing utility carts perfect for any commercial or industrial space. Service carts feature up to 4 shelves, locking storage cabinets, and swivel casters making them easy to maneuver. With a variety of sizes and different shelf types, these busing carts are sure to meet any of your workplace storage or transportation needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:00:23','2026-05-14 12:00:23'),(1710,'Bus Carts','bus-carts-1',1683,'Bus carts are a perfect solution for busy restaurants, catering halls, and other food service applications. Most carts are manufactured from stainless steel for lasting and dependable use. Many different styles are available with open or closed sides and varying numbers of shelves. Silverware holders are also available to help keep carts organized. Specific dimensions vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:00:25','2026-05-14 12:00:25'),(1711,'Turntables','turntables',460,'Turntables provide an ergonomic and efficient way to rotate, position, or transfer palletized loads, reducing the risk of injuries and improving overall productivity. All units are made from durable materials to handle repeated use and heavy loads of pallets or skids, and some turntables can be mounted or placed on the floor for easy accessibility. Turntables are best used for manufacturing, warehousing, logistics, and other industrial applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:01:03','2026-05-14 12:01:03'),(1712,'Catwalks & Mezzanines','catwalks-mezzanines',461,'Catwalks and mezzanines are overhead workspace solutions that provide convenient access to different areas. They are made of durable materials and can support heavy-duty loads. Mezzanines and catwalks can be reconfigured as needed and are ideal for any industrial facilities, warehouses, entertainment spaces and manufacturing plants.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:03:01','2026-05-14 12:03:01'),(1713,'Universal Pan Racks','universal-pan-racks',1682,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:03:19','2026-05-14 12:03:19'),(1714,'Advance Tabco Welded Aluminum Pan Racks','advance-tabco-welded-aluminum-pan-racks',1682,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:03:23','2026-05-14 12:03:23'),(1715,'Rubbermaid Pan Rack','rubbermaid-pan-rack',1682,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:03:26','2026-05-14 12:03:26'),(1716,'Winholt Pan And Platter Racks','winholt-pan-and-platter-racks',1682,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:03:29','2026-05-14 12:03:29'),(1717,'Specialty Pan Racks','specialty-pan-racks',1682,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:03:38','2026-05-14 12:03:38'),(1718,'Winco Pan Racks','winco-pan-racks',1682,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:03:38','2026-05-14 12:03:38'),(1719,'Nexel® Pan Racks','nexel-pan-racks',1682,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:03:40','2026-05-14 12:03:40'),(1720,'Inplant Offices','inplant-offices',461,'Inplant offices create separate, private work spaces within existing production floors or warehouse areas. Their modular design ensures easy setup, flexibility, and portability to suit any location in need of a dedicated office space. Inplant offices feature doors for privacy and noise reduction as well as windows to accommodate natural light. They can function as indoor or outdoor pre-screening stations, security guard shacks, and are well-suited for health screenings, temperature checks, and security protocols.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:04:06','2026-05-14 12:04:06'),(1721,'Tray Carts','tray-carts',1680,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:05:20','2026-05-14 12:05:20'),(1722,'Equipment Stands','equipment-stands',1680,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:05:22','2026-05-14 12:05:22'),(1723,'Pan Dollies','pan-dollies',1680,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:05:24','2026-05-14 12:05:24'),(1724,'Enclosed Mobile Transport Cabinets','enclosed-mobile-transport-cabinets',1680,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:05:28','2026-05-14 12:05:28'),(1725,'Modular Office Components','modular-office-components',461,'Modular office components are pre-made parts that can be customized to specific needs and quickly installed in industrial or warehouse settings. The offering includes partition walls, duplex outlets, HVAC wall units, data cable phone jacks, and more allowing for versatile configurations and various setups. These components are durable, provide sound insulation, and are commonly used to maximize space usage and create organized work environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:06:36','2026-05-14 12:06:36'),(1726,'Camcruiser® Vending Carts','camcruiser-vending-carts',1679,'Camcruiser® vending carts are ideal for any food service area. Vending carts are made of durable polyethylene that won\'t crack, dent, bubble, chip, or break. Most carts feature a large lower storage cabinet and a brightly colored umbrella. Food storage compartments are insulated and can maintain food safe temperatures for hours. Various sizes and colors are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:07:00','2026-05-14 12:07:00'),(1727,'Mobile Beverage Centers','mobile-beverage-centers',1678,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:13:46','2026-05-14 12:13:46'),(1728,'Origami Collapsible Shelving, Racks & Accessories','origami-collapsible-shelving-racks-accessories',1677,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:15:57','2026-05-14 12:15:57'),(1729,'Nexel® Poly-Z-Brite® Wire Microwave Carts','nexel-poly-z-brite-wire-microwave-carts',1677,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:16:00','2026-05-14 12:16:00'),(1730,'School Carts','school-carts',1676,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:17:26','2026-05-14 12:17:26'),(1731,'Indoor Serving Cart','indoor-serving-cart',1676,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:17:30','2026-05-14 12:17:30'),(1732,'Outdoor Serving Cart','outdoor-serving-cart',1676,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:17:34','2026-05-14 12:17:34'),(1733,'High Profile Meal Delivery Carts','high-profile-meal-delivery-carts',1675,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:19:53','2026-05-14 12:19:53'),(1734,'Low Profile Meal Delivery Carts','low-profile-meal-delivery-carts',1675,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:19:56','2026-05-14 12:19:56'),(1735,'Instrument Carts with Flush Top','instrument-carts-with-flush-top',1583,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:22:26','2026-05-14 12:22:26'),(1736,'Instrument Carts with Tray Top','instrument-carts-with-tray-top',1583,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:22:29','2026-05-14 12:22:29'),(1737,'Instrument Carts with Flat Top','instrument-carts-with-flat-top',1583,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:22:32','2026-05-14 12:22:32'),(1738,'Motorized Housekeeping Carts','motorized-housekeeping-carts',1584,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:27:54','2026-05-14 12:27:54'),(1739,'Sanitization Carts','sanitization-carts',1584,'Sanitization Carts provide the user with a convenient and efficient way to transport the supplies needed for frequent cleaning and disinfecting of facilities. These carts provide ample storage for sanitizing materials, equipment, and tools. Ideal for healthcare, schools, and hospitality industries.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:27:57','2026-05-14 12:27:57'),(1740,'Mobile Waste Collector Cart','mobile-waste-collector-cart',1584,'The Mobile Waste Collector Carts offer an efficient and safe way to transport waste. Waste carts include ergonomic handlebars and 4\" casters that allow for easy transportation. These carts are great for large-scale cleaning jobs and offer plenty of storage for supplies.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:28:00','2026-05-14 12:28:00'),(1741,'Compact Janitorial Carts','compact-janitorial-carts',1584,'Compact Janitorial Carts are excellent for organizing and transporting janitorial supplies. They have a slim design with multiple shelves and are equipped with locking casters, to ensure the secure storage of maintenance. These carts are particularly beneficial for quick cleans required throughout the day, while their heavy-duty construction guarantees durability to tackle demanding tasks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:28:06','2026-05-14 12:28:06'),(1742,'Janitorial Carts with Supplies','janitorial-carts-with-supplies',1584,'These janitorial carts come complete with necessary supplies for prepping, cleaning, and emptying trash. These carts feature sturdy shelves, mop and broom holders, collection bag, and more. Our high-density plastic janitorial carts hold everything, are easy-to-clean and withstand constant heavy use. Choose from a wide selection of popular vinyl and poly models.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:28:09','2026-05-14 12:28:09'),(1743,'High Security Janitorial Carts','high-security-janitorial-carts',1584,'High security janitorial carts provide maximum protection in your facility. These carts have a sturdy locking system to secure supplies, and feature enclosed tops to prevent pilfering. They are made from corrosion-resistant materials, and are available in a variety colors and sizes',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:28:13','2026-05-14 12:28:13'),(1744,'Janitorial Cart Accessories & Replacements','janitorial-cart-accessories-replacements',1584,'The Janitorial Cart Accessories & Replacements section is a great place to find all of the items you need for your janitorial cart. From bags and buckets to signs, shelves, textiles, replacement wheels and casters, you\'ll find everything you need to keep your cart in top working order. You can even customize your cart to suit your own unique cleaning needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:28:15','2026-05-14 12:28:15'),(1745,'Standard Janitorial Carts','standard-janitorial-carts',1584,'Standard Janitorial Carts are designed specifically for cleaning and maintenance. Durable and reliable, they contain various compartments and features to help keep cleaning supplies organized. From built-in mop holders to large bag compartments, these carts make it easy to transport necessary materials.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:28:19','2026-05-14 12:28:19'),(1746,'Housekeeping Carts','housekeeping-carts',1584,'Housekeeping Carts are essential for any cleaning staff, allowing for plenty of supplies to be stored in one place. These carts are easy to maneuver and feature sturdy dividers and shelf surfaces perfect for storing everything you need. They come in various sizes and colors to fit your needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:28:22','2026-05-14 12:28:22'),(1747,'Modular Wall Systems','modular-wall-systems',461,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:34:41','2026-05-14 12:34:41'),(1748,'Safety Swing Gates','safety-swing-gates',461,'Safety swing gates can be added to rails to provide accessibility to equipment while also creating a safer work environment for employees and personnel on manufacturing floors and construction sites. They may be spring-loaded and swing back into place when released, preventing unauthorized entry. Fully adjustable, swing gates can be customized to fit in various spaces. Mezzanine gates provide access to loading docks and other manufacturing areas that are elevated.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:35:28','2026-05-14 12:35:28'),(1749,'Wire Panels & Components','wire-panels-components',461,'Wire machine guards are modular panels that allow users to create secure areas around the facility. Panel guards can be used to create secure barriers and enclosures around machinery and equipment to prevent unauthorized access and to minimize the risk of accidents. Its wire mesh design offers unrestricted ventilation and visibility into the secured area.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:36:58','2026-05-14 12:36:58'),(1750,'Global Industrial™ Thermostatic Mixing Valves','global-industrial-thermostatic-mixing-valves',1644,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:38:27','2026-05-14 12:38:27'),(1751,'Guardian Equipment Thermostatic Mixing Valves','guardian-equipment-thermostatic-mixing-valves',1644,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:39:15','2026-05-14 12:39:15'),(1752,'Bradley Thermostatic Mixing Valves','bradley-thermostatic-mixing-valves',1644,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:39:40','2026-05-14 12:39:40'),(1753,'Speakman® Thermostatic Mixing Valves & Replacement Valves','speakman-thermostatic-mixing-valves-replacement-valves',1644,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:40:06','2026-05-14 12:40:06'),(1754,'Zurn Thermostatic Mixing Valves','zurn-thermostatic-mixing-valves',1644,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:40:51','2026-05-14 12:40:51'),(1755,'Wire Security Rooms','wire-security-rooms',461,'Wire security rooms are specialized enclosures designed to provide secure and controlled access areas within industrial and commercial settings. They are constructed using durable wire mesh panels that offer strength and visibility, allowing for clear, unobstructed views of items within the enclosure. Wire security rooms are typically used in warehouses, distribution centers, and manufacturing facilities where controlled access areas are needed to safeguard valuable assets, sensitive equipment, or hazardous materials.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:41:14','2026-05-14 12:41:14'),(1756,'Portable Eyewash Stations','portable-eyewash-stations',1205,'Portable eyewash stations are a convenient safety solution for warehouses, laboratories, and more. They offer immediate relief for eyes that have been exposed to contaminants by flushing the eye with water. Portable eyewash tanks and stations feature user-friendly components, resulting in immediate relief in hazardous setting.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:41:39','2026-05-14 12:41:39'),(1757,'Gravity Fed Portable Eyewash Stations','gravity-fed-portable-eyewash-stations',1756,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:42:07','2026-05-14 12:42:07'),(1758,'Heated Gravity Fed Portable Eyewash Stations','heated-gravity-fed-portable-eyewash-stations',1756,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:42:34','2026-05-14 12:42:34'),(1759,'Pressurized Portable Eyewash Stations','pressurized-portable-eyewash-stations',1756,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:42:59','2026-05-14 12:42:59'),(1760,'Heated Pressurized Portable Eyewash Stations','heated-pressurized-portable-eyewash-stations',1756,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:43:23','2026-05-14 12:43:23'),(1761,'Fully Enclosed Powertable Eyewash Trailer','fully-enclosed-powertable-eyewash-trailer',1756,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:43:52','2026-05-14 12:43:52'),(1762,'Refills & Water Preservatives for Portable Eyewash Stations','refills-water-preservatives-for-portable-eyewash-stations',1756,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:44:14','2026-05-14 12:44:14'),(1763,'All Terrain Pallet Jack Trucks','all-terrain-pallet-jack-trucks-1',474,'All Terrain Pallet Jack Trucks are designed to raise and lower loads for quick material handling operations on outdoor and indoor surfaces. The ergonomics handle operations have forward/reverse speeds, lift/lower controls, and emergency reverse-function. Dimensions and power types vary per model. Our versatile pallet trucks roll smoothly over uneven surfaces and can hold loads up to 4000 lbs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:44:16','2026-05-14 12:44:16'),(1764,'Galvanized & Stainless Steel Pallet Jack Trucks','galvanized-stainless-steel-pallet-jack-trucks-1',474,'The same great features of a standard pallet jacks, but made of stainless steel or galvanized steel. Clean environment pallet jacks are specifically designed for corrosive or extremely wet environments and ideal for use in the foodservice industry, laboratories, and clean rooms. Available in a range of weight capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:45:01','2026-05-14 12:45:01'),(1765,'Anchorage Connectors','anchorage-connectors',1208,'Anchorage connectors are crucial components in fall protection systems, ensuring the safety of personnel working at elevated heights. An anchorage connector is designed to securely attach to structural elements and are compatible with fall protection equipment like lifelines and lanyards. Fall protection anchorage connectors are easy to install and their robust design and compatibility with a range of fall protection gear ensures a safe work environment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:46:14','2026-05-14 12:46:14'),(1766,'Body Belts','body-belts',1208,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:46:46','2026-05-14 12:46:46'),(1767,'Confined Space Rescue Equipment','confined-space-rescue-equipment',1208,'Confined space rescue equipment is crucial for ensuring safety in hazardous work environments. Tailored specifically for emergencies in confined spaces, these specialized tools and gear include harnesses, tripods, and retrieval systems that aid in safe extraction and evacuation. Rescue equipment for confined spaces enhances worker safety in various industrial industries, including construction and mining.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:47:44','2026-05-14 12:47:44'),(1768,'Fall Protection Kits','fall-protection-kits',1208,'Fall Protection Kits are safety packages designed to provide essential equipment for workers performing tasks at elevated heights. The kits are crucial for occupational safety, ensuring workers have the tools to prevent falls and limit risks. Strong materials like steel and polyester can hold high weight capacities, ensuring workers are secure. The fall protection equipment is compact and lightweight, allowing easy storage and transport. Great for tasks such as window cleaning, construction, and roofing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:48:36','2026-05-14 12:48:36'),(1769,'Deluxe Hotel Luggage Platform Trucks','deluxe-hotel-luggage-platform-trucks',1585,'Move luggage around hotels easily with our deluxe hotel luggage platform trucks. These luggage trucks feature large casters for easy mobility, and a durable waterproof deck for moving around the largest suitcases. Some of these platform luggage trucks feature a carpet covering the deck to prevent luggage from falling during transport.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:57:40','2026-05-14 12:57:40'),(1770,'CSL Economy Bellman Luggage Carts','csl-economy-bellman-luggage-carts',1585,'The CSL economy bellman luggage carts are a convenient and affordable way to transport luggage in hotels, resorts, and more. These carts are constructed with a sturdy steel frame for extra durability, and feature quiet casters for easy mobility. Our bellman luggage carts come equipped with a rubber bumper to protect walls and doors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:57:44','2026-05-14 12:57:44'),(1771,'CSL Bellman Utility Luggage Platform Truck','csl-bellman-utility-luggage-platform-truck',1585,'The CSL Bellman utility luggage platform truck is ideal for airports, hotels, and more. It features a heavy-duty platform that can easily handle heavy luggage, and 4 casters for easy maneuverability around tight corners. Some models of luggage trucks are sold with a carpeted platform to prevent luggage from slipping.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:57:47','2026-05-14 12:57:47'),(1772,'Forbes Bellman Luggage Carts','forbes-bellman-luggage-carts',1585,'The Forbes Bellman Luggage Carts provide an ideal solution for transporting large amounts of luggage. The durable steel construction, ergonomic handle, and swivel casters make maneuvering and transporting luggage a breeze. Our bellman luggage carts are available in various sizes and colors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:57:50','2026-05-14 12:57:50'),(1773,'Hospitality 1 Source Bellman Luggage Carts','hospitality-1-source-bellman-luggage-carts',1585,'The Hospitality 1 Source Bellman Luggage Carts allow guests to easily and conveniently transport their luggage. They are designed to be both durable and long lasting. These bellman luggage carts feature semi to full pneumatic wheels for easy mobility, and bars for hanging garment bags. Some models are compact making them perfect for airports.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:57:53','2026-05-14 12:57:53'),(1774,'Easy-Roll Bellman Hotel Luggage Carts','easy-roll-bellman-hotel-luggage-carts',1585,'The Easy-Roll Bellman Hotel Luggage Carts offer effortless luggage transport. They feature a heavy-duty steel construction, swivel and rigid casters for easy mobility, and a top bar that doubles as a wardrobe hanger. Our hotel luggage carts come equipped with a rubber deck bumper perimeter that protects walls and doorways.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:57:56','2026-05-14 12:57:56'),(1775,'Glaro Bellman Hotel Luggage Carts','glaro-bellman-hotel-luggage-carts',1585,'Glaro bellman luggage carts are ideal for hotels due to their durable steel construction. They come equipped with casters for easy mobility, and a closed loop carpeted deck to prevent items from slipping. These bellman luggage carts also feature bars for convenient garment bag hanging.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:58:00','2026-05-14 12:58:00'),(1776,'Glaro Bellman Condo Luggage Carts','glaro-bellman-condo-luggage-carts',1585,'Glaro bellman condo luggage carts are the perfect solution for condos, apartments, nursing homes and more. These luggage carts feature heavy-duty construction for long-lasting use. Our bellman luggage carts include a removable secondary shelf for added storage, a rubber bumper to protect walls, and carpet on the shelf and deck to prevent items from slipping.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:58:05','2026-05-14 12:58:05'),(1777,'CSL Heavy Duty Bellman Luggage Carts','csl-heavy-duty-bellman-luggage-carts',1585,'CSL heavy duty bellman luggage carts are ideal for high end hotels, resorts, condo complexes and more. They feature a heavy duty stainless steel tubing construction for long lasting durability. These bellman luggage carts are available in rounded or square styles and come equipped with a slip resistant carpeted deck, and a bar for hanging garments and bags.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:58:08','2026-05-14 12:58:08'),(1778,'Glaro Signature Collection Ball Crown Bellman Luggage Carts','glaro-signature-collection-ball-crown-bellman-luggage-carts',1585,'The Glaro signature collection ball crown bellman luggage carts offer a polished look for hotels, banquet halls and more. Crafted with durable materials, these carts provide an ideal solution for transporting bags and other items. These bellman luggage carts feature casters for optimal maneuverability, and a carpeted deck to prevent bags from sliding off during transport.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:58:11','2026-05-14 12:58:11'),(1779,'Global Industrial™ Bellman Carts','global-industrial-bellman-carts',1585,'Global Industrial bellman luggage carts are perfect for hospitality and other service industries. These multi-purpose carts feature both swivel and rigid casters, allowing for smooth and convenient transportation of luggage, supplies, and other items. Our bellman luggage carts are available in a variety of styles, colors and sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 12:58:14','2026-05-14 12:58:14'),(1780,'Wire Mobile File Carts','wire-mobile-file-carts',1586,'Wire Mobile File Carts offer a practical mobile storage solution for your files. These carts feature multiple tiers of wire shelves, providing ample space for organizing documents and folders. With their sturdy construction and smooth-rolling casters, these mobile wire file carts can be easily maneuvered throughout the office, allowing for convenient file access and transport.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:02:20','2026-05-14 13:02:20'),(1781,'Mesh Tub Mobile Filing Carts','mesh-tub-mobile-filing-carts',1586,'The Mesh Tub Mobile Filing Carts offer efficient file organization and transport. These carts feature a durable steel frame with a mesh tub design, allowing for easy visibility of contents and proper ventilation. With their smooth-rolling casters, these mobile filing carts can be easily maneuvered around the office or workspace, making them ideal for quick file retrieval and distribution.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:02:25','2026-05-14 13:02:25'),(1782,'Mobile Steel Tub File Carts','mobile-steel-tub-file-carts',1586,'Mobile Steel Tub File Carts offer a secure and mobile storage solution for your important documents and files. Constructed with sturdy steel, these carts feature lockable tubs for organized and confidential file storage. Equipped with smooth-rolling casters, these mobile filing carts provide effortless mobility, granting easy access to your files wherever needed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:02:29','2026-05-14 13:02:29'),(1783,'Loaders & Dumpers','loaders-dumpers-1',475,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:02:30','2026-05-14 13:02:30'),(1784,'Wire Utility Basket Mail & Office File Cart','wire-utility-basket-mail-office-file-cart',1586,'Our Wire Utility Basket Mail & Office File Carts offer versatile storage and transport for various items in mailrooms, offices, and more. These carts feature multiple wire baskets that provide ample storage space and easy visibility of contents. With durable construction and smooth-rolling casters, these carts ensure mobility and efficient organization of mail, files, and supplies.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:02:31','2026-05-14 13:02:31'),(1785,'Mail & Office File Carts','mail-office-file-carts',1586,'Streamline office operations with Mail & Office File Carts. These carts come with spacious compartments and shelves, allowing you to efficiently organize and sort mail, documents, and office supplies. These office file carts on wheels are essential in busy mailrooms and offices, offering durability and smooth maneuverability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:02:34','2026-05-14 13:02:34'),(1786,'Electro Kinetic Technologies Pony Express Motorized Mail Room Cart','electro-kinetic-technologies-pony-express-motorized-mail-room-cart',1586,'The Electro Kinetic Technologies Pony Express Motorized Mail Room Cart revolutionizes mail transportation with its motorized design. This cart is designed for efficient mailroom operations, effortlessly moving heavy loads of mail and packages. With its powerful motor and durable construction, this mail room cart ensures swift and secure transport, saving time and effort in busy workspaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:03:21','2026-05-14 13:03:21'),(1787,'Self Dumping Hoppers','self-dumping-hoppers-1',475,'Self-dumping hoppers are essential for waste disposal, scrap collection, and bulk material transport in warehouses, construction sites, and manufacturing facilities. Designed for use with forklifts, these hoppers allow for safe, controlled dumping with minimal effort, improving workplace efficiency and safety. Features durable steel construction and automatic release mechanisms for easy operation. Whether managing industrial waste or transporting heavy materials, self-dumping hoppers provide a reliable, time-saving solution for material handling needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:03:44','2026-05-14 13:03:44'),(1788,'Additional Shelves & Decks','additional-shelves-decks',476,'Replacement shelves provide more than just the ability to replace worn-out or damaged ones; they also support the expansion of existing shelving units. Perfect for diverse setups such as boltless shelving, wire shelving, bulk storage shelves, cabinets, steel, or plastic shelving, these replacement or additional shelves enable effortless increases in storage capacity or upgrades to outdated systems.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:05:00','2026-05-14 13:05:00'),(1789,'Aluminum Shelving','aluminum-shelving',476,'Aluminum shelving is a lightweight but durable storage solution. Aluminum shelving units are modular, allowing easy assembly, disassembly, and reconfiguration. The aluminum corrosion resistance makes it suitable to use in environments where exposure to moisture is a concern. Our aluminum shelving systems are perfect for use in retail spaces, food service, manufacturing, healthcare facilities, and warehouses.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:05:57','2026-05-14 13:05:57'),(1790,'Bin Shelving','bin-shelving',476,'Suitable for small item or part storage in factories, warehouses, and other industrial settings, Bin Shelving is designed to hold a large number of bins for simple organization and easy accessibility. They are available with durable steel construction for the strength to handle heavy-duty loads, as well as wire frame models for air circulation and light & sprinkler penetration with reduced dust accumulation, and they come in pick rack styles that allow open access to the bins for quick retrieval of items.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:06:35','2026-05-14 13:06:35'),(1791,'Boltless Shelving','boltless-shelving',476,'Boltless shelving requires no bolts or nuts to assemble and its open design provides easy access to stored items on all 4-sides. Boltless shelving units are configurable with adjustable shelf decks in different styles including solid decks, wire decks, or perforated decks. Boltless shelving can be expanded with add-on shelves. Low to high-capacity boltless shelving can maximize vertical storage space with a range of unit dimensions, number of shelves, and weight capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:07:11','2026-05-14 13:07:11'),(1792,'Bookcases','bookcases',476,'Bookcases are designed for the organized storage and display of books, documents, and other items. Our commercial bookshelves are constructed of durable materials and feature adjustable shelves, allowing customization to accommodate various book sizes and other objects. Bookcases are commonly used in homes, offices, libraries, and educational institutions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:08:01','2026-05-14 13:08:01'),(1793,'Laptop & Charging Cabinets','laptop-charging-cabinets',1587,'Laptop and charging cabinets serve as essential components in educational spaces, offices, manufacturing environments, and beyond, ensuring laptops are securely stored and consistently charged. These cabinets offer a secure and mobile solution for charging multiple mobile devices simultaneously, such as laptops, tablets, and smartphones. Additionally, charging and storage carts and stations can be locked to guarantee safety and security during storage periods.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:10:21','2026-05-14 13:10:21'),(1794,'Computer Stands & Carts','computer-stands-carts',1587,'Computer carts and stands provide customized workspaces designed to accommodate and organize computer equipment, components, and accessories. With mobile computer carts and workstations, users can enjoy the flexibility of portable workspaces that can be deployed wherever needed. Whether it\'s secure storage solutions in the form of computer cabinets, specialized computer carts for healthcare environments, or sturdy floor-mounted workstations ideal for warehouses, these versatile options offer practical workspace solutions for any setting.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:10:31','2026-05-14 13:10:31'),(1795,'Book Trucks','book-trucks',1587,'Built with multiple shelves to accommodate large quantities of books, movies, and more, mobile Book Trucks provide a simple way to store and transport media in public & school libraries, book stores, studios, and more. They are equipped with smooth-rolling wheels for easy maneuverability, and models with side handles give users additional better control when pushing or pulling. Constructed from durable materials, such as steel for strength & stability, and wood-look materials for a professional, elegant appearance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:10:31','2026-05-14 13:10:31'),(1796,'Audio Visual Carts','audio-visual-carts',1587,'Audio Visual Carts are constructed with durable materials to facilitate the transportation and organization of audiovisual equipment in commercial and industrial settings. Audio visual carts and stands feature ample storage space to store various audio visual equipment, ensuring efficient setup of presentations, events, and educational purposes. The casters and wheels make these audio visual carts mobile so that they can be positioned where necessary.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:10:31','2026-05-14 13:10:31'),(1797,'High Density Track Shelving','high-density-track-shelving',476,'High-density shelving units are versatile solutions for increasing storage capacity in warehouses, garages, workshops, and other industrial facilities without taking up too much space. These high-density track shelves feature a design that minimizes aisle widths and utilizes vertical storage to maximize capacity and enhance organization. High-density storage systems include a set of shelving units that can be customized and configured to meet specific storage needs. Mobile high-density track shelving combines expanded storage capacity with portability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:10:56','2026-05-14 13:10:56'),(1798,'Mobile Shelving','mobile-shelving',476,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:12:02','2026-05-14 13:12:02'),(1799,'Plastic Shelving','plastic-shelving',476,'Plastic shelving provides durable and versatile storage solutions for various environments. With sturdy construction and easy assembly, plastic storage shelves offer a lightweight alternative to traditional shelving. Plastic shelving units are ideal for garages, workshops, and storage rooms by maintaining organized and efficient storage without compromising strength.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:13:03','2026-05-14 13:13:03'),(1800,'Plastic Audio Visual Carts with Sliding Keyboard Shelf','plastic-audio-visual-carts-with-sliding-keyboard-shelf',1796,'Our plastic audio visual carts are ideal in classrooms, boardrooms and more. They are constructed with durable, lightweight plastic for easy mobility and cost effectiveness when compared to similar carts made from steel. Each AV cart features a slide-out shelf for keyboards, casters for easy mobility, and cord wraps for convenience. Some models are available with an additional storage shelf',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:13:11','2026-05-14 13:13:11'),(1801,'Plastic Audio Visual Carts','plastic-audio-visual-carts',1796,'Plastic audio visual carts provide an ideal solution for safely transporting AV equipment. These carts feature a durable plastic construction and are available with multiple shelves. Our audio visual carts come equipped with casters for easy mobility, and a cord wrap for convenience. These carts on wheels are the perfect solution for moving and storing projectors, AV systems, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:13:14','2026-05-14 13:13:14'),(1802,'Steel Audio Visual Carts with Sliding Keyboard Shelf','steel-audio-visual-carts-with-sliding-keyboard-shelf',1796,'Our audio visual carts are made of solid steel frames and shelves for long lasting durability and dependability. Our projector carts have an open design so you can easily store and transport equipment. These steel audio visual carts feature casters for easy mobility, a cord wrap for convenience, and some models come with lockable cabinets for added security.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:13:17','2026-05-14 13:13:17'),(1803,'Steel Audio Visual Carts','steel-audio-visual-carts',1796,'Steel audio visual carts provide convenient moving and storage for AV equipment. These mobile AV carts feature a durable steel construction, multiple shelves for optimal storage, and include casters for easy mobility. Our audio visual carts are perfect for use in the classroom, conference rooms, auditoriums and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:13:22','2026-05-14 13:13:22'),(1804,'Racks','racks',476,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:13:41','2026-05-14 13:13:41'),(1805,'Shelving Accessories & Components','shelving-accessories-components',476,'Shelving accessories enhance the functionality of shelving solutions. Shelf and cabinet dividers improve organization. Strips and ledges ensure that parts and materials remain in place. Shelf doors, enclosure kits, and shelf covers improve the security of storage while shelf and drawer liners protect the storage of tools and sensitive materials. Shelving accessories are necessary to enhance the functionality of any shelving system.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:14:46','2026-05-14 13:14:46'),(1806,'Special Purpose Shelving','special-purpose-shelving',476,'Special purpose shelving collections offer versatile and durable solutions designed for specific storage needs. Whether optimizing warehouse, factory, office, retail, or any other space, these shelves provide a range of options. From record storage shelving for bulk document storage to versatile gondola shelving for creating shopping aisles, and from food prep stations to to-go shelving for foodservice and retail settings, these shelving units are designed to meet unique storage requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:15:27','2026-05-14 13:15:27'),(1807,'Steel Shelving','steel-shelving',476,'Steel shelving is durable, long-lasting and strong. Useful for storage of raw materials, inventory, stock and tools, our steel shelving units come in open and closed options. Mobile steel shelving is a portable, heavy-duty option with true flexibility. Boltless shelving is easy to assemble and provides access from any side. Bulk storage racks support heavy loads and are perfect for the storage of bulky items and large equipment in commercial or industrial spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:16:14','2026-05-14 13:16:14'),(1808,'Wood-Like Book Carts','wood-like-book-carts',1795,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:16:21','2026-05-14 13:16:21'),(1809,'Steel Book Carts','steel-book-carts',1795,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:16:24','2026-05-14 13:16:24'),(1810,'Wall Mount Shelving','wall-mount-shelving',476,'Wall mount shelving units are specifically designed for secure attachment to walls, maximizing vertical storage space and decluttering areas. They are constructed of durable materials for long-lasting dependability and come in diverse configurations, including adjustable wire shelving, corner mount, solid deck, and more. Wall mount shelves are typically used where floor space is limited, including kitchens, garages, warehouses, offices, or retail environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:17:01','2026-05-14 13:17:01'),(1811,'Wire Shelving','wire-shelving',476,'With its open-design, wire rack shelving is an ideal storage solution that maximizes visibility to shelved contents while minimizing dust accumulation in any business, warehouse, or facility that requires efficient and flexible storage. Wire shelving units are available in a variety of finishes including chrome, stainless steel, and black or silver epoxy. They are easy to assemble and available in various sizes and styles to fit any storage need. All industrial and commercial wire shelving for sale is suitable for wet and/or dry environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:17:51','2026-05-14 13:17:51'),(1812,'Computer Stand & Cart Accessories','computer-stand-cart-accessories',1794,'Computer stands and cart accessories enhance functionality in office spaces, healthcare facilities, and other commercial environments. Whether it\'s computer fans, drawers, monitor arms and mounts, or side shelves, these accessories are easy to install and improve workspace efficiency and organization. They provide functional solutions for computer carts, leading to increased productivity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:20:05','2026-05-14 13:20:05'),(1813,'Medical Computer Carts','medical-computer-carts',1794,'Medical computer carts are designed to provide healthcare professionals with a versatile and efficient workspace. Avaliable in a variety of applications including laptop carts, and battery powered carts for a range of uses. The carts allow medical professionals to access mobile electronic health records at the point of care. Available in a variety of sizes and configurations for any commercial or industrial medical space.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:20:08','2026-05-14 13:20:08'),(1814,'Laptop Carts','laptop-carts',1794,'Laptop carts are versatile workspace solutions designed for use with laptop computers. Laptop stands and carts have a sturdy frame with a durable and convenient top that serves as a work surface and platform for electronics. Mobile laptop carts are equipped with casters for easy maneuverability. Some laptop workstations come with built-in storage. Laptop carts are ideal for offices, schools, healthcare settings, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:20:10','2026-05-14 13:20:10'),(1815,'Computer Workstations','computer-workstations',1794,'Computer workstations are versatile, functional solutions designed to optimize workspaces for efficient computer use. With durable frames and sturdy tops, computer carts and workstations provide a convenient work surface for computers, laptops, and monitors and come with storage space. Designed to improve posture and comfort, ergonomic computer workstations feature casters for easy mobility around offices, schools, medical offices, warehouses, and manufacturing facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:20:13','2026-05-14 13:20:13'),(1816,'Computer Cabinets','computer-cabinets',1794,'Computer cabinets are essential for safeguarding computers and other technological equipment in shared workspaces within commercial, industrial and office settings. Heavy-duty computer cabinets offer robust protection against dust, dirt, and damage. Mobile computer cabinets provide portability, flexibility, and convenience with swivel casters. Other computer cabinet configurations offer adjustable shelves and secure locking mechanisms, ensuring the safety and accessibility of valuable computer hardware.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:20:16','2026-05-14 13:20:16'),(1817,'Battery Powered Carts & Workstations','battery-powered-carts-workstations',1794,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:20:19','2026-05-14 13:20:19'),(1818,'FallTech® Fall Protection Kits','falltech-fall-protection-kits',1768,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 13:32:33','2026-05-14 13:32:33'),(1819,'Battery Powered Computer Cabinets','battery-powered-computer-cabinets',1817,'Our battery-powered computer cabinets are designed to keep your computer equipment protected and charged. These battery-powered computer carts feature a rechargeable battery that can keep your computer running for up to 8 hours - no outlet needed. Made of durable steel, these cabinets provide lockable storage and a mobile workstation for warehouses, garages, and other industrial spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:42:28','2026-05-14 14:42:28'),(1820,'Battery Powered Medical Carts','battery-powered-medical-carts',1817,'Our battery-powered medical carts are designed to provide convenient workstations that can stay charged throughout the day while the user is on the move. These carts feature replaceable batteries that provide reliable power for medical devices and equipment and durable casters for mobility. Our powered medical carts are designed to improve workflow efficiency and ensure patient safety.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:42:32','2026-05-14 14:42:32'),(1821,'Battery Powered Carts & Workstations','battery-powered-carts-workstations-1',1817,'Our battery-powered computer carts and workstations are designed to provide mobility and power during your workday. These mobile workstations feature a portable rechargeable battery that can keep your computer running for up to 8 hours. Made with steel, our durable carts feature lockable wheels and shelves for superior organization.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:42:36','2026-05-14 14:42:36'),(1822,'Swappable Battery Powered Carts & Workstations','swappable-battery-powered-carts-workstations',1817,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:42:41','2026-05-14 14:42:41'),(1823,'Anatomical Models & Charts','anatomical-models-charts',480,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:43:53','2026-05-14 14:43:53'),(1824,'Basins & Carafes','basins-carafes',480,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:44:23','2026-05-14 14:44:23'),(1825,'Bedpans','bedpans',480,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:45:05','2026-05-14 14:45:05'),(1826,'Commodes','commodes',480,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:45:39','2026-05-14 14:45:39'),(1827,'Cotton Tipped Applicators','cotton-tipped-applicators',480,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:46:09','2026-05-14 14:46:09'),(1828,'Exam & Treatment Chairs','exam-treatment-chairs',480,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:46:39','2026-05-14 14:46:39'),(1829,'Exam & Treatment Tables','exam-treatment-tables',480,'Exam and treatment tables are essential in medical and healthcare settings, providing a dedicated space for patient examinations, diagnostic procedures, and treatments. They come in various configurations, including work or platform tables, and are made from materials that are easy to clean and disinfect, maintaining a hygienic environment in medical settings. Exam and treatment tables are ideal for medical clinics, hospitals, rehabilitation centers, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:47:13','2026-05-14 14:47:13'),(1830,'Exam Room Consumables','exam-room-consumables',480,'Exam Room Consumables are supplies that help maintain a clean and sterile environment in healthcare settings. Cotton balls, disposable gloves, alcohol prep pads, and more keep both the patient and provider safe when performing examinations and assessments. Exam room supplies are essential for environments where hygiene is paramount such as hospital patient rooms, lab work facilities, nursing home facilities, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:47:59','2026-05-14 14:47:59'),(1831,'Exam Room Flags','exam-room-flags',480,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:48:28','2026-05-14 14:48:28'),(1832,'Glove Dispensers','glove-dispensers',480,'Disposable glove dispensers offer a convenient and hygienic solution for organizing and accessing disposable gloves. With a durable wall-mounted design, glove dispensers keep gloves easily accessible in various work environments. Ideal for healthcare settings, food service establishments, and laboratories, disposable glove dispensers contribute to efficient glove management and hygiene.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:49:11','2026-05-14 14:49:11'),(1833,'Hand Sanitizers','hand-sanitizers',480,'Hand sanitizers are personal care and hygiene products designed to kill germs and bacteria on hands when soap and water are not readily available. They typically contain alcohol, such as ethyl alcohol, isopropyl alcohol, or benzalkonium chloride, as the active ingredient, which effectively kills a broad spectrum of germs. Hand sanitizers come in various forms, including gel, foam, and liquid, to best suit users\' needs. Ideal for use in hospitals, healthcare facilities, offices, schools, restaurants, and public transportation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:49:49','2026-05-14 14:49:49'),(1834,'Heel & Foot Pillows','heel-foot-pillows',480,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:50:25','2026-05-14 14:50:25'),(1835,'Wall-Mounted Computer Cabinets','wall-mounted-computer-cabinets',1816,'Our wall-mounted computer cabinets provide secure storage that frees up counter and table space. These computer storage cabinets feature a compact design that keeps computers protected and easily accessible. Dimensions vary by product. Some wall-mount computer cabinet models feature locking doors for added security.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:50:52','2026-05-14 14:50:52'),(1836,'Countertop Computer Cabinets','countertop-computer-cabinets',1816,'Our industrial countertop computer cabinets offer a secure and compact storage solution for your computer equipment. These desktop computer cabinets are made of durable steel and feature lockable doors to limit monitor and keyboard access and protect equipment from dust and debris. Enclosures for display and CPU are available. Size varies by product.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:50:52','2026-05-14 14:50:52'),(1837,'Mobile Fold-Out Computer Cabinets','mobile-fold-out-computer-cabinets',1816,'Our mobile fold-out computer cabinets offer a convenient, space-saving solution for computer equipment storage. These mobile computer cabinets feature fold-out storage cubbies, adjustable shelves, and locking doors for secure storage. Made with durable steel and four swivel casters, these computer cabinets are built to last and provide mobility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:50:52','2026-05-14 14:50:52'),(1838,'Heavy-Duty Computer Cabinets','heavy-duty-computer-cabinets',1816,'Our heavy-duty computer cabinets are designed to provide durable protection and security for computer equipment in industrial settings. Made with rugged steel, these heavy-duty computer carts feature lockable doors to protect equipment from vandalism, dust, and debris. Available features include LCD monitor storage and casters for added mobility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:50:56','2026-05-14 14:50:56'),(1839,'Computer Cabinets & Workstations','computer-cabinets-workstations',1816,'Our computer cabinets and workstations are designed to protect valuable equipment in harsh environments. From industrial computer cabinets to computer desk workstations, these storage solutions can keep your computer safe and secure from vandals, dust, and debris. Product options include mobile workstations, cabinets with shelves, and multi-compartment cabinets. Size and color vary.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:50:59','2026-05-14 14:50:59'),(1840,'LCD Computer Cabinets','lcd-computer-cabinets',1816,'Our LCD computer cabinets provide a secure and convenient storage solution for computers in shared work environments. These industrial cabinets feature window panels that offer an easy view of the screen, and locks for extra security. Additional features include swivel casters for mobile cabinets and removable window panels to accommodate touchscreen computers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:51:03','2026-05-14 14:51:03'),(1841,'Jars & Containers','jars-containers',480,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:51:03','2026-05-14 14:51:03'),(1842,'Medical Chart & File Holders','medical-chart-file-holders-1',480,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:51:39','2026-05-14 14:51:39'),(1843,'Medical Scrub Sinks','medical-scrub-sinks-1',480,'Medical scrub sinks provide an essential means for healthcare professionals to maintain optimal hand hygiene before and after medical procedures, surgeries, and patient care, effectively minimizing the risk of infections. These sinks are crucial in upholding patient safety by facilitating sterile conditions to reduce the likelihood of cross-contamination during medical interventions. They are ideal for maintaining hygiene standards in operating rooms, procedure rooms, emergency rooms, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:52:23','2026-05-14 14:52:23'),(1844,'Medical Stands','medical-stands',480,'Medical Stands are specialized mobile platforms that provide a stable and adjustable base for various medical equipment, including IV stands, mayo instrument stands, phlebotomy stands, irrigation stands, and solution stands. They are made with durable materials, and feature adjustable height for ergonomic use. Outfitted with durable casters for easy portability around the facility. They improve efficiency and organization in healthcare environments, making them crucial for medical facilities, clinics, and offices.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:53:00','2026-05-14 14:53:00'),(1845,'Medical Supply Carts','medical-supply-carts-1',480,'Medical supply carts offer ample storage of devices, supplies, instruments, and equipment in hospitals, pharmacies, clinics, and other healthcare facilities. Designed for mobility, medical storage carts feature smooth casters and locking mechanisms for security. Whether for acute emergency care, bedside storage, or surgical procedures, these carts are engineered for safe storage and quick access of medical supplies and devices when needed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:53:36','2026-05-14 14:53:36'),(1846,'Overbed Tables','overbed-tables',480,'Overbed Tables are positioned above medical beds or wheelchairs to provide convenient surface spaces for food trays, reading materials, or electronic devices. The tables can be easily adjusted and feature swivel casters for enhanced maneuverability. Materials such as steel, laminate, and more ensure the tables are sturdy and can last through years of use. Overbed tables can be used in environments including nursing homes, hospital patient rooms, and other healthcare facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:54:10','2026-05-14 14:54:10'),(1847,'Patient Alarms','patient-alarms',480,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:54:56','2026-05-14 14:54:56'),(1848,'Werner® Fall Protection Kits','werner-fall-protection-kits',1768,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:54:57','2026-05-14 14:54:57'),(1849,'Patient Bibs','patient-bibs',480,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:55:32','2026-05-14 14:55:32'),(1850,'Guardian Fall Protection Kits','guardian-fall-protection-kits',1768,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:55:38','2026-05-14 14:55:38'),(1851,'Patient ID Bracelets','patient-id-bracelets',480,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:56:10','2026-05-14 14:56:10'),(1852,'Wire Workstations','wire-workstations',1815,'Our wire workstations offer a durable, versatile storage solution for computers and workspaces. These computer workstations are made of heavy-duty steel, chrome, and wire. The open-wire design workstation minimizes dust accumulation and maximizes light and air circulation. Optional features include adjustable shelving, modular designs, and casters for added mobility. Sizes and configuration vary.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:56:10','2026-05-14 14:56:10'),(1853,'LCD & LED Carts','lcd-led-carts',1815,'Our LCD and LED carts provide a reliable, durable solution for displaying and transporting monitors like LCD and plasma screens. These flat-panel monitor carts are made of durable steel and feature strong, lockable casters for easy mobility. LCD and LED TV carts come in various sizes to accommodate different weights and screen dimensions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:56:10','2026-05-14 14:56:10'),(1854,'Laptop & Computer Carts','laptop-computer-carts',1815,'Our laptop and computer carts offer a versatile and mobile workday solution for offices, schools, healthcare facilities, and more. These rolling computer and laptop carts are designed to accommodate various laptop and computer sizes. Our carts feature lockable wheels and cable management options for optimal mobility and organization.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:56:12','2026-05-14 14:56:12'),(1855,'Multi-Monitor Workstations','multi-monitor-workstations',1815,'Our multi-monitor workstations are designed to display multiple computer monitors, keeping user comfort in mind. These dual-monitor workstations feature adjustable monitor mounts for screens of different weights and sizes. Made of durable steel, our products offer options like mobile and sit-stand workstations to help improve efficiency.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:56:14','2026-05-14 14:56:14'),(1856,'Computer Carts','computer-carts',1815,'Our computer carts provide a durable, mobile solution for computers in schools, hospitals, industrial settings, and other commercial workspaces. These mobile carts feature durable steel frames, laminate work surfaces, and lockable casters that provide mobility and stability. Our carts can hold computer monitors and towers. Some carts include shelves for additional hardware and accessories.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:56:17','2026-05-14 14:56:17'),(1857,'Desktop Computer Workstations','desktop-computer-workstations',1815,'Our desktop computer workstations provide a sturdy and versatile workday solution for offices and other commercial settings. Designed with the user in mind, these mobile workstations include height-adjustable and standing options for comfort and efficiency. Additional feature options include cable management and adjustable shelves.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:56:20','2026-05-14 14:56:20'),(1858,'Floor Mount Workstations','floor-mount-workstations',1815,'Our floor-mount workstations provide a sturdy and practical solution for workshops, warehouses, and other industrial workspaces. Made with heavy-duty steel, these workstations feature laminate work surfaces and adjustable display settings. These mounted workstations can accommodate multiple users to improve efficiency and productivity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:56:23','2026-05-14 14:56:23'),(1859,'DBI-SALA® Fall Protection Kits','dbi-sala-fall-protection-kits',1768,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:56:31','2026-05-14 14:56:31'),(1860,'Adjustable Height Workstations','adjustable-height-workstations',1815,'Our adjustable-height workstations are designed to bring comfort and versatility to workspaces. These computer workstations can be easily customized to fit individual users and are perfect for offices, labs, hospitals, and other commercial spaces. Our mobile adjustable workstations feature lockable wheels for mobility and stability. Most stations can accommodate sitting or standing use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:56:31','2026-05-14 14:56:31'),(1861,'Patient Wear','patient-wear',480,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:56:48','2026-05-14 14:56:48'),(1862,'PeakWorks Roofers Fall Protection Kits','peakworks-roofers-fall-protection-kits',1768,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:57:12','2026-05-14 14:57:12'),(1863,'Portable Sinks','portable-sinks-1',480,'Portable sinks are self-contained units that provide convenient and hygienic hand washing solutions in locations where traditional plumbing infrastructure is unavailable or impractical. Since the sinks are self-contained, they have built-in water reservoirs, soap dispensers, and wastewater tanks, which eliminates the need for external plumbing connections. Portable sinks are versatile and find application in various settings, including outdoor events, construction sites, food service, and healthcare.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:57:29','2026-05-14 14:57:29'),(1864,'PeakWorks Fall Protection Kits','peakworks-fall-protection-kits',1768,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:57:57','2026-05-14 14:57:57'),(1865,'Privacy Screens','privacy-screens',480,'Privacy screens are adaptable and convenient partitions designed to offer privacy in workplace settings. Mobile privacy screens are perfect for offices or spaces requiring flexible configurations, while stationary options provide standing dividers with a slim design. Ideal for open office environments, educational institutions, and healthcare facilities, these screens cater to various needs for privacy and space division.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:58:20','2026-05-14 14:58:20'),(1866,'PeakWorks Fall Protection Accessories','peakworks-fall-protection-accessories',1768,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:58:39','2026-05-14 14:58:39'),(1867,'Laptop Carts with Storage','laptop-carts-with-storage',1814,'Our laptop carts with storage are designed to bring more organization and convenience to the workspace. Made with durable materials like steel and laminate, these rolling carts with storage come with a sturdy work surface for your laptop and compartments that can hold cords, accessories, and more. Carts are adjustable and have durable wheels to provide added mobility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:58:54','2026-05-14 14:58:54'),(1868,'Sharps & Biohazard Containers','sharps-biohazard-containers',480,'Sharps and biohazard containers are engineered for the safe disposal of medical waste, including used needles, syringes, and other biohazardous materials. These containers serve as a vital safeguard against accidental needlesticks, guaranteeing the proper containment and disposal of potentially infectious substances. They play a pivotal role in promoting safety within healthcare settings. Typically color-coded in red or yellow to signify their contents, they are indispensable assets for hospitals, doctor\'s offices, and pharmacies alike.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:58:55','2026-05-14 14:58:55'),(1869,'Laptop Computer Desks','laptop-computer-desks',1814,'Our laptop computer desks are a practical solution for workspaces. These mobile laptop desks are made of sturdy materials like steel and laminate, and feature adjustable heights for customizable comfort and locking wheels for added stability. Our sleek and mobile desks are perfect for offices, classrooms, and other commercial work settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:58:57','2026-05-14 14:58:57'),(1870,'Laptop Carts & Stands','laptop-carts-stands',1814,'Our laptop carts and stands are designed to bring mobility and convenience to the workplace. These mobile carts feature sturdy metal frames and laminate work surfaces for long-lasting durability. Locking wheels provide mobility and stability, while adjustable features help you achieve the most comfortable working position. Portable laptop stands are ideal for schools, medical facilities, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:59:04','2026-05-14 14:59:04'),(1871,'Laptop Workstations','laptop-workstations',1814,'Our laptop workstations are designed to provide a comfortable and efficient space to work on your laptop. These workstations feature ergonomic designs and can be adjusted to fit different heights. Our workstations have casters to add mobility and optional shelves for storage of accessories and cords. Size and color vary by product.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:59:07','2026-05-14 14:59:07'),(1872,'Surgical & Disposable Masks','surgical-disposable-masks',480,'Disposable face masks are essential protective gear for personnel working in various environments, such as medical facilities, cleanrooms, or warehouses. They provide an effective barrier against airborne particles, ensuring respiratory health and safety. Disposable Respirators provide protection from nuisance dusts, household powders, airborne particles, and hazardous mists. They come in a variety of styles including standard or full face seal, and with or without exhalation valves.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 14:59:44','2026-05-14 14:59:44'),(1873,'Mobile Medical Laptop Carts','mobile-medical-laptop-carts',1813,'Our mobile medical laptop carts are designed to provide a versatile and efficient workspace for medical professionals. Made with sturdy materials, these medical laptop carts feature ergonomic designs and storage options to hold medical equipment, cords, and accessories. These carts are designed to improve efficiency and organization in hospitals, clinics, and other medical facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:00:23','2026-05-14 15:00:23'),(1874,'Mobile Medical Computer Workstations','mobile-medical-computer-workstations',1813,'Our mobile medical computer workstations are designed to provide healthcare professionals with a versatile and efficient workspace solution. These mobile medical computer carts feature sturdy construction with durable materials, ergonomic designs, and lockable casters for stability and mobility. Workstations come in a variety of sizes and are ideal for hospitals and other healthcare facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:00:26','2026-05-14 15:00:26'),(1875,'Medical Computer Cart Accessories','medical-computer-cart-accessories',1812,'Medical Computer Cart Accessories attach to computer carts to enhance workspace efficiency for healthcare professionals. Medical cart accessories include power strips and batteries to provide reliable power for computers and other equipment. Computer cart attachments like baskets, drawers, and holders provide simple organization and quick accessibility to charts and medical supplies.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:02:56','2026-05-14 15:02:56'),(1876,'Computer Cabinet Accessories','computer-cabinet-accessories',1812,'Computer Cabinet Accessories are designed to maintain functionality and organization of computer equipment secured inside a cabinet. Cabinet attachments like shelves, mouse trays, and CPU side cabinets provide organized storage for office supplies and computer hardware, while AC fan kits maintain airflow to help prevent electronics from overheating.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:02:59','2026-05-14 15:02:59'),(1877,'Computer Cart & Workstation Accessories','computer-cart-workstation-accessories',1812,'Computer Cart and Workstation Accessories such as storage kits, keyboard and mouse trays, work surfaces, and shelves are designed to extend the functionality of computer carts and workstations to help keep equipment organized and easily accessible. Monitor arms, laptop mounts, and height adjusters attach to carts and desks to keep screens stable and in a comfortable viewing position.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:03:02','2026-05-14 15:03:02'),(1878,'Harness Accessories','harness-accessories',1208,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:14:41','2026-05-14 15:14:41'),(1879,'Harnesses','harnesses',1208,'Harnesses protect from workers from elevated positions and provide reliable, safe fall protection for construction, roofing, and similar industrial jobs. Whether a full-body harness, a positioning harness, or one with specific features like reflective strips for low-light conditions, fall protection gear are designed to withstand the rigors of demanding work environments, ensuring protection and safety over the long term.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:15:42','2026-05-14 15:15:42'),(1880,'Global Industrial™ Harnesses','global-industrial-harnesses',1879,'Global Industrial™harnesses provide reliable, safe fall protection for construction, roofing, and similar industrial jobs. Made with heavy-duty polyester, these vest-style harnesses feature plated alloy steel mating buckles and D-rings for maximum safety. We offer a range of ANSI, CSA, and OSHA-compliant products, including full-body harnesses and fall protection safety harnesses with lanyards.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:17:20','2026-05-14 15:23:14'),(1881,'Miller® Fall Protection Harnesses','miller-fall-protection-harnesses',1879,'Miller® fall protection harnesses are the ultimate choice for reliable, comfortable fall protection. Ideal for a wide variety of industrial jobs, these fall protection harnesses feature durable webbing, adjustable straps, and multiple attachments for exceptional safety and premium comfort. We offer Miller® climbing, positioning, and construction harnesses in a range of sizes and capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:18:01','2026-05-14 15:23:50'),(1882,'Antiseptics & Ointments','antiseptics-ointments',481,'Antiseptics disinfect the skin before medical procedures, surgeries, or injections. They kill or resist the growth of bacteria, viruses, and fungi on the skin\'s surface. Ointments are used to help the healing of wounds, burns, and minor skin injuries. They create a protective barrier and provide a moist environment conducive to healing. The antiseptics and ointments are ideal for commercial medical facilities and hospitals.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:18:27','2026-05-14 15:18:27'),(1883,'DBI/SALA® Harnesses','dbisala-harnesses',1879,'DBI/SALA® harnesses are designed to provide premium safety for industrial workers without sacrificing comfort. With ergonomic designs, adjustable straps, and innovative features like a no-tangle design, these safety harnesses ensure a secure and customized fit. OSHA and ANSI-compliant climbing, positioning, confined space, general industry, and construction safety harnesses are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:18:37','2026-05-14 15:24:21'),(1884,'Protecta® Fall Harnesses','protecta-fall-harnesses',1879,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:22:14','2026-05-14 15:22:14'),(1886,'Bandages & Dressings','bandages-dressings',481,'Bandages and dressings play important roles in wound care, offering essential protection, support, and a conducive environment for healing. Their significance spans across diverse industries such as healthcare, sports, emergency response, and more. Designed to be breathable and stretchable, they foster a healthier wound environment and mitigate the risk of infection, contributing to effective wound management and recovery.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:23:57','2026-05-14 15:23:57'),(1887,'Bandages & Dressings','bandages-dressings-1',481,'Bandages and dressings play important roles in wound care, offering essential protection, support, and a conducive environment for healing. Their significance spans across diverse industries such as healthcare, sports, emergency response, and more. Designed to be breathable and stretchable, they foster a healthier wound environment and mitigate the risk of infection, contributing to effective wound management and recovery.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:23:57','2026-05-14 15:23:57'),(1888,'FallTech® Harnesses','falltech-harnesses',1879,'FallTech® harnesses are built to deliver exceptional fall protection with a focus on user comfort. With breathable padding, quick-connect buckles, and multiple attachment points, these positioning and climbing harnesses provide safety and convenience. We offer 1-D or 3-D full-body harnesses, harness and lanyard combination sets, and more in various sizes to meet a variety of specific needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:25:37','2026-05-14 15:25:37'),(1889,'Guardian Fall Protection Harnesses','guardian-fall-protection-harnesses',1879,'Guardian Fall Protection harnesses combine safety and comfort to provide reliable fall protection for elevated industrial jobs. Versatile and ergonomic, these construction and fall arrest harnesses offer features like water-repellant webbing, dual lanyard keepers, and removable padding. Harnesses have pass-through or quick-connect chest strap buckles and quick-connect or tongue leg strap buckles.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:26:12','2026-05-14 15:26:12'),(1890,'MSA® Fall Harnesses','msa-fall-harnesses',1879,'MSA® fall harnesses offer reliable protection and durability for various industrial, elevated work environments. Lightweight yet durable, these fall protection harnesses offer features like non-binding padding, fire-resistant Kevlar webbing, reflective strips for visibility, and Nanosphere® coating to repel grease, dirt, and moisture. Positioning and construction harnesses come in various sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:26:47','2026-05-14 15:26:47'),(1891,'Werner® Harnesses','werner-harnesses',1879,'Werner® harnesses are versatile, comfortable products that provide dependable fall protection for industrial jobs at elevated heights. From positioning and climbing harnesses to general industry and construction harnesses, Werner® offers a range of durable designs with comfortable padding and versatile connections to meet specific needs. Various sizes are available, including universal harnesses.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:27:19','2026-05-14 15:27:19'),(1892,'PeakWorks Fall Harnesses','peakworks-fall-harnesses',1879,'PeakWorks fall harnesses provide reliable and secure fall protection for various industrial applications. Made with polyester webbing and aluminum rings, these positioning harnesses feature pass-through chest strap buckles and mating or tongue leg strap buckles. Fall harnesses are universal fit and have various weight capacities. Products are ANSI and CSA-certified and exceed OSHA standards.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:27:58','2026-05-14 15:27:58'),(1893,'Gemtor™ Harnesses','gemtor-harnesses',1879,'Gemtor™ harnesses are designed with durability and versatility in mind to provide reliable fall protection in various industrial applications. Gemtor™ offers a range of safety harness styles for customizable comfort, including full-body and vest full-body harnesses. OSHA and ANSI-compliant, these positioning harnesses feature adjustable leg straps, reinforced webbing, and lightweight components.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:28:34','2026-05-14 15:28:34'),(1894,'Cooling Towels','cooling-towels',481,'Evaporative cooling towels provide relief from intense heat. They can be activated quickly and are placed on the back of the neck to prevent exhaustion and illness from prolonged exposure to high temperatures or direct sunlight. Neck cooling towels are ideal for use in construction, mining, agriculture, solar, steelwork, landscaping, and more physically demanding industries.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:29:09','2026-05-14 15:29:09'),(1895,'Horizontal Lifelines','horizontal-lifelines',1208,'Available in a variety of lengths and weight capacities to suit a wide range of maintenance and utility jobs, Horizontal Lifelines provide continuous fall protection as workers move along rooftops, construction sites, industrial facilities, and other elevated work areas. They are designed to secure a rope or cable between two or more anchor points to promote safety as employees move horizontally, and they are crafted from durable, high-quality material to provide long-lasting strength.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:29:43','2026-05-14 15:29:43'),(1896,'Disposable Gloves','disposable-gloves',2316,'Disposable gloves are an essential personal protective equipment that cater to various needs. Gloves are available in different materials, sizes, and types to meet diverse requirements across different industries and applications. Whether it is a medical, industrial, or food service setting, high-quality disposable gloves provide a dependable barrier against contaminants while ensuring comfort and secure wear.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:30:01','2026-05-18 11:06:42'),(1897,'Temporary Rope Horizontal Lifelines','temporary-rope-horizontal-lifelines',1895,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:30:18','2026-05-14 15:30:18'),(1898,'Permanent Multi-Span Horizontal Lifelines','permanent-multi-span-horizontal-lifelines',1895,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:30:55','2026-05-14 15:30:55'),(1899,'Emergency & Survival Kits','emergency-survival-kits',481,'Emergency and survival kits are comprehensive and essential resources designed to provide individuals and organizations with the necessary tools to navigate emergency situations. Whether for personal use, businesses, or community preparedness, kits are meticulously curated to address a range of potential crises, from natural disasters to medical emergencies.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:31:00','2026-05-14 15:31:00'),(1900,'Temporary Cable Horizontal Lifelines','temporary-cable-horizontal-lifelines',1895,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:31:23','2026-05-14 15:31:23'),(1901,'Emergency Blankets & Bivy Sacks','emergency-blankets-bivy-sacks',481,'Emergency blankets and bivy sacks are designed to retain body heat. The blankets and bivy sacks are valuable in first aid solutions, providing warmth to individuals in shock or those facing exposure. They are designed to be compact and lightweight, making them easily portable and ideal for inclusion in emergency kits, backpacks, or survival gear. Some emergency blankets come with bright-colored surfaces, enhancing visibility and making them helpful in signaling rescuers or authorities in emergencies.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:32:07','2026-05-14 15:32:07'),(1902,'I-Beam Stanchion Systems','i-beam-stanchion-systems',1895,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:32:14','2026-05-14 15:32:14'),(1903,'Shelves & Brackets for Computer Workstations','shelves-brackets-for-computer-workstations',1877,'Shelves and Brackets for Computer Workstations provide an additional worksurface or storage option. These workstation shelves and brackets attach directly to computer carts to extend their length, offering space to perform administrative tasks or store supplies, while computer cart shelves with hinged designs can be folded down when not in use to save space.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:32:38','2026-05-14 15:32:38'),(1904,'Protective Shields for Computer Workstations','protective-shields-for-computer-workstations',1877,'Protective Shields for Computer Workstations are suitable for use in hospitals, medical facilities, and healthcare settings. These workstation protective shields attach directly to PC carts and surround the monitor on three sides for an effective barrier against coughs and sneezes. The clear design of these protective shield kits allow users to maintain visibility with co-workers and patients.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:32:43','2026-05-14 15:32:43'),(1905,'Footrests for Computer Workstations','footrests-for-computer-workstations',1877,'Footrests for Computer Workstations allow workers to enjoy a comfortable, ergonomic position when sitting at computer workstations. These workstation footrests are constructed from durable materials, such as powder-coated steel, to provide long-lasting functionality, and the easy-to-assemble design of these computer workstation accessories offers quick, simple installation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:32:46','2026-05-14 15:32:46'),(1906,'Power Holders for Computer Workstations','power-holders-for-computer-workstations',1877,'Power Holders for Computer Workstations provide reliable support for power devices and equipment including UPS battery units. Designed for secure attachment to a computer workstation, computer cart, or wall, these power station holders keep a power source close by while maintaining a free and clear workspace. These workstation accessories are crafted from durable material, such as steel, to offer long-lasting use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:32:49','2026-05-14 15:32:49'),(1907,'Laptop Holders & Brackets for Workstations','laptop-holders-brackets-for-workstations',1877,'Laptop Holders and Brackets for Workstations offer a secure place to affix laptops, tablets, and other office electronics to computer workstations. Laptop security brackets hold personal devices firmly in place to help prevent damage or theft, while laptop and tablet holders with built-in arms allow acustomized workspaces to accommodate specific tasks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:32:52','2026-05-14 15:32:52'),(1908,'Temporary Cable Horizontal Lifelines','temporary-cable-horizontal-lifelines-1',1895,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:32:55','2026-05-14 15:32:55'),(1909,'Storage Kits for Computer Workstations','storage-kits-for-computer-workstations',1877,'Storage Kits for Computer Workstations are designed to efficiently utilize space at workstations in office and warehouse applications. These computer workstation accessories attach directly to workstations for quick, convenient access to stored supplies and devices, and various workstation storage kits offer specific holding options for folders, binders, printers, and other supplies and devices.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:32:55','2026-05-14 15:32:55'),(1910,'Power Kits for Computer Workstations','power-kits-for-computer-workstations',1877,'Power Kits for Computer Workstations provide a reliable power source for computer workstations. These computer workstation power kits are equipped with multiple electrical outlets to keep monitors, CPUs, and other computer components running. These computer accessories attach securely to workstations to keep the power source close & ready for use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:32:59','2026-05-14 15:32:59'),(1911,'Scanner Holders for Computer Workstations','scanner-holders-for-computer-workstations',1877,'Scanner Holders for Computer Workstations are designed to keep barcode scanners easily accessible and neatly stored between uses. These barcode scanner holders attach to the underside of computer workstation shelves for secure placement, and the slotted design of this computer workstation accessory makes it easy to quickly grab the handle of the barcode scanner when it’s time to use the device.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:33:01','2026-05-14 15:33:01'),(1912,'Height Adjusters for Computer Workstations','height-adjusters-for-computer-workstations',1877,'Height Adjusters for Computer Workstations are suitable for shared environments and promote a comfortable working experience. Workstation height adjusters with multiple settings allow users to adapt their workplace setup to suit their standing height or seated position, and these workstation accessories are made from durable materials, such as steel, to support various devices.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:33:09','2026-05-14 15:33:09'),(1913,'Monitor Arms & Mounts for Computer Workstations','monitor-arms-mounts-for-computer-workstations',1877,'Monitor Arms and Mounts for Computer Workstations promote a comfortable working position while keeping computer monitors clearly in view. Adjustable computer monitor arms allow users to modify monitor height and angle to suit their height and workstation setup, while single-arm and double-arm monitor mount options enable customization in a variety of office and warehouse settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:33:09','2026-05-14 15:33:09'),(1914,'CPU Side Cabinets for Computer Workstations','cpu-side-cabinets-for-computer-workstations',1877,'CPU Side Cabinets for Computer Workstations are designed to keep a computer’s central processing unit securely contained. Computer side cabinets with doors that lock in the front and rear offer easy installation and secure protection of a central processor, while CPU cabinets with ventilation ports and built-in fans help prevent overheating by circulating air.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:33:11','2026-05-14 15:33:11'),(1915,'Worksurfaces for Computer Workstations','worksurfaces-for-computer-workstations',1877,'Worksurfaces for Computer Workstations attach to workstation posts and provide additional space to store office supplies or perform administrative tasks. These workstation accessories are made of durable materials that stand up to everyday use, and up to 4 triangular worksurfaces can be placed around one stationary post for a custom, optimized work area. Available in a variety of shapes and sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:33:14','2026-05-14 15:33:14'),(1916,'Keyboard, Mouse & Printer Trays for Computer Workstations','keyboard-mouse-printer-trays-for-computer-workstations',1877,'Keyboard, Mouse and Printer Trays for Computer Workstations are workstation accessories that allow customizable positioning of computer peripherals. Slide-out printer trays, as well as flip-up keyboard and mouse trays, provide easy access to devices and can be tucked away to save space between uses, while keyboard trays and drawers with locking mechanisms help keep equipment safe and secure.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:33:18','2026-05-14 15:33:18'),(1917,'Posts for Computer Workstations','posts-for-computer-workstations',1877,'Posts for Computer Workstations are designed to create customizable, space-saving workstations in administrative and industrial settings. These computer workstation posts are crafted from durable steel for a long service life, and connection points allow attachment of monitor floats, work surfaces, and trays. Select posts include casters for simple maneuverability between rooms.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:33:21','2026-05-14 15:33:21'),(1918,'Retractable Horizontal Lifelines','retractable-horizontal-lifelines',1895,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:33:22','2026-05-14 15:33:22'),(1919,'Emergency Tools','emergency-tools',481,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:34:41','2026-05-14 15:34:41'),(1920,'Window Door for Computer Cabinets','window-door-for-computer-cabinets',1876,'Window Door for Computer Cabinets are computer cabinet accessories that help prevent computer screens from being fully visible from all angles, making them great for shared environments that still require a level of privacy. Cabinet window doors with locking designs provide a safeguard against damage and theft, and the integrated window of these cabinet doors preserves the view of the computer screen.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:35:46','2026-05-14 15:35:46'),(1921,'Mouse Tray for Computer Cabinets','mouse-tray-for-computer-cabinets',1876,'Mouse Tray for Computer Cabinets is a computer cabinet accessory that provides ergonomic and easy accessiblility. Computer mouse trays can be attached to either side of a compatible cabinet’s keyboard drawer to accommodate left- or right-handed users, and sliding models allow for customizable positioning of the computer mouse.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:35:49','2026-05-14 15:35:49'),(1922,'Shelves for Computer Cabinets','shelves-for-computer-cabinets',1876,'Shelves for Computer Cabinets add functionality and storage space to computer cabinets and workstations. These computer shelves can be attached to either side of a computer cabinet to create additional workspace or hold administrative supplies, and the durable construction means these computer cabinet shelves will stand up to the everyday wear and tear of demanding jobs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:35:52','2026-05-14 15:35:52'),(1923,'CPU Side Cabinets for Computer Cabinets','cpu-side-cabinets-for-computer-cabinets',1876,'CPU Side Cabinets for Computer Cabinets provide a secure place to house a computer’s central processing unit. Computer side cabinets with lockable front and rear doors make it easy to install a central processor and keep it protected during and between shifts, while CPU cabinets with ventilation ports and built-in fans offer air circulation and help prevent overheating of the unit.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:35:55','2026-05-14 15:35:55'),(1924,'Ladder Safety Systems','ladder-safety-systems',1208,'Ladder safety systems are intended to reduce the risk of slips, falls, and accidents when working with ladders. The safety accessories and items are essential for securing, stabilizing, and anchoring items and users. Ladder safety equipment can be used when working at high heights or in construction and maintenance environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:36:28','2026-05-14 15:36:28'),(1925,'Wheel Rings for Medical Computer Carts','wheel-rings-for-medical-computer-carts',1875,'Wheel Rings for Medical Computer Carts are convenient handles that attach to pole-style mobile workstations. The wheel ring design makes it easy to grab these computer cart handles from any angle to move or transport stands between rooms, and optional wheel ring trays can be securely inserted into one of the segments to provide quick, handy access to stored medical and office supplies.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:39:46','2026-05-14 15:39:46'),(1926,'Scanner Holders for Medical Computer Carts','scanner-holders-for-medical-computer-carts',1875,'Scanner Holders for Medical Computer Carts offer a convenient place to keep a scanner easily accessible on a mobile workstation. Designed for use on portable healthcare workspaces, these scanner forks and holders come with mounting hardware or assembly kits to make installation a breeze and provide secure attachment to medical computer carts.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:39:49','2026-05-14 15:39:49'),(1927,'Batteries & Holders for Medical Computer Carts','batteries-holders-for-medical-computer-carts',1875,'Batteries and Holders for Medical Computer Carts help keep laptop batteries and other computer cart accessories easily accessible. Computer batteries help ensure that laptops have a reliable power supply, while laptop battery holders that attach to medical carts keep those batteries within reach. Computer cart brackets can also be secured to mobile workstations to hold other medical supplies.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:39:51','2026-05-14 15:39:51'),(1928,'Task Lights for Medical Computer Carts','task-lights-for-medical-computer-carts',1875,'Task Lights for Medical Computer Carts are mobile workstation accessories that provide illumination when it\'s required. These computer task lights can be attached directly to medical carts for a dependable light source during administrative tasks, and computer cart lights that come with included mounting hardware allow for a simple and secure connection.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:39:54','2026-05-14 15:39:54'),(1929,'Trays for Medical Computer Carts','trays-for-medical-computer-carts',1875,'Trays for Medical Computer Carts make it easy to customize mobile workstations that are designed for use in hospitals and healthcare facilities. Computer cart trays are designed to hold a laptop, mouse, or keyboard and to help keep computer equipment secure and in an ergonomic working position. Printer shelves and trays attach to medical carts for easy and quick access to printouts and paperwork',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:39:57','2026-05-14 15:39:57'),(1930,'Power Cords & Strips for Medical Computer Carts','power-cords-strips-for-medical-computer-carts',1875,'Power Cords and Strips for Medical Computer Carts offer a reliable source of energy for laptops, medical equipment, and other electrical devices. These medical power strips attach directly to computer carts for consistent power when the mobile workstations are moved from room to room. Select medical power cords have attached wraps or reels that help keep excess cables neatly secure.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:40:00','2026-05-14 15:40:00'),(1931,'Drawers & Dividers for Medical Computer Carts','drawers-dividers-for-medical-computer-carts',1875,'Drawers and Dividers for Medical Computer Carts provide organized storage for medication and other healthcare supplies. Designed for direct attachment to a mobile workstation, these medical computer cart drawers are equipped with internal dividers to keep contents separated and easily accessible, while individual drawer dividers can be installed in pre-existing cart drawers to enhance functionality.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:40:02','2026-05-14 15:40:02'),(1932,'Baskets & Storage for Medical Computer Carts','baskets-storage-for-medical-computer-carts',1875,'Baskets and Storage for Medical Computer Carts provide additional storage space on computer carts in hospitals and other healthcare facilities. Computer cart storage baskets attach directly to mobile workstations to keep charts, medical paperwork, or office supplies within reach and easily accessible, and computer cart baskets with wire construction make it easy to quickly view stored contents.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:40:05','2026-05-14 15:40:05'),(1933,'First Aid Accessories','first-aid-accessories',481,'First Aid Accessories are designed to enhance and complement first aid kits or stations in the workplace. Accessories include first aid boxes and cabinets, first responder bags, and more specialized items such as training supplies and safety straps. They are crafted from high-quality materials, ensuring reliability and effectiveness in various first-aid situations. First Aid Accessories enhance existing first aid setups in workplaces, schools, offices, and healthcare facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:40:56','2026-05-14 15:40:56'),(1934,'Laptop & Tablet Storage Carts','laptop-tablet-storage-carts',1793,'Built with a sturdy construction and modern design, these storage carts are ideal for any commercial or industrial setting. This tablet storage cart features a thermally fused melamine laminate surface which is water, scratch, stain and burn resistant for greater structural integrity. These carts can hold anywhere from 24-32 laptops or tablets, and feature locking doors to keep devices secure.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:51:33','2026-05-14 15:51:33'),(1935,'Charging Stations','charging-stations',1793,'These simple, lightweight charging stations are designed with convenience in mind. With multiple charging ports, these charging stations allow you to charge anywhere from 8 to 12 devices simultaneously. Stay connected and powered up with our mobile charging stations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:51:36','2026-05-14 15:51:36'),(1936,'Laptop Storage Lockers','laptop-storage-lockers',1793,'Designed with convenience and security in mind, these laptop storage lockers are ideal for use in commercial or industrial settings. With heavy-duty steel construction and a powder-coated finish, this locker can withstand the wear and tear of daily use. Choose from laptop storage lockers that can accommodate anywhere from 5 to 35 devices.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:51:39','2026-05-14 15:51:39'),(1937,'Charging & Storage Stations','charging-storage-stations',1793,'Our Charging & Storage Station is the ultimate solution for all your charging and storage needs. The compartments are designed to accommodate different device sizes, so you can safely store all your devices in one place. These storage stations offer a convenient and organized way to charge and store your devices while keeping them safe and protected.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:51:41','2026-05-14 15:51:41'),(1938,'Charging & Storage Carts','charging-storage-carts',1793,'Our storage and charging carts are constructed from rugged steel and feature channel-reinforced doors with a 3-point locking system to ensure safety and security. Each cart features multiple shelves or compartments that can hold anywhere from 12-75 devices, including laptops, tablets, smartphones, and other electronic equipment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:51:44','2026-05-14 15:51:44'),(1939,'Procedure Carts','procedure-carts',1588,'Procedure Carts cater to the specific needs of medical supplies related to surgical or medical procedures. They provide healthcare facilities with a practical solution for storing and transporting essential items. These mobile units are fitted with durable casters to facilitate seamless mobility and are structured with drawers and compartments to ensure convenient access, organization, and movement. Suitable for use in hospitals and clinics, medical procedure carts create a sterile environment, improving patient care and operational efficiency.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:54:26','2026-05-14 15:54:26'),(1940,'Acute Care Carts','acute-care-carts',1588,'Acute care carts allow for organized, convenient access to emergency medical supplies, tools, and equipment. The carts come with caster wheels, ensuring easy maneuverability around any medical facility. Emergency care carts come in a variety of sizes and include various drawer quantities, allowing for personalized storage capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:54:30','2026-05-14 15:54:30'),(1941,'Medical Storage Carts','medical-storage-carts',1588,'Medical storage carts are an essential component in healthcare facilities as they help in the efficient organization and transportation of medical supplies. They are designed with durability and safety, ensuring that crucial supplies can be easily moved to where medical supplies are most needed. Equipped with locking mechanisms and smooth casters, medical carts are suitable for diverse healthcare settings such as hospitals, medical offices, clinics, and pharmacies.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 15:54:33','2026-05-14 15:54:33'),(1942,'Cylinder Carts','cylinder-carts',1941,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:06:06','2026-05-14 16:06:06'),(1943,'Column Medical Storage Carts','column-medical-storage-carts',1941,'Column medical storage carts help maximize storage space in healthcare facilities like hospitals and clinics. These column storage cabinets feature a vertical steel design, quiet-rolling casters, and lockable tempered glass doors for security and easy access to stored items. Our medical supply storage carts can be fully customized with shelves, catheter slides, ABS trays, or wire baskets.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:06:09','2026-05-14 16:06:09'),(1944,'Dilator Drying Carts','dilator-drying-carts',1941,'The dilator drying cart is specialized to provide a safe way to dry, store, and organize medical dilators. It features multiple hooks for easy hanging of dilators and vertical drying and a range of storage capacities. The HEPA advanced drying filter removes 99.7% of particles,and the cart features a fully adjustable fan with a customizable drying time (ranging from 10 to 180 minutes).',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:06:12','2026-05-14 16:06:12'),(1945,'Malignant Hyperthermia Cart','malignant-hyperthermia-cart',1941,'Malignant hyperthermia carts are designed to hold critical supplies needed to treat patients experiencing the condition. Our malignant hyperthermia carts come with a built-in refrigerator to ensure treatment supplies are kept at proper temperatures, as well as two drawers for additional emergency supply storage. These carts feature a heavy-duty steel design and rolling casters for easy mobility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:06:17','2026-05-14 16:06:17'),(1946,'Vaccine Storage Carts','vaccine-storage-carts',1941,'Our high-quality vaccine storage carts are designed to provide safe and efficient storage for vaccines, with adjustable shelves and a key locking door for secure storage. Carts include lab quality 3.2 cu ft Freezer, 2-3\" storage drawers and are made with durable swivel casters for mobility. No additional accessories included.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:06:21','2026-05-14 16:06:21'),(1947,'MRI Carts','mri-carts',1941,'MRI carts provide efficient storage and transportation for medical equipment that can be used within sensitive magnetic image environments. These MRI-safe carts are constructed from non-ferrous durable high density polyethylene and ABS and non-ferrous casters and screws. Our MRI carts feature three drawers and four swivel casters, two of which have brakes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:06:23','2026-05-14 16:06:23'),(1948,'Sterile Wrap Racks','sterile-wrap-racks',1941,'Sterile wrap racks provide a safe, convenient place to hold sterile wraps in hospitals, clinics, and other healthcare facilities. Our wrap racks have a rust-resistant chrome finish and feature swivel casters for easy mobility. We offer both high and low-profile wrap racks to fit your specific storage needs. High-profile racks have adjustable carriers and square bars for additional customization.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:06:26','2026-05-14 16:06:26'),(1949,'Medication Carts','medication-carts',1941,'Our medication carts is meticulously designed to offer efficient and well-organized storage for medications and medical supplies. Carts include 5-ball-bearing premium rubber casters, full swivel, 2 with toe locking brakes and drawer key locking system. Choose from a variety of models with a range of drawers and bins.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:06:29','2026-05-14 16:06:29'),(1950,'Case Carts','case-carts',1941,'This stainless steel case cart is the ultimate choice for sterility control during transportation. Featuring sealed doors to safeguard contents against cross-contamination and smooth-rolling casters for versatile operations. Carts come standard with door latches with locking doors available to keep contents safe. Made in the USA.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:06:33','2026-05-14 16:06:33'),(1951,'Linen Service Carts','linen-service-carts',1941,'Our linen service carts provide organized and efficient linen and laundry transportation in healthcare facilities including hospitals, nursing homes, and clinics. Made with heavy-duty materials like chrome wire or galvanized steel, these linen carts feature multiple shelves and casters for mobility. Some carts come with water-resistant nylon covers for added protection from airborne dust and dirt.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:06:36','2026-05-14 16:06:36'),(1952,'Bedside Carts','bedside-carts',1941,'Our bedside carts provide efficient and accessible storage for medical supplies and equipment in patient rooms within hospitals, nursing homes, and other healthcare facilities. Cart models are built with heavy-duty steel for long-lasting durability, a key locking system for security, and casters for easy mobility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:06:39','2026-05-14 16:06:39'),(1953,'General Purpose Medical Storage Carts','general-purpose-medical-storage-carts',1941,'General purpose medical storage carts are a versatile and convenient storage solution for hospitals, clinics, and other healthcare facilities. Made with durable materials, these medical carts come with shelves, compartments, and up to six drawers. Our medical carts have four durable casters for mobility; most units include at least two casters with locks or brakes that provide stability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:06:42','2026-05-14 16:06:42'),(1954,'First Aid Kits','first-aid-kits',NULL,'First aid kits are a necessity in medical, laboratory, commercial, and industrial settings to treat minor injuries. Pre-assembled first aid kits contain various essential items, including bandages, adhesive tape, antiseptic wipes, gauze pads, gloves, scissors, and more. Keep kits fully stocked with first aid kit refills that meet all OSHA/ANSI requirements, and ensure proper product storage with durable first aid cabinets.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:09:37','2026-05-14 16:09:37'),(1955,'Hot & Cold Packs','hot-cold-packs',481,'Hot packs provide soothing heat to alleviate muscle stiffness, joint pain, and tension. Cold packs deliver cold therapy to reduce inflammation, swelling, and numbness. They come in various sizes to accommodate different body parts, offering versatility in application. Hot & cold packs are ideal for first aid and emergency situations in industrial environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:12:43','2026-05-14 16:12:43'),(1956,'Trauma Cart','trauma-cart',1940,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:18:43','2026-05-14 16:18:43'),(1957,'ECMO Cart','ecmo-cart',1940,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:18:48','2026-05-14 16:18:48'),(1958,'Critical Care Cart','critical-care-cart',1940,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:18:50','2026-05-14 16:18:50'),(1959,'Arthroscopic Cart','arthroscopic-cart',1940,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:18:54','2026-05-14 16:18:54'),(1960,'IV Carts','iv-carts',1940,'Our IV carts come standard with sturdy stainless steel shelves and a round push handle with protective rubber bumpers on each corner. The front and bottom shelves are easily accessible and the cart smoothly moves on four 4\" swivel casters, ensuring easy mobility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:18:57','2026-05-14 16:18:57'),(1961,'Pediatric Emergency Carts','pediatric-emergency-carts',1940,'Our pediatric emergency carts are designed with multicolored drawers for quick access to pediatric medical supplies and equipment during urgent situations. Carts come with a single pull-out shelf for additional workspace, a removable ABS plastic top, auto-close mechanism to pull the drawer fully closed, and 5\" Premium \"Easy roll\" sealed bearing casters with precision bearing swivels.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:19:00','2026-05-14 16:19:00'),(1962,'Treatment Carts','treatment-carts',1940,'Designed for bedside use and emergency situations, our treatment carts ensure the accessibility and security of critical supplies. Our carts are equipped with a secure key and lock system, roller drawer slides, rubber caster or swivel wheels depending on the model, and secure breaks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:19:04','2026-05-14 16:19:04'),(1963,'Crash Carts with 6 Drawers','crash-carts-with-6-drawers',1940,'The 6 drawer emergency crash carts offer easy access for medical supplies during emerceny situations. Carts come in red to visually represent emergency use along with a choice of lock options and pack of 100 break-away seals ensure secure storage. These carts are also available in various sizes, include ergonomic side push handles, an antimicrobial plastic top, and latex-free construction.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:19:06','2026-05-14 16:19:06'),(1964,'Crash Carts with 5 Drawers','crash-carts-with-5-drawers',1940,'Find optimal storage for your medical supplies with our crash carts with 5 drawers. This state-of-the-art cart design is functional with secure door latches, multiple alternative storage options, and antimicrobial properties built-in. Available in red to represent emergency use, they provide a secure and convenient storage solution for medications and supplies during emergency situations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:19:09','2026-05-14 16:19:09'),(1965,'Crash Carts with 4 Drawers','crash-carts-with-4-drawers',1940,'Depended upon by thousands of medical professionals, our red emergency crash carts feature 4 drawers to ensure the correct emergency equipment, medications and supplies are easily available in emergencies. Carts include ergonomic side push handles, a variety of lock types, and rubber swivel or caster wheels depending on the model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:19:13','2026-05-14 16:19:13'),(1966,'Anesthesia Carts with 6 Drawers','anesthesia-carts-with-6-drawers',1940,'Organize and keep supplies within arm\'s reach of the anesthesiologist during surgery with our anesthesia carts featuring 6 secure drawers. Equipped with a pull-out shelf and extension drawer slides, these carts are made for convenience. Crafted from durable aluminum, and equipped with caster wheels and brakes for stability, these carts offer easy mobility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:19:16','2026-05-14 16:19:16'),(1967,'Anesthesia Carts with 5 Drawers','anesthesia-carts-with-5-drawers',1940,'Ensure organization and easy access to supplies by keeping them within reach of the anesthesiologist during patient procedures or surgeries with our Anesthesia Carts with 5 Drawers. Equipped with a convenient keyed central lock mechanism, 360-degree rotation capability, antimicrobial countertop surface, and durable aluminum construction. Models available in various sizes and colors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:19:19','2026-05-14 16:19:19'),(1968,'Anesthesia Carts with 1 - 4 Drawers','anesthesia-carts-with-1-4-drawers',1940,'Choose from a variety of our durable anesthesia carts with numerous drawers. Their compact design and spacious drawers ensure quick and easy access of supplies for anesthesiologists during patient procedures. Carts include top-quality drawer slides, caster or rubber swivel wheels (model depending), and a supporting top shelf with enhanced strength.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:19:22','2026-05-14 16:19:22'),(1969,'Isolation Carts with 5 - 6 Drawers','isolation-carts-with-5-6-drawers',1940,'Acute care isolation carts with numerous lockable drawers provide secure storage for medical supplies. Designed specifically in yellow for isolation rooms, they come in a series of drawer options with top-quality drawer slides and pushbutton E-Lock. Drawers include casters or rubber swivel wheels for easy mobility. Perfect for holding PPE items like gloves, masks, goggles, gowns, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:19:25','2026-05-14 16:19:25'),(1970,'Isolation Carts with 3 - 4 Drawers','isolation-carts-with-3-4-drawers',1940,'Our Isolation Carts with 3 - 4 Drawers provide mobile medical supply storage for your facility. Specifically yellow in color for designated isolation rooms, drawers come started with a secure lock and key system, full extension drawers slides for easy access, ergonomic side push handles, and an antimicrobial top. Drawers hold PPE items like gloves, gowns, masks, gowns, and goggles.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:19:30','2026-05-14 16:19:30'),(1971,'Emergency Carts with 6 - 9 Drawers','emergency-carts-with-6-9-drawers',1940,'Emergency carts with 6-9 drawers are designed for use in acute care settings. They feature durable drawers of varying sizes, locking mechanisms, and additional features like a work surface and power strip. These medical emergency carts help healthcare professionals easily access critical medical supplies and equipment during emergencies, ensuring they are readily available when needed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:19:32','2026-05-14 16:19:32'),(1972,'Emergency Carts with 3 - 5 Drawers','emergency-carts-with-3-5-drawers',1940,'Ensure the right emergency equipment such as medications and supplies are at your finger tips with our versatile Emergency Carts with 3 to 5 Drawers. Carts include removable antimicrobial plastic top, Ball-bearing full extension drawer slides, and secure locking systems. Wheel types include caster, rubber swivel and polyurethane depending on the model. All models are red to designate emergencies.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:19:35','2026-05-14 16:19:35'),(1973,'Cast & Splint Carts','cast-splint-carts',1939,'Cast and splint carts are mobile storage units that hold the medical equipment needed for casting and splinting in hospitals and other healthcare facilities. These rolling procedure carts are made with steel or aluminum and feature eight drawers, corner bumpers, scissor cables, and swivel tourniquets. Cast and splint carts were designed with orthopedic technicians for maximum functionality.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:22:48','2026-05-14 16:22:48'),(1974,'EKG Carts','ekg-carts',1939,'EKG carts are height-adjustable rolling units designed to store and transport EKG machines in hospitals, cardiology centers, and other healthcare facilities. These carts feature a lipped top surface to secure equipment and side bins to store supplies and patient files. Made with steel and thermoplastic laminate, our EKG machine carts have lockable dual-wheel casters for mobility and stability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:22:51','2026-05-14 16:22:51'),(1975,'Phlebotomy Carts','phlebotomy-carts',1939,'Our phlebotomy carts provide mobile storage and easy access to blood draw supplies for hospitals, medical labs, and other healthcare facilities. These compact and versatile carts feature a variety of storage compartments, bins, and drawers that can hold supplies for phlebotomy, IVs, and sutures. Mobile phlebotomy carts also include a sharps container, trash receptacle, and removable trays.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:22:54','2026-05-14 16:22:54'),(1976,'Catheter Carts','catheter-carts',1939,'Catheter carts provide convenient, organized storage for catheterization supplies in hospitals, clinics, and other healthcare facilities. Carts are made with chrome-plated steel and have casters for easy mobility. These catheter storage carts can accommodate all kinds of catheter packages including on hooks, shelves, or in bins. Catheters can be organized easily with hooks and label holders.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:22:57','2026-05-14 16:22:57'),(1977,'General Purpose Procedure Carts','general-purpose-procedure-carts',1939,'Perfect for hospitals, clinics, and doctors\' offices, our general-purpose procedure carts keep supplies safe and organized. All models include a heavy-duty steel construction, a secure locking system, and a durable latex-free exterior. Procedure carts are space-savers, making them ideal for offices with limited space.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:23:00','2026-05-14 16:23:00'),(1978,'Suture Carts','suture-carts',1939,'Our suture carts provide convenient transportation and easy access to suture supplies in hospitals, surgery centers, and other healthcare facilities. Made with durable materials like steel and heavy-duty plastic, these mobile suture carts have drawers, side shelves, and other storage designed for easy suture retrieval. Lockable swivel casters provide both mobility and stability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:23:04','2026-05-14 16:23:04'),(1979,'Oxygen & CPR Supplies','oxygen-cpr-supplies',481,'Oxygen and CPR supplies aid in emergency situations where someone is having difficulty breathing or needs protection from pathogens. They are designed to be easy to transport and can deliver a high concentration of oxygen during ventilation. CPR and oxygen supplies are reliable and efficient making them ideal for any first responder or healthcare professional.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:23:28','2026-05-14 16:23:28'),(1980,'Pain Relievers & Vitamins','pain-relievers-vitamins',481,'Pain relievers and vitamins are healthcare products that serve different purposes. Pain relievers come in tablet or capsule forms and alleviate headaches, muscle aches, and fever. Vitamins are dietary supplements that provide essential nutrients and minerals to support overall health. They are commonly used for pain relief, nutritional support, and preventive healthcare in healthcare facilities, pharmacies, households, and workplaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:25:56','2026-05-14 16:25:56'),(1981,'Mobile Pegboard Panel Racks','mobile-pegboard-panel-racks',1589,'Mobile pegboard panel racks offer flexible, portable storage for industrial workspaces. The panels are adjustable and can move up or down the punched steel posts of the frame. Panel racks roll smoothly on four swivel-locking casters and feature side push handles for easy maneuverability. Available in different width options.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:26:26','2026-05-14 16:26:26'),(1982,'Louvered Panel Carts','louvered-panel-carts',1589,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:26:28','2026-05-14 16:26:28'),(1983,'Modular Bin & Panel Carts','modular-bin-panel-carts',1589,'Modular bin & panel carts are designed for secure mobile storage and organization of tools, parts, and supplies. Most models feature heavy-duty steel construction that provides lasting durability and easily maneuvers on phenolic casters. Panel carts are highly customizable and available in a variety of sizes and colors. Other features and specific dimensions vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:26:31','2026-05-14 16:26:31'),(1984,'Tool Carts','tool-carts-1',1589,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:26:34','2026-05-14 16:26:34'),(1985,'Portable Sinks','portable-sinks-2',481,'Portable sinks are self-contained units that provide convenient and hygienic hand washing solutions in locations where traditional plumbing infrastructure is unavailable or impractical. Since the sinks are self-contained, they have built-in water reservoirs, soap dispensers, and wastewater tanks, which eliminates the need for external plumbing connections. Portable sinks are versatile and find application in various settings, including outdoor events, construction sites, food service, and healthcare.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:29:24','2026-05-14 16:29:24'),(1986,'Electric Grocery Carts','electric-grocery-carts',1590,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:30:54','2026-05-14 16:30:54'),(1987,'Rolling Shopping Carts','rolling-shopping-carts',1590,'Rolling shopping carts are designed with adjustable handles and nestable baskets for easy storage, making shopping more efficient. They come with smooth-rolling wheels for effortless mobility and an extendable handle for tilt and roll convenience. They are available in different sizes and colors, making them practical for supermarkets and department stores.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:30:57','2026-05-14 16:30:57'),(1988,'Two Tier Shopping Carts','two-tier-shopping-carts',1590,'Two-Tier Shopping Carts provide additional storage, which helps maximize carrying capacity by having two baskets. They are helpful when shopping for large or bulky items. Two-tier shopping carts have durable wheels for easy movement and sturdy handles for comfortable grip. They are ideal for supermarkets and retail stores.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:31:06','2026-05-14 16:31:06'),(1989,'Shopping Cart Corrals','shopping-cart-corrals',1590,'Shopping Cart Corrals are storage solutions designed to keep shopping carts organized and easily accessible for customers. These corrals are typically placed in parking lots or designated areas outside retail establishments. Corrals are made of durable steel and come in several sizes. They help maintain a tidy shopping space by providing a dedicated area for cart storage.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:31:06','2026-05-14 16:31:06'),(1990,'Standard Shopping Baskets','standard-shopping-baskets',1590,'Standard Shopping Baskets are lightweight and durable, designed for small to medium-sized purchases. The open mesh design ensures air circulation and high visibility. Baskets are nestable for efficient space utilization. They have comfortable handles and are practical and user-friendly, making them ideal for grocery, convenience stores, and retail outlets.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:31:07','2026-05-14 16:31:07'),(1991,'Standard Shopping Carts','standard-shopping-carts',1590,'Shopping carts are strong and versatile carriages used for transporting items efficiently. They have solid handles, smooth-rolling wheels, and a heavy-duty steel chassis with a durable powder coat finish. Designed with a child’s seat, shopping carts have a lower shelf for additional storage space, making them ideal for grocery stores, retail shops, and other locations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:31:08','2026-05-14 16:31:08'),(1992,'Surgical & Disposable Masks','surgical-disposable-masks-1',481,'Disposable face masks are essential protective gear for personnel working in various environments, such as medical facilities, cleanrooms, or warehouses. They provide an effective barrier against airborne particles, ensuring respiratory health and safety. Disposable Respirators provide protection from nuisance dusts, household powders, airborne particles, and hazardous mists. They come in a variety of styles including standard or full face seal, and with or without exhalation valves.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:31:36','2026-05-14 16:31:36'),(1993,'Heavy Duty Aluminum Trash Can Carts','heavy-duty-aluminum-trash-can-carts',1591,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:32:49','2026-05-14 16:32:49'),(1994,'Steel Spill Response Cart','steel-spill-response-cart',1591,'Our steel spill response carts are constructed of all-welded steel that is finished with a powder coating for long lasting durability. These spill response carts are ideal for storing and transporting PPE for protection after hazardous spills. They feature a fixed shelf inside the cabinet for optimal storage, and a lockable handle to keep your items secure.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:32:52','2026-05-14 16:32:52'),(1995,'Poly Drum Spill Dollies & Carts','poly-drum-spill-dollies-carts',1591,'Eliminate the risk of spills when transporting drums and pails with our poly drum spill containment carts. These carts come equipped with a heavy duty grate for the drums to sit on a flat surface, and a basin under the grate meant to catch any spilled substances. There spill containment carts come equipped with 4 casters for easy mobility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:32:55','2026-05-14 16:32:55'),(1996,'Chemical Carts','chemical-carts',1591,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:32:58','2026-05-14 16:32:58'),(1997,'Barricade Carts','barricade-carts-1',1592,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:35:19','2026-05-14 16:35:19'),(1998,'Stanchion Dolly','stanchion-dolly',1592,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:35:22','2026-05-14 16:35:22'),(1999,'Stanchion Storage Carts','stanchion-storage-carts-1',1592,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:35:24','2026-05-14 16:35:24'),(2000,'Flextur Welding Carts','flextur-welding-carts',1593,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:41:24','2026-05-14 16:41:24'),(2001,'SPC Industrial Tool Carts','spc-industrial-tool-carts',1593,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:41:26','2026-05-14 16:41:26'),(2002,'Beta Tool Carts','beta-tool-carts',1593,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:41:30','2026-05-14 16:41:30'),(2003,'Crescent Tool Carts','crescent-tool-carts',1593,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:41:32','2026-05-14 16:41:32'),(2004,'Valley Craft® Tool Carts','valley-craft-tool-carts',1593,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:41:35','2026-05-14 16:41:35'),(2005,'Proto® Tool Carts','proto-tool-carts',1593,'Discover the superior storage capabilities of Proto® Tool Carts, designed with secure organization solutions to keep tools and parts handy. Our utility tool carts feature a range of sizes and are available in multiple colors. They are equipped with large capacity drawers, plenty of tool organization, and strong welded steel construction.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:41:38','2026-05-14 16:41:38'),(2006,'Gearwrench Tool Carts','gearwrench-tool-carts',1593,'Gearwrench® tool carts are essential for conveniently storing and transporting tools in any dynamic work setting. They are designed for maximum storage capacity and offer superior storage solutions for working professionals. These tool carts include a steel cabinet body, as well as a trigger lock system with aluminum drawer pulls for smooth operation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:41:41','2026-05-14 16:41:41'),(2007,'Shuter® Tool Carts','shuter-tool-carts',1593,'Efficiently store and transport your tools with our Shuter® Tool Carts tailored to suit your specific needs. These professional utility carts feature durable steel construction, a range of drawer options, and the inclusion of industrial casters. Choose from a variety of sizes, styles, and colors to discover the perfect storage solution for your shop.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:41:44','2026-05-14 16:41:44'),(2008,'Homak Tool Carts','homak-tool-carts',1593,'Enhance your tool storage and transport with Homak Tool Carts. Designed to elevate your tool organization, these carts offer a range of shelf options and come in multiple sizes. Choose between a sliding top or a clamshell top to provide secure storage for your tools and parts. Their sturdy steel construction guarantees impact resistance and durability in harsh working conditions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:41:47','2026-05-14 16:41:47'),(2009,'Extreme Tools Tool Carts','extreme-tools-tool-carts',1593,'Designed to meet the storage needs of professional technicians, these Extreme Tools Tool Carts combine the convenience of a cart with the storage capacity of a cabinet. Our roll carts are crafted with heavy-duty steel, including impact-resistant reinforced corners for protection. Equipped with sturdy wheels and swivel casters, these carts make it easy to transport your tools.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:41:49','2026-05-14 16:41:49'),(2010,'Sunex® Tool Carts','sunex-tool-carts',1593,'Upgrade your workspace with Sunex® Tool Carts, essential for effectively storing your tools and parts. With Sunex® Tool Carts, experience a variety of shelving and locking lid options. They include durable steel construction and come in various sizes and colors, ensuring an ideal match for your storage and transportation needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:41:52','2026-05-14 16:41:52'),(2011,'Global Industrial™ Tool Carts','global-industrial-tool-carts',1593,'Our Global Industrial™ Tool Carts selection is the ideal solution for your tool storage and transportation needs. They provide maximum security and durable steel construction, suitable for harsh working environments. Our carts include various features, such as lockable compartments, full-length aluminum drawers, and swivel casters, allowing for easy mobility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:42:00','2026-05-14 16:42:00'),(2012,'Welding Carts','welding-carts-1',1594,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:42:56','2026-05-14 16:42:56'),(2013,'Wheelbarrows & Garden Cart Accessories','wheelbarrows-garden-cart-accessories',1595,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:45:01','2026-05-14 16:45:01'),(2014,'Nursery Shelf Trucks','nursery-shelf-trucks',1595,'Crafted with high-quality steel mesh, these nursery trucks provide durability and longevity for use in nurseries, greenhouses, and other environments. The sturdy steel frame provides excellent stability while the smooth-rolling casters allow for easy maneuverability in tight spaces. These nursery trucks are equipped with a perforated steel deck to ensure moisture & debris pass through.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:45:05','2026-05-14 16:45:05'),(2015,'Nursery Carts','nursery-carts',1595,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:45:07','2026-05-14 16:45:07'),(2016,'Wheelbarrows','wheelbarrows',1595,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:45:11','2026-05-14 16:45:11'),(2017,'Towable Nursery Utility Carts','towable-nursery-utility-carts',1595,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:45:13','2026-05-14 16:45:13'),(2018,'Nursery Wagons','nursery-wagons',1595,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:45:16','2026-05-14 16:45:16'),(2019,'Wire Utility Carts','wire-utility-carts',1321,'Wire utility carts are used to store, transport, and organize parts, goods, and equipment. Rolling wire utility carts are equipped with caster wheels for easy maneuverability and shelves for optimal storage and organization. Its open-design minimizes dust collection while maximizing visibility, air circulation, and sprinkler penetration. Ideal for use in warehouses, retail, offices, laboratories, and other commercial and industrial applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:55:04','2026-05-14 16:55:04'),(2020,'Utility Cart Accessories','utility-cart-accessories-1',1321,'Utility cart accessories expand the functionality of utility carts, making them versatile tools for transporting equipment and supplies in industrial and commercial settings. From ladder hooks for hanging tools to power strips for charging devices, utility cart accessories enhance efficiency and organization and are invaluable in warehouses, maintenance facilities, and hospitality venues, where mobility and storage are essential for daily operations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:55:07','2026-05-14 16:55:07'),(2021,'Steel Utility Carts','steel-utility-carts',1321,'Steel utility carts transport inventory, parts, tools, equipment, and more efficiently and quickly around a facility. Featuring smooth-rolling casters for optimal maneuverability, utility carts streamline the material handling of goods from one location to the next. Their durable steel construction and multi-shelves enable the storage of heavy load capacities and sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:55:10','2026-05-14 16:55:10'),(2022,'Stainless Steel Utility Carts','stainless-steel-utility-carts',1321,'Built with multiple shelves to store and transport supplies, equipment, and inventory, Stainless Steel Utility Carts offer natural strength, durability, and rust & corrosion resistance, and are equipped with casters that roll smoothly for easy maneuverability around warehouses, stockrooms, and industrial environments. They are available in an assortment of shapes and sizes to suit a range of applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:55:13','2026-05-14 16:55:13'),(2023,'Plastic Utility Carts','plastic-utility-carts',1321,'Plastic utility carts offer an ideal solution for transporting supplies, tools, equipment, and other items. Made from sturdy plastic, our utility carts ensure reliable performance even under heavy loads, maintaining stability throughout. Equipped with durable casters, these heavy-duty plastic utility carts are easily maneuverable around any facility. With durability, versatility, and resilience customized for industrial or commercial settings, plastic utility carts stand as dependable storage and transport solutions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:55:16','2026-05-14 16:55:16'),(2024,'Aluminum Utility Carts','aluminum-utility-carts',1321,'Equipped with smooth-rolling casters for simple, convenient mobility around stockrooms, warehouses, and industrial facilities, Aluminum Utility Carts feature durable, non-ferrous materials that are built to withstand impacts, support heavy loads, resist rust, and remain lightweight for easy maneuverability. They have multiple shelves to carry inventory, equipment, and supplies.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:55:18','2026-05-14 16:55:18'),(2025,'Heavy Duty Aluminum Utility & Stock Carts','heavy-duty-aluminum-utility-stock-carts',2024,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:58:20','2026-05-14 16:58:20'),(2026,'Heavy Duty Aluminum Order Picking Carts','heavy-duty-aluminum-order-picking-carts',2024,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:58:23','2026-05-14 16:58:23'),(2027,'Heavy Duty Aluminum Floor Mat Carts','heavy-duty-aluminum-floor-mat-carts',2024,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:58:25','2026-05-14 16:58:25'),(2028,'Extreme Duty Aluminum Correctional Carts','extreme-duty-aluminum-correctional-carts',2024,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:58:28','2026-05-14 16:58:28'),(2029,'General Purpose Aluminum Utility Carts','general-purpose-aluminum-utility-carts',2024,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:58:30','2026-05-14 16:58:30'),(2030,'Aluminum Low Deck Stock Carts','aluminum-low-deck-stock-carts',2024,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:58:33','2026-05-14 16:58:33'),(2031,'Aluminum Stock Picker & Step Ladder Carts','aluminum-stock-picker-step-ladder-carts',2024,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 16:58:35','2026-05-14 16:58:35'),(2032,'Stainless Steel Electric Utility Cart','stainless-steel-electric-utility-cart',2022,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 17:03:07','2026-05-14 17:03:07'),(2033,'Stainless Steel Tub Rack Utility Carts','stainless-steel-tub-rack-utility-carts',2022,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 17:03:10','2026-05-14 17:03:10'),(2034,'Nexel® Solid Stainless Steel Utility Carts','nexel-solid-stainless-steel-utility-carts',2022,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 17:03:13','2026-05-14 17:03:13'),(2035,'Stainless Steel Low Deck Stock Carts','stainless-steel-low-deck-stock-carts',2022,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 17:03:15','2026-05-14 17:03:15'),(2036,'Stainless Steel Utility & Stock Carts','stainless-steel-utility-stock-carts',2022,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 17:03:18','2026-05-14 17:03:18'),(2037,'Crescent Utility Cart Accessories','crescent-utility-cart-accessories-1',2020,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 17:07:51','2026-05-14 17:07:51'),(2038,'Luxor Utility Cart Accessories','luxor-utility-cart-accessories-1',2020,'Designed to fit a wide range of utility carts with durable plastic construction that delivers strength in a lightweight build, Luxor Utility Cart Accessories are suitable for use in factory and warehouse settings, providing additional storage and uses for industrial carts. Accessories like storage bins offer extra room for holding and organizing an assortment of tools, supplies & small parts.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 17:07:54','2026-05-14 17:07:54'),(2039,'Rubbermaid® Utility Cart Accessories','rubbermaid-utility-cart-accessories-1',2020,'Rubbermaid Utility Cart Accessories include a variety of attachments and add-ons that increase the organization capabilities and overall functionality of industrial carts. Compartment boxes, steel drawers, and bins provide extra storage space for tools and small parts, while panel kits and locking door kits protect equipment from unwanted access.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 17:07:57','2026-05-14 17:07:57'),(2040,'Knaack Utility Cart Accessories','knaack-utility-cart-accessories-1',2020,'Available in a range of options to fit specific utility cart models and made with sturdy steel for strength and durability, Knaack Utility Cart Accessories are designed to improve the functionality of industrial carts in warehouse and factory environments. Accessories like security paneling feature a locking design that helps prevent unwanted access to stored supplies.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 17:08:00','2026-05-14 17:08:00'),(2041,'Global Industrial™ Utility Cart Accessories','global-industrial-utility-cart-accessories-1',2020,'Made from durable materials like steel & plastic, Global Industrial Utility Cart Accessories can be added to utility carts to improve their storage capability and overall functionality. Attachments, including hooks, bins, and drawers, provide space to hold tools and small parts, while replacement hardware helps extend their service life.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 17:08:03','2026-05-14 17:08:03'),(2042,'Metro Utility Cart Accessories','metro-utility-cart-accessories',2020,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 17:08:05','2026-05-14 17:08:05'),(2043,'Portable Parts Bin','portable-parts-bin-1',2020,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-14 17:08:58','2026-05-14 17:08:58'),(2044,'Aspirators','aspirators',482,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:19:31','2026-05-15 09:19:31'),(2045,'Calibration Gases','calibration-gases',482,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:20:14','2026-05-15 09:20:14'),(2046,'Centrifuges','centrifuges',482,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:20:54','2026-05-15 09:20:54'),(2047,'Desiccators','desiccators',482,'Desiccators provide a controlled environment for preserving moisture-sensitive materials such as chemicals, pharmaceuticals, documents, and more in laboratories and research facilities. Vacuum desiccators offer precise humidity control, while light-blocking desiccators protect light-sensitive samples from degradation. Essential for experiments, testing, and sample storage, desiccators ensure the integrity and stability of sensitive materials, enabling researchers and scientists to achieve accurate and reproducible results.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:21:32','2026-05-15 09:21:32'),(2048,'Electrochemistry Meters','electrochemistry-meters',482,'Electrochemistry meters are precision instruments used for measuring pH, conductivity, and dissolved oxygen levels in aqueous solutions. With accurate sensors and intuitive interfaces, conductivity meters provide reliable data for scientific research, environmental monitoring, and quality control applications. Ideal for laboratories, water treatment facilities, and industrial processes, electrochemistry meters ensure accurate and consistent measurement of critical parameters, enabling informed decision-making and regulatory compliance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:22:09','2026-05-15 09:22:09'),(2049,'Fume Hoods','fume-hoods',482,'Fume Hoods are specialized chambers that provide advanced airflow technology to effectively contain hazardous fumes, vapors, and particles, resulting in safe, clean air within controlled environments. Whether ductless fume hoods, laminar flow hoods, canopy hoods, or fume hood cabinets, these integral air ventilation solutions maintain sterile conditions and contaminant-free environments within laboratories, pharmaceutical and biotech labs, as well as research and educational facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:22:59','2026-05-15 09:22:59'),(2050,'Homogenizers','homogenizers',482,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:23:39','2026-05-15 09:23:39'),(2051,'Laboratory Balance Scales','laboratory-balance-scales',482,'Lab balance scales are precise instruments for weighing a wide range of materials. These top-of-the-line scales feature a balance beam design for the most exact measurement results. These scales are accurate for industrial, educational or healthcare labs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:24:22','2026-05-15 09:24:22'),(2052,'Laboratory Filtration','laboratory-filtration',482,'Lab filtration is used in chemistry, biology, and environmental science for separating and purifying substances. It includes syringe filters, bottle top filters, and membrane filters. They help in sample preparation, impurity removal, and precise separations, with different pore sizes, substance compatibility, and ease of use. Lab filtration ensures accurate and reliable results in analytical processes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:24:59','2026-05-15 09:24:59'),(2053,'Laboratory Gas Valves','laboratory-gas-valves-1',482,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:26:29','2026-05-15 09:26:29'),(2054,'Laboratory Mixers','laboratory-mixers',482,'Laboratory mixers are essential tools in scientific and medical settings, designed to blend, homogenize, and agitate substances with precision. The mixers are equipped with various mixing attachments, such as blades, paddles, and impellers, to accommodate different sample types and viscosities. They are ideal for multiple applications, including medical laboratories, research and development facilities, and pharmaceutical production.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:27:12','2026-05-15 09:27:12'),(2055,'Laboratory Tables','laboratory-tables',482,'Lab tables are designed to meet the specific needs and requirements of scientific research and experiments. They are typically made from chemical resistant materials to ensure years of long lasting use and have an easy to clean work surface. Lab tables are ideal for use in laboratories, classrooms & healthcare facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:27:51','2026-05-15 09:27:51'),(2056,'Medical Equipment Covers','medical-equipment-covers',482,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:28:29','2026-05-15 09:28:29'),(2057,'Microscopes','microscopes',482,'Microscopes are essential instruments used to magnify and provide clear views of tiny objects in scientific laboratory settings, including hospitals, clinics, and schools. They offer high-resolution imaging, adjustable magnification levels, and ergonomic designs for comfortable use. Available in various types and styles like Compound, Digital, or Stereo, microscopes can be used for clinical research, medical diagnostics, and educational purposes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:29:16','2026-05-15 09:29:16'),(2058,'Rotary Evaporators','rotary-evaporators',482,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:29:49','2026-05-15 09:29:49'),(2059,'Rotators, Rockers & Shakers','rotators-rockers-shakers',482,'Rotators, rockers, and shakers provide controlled and consistent agitation, mixing, and shaking of medical samples. Most models feature variable speed control, allowing users to adjust the speed according to the specific requirements of their applications. They are designed to accommodate a variety of containers, including flasks, tubes, microplates, and gel trays, through interchangeable and adaptable platforms. The tools are ideal for laboratories, testing sites, or other medical settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:30:27','2026-05-15 09:30:27'),(2060,'Scrub & Laboratory Faucets','scrub-laboratory-faucets-1',482,'Scrub and laboratory faucets prevent cross-contamination by providing a dedicated water source for laboratory use, distinct from standard faucets used in other areas. They offer precise control over water flow and temperature, which is crucial for experiments, sample preparation, and other laboratory tasks requiring accuracy. The faucets are ideal for chemical laboratories, research facilities, and educational institutions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:31:21','2026-05-15 09:31:21'),(2061,'Spectrophotometers','spectrophotometers',482,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:32:06','2026-05-15 09:32:06'),(2062,'Telescopes','telescopes',482,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:32:43','2026-05-15 09:32:43'),(2063,'Thermometers & Hydrometers','thermometers-hydrometers',482,'Thermometers and hydrometers are designed for measuring temperature and humidity. Some feature digital technology for quick and easy readings, often with additional features such as memory storage and data logging. Thermometers and hydrometers are ideal for use in healthcare facilities, laboratories, and industrial processes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:37:26','2026-05-15 09:37:26'),(2064,'Ultrasonic Cleaners','ultrasonic-cleaners',482,'Ultrasonic cleaners are designed for precision cleaning, using ultrasonic waves to create microscopic bubbles in a cleaning solution. The bubbles implode upon contact with the surface of objects, effectively removing contaminants, dirt, and residues. They are ideal for cleaning delicate and intricate instruments such as surgical tools, laboratory glassware, and precision components in medical, laboratory, and healthcare facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:38:12','2026-05-15 09:38:12'),(2065,'Water Purification Devices','water-purification-devices',482,'Water purification devices are designed to remove impurities and contaminants from water making it safe for consumption or scientific use. Filters and cartridges are easy to change and feature different filtration technologies depending on the contaminant. Water purification devices are ideal for any laboratory or scientific need.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:40:09','2026-05-15 09:40:09'),(2066,'Circulators & Water Baths','circulators-water-baths',483,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:43:52','2026-05-15 09:43:52'),(2067,'Cryogenic Storage','cryogenic-storage',483,'Cryogenic storage is essential for storing temperature-sensitive pharmaceuticals, vaccines, and other medical products that require ultra-low temperatures to maintain their stability and efficacy. Some storage options include tanks, containers, boxes, and more for long-term preservation. The storage solutions are ideal for medical research laboratories, pharmaceutical manufacturing, hospitals, and clinical laboratories.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:44:43','2026-05-15 09:44:43'),(2068,'Dry Baths & Blocks','dry-baths-blocks',483,'Dry baths and blocks are used for precise control over the heating and cooling process in controlled environments including laboratories. Dry baths are compact and are designed to maintain specific temperatures for lab samples in tubes or microplates. The accompanying blocks, are made of heavy duty materials to ensure uniform heat distribution. Dry baths come with microprocessor controls, overtemperature protections, and varying capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:45:36','2026-05-15 09:45:36'),(2069,'Perforated Flat Shelf Utility Carts','perforated-flat-shelf-utility-carts',2023,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:57:33','2026-05-15 09:57:33'),(2070,'Round Post Service & Utility Carts with Tray Shelf','round-post-service-utility-carts-with-tray-shelf',2023,'Our utility carts with wheels and tray shelves are perfect for storage and transport needs. These lightweight carts feature deep trays to help secure products during transit. Designed for smooth mobility, they come in a range of sizes and styles.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:57:36','2026-05-15 09:57:36'),(2071,'Shop & Work Center Utility Carts with Tray Shelf','shop-work-center-utility-carts-with-tray-shelf',2023,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:57:39','2026-05-15 09:57:39'),(2072,'Shop & Work Center Utility Carts with Flat Shelf','shop-work-center-utility-carts-with-flat-shelf',2023,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:57:42','2026-05-15 09:57:42'),(2073,'Flat Shelf Utility Carts','flat-shelf-utility-carts',2023,'Our flat-shelf utility carts have a large work surface making them ideal for many different applications. These work carts can hold up to 500 lbs and are designed to resist staining, denting, and rusting. Available with either 2 or 3 shelves these flat shelf carts are designed for easy loading and unloading of products',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:57:45','2026-05-15 09:57:45'),(2074,'Service & Busing Utility Carts','service-busing-utility-carts-1',2023,'Wide selection of service & busing utility carts perfect for any commercial or industrial space. Service carts feature up to 4 shelves, locking storage cabinets, and swivel casters making them easy to maneuver. With a variety of sizes and different shelf types, these busing carts are sure to meet any of your workplace storage or transportation needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:57:48','2026-05-15 09:57:48'),(2075,'Tray Shelf Utility Carts','tray-shelf-utility-carts',2023,'Our high-quality tray shelf utility carts are perfect for any commercial or industrial use. Made of durable materials, these plastic work carts resist stains, scratches, and rust. Built to hold up to 750 lbs, our tray shelf utility carts can help with any storage and transportation needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 09:57:51','2026-05-15 09:57:51'),(2076,'General Purpose Steel Utility Carts','general-purpose-steel-utility-carts',2021,'Streamline material handling and organization with General Purpose Utility Carts. The multi-tiered design offers ample storage, enhancing organization and accessibility to items. Utility carts are crafted for durability and are ideal for moving items around offices, warehouses, and more. They feature smooth-rolling casters for optimal maneuverability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:07:25','2026-05-15 10:07:25'),(2077,'Low Deck Steel Utility Carts','low-deck-steel-utility-carts',2021,'Low deck utility carts are versatile and sturdy transport equipment designed for material handling tasks in various industrial settings, including warehouses and workshops. The low-profile design and durable casters of these low deck carts provides mobility and easy loading and unloading, making them ideal for applications that involve moving heavy or bulky items. With durable construction and a low deck height, these carts offer reliability and stability, ensuring the safe and efficient transport of materials.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:07:28','2026-05-15 10:07:28'),(2078,'Stock & Order Picking Steel Utility Carts','stock-order-picking-steel-utility-carts',2021,'Stock and order picking utility carts provide efficient material handling and storage ideal in distribution centers or fulfillment centers. Designed for heavy-duty applications, metal carts excel in transporting goods, making order fulfillment and stock replenishment a breeze. With a sturdy construction and ergonomic features, such as swivel caster wheels, heavy-duty stock carts ensure durability, mobility, and ease of use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:07:32','2026-05-15 10:07:32'),(2079,'Fold-A-Way Steel Stock & Utility Cart','fold-a-way-steel-stock-utility-cart',2078,'Easily haul materials while saving space with our Fold-A-Way Steel Stock & Utility Cart. The construction of these steel utility carts make them durable and sure to last, while polyurethane casters and rubber wheels ensure a smooth ride. To save space in tight areas, this cart is able to be easily folded and transported.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:21:20','2026-05-15 10:21:20'),(2080,'Steel Stock & Utility Carts with Drawers','steel-stock-utility-carts-with-drawers',2078,'Steel Stock & Utility Carts with Drawers allow you to move more items smoothly. These heavy-duty utility carts are available in multiple lengths, widths, and heights and feature both two and three-shelf options. These carts are built to last and are made with durable and high-quality materials.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:21:23','2026-05-15 10:21:23'),(2081,'Steel Flat Shelf Stock & Utility Carts with Ergonomic Handle','steel-flat-shelf-stock-utility-carts-with-ergonomic-handle',2078,'Keep items moving with steel flat stock & shelf trucks with ergonomic handles. The raised offset handles feature cross brace hand guards that ensure safety and comfort while pushing. These welded steel shelf trucks are made to carry heavy-duty items, and feature structurally angled corners and shelf reinforcements on shelves longer than thirty six inches for added durability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:21:26','2026-05-15 10:21:26'),(2082,'Heavy Duty Steel Stock & Shelf Carts','heavy-duty-steel-stock-shelf-carts',2078,'Heavy-duty steel stock and shelf carts are essential for material handling in industrial facilities, warehouses, and various work settings. These stock picker carts are designed with both two and three shelf options to move heavy items quickly and efficiently while keeping them organized and easily accessible.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:21:32','2026-05-15 10:21:32'),(2083,'Steel Order Picking Carts','steel-order-picking-carts',2078,'Steel order picking carts come equipped with three shelves, and they are available in a variety of lengths, sizes, and heights to accommodate different product sizes and quantities. Made of high-quality steel, these order picking carts are built to withstand the rigors of daily use and are capable of transporting products weighing up to 3,600 lbs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:21:36','2026-05-15 10:21:36'),(2084,'Stock Picker & Step Ladder Carts','stock-picker-step-ladder-carts',2078,'Increase stocking efficiency with stock picker and step ladder carts. These step ladder carts are available in both two and three-shelf options and in heights up to seventy-three inches. Ensure safety while stocking with non-slip features and brakes that keep the cart from moving and shifting.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:21:39','2026-05-15 10:21:39'),(2085,'Steel Tray Shelf Stock & Utility Carts with Ergonomic Handle','steel-tray-shelf-stock-utility-carts-with-ergonomic-handle',2078,'Ergonomic steel stock & shelf steel utility carts allow for easy transport of materials. These welded steel utility trucks have structural angled corners and shelf reinforcements longer than 36\" for added durability and handling. Retaining lips on both shelves are made to secure contents, and a raised ergonomical offset handle has a cross brace hand guard for added safety.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:21:43','2026-05-15 10:21:43'),(2086,'Steel Flat Shelf Stock & Utility Carts','steel-flat-shelf-stock-utility-carts-1',2078,'Steel Stock & Shelf Trucks move items quickly and efficiently. Our heavy duty utility carts have structural angled corners, up to three shelves, and lengths ranging between twenty four and thirty six inches for simple transport of heavy equipment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:21:45','2026-05-15 10:21:45'),(2087,'Steel Tray Shelf Stock & Utility Carts','steel-tray-shelf-stock-utility-carts',2078,'Transport materials quickly through warehouses and facilities with steel stock & shelf utility carts. These heavy duty utility carts feature both two and three shelf options with retaining lips to keep small items secure. Metal carts ranging from 30\" to 53\" in length can take on equipment and materials of all weights and sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:21:49','2026-05-15 10:21:49'),(2088,'Steel Tubular Low Deck Service Trucks with Sloped Handle','steel-tubular-low-deck-service-trucks-with-sloped-handle',2077,'Steel tubular low deck service trucks with a sloped handle help you move heavy loads with ease. These low deck carts are able to maneuver easily and can handle up to 1200 lbs. Available in a variety of colors with either 1 or 2 shelves.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:23:46','2026-05-15 10:23:46'),(2089,'Steel Low Deck Service Carts with Floor Locks','steel-low-deck-service-carts-with-floor-locks',2077,'Low deck service carts are equipped with floor locks to provide maximum safety when loading and unloading carts. Utility carts also have 2 tray shelves and can carry loads of up to 3600 lbs. All units are finished with a gray powder coat to ensure long-lasting use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:23:49','2026-05-15 10:23:49'),(2090,'Steel Low Deck Service Trucks with Sloped Handle','steel-low-deck-service-trucks-with-sloped-handle',2077,'Steel low deck service trucks are equipped with a sloped handle to maximize comfortability when hauling heavy loads. Available in various finishes, these trucks have 2 shelves with a weight capacity of up to 3600 lbs. These steel service trucks are durable and made to last.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:23:52','2026-05-15 10:23:52'),(2091,'Steel Heavy Duty Reversible Shelf Utility Carts','steel-heavy-duty-reversible-shelf-utility-carts',2076,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:26:43','2026-05-15 10:26:43'),(2092,'Steel Carts with Vinyl Mats','steel-carts-with-vinyl-mats',2076,'Transfer heavy loads stress-free with our steel carts equipped with vinyl mats. The shock absorbing vinyl matting provides a cushioned, non-conductive surface. The non-slip vinyl mats help keep products in place during transport. Steel carts are available with 2 shelves and can carry 1200 lbs, making them ideal for any industrial space.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:26:46','2026-05-15 10:26:46'),(2093,'Steel Carts with Perforated Shelf','steel-carts-with-perforated-shelf',2076,'Steel service carts with perforated shelves are the perfect way to transport lighter loads in any commercial or industrial space. The perforated shelves allow for unwanted debris and moisture to pass through. Service carts are available in a green or gray finish with a weight capacity of up to 1200 lbs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:26:49','2026-05-15 10:26:49'),(2094,'6-Wheeled Heavy Duty Steel Shelf Trucks','6-wheeled-heavy-duty-steel-shelf-trucks',2076,'Move heavy loads with ease with our heavy duty steel shelf trucks. These 6-wheeled utility carts are available with up to 3 shelves and are designed for improved mobility. Hard tread phenolic casters provide increased maneuverability with a tight turn radius. With a weight capacity of up to 3600 lbs these steel shelf trucks are ideal for any warehouse or industrial space.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:26:52','2026-05-15 10:26:52'),(2095,'Steel Double Handle Heavy Duty Shelf Truck','steel-double-handle-heavy-duty-shelf-truck',2076,'Double-handle shelf trucks are ideal for any heavy-duty hauling needs. The dual handles allow the carts to easily move from either side and can maneuver through narrow aisles and tight corners. With a weight capacity of up to 3600 lbs, these steel heavy-duty shelf trucks are perfect for any industrial or commercial space.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:26:55','2026-05-15 10:26:55'),(2096,'Steel Receiving Carts','steel-receiving-carts',2076,'Perfect for any industrial or commercial space, our steel receiving cart has 4 shelves and ventilated locking cabinets to keep tools clean and electronics secure. With a weight capacity of up to 500 lbs our receiving carts can help you move heavy-duty items safely.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:26:58','2026-05-15 10:26:58'),(2097,'Steel Deep Shelf Trucks','steel-deep-shelf-trucks',2076,'Our steel deep-shelf utility carts provide ample carrying space for any bulky products. Carts are available with 2 or 3 shelves and a depth of up to 12\". With smooth-rolling casters, these deep-shelf trucks are able to maneuver easily even when carrying heavy loads.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:27:02','2026-05-15 10:27:02'),(2098,'Dry Ice Makers','dry-ice-makers',483,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:31:23','2026-05-15 10:31:23'),(2099,'Hotplates & Stirrers','hotplates-stirrers',483,'Hotplates and stirrers are lab devices that heat and stir liquids for scientific research and experimentation. They have precise temperature control, adjustable settings, and safety features such as overheat protection. Hotplates are used in research labs, chemical analysis, biotechnology labs, and quality control in pharmaceutical and food testing industries.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:32:05','2026-05-15 10:32:05'),(2100,'Incubators','incubators',483,'Incubators are designed to provide a controlled environment for cultivating and studying microbiological cultures. They feature precise temperature and humidity control in order to support various scientific experiments. Ideal for research labs and medical facilities, incubators facilitate the growth of cultures and maintain optimal conditions for scientific investigations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:33:03','2026-05-15 10:33:03'),(2101,'Ovens & Furnaces','ovens-furnaces',483,'Ovens and furnaces are heating appliances used for industrial processes, laboratory experiments, and material testing. They offer controlled heating environments for tasks like drying, curing, sterilizing, sintering, annealing, and heat treating. Ovens and furnaces have precise temperature control, uniform heating distribution, and programmable settings to accommodate different materials and processes. They are commonly used in laboratories, research facilities, manufacturing plants, and educational institutions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:34:23','2026-05-15 10:34:23'),(2102,'Warming Cabinets','warming-cabinets',483,'Warming Cabinets are engineered to deliver precise temperature control for medical and laboratory environments. Trusted by healthcare professionals, heated cabinets offer blanket warming solutions. Ideal for hospitals, clinics, and laboratories, medical warming cabinets ensure that medical supplies and blankets are kept at the required temperature. Warming cabinets are essential for maintaining the integrity of temperature-sensitive materials.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:35:01','2026-05-15 10:35:01'),(2103,'Stainless Steel Wire Utility Carts','stainless-steel-wire-utility-carts',2019,'Capable of standing up to moisture and temperature extremes, Stainless Steel Wire Utility Carts are mobile shelving units crafted from durable stainless steel to withstand heavy-duty use and provide rust and corrosion resistance. The open wire design helps ensure air circulation, sprinkler penetration, and reduced dust accumulation, while built-in casters and handle promote maneuverability through a variety of industrial environments, including stockrooms and warehouses.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:35:13','2026-05-15 10:35:13'),(2104,'Zinc Plated Wire Utility Carts','zinc-plated-wire-utility-carts',2019,'Available in a selection of sizes with multiple shelves to suit a variety of inventory transport and storage needs, Zinc Plated Wire Utility Carts feature durable construction with a zinc plating for strength and protection against corrosion. Built-in casters roll smoothly for efficient portability through stockrooms, warehouses, and other industrial areas, while the attached handle makes it easy to maneuver around the facility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:35:15','2026-05-15 10:35:15'),(2105,'Poly-Green Epoxy Wire Utility Carts','poly-green-epoxy-wire-utility-carts',2019,'Poly Green Epoxy Wire Utility Carts are finished with a special green epoxy powder coat over zinc-chromate electroplating and a NEXGard undercoat that inhibits the growth of mold, mildew, and bacteria, making them ideal for wet and dry environments. The open wire design minimizes dust collection while maximizing visibility, air circulation, and sprinkler penetration, with attached casters that roll smoothly for easy maneuverability of inventory, supplies, equipment or parts around warehouses, storerooms, and industrial facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:35:18','2026-05-15 10:35:18'),(2106,'Black & Silver Epoxy Wire Utility Carts','black-silver-epoxy-wire-utility-carts',2019,'Great for storing & moving inventory and supplies in warehouses & storerooms, Black & Silver Epoxy Wire Utility Carts feature an epoxy powder coat finish over a rust-inhibiting undercoat to withstand use in wet and dry environments. Available in a variety of styles and sizes to suit a range of industrial storage needs, the carts have an open wire design that maximizes visibility and air circulation while minimizing dust accumulation, with casters for smooth rolling and simple portability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:35:20','2026-05-15 10:35:20'),(2107,'Galvanized & Stainless Steel Solid Utility Carts','galvanized-stainless-steel-solid-utility-carts',2019,'Crafted from durable galvanized steel or stainless steel for strength and corrosion resistance, Galvanized & Stainless Steel Solid Utility Carts provide a sturdy surface to store and transport items in extreme temperatures and wet or dry environments. Multiple shelves offer space for various supplies & equipment, and built-in casters allow the carts to roll smoothly around stockrooms, warehouses, and other industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:35:23','2026-05-15 10:35:23'),(2108,'Chrome Wire Utility Carts','chrome-wire-utility-carts',2019,'Featuring a high-gloss chrome finish and made for use in dry environments, Chrome Wire Utility Carts are designed to transport inventory in stockrooms and warehouses with an open wire design that maximizes visibility and promotes air circulation. Built-in casters roll smoothly for easy portability and the carts come in a range of sizes to suit a variety of industrial applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:35:25','2026-05-15 10:35:25'),(2109,'Bench Protectors & Liners','bench-protectors-liners',484,'Bench protectors and liners prevent damage to workbenches and keep labs in good working condition. Durable liners guard against most acids, oils, fine particulates, and other chemical contaminants while providing a non-slip surface for secure containment of spills. Lab bench protectors and workbench protectors include accessories for universal fit and sizes. Economical and heavy-duty materials available to match the level of protection required. Great for professional labs and classrooms.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:36:15','2026-05-15 10:36:15'),(2110,'Bottle Holders','bottle-holders',483,'Bottle Holders are essential accessories for organizing and accessing bottles with ease. Built from sturdy materials like stainless steel or durable plastics, bottle holders ensure long-lasting performance. Bottle holders can accommodate various bottle sizes and shapes securely. Ideal for home kitchens, bars, or outdoor events, bottle holders keep items neatly stored and easily accessible while maximizing space.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:41:51','2026-05-15 10:41:51'),(2111,'Bostitch Chrome Stow-Away Carts','bostitch-chrome-stow-away-carts',2108,'Bostitch Chrome Stow-Away Carts are an ideal solution for storage, delivery, and organizing. The carts feature an epoxy-coated steel and chrome shelves, rolling casters, and a collapsible design for easy storage. The carts are ideal for office, retail, and industrial use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:42:33','2026-05-15 10:42:33'),(2112,'Gas Cylinder Carts & Stands','gas-cylinder-carts-stands',483,'Gas cylinder carts are designed to safely and securely transport gas cylinders. They allow for easy loading and unloading of the cylinders and feature swivel casters for easy maneuverability. Cylinder stands prevent the gas cylinders from falling, tipping, or rolling which reduces the risk of accidents and increases workplace safety. Ideal for use in laboratories, medical facilities and other industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:42:34','2026-05-15 10:42:34'),(2113,'Omnimed® Chrome Utility Carts','omnimed-chrome-utility-carts',2108,'Omnimed® Chrome Utility Carts are sturdy and reliable carts constructed with heavy-duty chrome plated steel frame and removable shelves. The utility carts are available in a variety of sizes for any medical, industrial, or office purposes. The scissor frame easily folds flat for storage and shipping. The carts feature dual wheel swivel casters for easy maneuverability and locking caster brakes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:42:36','2026-05-15 10:42:36'),(2114,'Luxor Chrome Collapsible Wire Carts','luxor-chrome-collapsible-wire-carts',2108,'Luxor Chrome Collapsible Wire Carts feature a chrome steel frame with ergonomic handles that make maneuvering easy, and can be folded flat when not in use for space-saving storage. The deep basket shelves offer extra storage space. The collapsible wire carts include casters for easy transport, making them ideal for mailrooms, warehouses, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:42:38','2026-05-15 10:42:38'),(2115,'Nexel® Plastic Utility Carts','nexel-plastic-utility-carts',2108,'Nexel® Plastic Utility Carts are ideal for transporting items in commercial applications. The carts have solid plastic shelves that provide increased capacity and easy-to-clean surfaces. The shelves have a raised edge to prevent spills and heavy shelf load capacity and can be easily adjusted. The cart rolls smoothly on 5\" polyurethane stem casters. The utility carts are NSF-approved for dry use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:42:42','2026-05-15 10:42:42'),(2116,'Nexel® Chrome Instrument Carts','nexel-chrome-instrument-carts',2108,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:42:48','2026-05-15 10:42:48'),(2117,'Nexel® Chrome ESD Utility Carts','nexel-chrome-esd-utility-carts',2108,'Nexel® Chrome ESD Utility Carts are ideal for transporting electronics, circuit boards, and other sensitive materials. The ESD utility cart is electro-statically dissipative and meets NFPA 99 requirements for static control. They include adjustable shelving and swivel casters for smooth and easy mobility. The cart\'s open design maximizes air and light circulation and minimizes dust accumulation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:42:50','2026-05-15 10:42:50'),(2118,'Nexel® Chrome ESD Shelf Carts','nexel-chrome-esd-shelf-carts',2108,'Designed to dissipate or prevent the buildup of static electricity, Nexel® Chrome ESD Shelf Carts are ideal for storing and transporting electronic components and static-sensitive devices. Shelves adjust easily without tools and carts come with ESD swivel caster kits. Its open-design maximizes air and light circulation and minimizes dust accumulation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:42:54','2026-05-15 10:42:54'),(2119,'Nexel® Chrome Utility Carts','nexel-chrome-utility-carts',2108,'Nexel® Chrome Utility Carts offers a solution to carting and stocking an array of items. They have U-shaped handles on both ends to push or pull, brakes and casters for ease of transport, and bottom and top adjustable shelves. The heavy-duty casters on the carts provide smooth and easy maneuverability. The open design minimizes dust accumulation and maximizes light and sprinkler penetration.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:43:02','2026-05-15 10:43:02'),(2120,'Nexel® Chrome Shelf Carts','nexel-chrome-shelf-carts',2108,'Nexel® Chrome Shelf Carts offer storage, transport and organization of materials in commercial buildings, offices, and facilities. Made of welded steel in a chrome finish, the shelf carts feature adjustable shelves and casters that are durable and great for industrial use. The open design maximizes visibility and air circulation. The carts assemble quickly without tools to fit any application.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:43:03','2026-05-15 10:43:03'),(2121,'Nexel® Chrome ESD Push Carts','nexel-chrome-esd-push-carts',2108,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:43:03','2026-05-15 10:43:03'),(2122,'Nexel® Chrome Curbside Carts','nexel-chrome-curbside-carts',2108,'Nexel® Chrome Curbside Carts provide storage and transportation of curbside orders. Made from heavy-duty chrome-coated steel, the NSF-approved carts are resistant to chipping, rusting, and scratches. The carts feature high visibility, 4-way access shelves and four polyurethane casters for easy mobility. Designed to transport multiple mobile pick-up orders in retail or foodservice settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:43:10','2026-05-15 10:43:10'),(2123,'Nexel® Chrome Retail Carts','nexel-chrome-retail-carts',2108,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:43:14','2026-05-15 10:43:14'),(2124,'Laboratory Dispensers','laboratory-dispensers',483,'Laboratory dispensers help organize, store, and dispense everyday laboratory supplies. The dispensing bins and dispenser stations are designed to contain and dispense gloves, wipes, towels, bags, and other essentials found in a medical or laboratory setting. Dispensers of lab supplies are designed with strategic openings or easy-to-open lids for quick dispensing or accessing of material. Dispensers are constructed from durable materials for hard-working every day use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:43:20','2026-05-15 10:43:20'),(2125,'Laboratory Trays','laboratory-trays',484,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:44:24','2026-05-15 10:44:24'),(2126,'PPE Station Dispensers','ppe-station-dispensers',484,'PPE Station Dispensers are specialized organizers designed to efficiently dispense and store essential protective gear in various environments. They promote accessibility to essential protective gear, including gloves, masks, gowns, and more. PPE Station Dispensers are commonly used in medical facilities, laboratories, cleanrooms, and industrial settings where adherence to safety protocols is crucial.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:45:06','2026-05-15 10:45:06'),(2127,'Racks & Stands','racks-stands',484,'Racks and stands offer secure storage for a variety of laboratory items, including sample containers, test tubes, vials, and other tools. They provide secure storage for delicate glassware, preventing accidental breakage and minimizing the risk of spills or accidents. Racks and stands are ideal for commercial medical facilities and lab settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:45:43','2026-05-15 10:45:43'),(2128,'Splash Guards & Shields','splash-guards-shields',484,'Splash guards and shields serve as vital protective measures, safeguarding lab personnel from hazardous chemical splashes and enhancing overall safety. Available in models constructed from impact-resistant polycarbonate with shatterproof coatings and stainless steel for maximum durability, they offer strong protection. These shields find applications across various settings, including laboratories, medical facilities, and research environments, ensuring safety during experiments and procedures.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:46:20','2026-05-15 10:46:20'),(2129,'Nexel® Solid Stainless Steel Utility Carts','nexel-solid-stainless-steel-utility-carts-1',2107,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:46:45','2026-05-15 10:46:45'),(2130,'Nexel® Solid Galvanized Shelf Carts','nexel-solid-galvanized-shelf-carts',2107,'The Nexel® Solid Galvanized Shelf Carts efficiently transport and store materials and equipment. Constructed from heavy-duty galvanized steel, these carts can easily hold high-weight capacities. The shelves can be adjusted to accommodate items of all sizes. Ideal for warehouses, manufacturing facilities, and food service applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:46:47','2026-05-15 10:46:47'),(2131,'Nexel® Solid Galvanized Utility Carts','nexel-solid-galvanized-utility-carts',2107,'Nexel® Solid Galvanized Utility Carts provide a flat and stable surface for transporting and storing equipment. The shelves can be adjusted in 1\'\' increments, allowing items of all shapes and sizes to be transported. Galvanized steel construction is durable and resistant to rust and corrosion. Polyurethane swivel casters allow smooth movement in healthcare facilities, warehouses, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:46:50','2026-05-15 10:46:50'),(2132,'Absorbent Mats & Rolls','absorbent-mats-rolls',486,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:52:23','2026-05-15 10:52:23'),(2133,'Beakers','beakers',486,'Beakers are used to prepare and mix substances, facilitating reactions and experiments in a controlled environment. They are suitable for heating liquids over a Bunsen burner or other heat sources, enabling evaporation or controlled heating of substances. They can be used across various applications, including chemical laboratories, educational settings, and industrial research settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:53:12','2026-05-15 10:53:12'),(2134,'Bottles & Jars','bottles-jars',486,'Bottles and jars are containers designed for storing, preserving, and dispensing various liquids, powders, or specimens in scientific settings. They provide a secure and sterile environment, ensuring the safe storage and preservation of substances, making them ideal for laboratory, research, pharmaceutical, and medical facilities. They can feature airtight seals, screw caps, or stoppers to prevent leaks and maintain sample integrity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:54:07','2026-05-15 10:54:07'),(2135,'Nexel® Silver Epoxy Wire Curbside Carts','nexel-silver-epoxy-wire-curbside-carts',2106,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:54:12','2026-05-15 10:54:12'),(2136,'Nexel® Silver Epoxy Wire Utility Carts','nexel-silver-epoxy-wire-utility-carts',2106,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:54:14','2026-05-15 10:54:14'),(2137,'Alera® Black Epoxy Wire Utility Carts','alera-black-epoxy-wire-utility-carts',2106,'Alera® Black Epoxy Wire Utility Carts are versatile, durable carts designed for efficient transport and organization of items. These carts feature swivel casters and a sturdy steel frame with an epoxy coating, ensuring durability and making them suitable for warehouses, offices, and more. They offer ample storage, while the open wire design allows for air circulation to minimize dust accumulation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:54:17','2026-05-15 10:54:17'),(2138,'Omnimed® Black Epoxy Wire Utility Carts','omnimed-black-epoxy-wire-utility-carts',2106,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:54:33','2026-05-15 10:54:33'),(2139,'Safco® Black Epoxy Wire Utility Carts','safco-black-epoxy-wire-utility-carts',2106,'Safco® Black Epoxy Wire Utility Carts make it easy to organize and transport a variety of equipment and supplies. Durable all-steel construction with epoxy powdercoat finish resists chips and scratches. Open wire design permits sprinkler, air and light penetration. These utility carts feature durable nylon swivel casters, and are available in various shelf configurations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:54:33','2026-05-15 10:54:33'),(2140,'Bostitch Black Epoxy Wire Utility Carts','bostitch-black-epoxy-wire-utility-carts',2106,'Bostitch Black Epoxy Wire Utility Carts are perfect for the storage and transport of materials. With a heavy-duty steel frame and solid black epoxy finish, these utility carts offer superior strength and durability. These carts feature multiple swivel casters for peak maneuverability, and some models feature a folding ability for easy storage when not in use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:54:47','2026-05-15 10:54:47'),(2141,'Nexel® Black Epoxy Retail Carts','nexel-black-epoxy-retail-carts',2106,'Nexel® black epoxy retail carts enhance goods movement with a smooth design, open-wire structure for visibility, and swivel casters. Ideal for wet/dry environments, they resist corrosion. Suitable for retail, warehouses, and stockrooms, the carts feature adjustable shelves and a solid wood butcher block top for versatile storage and display of light to medium equipment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:54:47','2026-05-15 10:54:47'),(2142,'Nexel® Black Epoxy Shelf Carts','nexel-black-epoxy-shelf-carts',2106,'Nexel® Black Epoxy Shelf Carts are designed for transporting goods, materials, equipment around facilities. They feature a black epoxy powder coat over a rust-inhibiting undercoat, an open design that minimizes dust accumulation, and four swivel casters. These shelf carts are NSF-listed for Dry and Wet environments making them perfect for use in retail, and other commercial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:54:47','2026-05-15 10:54:47'),(2143,'Nexel® Poly-Green® Wire Shelf Carts','nexel-poly-green-wire-shelf-carts',2105,'Nexel® Poly-Green® Wire Shelf Carts provide mobile storage. Easily adjustable shelves, smooth roll on durable stem casters, and NSF approved for wet or dry use. Green powder-epoxy over zinc-chromate electro-plating handles temperature and moisture extremes well. NEXGard anti-microbial agent protects against bacteria, mold, and mildew that cause odors and product degradation. Great for warehouses.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:57:53','2026-05-15 10:57:53'),(2144,'Nexel® Poly-Green® Wire Utility Carts','nexel-poly-green-wire-utility-carts',2105,'Nexel® Poly-Green® Wire Utility Carts offer storage with convenient 4-way access and mobility. Smooth-rolling with adjustable shelf height, these carts minimize dust accumulation and maximize visibility. Green epoxy powder coat over zinc-chromate electroplating with NEXGard, an antimicrobial agent that inhibits bacteria, mold, and mildew. Ideal for commercial and industrial environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:57:56','2026-05-15 10:57:56'),(2145,'Nexel® Poly-Green® Push Carts','nexel-poly-green-push-carts',2105,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:58:00','2026-05-15 10:58:00'),(2146,'Metro Brite Wire Utility Carts','metro-brite-wire-utility-carts',2104,'Metro Brite Wire Utility Carts are heavy duty mobile solutions for efficient material transport and storage in industrial work environments. The wire utility cart is NSF-certified and features a breathable steel construction to minimize dust accumulation and increase content visibility. The heavy duty casters feature donut bumpers to protect walls from potential marks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:58:51','2026-05-15 10:58:51'),(2147,'Metro® Super Erecta® Stainless Steel Wire Shelf Carts','metro-super-erecta-stainless-steel-wire-shelf-carts',2103,'Metro® Stainless Steel Wire Utility Carts offer durability and ease of use, making them ideal for transporting equipment, and materials in various settings. Quality stainless steel construction ensures exceptional strength and corrosion resistance. Durable caster wheels ensure smooth movement across surfaces. The wire design allows for easy cleaning and prevents the build-up of dust and debris.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 10:59:36','2026-05-15 10:59:36'),(2148,'Carboys, Jerricans & Jugs','carboys-jerricans-jugs',486,'Carboys, jerricans, and jugs are designed to store liquids, chemicals, reagents, and laboratory solutions safely and securely. They feature leak-resistant closures and caps to prevent spills and contamination during storage and transport. Many models come with graduated scales for accurate measurement and volume control. They are ideal for use in commercial or industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 11:01:06','2026-05-15 11:01:06'),(2149,'Nozzles','nozzles',27,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 11:09:47','2026-05-15 11:09:47'),(2150,'Heat Guns','heat-guns-1',27,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 11:09:50','2026-05-15 11:09:50'),(2151,'Glue Guns','glue-guns-1',103,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 11:11:28','2026-05-15 11:11:28'),(2152,'Water Activated Tape Dispenser','water-activated-tape-dispenser',111,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 11:54:42','2026-05-15 11:54:42'),(2153,'Adhesive Transfer Tape Dispensers','adhesive-transfer-tape-dispensers',111,'Adhesive transfer tape dispensers are designed to quickly and easily dispense pressure-sensitive adhesive tape for various packaging, sealing, and labeling applications. They come in multiple styles and sizes to fit different tape sizes. These tape dispensers feature a handheld design, lightweight, adjustable brakes, and more. Ideal for factories, warehouses, and shipping departments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 11:54:44','2026-05-15 11:54:44'),(2154,'Strapping Tape Dispensers','strapping-tape-dispensers',111,'Our Strapping Tape Dispensers are equipped with a specialized corrugated blade designed for efficient cutting of tough tapes. These dispensers are constructed with a combination of high-quality materials, ensuring long-lasting durability. With a hand brake feature, operators can easily control the tension for secure reinforcing and bundling applications. Dimensions may vary by model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 11:54:47','2026-05-15 11:54:47'),(2155,'Wide Manual Tape & Label Dispensers','wide-manual-tape-label-dispensers',111,'Our wide tape and manual label dispensers conveniently seal and identify packages. They are industrial-grade devices that can easily dispense wide tape and labels. Made of durable plastic and steel, these wide tape dispensers are both economical and long-lasting. The label dispenser machines have a stable weighted base and multi-roll functionality, optimizing tape usage.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 11:54:50','2026-05-15 11:54:50'),(2156,'Bag Tapers','bag-tapers',111,'The bag sealer tape dispenser is designed to quickly and securely tape bags for high volume packaging. Models feature adjustable tension control and cardholders for easy tape loading and unloading. Bag tapers are suitable for any retail or industrial packaging operation. Choose from models offering reinforced paper or poly bags. Available in single-roll or heavy-duty dual-roll designs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 11:54:53','2026-05-15 11:54:53'),(2157,'Hand Held Tape Dispensers','hand-held-tape-dispensers',111,'Maximize packaging efficiency with our versatile hand-held packing tape dispensers. Ideal for warehouses, assembly lines, and carton sealing. Choose from Clamshell, Ergonomic, Heavy Duty, Lightweight, Mousetrap, and Pistol Grip styles. Featuring an adjustable brake and easy-grip handle, our hand-held tape dispensers are compatible with a variety of tape widths and come in various colors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 11:54:56','2026-05-15 11:54:56'),(2158,'Industrial Automatic Tape Dispensers','industrial-automatic-tape-dispensers',111,'Industrial automatic tape dispensers make packing more efficient in high volume packaging environments. With adjustable tension, they can fit a variety of tape sizes, and can quickly apply it to boxes and packages. The automatic tape dispenser includes an adjustable brake that controls the tape, a squeeze trigger to apply tension, and a steel blade that cuts the tape to the desired length.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 11:54:59','2026-05-15 11:54:59'),(2159,'Dispenser & Kraft Tape Bundles','dispenser-kraft-tape-bundles',111,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 11:55:02','2026-05-15 11:55:02'),(2160,'Kraft Tape Dispensers','kraft-tape-dispensers',111,'Kraft tape dispensers offer a simple and convenient way to seal boxes, packages, and other items during shipping. These water-activated kraft tape dispensers accommodate paper tape in a range of widths and incorporate advanced wetting systems for optimal adhesion. Various models are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 11:55:05','2026-05-15 11:55:05'),(2161,'Art Glue & Putty','art-glue-putty',122,'Art Glue and Putty provides an ideal alternative to traditional types of glue and adhesive. These glue and putty options are easy to use and quickly create a long-lasting bond for crafts and similar projects. Multiple sizes and package quantities are available to fit your application needs. Perfect for arts and DIY projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 12:18:02','2026-05-15 12:18:02'),(2162,'Glues & Adhesives','glues-adhesives',122,'Our selection of glues and adhesives includes a wide range of products ideal for various commercial projects. Adhesive types are available in multiple size and package quantity options to fit specific applications. With quality formulations and strong adhesive power, these heavy-duty glues and adhesives can meet a wide variety of needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 12:18:05','2026-05-15 12:18:05'),(2163,'Glue Sticks','glue-sticks',122,'Glue sticks are an easy-to-use adhesive solution that offers a mess-free application ideal for various craft projects. Acid-free and photo-safe, these glue sticks dry clear and can be used on paper, cardboard, and photos safely. Glue sticks offer strong staying power but are still washable and easy to remove from unwanted areas. Great for school and office use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 12:18:08','2026-05-15 12:18:08'),(2164,'Spray Adhesives','spray-adhesives',122,'Spray Adhesives are fast-drying, easy-to-apply, and stronger than other adhesive types. Great for use on a variety of materials and surface types, they offer a long term adhesion solution. These heavy duty spray adhesives are great for commercial purposes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 12:18:11','2026-05-15 12:18:11'),(2165,'Instant Bond Super Glue','instant-bond-super-glue',143,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 12:23:37','2026-05-15 12:23:37'),(2166,'Specialty Super Glue','specialty-super-glue',143,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 12:23:40','2026-05-15 12:23:40'),(2167,'Epoxy, Silicone, and Plastic Adhesives','epoxy-silicone-and-plastic-adhesives',147,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 12:25:31','2026-05-15 12:25:31'),(2168,'Contact Cement','contact-cement-1',149,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 12:28:51','2026-05-15 12:28:51'),(2169,'Epoxy, Silicone, and Plastic Adhesives','epoxy-silicone-and-plastic-adhesives-1',149,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 12:28:54','2026-05-15 12:28:54'),(2170,'Wood Filler Tub','wood-filler-tub',152,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 12:29:57','2026-05-15 12:29:57'),(2171,'Wood Glue','wood-glue-1',152,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 12:30:00','2026-05-15 12:30:00'),(2172,'Clear Label Protectors','clear-label-protectors',166,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 12:55:05','2026-05-15 12:55:05'),(2173,'Warning Message Safety Tapes','warning-message-safety-tapes',166,'Warning Message Safety Tapes are highly visible to communicate safety messages and mark off restricted areas. These caution tape rolls are made from durable and weather-resistant materials. Our warning tapes are color coded according to American Public Works Association Standards and meet OSHA codes for pedestrian safety. Dimensions, messages, and additional specifications vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 12:55:08','2026-05-15 12:55:08'),(2174,'Reflective Conspicuity Tapes','reflective-conspicuity-tapes',166,'Reflective Conspicuity Tapes enhance vehicle visibility in low-light conditions to improve safety and ensure that large vehicles meet FMCSA regulations. These high visibility reflective tape rolls are made with weather-resistant, retroreflective material and pressure sensitive adhesive for secure attachment. Select conspicuity reflective tape models offer brightness equivalent of 750+ candlepower.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 12:55:10','2026-05-15 12:55:10'),(2175,'Photoluminescent and Glow-in-the-Dark Tapes','photoluminescent-and-glow-in-the-dark-tapes',166,'Mark aisles and emergency equipment with our OSHA & ATM approved Photoluminescent and Glow-in-the-Dark Tapes. Our highly visible glow in the dark tapes do not require an electrical power source; they absorb and store energy from ambient light. With a high tack pressure sensitive adhesive, these photoluminescent safety tapes adhere to any flat, horizontal or vertical surface for lasting durability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 12:55:14','2026-05-15 12:55:14'),(2176,'Tape Applicators','tape-applicators',166,'Tape Applicators are designed to simplify the process of adhering tape to floor surfaces in industrial areas. The steel tubing construction offers lasting durability, while the lightweight, compact build makes our floor tape applicator easy to store. These industrial floor tape applicators have dual comfort grip handles and rubber wheels, which offer easy mobility and control.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 12:55:17','2026-05-15 12:55:17'),(2177,'Floor Marking Shapes Safety Tapes','floor-marking-shapes-safety-tapes',166,'Floor Marking Shapes Safety Tapes are designed to aid in floor layout, sorting, and workflow while effectively utilizing space. Our floor marking shapes are made with tough adhesive to adhere to uneven, dirty, oily or painted floors, and withstands forklift and pedestrian traffic. This selection of safety floor tape is available in various high visibility, bright colors and shapes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 12:55:20','2026-05-15 12:55:20'),(2178,'Patterned Reflective Safety Tapes','patterned-reflective-safety-tapes',166,'Patterned Reflective Safety Tapes are ideal for a wide range of safety and security needs in commercial environments. These safety marking tapes feature a reflective, weather resistant surface with a tough adhesive drip and bright patterns to ensure optimal visibility and promote safety in low light conditions. Available in various dimensions, colors, and patterns, including striped safety tape.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 12:55:24','2026-05-15 12:55:24'),(2179,'Solid Reflective Safety Tapes','solid-reflective-safety-tapes',166,'Solid Reflective Safety Tapes mark off hazardous areas in commercial settings to protect employees and equipment. Our industrial floor marking tapes are weather resistant for lasting durability and can adhere to most surfaces, including concrete and wood. These reflective safety tapes offer high visibility in low light conditions. Colors, materials, and additional specifications vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 12:55:27','2026-05-15 12:55:27'),(2180,'Painter\'s Masking Tape','painters-masking-tape',177,'Painter\'s masking tape is used for painting and retouching. This tape can easily be applied to any rough, uneven, or hard-to-stick surface. Some models feature a super absorbent polymer that forms a micro barrier that seals the edges of the tape to prevent paint bleed and deliver sharp paint lines. Rolls of painter\'s tape are available in various sizes and colors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 12:57:20','2026-05-15 12:57:20'),(2181,'Masking Tape','masking-tape',177,'Masking tape is versatile making it ideal for a wide range of applications. This general-purpose tape can stick to many different surfaces and has medium-high adhesion. Most masking tape features a rubber-based adhesive and residue-free removal. Available in various sized rolls and colors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 12:57:23','2026-05-15 12:57:23'),(2182,'Slip-Resistant Conformable Tapes & Treads','slip-resistant-conformable-tapes-treads',178,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 13:03:00','2026-05-15 13:03:00'),(2183,'Photoluminescent And Glow-In-The-Dark Anti-Slip Tapes','photoluminescent-and-glow-in-the-dark-anti-slip-tapes',178,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 13:03:02','2026-05-15 13:03:02'),(2184,'Specialty Location Floor Tape','specialty-location-floor-tape',178,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 13:03:06','2026-05-15 13:03:06'),(2185,'Warning Message Anti-Slip Tape','warning-message-anti-slip-tape',178,'Warning message anti-slip tape provides increased traction and is ideal for use on ladders, ramps, loading docks, and walkways. Water and chemical resistance allows for adhesion over a wide variety of surfaces. Messages include \"watch your step\", \"caution\", and more. Various sizes and styles of anti-slip tape are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 13:03:10','2026-05-15 13:03:10'),(2186,'Striped Anti-Slip Tapes','striped-anti-slip-tapes',178,'Striped anti-slip tape provides improved traction in warehouses, offices, or schools. Most models are water and chemical resistant allowing for adhesion over a wide variety of surfaces. The stripes help draw attention to potentially hazardous areas. The tape is long-lasting and easy to install. Other specifications vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 13:03:13','2026-05-15 13:03:13'),(2187,'Slip-Resistant General Purpose Tapes/Treads','slip-resistant-general-purpose-tapestreads',178,'Slip-resistant general-purpose tapes are a quick and durable solution that provides excellent levels of grip and friction. Anti-slip tape can be applied to most surfaces and is made of highly durable material for long-lasting strength. Slip-resistant tapes helps reduce trip hazards, treads are available in various sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 13:03:15','2026-05-15 13:03:15'),(2188,'Endothermic Mat','endothermic-mat',179,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 13:06:17','2026-05-15 13:06:17'),(2189,'Lead Foil Tapes','lead-foil-tapes',179,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 13:06:19','2026-05-15 13:06:19'),(2190,'FSK Foil Tapes','fsk-foil-tapes',179,'FSK foil tape is designed for fans in need of sealing for increased insulation. Most models are UL Classified with an adhesive that contains mold-inhibiting agents to ensure regulatory compliance. Other features include a special acrylic adhesive that excels in hot or cold temperatures. A wide selection of FSK foil tape is available. Roll size and other specific features vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 13:06:22','2026-05-15 13:06:22'),(2191,'Aluminum Foil Tapes','aluminum-foil-tapes',179,'Aluminum foil tapes provide convenient adhesive repair for automotive garages, factories, and more. This tape is temperature, U.V., & solvent resistant and provides lasting durability. Tape easily adheres to a variety of irregular surfaces and acts as a barrier against moisture, dust, flame, and certain chemicals. A wide variety of aluminum foil tape is available. Specific features vary per unit.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 13:06:25','2026-05-15 13:06:25'),(2192,'Insulating Jacketing & Cooler Repair Tapes','insulating-jacketing-cooler-repair-tapes',179,'Insulating jacketing & cooler repair tapes are designed to have superior resistance to weathering, mold, UV, and extreme environmental conditions. Most models cut and seal with no additional tools required and are puncture and tear-resistant. Insulating jacketing and cooler tape is available in various roll sizes. Features vary per unit.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 13:06:27','2026-05-15 13:06:27'),(2193,'Silicone Self Sealing Tape Rolls','silicone-self-sealing-tape-rolls',180,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 13:09:56','2026-05-15 13:09:56'),(2194,'PVC Electrical Tape','pvc-electrical-tape',180,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 13:09:59','2026-05-15 13:09:59'),(2195,'Friction Tape Rolls','friction-tape-rolls',180,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 13:10:02','2026-05-15 13:10:02'),(2196,'Liquid Electrical Tape','liquid-electrical-tape',180,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 13:10:09','2026-05-15 13:10:09'),(2197,'Electrical Tape Rolls','electrical-tape-rolls',180,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 13:10:12','2026-05-15 13:10:12'),(2198,'Shurtape Mesh Tape','shurtape-mesh-tape',181,NUL