ous colors, weight capacities, and materials to suit your fall protection needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 13:26:07','2026-05-15 13:26:07'),(2209,'Safety Netting','safety-netting',1208,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 13:27:12','2026-05-15 13:27:12'),(2210,'US Netting Skylight Guards','us-netting-skylight-guards',2209,'US Netting Skylight Guards prevent fall-throughs during hatch installations and provide protection in the case of a fall. They are easy to set up and remain in place with continuous tension. Perfect for ensuring workers\' safety at construction sites, warehouses, and other industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 13:29:37','2026-05-15 13:29:37'),(2211,'US Netting Fall Safety Netting','us-netting-fall-safety-netting',2209,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 13:30:08','2026-05-15 13:30:08'),(2212,'Guardian Fall Protection Skylight Guards','guardian-fall-protection-skylight-guards',2209,'Guardian Fall Protection Skylight Guards are a must-have for effective fall protection. When installed over a skylight, this durable user-friendly equipment acts as a robust fall prevention system, protecting workers in the event of a fall onto a skylight. With these protective guards, you can ensure enhanced safety and convenience in fall arrest applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 13:32:41','2026-05-15 13:32:41'),(2213,'Clamps & Tube Fittings','clamps-tube-fittings',486,'Clamps and fittings increase safety and functionality of lab environments by securely holding equipment in place during an experiment. They are typically chemical resistant to ensure long lasting durability and are designed to create leak-proof connections between tubing. Clamps and fittings are ideal for any laboratories, researchers or educators.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 14:04:39','2026-05-15 14:04:39'),(2214,'Dippers, Scoops & Cups','dippers-scoops-cups',486,'Dippers, spoons, and cups are designed to be used for sampling or testing in medical or laboratory settings. They are ideal for facilitating controlled sample collection and precise dispensing. Designed for optimized cell culture sample handling and storage, these labware and utensils come in varying sizes allowing for efficient and accurate testing in any medical facility or laboratory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 14:05:50','2026-05-15 14:05:50'),(2215,'Flasks','flasks',486,'Flasks are ideal for different laboratory uses such as mixing, heating or containing liquids. They are made of high-quality materials to ensure lasting durability throughout many experiments. Flasks are commonly used in chemistry or scientific lab settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 14:06:46','2026-05-15 14:06:46'),(2216,'Funnels','funnels',486,'A funnel is a cone-shaped or cylindrical device with a narrow tube at the top and a wider opening at the bottom. Funnels are commonly used to transfer liquids or fine-grained substances from one container to another with minimal spillage or waste. From drum funnels to tabletop funnels, they are suitable for manufacturing and industrial processes, laboratories, and cooking.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 14:12:25','2026-05-15 14:12:25'),(2217,'Lab Trays','lab-trays',486,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 14:13:01','2026-05-15 14:13:01'),(2218,'Laboratory Cylinders','laboratory-cylinders',486,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 14:14:02','2026-05-15 14:14:02'),(2219,'Laboratory Dishes and Plates','laboratory-dishes-and-plates',486,'Laboratory dishes and plates are used for handling, storing and processing samples during an experiment. They can withstand high temperatures and are typically chemical resistant ensuring lasting dependability. Lab dishes are compatible with a range of equipment making them ideal for any medical or scientific research settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 14:16:24','2026-05-15 14:16:24'),(2220,'Laboratory Tape & Labels','laboratory-tape-labels',486,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 14:16:58','2026-05-15 14:16:58'),(2221,'Pipettes & Syringe Tips','pipettes-syringe-tips',486,'Pipettes and syringe tips enable controlled and accurate dispensing of liquids, ensuring precise volumes for experiments, assays, and medical procedures. They are also designed for precise volumes of samples in laboratory work. The pipettes and syringe tips are ideal for various applications, including chemical and pharmaceutical laboratories, medical facilities, and environmental testing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 14:17:57','2026-05-15 14:17:57'),(2222,'Tanks & Buckets','tanks-buckets',486,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 14:18:40','2026-05-15 14:18:40'),(2223,'Self-Retracting Lifelines & Lanyards','self-retracting-lifelines-lanyards',1208,'Great for utility workers, construction laborers, and maintenance staff working in elevated positions, Self-Retracting Lifelines & Lanyards arrest falls to help prevent injuries to personnel. They feature a self-retracting design that extends and retracts freely with the user’s movement, as well as an internal braking system that engages automatically when a fall is detected to minimize injuries. They are equipped with heavy-duty carabiners or snap hooks for secure attachment to workers’ harnesses.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 16:31:36','2026-05-15 16:31:36'),(2224,'Carpet Protection Sheeting','carpet-protection-sheeting',183,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 16:44:41','2026-05-15 16:44:41'),(2225,'Roberts® Carpet Installation Tape','roberts-carpet-installation-tape',183,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 16:44:44','2026-05-15 16:44:44'),(2226,'Ram Board Temporary Floor Protection','ram-board-temporary-floor-protection',183,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 16:44:48','2026-05-15 16:44:48'),(2227,'Specialty Tape','specialty-tape',183,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 16:44:51','2026-05-15 16:44:51'),(2228,'Seam Tape','seam-tape',183,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 16:44:54','2026-05-15 16:44:54'),(2229,'Carpet Grip & Tapes','carpet-grip-tapes',183,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 16:44:58','2026-05-15 16:44:58'),(2230,'PVC Floor & Surface Protection','pvc-floor-surface-protection',183,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 16:45:01','2026-05-15 16:45:01'),(2231,'All Climate Weatherseal','all-climate-weatherseal',184,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 17:07:30','2026-05-15 17:07:30'),(2232,'Window Air Conditioner Accessories','window-air-conditioner-accessories',184,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 17:07:33','2026-05-15 17:07:33'),(2233,'Weather Stripping Tape','weather-stripping-tape',184,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-15 17:07:36','2026-05-15 17:07:36'),(2234,'Portable Anchor Frames','portable-anchor-frames-1',1208,'Portable anchor frames are designed to provide mobile fall protection for large coverage areas. The portable anchor frames are made from durable steel and come in a variety of sizes to meet any need. They have an adjustable height which ensures adaptability in any scenario. The anchor frames are ideal for construction sites, manufacturing facilities, and commercial buildings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:10:04','2026-05-18 09:10:04'),(2235,'Mobile Fall Protection Systems','mobile-fall-protection-systems',2206,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:10:40','2026-05-18 09:10:40'),(2236,'Vials & Tubes','vials-tubes',486,'Vials and Tubes provide secure storage and transport of liquids and samples in various settings. Crafted from durable glass or plastic, glass vials and centrifuge tubes offer excellent chemical resistance and leak-proof seals, preserving sample integrity. Vials and tubes are perfect for laboratories, research facilities, or medical institutions requiring secure and contamination-free storage solutions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:11:38','2026-05-18 09:11:38'),(2237,'Water Bottle Conditioners','water-bottle-conditioners',486,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:12:18','2026-05-18 09:12:18'),(2238,'Weighing Dishes','weighing-dishes',486,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:13:09','2026-05-18 09:13:09'),(2239,'Self-Retracting Lifelines','self-retracting-lifelines',2223,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:13:35','2026-05-18 09:13:35'),(2240,'Shock-Absorbing Lanyards','shock-absorbing-lanyards',2223,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:14:24','2026-05-18 09:14:24'),(2241,'Laboratory Cold Storage','laboratory-cold-storage',487,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:14:50','2026-05-18 09:14:50'),(2242,'Positioning & Fall Restraint Lanyards','positioning-fall-restraint-lanyards',2223,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:15:00','2026-05-18 09:15:00'),(2243,'Pharmacy & Vaccine Cold Storage','pharmacy-vaccine-cold-storage',487,'Equipped with a narrow temperature range for precise control during drug stability testing, Pharmacy & Vaccine Cold Storage includes refrigerators, freezers, and combo units designed to house vaccines, medicines, and other pharmaceutical products with strict temperature requirements. The ICH-compliant construction produces a consistent environment that promotes reproducibility and is suitable for cold-chain testing. The storage units are built with multiple fail-safe systems to ensure the power doesn’t fail and compromise the samples.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:16:09','2026-05-18 09:16:09'),(2244,'Tool Tethers & Dropped-Object Safety','tool-tethers-dropped-object-safety',1208,'Tool tethers and lanyards are designed to secure tools during use in high-risk work environments. Easily attach the tethers to tools and anchor points, providing a reliable link that prevents accidental drops. The adjustable length ensures flexibility, and the carabiner attachments guarantee a strong connection. The tethers and lanyards are ideal for professionals in construction and maintenance where tool safety is important.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:16:24','2026-05-18 09:16:24'),(2245,'Tool Tethers','tool-tethers',2244,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:17:12','2026-05-18 09:17:12'),(2246,'Dropped-Object Safety Containers','dropped-object-safety-containers',2244,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:17:45','2026-05-18 09:17:45'),(2247,'Endoscope Storage Cabinets','endoscope-storage-cabinets',488,'Endoscope Storage Cabinets are available in wall-mount and full-height models to suit the specific needs of various healthcare facilities to keep multiple endoscopes stored while allowing them to dry off. These medical storage cabinets are equipped with a HEPA filtered fan system to dry instruments while helping them remain sterile, and are outfitted with standard key or electronic locks to help prevent unwanted access, damage, or theft to medical equipment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:18:18','2026-05-18 09:18:18'),(2248,'Tool Tether Attachment Points','tool-tether-attachment-points',2244,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:18:21','2026-05-18 09:18:21'),(2249,'Tool Tether Kits','tool-tether-kits',2244,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:19:01','2026-05-18 09:19:01'),(2250,'Tool Tether Anchor Points','tool-tether-anchor-points',2244,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:19:55','2026-05-18 09:19:55'),(2251,'Vertical Lifelines','vertical-lifelines',1208,'Designed for maintenance and utility workers who ascend and descend ladders, towers, building exteriors, and other vertical surfaces, Vertical Lifelines secure to an anchor point and protect against falls & and related injuries. These fall protection systems are designed for fall restraint, as well as fall arrest, protecting those working at elevated heights.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:23:52','2026-05-18 09:23:52'),(2252,'Microscope Slide Cabinets','microscope-slide-cabinets',488,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:24:07','2026-05-18 09:24:07'),(2253,'Flexible Rope Vertical Lifeline Systems','flexible-rope-vertical-lifeline-systems',2251,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:24:43','2026-05-18 09:24:43'),(2254,'Mobile Medical Cabinets','mobile-medical-cabinets',488,'Mobile Medical Cabinets offer secure storage and simple portability for healthcare tools, supplies, and accessories. Crafted from steel or stainless steel, medical storage cabinets remain strong over time, and the casters on the bottom make them easy to transport and maneuver. Portable medical storage cabinets feature multiple columns that can be customized with shelves, trays, and baskets, and the lockable doors help prevent unwanted access to medical equipment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:24:46','2026-05-18 09:26:56'),(2255,'Multi Use Wall Mount Medical Cabinets','multi-use-wall-mount-medical-cabinets',488,'Multi Use Wall Mount Medical Cabinets keep healthcare supplies stored and easily accessible without taking up valuable floor space. Designed for general use, they are constructed from durable, heavy-gauge materials, such as steel, stainless steel, or plastic, for lasting strength; with key or electronic locks that provide additional security against unwanted access, theft, and damage to stored tools and pharmaceuticals.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:27:42','2026-05-18 09:27:42'),(2256,'Fire Alarm Control Panels','fire-alarm-control-panels',1231,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:27:50','2026-05-18 09:27:50'),(2257,'Fire Alarm Systems','fire-alarm-systems',1231,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:28:39','2026-05-18 09:28:39'),(2258,'Narcotics & Medicine Cabinets','narcotics-medicine-cabinets',488,'Narcotics & Medicine Cabinets offer a secure place to store medication and other pharmaceuticals. Medicine storage cabinets built from steel provide lasting durability, while stainless-steel narcotics cabinets boast strength, rust resistance, and antimicrobial properties. Additionally, there are acrylic storage cabinets with a see-through design that allows medical personnel to view stored contents at a glance. Medical cabinets are equipped with a key or electronic lock to restrict access.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:28:41','2026-05-18 09:28:41'),(2259,'Fire Blankets','fire-blankets',1231,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:29:14','2026-05-18 09:29:14'),(2260,'Pass-Thru Specimen Cabinets','pass-thru-specimen-cabinets',488,'Pass-Thru Specimen Cabinets allow specimen containers to be privately passed between the patient area and the laboratory. Constructed from stainless steel, they provide corrosion and microbial resistance, helping to maintain a sterile environment. Self-closing doors with spring hinges ensure that only one side of the cabinet opens at a time, protecting patient privacy during sample transfers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:29:43','2026-05-18 09:29:43'),(2261,'Fire Extinguisher Cabinets & Accessories','fire-extinguisher-cabinets-accessories',1231,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:30:13','2026-05-18 09:30:13'),(2262,'Stationary Medical & Laboratory Cabinets','stationary-medical-laboratory-cabinets',488,'Stationary Medical and Laboratory Cabinets store and organize medical supplies or sensitive documents in labs and healthcare facilities. Wall and freestanding cabinet options allow versatile placement to suit a variety of workspaces, and durable construction provides long-lasting strength while housing patient paperwork, pharmaceutical equipment, and other sensitive materials.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:30:38','2026-05-18 09:30:38'),(2263,'Fire Extinguishers','fire-extinguishers',1231,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:30:55','2026-05-18 09:30:55'),(2264,'X-Ray Storage Cabinets','x-ray-storage-cabinets',488,'X-Ray Storage Cabinets make it easy to organize imaging scans in radiology centers, doctors’ offices, and other healthcare environments. X-ray cabinets are designed with numerous shelves, compartments, and dividers to accommodate the records of multiple patients. Open-front storage cabinets provide quick, easy access to X-rays in administrative settings, while closed-front, lockable models allow health care professionals to secure sensitive information and help protect patient confidentiality.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:31:25','2026-05-18 09:31:25'),(2265,'Fire Hoses & Accessories','fire-hoses-accessories',1231,'Fire hoses and accessories are essential tools designed for combating and controlling fires, and organizing equipment. Hoses are made of durable materials capable of withstanding high-pressure water flow, and are available in a variety of lengths and diameters. Accessories including hose reels, racks, and carts are crucial for storage, organization, and quick deployment of hoses during emergencies. These items are ideal for fire stations, industrial facilities, commercial buildings, or emergency response centers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:31:30','2026-05-18 09:33:45'),(2266,'Aesthesiometers','aesthesiometers',490,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:32:36','2026-05-18 09:32:36'),(2267,'Blood Pressure Monitors','blood-pressure-monitors',490,'Blood pressure monitors are medical instruments that provide quick and efficient readings in hospitals, clinics, and other healthcare facilities. Monitors come in various sizes suitable for patients of all ages and in different styles that can attach to arms or wrists. Wall-mount, mobile, or pocket-style blood pressure monitors are available in a range of materials to suit any medical needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:33:43','2026-05-18 09:33:43'),(2268,'Compact Digital Scales','compact-digital-scales',490,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:34:23','2026-05-18 09:34:23'),(2269,'Fire Hose Carts & Racks','fire-hose-carts-racks',2265,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:34:44','2026-05-18 09:34:44'),(2270,'Fire Hose Pin Rack Assemblies','fire-hose-pin-rack-assemblies-1',2265,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:35:16','2026-05-18 09:35:16'),(2271,'Fire Hose Reels & Storage Racks','fire-hose-reels-storage-racks',2265,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:35:59','2026-05-18 09:35:59'),(2272,'Defibrillator Accessories','defibrillator-accessories',490,'Defibrillator accessories are designed to support and optimize the performance of defibrillators, which are vital medical devices used in emergencies to deliver electric shocks to the heart. Batteries ensure the units are ready when needed, and carrying cases and cabinets secure the storage of defibrillators, keeping them accessible in strategic locations. They are ideal for hospitals, medical facilities, and healthcare institutions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:36:05','2026-05-18 09:36:05'),(2273,'Fire Hoses','fire-hoses-1',2265,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:36:42','2026-05-18 09:36:42'),(2274,'Industrial & Fire Hose Nozzles','industrial-fire-hose-nozzles-1',2265,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:37:09','2026-05-18 09:37:09'),(2275,'Fire Pull Stations','fire-pull-stations',1231,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:38:01','2026-05-18 09:38:01'),(2276,'Defibrillators & Oxygen Units','defibrillators-oxygen-units',490,'Defibrillators and oxygen units are designed to help first responders and emergency personnel provide essential medical treatment in various situations. AED defibrillators are compact, lightweight, and easy to use. Portable oxygen units provide secure oxygen flow for home health care or medical facility support.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:38:05','2026-05-18 09:38:05'),(2277,'Gas Detectors','gas-detectors',1231,'Gas detectors are critical tools designed to monitor and detect the presence of potentially hazardous gases in various environments. They serve as an early warning system, providing timely alerts when gas concentrations exceed predetermined safety thresholds, allowing for prompt evacuation or corrective action. The detectors incorporate audible and visual alarms to alert users when gas concentrations reach critical levels, ensuring immediate attention and response. They are ideal for commercial or industrial environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:38:46','2026-05-18 09:38:46'),(2278,'Dental Steam Cleaners','dental-steam-cleaners',490,'Dental steam cleaners use a high pressure steam to remove debris, kill bacteria, and sterilize equipment. They help reduce the risk of infection and are typically portable allowing for easily mobility. Dental steam cleaners are ideal for dental clinics, orthodontic offices, and oral surgery centers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:39:03','2026-05-18 09:39:03'),(2279,'Gas & Leak Detectors','gas-leak-detectors',1231,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:39:38','2026-05-18 09:39:38'),(2280,'Enema Bags & Douches','enema-bags-douches',490,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:39:46','2026-05-18 09:39:46'),(2281,'MSA Automated Gas Test Systems','msa-automated-gas-test-systems',2277,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:40:27','2026-05-18 09:40:27'),(2282,'Glucose Monitoring','glucose-monitoring',490,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:40:36','2026-05-18 09:40:36'),(2283,'MSA Calibration Gas','msa-calibration-gas',2277,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:41:38','2026-05-18 09:41:38'),(2284,'Hammers & Mallets','hammers-mallets',490,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:42:50','2026-05-18 09:42:50'),(2285,'Hand Dynamometers','hand-dynamometers',490,'Hand Dynamometers are medical instruments used to measure a medical patient’s hand grip and pinch strength. Utilized by medical professionals from surgeons to physical therapists, Hand Dynamometers measure and track the strength of a patient’s hand grip. A range of dynamometers from hand to pinch-gauge to push-pull help to objectively diagnose and assess a patient’s muscle strength.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:45:37','2026-05-18 09:45:37'),(2286,'Medical & Physician Scales','medical-physician-scales',490,'Medical and physician scales are specialized weighing devices designed for use in medical settings such as hospitals, clinics, or physician offices. They are specifically calibrated and constructed to accurately measure the weight of individuals, providing essential data for monitoring health and managing medical conditions. Scales feature a sturdy platform with non-slip surface for stability and safety during weighing procedures, and digital displays with large, easy-to-read numbers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:46:33','2026-05-18 09:46:33'),(2287,'Medical Batteries','medical-batteries',490,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:47:29','2026-05-18 09:47:29'),(2288,'Medical Scissors','medical-scissors',490,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:48:09','2026-05-18 09:48:09'),(2289,'Medical Thermometers','medical-thermometers',490,'Medical thermometers are devices designed to accurately and precisely measure body temperature. Whether its contactless Infrared thermometers that measure body temperature by simply aiming the device at the forehead, Ear thermometers that measure body temperature through the ear, or traditional Oral thermometers that measure temperature through the mouth, Medical thermometers are essential diagnostic tools for medical personnel and patients.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:48:53','2026-05-18 09:48:53'),(2290,'Needles & Syringes','needles-syringes',490,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:49:45','2026-05-18 09:49:45'),(2291,'Neurological Pinwheels','neurological-pinwheels',490,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:50:23','2026-05-18 09:50:23'),(2292,'MSA Gas Detector Accessories','msa-gas-detector-accessories',2277,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:51:21','2026-05-18 09:51:21'),(2293,'Otoscope Instruments','otoscope-instruments',490,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:51:41','2026-05-18 09:51:41'),(2294,'Manometers & Gas Pressure Testers','manometers-gas-pressure-testers',2277,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:51:55','2026-05-18 09:51:55'),(2295,'Heat Detectors','heat-detectors',2277,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:52:55','2026-05-18 09:52:55'),(2296,'Oximeters & Finger Probes','oximeters-finger-probes',490,'Oximeters and finger probes provide non-invasive and real-time monitoring of oxygen saturation levels (SpO2) and pulse rates. The devices are crucial in assessing respiratory function and overall cardiovascular health. They are portable and lightweight devices that are easy to carry, making them suitable for clinical use. Oximeters and finger probes are ideal for hospitals and clinics to continuously monitor patients in various departments, including emergency rooms, intensive care units, and general wards.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:53:02','2026-05-18 09:53:02'),(2297,'Smoke & Carbon Monoxide Detectors','smoke-carbon-monoxide-detectors',1231,'Smoke and Carbon Monoxide Detectors are essential safety devices designed to protect homes and workplaces from fire and carbon monoxide hazards. Equipped with advanced detection technology, smoke detectors provide early warnings, allowing for prompt evacuation or intervention in case of emergencies. Easy to install and suitable for residential and commercial settings, smoke and carbon monoxide detectors offer peace of mind and enhanced safety for occupants.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:54:57','2026-05-18 09:54:57'),(2298,'Antiseptics & Ointments','antiseptics-ointments-1',2316,'Antiseptics disinfect the skin before medical procedures, surgeries, or injections. They kill or resist the growth of bacteria, viruses, and fungi on the skin\'s surface. Ointments are used to help the healing of wounds, burns, and minor skin injuries. They create a protective barrier and provide a moist environment conducive to healing. The antiseptics and ointments are ideal for commercial medical facilities and hospitals.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:59:23','2026-05-18 10:13:23'),(2299,'Penlights','penlights',490,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 09:59:33','2026-05-18 09:59:33'),(2300,'Stethoscopes','stethoscopes',490,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:00:30','2026-05-18 10:00:30'),(2301,'Bandages & Dressings','bandages-dressings-2',2316,'Bandages and dressings play important roles in wound care, offering essential protection, support, and a conducive environment for healing. Their significance spans across diverse industries such as healthcare, sports, emergency response, and more. Designed to be breathable and stretchable, they foster a healthier wound environment and mitigate the risk of infection, contributing to effective wound management and recovery.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:00:35','2026-05-18 10:20:37'),(2302,'Testing Kits & Supplies','testing-kits-supplies',490,'Testing Kits & Supplies are essential tools in the field of healthcare, ensuring accurate diagnostics, monitoring, and preventive measures. The kits and supplies make testing efficient and convenient by supplying needed test elements and tools together. Test kits can also provide results quickly, cutting down on processing time. Great for use in healthcare facilities and clinics.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:01:26','2026-05-18 10:01:26'),(2303,'Cooling Towels','cooling-towels-1',2316,'Evaporative cooling towels provide relief from intense heat. They can be activated quickly and are placed on the back of the neck to prevent exhaustion and illness from prolonged exposure to high temperatures or direct sunlight. Neck cooling towels are ideal for use in construction, mining, agriculture, solar, steelwork, landscaping, and more physically demanding industries.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:01:26','2026-05-18 10:21:27'),(2304,'Evaporative Cooling Towels','evaporative-cooling-towels',2303,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:02:02','2026-05-18 10:22:22'),(2305,'Tuning Forks','tuning-forks',490,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:02:35','2026-05-18 10:02:35'),(2306,'Cooling Neck Wraps','cooling-neck-wraps',2303,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:02:44','2026-05-18 10:23:05'),(2307,'Disposable Gloves','disposable-gloves-1',481,'Disposable gloves are an essential personal protective equipment that cater to various needs. Gloves are available in different materials, sizes, and types to meet diverse requirements across different industries and applications. Whether it is a medical, industrial, or food service setting, high-quality disposable gloves provide a dependable barrier against contaminants while ensuring comfort and secure wear.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:05:35','2026-05-18 10:05:35'),(2308,'Mounting Tape','mounting-tape-1',185,'Mounting Tape is an easy, peel-and-stick solution for your mounting and bonding needs. Its strong adhesive allows you to securely bond various surfaces and materials for quick installations. Perfect for mounting graphics and signs, bundling, and interleaving. Available in different sizes to fit your specific needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:06:23','2026-05-18 10:06:23'),(2309,'Adhesive Transfer Tape - Dispenser Rolls','adhesive-transfer-tape-dispenser-rolls',185,'These adhesive transfer tape dispenser rolls are designed to easily apply adhesives to various surfaces and items. Adhesive transfer tape dispensers can wrap and secure various materials like cardboard, plastics, wood, glass, and more. The dispenser rolls provide great convenience and control, making them ideal for distribution centers, warehouses, and other shipping environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:06:26','2026-05-18 10:06:26'),(2310,'Adhesive Transfer Tape - Hand Dispensed Rolls','adhesive-transfer-tape-hand-dispensed-rolls',185,'These Hand Dispensed Adhesive Transfer Tape Rolls are designed for use in various applications. Using powerful adhesive, these tape rolls deliver consistent results and are perfect for securely bonding materials in industrial applications. They are available in various sizes and thicknesses options.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:06:30','2026-05-18 10:06:30'),(2311,'ESD Tape','esd-tape-1',188,'ESD tape is low charging for safe use around most static-sensitive equipment. Tape is tested per ANSI/ESD S11.11 to meet dissipative limits of packaging standards. Some models are marked with ESD symbols between film and adhesive to distinguish them from standard tape. Roll size and other specific features vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:07:48','2026-05-18 10:07:48'),(2312,'Vital Signs Monitors','vital-signs-monitors',490,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:08:27','2026-05-18 10:08:27'),(2313,'Washdown Scales','washdown-scales',490,'Washdown scales are specialized weighing instruments designed for use in environments where sanitation and cleanliness are paramount. They are constructed with materials that can withstand frequent cleaning with water, detergents, and sanitizing solutions without compromising accuracy or performance. Scales feature sealed enclosures and waterproof components to prevent moisture ingress and damage to internal components during cleaning processes. They are ideal for food processing facilities, pharmaceutical laboratories, and industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:09:18','2026-05-18 10:09:18'),(2314,'Silver Defender Antimicrobial Surface Protection','silver-defender-antimicrobial-surface-protection',190,'Silver Defender Antimicrobial Surface Protection is designed to effectively protect surfaces from bacterial growth and germs to keep users safe. These surface protection products can easily be applied and are great for high traffic touchpoints such as door handles, touch screens, and more. Available in multiple width and length options.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:09:45','2026-05-18 10:09:45'),(2315,'Global Industrial™ V-Guard Constant Clean Antimicrobial Surface Protection','global-industrial-v-guard-constant-clean-antimicrobial-surface-protection',190,'Global Industrial™ V-Guard Constant Clean is an antimicrobial surface protector for your business or workplace. These antimicrobial film strips and sheets prevent the spread of germs and bacteria and keeps surfaces clean. They can be applied with ease and come in various lengths and widths to fit different areas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:09:49','2026-05-18 10:09:49'),(2316,'First Aid & Wound Treatment','first-aid-wound-treatment-1',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:12:23','2026-05-18 10:12:23'),(2317,'Medical Lighting','medical-lighting-1',46,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:12:25','2026-05-18 10:12:25'),(2318,'Thread Sealant Tape','thread-sealant-tape',192,'Thread Sealant Tape is used for securing threaded connections on pipes and fittings in plumbing and industrial applications. These PTFE tape options are simple to apply and help prevent leaks on pipes of various material construction. Available in a range of length and width options.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:12:27','2026-05-18 10:12:27'),(2319,'Gasket Tape','gasket-tape',192,'Gasket Tapes create a strong, waterproof seal on pipes and tubing carrying water, fuel, oils, and other liquids. They are created from high quality and durable materials, and can handle a large temperature range. They are a great choice for plumbing and industrial applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:12:30','2026-05-18 10:12:30'),(2320,'Lab Miscellaneous','lab-miscellaneous',192,'These Lab Miscellaneous sealant tape offerings include a variety of products perfect for laboratory applications. These tapes do not feature adhesive but can be used in a wide range of uses in the lab such as sealing small holes and gaps. They can be used on a variety of materials and surfaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:12:33','2026-05-18 10:12:33'),(2321,'Thread Sealant Tape','thread-sealant-tape-1',192,'Thread Sealant Tape is used for securing threaded connections on pipes and fittings in plumbing and industrial applications. These PTFE tape options are simple to apply and help prevent leaks on pipes of various material construction. Available in a range of length and width options.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:12:35','2026-05-18 10:12:35'),(2322,'Examination Lights','examination-lights',2317,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:13:13','2026-05-18 10:13:13'),(2323,'Minor Procedure Lights','minor-procedure-lights',2317,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:14:01','2026-05-18 10:14:01'),(2324,'Patch and Seal Tape','patch-and-seal-tape',195,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:14:39','2026-05-18 10:14:39'),(2325,'Tarp Repair Tapes & Kits','tarp-repair-tapes-kits',195,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:14:42','2026-05-18 10:14:42'),(2326,'Specialty Tape','specialty-tape-1',195,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:14:46','2026-05-18 10:14:46'),(2327,'Patient Room Lights','patient-room-lights',2317,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:15:10','2026-05-18 10:15:10'),(2328,'Patient Warming Lamps','patient-warming-lamps',2317,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:16:09','2026-05-18 10:16:09'),(2329,'Construction Washouts','construction-washouts',197,'Construction Washouts are specifically designed to collect the used water after a concrete truck is washed down. They feature heavy duty construction to ensure long term use and can be easily set up and transferred to different work sites. Available in multiple sizes to fit a variety of industrial and construction needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:17:37','2026-05-18 10:17:37'),(2330,'Asphalt Repair','asphalt-repair',197,'These Asphalt Repair materials provide fast and permanent solutions for deteriorating, cracked and damaged asphalt surfaces. These products are easy-to-use and are made durable to restore strength, durability and flexibility to prevent further deterioration from harsh weather and wear. Various sizes are available to meet your needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:17:40','2026-05-18 10:17:40'),(2331,'Concrete & Masonry Repair','concrete-masonry-repair',197,'Masonry and Concrete Repair products provide a quick, easy, and effective solution for patching, filling, and repairing damaged surfaces. They are made of quality materials, and are ideal for filling cracks, holes, and other surface irregularities to improve strength and prevent further structural damage. Available in multiple sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:17:43','2026-05-18 10:17:43'),(2332,'Compression Socks & Stockings','compression-socks-stockings',493,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:20:25','2026-05-18 10:20:25'),(2333,'Immobilizers','immobilizers',493,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:22:52','2026-05-18 10:22:52'),(2334,'Lifts & Slings','lifts-slings',493,'Lifts and slings are designed to assist in the safe and efficient transfer, positioning, and mobilization of individuals with limited mobility. They are equipped with adjustable straps and buckles, allowing caregivers to customize the fit and ensure optimal support for each patient. Many slings feature padded designs to ensure patient comfort during transfers and extended periods of use. They are ideal for various applications, including hospitals, nursing homes, rehabilitation centers, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:23:59','2026-05-18 10:23:59'),(2335,'Splints & Supports','splints-supports',493,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:25:02','2026-05-18 10:25:02'),(2336,'Nitrile Gloves','nitrile-gloves',2316,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:25:11','2026-05-18 10:25:11'),(2337,'Liquid Sealants','liquid-sealants',198,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:28:06','2026-05-18 10:28:06'),(2338,'Aerosol Sealants','aerosol-sealants',198,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:28:09','2026-05-18 10:28:09'),(2339,'Sealants','sealants',198,'Sealants are designed to create a watertight seal that can keep out moisture, air, dust and noise, making them ideal for indoor or outdoor use. Most sealants can adhere to a wide range of materials and provide excellent durability. Available in various colors to blend in with many surfaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:28:13','2026-05-18 10:28:13'),(2340,'Hybrid Caulks & Sealants','hybrid-caulks-sealants',198,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:28:16','2026-05-18 10:28:16'),(2341,'Vinyl Adhesive Caulks','vinyl-adhesive-caulks',198,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:28:19','2026-05-18 10:28:19'),(2342,'Thread Sealants','thread-sealants',1