ULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:32:59','2026-05-18 10:32:59'),(2357,'Drum & Tank Repair Compound','drum-tank-repair-compound',203,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:33:04','2026-05-18 10:33:04'),(2358,'PVC, CPVC & ABS Cements','pvc-cpvc-abs-cements',203,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:33:06','2026-05-18 10:33:06'),(2359,'PVC and CPVC Primers/Cleaners','pvc-and-cpvc-primerscleaners',205,'Our PVC and CPVC Primers/Cleaners are essential for successful pipe installations. These dual-purpose products clean and prime pipes and fittings. The priming function ensures optimal adhesion and a strong bond, while the cleaning function removes dirt, oil, and contaminants. Ideal for various applications, our PVC cleaners and primers guarantee long-lasting and dependable pipe installations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:37:13','2026-05-18 10:37:13'),(2360,'CPVC and PVC Primers','cpvc-and-pvc-primers',205,'Our CPVC and PVC primers are designed to ensure secure and reliable pipe connections. These primers prepare CPVC and PVC pipes and fittings for solvent cement application. With high-quality formulation, our primers clean and condition the pipe surfaces, providing optimal adhesion and a strong bond. Ideal for residential and commercial plumbing projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:37:16','2026-05-18 10:37:16'),(2361,'All Purpose Cleaners','all-purpose-cleaners',205,'All-purpose cleaners are the perfect solution for tackling a variety of cleaning tasks. These versatile cleaners are ideal for effectively cleaning and preparing PVC, CPVC, ABS, and Styrene pipes and fittings for bonding. These all-purpose cleaners evaporate quickly and feature compounds specifically designed to remove dirt and oil from piping surfaces of all schedules and diameters.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:37:20','2026-05-18 10:37:20'),(2362,'CPVC and PVC Primers','cpvc-and-pvc-primers-1',205,'Our CPVC and PVC primers are designed to ensure secure and reliable pipe connections. These primers prepare CPVC and PVC pipes and fittings for solvent cement application. With high-quality formulation, our primers clean and condition the pipe surfaces, providing optimal adhesion and a strong bond. Ideal for residential and commercial plumbing projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:37:23','2026-05-18 10:37:23'),(2363,'PVC and CPVC Primers/Cleaners','pvc-and-cpvc-primerscleaners-1',205,'Our PVC and CPVC Primers/Cleaners are essential for successful pipe installations. These dual-purpose products clean and prime pipes and fittings. The priming function ensures optimal adhesion and a strong bond, while the cleaning function removes dirt, oil, and contaminants. Ideal for various applications, our PVC cleaners and primers guarantee long-lasting and dependable pipe installations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:37:27','2026-05-18 10:37:27'),(2364,'All Purpose Cleaners','all-purpose-cleaners-1',205,'All-purpose cleaners are the perfect solution for tackling a variety of cleaning tasks. These versatile cleaners are ideal for effectively cleaning and preparing PVC, CPVC, ABS, and Styrene pipes and fittings for bonding. These all-purpose cleaners evaporate quickly and feature compounds specifically designed to remove dirt and oil from piping surfaces of all schedules and diameters.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:37:31','2026-05-18 10:37:31'),(2365,'ZAR® Wood Repair','zar-wood-repair',207,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:40:13','2026-05-18 10:40:13'),(2366,'DAP® Caulks, Sealants & Adhesives','dap-caulks-sealants-adhesives-1',207,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:40:17','2026-05-18 10:40:17'),(2367,'Epoxy, Silicone, and Plastic Adhesives','epoxy-silicone-and-plastic-adhesives-2',207,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:40:20','2026-05-18 10:40:20'),(2368,'Threadlockers','threadlockers-1',209,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:41:08','2026-05-18 10:41:08'),(2369,'Kapton Tape','kapton-tape',237,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:48:11','2026-05-18 10:48:11'),(2370,'Cloth Tape','cloth-tape',237,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:48:14','2026-05-18 10:48:14'),(2371,'Carton Sealing Tape Strips','carton-sealing-tape-strips',237,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:48:18','2026-05-18 10:48:18'),(2372,'Secure Tape Rolls & Strips','secure-tape-rolls-strips',237,'This tamper evident tape is designed to reduce theft and damage resulting from security issues on high value shipments. When the security tape strip is damaged or removed, a highly visible message will display as a warning. Our tape features consecutive numbers to differentiate shipments allowing convenient inventory itemization and tracking.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:48:22','2026-05-18 10:48:22'),(2373,'Natural Rubber Tape','natural-rubber-tape',237,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:48:25','2026-05-18 10:48:25'),(2374,'Label Protection Tape','label-protection-tape',237,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:48:29','2026-05-18 10:48:29'),(2375,'Flatback Tape','flatback-tape',237,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:48:32','2026-05-18 10:48:32'),(2376,'Printed Security Carton Sealing Tape','printed-security-carton-sealing-tape',237,'Printed carton sealing tape is a self-adhesive tape used for securely adhering cartons and boxes. This security tape is printed with warning messages including Fragile, Tamper Evident, and more making it perfect for commercial storage, shipping, or moving. It\'s available in a variety of lengths, widths, colors, and messages to best suit your needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:48:36','2026-05-18 10:48:36'),(2377,'Printed Security Carton Sealing Tape','printed-security-carton-sealing-tape-1',237,'Printed carton sealing tape is a self-adhesive tape used for securely adhering cartons and boxes. This security tape is printed with warning messages including Fragile, Tamper Evident, and more making it perfect for commercial storage, shipping, or moving. It\'s available in a variety of lengths, widths, colors, and messages to best suit your needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:48:36','2026-05-18 10:48:36'),(2378,'Machine Length Carton Sealing Tape Skid Lots','machine-length-carton-sealing-tape-skid-lots',237,'3M™ machine length carton sealing tape secures cardboard, corrugated fiberboard, and more. The durable material has a moisture-resistant backing that resists abrasion, chemicals, and scuffing for stability and content protection. Our machine length carton sealing tape is ideal for exporting and shipping overseas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:48:39','2026-05-18 10:48:39'),(2379,'Machine Length Carton Sealing Tape','machine-length-carton-sealing-tape',237,'3M™ machine length carton sealing tape secures cardboard, corrugated fiberboard, and more. The durable material has a moisture-resistant backing that resists abrasion, chemicals, and scuffing for stability and content protection. Our machine length carton sealing tape is ideal for exporting and shipping overseas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:48:42','2026-05-18 10:48:42'),(2380,'Acrylic Carton Sealing Tape','acrylic-carton-sealing-tape',237,'Acrylic carton sealing tape is a versatile packaging tape for all of your shipping, bundling and sealing needs. This industrial grade tape adheres to most surfaces and performs well in damp and cold environments. Our acrylic tape is available in a variety of lengths, and features adhesive that offers high performance in tough environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:48:46','2026-05-18 10:48:46'),(2381,'Water Activated Paper Carton Sealing Tape','water-activated-paper-carton-sealing-tape',237,'This water activated tape is perfect for sealing up cartons, packages, boxes, and more. The tape is easy to use; simply moisten it with water, once wet the adhesive is activated and it can bond to your packages. It features fiberglass yarns in the backing to add strength to the seal. Our paper carton sealing tape is available in a variety of lengths.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:48:49','2026-05-18 10:48:49'),(2382,'Hot Melt Carton Sealing Tape','hot-melt-carton-sealing-tape',237,'Hot melt carton sealing tape offers a strong, long-lasting seal on a wide range of materials including corrugated boxes. It\'s ideal in a variety of applications including electronics, food packaging, and more. The backing easily conforms around edges and on rough surfaces for a tight seal. Our hot melt tape resists abrasion, moisture, chemicals and scuffing for long-lasting performance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:48:53','2026-05-18 10:48:53'),(2383,'Stretchers','stretchers',493,'Stretchers are designed to provide a safe and efficient means of patient transportation, support, and comfort. They feature adjustable backrests and heights, allowing healthcare professionals to customize the positioning based on the patient\'s needs. Stretchers also have safety straps and restraints to secure patients during transport and prevent unintended movements. They are ideal for use in hospitals, ambulances, and rehabilitation centers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:54:28','2026-05-18 10:54:28'),(2384,'Traction Sets','traction-sets',493,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:56:03','2026-05-18 10:56:03'),(2385,'Exercise & Fitness','exercise-fitness',497,'Exercise and fitness equipment are designed for rehabilitation and strength training purposes, offering versatile solutions for medical, fitness, and therapy applications. This diverse range includes exercise balls, machines, mats, and stretch bands, catering to a variety of needs. Certain equipment is engineered to be compact and portable, ensuring effortless storage and transportation, making them particularly suitable for gyms or rehabilitation facilities with space constraints. Tailored for professional use in commercial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 10:58:52','2026-05-18 10:58:52'),(2386,'Glassless Mirrors','glassless-mirrors',497,'Framed and folding glassless mirrors provide enhanced visibility and a larger field of view. Setup and takedown of folding mirrors is quick and easy, while framed mirrors allow semi-permanent installation. They are ideal for physical therapy, dance studios, gyms, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:00:33','2026-05-18 11:00:33'),(2387,'Nitrile Gloves','nitrile-gloves-1',1896,'Disposable gloves are an essential personal protective equipment that cater to various needs. Gloves are available in different materials, sizes, and types to meet diverse requirements across different industries and applications. Whether it is a medical, industrial, or food service setting, high-quality disposable gloves provide a dependable barrier against contaminants while ensuring comfort and secure wear.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:07:28','2026-05-18 11:07:28'),(2388,'Latex Gloves','latex-gloves',1896,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:08:28','2026-05-18 11:08:28'),(2389,'3M™ Scotch® and Tartan™ Filament Tapes','3m-scotch-and-tartan-filament-tapes',238,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:08:30','2026-05-18 11:08:30'),(2390,'Super Strength Strapping Tape','super-strength-strapping-tape',238,'Super Strength Strapping Tape gives you the ultimate support for heavier and bulkier objects and packages. This tape features abrasion resistant construction to ensure long term use, and the high tensile strength options for larger items. These strapping tape rolls are ideal for industrial applications where high strength adhesion is necessary.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:08:33','2026-05-18 11:08:33'),(2391,'Standard Strapping Tape','standard-strapping-tape',238,'Our standard strapping tape features quality adhesive power and can stick to surfaces with minimum pressure, creating a secure bond. These tape rolls are ideal for medium-duty applications such as bundling, reinforcing boxes, and palletizing tasks. An array of widths, thicknesses, and tensile strengths are available to meet your needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:08:37','2026-05-18 11:08:37'),(2392,'Industrial Strapping Tape','industrial-strapping-tape',238,'Industrial Strapping Tape offers heavy-duty strength for bundling and reinforcing packages and materials. The quality construction is ultra-resistant to abrasions and cracking, and provides strong adhesion that holds heavy boxes and items together. These heavy duty strapping tape rolls are available in a variety of width, length, and thickness options to fit your application needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:08:40','2026-05-18 11:08:40'),(2393,'Economy Strapping Tape','economy-strapping-tape',238,'Economy strapping tape is ideal for general-purpose and light-duty reinforcing needs. Strapping tape is resistant to moisture, abrasion, and cracking. To fit your specific needs, these economy-grade strapping tape rolls are available in an array of widths, lengths, and thickness options.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:08:42','2026-05-18 11:08:42'),(2394,'Latex Gloves','latex-gloves-1',1896,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:14:02','2026-05-18 11:14:02'),(2395,'Tri-Polymer Gloves','tri-polymer-gloves',1896,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:14:37','2026-05-18 11:14:37'),(2396,'Vinyl Gloves','vinyl-gloves',1896,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:15:10','2026-05-18 11:15:10'),(2397,'Polyethylene Gloves','polyethylene-gloves',1896,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:15:56','