riety of materials without leaving a residue or damaging surfaces. The linerless, long-aging tape won\'t dry out or yellow over time. Made from quality materials, these double sided stick tape rolls are designed to be an all purpose option, ideal for commercial applications and for school and office use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:22:46','2026-05-18 11:22:46'),(2409,'3M™ Removable Double Sided Tape','3m-removable-double-sided-tape',240,'3M™ Removable Double Sided Tapes effectively adhere items together while still offering temporary adhesion. They are ideal when repositioning might be needed in the future. These 3M™ double sided tape rolls are great for use on a variety of surfaces and provide a secure and clean solution for mounting paper, plastics, films, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:22:56','2026-05-18 11:22:56'),(2410,'3M™ Double Sided Film Tape','3m-double-sided-film-tape',240,'3M™ Double Sided Film Tape features a strong adhesive for dependable mounting to a variety of surfaces. This tape creates secure bonds with superior adhesion strength and is easy to apply. Double sided film tape is an ideal choice for commercial level projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:22:56','2026-05-18 11:22:56'),(2411,'First Aid Only Emergency Preparedness Kits','first-aid-only-emergency-preparedness-kits',2399,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:23:21','2026-05-18 11:23:21'),(2412,'Personal Protection Packs','personal-protection-packs',2399,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:25:37','2026-05-18 11:25:37'),(2413,'Personal Protection Packs','personal-protection-packs-1',2399,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:26:20','2026-05-18 11:26:20'),(2414,'Emergency Blankets & Bivy Sacks','emergency-blankets-bivy-sacks-1',2316,'Emergency blankets and bivy sacks are designed to retain body heat. The blankets and bivy sacks are valuable in first aid solutions, providing warmth to individuals in shock or those facing exposure. They are designed to be compact and lightweight, making them easily portable and ideal for inclusion in emergency kits, backpacks, or survival gear. Some emergency blankets come with bright-colored surfaces, enhancing visibility and making them helpful in signaling rescuers or authorities in emergencies.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:28:18','2026-05-18 11:28:18'),(2415,'Emergency Blankets & Bivy Sacks','emergency-blankets-bivy-sacks-2',2414,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:29:07','2026-05-18 11:29:07'),(2416,'Emergency Shelter & Warmth','emergency-shelter-warmth',2414,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:29:52','2026-05-18 11:29:52'),(2417,'Suppression Blanket','suppression-blanket',2414,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:31:10','2026-05-18 11:31:10'),(2418,'Ballistic Blanket','ballistic-blanket',2414,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:32:35','2026-05-18 11:32:35'),(2419,'Hook And Loop Tape Strips','hook-and-loop-tape-strips',250,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:39:10','2026-05-18 11:39:10'),(2420,'Hook And Loop Tape Dots','hook-and-loop-tape-dots',250,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:39:13','2026-05-18 11:39:13'),(2421,'Sew-On Hook and Loop Fastener Separates','sew-on-hook-and-loop-fastener-separates',250,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:39:19','2026-05-18 11:39:19'),(2422,'Hook and Loop Fastener Separates','hook-and-loop-fastener-separates',250,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:39:22','2026-05-18 11:39:22'),(2423,'Floor Mats','floor-mats',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:40:09','2026-05-18 11:40:09'),(2424,'Gloves & Sleeves','gloves-sleeves-3',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:40:44','2026-05-18 11:40:44'),(2425,'Hot & Cold Packs','hot-cold-packs-1',497,'Hot packs provide soothing heat to alleviate muscle stiffness, joint pain, and tension. Cold packs deliver cold therapy to reduce inflammation, swelling, and numbness. They come in various sizes to accommodate different body parts, offering versatility in application. Hot & cold packs are ideal for first aid and emergency situations in industrial environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:41:33','2026-05-18 11:41:33'),(2426,'Guards, Protectors, & Railings','guards-protectors-railings-3',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:42:23','2026-05-18 11:42:23'),(2427,'Massage Supplies','massage-supplies',497,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:42:50','2026-05-18 11:42:50'),(2428,'3M™ Single Sided Foam Tape','3m-single-sided-foam-tape',251,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:43:12','2026-05-18 11:43:12'),(2429,'3M™ Double Sided Tape Squares','3m-double-sided-tape-squares',251,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:43:12','2026-05-18 11:43:12'),(2430,'3M™ Double Sided Foam Tape','3m-double-sided-foam-tape',251,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:43:13','2026-05-18 11:43:13'),(2431,'Locks & Lockout Devices','locks-lockout-devices',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:43:16','2026-05-18 11:43:16'),(2432,'Mounting Tape','mounting-tape-2',251,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:43:17','2026-05-18 11:43:17'),(2433,'3M™ Double Sided Film Tape','3m-double-sided-film-tape-1',251,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:43:20','2026-05-18 11:43:20'),(2434,'3M™ Double Sided Foam Tape - Single Rolls','3m-double-sided-foam-tape-single-rolls',251,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:43:23','2026-05-18 11:43:23'),(2435,'3M™ Double Sided VHB™ Foam Tape - Single Rolls','3m-double-sided-vhb-foam-tape-single-rolls',251,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:43:27','2026-05-18 11:43:27'),(2436,'Pain Relief Gel','pain-relief-gel',497,'Pain relief gels are topical