Heat therapy units, moist heating pads, and heating gel packs are available for warm relief. Therapeutic chillers include cold therapy units, reusable ice bags, and hydrocollator packs. All products are designed for therapeutic pain relief and ideal for keeping on hand at schools, offices, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:47:18','2026-05-18 11:47:18'),(2444,'Security','security-1',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:47:46','2026-05-18 11:47:46'),(2445,'Spill Control','spill-control-1',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:48:12','2026-05-18 11:48:12'),(2446,'Spill Control','spill-control-2',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:49:07','2026-05-18 11:49:07'),(2447,'Bath & Toilet Seats','bath-toilet-seats',500,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:49:30','2026-05-18 11:49:30'),(2448,'Canes & Crutches','canes-crutches',500,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:50:12','2026-05-18 11:50:12'),(2449,'Dressing Aids','dressing-aids',500,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:50:57','2026-05-18 11:50:57'),(2450,'Anti Fatigue Mats','anti-fatigue-mats',2423,'Anti fatigue mats are a functional and ergonomic solution to improve comfort and safety in the workplace. They prevent slips and falls by provide traction and a supportive surface to stand on for a long period. Dry area floor mats are available in a variety of textures and materials including diamond plate, ribbed and pebble and bubble surfaces. Wet area floor mats are useful in areas prone to moisture including kitchens or washdown areas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:51:30','2026-05-18 11:51:30'),(2451,'Grab Bars','grab-bars',500,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:51:30','2026-05-18 11:51:30'),(2452,'Dry Area Mats','dry-area-mats',2450,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:52:53','2026-05-18 11:52:53'),(2453,'Lumbar Support & Cushions','lumbar-support-cushions',500,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:52:54','2026-05-18 11:52:54'),(2454,'Reachers & Grabbers','reachers-grabbers',500,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:53:32','2026-05-18 11:53:32'),(2455,'Wet Area Mats','wet-area-mats',2450,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:53:37','2026-05-18 11:53:37'),(2456,'Transfer Boards & Chairs','transfer-boards-chairs',500,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:54:38','2026-05-18 11:54:38'),(2457,'Chair Mats','chair-mats',2423,'Chair mats are protective floor coverings specifically designed to safeguard flooring surfaces from the wear and tear caused by rolling chairs and heavy furniture. They provide a flat surface that allows chair casters to move easily, reducing friction and preventing damage to carpets or hard floors. Chair mats are commonly used in offices, home offices, and workspaces where rolling chairs are used.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:54:45','2026-05-18 11:54:45'),(2458,'Walkers & Rollators','walkers-rollators',500,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:55:18','2026-05-18 11:55:18'),(2459,'Wheelchair Batteries','wheelchair-batteries-1',500,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:55:52','2026-05-18 11:55:52'),(2460,'Carpet Floor Chair Mats','carpet-floor-chair-mats',2457,'Carpet floor chair mats offer an effective solution to protect your carpeted floors from wear and tear caused by office chair wheels. They help to maintain a neat workspace and extend the life of office carpets by minimizing the accumulation of dirt, scratches, and dents. These mats are versatile and available in various sizes and material types to meet your particular needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:56:11','2026-05-18 11:56:11'),(2461,'Wheelchair Ramps','wheelchair-ramps',500,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:56:22','2026-05-18 11:56:22'),(2462,'Wheelchairs','wheelchairs',500,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:56:53','2026-05-18 11:56:53'),(2463,'Angular Contact Bearings','angular-contact-bearings',518,'Angular contact bearings support combined radial and axial loads while facilitating controlled rotation. Their design allows for precise contact angles between the inner and outer raceways, optimizing load distribution and enhancing overall bearing performance. Bearings can handle high-speed applications, making them suitable for machinery with rapid rotational requirements. They are ideal for automotive applications, industrial gearboxes, and material handling equipment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 11:58:19','2026-05-18 11:58:19'),(2464,'Bearing Inner Rings','bearing-inner-rings',518,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:00:32','2026-05-18 12:00:32'),(2465,'Double Stick Tape','double-stick-tape-1',252,'The Double Stick Tape section offers a wide range of strong and reliable double-sided tapes. With adhesive on both sides, these rolls are a mess free and undetectable alternative to other adhesion methods. These double stick tape rolls are available in different lengths, widths, and core sizes and are perfect for use in offices and classrooms.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:00:34','2026-05-18 12:00:34'),(2466,'Transparent Tape','transparent-tape',252,'Transparent Tape provides a crystal clear bond and strong adhesive power. They are ideal for light duty and general purpose tasks such as mending, sealing and labeling. These premium translucent tape rolls come in an array widths, lengths, core sizes, and package quantities to meet a variety of needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:00:37','2026-05-18 12:00:37'),(2467,'Art Glue & Tape','art-glue-tape',252,'Art Glue & Tapes are great for scrapbooking, crafting, art projects, and more. These decorative tapes are available in different colors and finishes to fit your specific style or project. They are made to provide strong and reliable adhesive power and ensure lasting use. Choose from available art tape package quantities to meet your application needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:01:00','2026-05-18 12:01:00'),(2468,'Specialty Tape','specialty-tape-2',252,'Specialty Tapes are great for a wide variety of commercial applications, including packaging, office, and classroom settings. With an array of length, width, and core size options, you can find the perfect tape for your needs. Quality construction ensures that you can quickly secure items with high strength and lasting adhesive power. Available in multiple package quantities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:01:00','2026-05-18 12:01:00'),(2469,'School & Office Tape','school-office-tape',252,'School and office tape is perfect for packaging and sealing in commercial work environments and classrooms. These premium quality tape rolls provide strong adhesive power, keeping the tape strips from coming off easily. Choose from different package quantities, lengths, widths, and core sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:01:00','2026-05-18 12:01:00'),(2470,'Bearing Kits','bearing-kits',518,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:01:17','2026-05-18 12:01:17'),(2471,'Cam Followers','cam-followers',518,'Cam followers, also known as yoke rollers, are bearings designed to follow cams or tracks on a rotating shaft. With cylindrical outer rings and stud-type designs, cam followers provide high radial and axial load capacity, making them suitable for heavy-load applications with oscillating or intermittent motion. Ideal for machinery, conveyors, and cam-driven systems, cam follower bearings offer reliable performance and long service life, reducing maintenance and downtime in industrial operations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:03:07','2026-05-18 12:03:07'),(2472,'Clip Bearings','clip-bearings',518,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:06:44','2026-05-18 12:06:44'),(2473,'3M™ Carry Handle Tape','3m-carry-handle-tape',264,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:08:17','2026-05-18 12:08:17'),(2474,'Bag Sealing Tape','bag-sealing-tape',263,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:09:18','2026-05-18 12:09:18'),(2475,'Pocket Tape Pads','pocket-tape-pads',261,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:09:59','2026-05-18 12:09:59'),(2476,'Dr. Shrink Heat Shrink Tape','dr-shrink-heat-shrink-tape',276,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:12:13','2026-05-18 12:12:13'),(2477,'Dr. Shrink Light Tack Tape','dr-shrink-light-tack-tape',274,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:15:29','2026-05-18 12:15:29'),(2478,'Dr. Shrink Preservation Tape','dr-shrink-preservation-tape',274,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:15:33','2026-05-18 12:15:33'),(2479,'Art Glue & Tape','art-glue-tape-1',273,'Our art tape dispensers are ideal for art studios, classrooms and more. They can hold many rolls of tape so you can offer a selection of different colors or styles of tape in one convenient dispenser. Our selection also includes handheld art glue dispensers for holding and dispensing rolls of glue dots. These art glue and tape dispensers are durable and built to last through any craft project.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:17:23','2026-05-18 12:17:23'),(2480,'Tape Dispensers','tape-dispensers-2',273,'Office tape dispensers are essential tools for keeping tape within reach at your office. They feature non-skip bases for convenient one-handed dispensing, and a serrated edge for easy ripping. Our office tape dispensers are constructed of high-quality materials for long-lasting use and are available in a variety of styles.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:17:27','2026-05-18 12:17:27'),(2481,'Water Activated Tape Dispenser','water-activated-tape-dispenser-1',111,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:22:08','2026-05-18 12:22:08'),(2482,'Adhesive Transfer Tape Dispensers','adhesive-transfer-tape-dispensers-1',111,'Adhesive transfer tape dispensers are designed to quickly and easily dispense pressure-sensitive adhesive tape for various packaging, sealing, and labeling applications. They come in multiple styles and sizes to fit different tape sizes. These tape dispensers feature a handheld design, lightweight, adjustable brakes, and more. Ideal for factories, warehouses, and shipping departments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:22:11','2026-05-18 12:22:11'),(2483,'Strapping Tape Dispensers','strapping-tape-dispensers-1',111,'Our Strapping Tape Dispensers are equipped with a specialized corrugated blade designed for efficient cutting of tough tapes. These dispensers are constructed with a combination of high-quality materials, ensuring long-lasting durability. With a hand brake feature, operators can easily control the tension for secure reinforcing and bundling applications. Dimensions may vary by model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:22:14','2026-05-18 12:22:14'),(2484,'Wide Manual Tape & Label Dispensers','wide-manual-tape-label-dispensers-1',111,'Our wide tape and manual label dispensers conveniently seal and identify packages. They are industrial-grade devices that can easily dispense wide tape and labels. Made of durable plastic and steel, these wide tape dispensers are both economical and long-lasting. The label dispenser machines have a stable weighted base and multi-roll functionality, optimizing tape usage.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:22:17','2026-05-18 12:22:17'),(2485,'Bag Tapers','bag-tapers-1',111,'The bag sealer tape dispenser is designed to quickly and securely tape bags for high volume packaging. Models feature adjustable tension control and cardholders for easy tape loading and unloading. Bag tapers are suitable for any retail or industrial packaging operation. Choose from models offering reinforced paper or poly bags. Available in single-roll or heavy-duty dual-roll designs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:22:19','2026-05-18 12:22:19'),(2486,'Hand Held Tape Dispensers','hand-held-tape-dispensers-1',111,'Maximize packaging efficiency with our versatile hand-held packing tape dispensers. Ideal for warehouses, assembly lines, and carton sealing. Choose from Clamshell, Ergonomic, Heavy Duty, Lightweight, Mousetrap, and Pistol Grip styles. Featuring an adjustable brake and easy-grip handle, our hand-held tape dispensers are compatible with a variety of tape widths and come in various colors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:22:24','2026-05-18 12:22:24'),(2487,'Industrial Automatic Tape Dispensers','industrial-automatic-tape-dispensers-1',111,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:22:28','2026-05-18 12:22:28'),(2488,'Dispenser & Kraft Tape Bundles','dispenser-kraft-tape-bundles-1',111,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:22:30','2026-05-18 12:22:30'),(2489,'Kraft Tape Dispensers','kraft-tape-dispensers-1',111,'Kraft tape dispensers offer a simple and convenient way to seal boxes, packages, and other items during shipping. These water-activated kraft tape dispensers accommodate paper tape in a range of widths and incorporate advanced wetting systems for optimal adhesion. Various models are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:22:32','2026-05-18 12:22:32'),(2490,'Blickman Base Medical Cabinets','blickman-base-medical-cabinets',332,'Blickman Medical Base Cabinets offer superior quality and functionality, trusted by healthcare professionals. Designed for healthcare facilities, these stainless steel cabinets ensure the safety and organization of supplies. They provide easy access and efficient organization with durable construction and adjustable shelves. Customize with optional backsplashes or wall shelves for a complete look.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:29:44','2026-05-18 12:29:44'),(2491,'Lab Design Laboratory Base Cabinets','lab-design-laboratory-base-cabinets',332,'Lab Design Laboratory Base Cabinets are designed to meet the storage needs of laboratories and scientific facilities. With their sturdy construction and customizable features, these cabinets offer secure and efficient storage for casework including chemicals, equipment, and supplies. Choose from a range of configurations and accessories to create a tailored storage solution.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:29:46','2026-05-18 12:29:46'),(2492,'Bathroom Medicine Cabinets','bathroom-medicine-cabinets',332,'Bathroom Medicine Cabinets offer practical storage for bathrooms. With a range of sizes and styles to choose from, these cabinets ensure easy access to everyday essentials. Keep medications, toiletries, and personal care items organized and within reach with these well-designed cabinets. Discover the ideal medicine cabinet for bathrooms and enhance functionality of your space.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:29:49','2026-05-18 12:29:49'),(2493,'HEMCO® UniLine Casework Groupings','hemco-uniline-casework-groupings',332,'Upgrade your laboratory storage with HEMCO® Uniline Casework Groupings, the ultimate solution for efficiency and organization. With versatile configurations and durable construction, these cabinet groups are designed to meet the needs of laboratories. Customize your setup to maximize workspace and experience enhanced efficiency and productivity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:29:52','2026-05-18 12:29:52'),(2494,'Aero Manufacturing Stainless Steel Base Medical Cabinets','aero-manufacturing-stainless-steel-base-medical-cabinets',332,'Aero Manufacturing Medical Base Cabinets are a reliable storage solution for medical facilities. Crafted by Aero Manufacturing, these cabinets are built to meet demanding healthcare requirements. Made from premium materials, they provide exceptional durability. These stainless steel medical cabinets provide ample storage and organization for convenient access to essential medical supplies.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:29:55','2026-05-18 12:29:55'),(2495,'Rust-Oleum 108 Cleaning & Etching Solution','rust-oleum-108-cleaning-etching-solution',334,'Rust-Oleum 108 Cleaning & Etching Solution is a powerful and effective solution for preparing concrete surfaces in commercial and industrial facilities. The Rust-Oleum clean and etch solution is a dual-action liquid that removes dirt and oil and dissolves grease before coatings are applied to concrete. The pre-mixed Rust-Oleum formula also adds texture to the surface to improve coating adhesion.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:50:05','2026-05-18 12:50:05'),(2496,'Concrete Maintenance & Repair','concrete-maintenance-repair',334,'Concrete maintenance and repair products are designed to restore and maintain the integrity of concrete surfaces. A range of concrete repair and maintenance solutions are available, including sealers and protectors. Sealers provide a glossy finish and resistance to UV rays, stains, and abrasions, while protectors form a protective barrier that prevents moisture penetration to reduce cracking.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:50:08','2026-05-18 12:50:08'),(2497,'Specialty Coatings','specialty-coatings',334,'Specialty coating products are designed to provide exceptional protection and enhancement for concrete surfaces. Concrete epoxy coatings offer superior chemical and abrasion resistance, ensuring long-lasting durability. Specialty coating products help protect against deterioration caused by de-icing, salt, gasoline & more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:50:11','2026-05-18 12:50:11'),(2498,'Concrete Fillers & Patchers','concrete-fillers-patchers-1',333,'Concrete Fillers and Patchers are essential for seamless and enduring concrete, masonry, and asphalt repair. They are high-quality, easy to apply, and restore and preserve surfaces by filling cracks, holes, and imperfections. Engineered with precision, these products are indispensable for professionals seeking reliable solutions for the repair and maintenance of concrete, masonry, and asphalt surfaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:51:59','2026-05-18 12:51:59'),(2499,'Construction Washouts','construction-washouts-1',2498,'Construction Washouts are specifically designed to collect the used water after a concrete truck is washed down. They feature heavy duty construction to ensure long term use and can be easily set up and transferred to different work sites. Available in multiple sizes to fit a variety of industrial and construction needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:54:54','2026-05-18 12:54:54'),(2500,'Asphalt Repair','asphalt-repair-1',2498,'These Asphalt Repair materials provide fast and permanent solutions for deteriorating, cracked and damaged asphalt surfaces. These products are easy-to-use and are made durable to restore strength, durability and flexibility to prevent further deterioration from harsh weather and wear. Various sizes are available to meet your needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:54:58','2026-05-18 12:54:58'),(2501,'Concrete & Masonry Repair','concrete-masonry-repair-1',2498,'Masonry and Concrete Repair products provide a quick, easy, and effective solution for patching, filling, and repairing damaged surfaces. They are made of quality materials, and are ideal for filling cracks, holes, and other surface irregularities to improve strength and prevent further structural damage. Available in multiple sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:55:01','2026-05-18 12:55:01'),(2502,'Concrete Forms','concrete-forms',333,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:56:18','2026-05-18 12:56:18'),(2503,'Concrete Accessories','concrete-accessories',2502,'Concrete accessories are designed to facilitate concrete work in commercial and industrial construction applications. Concrete forms help with stability, and reinforcing chairs are designed to provide support and spacing for reinforcing steel bars. These chairs ensure proper positioning and alignment of the rebar to enhance structural integrity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 12:57:05','2026-05-18 12:57:05'),(2504,'Door & Wall Guards','door-wall-guards',12,'Whether you\'re looking to prevent damage from heavy equipment, carts, or general wear and tear, our extensive selection has you covered. From corner guards and door edge protectors to kick plates and wall shields, we offer a wide variety of options to suit your specific needs. Our durable and easy-to-install guards are made from sturdy materials such as stainless steel, aluminum, and impact-resistant plastics, ensuring long-lasting performance and optimal protection for your facility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:02:35','2026-05-18 13:02:35'),(2505,'Wall Sheet','wall-sheet',2504,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:09:13','2026-05-18 13:09:13'),(2506,'Sculpted Wall Guards','sculpted-wall-guards',2504,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:09:18','2026-05-18 13:09:18'),(2507,'Rub Rail','rub-rail',2504,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:09:22','2026-05-18 13:09:22'),(2508,'Parts & Accessories','parts-accessories',2504,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:09:24','2026-05-18 13:09:24'),(2509,'Kick Plates','kick-plates',2504,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:09:27','2026-05-18 13:09:27'),(2510,'Flat Wall Guards','flat-wall-guards',2504,'Flat wall guard help prevent wall damage caused by abrasions and collisions. They are easy to install and made of heavy-duty materials that can withstand repeated impact from carts or trolleys. Flat wall guards are ideal for high-traffic areas such as commercial buildings, airports, healthcare facilities and manufacturing plants.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:09:30','2026-05-18 13:09:30'),(2511,'Door Knob Protectors','door-knob-protectors',2504,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:09:33','2026-05-18 13:09:33'),(2512,'Door Frame Guards','door-frame-guards',2504,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:09:37','2026-05-18 13:09:37'),(2513,'Corner Guards','corner-guards',2504,'Corner guards shield wall corners from impact, preventing damage caused by furniture, carts, equipment, or other objects. They help prevent wear and tear on wall surfaces, particularly in high-traffic areas or spaces where heavy equipment may come into contact with the walls. Corner guards are ideal for commercial applications including offices, hospitals, schools, and industrial facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:09:40','2026-05-18 13:09:40'),(2514,'Bumpers & Chair Rails','bumpers-chair-rails',2504,'Bumper and chair rails are designed to shield walls from damage caused by carts, vehicles, and more. They are constructed of durable materials, ensuring resilience to impact for long-lasting dependability. Bumper and chair rails are ideal for use in warehouses and manufacturing facilities to protect walls and equipment from collisions with forklifts and other machinery. They are also designed for offices, retail stores, and commercial establishments to protect walls in high-traffic areas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:09:43','2026-05-18 13:09:43'),(2515,'Hard Floor Chair Mats','hard-floor-chair-mats',2457,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:12:52','2026-05-18 13:12:52'),(2516,'Glass Chair Mats','glass-chair-mats',2457,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:13:31','2026-05-18 13:13:31'),(2517,'Multi-Surface Chair Mats','multi-surface-chair-mats',2457,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:14:13','2026-05-18 13:14:13'),(2518,'Pawling Tall Bed Bumpers','pawling-tall-bed-bumpers',2514,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:14:50','2026-05-18 13:14:50'),(2519,'Pawling Equipment/Cart Bumpers','pawling-equipmentcart-bumpers',2514,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:14:50','2026-05-18 13:14:50'),(2520,'Pawling Chair Rails','pawling-chair-rails',2514,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:14:50','2026-05-18 13:14:50'),(2521,'Wall & Corner Protectors','wall-corner-protectors',2514,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:14:51','2026-05-18 13:14:51'),(2522,'Floor Protectors','floor-protectors',2457,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:16:07','2026-05-18 13:16:07'),(2523,'Pawling Door Frame Guards','pawling-door-frame-guards',2512,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:16:15','2026-05-18 13:16:15'),(2524,'Cleanroom & Sticky Mats','cleanroom-sticky-mats',2423,'Ideal for use in hospitals, laboratories, and other areas that prioritize a sanitized, sterile environment, Cleanroom and Sticky Mats remove bacteria, dirt, dust, and other contaminants from footwear to help maintain hygienic conditions. Crafted from durable materials to withstand heavy-duty use, cleanroom mats are constructed with a variety of surface patterns that trap and eliminate pollutants and impurities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:17:10','2026-05-18 13:17:10'),(2525,'Pawling Doorknob Protectors','pawling-doorknob-protectors',2511,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:17:18','2026-05-18 13:17:18'),(2526,'ESD Anti Fatigue Cleanroom Mats','esd-anti-fatigue-cleanroom-mats',2423,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:18:57','2026-05-18 13:18:57'),(2527,'Sanitizing Footbath Contamination Control Mats','sanitizing-footbath-contamination-control-mats',2423,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:19:43','2026-05-18 13:19:43'),(2528,'Cleanroom Mats','cleanroom-mats',2423,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:20:49','2026-05-18 13:20:49'),(2529,'Sticky Mats & Frames','sticky-mats-frames',2423,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:21:39','2026-05-18 13:21:39'),(2530,'Antifatigue Cleanroom Mats','antifatigue-cleanroom-mats',2423,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:23:04','2026-05-18 13:23:04'),(2531,'Custom Logo Mats','custom-logo-mats',2423,'Available for indoor and outdoor environments, Custom Logo Mats can be customized with artwork or branding to help businesses stand out and add a personal touch to their entryway. Employees and other personnel are able to wipe their shoes before entering the facility, preventing dirt, rain, and snow from getting tracked inside. A wide selection of sizes and thicknesses offer a wide range of applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:25:37','2026-05-18 13:25:37'),(2532,'Indoor Custom Art Logo Mats','indoor-custom-art-logo-mats',2531,'Custom Logo Art Mats seamlessly blend functionality with custom design, preventing dirt and moisture from entering an indoor facility. The customizable feature enables businesses to incorporate branding or a unique design, making these entrance floor mats practical for cleanliness and visually appealing at entrances. Ideal for businesses, offices, and commercial spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:27:34','2026-05-18 13:30:50'),(2533,'Cylindrical Roller Bearings','cylindrical-roller-bearings',518,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-18 13:29:44','2026-05-18 13:29:44'),(2534,'Indoor/Outdoor Custom Art Logo Mats','indooroutdoor-custom-art-logo-mats',2531,'Custom Art Logo Mats seamlessly blend functionality with custom design, preventing dirt and moisture from entering an outdoor or indoor facility. The customizable feature enables businesses to incorporate branding or a unique design. Lightweight flexible design ensures easy handling and cleaning. Mats can withstand heavy foot traffic while scraping dirt and moisture from shoes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-1