als like nitrile, which provide a reliable barrier against various chemicals. These heavy duty chemical resistant gloves ensure the safety of hands while handling reactive substances.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:29:37','2026-05-22 12:29:37'),(2754,'Chemical Resistant Nitrile Gloves','chemical-resistant-nitrile-gloves',2753,'Nitrile Chemical Resistant Gloves offer stability and dexterity in wet or dry industrial, manufacturing, and foodservice applications. They protect hands from harsh cleaning chemicals, acids, and detergents ensuring user safety and durability. With various cuff styles, these chemical resistant nitrile gloves provide a comfortable fit. Available in various colors and sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:30:37','2026-05-22 12:30:37'),(2755,'Neoprene Gloves','neoprene-gloves',2753,'Neoprene Gloves provide heat and puncture resistance, flexibility, and durability, making them suitable for various industries. With an interlock knit lining, these gloves offer strength and grip on wet and dry surfaces, enhancing chemical protection. Choose from different lining options, sizes, and colors. Chemical-resistant Neoprene Gloves are sold in convenient package quantities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:31:10','2026-05-22 12:31:10'),(2756,'Butyl Gloves','butyl-gloves',2753,'Butyl Chemical Resistant Gloves offer ultimate chemical resistance for any industry that requires durable yet flexible gloves. Multi-layered coating provides long-lasting strength. These chemical-resistant gloves protect against corrosive acids making them ideal for handling chemicals in a variety of applications. Available in many sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:31:43','2026-05-22 12:31:43'),(2757,'Disposable Polyethylene Gloves','disposable-polyethylene-gloves',2753,'Polyethylene Disposable Gloves provide excellent stability and dexterity for wet or dry applications in industrial, manufacturing, and foodservice settings. Polyethylene Gloves offer protection against oil penetration, punctures, and abrasions, ensuring user safety and glove durability. Choose from various Disposable Glove cuff styles and colors. Available in sizes XS-XL.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:32:44','2026-05-22 12:32:44'),(2758,'Natural Rubber Gloves','natural-rubber-gloves',2753,'Natural Rubber Gloves provide excellent stability and agility for handling in wet or dry applications. These rubber gloves offer protection against penetration, punctures, and abrasions, ensuring user safety and glove longevity in various conditions. The knit liner improves user fit and comfort, along with multiple cuff styles. Available in different sizes and colors to suit individual needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:33:16','2026-05-22 12:33:16'),(2759,'Chemical Resistant Latex Gloves','chemical-resistant-latex-gloves',2753,'Chemical Resistant Latex Gloves offer durable hand protection for various industries. Choose from a wide selection of Latex Gloves in various colors and sizes. Available in unlined or flock lined, with cuff styles like Pinked, Slip-On, Beaded, Rolled, or Straight. Chemical resistant gloves are ideal for food processing, janitorial, and industrial applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:33:51','2026-05-22 12:33:51'),(2760,'Dishwashing Gloves','dishwashing-gloves',2753,'Dishwashing gloves are designed to protect hands in foodservice settings. Made with durable nitrile, neoprene, latex, or PVC, these dishwashing gloves are chemical-resistant, liquid-proof, and made for long-lasting durability. Embossed, heat-resistant, rough grip, or extra-long style gloves in various colors and universal, S, M, L, and XL sizes are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:34:41','2026-05-22 12:34:41'),(2761,'Rotissi Glove','rotissi-glove',2753,'Rotissi gloves are designed to protect hands in rotisserie pits or intense heat. These gloves are liquid, grease, and heat resistant and can withstand extreme temperatures. Most models are rubber on the outside and cotton on the inside for additional comfort. Ideal for any food service applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:35:31','2026-05-22 12:35:31'),(2762,'PVC Chip Safety Gloves','pvc-chip-safety-gloves',2753,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:36:20','2026-05-22 12:36:20'),(2763,'Disposable Polyethylene Gloves','disposable-polyethylene-gloves-1',2753,'Polyethylene Disposable Gloves provide excellent stability and dexterity for wet or dry applications in industrial, manufacturing, and foodservice settings. Polyethylene Gloves offer protection against oil penetration, punctures, and abrasions, ensuring user safety and glove durability. Choose from various Disposable Glove cuff styles and colors. Available in sizes XS-XL.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:37:15','2026-05-22 12:37:15'),(2764,'Butyl Gloves','butyl-gloves-1',2753,'Butyl Chemical Resistant Gloves offer ultimate chemical resistance for any industry that requires durable yet flexible gloves. Multi-layered coating provides long-lasting strength. These chemical-resistant gloves protect against corrosive acids making them ideal for handling chemicals in a variety of applications. Available in many sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:37:56','2026-05-22 12:37:56'),(2765,'Coated Gloves','coated-gloves',1209,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:39:14','2026-05-22 12:39:14'),(2766,'Cold Protection Gloves','cold-protection-gloves',1209,'Cold protection gloves provide insulated hand protection in low-temp or freezing environments. Designed with thermal linings and durable exteriors, cold-weather work gloves offer warmth and flexibility for a range of tasks, ensuring comfort and dexterity in cold conditions. Cold work gloves are available in various materials and sizes. High-visibility gloves, cryogenic gloves, and other specialty gloves are available for more specific settings and tasks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:39:55','2026-05-22 12:39:55'),(2767,'Nitrile Coated Gloves','nitrile-coated-gloves',2765,'Nitrile-coated gloves offer superior hand protection for various work environments. These gloves feature a durable, abrasion-resistant nitrile coating, providing excellent grip and dexterity. These work gloves are ideal for handling oily substances in automotive, material handling, maintenance and repair industries, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:40:40','2026-05-22 12:40:40'),(2768,'Polyurethane Coated Gloves','polyurethane-coated-gloves',2765,'Polyurethane Coated Gloves are protective work gloves that offer comfort, movement, and superior abrasion resistance. They provide excellent grip in wet and dry conditions and offer superior protection against cuts and hazardous materials. Polyurethane gloves are ideal for construction, automotive, and industrial work applications. Available in various sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:41:21','2026-05-22 12:41:21'),(2769,'Latex Coated Gloves','latex-coated-gloves',2765,'The latex coated gloves feature a latex coating that ensures a firm grip and resistance against abrasions. The latex coating ensures a secure hold on tools and materials, making them ideal for tasks that demand precision and durability. The latex coated gloves are ideal for general purpose work in a variety of industrial or commercial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:42:00','2026-05-22 12:42:00'),(2770,'Synthetic Leather Coated Gloves','synthetic-leather-coated-gloves',2765,'Synthetic Leather Coated Gloves prioritize safety without compromising comfort or functionality. They are crafted with high-quality materials and feature a specialized coating, ensuring resistance against abrasions, cuts, and punctures during demanding tasks. These work gloves are ideal for general-purpose work, construction, maintenance, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:42:33','2026-05-22 12:42:33'),(2771,'Polymer Coated Gloves','polymer-coated-gloves',2765,'Polymer-coated gloves are designed to protect a wearer\'s hands while enhancing grip. The textured, waterproof, and oil-resistant surfaces make them perfect to protect hands from work hazards in dry and wet environments. These work gloves are ideal for concrete, landscaping, general maintenance, construction, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:43:10','2026-05-22 12:43:10'),(2772,'HPT Coated Gloves','hpt-coated-gloves',2765,'HPT-coated gloves provide maximum protection for hands while ensuring a firm grip and exceptional flexibility. The HPT coating is ideal in slippery conditions, reducing the risk of accidents and ensuring precision in handling tasks. The breathable fabric and ergonomic design guarantee comfort for extended wear, enhancing productivity in construction, assembly work, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:43:51','2026-05-22 12:43:51'),(2773,'Definite Purpose Electric Motors','definite-purpose-electric-motors',615,'Definite Purpose Electric Motors are engineered for specific applications such as HVAC, refrigeration, compressors, pumps, conveyors, and more. Commercial motors, including explosion-proof and brake motors, offer reliable performance in demanding environments. With sturdy construction, electric motors provide durability and precision in applications requiring specific motor functions and capabilities. Electric motors are ideal for manufacturing facilities, automotive workshops, and commercial buildings requiring customized motor solutions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:45:24','2026-05-22 12:45:24'),(2774,'Gearmotors','gearmotors',615,'Gearmotors are designed to transmit mechanical power from the motor to the driven equipment, enhancing torque and reducing speed to suit specific applications. They provide increased torque output compared to standalone motors, making them suitable for applications demanding higher torque at lower speeds. The gearmotors are ideal for powering conveyor systems, automated machinery, and industrial equipment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:46:19','2026-05-22 12:46:19'),(2775,'Tub & Shower Door Hardware','tub-shower-door-hardware',2576,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:53:22','2026-05-22 12:53:22'),(2776,'General Purpose Electric Motors','general-purpose-electric-motors',615,'General Purpose Electric Motors are devices that convert electrical energy into mechanical energy for various applications. They are composed of a rotor and a stator, generating a rotating magnetic field, resulting in motion. Electric motors are available in different sizes, power ratings, and configurations. They provide essential power for driving mechanical systems and equipment and are commonly used in industrial machinery, pumps, fans, compressors, and conveyors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:54:32','2026-05-22 12:54:32'),(2777,'Cold Weather Gloves','cold-weather-gloves',2766,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:54:58','2026-05-22 12:54:58'),(2778,'HVAC Electric Motors','hvac-electric-motors',615,'HVAC electric motors are specialized electric motors designed specifically for various HVAC systems. They are designed to meet the requirements of HVAC applications, offering reliability, efficiency, and optimal performance. HVAC motors come in various types, including condenser fan motors, cooling tower motors, circulating pump motors, and draft inducer motors. They are crucial for maintaining proper airflow, temperature control, and overall system efficiency in offices, warehouses, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:56:33','2026-05-22 12:56:33'),(2779,'Cryogenic Gloves','cryogenic-gloves',2766,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:57:15','2026-05-22 12:57:15'),(2780,'Motor Controls','motor-controls',615,'Motor controls are essential components designed to regulate and manage the operation of electric motors in various applications. They are widely used in industrial settings such as manufacturing plants, conveyor systems, HVAC systems, and pumping stations where precise motor control is crucial. Motor controls include AC drives, DC drives, enclosures, joysticks, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:57:34','2026-05-22 12:57:34'),(2781,'MCR Safety Thermal Protection Gloves','mcr-safety-thermal-protection-gloves',2766,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:58:02','2026-05-22 12:58:02'),(2782,'Motor Parts & Accessories','motor-parts-accessories',615,'Motor parts and accessories include a variety of components essential for maintaining and optimizing electric motors. Encoders, limit switches, and motor brakes enhance motor performance and functionality, ensuring smooth operation in industrial machinery, conveyors, and automation systems. With a robust construction and precise engineering, motor components offer reliability and durability, minimizing downtime and maximizing productivity in demanding applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:58:17','2026-05-22 12:58:17'),(2783,'Actuators','actuators',618,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:59:23','2026-05-22 12:59:23'),(2784,'ProFlex® Thermal Gloves','proflex-thermal-gloves',2766,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 12:59:30','2026-05-22 12:59:30'),(2785,'Air Amplifiers','air-amplifiers',618,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 13:01:18','2026-05-22 13:01:18'),(2786,'Lift Safety Lined Leather Gloves','lift-safety-lined-leather-gloves',2766,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 13:01:47','2026-05-22 13:01:47'),(2787,'Air Compressors & Accessories','air-compressors-accessories',618,'Air compressors are integral equipment serving as a source of compressed air for uses like pneumatic tool operation and inflation of tires and other items. Silent air compressors provide a noise-free solution and portable options are available in gas- and electric-powered models. Replacement air tanks, fittings, piping, filters, regulators, and lubricators are available. Ideal for garages, maintenance facilities, production and assembly stations, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 13:02:53','2026-05-22 13:02:53'),(2788,'Cut Resistant Gloves','cut-resistant-gloves',1209,'Cut-resistant gloves are protective equipment items that prevent cuts, abrasions, and punctures. High-performance materials provide superior protection without taking away comfort or grip while wearing. Cut-resistant safety gloves can be used in various applications where additional safety equipment may be required, including construction zones, warehouses, and factories.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 13:03:25','2026-05-22 13:03:25'),(2789,'A1 Cut Resistant Gloves','a1-cut-resistant-gloves',2788,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 13:04:02','2026-05-22 13:04:02'),(2790,'A2 Cut Resistant Gloves','a2-cut-resistant-gloves',2788,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 13:04:42','2026-05-22 13:04:42'),(2791,'A3 Cut Resistant Gloves','a3-cut-resistant-gloves',2788,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 13:05:30','2026-05-22 13:05:30'),(2792,'A4 Cut Resistant Gloves','a4-cut-resistant-gloves',2788,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 13:06:11','2026-05-22 13:06:11'),(2793,'A5 Cut Resistant Gloves','a5-cut-resistant-gloves',2788,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 13:06:45','2026-05-22 13:06:45'),(2794,'A6 Cut Resistant Gloves','a6-cut-resistant-gloves',2788,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 13:07:31','2026-05-22 13:07:31'),(2795,'A7 Cut Resistant Gloves','a7-cut-resistant-gloves',2788,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 13:09:25','2026-05-22 13:09:25'),(2796,'A9 Cut Resistant Gloves','a9-cut-resistant-gloves',2788,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 13:10:06','2026-05-22 13:10:06'),(2797,'A8 Cut Resistant Gloves','a8-cut-resistant-gloves',2788,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 13:10:49','2026-05-22 13:10:49'),(2798,'Shower Door Bottom Guide','shower-door-bottom-guide',2775,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 13:10:56','2026-05-22 13:10:56'),(2799,'Shower Door Handle','shower-door-handle',2775,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 13:10:59','2026-05-22 13:10:59'),(2800,'Tub & Shower Hardware','tub-shower-hardware',2775,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 13:11:02','2026-05-22 13:11:02'),(2801,'Tub Enclosure Roller','tub-enclosure-roller',2775,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 13:11:05','2026-05-22 13:11:05'),(2802,'Shower Door Bottom Seal','shower-door-bottom-seal',2775,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 13:11:08','2026-05-22 13:11:08'),(2803,'Closet Door Hardware','closet-door-hardware',2576,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 13:13:49','2026-05-22 13:13:49'),(2804,'Closet Door Hardware','closet-door-hardware-1',2803,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 13:15:28','2026-05-22 13:15:28'),(2805,'Disposable Gloves','disposable-gloves-2',1209,'Disposable gloves are an essential personal protective equipment that cater to various needs. Gloves are available in different materials, sizes, and types to meet diverse requirements across different industries and applications. Whether it is a medical, industrial, or food service setting, high-quality disposable gloves provide a dependable barrier against contaminants while ensuring comfort and secure wear.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 13:31:43','2026-05-22 13:31:43'),(2806,'Nitrile Gloves','nitrile-gloves-2',2805,'Nitrile gloves provide maximum protection against bacteria and chemicals, making them ideal for use in industrial, janitorial, medical, laboratory, and similar settings. These latex-free and powder-free heavy-duty nitrile gloves are available in a variety of sizes and colors. We offer industrial-grade gloves and medical-grade nitrile exam gloves.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 16:03:59','2026-05-22 16:06:04'),(2807,'Latex Gloves','latex-gloves-2',2805,'Latex gloves are a versatile protective solution that can be used in a wide range of applications, including food handling. Made with USDA-approved materials, these disposable latex gloves are comfortable to wear, highly elastic, and provide excellent tactile sensitivity and protection. Available in bulk, latex gloves come powdered or powder-free in various sizes and some models are ambidextrous.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 16:05:07','2026-05-22 16:05:07'),(2808,'Window Operators','window-operators',2576,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 16:58:17','2026-05-22 16:58:17'),(2809,'Sliding Door Hardware','sliding-door-hardware',2576,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-22 17:00:34','2026-05-22 17:00:34'),(2810,'Driver\'s Gloves','drivers-gloves',1209,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 09:27:03','2026-05-25 09:27:03'),(2811,'Driver Gloves with Keystone Thumb','driver-gloves-with-keystone-thumb',2810,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 09:27:51','2026-05-25 09:27:51'),(2812,'Operator Gloves','operator-gloves',2810,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 09:28:23','2026-05-25 09:28:23'),(2813,'Lift Safety 8 Seconds Multi Gloves','lift-safety-8-seconds-multi-gloves',2810,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 09:28:53','2026-05-25 09:28:53'),(2814,'3-Finger Leather Mitt','3-finger-leather-mitt',2810,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 09:29:28','2026-05-25 09:29:28'),(2815,'General Purpose Work Gloves','general-purpose-work-gloves',1209,'General purpose work gloves are ideal for any commercial or industrial work. The coated work gloves provide protection against harmful influencers and provide a balance of abrasion resistance. General purpose work gloves come in a variety of coatings including nitrile, latex, pvc, and many others. Commercial gloves are ideal for protecting hands on any commercial or industrial job.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 09:44:37','2026-05-25 09:44:37'),(2816,'Forklift Handling Gloves','forklift-handling-gloves',2815,'Forklift Handling Gloves provide durability, grip, and flexibility to enhance safety and performance during forklift-related tasks. Materials such as rubber with a PVC coating protect hands from abrasions and cold weather conditions. Included cords allow the gloves to be hung on forklift overhead guards, ensuring they are always accessible. Ideal for warehouse and manufacturing environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 09:47:06','2026-05-25 09:47:06'),(2817,'Anti-Vibration Gloves','anti-vibration-gloves',2815,'Anti-vibration gloves are designed to shield hands from the impact of vibrations caused by power tools or machinery. They feature memory foam padding in strategic areas to dampen and absorb vibrations, reducing the risk of hand fatigue or injury during prolonged tool usage. Anti-vibration gloves are ideal for construction, manufacturing, or heavy machinery operations professionals.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 09:51:29','2026-05-25 09:51:29'),(2818,'Mechanic GlovesMechanic Gloves','mechanic-glovesmechanic-gloves',2815,'Mechanic gloves are ideal for protecting hands during tasks in automotive, machinery handling, and general maintenance. The gloves are designed with a synthetic leather palm for grip and abrasion resistance. The stretch spandex back ensures flexibility, while the reinforced fingertips provide extra protection.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 09:54:49','2026-05-25 09:54:49'),(2819,'Leather Palm Gloves','leather-palm-gloves',2815,'Leather palm gloves provide superior grip and protection against dirt, abrasions, and liquids during heavy-duty applications. The work gloves come in a comfortable and durable leather material for long-lasting performance. The leather palm gloves can be used in gardening, construction, mechanical work, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 09:55:35','2026-05-25 09:55:35'),(2820,'High Visibility Gloves','high-visibility-gloves',2815,'High-visibility gloves prioritize safety in various work environments. They offer a secure grip while ensuring hands remain visible and help reduce workplace hazards in challenging or low-visibility environments. High-visibility gloves are best used in construction, roadwork, warehouse settings, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 09:57:00','2026-05-25 09:57:00'),(2821,'High Dexterity Gloves','high-dexterity-gloves',2815,'High-dexterity gloves are designed for hand protection when working with sharp or harmful objects. They are tough yet flexible and feature sensitivity and breathability for comfort and grip when working in industrial settings. The gloves are constructed with nylon, spandex, and nitrile for the most demanding applications. The gloves are ideal for automotive, maintenance, and farming use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 09:57:45','2026-05-25 09:57:45'),(2822,'Utility Work Gloves','utility-work-gloves',2815,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 09:58:18','2026-05-25 09:58:18'),(2823,'Tactical Gloves','tactical-gloves',2815,'Tactical gloves are designed with a synthetic leather palm for durability and grip. The reinforced knuckles provide impact resistance, ensuring hands stay shielded and protected. Ideal for law enforcement and military use, the tactical impact glove features thermoplastic rubber for knuckle and metacarpal protection, with a terry cloth on the thumb for wiping away sweat during tasks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 09:58:53','2026-05-25 09:58:53'),(2824,'Glove Accessories','glove-accessories',1209,'Glove accessories are essential for hand protection in the workplace. From glove clips ensuring easy access to gloves to glove liners for added warmth or moisture-wicking, these accessories cater to various needs. Glove accessories improve comfort, hygiene, and efficiency, ensuring hands remain protected across industries such as healthcare, manufacturing, and construction.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:00:43','2026-05-25 10:00:43'),(2825,'Polymer Coated Gloves','polymer-coated-gloves-1',2824,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:01:39','2026-05-25 10:01:39'),(2826,'Hooks & Clips','hooks-clips',2824,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:02:09','2026-05-25 10:02:09'),(2827,'ID/Badge Holders','idbadge-holders',2824,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:02:39','2026-05-25 10:02:39'),(2828,'Glove Liners','glove-liners',2824,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:03:11','2026-05-25 10:03:11'),(2829,'Glove Racks','glove-racks',2824,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:03:46','2026-05-25 10:03:46'),(2830,'Scratch Guards','scratch-guards',2824,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:04:28','2026-05-25 10:04:28'),(2831,'Hand & Toe Warmers','hand-toe-warmers',1209,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:07:31','2026-05-25 10:07:31'),(2832,'Hand & Body Warmers','hand-body-warmers',2831,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:08:05','2026-05-25 10:08:05'),(2833,'Toe Warmers','toe-warmers',2831,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:08:32','2026-05-25 10:08:32'),(2834,'Heat Protection Gloves','heat-protection-gloves',1209,'Heat Protection Gloves are essential tactical gear designed for reliable defense against extreme heat surfaces. Crafted with advanced heat-resistant materials, these gloves provide vital protection against thermal hazards, making them suitable for applications such as welding, foundries, and manufacturing. With a focus on dexterity and insulation, these gloves ensure optimal performance in extreme heat conditions. Their durable construction is tailored to guarantee safety for professionals working in environments with elevated temperatures.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:09:37','2026-05-25 10:09:37'),(2835,'High Heat Gloves','high-heat-gloves',2834,'High Heat Gloves provide high-level protection from temperatures up to 900°F. These heavy-duty thermal gloves are perfect for tasks involving heat, with flame-resistant material and insulated kevlar-lined palms. Reversible for extended durability and a secure fit on either hand, and fonded nitrile coating protects against snags, punctures, abrasions and cuts. Styles vary by model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:10:45','2026-05-25 10:10:45'),(2836,'NSA Heat Resistant Gloves','nsa-heat-resistant-gloves',2834,'Shield your hands from high temperatures with NSA Heat Resistant Gloves. Engineered with a high-performance, heat-resistant material, these gloves provide reliable protection. Their ergonomic shape and breathable fabric ensure comfort during use. Ideal for handling hot liquids, hot glass, or working in extreme temperatures.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:11:25','2026-05-25 10:11:25'),(2837,'Door Tracks and Frames','door-tracks-and-frames',2809,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:11:58','2026-05-25 10:11:58'),(2838,'Sliding Door Hardware','sliding-door-hardware-1',2809,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:12:02','2026-05-25 10:12:02'),(2839,'Exterior Sliding Door Hardware','exterior-sliding-door-hardware',2809,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:12:05','2026-05-25 10:12:05'),(2840,'Bi-Pass Closet Track Kit','bi-pass-closet-track-kit',2809,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:12:08','2026-05-25 10:12:08'),(2841,'Prime-Line® Patio Door Locks','prime-line-patio-door-locks',2809,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:12:13','2026-05-25 10:12:13'),(2842,'Prime-Line® Patio Door Rollers','prime-line-patio-door-rollers',2809,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:12:16','2026-05-25 10:12:16'),(2843,'Prime-Line® Patio Door Handle Sets','prime-line-patio-door-handle-sets',2809,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:12:20','2026-05-25 10:12:20'),(2844,'High Heat Mittens','high-heat-mittens',2834,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:15:41','2026-05-25 10:15:41'),(2845,'Bel-Art Biohazard Autoclave Gloves','bel-art-biohazard-autoclave-gloves',2834,'Bel-Art Biohazard Autoclave Gloves are designed for safe use in autoclaves. Crafted from latex-free natural rubber latex, these heat protection gloves offer excellent grip for delicate procedures. Extended length provides enhanced protection from splashes and aerosols. CE-certified and tested for pinholes, meeting European Class II standards. Ensure your safety with biohazard autoclave gloves.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:16:34','2026-05-25 10:16:34'),(2846,'Kitchen Specialty Gloves','kitchen-specialty-gloves',2834,'Kitchen Specialty Gloves are designed for a range of kitchen tasks. Explore heat-resistant gloves, sleeve protection, and bite protection options. These lightweight kitchen gloves offer flexibility and dexterity, perfect for high-heat kitchen tasks like ovens, grills, and fryers. Available for various applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:17:15','2026-05-25 10:17:15'),(2847,'NSA Arc Rated Gloves','nsa-arc-rated-gloves',2834,'Choose NSA Arc Rated Gloves for exceptional arc flash protection and heat resistance, tailored to electrical workers. Explore a range of sizes and styles to suit your specific safety needs. These flame-resistant gloves meet ASTM F2178 standards and provide secondary arc flash protection in hazardous work environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:17:49','