ULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:39:34','2026-05-25 10:39:34'),(2881,'Door Frames','door-frames',2575,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:39:37','2026-05-25 10:39:37'),(2882,'Door Louver & Window Kits','door-louver-window-kits',2575,'Door Louver & Window Kits are designed to modify doors and windows quickly. They include durable louvers or window panels that can be installed onto existing structures. Door louvers and window kits provide better ventilation and natural light while maintaining structural integrity. These kits are commonly used in various settings, such as commercial buildings, industrial facilities, institutional spaces, and residential areas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:39:40','2026-05-25 10:39:40'),(2883,'Security Doors','security-doors',2575,'Security doors are barriers designed to enhance safety and fortify entryways. Being constructed from heavy-duty steel, they offer superior strength and durability, deterring unauthorized access to high-security areas, storage facilities, parking garages, and more. They feature advanced locking mechanisms and reinforced frames, offering heightened security for commercial, industrial, or residential properties.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:39:43','2026-05-25 10:39:43'),(2884,'Impact Doors','impact-doors-1',2575,'Impact Doors enhance safety and security within warehouses and industrial environments. Designed to endure heavy machinery impact, such as forklifts, they effectively reduce noise and absorb dents, bumps, and dings. While these doors excel in withstanding physical impact, they are not intended to protect against harsh weather conditions. In warehouses and factories, impact doors are protective barriers in high-traffic areas, providing durability and energy conservation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:39:48','2026-05-25 10:40:59'),(2885,'Security Doors with Frames','security-doors-with-frames',2575,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:39:51','2026-05-25 10:39:51'),(2886,'Laminate Doors','laminate-doors',2884,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:46:00','2026-05-25 10:46:00'),(2887,'Walk-In Freezer Swinging Doors','walk-in-freezer-swinging-doors',2884,'Walk-in freezer swinging doors provide easy access to coolers & freezers while keeping contents insulated. These doors are designed to maintain temperature control & prevent cold air leakage. Crafted with durable materials, they withstand demanding freezer environments. With smooth swinging operation & a tight seal, these freezer doors provide efficiency & convenience for cold storage needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:46:02','2026-05-25 10:46:02'),(2888,'Walk-In Freezer Swinging Doors','walk-in-freezer-swinging-doors-1',2884,'Walk-in freezer swinging doors provide easy access to coolers & freezers while keeping contents insulated. These doors are designed to maintain temperature control & prevent cold air leakage. Crafted with durable materials, they withstand demanding freezer environments. With smooth swinging operation & a tight seal, these freezer doors provide efficiency & convenience for cold storage needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:46:03','2026-05-25 10:46:03'),(2889,'Stainless Steel Impact Traffic Doors','stainless-steel-impact-traffic-doors',2884,'Stainless steel impact traffic doors are ideal for restaurants, retail settings, factory offices, and more. Designed to withstand frequent and heavy use in high-traffic areas, these strong and impact-resistant doors are easy to maintain and keep clean. They feature a stainless steel design that won\'t warp or crack and an acrylic window for easy visibility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:46:06','2026-05-25 10:46:06'),(2890,'Medium Duty Impact Traffic Doors','medium-duty-impact-traffic-doors',2884,'Medium Duty Impact Traffic Doors are designed for secure, high-traffic areas. With steel reinforcement, they withstand forklift strikes and provide durability. Easy to install and maintain, they are perfect for loading docks, distribution centers, freezers, and warehouses. These doors open with minimal resistance, close gently, and come in various sizes and colors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:46:09','2026-05-25 10:46:09'),(2891,'Flexible Impact Traffic Doors','flexible-impact-traffic-doors',2884,'Flexible Impact Traffic Doors protect high-traffic areas from dirt, dust, and pests. Made from flexible PVC, these self-closing doors are commonly used in storerooms, kitchens, delivery areas, and airports. Their flexible design allows for easy passage, minimizing damage or injury. Easy to clean and maintain, these doors ensure long-lasting safety for employees.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:46:12','2026-05-25 10:46:12'),(2892,'Aluminum Impact Traffic Doors','aluminum-impact-traffic-doors',2884,'Aluminum impact traffic doors are durable and doors designed to withstand heavy usage in high-traffic areas and provide long-lasting performance. Made from high-quality aluminum, they offer strength and impact resistance. Ideal for warehouses, restaurants, and industrial facilities, these doors ensure reliable operation and promote safety.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:46:17','2026-05-25 10:46:17'),(2893,'Light Duty Impact Traffic Doors','light-duty-impact-traffic-doors',2884,'Light Duty Impact Traffic Doors offer a secure barrier for personnel and equipment in various work areas. With durable construction, full-length vinyl hinges, and reinforced frames, these doors ensure lasting safety and function. They effectively reduce noise and drafts while enabling easy, hands-free transitions between spaces. Perfect for busy warehouses, lobbies, and high-traffic areas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:46:21','2026-05-25 10:46:21'),(2894,'Heavy Duty Impact Traffic Doors','heavy-duty-impact-traffic-doors',2884,'Our Heavy Duty Impact Traffic Doors offer superior protection against dents, impacts, and abrasions. Ideal for industrial, commercial, and institutional applications, they feature durable construction, heavy-duty hinges, fluid corner construction, and an integrated impact-resistant aluminum threshold. Available in various sizes and colors, including single and double panel models.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:46:24','2026-05-25 10:46:24'),(2895,'CECO Hollow Steel Doors With Louvers','ceco-hollow-steel-doors-with-louvers',2883,'These hollow steel security doors from CECO feature louvers for enhanced ventilation and temperature control. With steel construction, fire rating, honeycomb core, and thermal insulation, these doors provide long-lasting reliability. Perfect for commercial and industrial environments such as offices, stairwells, parking garages, and storage facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:56:45','2026-05-25 10:56:45'),(2896,'CECO Hollow Steel Vision Light Doors','ceco-hollow-steel-vision-light-doors',2883,'CECO Hollow Steel Vision Light Doors offer enhanced access to natural light in parking garages, stairwells, offices, and more. Crafted with durable hollow steel, these doors offer superior strength and reliability. They provide ample daylight while ensuring sturdy protection with impact-resistant and tinted glass panels.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:56:48','2026-05-25 10:56:48'),(2897,'CECO Hollow Steel Narrow Light Glass Doors','ceco-hollow-steel-narrow-light-glass-doors',2883,'CECO hollow steel narrow light doors are great for offices, stairwells, parking garages, storage facilities and other commercial and industrial settings. Made with steel for durability, these doors feature a narrow window design and a honeycomb core. CECO doors are fire rated and have thermal insulation. Closer reinforcements offer a tight, reliable shut.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:56:52','2026-05-25 10:56:52'),(2898,'CECO Hollow Steel Half Glass Doors','ceco-hollow-steel-half-glass-doors',2883,'CECO Hollow Steel Half-Glass Doors offer enhanced visibility without sacrificing security. These durable doors provide privacy and protection while allowing natural light to enter. With a heavy-duty steel frame, laminated safety half-glass window, and a concealed continuous hinge these doors offer exceptional strength. They are easy to install and available in various sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:56:55','2026-05-25 10:56:55'),(2899,'CECO Hollow Steel Flush Doors','ceco-hollow-steel-flush-doors',2883,'CECO Hollow Steel Flush Doors are secure solutions for offices, parking garages, storage facilities, and more. Crafted with durable steel, these flush doors provide exceptional strength. These fire-rated doors feature a flush surface design that offers superior sound control and easy installation. Optional lite kits enhance visibility and safety.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:56:58','2026-05-25 10:56:58'),(2900,'Fortis Security Doors','fortis-security-doors',2883,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 10:57:01','2026-05-25 10:57:01'),(2901,'Activar Vision Lites - Steel For Interior, Galvanized And Stainless For Exterior','activar-vision-lites-steel-for-interior-galvanized-and-stainless-for-exterior',2882,'Activar Vision Lites are durable industrial-grade window lites for interior and exterior use. The steel interior and galvanized or stainless steel exterior frames ensure resilience against harsh weather conditions. These vision lites are versatile and well-suited for a wide range of applications. Additionally, they are designed for easy installation, making them a convenient choice.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:03:36','2026-05-25 11:03:36'),(2902,'Activar Steel Door Louvers - Inverted \"Y\" Blade, Self-Attaching & Screw-In Louvers','activar-steel-door-louvers-inverted-y-blade-self-attaching-screw-in-louvers',2882,'Activar Steel Door Louvers help maximize the airflow of doors in commercial spaces. The inverted \"Y\" blade design ensures efficient circulation while keeping out debris. Self-attaching or screw-in options are available for easy installation. With a durable steel construction and versatile mounting choices, Activar Steel Door Louvers provide reliable performance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:03:39','2026-05-25 11:03:39'),(2903,'Activar Door Louvers - Fire Rated','activar-door-louvers-fire-rated',2882,'Fire Rated Activar Door Louvers offer fire protection and ventilation with a balance of air transfer and flame resistance. Available in various sizes, configurations, and fire ratings, these louvers suit your specific needs. They are compatible with single and double-leaf doors and come pre-assembled for easy installation with jamb brackets, masonry anchors, and frame edge seals.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:03:42','2026-05-25 11:03:42'),(2904,'CECO Door Louver & Window Kits','ceco-door-louver-window-kits',2882,'CECO Door Louver Kits are designed to enhance the functionality of doors in commercial spaces. These door and window kits are ideal for incorporating louvers or windows into your doors to improve airflow, visibility, and versatility. A variety of options are available to meet your specific needs, including louvers, windows, and combination kits.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:03:47','2026-05-25 11:03:47'),(2905,'Complete Vision Kits','complete-vision-kits',2882,'Complete Vision Kits elevate the functionality of door windows in schools, hospitals, offices, and more. These kits contain all the essential components, including a frame, tempered glass, and necessary hardware for hassle-free installation. With a variety of sizes and finishes to choose from, Complete Vision Kits offer a comprehensive solution for enhancing your doors with windows.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:03:50','2026-05-25 11:03:50'),(2906,'Fortis Door Frames','fortis-door-frames',2881,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:09:14','2026-05-25 11:09:14'),(2907,'CECO Door Frames','ceco-door-frames',2881,'CECO Door Frames offer superior performance and functionality for new construction, expansion, and remodeling projects. With various steel and aluminum frames available for interior and exterior applications, they provide the perfect fit for your specific requirements. Engineered to meet rigorous performance standards, these CECO doors and frames ensure a sturdy perimeter around doors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:09:19','2026-05-25 11:09:19'),(2908,'Bilco® Basement Doors, Flat & Sloped Areaways','bilco-basement-doors-flat-sloped-areaways',2880,'Made of galvanized steel or high-density polyethylene Bilco® Basement Doors ensure durable and dependable performance. They provide code-compliant access to basement living spaces or storage areas. With a wide door opening, they accommodate large items effortlessly. These basement Bilco® doors have easy-to-mount installation hardware and offer superior weather resistance and insulation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:10:40','2026-05-25 11:10:40'),(2909,'Activar Roof Hatches','activar-roof-hatches-1',2574,'The Activar Roof Hatches provide efficient roof access and ventilation. They are designed to offer superior performance and protection from the elements and water penetration. These roof hatches are available in a variety of door heights and opening sizes to fit the needs of many commercial building applications. They also feature quality construction with durable materials to ensure lasting use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:16:24','2026-05-25 11:16:24'),(2910,'Babcock Davis Roof Hatches','babcock-davis-roof-hatches-1',2574,'Babcock-Davis roof hatches allow for safe access to rooftops for maintenance and repairs. The featured hatches are insulated and allow for superior protection against harsh weather conditions. Available in an array of sizes, these roof hatches are an ideal option for commercial building roof access.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:16:27','2026-05-25 11:16:27'),(2911,'Acudor Roof Hatches','acudor-roof-hatches-1',2574,'Acudor roof hatches provide safe and convenient access to rooftops. They feature weathertight construction and are available in a variety of sizes and materials to fit your needs. The locking mechanisms on these roof hatches provide added safety and security when not in use. Ideal for use in commercial building structures.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:16:30','2026-05-25 11:16:30'),(2912,'Bilco® Roof Hatches','bilco-roof-hatches-1',2574,'Bilco® roof hatches provide convenient, reliable access to roof areas. They are made from durable materials and provide protection from the elements. These roof access hatches include strong hinges for easy lifting, sealed moisture protection, and a broad range of sizes to fit most commercial buildings. Heavy-duty construction ensures years of dependable use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:16:33','2026-05-25 11:16:33'),(2913,'Global Industrial Roof Hatches','global-industrial-roof-hatches-1',2574,'Global Industrial Roof Hatches ensure workers have safe and easy access to rooftops. Choose from an array of sizes and materials to meet any commercial or industrial need. Their durable construction allows for indoor climate control and protection from the elements. They are ideal for use in commercial buildings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:16:37','2026-05-25 11:16:37'),(2914,'Frame & Screen Parts','frame-screen-parts',2573,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:20:44','2026-05-25 11:20:44'),(2915,'Screen Repair Kits','screen-repair-kits',2914,'Screen Repair Kits provide an all-in-one solution for fixing damaged window screens. Each kit includes various essential components such as mesh, spline, and a roller tool. With easy-to-follow instructions included, these kits offer a quick, hassle-free, and cost-effective way to repair window screens and restore functionality.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:30:52','2026-05-25 11:30:52'),(2916,'Screen Repair Parts','screen-repair-parts',2914,'Our selection of screen repair parts includes various components designed to seamlessly replace damaged parts of existing window screens. From heavy-duty mesh material and frame corners to springs and clips, these components can help you restore and repair your screens.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:30:55','2026-05-25 11:30:55'),(2917,'Splines','splines',2914,'Splines ensure a secure, tight fit for window and door screens. These flexible and durable rubber or vinyl strips are used to hold the screen material in place within the window frame. Available in different sizes and materials, these screen retainer splines provide the necessary tension and grip to keep your screens securely positioned.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:30:58','2026-05-25 11:30:58'),(2918,'Screen Repair Tools and Accessories','screen-repair-tools-and-accessories',2914,'Screen repair tools and accessories are designed to assist in repair as well as assembly and replacement of damaged screens. Our selection of specialized tools and accessories includes everything from spline rollers and screen installation tools to screen cutters and frame end caps. Screen repair tools and accessories are made with various materials. Dimensions vary by product.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:31:01','2026-05-25 11:31:01'),(2919,'Fencing','fencing',12,'Whether you\'re looking for security enclosures, welded wire, screens, safety barriers, or fencing materials, we have you covered. Our selection of enclosures is designed to provide maximum security and protection for your valuable equipment and assets. From sturdy steel enclosures to durable plastic ones, we offer a variety of options to suit different environments and requirements. These enclosures are perfect for warehouses, manufacturing facilities, data centers, and any other location where security is paramount.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:34:12','2026-05-25 11:34:12'),(2920,'Welded Wire Fences','welded-wire-fences',2919,'Welded wire fencing provides a versatile and durable fencing solution across commercial, agricultural, and industrial applications. The fencing is ideal for creating enclosures for animals, livestock, and pets, offering a secure environment while preventing unwanted entry. It is also designed to act as a barrier for gardens and plants, avoiding damage from wildlife and unauthorized access. The fencing comes in different heights, gauges, and styles, providing flexibility to meet specific fencing requirements for different applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:36:57','2026-05-25 11:36:57'),(2921,'Vinyl Fences','vinyl-fences',2919,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:37:00','2026-05-25 11:37:00'),(2922,'Privacy Fences & Screens','privacy-fences-screens',2919,'Screens are a privacy solution, creating visual barriers to enhance confidentiality and seclusion in various environments. They also help control dust and debris in outdoor environments, making them valuable in construction sites, industrial areas, or locations prone to dust. Screens are constructed from durable materials like polyethylene to ensure longevity and resistance to environmental elements. They are ideal for sports facilities, commercial properties, and outdoor event areas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:37:03','2026-05-25 11:37:03'),(2923,'Gates','gates',2919,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:37:08','2026-05-25 11:37:08'),(2924,'Border Fences','border-fences',2919,'Creating well-defined boundaries while adding aesthetic appeal to landscape with portable patio fences. Fences come in various styles and sizes, and are easy to install and remove offering flexibility and functionality. Patio fences are designed for various applications, including garden delineation, pathway borders, and decorative landscaping.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:37:11','2026-05-25 11:37:11'),(2925,'Portable Patio Fence','portable-patio-fence',2924,'Portable patio fence panels are a durable and versatile solution for designing and defining outdoor spaces. Made with weather-resistant, UV-stabilized prime resin, these portable patio fences resist fading and don\'t require painting, sanding, or refinishing. Panels don\'t rust or splinter. They are lightweight and easy to set up, reposition, remove, and transport.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:44:28','2026-05-25 11:44:28'),(2926,'Jewett Cameron Fit Right Gate Panel Kits','jewett-cameron-fit-right-gate-panel-kits',2923,'Jewett Cameron Fit Right Gate Panel Kits include gate hinges, frame, chain link and hardware, truss kit and hardware. These gate panel kits are ideal for creating a custom solution for a special sized gate opening. The durable and high-quality materials used in these kits ensure long-lasting performance and resistance to harsh weather conditions. Choose from various configurations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:46:07','2026-05-25 11:46:07'),(2927,'Jewett Cameron Adjust-A-Gate Adjustable Steel Gate Frame Kits','jewett-cameron-adjust-a-gate-adjustable-steel-gate-frame-kits',2923,'Jewett Cameron adjustable steel gate frame kits help create a secure enclosure around existing fences. Each adjust-a-gate steel frame gate building kit is built with weather-resistant steel with a powder coat finish and heavy-duty hinges, offering durability and resistance to rust and fading. These adjustable steel gate frames are easy to assemble and require little maintenance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:46:10','2026-05-25 11:46:10'),(2928,'Liquid & Particulate Protection Sleeves','liquid-particulate-protection-sleeves',2865,'Constructed from durable materials like polyurethane & polypropylene for strength and mobility, Liquid & Particulate Protection Sleeves help prevent chemicals, liquids, and other environmental irritants from contacting clothing or skin. They come in a selection of sizes to accommodate different users and assorted pharmaceutical & biomedical research tasks, and are available in high-quantity multi-packs to ensure a ready supply is always on hand.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:48:17','2026-05-25 11:48:17'),(2929,'BOEN Scaffold Sheeting','boen-scaffold-sheeting',2922,'BOEN Scaffold Sheeting protects construction site structures and workers in harsh weather conditions. These scaffolding sheets are made from laminated propylene with reinforced webbing bands and pre-punched eyelet holes, offering lasting durability. Scaffold sheeting is easy to install, can withstand extreme temperatures, and is UV treated. Choose from flame and non flame retardant models.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:48:38','2026-05-25 11:48:38'),(2930,'Tennis Court Wind Screens','tennis-court-wind-screens',2922,'Tennis court windscreens are designed to reduce wind interference during tennis matches, allowing for more consistent and enhanced gameplay. The polyester knitted mesh screen offers strength and corrosion resistance and is water and UV resistant for dependability through harsh weather conditions. Windscreens for tennis courts also provide maximum privacy without compromising visibility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:48:38','2026-05-25 11:48:38'),(2931,'Premier Privacy Fence Screens','premier-privacy-fence-screens',2922,'Premier Privacy Fence Screens prevent onlooker visibility for various applications including construction, commercial, and more. Made from high quality knitted mesh, our outdoor privacy screens can last through harsh conditions and are designed to reduce sun and heat exposure while maintaining optimal airflow. These privacy fence screens are easy to install and offered in various sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:48:38','2026-05-25 11:48:38'),(2932,'BOEN Privacy Nettings','boen-privacy-nettings',2922,'BOEN Privacy Nettings are designed to create a secluded private space or provide shielding protection for various commercial locations. Our privacy fence netting is made from durable, UV-resistant HDPE that can withstand outdoor elements. Each privacy netting features reinforced grommets and has a lightweight, easy-to-install design. Dimensions vary per model to meet your specific needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:48:41','2026-05-25 11:48:41'),(2933,'Sleeves for Non-Hazardous Dry Particulates & Liquid Splash','sleeves-for-non-hazardous-dry-particulates-liquid-splash',2928,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:49:04','2026-05-25 11:49:04'),(2934,'Welding Sleeves','welding-sleeves',2865,'Designed to be worn during a variety of welding tasks, Welding Sleeves and Capes protect welders from sparks and flames. Welding sleeves are pulled over the hands & wrists and work in conjunction with welding gloves to provide complete arm protection, and welding capes are worn like a shirt to guard the arms, upper chest, and upper back when working overhead or at chest height. They are constructed from durable materials including leather and treated fabrics, for strength and resistance to sparks, slag, and flames.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:51:05','2026-05-25 11:51:05'),(2935,'Poly Gates','poly-gates',2921,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:51:31','2026-05-25 11:51:31'),(2936,'Jewett Cameron Infinity Privacy Fencing','jewett-cameron-infinity-privacy-fencing',2921,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:51:34','2026-05-25 11:51:34'),(2937,'Cotton Welding Sleeves','cotton-welding-sleeves',2934,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:52:29','2026-05-25 11:52:29'),(2938,'Metal Fencing','metal-fencing',2920,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:53:23','2026-05-25 11:53:23'),(2939,'Partition Components','partition-components',2920,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:53:25','2026-05-25 11:53:25'),(2940,'Powder Coat Fence','powder-coat-fence',2920,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:53:28','2026-05-25 11:53:28'),(2941,'Flooring','flooring',12,'Our selection showcases a variety of flooring types, including but not limited to wall-base flooring, stair treads, vinyl flooring, hardwood, laminate, carpet, ceramic, and rubber. Each category offers numerous styles, colors, sizes, and finishes, ensuring that you can find the perfect match for your project. Whether you prefer the timeless elegance of hardwood, the versatility of vinyl, or the comfort of carpet, we have options that will meet your specific preferences. Explore our selection today and discover the perfect flooring solution to elevate your space.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:55:10','2026-05-25 11:55:10'),(2942,'Cotton Welding Cape Sleeves','cotton-welding-cape-sleeves',2934,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:55:45','2026-05-25 11:55:45'),(2943,'Oil Palm Fiber Welding Sleeves','oil-palm-fiber-welding-sleeves',2934,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:57:17','2026-05-25 11:57:17'),(2944,'Leather Welding Cape Sleeves','leather-welding-cape-sleeves',2934,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:57:58','2026-05-25 11:57:58'),(2945,'Leather Welding Bibs','leather-welding-bibs',2934,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 11:58:45','2026-05-25 11:58:45'),(2946,'Heat Protection Sleeves','heat-protection-sleeves',2865,'Great for welders, manufacturers, and other employees that work in high-temperature environments, Heat Protection Sleeves are designed to cover the wearer’s arms for protection against hot slag, sparks, and other sources of heat. They are constructed from durable materials including aluminum, cotton, and aramid for strength & durability and are treated with heat-resistant materials to create a shield against hot surfaces, flames, and other heat-emitting hazards.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:06:06','2026-05-25 12:06:06'),(2947,'High Heat Resistant Aluminized Sleeves','high-heat-resistant-aluminized-sleeves',2946,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:06:40','2026-05-25 12:06:40'),(2948,'Heat Resistant Arm Sleeves','heat-resistant-arm-sleeves',2946,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:08:03','2026-05-25 12:08:03'),(2949,'Heat & Cut Resistant Sleeves','heat-cut-resistant-sleeves',2946,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:08:32','2026-05-25 12:08:32'),(2950,'Chemical Resistant Sleeves','chemical-resistant-sleeves',2865,'Suitable for labeling, sampling, cleaning, and other jobs that may result in contact with hazardous materials, Chemical Resistant Sleeves provide full arm coverage for supplemental protection and reduced heat stress when worn in conjunction with coveralls and other protective apparel. They are made from durable, flexible PVC to hold strong and allow workers to maintain their range of motion.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:09:16','2026-05-25 12:09:16'),(2951,'Aggressive Application Chemical Resistant Sleeves','aggressive-application-chemical-resistant-sleeves',2950,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:10:12','2026-05-25 12:10:12'),(2952,'Welding Gloves','welding-gloves',1209,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:11:01','2026-05-25 12:11:01'),(2953,'Ironcat Welding Gloves','ironcat-welding-gloves',2952,'Ironcat® Welding Gloves provide excellent protection from heat, flames, and sparks generated during the welding process. Designed to withstand high temperatures, these leather gloves are made from cowhide, goatskin, deerskin, or pigskin and are ideal for TIG or MIG welding. Available in a range of sizes and cuff styles.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:11:43','2026-05-25 12:11:43'),(2954,'Stanco Welding Gloves','stanco-welding-gloves',2952,'Stanco Welding Glove Gloves are an ideal solution for protecting against burns caused by sparks and medium heat. Featuring a cowhide construction, these gloves have wing thumbs and a cotton-fleece lining.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:12:25','2026-05-25 12:12:25'),(2955,'Mechanix Wear Welding Gloves','mechanix-wear-welding-gloves',2952,'Mechanix Wear® Welding Gloves are an ideal solution for providing welders protection in high-production environments such as metalworking, manufacturing, railroad, and automotive applications. Made from a range of durable leathers and fabrics, these gloves are designed to withstand high heats and improve welders’ dexterity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:13:04','2026-05-25 12:13:04'),(2956,'PIP Welding Gloves','pip-welding-gloves',2952,'PIP Welding Gloves are an ideal solution for heavy-duty industrial welding applications. Made from a mix of elk skin and cowhide for enhanced durability, these gloves protect the hand from burns caused by sparks and high heat. These gloves are ideal for MIG and stick welding projects. Available in a range of sizes and cuff styles.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:13:40','2026-05-25 12:13:40'),(2957,'Ironclad Welding Gloves','ironclad-welding-gloves',2952,'Ironclad Welding Gloves are an ideal solution for providing welders protection in high-production environments such as metalworking, manufacturing, railroad, and automotive applications. Made from a range of durable leathers and fabrics, these gloves are designed to withstand high heats and improve welders’ dexterity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:14:44','2026-05-25 12:14:44'),(2958,'Wall Base','wall-base',2941,'Wall bases trim the bottom edges of a wall, providing protection from scuffs, dents, and impacts caused by foot traffic and enhancing the transition between the walls and floors. Made from tough rubber, vinyl, or thermoplastic materials, Wall bases help prevent walls from getting scratched or damaged due to impacts and contribute to the overall cleanliness and aesthetic of the space. They come in various profiles and sizes, effectively covering up joints in commercial spaces, offices, healthcare facilities, and residential areas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:15:58','2026-05-25 12:15:58'),(2959,'Vinyl Flooring','vinyl-flooring',2941,'Vinyl flooring is a sustainable flooring solution for any space. Flooring tiles come in many textures and styles such as rubber, wood, leather, and more. Rubber tiles have a built-in anti-slip surface, and PVC tiles are scuff and stain resistant. Ideal for use in machine shops, warehouse, garages, gyms, & other commercial spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:16:01','2026-05-25 12:16:01'),(2960,'Underlayment','underlayment',2941,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:16:04','2026-05-25 12:16:04'),(2961,'Tile Spacers','tile-spacers',2941,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:16:07','2026-05-25 12:16:07'),(2962,'Surface Protectors','surface-protectors-1',2941,'Surface protectors are essential building supplies that help protect surfaces from wear and tear. They include window film, floor guards, and carpet protector films. Floor protection products can be used to guard different floor surfaces from damage. Carpet protector films are a durable, easy-to-apply film that protects carpets from dirt and wear. Surface protectors are ideal for any commercial or industrial application.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:16:10','2026-05-25 12:16:10'),(2963,'Stair Treads','stair-treads',2941,'Stair treads are designed to provide an anti-slip surface, reducing the risk of slips, trips, and falls on stairs, especially in high-traffic areas. They also act as a protective layer for the underlying staircase, shielding it from wear and tear caused by foot traffic, impact, and environmental factors. The treads are constructed from durable materials such as rubber, vinyl, or abrasive grit, ensuring long-lasting performance and resistance to wear. They are ideal for commercial buildings, offices, and retail spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:16:13','2026-05-25 12:16:13'),(2964,'Rubber Flooring','rubber-flooring-1',2941,'Rubber flooring includes various materials primarily composed of rubber, a resilient and flexible substance sourced from natural or synthetic origins. Available in diverse forms such as rubber floor tiles, mats, and gym flooring, it offers durability, slip resistance, and easy maintenance. Widely utilized in gyms, fitness centers, playgrounds, commercial and industrial areas, as well as healthcare facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:16:16','2026-05-25 12:16:16'),(2965,'Playground Tiles','playground-tiles',2941,'Playground tiles are durable and weather-resistant flooring solutions that offer impact absorption to cushion falls and reduce injuries. They are easy to install, low-maintenance, and can adapt to various surfaces such as concrete, asphalt, or compacted gravel due to their interlocking designs. Playground tiles are commonly used in schools, daycare centers, parks, and residential play areas to create a safe surface for children to play on.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:16:20','2026-05-25 12:16:20'),(2966,'Floor Trim','floor-trim',2941,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:16:24','2026-05-25 12:16:24'),(2967,'Exercise & Sports Mats','exercise-sports-mats-1',2941,'Exercise and sports mats mitigate the impact on joints, reducing the risk of injuries during exercises, workouts, or sports activities. They also act as a protective layer, minimizing the impact of falls or accidental slips and contributing to a safer exercise environment. The mats are lightweight and portable and come in various sizes to suit different workout spaces. They are ideal for commercial gyms, yoga studios, and sports facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:16:27','2026-05-25 12:16:27'),(2968,'Construction Adhesives','construction-adhesives-2',2941,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:16:31','2026-05-25 12:16:31'),(2969,'Carpet','carpet',2941,'Commercial carpet tiles are a durable flooring solution that can withstand heavy-duty use. They are designed for easy installation and if a tile becomes damaged it is simple to replace the square without having to replace the whole carpet. Tiles can collect years of dirt and moisture which makes them ideal for areas with heavy foot traffic such as entryways, offices, and retail spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:16:34','2026-05-25 12:16:34'),(2970,'Pawling Entrance Mats','pawling-entrance-mats',2969,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:24:22','2026-05-25 12:24:22'),(2971,'Waterhog Carpet Tiles, Entrance Scraper/Wiper for Indoor','waterhog-carpet-tiles-entrance-scraperwiper-for-indoor',2969,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:24:28','2026-05-25 12:24:28'),(2972,'Heavy Duty Berber Carpet Tiles','heavy-duty-berber-carpet-tiles',2969,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:24:32','2026-05-25 12:24:32'),(2973,'Power Systems Exercise & Yoga Mats','power-systems-exercise-yoga-mats-1',2967,'Experience comfort and stability during your workout with Power Systems Exercise & Yoga Mats. Exercise mats feature a thick closed-cell foam structure that resists moisture and odor from sweat or spilled water bottles, and wipes clean with a cloth. The non-slip surface offers a firm grip that provides extra support for your joints and muscles. Additional features vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:27:29','2026-05-25 12:27:29'),(2974,'EZ Flex Sport Mats Wrestling & Martial Arts Mats','ez-flex-sport-mats-wrestling-martial-arts-mats-1',2967,'EZ Flex Sport Mats Wrestling & Martial Arts Mats allow you to set up, break down, move, and store competition mats with ease. These wrestling mats have a heavy duty vinyl surface with a durable foam base and are antimicrobial treated to prevent the spread of bodily bacteria. They provide excellent shock absorption and impact resistance, reducing injury risks during combat sports.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:27:33','2026-05-25 12:27:33'),(2975,'EZ Flex Sport Mats Cheerleading & Gymnastics Mats','ez-flex-sport-mats-cheerleading-gymnastics-mats-1',2967,'EZ Flex Sport Mats Cheerleading & Gymnastics Mats are designed to meet different skill levels and training needs. With a polyethylene foam build, these gymnastics mats deliver optimal cushioning and support during athletic activities. Our cheerleading mats have a lightweight and portable design, making them easy to transport and set up so you can practice anywhere. Thickness varies per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:27:35','2026-05-25 12:27:35'),(2976,'Aluminum Floor & Carpet Trim','aluminum-floor-carpet-trim',2966,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:28:46','2026-05-25 12:28:46'),(2977,'M-D Floor & Carpet Accessories','m-d-floor-carpet-accessories',2966,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:28:49','2026-05-25 12:28:49'),(2978,'Air Knives & Wipes','air-knives-wipes',618,'Air knives and wipes, essential pneumatic tools in industrial settings, deliver precise airflow for diverse applications. These tools are indispensable for tasks such as general cleaning, surface preparation, and contaminant removal using compressed air before subsequent processing. They offer efficient and controlled airflow, making them ideal for various industrial processes requiring cleanliness and precision.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:38:48','2026-05-25 12:38:48'),(2979,'Air Tools & Accessories','air-tools-accessories',618,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:45:51','2026-05-25 12:45:51'),(2980,'Playground Safety Tile','playground-safety-tile',2965,'Playground safety tiles offer a durable and reliable flooring surface for outdoor play areas. Shock-absorbing and slip-resistant rubber playground tiles are designed to reduce injuries and offer a comfortable walking surface. Tiles are easy to maintain and feature an interlocking design for simple installation without the need for adhesive. Color and size vary by product.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:47:17','2026-05-25 12:47:17'),(2981,'Guards, Protectors, & Railings','guards-protectors-railings-4',29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:49:59','2026-05-25 12:49:59'),(2982,'Bollards & Sleeves','bollards-sleeves',1222,'Our steel bollards for sale are durable vertical obstructions that safeguard pedestrian walkways, protect equipment, and delineate building perimeters. Cylindrical in shape and highly-visible, safety bollards and posts are designed to control or direct traffic, protect buildings, and delineate specific areas or danger zones. These protective bollards are capable of absorbing impacts from moving vehicles due to their durable steel construction. Bollard covers and sleeves provide a durable layer of protection against impacts, weathering, and wear.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:52:33','2026-05-25 12:52:33'),(2983,'Bollards & Posts','bollards-posts',2982,'Bollards and posts are robust safety solutions designed to protect both people and property in various environments. Bollards provide reliable safeguarding for pedestrian walkways, equipment, and building perimeters. Suitable for different applications and needs, safety bollards and posts provide accident prevention and guide vehicular traffic in commercial, industrial, and public spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:53:39','2026-05-25 12:53:39'),(2984,'Surface Mount Steel Bollards','surface-mount-steel-bollards',2983,'Surface mount bollards protects machinery, equipment, and other personnel from vehicular traffic. These bollard are made from heavy-duty steel and are available in both bright yellow and silver finishes for enhanced visibility. The surface mount design allows for easy installation on concrete or other flat surfaces, while the durable construction ensures maximum stability and security.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 12:58:14','2026-05-25 12:58:14'),(2985,'Square Rubber Flooring','square-rubber-flooring',2964,'Square rubber flooring is a versatile and practical floor solution for various commercial and industrial applications. With a raised square surface pattern, this rubber flooring increases traction and promotes safety. Flooring is made with abrasion-resistant raw materials to create an ultra-durable non-slip rubber surface. Mats are easy to clean and can be used in wet or dry areas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:00:28','2026-05-25 13:00:28'),(2986,'Rubber-Cal \"Block-Grip\" Rubber Stair Mats','rubber-cal-block-grip-rubber-stair-mats',2964,'Rubber-Cal \"Block-Grip\" rubber stair mats are designed to enhance traction on stairways in commercial and industrial settings. These stair mats feature a roll-up design for easy storage and a coin flooring texture that prevents slips and falls in damp, wet areas, improving the safety of garages, warehouses, plants, and more. Double-sided carpet tape makes installation easy.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:00:28','2026-05-25 13:00:28'),(2987,'Pro Tect Runner® Floor Protection','pro-tect-runner-floor-protection',2964,'Pro Tect Runner® offers reliable and versatile floor protection rolls that safeguard floors in high-traffic areas. Floor runners feature non-porous fabric with a rubber backing that allows surfaces to breathe while being protected against moisture and spills. Available in various sizes, these floor protection runners can preserve hardwood, tile, granite, marble, linoleum, and more',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:00:28','2026-05-25 13:00:28'),(2988,'Pro Tect Runner® Floor Protection','pro-tect-runner-floor-protection-1',2964,'Pro Tect Runner® offers reliable and versatile floor protection rolls that safeguard floors in high-traffic areas. Floor runners feature non-porous fabric with a rubber backing that allows surfaces to breathe while being protected against moisture and spills. Available in various sizes, these floor protection runners can preserve hardwood, tile, granite, marble, linoleum, and more',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:00:28','2026-05-25 13:00:28'),(2989,'Roppe Rubber Tiles','roppe-rubber-tiles',2964,'Roppe rubber tiles are a durable and versatile flooring solution that\'s suitable for a variety of flooring applications. Made with PVC-free rubber, these easy-to-maintain floor tiles resist scuffing, gouging, chemicals, and more. Rubber floor tiles are comfortable to walk on and enhance slip resistance when floors are wet. Various surface designs, colors, and sizes are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:00:28','2026-05-25 13:00:28'),(2990,'Roppe Rubber Tiles','roppe-rubber-tiles-1',2964,'Roppe rubber tiles are a durable and versatile flooring solution that\'s suitable for a variety of flooring applications. Made with PVC-free rubber, these easy-to-maintain floor tiles resist scuffing, gouging, chemicals, and more. Rubber floor tiles are comfortable to walk on and enhance slip resistance when floors are wet. Various surface designs, colors, and sizes are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:00:28','2026-05-25 13:00:28'),(2991,'Textured Rubber Flooring','textured-rubber-flooring',2964,'Textured rubber flooring provides superior slip resistance in commercial, industrial, athletic, and other settings. The rubber material of this textured flooring provides resistance to corrosion and long-lasting durability, even in high-traffic areas. Available in various sizes, this rubber flooring features a textured surface for comfort, user safety, and fall prevention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:00:31','2026-05-25 13:00:31'),(2992,'Rubber-Cal Fitness Equipment Mats','rubber-cal-fitness-equipment-mats',2964,'Rubber-Cat fitness equipment mats are heavy-duty protective solutions designed specifically for use on floors with gym equipment and other heavy machinery. Made with corrosion-resistant rubber, these fitness equipment mats absorb impact, reduce vibration, and withstand wear and tear to protect both floors and equipment. Rubber-Cal mats feature a textured surface for enhanced user safety.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:00:34','2026-05-25 13:00:34'),(2993,'Diamond Rubber Flooring','diamond-rubber-flooring',2964,'Diamond rubber flooring is a durable and slip-resistant flooring option that features a diamond plate pattern. Built for years of durability in demanding commercial and industrial settings, this diamond tread rubber flooring provides enhanced traction and helps trap moisture and debris. This flooring can be used in wet or dry areas and comes in various sizes, colors, and shapes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:00:38','2026-05-25 13:00:38'),(2994,'Recycled Rubber Interlocking Tiles','recycled-rubber-interlocking-tiles',2964,'Interlocking recycled rubber floor tiles offer a heavy-duty and eco-friendly surface protection solution for various commercial spaces. Designed to withstand high impact and abrasive applications, these interlocking rubber tiles are easy to install and available in a range of thicknesses with smooth or textured patterns. Recycled rubber reduces noise, absorbs shock, and contains vibrations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:01:21','2026-05-25 13:01:21'),(2995,'Rubber-Cal Rubber Runner Mats/Rolls','rubber-cal-rubber-runner-matsrolls',2964,'These rubber runner mats and rolls from Rubber-Cal offer a versatile and durable flooring solution for industrial and commercial settings. Made with durable and corrosion-resistant rubber, these Rubber-Cal mats are built to withstand heavy-duty wear and tear. Mats and rolls feature coin-grip, diamond-grip, and other textures to prevent slips and falls, enhancing user safety in high-traffic areas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:01:21','2026-05-25 13:01:21'),(2996,'Surface Mount Plastic Bollards','surface-mount-plastic-bollards',2983,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:02:14','2026-05-25 13:02:14'),(2997,'Corrugated Rubber Mats','corrugated-rubber-mats',2964,'Corrugated rubber mats are versatile floor coverings that provide surface protection and slip resistance. Featuring a high-traction corrugated design, these rubber mats help improve safety and prevent slips in high-traffic commercial or industrial areas. Corrugated rubber matting also traps dirt and moisture to keep the walking surface clean and safe. Mats can be used indoor and outdoor.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:07:20','2026-05-25 13:07:20'),(2998,'Rubber-Cal Elephant Bark Rubberized Flooring','rubber-cal-elephant-bark-rubberized-flooring',2964,'Rubber-Cal elephant bark rubberized flooring provides a resilient and versatile flooring option for gyms, play areas, classrooms, and similar settings. Elephant bark rubber flooring is designed to absorb impact and reduce vibration, and can withstand heavy-duty wear and tear. Rugged rubberized flooring comes in various colors and pre-cut lengths for easy installation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:07:20','2026-05-25 13:07:20'),(2999,'Rubber-Cal Elephant Bark Rubberized Flooring','rubber-cal-elephant-bark-rubberized-flooring-1',2964,'Rubber-Cal elephant bark rubberized flooring provides a resilient and versatile flooring option for gyms, play areas, classrooms, and similar settings. Elephant bark rubber flooring is designed to absorb impact and reduce vibration, and can withstand heavy-duty wear and tear. Rugged rubberized flooring comes in various colors and pre-cut lengths for easy installation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:07:20','2026-05-25 13:07:20'),(3000,'Rubber-Cal Elephant Bark Rubberized Flooring','rubber-cal-elephant-bark-rubberized-flooring-2',2964,'Rubber-Cal elephant bark rubberized flooring provides a resilient and versatile flooring option for gyms, play areas, classrooms, and similar settings. Elephant bark rubber flooring is designed to absorb impact and reduce vibration, and can withstand heavy-duty wear and tear. Rugged rubberized flooring comes in various colors and pre-cut lengths for easy installation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:07:22','2026-05-25 13:07:22'),(3001,'Grit Surface Aluminum Stair Treads - Standard Sizes','grit-surface-aluminum-stair-treads-standard-sizes',2963,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:11:13','2026-05-25 13:11:13'),(3002,'M-D Building Stair Treads & Edging','m-d-building-stair-treads-edging',2963,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:11:17','2026-05-25 13:11:17'),(3003,'Babcock-Davis® Stair Treads With Abrasive, Extruded & Type 319 Aluminum','babcock-davis-stair-treads-with-abrasive-extruded-type-319-aluminum',2963,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:11:20','2026-05-25 13:11:20'),(3004,'Stair Treads & Floor Tiles','stair-treads-floor-tiles',2963,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:11:23','2026-05-25 13:11:23'),(3005,'Roppe Stair Treads','roppe-stair-treads',2963,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:11:26','2026-05-25 13:11:26'),(3006,'M-D Building Adhesive Stair Treads, Heavy Duty','m-d-building-adhesive-stair-treads-heavy-duty',2962,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:16:27','2026-05-25 13:16:27'),(3007,'Ram Board Temporary Floor Protection','ram-board-temporary-floor-protection-1',2962,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:16:30','2026-05-25 13:16:30'),(3008,'Finished Floor Guard®','finished-floor-guard',2962,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:16:33','2026-05-25 13:16:33'),(3009,'Tack Mat Disposable Sheet Mats','tack-mat-disposable-sheet-mats',2962,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:16:36','2026-05-25 13:16:36'),(3010,'Carpet Protection & Floor Protection Film','carpet-protection-floor-protection-film',2962,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:16:39','2026-05-25 13:16:39'),(3011,'Poly-Craft Mask® Floor Protection','poly-craft-mask-floor-protection',2962,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:16:42','2026-05-25 13:16:42'),(3012,'Protective Window Film','protective-window-film',2962,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:16:45','2026-05-25 13:16:45'),(3013,'PVC Floor & Surface Protection','pvc-floor-surface-protection-1',2962,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:16:48','2026-05-25 13:16:48'),(3014,'Rebounding Safety Bollards','rebounding-safety-bollards',2983,'Rebounding Safety Bollards protect equipment and structures from impact damage. Made from heavy-duty steel, these surface-mounted bollard absorb energy upon impact and bounce back after contact. These bright, safety yellow bollards can be mounted in concrete or asphalt, making them an ideal addition to any warehouse or facility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:18:40','2026-05-25 13:18:40'),(3015,'Flexible Bollards','flexible-bollards',2983,'Flexible bollards are highly visible, flexible solutions for traffic control and pedestrian safety. These bollards have a bright yellow powder coated finish and stand at heights ranging from 30\'\' to 52\'\'. The spring-loaded designs allow them to bend under pressure and return to their original position, minimizing damage to both the bollard and the vehicle that made impact.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:19:19','2026-05-25 13:19:19'),(3016,'Flexible Bollards with Sign Posts','flexible-bollards-with-sign-posts',2983,'Flexible Bollards are impact-resistant parking spot markers designed to hold traffic or parking signs to help guide traffic safely in parking lots. These heavy-duty bollards are solid and stable to absorb impact, helping to eliminate cost and damage to parking lot surfaces and vehicles. Flexible bollards are available in various ground installations and feature reflective tape for visibility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:20:09','2026-05-25 13:20:09'),(3017,'Pour In Place Bollards','pour-in-place-bollards',2983,'Heavy duty steel bollards are constructed to be installed underground or into wet cement to allow for extra reinforcement. These steel bollards are finshed with a high visibility yellow powder coat and can be filled with concrete for added durability. Available in multiple heights and diameters, our bollards can be used in multiple industrial work environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:20:53','2026-05-25 13:20:53'),(3018,'Floor Stop Bollards','floor-stop-bollards',2983,'Floor Stop Bollards are an effective solution for controlling the flow of machinery and vehicles and preventing access to work areas. These heavy duty floor bollards are made of steel with included removeable caps to be filled with concrete, adding extra durability. Available in heights of 4-4/5\'\' and lengths ranging from 24\'\' to 38\'\', these bollards can fit in mutliple work settings and areas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:21:37','2026-05-25 13:21:37'),(3019,'Folding Bollards','folding-bollards',2983,'Folding bollard provide versatile solutions for controlling access to areas such as parking spaces or loading docks. These bollards are constructed of durable steel, with bright yellow and silver finishes that enhance their visibility. The 35-1/2\'\' and 42\'\' available heights provide a visible deterrent, while the fold-down feature allows for easy access to the area when necessary.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:22:19','2026-05-25 13:22:19'),(3020,'Concrete Bollards','concrete-bollards',2983,'Heavy-duty concrete bollards are ideal for industrial and commercial settings. Made of durable concrete, these are built to withstand harsh outdoor conditions in parking lots, walkways, and other areas. With a variety of heights and diameters available, these concrete bollards are a reliable and sturdy option.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:22:58','2026-05-25 13:22:58'),(3021,'Portable Bollards','portable-bollards',2983,'Portable bollards are temporary solutions for traffic control and safety management. These bollards feature a recycled rubber base that provides stability and secure placement. Available in multiple heights and diameters, these bollards are versatile and can be used for promotional efforts in addition to traffic control and pedestrian safety.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:23:38','2026-05-25 13:23:38'),(3022,'Offset Bollards','offset-bollards',2983,'Offset bollards are highly effective, versatile safety barriers that can be used in indoor or outdoor industrial and commercial environments. Constructed from heavy-duty steel, they are built to withstand heavy impact and harsh outdoor conditions. The curved bollard design allows for greater protection of machinery or valuable assets.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:24:45','2026-05-25 13:24:45'),(3023,'Automatic Retractable Bollards','automatic-retractable-bollards',2983,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:25:29','2026-05-25 13:25:29'),(3024,'Removable Mount Bollards','removable-mount-bollards',2983,'Removable mount bollards are ideal for controlling vehicular and pedestrian traffic, as well as protecting doorways and industrial equipment. The durable steel posts feature bright yellow and silver finishes for enhanced visibility. The base is made from heavy-duty steel and can be securely anchored to the ground.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:26:09','2026-05-25 13:26:09'),(3025,'Covers & Sleeves','covers-sleeves',2982,'Bollard Covers and sleeves are designed to fit seamlessly over bollards and posts, providing a durable layer of protection against impacts, weathering, and wear. Crafted from high-quality materials like polyethylene, bollard covers offer exceptional resistance to UV rays, chemicals, and harsh weather conditions, ensuring long-lasting performance. Bollard sleeves are ideal for managing traffic flow, enhancing safety in parking lots, or simply improving the appearance of any facility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:28:05','2026-05-25 13:28:05'),(3026,'Hoses & Connectors','hoses-connectors',618,'Hoses and connectors are essential parts of pneumatic systems that enable the seamless transfer of air and gases. Components include fittings and quick-connect couplings that are designed for durability and reliable performance under pressure. They maintain efficient air or gas flow within pneumatic systems and are used in various industries, such as manufacturing, construction, automotive, and machinery setups.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 13:28:07','2026-05-25 13:28:07'),(3027,'Smooth Bollard Post Sleeves','smooth-bollard-post-sleeves',3025,'Smooth Bollard Post Sleeves install over existing bollard posts to improve impact resistance, while reducing the cost and time spent on maintenance. These bollard covers are made of high density polyethylene with UV inhibitors for outdoor use and lasting durability. Sleeves have two reflective stripes for extra visibility. Various models are available for a secure fit around your posts.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 14:18:19','2026-05-25 14:18:19'),(3028,'Ribbed Bollard Post Sleeves','ribbed-bollard-post-sleeves',3025,'Ribbed Bollard Post Sleeves improve bollard visibility in high traffic areas where facility equipment needs to be protected from moving vehicles such as forklifts. They can also be used in outdoor environments where they can easily slide over existing bollards to minimimize maintenance. The rugged ribbed design of our bollard sleeves enhances strength for added protection against collisions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 15:11:51','2026-05-25 15:11:51'),(3029,'Soft Polyethylene Post Covers','soft-polyethylene-post-covers',3025,'Soft Polyethylene Post Covers reduce hazards and repair costs by protecting the bollards from scratches, abrasions, impacts, and corrosion. Made of 10 oz. polyethylene fabric with a reflective stripe, our plastic bollard covers offer lasting durability and high viability. The self adhesive straps allow for easy installation and removal, making covers ideal for temporary or movable applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 15:13:24','2026-05-25 15:13:24'),(3030,'Decorative Post Sleeves','decorative-post-sleeves',3025,'Decorative Post Sleeves are protective covers designed to fit easily and securely over existing bollards that provide traffic and pedestrian control. Made from durable polyethylene, these bollard sleeves offer long-lasting performance and require minimal upkeep. These decorative bollard covers are available in various distinctive finishes and sizes, and are easy to install.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 15:14:44','2026-05-25 15:14:44'),(3031,'Bollard Hardware','bollard-hardware',2982,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 15:17:02','2026-05-25 15:17:02'),(3032,'Caps & Covers for Bollards','caps-covers-for-bollards',3031,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 15:20:26','2026-05-25 15:20:26'),(3033,'Removable Bases for Steel Bollards','removable-bases-for-steel-bollards',3031,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 15:21:02','2026-05-25 15:21:02'),(3034,'Installation Foam for Bollard Post Sleeves','installation-foam-for-bollard-post-sleeves',3031,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 15:21:45','2026-05-25 15:21:45'),(3035,'Installation Foam for Bollard Post Sleeves','installation-foam-for-bollard-post-sleeves-1',3031,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 15:22:27','2026-05-25 15:22:27'),(3036,'Bases for Bollard Post Sleeves','bases-for-bollard-post-sleeves',3031,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 15:23:01','2026-05-25 15:23:01'),(3037,'Bracket Kits for Rebounding Bollards','bracket-kits-for-rebounding-bollards',3031,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 15:23:51','2026-05-25 15:23:51'),(3038,'Hardware for Automatic Bollards','hardware-for-automatic-bollards',3031,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 15:24:39','2026-05-25 15:24:39'),(3039,'Bollard Decals','bollard-decals',3031,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 15:25:27','2026-05-25 15:25:27'),(3040,'Bases & Fastener Kits for Flexible Bollards','bases-fastener-kits-for-flexible-bollards',3031,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 15:26:05','2026-05-25 15:26:05'),(3041,'Tile Spacers For Floor & Wall Tiles','tile-spacers-for-floor-wall-tiles',2961,'Tile spacers for floor and wall tiles ensure precise and consistent spacing during tile installation. Made with durable yet flexible PVC, these spacers for tile feature a wedge shape that creates uniform grout joints between ceramic, porcelain, stone, or marble tiles being installed on floors or walls. Designed for easy insertion and removal, these spacers streamline installations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 16:23:39','2026-05-25 16:23:39'),(3042,'Underlayments','underlayments',2960,'Underlayments are designed to provide an additional layer of support and protection for commercial and industrial flooring. Designed to reduce noise, absorb impact, and control climate, this underlayment flooring can safeguard concrete or wood subfloors. Floor underlayments are easy to install and are made with various durable materials, including foam, cork, fibers, and kraft paper.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-25 16:26:38','2026-05-25 16:26:38'),(3043,'ROPPE Rubber Fitness Flooring','roppe-rubber-fitness-flooring',2959,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:17:51','2026-05-29 11:17:51'),(3044,'Drive Medical Safetycare Floor Mats','drive-medical-safetycare-floor-mats',2959,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:17:54','2026-05-29 11:17:54'),(3045,'Vinyl Floor Coverings','vinyl-floor-coverings',2959,'Vinyl floor coverings are a versatile and durable flooring solution for garages, auto shops, and other industrial or commercial settings. Designed to provide protection and enhanced traction, these ultra-durable vinyl floor covers hide cracks and stains, reduce dirt tracked in from outdoors, and prevent deterioration. Vinyl floor coverings are easy to cut for a custom fit, install and maintain.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:17:57','2026-05-29 11:17:57'),(3046,'Anti-Fatigue Floor Tiles','anti-fatigue-floor-tiles',2959,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:18:00','2026-05-29 11:18:00'),(3047,'Vinyl Floor Coverings','vinyl-floor-coverings-1',2959,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:18:02','2026-05-29 11:18:02'),(3048,'Vinyl Wood Plank Flooring','vinyl-wood-plank-flooring',2959,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:18:05','2026-05-29 11:18:05'),(3049,'Vinyl Floor Tiles','vinyl-floor-tiles',2959,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:18:10','2026-05-29 11:18:10'),(3050,'ROPPE Recycled Rubber Tiles','roppe-recycled-rubber-tiles',2959,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:18:12','2026-05-29 11:18:12'),(3051,'Lock-Tile® PVC Floor Tiles With Duro-Xtreme® Technology','lock-tile-pvc-floor-tiles-with-duro-xtreme-technology',2959,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:18:15','2026-05-29 11:18:15'),(3052,'Roppe Rubber Tiles','roppe-rubber-tiles-2',2959,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:18:19','2026-05-29 11:18:19'),(3053,'M-D Building Wall Bases','m-d-building-wall-bases',2958,'Efficiently protect interior spaces with M-D Building Wall Bases. Construction from materials like vinyl are flexible and can withstand use in high-traffic areas. They are easy to install, making them a user-friendly option. These wall bases are versatile and can be used in various commercial and residential spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:21:13','2026-05-29 11:21:13'),(3054,'Rubber Wall Bases','rubber-wall-bases',2958,'Rubber wall bases are designed to protect walls from scuffs, marks, and other types of damage. Most models are made of heavy-duty rubber that won\'t chip or crack and are scratch and abrasion-resistant to ensure lasting durability. Wall bases are easy to install, and the ribbed backing helps them easily adhere to the wall. Ideal for any school, office space, or home.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:21:16','2026-05-29 11:21:16'),(3055,'Vinyl Wall Bases','vinyl-wall-bases',2958,'Vinyl Wall Bases provide superior protection to the base of walls. Vinyl construction is impact-resistant and durable enough to withstand daily wear and tear. Made with 10% pre-consumer waste, these eco-friendly wall bases contribute to the LEED Green Building Certification System. They are ideal for use in commercial and residential environments. Available in different color and size options.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:21:19','2026-05-29 11:21:19'),(3056,'Ground Protection Mats','ground-protection-mats',12,'Ground protection mats are designed to reduce damage to the ground when moving heavy equipment or when there is increased foot traffic. They are made from durable materials to ensure long lasting use, and have enhanced traction to reduce the risk of slipping. Ground protection mats can create temporary access roads, working platforms or parking areas making them ideal for use in the any construction or landscaping industry.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:29:50','2026-05-29 11:29:50'),(3057,'Ground Protection Mat Accessories','ground-protection-mat-accessories',3056,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:39:54','2026-05-29 11:39:54'),(3058,'Ideal Warehouse Innovations Recycled Rubber Track-Out Mats','ideal-warehouse-innovations-recycled-rubber-track-out-mats',3056,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:39:57','2026-05-29 11:39:57'),(3059,'Checkers Ground Protection Mats','checkers-ground-protection-mats',3056,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:40:00','2026-05-29 11:40:00'),(3060,'TrakMat Ground Protection Mats','trakmat-ground-protection-mats',3056,'TrakMat Ground Protection Mats provide reliable ground protection for high-traffic areas. Designed to safeguard sensitive surfaces, these heavy-duty ground protection mats offer easy installation and a strong, self-supporting surface. Constructed from robust materials, they ensure long-lasting durability in demanding environments. Ideal for underground work, landscaping, and construction projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:40:03','2026-05-29 11:40:03'),(3061,'Zigma Outdoor Ground Protection Mats','zigma-outdoor-ground-protection-mats',3056,'Zigma Outdoor Ground Protection Mats protect grass and turf from vehicles, equipment, events, and pedestrians. They provide a stable surface for vehicles and foot traffic in extreme outdoor conditions, with non-slip traction, water drainage channels, and UV resistance. These ground protection mats are easy-to-install and do not require nails or spikes for installation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:40:09','2026-05-29 11:40:09'),(3062,'VersaMATS® Ground Protection Mats','versamats-ground-protection-mats',3056,'VersaMATS® Ground Protection Mats preserve ground integrity in various settings. These mats provide a reliable surface that distributes weight evenly and prevents rutting or damage. Their lightweight yet sturdy construction ensures easy handling and long-lasting performance. These heavy-duty ground protection mats enable safe and efficient movement while minimizing the impact on the ground.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:40:13','2026-05-29 11:40:13'),(3063,'Outrigger/Crane Ground Protection Pads','outriggercrane-ground-protection-pads',3056,'Maximize job site safety and efficiency with our Outrigger/Crane Ground Protection Pads. Our pads provide durable strength and stability for heavy equipment with a rugged, low-profile design for optimal traction and high-visibility colors for safety. Ideal for utility works, cable laying, and demanding applications, these outrigger pads protect your operations and boost productivity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:40:17','2026-05-29 11:40:17'),(3064,'AlturnaMATS® Ground Protection Mats','alturnamats-ground-protection-mats',3056,'Protect your work area with AlturnaMATS® Ground Protection Mats. These heavy-duty mats withstand challenging terrains, providing ground surface for vehicles, machinery, and equipment. With rugged construction and high load-bearing capacity, they offer optimal traction and prevent soil damage. Easy to install, lightweight, and reusable, these ground protection mats are a durable solution.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:40:20','2026-05-29 11:40:20'),(3065,'Moulding & Millwork','moulding-millwork',12,'Whether you\'re embarking on a renovation project or constructing a new building, our comprehensive range of building supplies is designed to meet your needs. Explore our extensive collection of mouldings, including crown moulding, baseboards, chair rails, and more, available in various styles and finishes to add a touch of elegance and sophistication to any space. Additionally, discover our wide range of millwork products, such as doors, windows, columns, and stair parts, crafted with precision and durability in mind.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:46:24','2026-05-29 11:46:24'),(3066,'Wall Niches','wall-niches',3065,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:59:13','2026-05-29 11:59:13'),(3067,'Stair Brackets & Finials','stair-brackets-finials',3065,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:59:16','2026-05-29 11:59:16'),(3068,'Sconces & Shelves','sconces-shelves',3065,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:59:18','2026-05-29 11:59:18'),(3069,'Moulding','moulding',3065,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:59:21','2026-05-29 11:59:21'),(3070,'Gable Vents & Louvers','gable-vents-louvers',3065,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:59:24','2026-05-29 11:59:24'),(3071,'Decorative Columns','decorative-columns',3065,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:59:28','2026-05-29 11:59:28'),(3072,'Ceiling Medallions & Rings','ceiling-medallions-rings',3065,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:59:31','2026-05-29 11:59:31'),(3073,'Brackets & Corbels','brackets-corbels',3065,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:59:34','2026-05-29 11:59:34'),(3074,'Appliques & Onlays','appliques-onlays',3065,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 11:59:38','2026-05-29 11:59:38'),(3075,'Clearance Bars','clearance-bars',1222,'Clearance bars are safety devices designed to indicate and enforce height restrictions in areas with limited overhead clearance. They feature durable construction, highly visible colors, reflective surfaces, or warning labels to alert drivers and equipment operators of height limitations. Clearance bars contribute to the prevention of accidents and property damage caused by vehicles or equipment exceeding the specified height limitations, making them essential in parking facilities, drive-thru lanes, and loading docks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:09:40','2026-05-29 12:09:40'),(3076,'Clearance Bars','clearance-bars-1',3075,'Clearance bars prevent damage and protect vehicles in industrial settings from entering an area that does now allow tall equipment. High density polyethylene construction provides long lasting durability. Some models feature an adjustable bar length and bright yellow finish for high visibility. Clearance bars are offered in a variety of sizes. Hardware kits are also available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:10:59','2026-05-29 12:10:59'),(3077,'Clearance Bars with Graphics','clearance-bars-with-graphics',3075,'Clearance bars with graphics can provide important messages such as height measurements for added safety. The ultraviolet resistant and antistatic sleeve is durable and can withstand extreme temperatures. Clearance bars with graphics are available in many sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:11:47','2026-05-29 12:11:47'),(3078,'Alarm Clearance Bars','alarm-clearance-bars',3075,'Alarm Clearance Bars provide drivers with an effective visual and audible warning message to protect door frames, loading docks, infrastructure, and overhead walkways. Alarm bars can also be used to safeguard safety assets such as sprinkler systems, ventilation pipes, and more. These high-vis clearance bars feature an easy-to-install design and heavy-duty construction for long-lasting durability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:13:34','2026-05-29 12:13:34'),(3079,'Clearance Bar Lettering Kits','clearance-bar-lettering-kits',3075,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:14:14','2026-05-29 12:14:14'),(3080,'Column Protectors','column-protectors',1222,'Column protectors are crucial for safeguarding structural columns in industrial spaces. They act as a barrier to absorb impact and prevent damage caused by collisions from forklifts, vehicles, or other moveable machinery. Column protectors are constructed from durable materials, ensuring long-lasting protection for columns and reducing the need for costly repairs. Column protectors are bright yellow to ensure high visibility and reduce collisions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:15:21','2026-05-29 12:15:21'),(3081,'Column Protectors for Round or Square Columns','column-protectors-for-round-or-square-columns',3080,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:16:02','2026-05-29 12:16:02'),(3082,'Column Protectors for Square Columns','column-protectors-for-square-columns',3080,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:16:40','2026-05-29 12:16:40'),(3083,'Column Protectors for Round Columns','column-protectors-for-round-columns',3080,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:17:16','2026-05-29 12:17:16'),(3084,'Column Wrap Protectors','column-wrap-protectors',3080,'Column Wrap Protectors reduce maintenance and prevent costly damage. Column Wraps are made of thick HDPE thermoplastic for long-lasting durability and are a cost-effective alternative to stainless steel options. Our plastic column protectors are waterproof, chemical-resistant, and non-conductive. No hardware or adhesive needed for installation. Available in high visibility yellow.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:18:10','2026-05-29 12:18:10'),(3085,'Light Pole Base Guards','light-pole-base-guards',3080,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:18:53','2026-05-29 12:18:53'),(3086,'Column Protector for H & I-Beams','column-protector-for-h-i-beams',3080,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:19:38','2026-05-29 12:19:38'),(3087,'Corner Column Protectors','corner-column-protectors',3080,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:20:23','2026-05-29 12:20:23'),(3088,'Ekena Left & Right Onlays','ekena-left-right-onlays',3074,'Ekena left and right onlays are crafted after traditional and historical designs. The polyurethane construction of most units will not crack or rot and provides long lasting durability. Onlays come primed and ready to be painted or stained. Wide selection of right and left onlays are available. Designs, size and other specific features vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:20:58','2026-05-29 12:20:58'),(3089,'Ekena Rosettes - Urethane','ekena-rosettes-urethane',3074,'Ekena rosettes have a sturdy urethane construction that provides lasting durability and strength. Each piece comes factory primed and ready for paint. Urethane rosettes are ideal accent pieces for a variety of applications and are simple to install. Dimensions and other specific features vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:21:01','2026-05-29 12:21:01'),(3090,'Gantry & Jib Column Protectors','gantry-jib-column-protectors',3080,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:21:03','2026-05-29 12:21:03'),(3091,'Ekena Drop & Swag Onlays','ekena-drop-swag-onlays',3074,'Ekena drop and swag onlays are used to accent mantels, ceilings amd more. Patterns are carefully crafted after traditional and historical designs and the pieces come ready for paint, stain, gel finish, and more. Heavy-duty materials such as urethane and lindenwood ensure lasting strength and durability. Swag onlays are easy to install and available in various styles.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:21:05','2026-05-29 12:21:05'),(3092,'Ekena Rosettes - Alder','ekena-rosettes-alder',3074,'Ekena alder rosettes are accent pieces for fireplace mantels, cabinetry, ceilings, furniture, and more. The alder construction is sturdy and provides lasting durability and strength. Rosettes are easy to install and come ready for painting or staining. Various shapes including star and oval rosettes are available. Other features vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:21:08','2026-05-29 12:21:08'),(3093,'Ekena Rosettes - Maple & Rubberwood','ekena-rosettes-maple-rubberwood',3074,'Rubberwood and maple rosettes can accent a wide variety of spaces. The sturdy construction provides long-lasting durability and dependability. Most pieces can be easily installed with simple glues and finish nails. Each Ekena rosette is carved with various patterns and is ready to be painted or stained. Many sizes and styles are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:21:12','2026-05-29 12:21:12'),(3094,'Ekena Rosettes - Cherry & Lindenwood','ekena-rosettes-cherry-lindenwood',3074,'Ekena rosettes are sturdy accent pieces designed for mantels, cabinets, and ceilings. Lindenwood and cherry rosettes are carefully carved and crafted after traditional and historical designs. These pieces are easy to install and have a long-lasting durable construction. Many sizes and styles of rosettes are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:21:46','2026-05-29 12:21:46'),(3095,'Ekena Appliques & Onlays','ekena-appliques-onlays',3074,'Ekena appliques and onlays are ideal accent pieces for any room. Center onlays are available in a wide variety of styles. The sturdy urethane construction provides lasting durability, and the pieces will not rot or crack. Most models are easy to install and come prepared for paints or stains. A wide selection of appliques and onlays are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:21:46','2026-05-29 12:21:46'),(3096,'Bumper Wrapping','bumper-wrapping',3080,'Our durable Bumper Wrap is made with extruded, flexible PVC vinyl that can be cut to any size, length or shape. Bumper wrap protection is ideal for safeguarding concrete light poles, railings, and columns. Our protective bumper wrap is sold in a black and yellow striped color for visibility. Bumper wrapping is easy to install using heavy duty cable ties or poly strapping that are sold separately.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:22:05','2026-05-29 12:22:05'),(3097,'Dock Bumpers','dock-bumpers-1',1222,'Dock bumpers are durable protective components that prevent loading docks from damage caused by impact while increasing the longevity of the loading dock. Dock bumpers cushion contact with trucks, containers and carts to prevent costly damage. They are made from durable materials like molded and extruded rubber, with some models featuring steel faces for added protection. Dock bumpers are used in shipping facilities, warehouses, and other logistics management locations that utilize high-traffic loading docks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:23:11','2026-05-29 12:23:11'),(3098,'Heavy-Duty Loading Dock Bumpers','heavy-duty-loading-dock-bumpers',3097,'Heavy-duty loading dock bumpers protect docks from vehicle impact. They are made of heavy-duty rubber allowing them to absorb 80% of the impact force, making them ideal for long-term outdoor use. Our loading dock bumpers feature pre-drilled anchor bolt holes allowing for quick installation, and are available in a variety of sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:23:50','2026-05-29 12:23:50'),(3099,'Extruded Rubber Fender Bumpers','extruded-rubber-fender-bumpers',3097,'Protect walls, buildings and other structures with extruded rubber fender bumpers. These bumpers have a weather and abrasion resistant construction, and feature a half-oval design that provides effective protection over a wide radius. These rubber fender bumpers can be installed horizontally or vertically depending on your needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:25:02','2026-05-29 12:25:02'),(3100,'Steel-Faced Loading Dock Bumpers','steel-faced-loading-dock-bumpers',3097,'Steel-faced loading dock bumpers offer optimal protection for docking areas where excessive friction occurs. They feature a scratch resistant steel face, and a heavy-duty laminated rubber base for peak impact absorption. These steel faced loading dock bumpers come with pre-drilled mounting holes and are available in a variety of sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:25:42','2026-05-29 12:25:42'),(3101,'Specialty Molded Dock Bumpers','specialty-molded-dock-bumpers',3097,'Specialty molded dock bumpers are the ideal choice for reinforcing your truck beds and loading docks. These bumpers are constructed of highly durable materials that will be long lasting and ideal for many applications. Our specialty molded dock bumpers feature pre-drilled mounting holes for easy installation and are available in a variety of shapes and sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:26:28','2026-05-29 12:26:28'),(3102,'Laminated Dock Bumpers','laminated-dock-bumpers',3097,'Laminated dock bumpers absorb 80% of impact force to protect structures from damage. Dock bumpers are constructed of truck tire material making them ideal for docks, warehouses, loading bays and more. Our laminated dock bumpers are available in a variety of sizes to fit your specific needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:27:19','2026-05-29 12:27:19'),(3103,'Weld One-Side Dock Bumpers','weld-one-side-dock-bumpers',3097,'Weld one-side dock bumpers absorb more shock than conventional bumpers. These bumpers can be used as rub rails for wall protection and are ideal for loading docks in factories and warehouses. These loading dock bumpers are constructed of heavy duty rubber, providing long lasting durability. They come equipped with pre-drilled holes for easy installation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:28:31','2026-05-29 12:28:31'),(3104,'Trailer & Crane Bumpers','trailer-crane-bumpers',3097,'Crane and trailer bumpers provide impact protection for warehouses, and construction sites from vehicles, cranes, and other material handling equipment. These rubber trailer bumpers are made of durable materials allowing them to withstand weather damage, making them ideal in indoor and outdoor environments. Bumpers feature pre-drilled mounting holes for easy installation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:31:02','2026-05-29 12:31:02'),(3105,'Extruded Rubber Bumper Stops','extruded-rubber-bumper-stops',3097,'Extruded rubber bumper stops are great for protecting equipment and facilities when vehicles are parked next to them. They are made of high impact-resistant rubber, making them highly durable in outdoor applications. These rubber bumper stops can be used vertically or horizontally depending on your needs, and feature pre-drilled holes for installation using anchor bolts.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:31:50','2026-05-29 12:31:50'),(3106,'Dock Door Guards','dock-door-guards',1222,'Dock door guards prevent accidental collisions with swinging doors, reducing the risk of injury to employees and visitors in industrial and commercial environments. They are designed with high-visibility colors and reflective stripes reducing the likelihood of collisions and accidents. The door guards are constructed from steel, ensuring durability and long-term protection. They are ideal for use in manufacturing plants, warehouses, and production facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:32:51','2026-05-29 12:32:51'),(3107,'Door Track Protectors','door-track-protectors',3106,'Door track protectors improve plant safety and efficiency by reducing insurance claims and building repairs due to accidental collisions. Some models feature a chamfered edge that reduces the risk of hand injury when lowering a door. Door track protectors are available in many sizes and come with pre-drilled holes in the base plates for easy installation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:33:36','2026-05-29 12:33:36'),(3108,'Ekena Corbels - Adler, Red Oak & Walnut','ekena-corbels-adler-red-oak-walnut',3073,'Wooden carved corbels are ideal accent pieces for a wide variety of spaces. The alder, red oak, or walnut corbels will provide lasting durability and the units are easy to install. These corbels come fully sanded and ready for paints or stains to match any room decor',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:34:10','2026-05-29 12:34:10'),(3109,'Ekena Corbels - Lindenwood, Mahogany, Rubberwood & Maple','ekena-corbels-lindenwood-mahogany-rubberwood-maple',3073,'Ekena corbels are carved from lindenwood, mahogany, rubberwood, or maple and are made for lasting durability. These corbels ship fully sanded and are ready to be stained or painted. Corbels are available in various sizes and styles to best meet the needs of different spaces. Weight capacity and other features vary per unit.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:34:12','2026-05-29 12:34:12'),(3110,'Ekena Brackets - Cold Rolled Steel','ekena-brackets-cold-rolled-steel',3073,'Ekena brackets are designed to provide support for countertops, mantels, shelving, and more. The cold-rolled steel construction provides lasting durability and dependability. Ekena steel brackets feature pre-drilled holes for easy installation. Steel brackets are available in various sizes and styles to best meet the needs of any space.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:34:15','2026-05-29 12:34:15'),(3111,'Folding Dock Door Guard','folding-dock-door-guard',3106,'Folding Dock Door Guards shield door tracks, pallets, and forklifts from impacts and are ideal for warehouses and service facilities. The folding design offers versatile protection for doors in both up and down positions. These door guards feature a steel frame with a modular design that allows for numerous configuration possibilities. Easy installation with a stable base and mounting holes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:34:17','2026-05-29 12:34:17'),(3112,'Ekena Brackets - Urethane','ekena-brackets-urethane',3073,'Urethane brackets are ideal for kitchens, bathrooms, entryways, and many other applications. The high-density urethane won\'t rot or crack and provides lasting durability and dependability. Brackets come with a factory prime and are ready to be painted or stained. A wide variety of styles are available to meet any room decor.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:34:19','2026-05-29 12:34:19'),(3113,'Ekena Corbels - Urethane','ekena-corbels-urethane',3073,'Ekena corbels are made of high-density urethane for long-lasting durability and dependability. The sturdy construction ensures the units won\'t split, rot, or crack making them ideal for indoor or outdoor applications. Corbels come fully sanded and ready for paints or stains. The wide variety of available styles is sure to match any room decor.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:34:22','2026-05-29 12:34:22'),(3114,'Ekena Brackets - Stainless Steel','ekena-brackets-stainless-steel',3073,'Ekena stainless steel brackets provide support and are suitable for a variety of room environments. The stainless steel construction is corrosive-resistant and will provide long-lasting durability and dependability. Ekena brackets have pre-drilled holes that allow for easy installation. Available in various styles and sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:34:41','2026-05-29 12:34:41'),(3115,'Overhead Door Guards','overhead-door-guards',3106,'Overhead Door Guards protect doors from costly repairs. Made of steel posts and a steel pipe crossbar, they are easy to install without welding or painting. Suitable for distribution centers, clean rooms, and other industrial enviroments. Overhead Door Guards are durable and prevent forklift accidents. Tubular steel uprights can be anchored to concrete floors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:34:55','2026-05-29 12:34:55'),(3116,'Dock Shelter Guard Posts','dock-shelter-guard-posts',3106,'Dock shelter guard posts ensure maximum protection for personnel and vehicles where your deliveries are made to your manufacturing or production facility. Made of heavy-duty steel with collapsible rubberized panels, they offer easy access. With a wide base for stability and customization options, they withstand heavy-duty applications. They are reliable and easy to install.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 12:35:34','2026-05-29 12:35:34'),(3117,'Ekena Ceiling Rings - Urethane','ekena-ceiling-rings-urethane',3072,'Ekena ceiling rings can be used in conjunction with ceiling medallions to highlight focal points such as chandeliers and fans. The high-density urethane construction provides lasting durability and dependability. These versatile rings can also be used on walls to accent mirrors or photo frames. Various designs and sizes are available to best complement your space.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:38:52','2026-05-29 12:38:52'),(3118,'Ekena Ceiling Domes','ekena-ceiling-domes',3072,'Ekena ceiling domes feature a wide selection of designs ranging from floral motifs to crisp molding. Units come factory primed and ready for paint or faux finish to match the decor of any room. Most ceiling domes have a urethane foam construction which makes them durable, lightweight, and easy to install. Various sizes are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:38:56','2026-05-29 12:38:56'),(3119,'Ekena Ceiling Medallions - Wood, Cherry, Maple & Red Oak','ekena-ceiling-medallions-wood-cherry-maple-red-oak',3072,'Wooden Ekena ceiling medallions are carved by master carvers and are designed to complement a wide selection of room decor. Most units are made from cherry, maple, and red oak woods which ensures lasting durability. Wood ceiling medallions ship fully sanded and ready for stain or paint. Many styles are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:38:58','2026-05-29 12:38:58'),(3120,'Ekena Ceiling Medallions - Urethane','ekena-ceiling-medallions-urethane',3072,'Ekena ceiling medallions provide a detailed focal piece that is perfect for a wide variety of spaces. The high-density urethane construction is ideal for indoor or outdoor applications and ensures lasting durability. Ceiling medallions are modeled after various historical patterns and designs and are available in many styles and sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:39:02','2026-05-29 12:39:02'),(3121,'Ekena Ekena - Capitals, Columns & Bases','ekena-ekena-capitals-columns-bases',3071,'Ekena capitals, columns, and bases provide the finishing touches to a variety of renovations. These pieces are made from heavy duty materials such as rubberwood and urethane to ensure lasting durability. Most decorative columns and capitals are modeled after historical patterns. Odessa, Southampton, and Corinthian capitals are all available. Specific features vary per unit.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:40:14','2026-05-29 12:40:14'),(3122,'Ekena Gable Vents & Louvers - Round & Oval','ekena-gable-vents-louvers-round-oval',3070,'Ekena gable vents & louvers are round or oval-shaped and made for lasting durability. The heavy-duty urethane construction provides lasting dependability and strength. The material can withstand a wide range of temperatures making them ideal for any environment. Various gable louvers and vents are available. Size and other features may vary per unit.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:42:12','2026-05-29 12:42:12'),(3123,'Ekena Gable Vents & Louvers - Octagon, Peaked, Triangle & Vertical','ekena-gable-vents-louvers-octagon-peaked-triangle-vertical',3070,'These Ekena gable vents & louvers feature octagon, peaked, triangle, and vertical designs. Both decorative and functional, most of these models feature a urethane construction that provides lasting durability and strength. The material is temperature resistant and can withstand a variety of environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:42:37','2026-05-29 12:42:37'),(3124,'Panel Moulding','panel-moulding',3069,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:46:06','2026-05-29 12:46:06'),(3125,'Crown','crown',3069,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:46:09','2026-05-29 12:46:09'),(3126,'Baseboard','baseboard',3069,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:46:12','2026-05-29 12:46:12'),(3127,'Door & Window Trim','door-window-trim',3069,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:46:16','2026-05-29 12:46:16'),(3128,'Ekena Pilasters & Casings','ekena-pilasters-casings',3127,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:48:46','2026-05-29 12:48:46'),(3129,'Ekena Plinth Blocks For Window Treatments','ekena-plinth-blocks-for-window-treatments',3127,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:48:49','2026-05-29 12:48:49'),(3130,'Ekena 7\" Traditional Window & Door Crossheads W/Bottom Trims','ekena-7-traditional-window-door-crossheads-wbottom-trims',3127,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:48:54','2026-05-29 12:48:54'),(3131,'Ekena Chair Rail Moulding','ekena-chair-rail-moulding',3127,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:48:57','2026-05-29 12:48:57'),(3132,'Decorative Aluminum Moulding','decorative-aluminum-moulding',3127,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:49:00','2026-05-29 12:49:00'),(3133,'Ekena Baseboard Moulding','ekena-baseboard-moulding',3126,'Ekena baseboard moulding is designed to elevate the visual appeal of any commercial space. Made from high-quality materials, these mouldings offer durability and timeless design. With various styles, sizes, and finishes, you can find the perfect baseboard moulding to complement your decor. Easy to install and maintain, Ekena Baseboard Moulding adds architectural detail to any room.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 12:51:08','2026-05-29 12:51:08'),(3134,'Ekena Outside Corner For Moulding','ekena-outside-corner-for-moulding',3125,'Ekena outside corners for moulding are convenient solutions designed to simplify crown moulding installations. Made with high-density urethane for long-lasting durability, these outside corners are primed and come ready to be painted or finished. Ekena outside corners are available in various sizes, styles, and colors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 13:14:51','2026-05-29 13:14:51'),(3135,'Ekena Inside Corner For Moulding','ekena-inside-corner-for-moulding',3125,'These Ekena inside corners for moulding offer flexibility for various installation jobs. Designed to complement Ekena crown moulding profiles, these inside corners ensure a seamless, professional finish. Made with high-quality materials, they offer durability and precision. Easy to install, these inside corners provide a protective finish for any moulding projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 13:14:54','2026-05-29 13:14:54'),(3136,'Ekena Universal Couplings For Molding Profiles','ekena-universal-couplings-for-molding-profiles',3125,'These universal couplings for crown moulding profiles are designed to simplify the installation process. Manufactured by Ekena, these high-quality couplings seamlessly connect different crown moulding profiles, enabling custom and intricate designs. These universal couplings are made with high-density urethane and come primed and ready for paint or finish. Various styles and colors are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 13:14:57','2026-05-29 13:14:57'),(3137,'Ekena Crown Moulding - Urethane','ekena-crown-moulding-urethane',3125,'This crown moulding from Ekena is made of urethane, offering a durable, cost-effective alternative to plaster moulding. With high-density urethane construction, this moulding offers a water-resistant design that won\'t crack or rot, making it ideal for bathroom and kitchen applications. This moulding has a realistic woodgrain texture and is pre-primed for convenience.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-05-29 13:15:01','2026-05-29 13:15:01'),(3138,'Dock Downspout Guards','dock-downspout-guards',3106,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 13:32:31','2026-05-29 13:32:31'),(3139,'Floor Curbs','floor-curbs',1222,'Floor Curbs are designed to help keep racks, machinery, and other warehouse equipment safe from damage, abrasion, or impact caused by forklifts or other industrial vehicles. Floor safety curbs are constructed from heavy-duty steel for reliable protection and long-lasting strength, and they can be bolted directly into the ground for fixed positioning. Steel floor curbs are available in straight sections, as well as angled sections at 45 and 90 degrees. For comprehensive security, they feature a bright yellow color for high visibility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 13:33:24','2026-05-29 13:33:24'),(3140,'Straight Floor Curbs','straight-floor-curbs',3139,'With a bright yellow color for high visibility, Straight Floor Curbs help keep warehouse racks, fixtures, and machinery safe against impacts caused by forklifts and other industrial vehicles. Available in a variety of thicknesses, safety curbs are crafted from heavy-duty steel for lasting strength, and the straight design makes it easy to safeguard the front and sides of structures.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-05-29 14:09:50','2026-05-29 14:09:50'),(3141,'Ekena Sconces & Shelves','ekena-sconces-shelves',3068,'Ekena sconces and shelves are ideal accent pieces for homes, hotels, and more. Most pieces have a durable urethane construction and are easy to install. Sconces and shelves are available in many different styles to fit a variety of environments. Dimensions and other specific features vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:16:58','2026-06-02 10:16:58'),(3142,'Ekena Stair Brackets','ekena-stair-brackets',3067,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:20:41','2026-06-02 10:20:41'),(3143,'Ekena Finials','ekena-finials',3067,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:20:45','2026-06-02 10:20:45'),(3144,'Brass Short Rail Components','brass-short-rail-components',3067,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:20:48','2026-06-02 10:20:48'),(3145,'Ekena Wall Niches & Accessories','ekena-wall-niches-accessories',3066,'Ekena wall niches can be used in hotels, lodges, residences, more. Most wall niches are made of a durable urethane material and can be installed quickly and easily on most surfaces. Size, style, and other specific features vary per model. Niche shelves are also available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:22:05','2026-06-02 10:22:05'),(3146,'Painting Supplies','painting-supplies',12,'We offer various building supplies to meet your painting needs, including brushes, rollers, sprayers, paint trays, drop cloths, and more. Our painting supplies are made from high-quality materials to ensure durability and long-lasting use. Whether you\'re a professional painter or a DIY enthusiast, our painting supplies will help you achieve a perfect finish every time. We also offer a variety of paint types, including latex, oil-based, enamel, and specialty paints, as well as spray paint, striping paint, and marking paint, to suit your specific needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:25:02','2026-06-02 10:25:02'),(3147,'Brushes, Rollers & Tools','brushes-rollers-tools',3146,'Paint brushes, rollers, and tools are essential for achieving a smooth and even finish when applying paint and coatings. Offering includes sprayers, trays, extension poles, bucket grids, and more, to suit different painting needs. They are comfortable to grip and easy to clean. Paint supplies can be used for residential and commercial painting, construction sites, industrial facilities, and home improvement projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:26:24','2026-06-02 10:26:24'),(3148,'Extension Poles','extension-poles',3147,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:32:38','2026-06-02 10:32:38'),(3149,'Bucket Grids','bucket-grids',3147,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:32:41','2026-06-02 10:32:41'),(3150,'Roller Frames','roller-frames',3147,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:32:45','2026-06-02 10:32:45'),(3151,'Paint Trays','paint-trays',3147,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:32:49','2026-06-02 10:32:49'),(3152,'Roller Kits','roller-kits',3147,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:32:51','2026-06-02 10:32:51'),(3153,'Paintbrushes & Pads','paintbrushes-pads',3147,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:32:55','2026-06-02 10:32:55'),(3154,'Paint Sprayers','paint-sprayers',3147,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:32:58','2026-06-02 10:32:58'),(3155,'Roller Covers','roller-covers',3147,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:33:01','2026-06-02 10:33:01'),(3156,'Roller & Paint Tray Sets','roller-paint-tray-sets',3155,'Roller & Paint Tray Sets include a high-quality roller, paint tray, and liner for efficient painting. The roller features a comfortable handle and durable cover for smooth and even paint application while the deep-well paint tray helps reduce spills',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:35:48','2026-06-02 10:35:48');
INSERT INTO `categories` VALUES (3157,'Roller Frames with Roller Covers','roller-frames-with-roller-covers',3155,'These durable roller frames and high-quality covers are designed for easy attachment and excellent control, and feature a unique grip handle and adjustable extension pole. Roller frames and covers are available in various styles and sizes',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:35:50','2026-06-02 10:35:50'),(3158,'Painter Roller Covers','painter-roller-covers',3155,'Paint roller covers ensure smooth and even paint coverage on various surfaces. They\'re available in different lengths and styles, including foam, shed-resistant, and high-density options to meet specific painting needs. Ideal for interior, drywall, and trim jobs, these roller covers provide excellent paint pickup and release.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:35:53','2026-06-02 10:35:53'),(3159,'Spray Gun Accessories','spray-gun-accessories',3154,'Our selection of spray gun accessories includes products designed to enhance the functionality of air tool spray guns. From nozzle tips to extension poles and cleaning kits, these professional-grade accessories optimize performance and streamline painting tasks. High-quality hoses, cups, guns, filters, and regulators ensure exceptional results and superior painting efficiency on various surfaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:38:37','2026-06-02 10:38:37'),(3160,'Pressure Pots','pressure-pots',3154,'Pressure pots improve efficiency and precision in large-scale paint spraying applications. Designed to hold and pressurize paint, these pots ensure a consistent flow. With durable construction and user-friendly features, pressure pot paint sprayers offer reliable performance and ease of use. They are available in a range of capacities to meet your specific painting requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:38:40','2026-06-02 10:38:40'),(3161,'Spray Guns','spray-guns',3154,'Spray guns are a convenient and efficient painting solution for professional applications. Designed to provide precise coverage on diverse surfaces, these guns offer exceptional control. With adjustable settings and ergonomic design, spray paint guns ensure efficient and comfortable use. Spray guns are available in various styles, and have a range of gun size, tip size, and nozzle options.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:38:44','2026-06-02 10:38:44'),(3162,'Paint Brushes','paint-brushes',3153,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:45:23','2026-06-02 10:45:23'),(3163,'Painter Roller Covers','painter-roller-covers-1',3152,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:46:31','2026-06-02 10:46:31'),(3164,'Rollers & Paint Trays','rollers-paint-trays',3152,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:46:34','2026-06-02 10:46:34'),(3165,'Paint Trays','paint-trays-1',3151,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:47:36','2026-06-02 10:47:36'),(3166,'Roller Frames','roller-frames-1',3150,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:48:38','2026-06-02 10:48:38'),(3167,'Bucket Grids','bucket-grids-1',3149,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:50:00','2026-06-02 10:50:00'),(3168,'Roller Extension Poles','roller-extension-poles',3148,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:50:52','2026-06-02 10:50:52'),(3169,'Striping & Marking Paints','striping-marking-paints',3146,'Striping and marking paints are specialized coatings designed to create clear and durable markings on various surfaces. They are formulated with high-quality pigments to ensure visibility, longevity, and resistance to weathering. Striping and marking paints come in convenient aerosol cans or larger containers for use with striping machines, making the application process efficient and precise. They are ideal for demarcating parking lots, roadways, warehouses, athletic fields, and construction sites.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:54:53','2026-06-02 10:54:53'),(3170,'Spray Paint','spray-paint',3146,'Spray paint is ideal for any small paint job and to mark or label different items in a workspace. It typically is quick to dry and designed to withstand harsh conditions for long lasting dependability. Spray paint is commonly used in construction sites, manufacturing facilities, and other industrial applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:54:56','2026-06-02 10:54:56'),(3171,'Specialty Coatings','specialty-coatings-1',3146,'Specialty coatings offer advanced protection and performance enhancements for various surfaces, including roofs and floors. With features like water resistance and durability, specialty coatings ensure long-lasting surface integrity in challenging environments. Ideal for industrial facilities, commercial buildings, and residential properties, coatings provide reliable protection against weathering, corrosion, and wear, prolonging the lifespan of structures and reducing maintenance costs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:54:59','2026-06-02 10:54:59'),(3172,'Paint & Primer','paint-primer',3146,'Paint and primer serve as a protective layer, shielding surfaces from environmental elements, moisture, and UV rays, preventing damage and deterioration. They also enhance the visual appeal of interiors and exteriors with an extensive palette of colors, finishes, and textures, allowing for creative expression and customization. The paints and primers are ideal for various applications, including commercial spaces, offices, and retail environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:55:03','2026-06-02 10:55:03'),(3173,'Line Striping & Marking Machines','line-striping-marking-machines',3146,'Striping and marking machines provide a systematic and professional means of applying lines, stripes, and markings on surfaces. The machines are equipped with generous paint reservoirs to reduce the need for frequent refilling, enabling uninterrupted line striping over larger areas. Whether for safety markings, traffic control, sports field layout, or facility organization, the machines offer a reliable solution for achieving precise and defined lines with speed and accuracy.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:55:06','2026-06-02 10:55:06'),(3174,'Accessories for Striping & Marking Machines','accessories-for-striping-marking-machines',3173,'Explore Striping & Marking Machine accessories, such as extra nozzles and tips, hopper lids, power conversion kits, hoses, stands, paint cups, and more, to help keep your machines running smoothly and safely. Choose from trusted brands to find the perfect accessory for your striping and marking needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:57:12','2026-06-02 10:57:12'),(3175,'Striping & Marking Machines','striping-marking-machines',3173,'Striping & Marking Machines are used to mark paint lines in parking lots, warehouses, construction and landscaping applications. These machines offer convenient long steel arms to relieve pressure and strain on your back, and a trigger for easy spray operation. With these machines, line striping and marking become quick and easy.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 10:57:16','2026-06-02 10:57:16'),(3176,'Stains and Sealants','stains-and-sealants',3172,'Protect against moisture and weathering while showcasing the natural grain of the wood with Stains and Sealants. Specially formulated for superior coverage and performance, these paint sealants repel water and resist scuffs and fading for long lasting durability on surfaces. Our wood stains feature UV reflectors that prevent graying and sun damage. Choose from a range of colors and finishes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 11:09:36','2026-06-02 11:09:36'),(3177,'Rust Preventative','rust-preventative',3172,'Rust Preventative Paint features a Direct-to-Metal (DTM) coating that provides metal surfaces with protection against weathering, fading, and corrosion. Our rust preventive paint has good leveling properties with excellent coverage to allow brush strokes to create a smooth, even finish. Choose from various colors, finishes, and sizes to enhance the protection and appearance of your metal surfaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 11:09:39','2026-06-02 11:09:39'),(3178,'General Purpose Paints','general-purpose-paints',3172,'General Purpose Paints are ideal for various industrial applications from interior and exterior painting to rust protection. With a quick drying formula, our all purpose paint allows the application of multiple coats in one day. The low VOC offers enhanced protection from fumes. Resistant to cracking, chipping, and fading for added reliability. Sold in a variety of colors, finishes, and sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 11:09:42','2026-06-02 11:09:42'),(3179,'Roof Coatings','roof-coatings',3171,'These roof coatings provide enhanced protection to increase the lifespan of roofs. The products that make up our wide variety of liquid roof coatings are designed to shield roof materials from harsh weather, UV rays, temperature fluctuations, and other outdoor elements that can cause wear and tear. Choose from co-polymer or acrylic topcoats, sealants, liquid rubber roof coatings, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 11:15:06','2026-06-02 11:15:06'),(3180,'Stains and Sealants','stains-and-sealants-1',3171,'These stains and sealants are designed to protect wood or masonry surfaces. Our wood stains come in various colors or clear options that enhance the natural grain patterns. Sealants provide a protective layer for concrete, brick, or other masonry surfaces. Stains and sealants create a protective barrier that prevents cracking, blistering, moisture buildup, stains, and other damage.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 11:15:10','2026-06-02 11:15:10'),(3181,'Water Resistant Coatings and Paints','water-resistant-coatings-and-paints',3171,'Our water-resistant coatings and paints provide reliable protection against moisture damage by forming a strong barrier that prevents water penetration. Designed for use with a wide range of surfaces, including wood, concrete, brick, and stone, these water-resistant paints, coatings, and sealants help reduce the risk of mold, mildew, and corrosion.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 11:15:16','2026-06-02 11:15:16'),(3182,'Floor Coatings','floor-coatings',3171,'These coatings are designed specifically to deliver superior protection and durability for all types of floors. Fast-drying floor coatings create a tough, long-lasting barrier that resists abrasions, chemicals, stains, and more. Explore a wide variety of products for different applications, including epoxy floor coatings, anti-slip coatings, floor sealers, and concrete floor coatings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 11:15:20','2026-06-02 11:15:20'),(3183,'High Heat Paints','high-heat-paints',3170,'High-heat paints are designed specifically for use in environments with extreme temperatures. High-heat spray paint is formulated to withstand and protect surfaces from temperatures up to 1,000 degrees Fahrenheit. High-heat paint is ideal for use on steam pipes, heaters, boilers, furnaces, radiators, and similar equipment that\'s often exposed to extreme heat.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 11:19:13','2026-06-02 11:19:13'),(3184,'Specialty Spray Paints','specialty-spray-paints',3170,'Specialty spray paints offer tailored solutions for specific painting tasks. Designed to provide thorough coverage and even coats, these spray paints are available in a range of formulas tailored to work on specific surfaces like plastics, metals, and more. Paint that meets manufacturer specifications for lawn, farm, and other commercial equipment is available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 11:19:13','2026-06-02 11:19:13'),(3185,'Rust Preventative Spray Paints','rust-preventative-spray-paints',3170,'Rust-preventative spray paints are designed to provide a protective coating on metal surfaces that prevents corrosion and decay. Available in various colors and finishes, rust-prevention spray paints are ideal for use on ladders, machinery, doors, racks, rails, and more equipment made from steel, aluminum, or other metals. Rust-preventer spray paint offers complete, long-lasting coverage.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 11:19:13','2026-06-02 11:19:13'),(3186,'General Purpose Aerosol Spray Paint','general-purpose-aerosol-spray-paint',3170,'General-purpose aerosol spray paints are versatile solutions suitable for a range of painting needs. Available in various colors and finishes, aerosol spray paint comes in pressurized cans that dispense the paint for maximum coverage and even coats. Spray paint offers protection, durability, high gloss, and color retention on metal, motors, machinery, tools, ducts, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 11:19:18','2026-06-02 11:19:18'),(3187,'Floor Hole Covers','floor-hole-covers',1222,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-02 11:19:38','2026-06-02 11:19:38'),(3188,'Hole Covers','hole-covers',3187,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-02 11:21:26','2026-06-02 11:21:26'),(3189,'Aerosol Marking Paints','aerosol-marking-paints',3169,'Aerosol marking paints are ideal for marking parking lots, driveways, warehouse floors & more. These paints are fast drying, produce vivid lines, and are made to last. Water-based and solvent-based paints are available. Aerosol striping paint comes in a wide variety of colors for any marking needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 11:24:14','2026-06-02 11:24:14'),(3190,'Aerosol Striping Paints','aerosol-striping-paints',3169,'Water-based and solvent-based aerosol striping paint provides crisp, long-lasting lines. These paints are formulated to quickly adhere to most surfaces and are ideal for athletic facilities, stadiums, parking lots & more. Striping paints are available in a wide range of colors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 11:24:14','2026-06-02 11:24:14'),(3191,'Pour Striping Paints','pour-striping-paints',3169,'Pour striping paints are available for larger marking applications including maintenance, construction & more. These paints are made of high-quality materials for a quick drying time and long-lasting durability and dependability. Multiple pour striping paint colors and sizes are available for varying needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 11:24:14','2026-06-02 11:24:14'),(3192,'Guard Rails','guard-rails',1222,'Guard rails are durable metal barriers designed to protect personnel and equipment from impacts. High-visibility guard rails and posts surround heavy machinery and other valuable equipment to absorb the effects of an impact or to deflect straying moving equipment or powered vehicles. As visible barriers that guard walkways, high-danger zones, and fragile equipment areas, durable steel guardrails are essential fixtures in a safe workplace.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-02 11:25:03','2026-06-02 11:25:03'),(3193,'Global Industrial™ Protective Steel Guard Rails','global-industrial-protective-steel-guard-rails',3192,'Global Industrial™ Protective Steel Guard Rails offer a sturdy and customizable barrier to protect people and property from potential hazards. Made from high-quality tubular steel, these guard rails are designed to withstand heavy impacts, providing long-lasting durability. Easy to install and available in various configurations, these protective guard rails are a practical and cost-effective solution.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-02 11:26:08','2026-06-02 11:26:08'),(3194,'Global Industrial™ Protective Plastic Guard Rails','global-industrial-protective-plastic-guard-rails',3192,'Crafted from durable, flexible resin material that self-heals after impacts and withstands chipping, flaking, and corrosion, Global Industrial Protective Plastic Guard Rails are built to hold strong against up to 9,000 lbs. of force at 7 mph, protecting personnel and equipment in warehouse environments. Posts are available to help create multidirectional or extended-length guardrail systems.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-02 11:27:13','2026-06-02 11:27:13'),(3195,'Portable Restrooms','portable-restrooms',12,'Portable restrooms are ideal in construction sites, outdoor events, or any other situations requiring temporary facilities. Durable and hygienic, portable restrooms are easy to transport, set up, and maintain. Engineered with advanced waste tanks and large gallon capacity holding tanks to accommodate frequent use in high-traffic areas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 11:27:55','2026-06-02 11:27:55'),(3196,'Global Industrial™ Drop-In/Lift-Out Light Duty Guard Rails','global-industrial-drop-inlift-out-light-duty-guard-rails',3192,'Global Industrial™ Light Duty Guard Rails offer an easy and practical solution for protecting equipment and personnel in your commercial facility. Made from durable steel, these guard rails feature a drop-in/lift-out design for easy maintenance. Each unit is constructed from 11-gauge steel and features a highly visible OSHA safety yellow powder-coated finish for quick recognition at approaching distances.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-02 11:28:11','2026-06-02 11:28:11'),(3197,'Global Industrial™ Guard Rails with Rebounding Bollards','global-industrial-guard-rails-with-rebounding-bollards',3192,'Protect your equipment and warehouse personnel using a steel guard rail system with rebounding bollards. These impact-absorbing guard rails protect machinery and equipment and are constructed to bounce-back preventing costly repairs. Made with heavy-duty steel with a bright yellow finish for easy visibility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-02 11:29:18','2026-06-02 11:29:18'),(3198,'Railings','railings',12,'Whether you\'re in need of durable foot railings or handrails for commercial spaces, or elegant balustrades for residential applications, our comprehensive range of railings has you covered. Explore our catalog to discover a wide array of materials, including steel, aluminum, and stainless steel, ensuring long-lasting durability and reliable performance. With our commitment to exceptional craftsmanship and industry-leading standards, Global Industrial is your trusted source for all your railing needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 11:30:53','2026-06-02 11:30:53'),(3199,'Global Industrial™ Pedestrian Plastic Guard Rails','global-industrial-pedestrian-plastic-guard-rails',3192,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-02 11:31:54','2026-06-02 11:31:54'),(3200,'Wildeck® Guard Rail System','wildeck-guard-rail-system',3192,'Wildeck® Guard Rail System offers optimal safety and protection in industrial and commercial settings. Made from high-quality steel, it is durable and built to withstand any impact. The modular design allows for easy installation and customization, making it the perfect solution for any space that requires additional safety measures.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-02 11:36:16','2026-06-02 11:36:16'),(3201,'Vestil Steel Guard Rail System','vestil-steel-guard-rail-system',3192,'Made from high-strength steel, these guard rails are designed to withstand impacts and prevent damage in any commercial setting. Available in a variety of sizes and configurations, this steel guard rail system is sure to offer a reliable and cost-effective solution for protecting your employees and equipment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-02 11:42:16','2026-06-02 11:42:16'),(3202,'Safety Railings & Fittings','safety-railings-fittings',3198,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 11:47:00','2026-06-02 11:47:00'),(3203,'Handrail Accessories','handrail-accessories',3198,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 11:47:04','2026-06-02 11:47:04'),(3204,'Foot Railings','foot-railings',3198,'Foot railings provide support, and stability to any bar. They are quick and easy to install and are made of heavy duty materials for lasting durability. Foot railings are ideal for use in any foodservice industry, counter or bar.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 11:47:08','2026-06-02 11:47:08'),(3205,'Footrail Kits','footrail-kits',3204,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-02 11:49:39','2026-06-02 11:49:39'),(3206,'Vestil Outdoor Removable Galvanized Guard Rails','vestil-outdoor-removable-galvanized-guard-rails',3192,'Outdoor galvanized guard rails provide reliable and durable protection for outdoor areas where safety is a priority. These removable guard rails feature high-quality galvanized steel, ensuring long-lasting performance. With their sturdy construction and easy installation, our guard rails offer a practical and effective solution for protecting outdoor spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-02 12:13:13','2026-06-02 12:13:13'),(3207,'Vestil Galvanized Structural Steel Guard Rail Systems','vestil-galvanized-structural-steel-guard-rail-systems',3192,'Vestil steel guard rail systems provide a reliable safety solution for any outdoor space. Made from durable galvanized steel, they offer resistance to rust, corrosion, and harsh weather. This guardrail design allows for easy installation and flexibility to fit any layout. With their high-quality construction, these rails are the perfect solution for providing long-lasting safety and protection.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-02 12:14:30','2026-06-02 12:14:30'),(3208,'Vestil Wall Mount Guard Rail Systems','vestil-wall-mount-guard-rail-systems',3192,'Vestil Wall Mount Guard Rail Systems provide a sturdy and secure barrier for all industries. Made from durable steel, these rails can be mounted to walls for maximum stability. With their easy installation and high-quality construction, wall mounted guard rails are a practical and effective way to enhance safety in any workplace or facility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-02 12:19:27','2026-06-02 12:19:27'),(3209,'Ideal Shield® Guard Rails','ideal-shield-guard-rails',3192,'Ideal Shield® guard rails offer sturdy protection for personnel and equipment in warehouses, loading docks, and other industrial settings. Made from a steel pipe covered in durable HDPE plastic, these industrial guard rails come in various styles to fit different applications. With their high visibility and easy installation, these rails provide a reliable and cost-effective solution for any workplace.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-02 12:23:47','2026-06-02 12:23:47'),(3210,'Ideal Warehouse Guard Rails','ideal-warehouse-guard-rails',3192,'Ideal Warehouse Guard Rails provide reliable protection for any industrial setting. Constructed from heavy-duty steel, these guard rails are designed to withstand impact from forklifts and other heavy equipment. Easy to install these warehouse guard rails offer an affordable and practical solution to improve safety in any setting.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-02 12:24:46','2026-06-02 12:24:46'),(3211,'Pneumatic Cylinders','pneumatic-cylinders',618,'Pneumatic Cylinders are designed to provide reliable and efficient linear motion in a variety of industrial applications. They are built to withstand the rigors of continuous use, ensuring consistent and smooth operation. Pneumatic cylinders are available in single and double capabilities in various sizes and configurations for manufacturing, automation, or other industrial processes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:04:07','2026-06-05 09:04:07'),(3212,'Pneumatic Vibrators','pneumatic-vibrators',618,'Pneumatic vibrators are specialized devices designed to generate controlled vibrations through the use of compressed air. The pneumatic vibrators are used to compact materials in containers, molds, or forms, ensuring uniform settling and reducing voids in the material. The machines are ideal for manufacturing and packaging lines to facilitate the movement of materials, enhance compaction, and reduce the risk of jams.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:05:33','2026-06-05 09:05:33'),(3213,'Valves','valves-2',618,'Valves are durable pneumatic components that are used to provide reliable control and automation in pneumatic systems. They come in various shapes and sizes, like directional control valves, pneumatic control values, and automated ball valves for various pneumatic systems. Valves are used in industrial settings like HVAC control systems and large water control systems.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:06:49','2026-06-05 09:06:49'),(3214,'Vortex Tubes & Cooling Cabinets','vortex-tubes-cooling-cabinets',618,'Vortex tubes are pneumatic system components that efficiently provide cooling using compressed air. Available in various sizes and lengths, vortex tubes are compact, cost-effective, and require minimal maintenance. Designed to create streams of cold air without any moving parts, tubes are ideal for a range of industrial applications, including cooling electronic components, machining operations, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:07:30','2026-06-05 09:07:30'),(3215,'Puller Accessories','puller-accessories',619,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:08:35','2026-06-05 09:08:35'),(3216,'Pullers & Separators','pullers-separators',619,'Pullers and separators enable the safe and efficient removal or separation of tightly-fitted components. Pullers are equipped with jaws or hooks to grip the component securely, and some feature handles or levers to enhance mechanical advantage. Separators utilize wedges or blades that can be inserted between closely-fitted components. These tools find applications in automotive repair, industrial maintenance, and other tasks requiring disassembly or extraction.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:09:26','2026-06-05 09:09:26'),(3217,'Bushed Sprockets','bushed-sprockets',621,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:10:30','2026-06-05 09:10:30'),(3218,'Finished Bore Sprockets','finished-bore-sprockets',621,'Finished bore sprockets are available in a wide range of industrial and commercial types. Configurations include metric-finished bore sprockets, industrial-finished bore sprockets and commercial-finished bore sprockets in multiple sizes, tooth counts and bore diameters. They are ideal for use with roller chains for driving various mechanical parts.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:11:16','2026-06-05 09:11:16'),(3219,'Plain Bore Sprockets','plain-bore-sprockets',621,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:12:26','2026-06-05 09:12:26'),(3220,'Roller Chain','roller-chain',621,'Roller chains are sturdy mechanical devices composed of interconnected links with cylindrical rollers. They efficiently transmit mechanical power between rotating shafts, with features including durability, resistance to wear, and high load capacity. Roller chains facilitate smooth power transmission and are typically utilized in industrial environments, such as manufacturing plants, conveyor systems, and agricultural machinery.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:13:10','2026-06-05 09:13:10'),(3221,'Timing Belt Pulleys','timing-belt-pulleys',623,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:14:24','2026-06-05 09:14:24'),(3222,'Banded V-Belts','banded-v-belts',624,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:15:23','2026-06-05 09:15:23'),(3223,'Cogged V-Belts','cogged-v-belts',624,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:16:08','2026-06-05 09:16:08'),(3224,'Kevlar V-Belts','kevlar-v-belts',624,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:17:20','2026-06-05 09:17:20'),(3225,'Light Duty V-Belts','light-duty-v-belts',624,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:49:16','2026-06-05 09:49:16'),(3226,'Standard V-Belts','standard-v-belts',624,'Standard v-belts transmit power efficiently from one pulley to another, providing a dependable means of transferring rotational force in machinery and equipment. They can accommodate different pulley configurations and application requirements. Standard v-belts are used in industrial machinery such as conveyors, crushers, and other manufacturing equipment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:50:31','2026-06-05 09:50:31'),(3227,'Machine Guards & Panels','machine-guards-panels',1234,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:51:05','2026-06-05 09:51:05'),(3228,'Timing Belts','timing-belts',624,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:51:14','2026-06-05 09:51:14'),(3229,'AC Electric Vibrators','ac-electric-vibrators',625,'AC Electric Vibrators are specialized vibratory devices powered by alternating current. They are designed for applications requiring controlled vibration, such as material handling, compaction, and screening processes. AC Electric Vibrators feature durable construction for long-lasting dependability and adjustable settings to regulate the amplitude and force of the vibration, providing flexibility for diverse industrial applications. They are commonly used in industries such as construction, agriculture, and manufacturing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:52:36','2026-06-05 09:52:36'),(3230,'Wire Machine Guards','wire-machine-guards',3227,'Wire machine guards are modular panels that allow users to create secure areas around the facility. Panel guards can be used to create secure barriers and enclosures around machinery and equipment to prevent unauthorized access and to minimize the risk of accidents. Its wire mesh design offers unrestricted ventilation and visibility into the secured area.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:54:50','2026-06-05 09:54:50'),(3231,'Global Industrial™ Wire Machine Guard System','global-industrial-wire-machine-guard-system',3230,'Global Industrial wire guard panels help protect your workforce from hazardous machinery. Partition panels can be easily installed for quick removal or more permanently for maximum security. Customize your machine guard with a swinging door and various size panels. Durable woven 10 gauge wire partitions provide clear visibility. Panels measure 5\'H and attach to post 1\' post 1\' above floor.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:55:34','2026-06-05 09:55:34'),(3232,'DC Electric Vibrators','dc-electric-vibrators',625,'DC electric vibrators provide powerful motion to improve material flow, reduce jams, and promote compaction. Ideal for use in construction, food processing, pharmaceuticals, and agriculture, industrial electric vibrators offer adjustable speed and force intensity. They are designed to be compact, durable, and energy-efficient.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:56:12','2026-06-05 09:56:12'),(3233,'WireCrafter® RapidGuard™ Lift-Out Machine Guard System','wirecrafter-rapidguard-lift-out-machine-guard-system',3230,'WireCrafters lift-out machine guarding system has panels made of steel tubing for long-lasting durability. Panels lift out from upright posts, allowing full access to guarded equipment when needed. Enclosure provides additional safety and security for machine operation. Various machine guard panel sizes are available along with swinging or sliding doors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:58:34','2026-06-05 09:58:34'),(3234,'Husky Rack & Wire Velox Machine Guard System','husky-rack-wire-velox-machine-guard-system',3230,'Husky rack & wire velox machine guarding systems protect machines from wear and tear while also keeping your workforce safe. Machine guard panels, doors, and line posts have high quality polyurethane paint coating for added strength. Velox guard panels can be trimmed for specific dimensions and attached to posts at angles other than 90 degrees, providing greater flexibility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 09:59:34','2026-06-05 09:59:34'),(3235,'Pneumatic Vibrators','pneumatic-vibrators-1',625,'Pneumatic vibrators are specialized devices designed to generate controlled vibrations through the use of compressed air. The pneumatic vibrators are used to compact materials in containers, molds, or forms, ensuring uniform settling and reducing voids in the material. The machines are ideal for manufacturing and packaging lines to facilitate the movement of materials, enhance compaction, and reduce the risk of jams.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:01:18','2026-06-05 10:01:18'),(3236,'Vibrator Repair Kits','vibrator-repair-kits',625,'Vibrator repair kits are designed to ensure the efficient operation of industrial vibrator equipment. Equipped with high-quality components such as bearings, seals, and gaskets, these kits adhere to strict standards for durability and longevity. By providing essential parts, vibrator repair kits minimize downtime and prolong the lifespan of vibrators, ensuring continuous performance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:10:06','2026-06-05 10:10:06'),(3237,'Clay & Dough','clay-dough',629,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:14:44','2026-06-05 10:14:44'),(3238,'Craft Basics','craft-basics',629,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:16:06','2026-06-05 10:16:06'),(3239,'Crayons, Markers & Chalk','crayons-markers-chalk',629,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:16:56','2026-06-05 10:16:56'),(3240,'Machine Guards','machine-guards',3227,'Machine guards protect personnel, equipment, and facilities from hazards associated with machinery and industrial processes. They are constructed from robust steel to withstand impact and provide long-lasting protection. Some machine guards feature high-visibility colors, enhancing awareness of the guard\'s presence and promoting a safety-conscious work environment. They are ideal for use in manufacturing plants and production facilities to protect operators from the moving parts of industrial machinery.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:17:34','2026-06-05 10:17:34'),(3241,'General Purpose Glue','general-purpose-glue-1',629,'General Purpose Glue is a versatile adhesive option used for bonding materials in a variety of applications. The adhesives are easy to apply and can be used on multiple types of surfaces including paper, metal, wood, and more. Commercial adhesives are made from quality materials, allowing them to provide a long lasting bond. Great for use in schools, workshops and studios.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:18:02','2026-06-05 10:18:02'),(3242,'Paint & Paint Brushes','paint-paint-brushes',629,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:20:38','2026-06-05 10:20:38'),(3243,'Stencils & Letters','stencils-letters',629,'Letter stencils are versatile tools that enhance creativity in arts and crafts projects. Ideal for DIY designs, school assignments, and professional applications, these stencils allow for precise lettering and artistic expression. Available in various sizes and styles, they cater to different needs, from scrapbooking to home décor. Made from high-quality materials, these stencils ensure durability and ease of use, making them perfect for repeated applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:22:02','2026-06-05 10:22:02'),(3244,'Accessories for BR-500 Vinyl Crash Rail-Type Handrail','accessories-for-br-500-vinyl-crash-rail-type-handrail',3203,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 10:24:15','2026-06-05 10:24:15'),(3245,'Installation Brackets for BR-500, BR-530, and BR-800 series Handrails','installation-brackets-for-br-500-br-530-and-br-800-series-handrails',3203,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 10:24:15','2026-06-05 10:24:15'),(3246,'Backpacks & Duffle Bags','backpacks-duffle-bags',632,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:24:47','2026-06-05 10:24:47'),(3247,'Safety Railings','safety-railings',3202,'Safety railings are durable steel fixtures that direct personnel or traffic flow, protect valuable machinery or equipment, or prevent personnel from falling from elevated heights. Weather-resistant and highly-visible, safety railings are OSHA compliant and can be customized to promote personnel and facility safety in commercial manufacturing, factories, construction sites, and other workplaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 10:26:40','2026-06-05 10:26:40'),(3248,'Computer Bags & Briefcases','computer-bags-briefcases',632,'Computer bags and briefcases carry and protect electronic devices, documents, and other work-related items. Computer bags and cases provide secure storage for laptops, and most feature additional compartments and pockets for organizing accessories and cables. Briefcases are often padded to accommodate laptops and tablets securely with a top handle or shoulder strap for hands-free carrying. Ideal for any commercial workplace applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:26:44','2026-06-05 10:26:44'),(3249,'Jewelry & Makeup Cases','jewelry-makeup-cases',632,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:28:03','2026-06-05 10:28:03'),(3250,'Luggage','luggage',632,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:30:09','2026-06-05 10:30:09'),(3251,'Global Industrial™ Safety Railings','global-industrial-safety-railings',3247,'Our safety railings provide an industrial-strength safety solution for commercial spaces. Made of durable steel pipe, these safety railings feature a highly visible yellow color and are ideal for directing traffic flow. These versatile railings can be used as removable, portable rails or permanent fixtures. Our OSHA-compliant rails are 42\" high and come in various lengths from 36\" to 96\".',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 10:30:54','2026-06-05 10:30:54'),(3252,'Padfolios & Portfolios','padfolios-portfolios',632,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:31:08','2026-06-05 10:31:08'),(3253,'Calculators','calculators',634,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:32:25','2026-06-05 10:32:25'),(3254,'Roof Zone Zip Rail Fall Protection System','roof-zone-zip-rail-fall-protection-system',3247,'The Roof Zone zip rail fall protection system is a simple yet secure solution for rooftop job sites without the need for a lanyard, harness, or line system. Solid steel construction allows access to the edge of the roof without the risk of falling. Roof fall protection kits include zip rails, safety locking pins, corner brackets, gravel stops, and other components within a stackable container.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 10:35:31','2026-06-05 10:35:31'),(3255,'Tie Down Safety Railings & Guardrail Systems','tie-down-safety-railings-guardrail-systems',3247,'Made with heavy-duty steel construction to withstand wear with a bright yellow high-visibility finish, Tie Down Safety Railings and Guardrail Systems are an alternative to active fall protection systems, allowing workers to freely move around construction sites and rooftops without the need for harnesses or lanyards.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 10:35:31','2026-06-05 10:35:31'),(3256,'Vestil Modular Square Safety Railings','vestil-modular-square-safety-railings',3247,'Vestil modular square safety railings provide an easy-to-assemble solution for guarding hazardous areas. These modular railing systems are ideal for loading docks, walkways, and other industrial settings. Made of 13-gauge square tubular steel, this guard railing has a high visibility yellow powder coat finish. Guard rails can come with toeboards and are customizable with wire mesh or connectors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 10:35:31','2026-06-05 10:35:31'),(3257,'Vestil Pipe Safety Rail Barrier','vestil-pipe-safety-rail-barrier',3247,'The Vestil pipe safety rail barrier is built with sturdy aluminum for maximum durability and is ideal for construction sites and similar industrial settings. These pipe safety railings create a secure barrier around uneven walkways, drop-offs, and other dangerous areas. The high and mid-rail design provides superior stability. Mounting options are available for convenient mounting and removal.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 10:35:31','2026-06-05 10:35:31'),(3258,'Kee Safety Railing Systems','kee-safety-railing-systems',3247,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 10:35:31','2026-06-05 10:35:31'),(3259,'Guardian Fall Protection Safety Railings','guardian-fall-protection-safety-railings',3247,'Guardian Fall Protection safety railings are designed to provide fall protection for mezzanines, platforms, and other elevated areas in industrial areas. These guard rails are part of the G-Rail System and made with steel and feature a high visibility yellow powder-coat finish that\'s weather-resistant. The Guardian Fall Protection safety railings are easy to install and customizable.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 10:35:31','2026-06-05 10:35:31'),(3260,'Clips & Fasteners','clips-fasteners',634,'Clips and Fasteners are indispensable tools for securing documents and files with ease. Made from durable materials, clips and fasteners provide reliable, long lasting performance. Binder clips, paper clips, and prong fasteners, offer versatile solutions for office, school, or home use ensuring that paperwork is organized and presentations tidy.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:35:52','2026-06-05 10:35:52'),(3261,'Compasses & Protractors','compasses-protractors',634,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:37:04','2026-06-05 10:37:04'),(3262,'Cutting Tools','cutting-tools',634,'Cutting tools are designed to efficiently cut paper, cardboard, or fabric. They include scissors, paper trimmers, and more. Precision cutting guides, found in tools like paper trimmers, ensure accurate and straight cuts. These versatile tools are suitable for a wide range of tasks, from arts and crafts to packaging and industrial applications. With their multipurpose design, they are ideal for use in offices, schools, and manufacturing settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:39:14','2026-06-05 10:39:14'),(3263,'Desk Accessories','desk-accessories',634,'Desk accessories, including bookends, business card holders, desk trays, desk pads, and document holders, create a more organized, functional, and efficient workspace. Durable desk organizers and trays reduce clutter and maximize the use of desk space. Use long-lasting desk accessories in settings such as corporate offices and classrooms.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:40:31','2026-06-05 10:40:31'),(3264,'Office Tape','office-tape-1',634,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:42:07','2026-06-05 10:42:07'),(3265,'Office Tape Dispensers','office-tape-dispensers-1',634,'Office tape dispensers are designed to hold and dispense rolls of adhesive tape for various tasks. They feature a cutting edge and a weighted base to prevent tipping. Tape dispensers come in different sizes and are available in manual or automatic models. They help to streamline packaging, wrapping, labeling, and other tasks. Tape dispensers are generally used in offices, schools, homes, and other settings requiring frequent tape use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:43:14','2026-06-05 10:43:14'),(3266,'Pencil Sharpeners','pencil-sharpeners',634,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:45:00','2026-06-05 10:45:00'),(3267,'Pens, Pencils & Markers','pens-pencils-markers',634,'Pens, pencils, and markers are essential writing and marking tools for various purposes across offices, schools, and industrial settings. They can be used for everyday writing tasks, note-taking, and documentation. They can also be used for sketching, drawing, and creative expression, providing artists and designers with various tools. The writing tools are ideal for offices, schools, and personal use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:47:23','2026-06-05 10:47:23'),(3268,'Punches','punches',634,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:48:17','2026-06-05 10:48:17'),(3269,'Rulers','rulers',634,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:49:45','2026-06-05 10:49:45'),(3270,'Stamp Pads','stamp-pads',634,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:52:07','2026-06-05 10:52:07'),(3271,'Stamps','stamps',634,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:53:24','2026-06-05 10:53:24'),(3272,'Staplers & Staples','staplers-staples',634,'Staplers and staples provide reliable document binding solutions for office, school, and household tasks. From securing documents to assembling materials, staplers offer convenience and efficiency in a wide range of applications. Heavy duty staplers accommodate different stapling needs and materials, ensuring secure and tidy binding. The ergonomic designs and durable construction make them useful tools for everyday use by professionals, students, and DIY enthusiasts.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:54:56','2026-06-05 10:54:56'),(3273,'Binder Labels','binder-labels',635,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 10:57:35','2026-06-05 10:57:35'),(3274,'Safety Railing Fittings','safety-railing-fittings',3202,'Safety Railing Fittings are versatile components that connect piping and tubing. Made with various heavy-duty materials like aluminum, brass, and stainless steel, pipe fittings ensure secure connections and are ideal for creating customizable pipelines, safety railings, machine guards, and other structures for commercial or industrial purposes. Fittings come in different types - like elbow, flange, and clamp pipe fittings - to meet a range of needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:02:04','2026-06-05 11:02:04'),(3275,'Binders','binders',635,'Binders are organizational tools designed to hold and secure loose sheets of paper, documents, and other materials. They come in various sizes and include D-ring and O-ring mechanisms to accommodate varying amounts of paper. Binders come in various colors, allowing users to color-code and categorize binders based on subject, project, or other criteria, making them ideal for use in offices, schools, and businesses.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 11:02:25','2026-06-05 11:02:25'),(3276,'Hardware','hardware-1',3274,'Designed for the secure attachment of components, Hardware for Pipes and Fittings, such as anti-theft devices and set screws, help enhance the connection of pipes and fittings. Galvanized iron construction offers strength, durability, and resistance to rust & corrosion.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:12:30','2026-06-05 11:12:30'),(3277,'Collars','collars-1',3274,'Collars are suitable for use with gate hinges and other fittings that may need to be left untightened. Designed to provide additional support for structures exceeding the allowed slip load for a set screw, railing collars come in a wide range of sizes to accommodate pipes and tubing of varying diameters. Galvanized iron construction holds strong over time while resisting rust and corrosion.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:12:33','2026-06-05 11:12:33'),(3278,'Plugs','plugs',3274,'Plugs are designed to fit into the ends of tubes or pipes, giving industrial railing systems an aesthetically pleasing finishing touch. These railing end caps are available in multiple sizes to accommodate a wide range of pipe diameters, and the drive-in design makes these railing plugs difficult to remove after installation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:12:36','2026-06-05 11:12:36'),(3279,'Couplings','couplings',3274,'Couplings offer a simple, secure way to connect two pieces of industrial pipe or tubing, extending the length of railing systems and creating an in-line joint. These railing couplings come in a variety of sizes to fit pipes of different diameters, and they are crafted from durable aluminum or galvanized iron to withstand the wear and tear of warehouse environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:12:39','2026-06-05 11:12:39'),(3280,'Sockets','sockets',3274,'Sockets provide a secure connection point between components of an industrial handrail or guard rail system. Swivel sockets feature male and female counterparts that work together to create adjustable angles between pipes or tubing and vertical posts. These railing sockets are constructed from durable material, such as galvanized iron or aluminum, to hold up against wear and tear.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:12:43','2026-06-05 11:12:43'),(3281,'Mounting Brackets & Supports','mounting-brackets-supports',3274,'Mounting Brackets and Supports increase the stability of handrails, guardrails, and other railing systems in industrial settings. Railing brackets and supports can be affixed to the wall or other sections of railing for secure placement, and they are made of durable material, such as galvanized iron or aluminum, for lasting strength. Available in a range of sizes to fit pipes of varying diameters.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:12:47','2026-06-05 11:12:47'),(3282,'Cross Fittings','cross-fittings',3274,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:12:50','2026-06-05 11:12:50'),(3283,'Elbows','elbows',3274,'Elbows make it easy to attach multiple pieces of pipes or tubing in industrial rail systems, creating a corner or change of direction. Available in 90-degree or adjustable-angle options, these railing elbows are suitable for a wide range of handrail and guard rail applications, and side outlet elbows are designed to join three pipes together at a corner to improve structural stability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:12:54','2026-06-05 11:12:54'),(3284,'Tee Fittings','tee-fittings',3274,'Tee Fittings allow connection of multiple pieces of pipes or tubing in industrial handrail and guard rail applications. Designed with up to three sockets, railing tee fittings create 90-degree attachments to increase rail system stability, and durable aluminum or galvanized iron construction provides lasting strength. Tee fittings with swivel designs enable custom builds with adjustable angles.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:12:57','2026-06-05 11:12:57'),(3285,'Flanges','flanges',3274,'Flanges provide a secure mounting point for industrial handrails, guard rails and piping. Available in a range of diameters to accommodate different-size pipes, these railing flanges can be mounted to the wall or the floor for secure, sturdy attachment, and they are crafted from durable material, such as aluminum or galvanized iron, to hold up against wear and tear over time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:13:01','2026-06-05 11:13:01'),(3286,'Architectural Railing Components','architectural-railing-components',3202,'Architectural Railing Components make it easy to construct handrails, foot rails, stair railings, and more to promote safety throughout industrial facilities. Tubing comes in a variety of lengths and diameters to suit a wide range of applications, and it’s made from durable materials, such as stainless steel and brass, for long-lasting strength. Flanges, mounts, posts, and fittings offer secure placement of architectural railings along the floor or wall, while adjustable ball saddles provide support and stability at a customizable angle.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:21:05','2026-06-05 11:21:05'),(3287,'Collars','collars-2',3286,'Collars allow the creation of custom-angled sections on architectural interior railing projects like handrails, stair railings, kitchen railings, or foot rails. Perpendicular collars rotate around the tubing for positioning at virtually any angle, while angle collars work with ball fittings to achieve the desired angle. Railing collars are made of brass or stainless steel for lasting strength.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:38:49','2026-06-05 11:38:49'),(3288,'Wall Returns','wall-returns',3286,'Wall Returns attach to the end of handrails to create a curved return with a minimal gap between the stair rail and wall, reducing the risk of injury. Railing wall returns come in a variety of pipe sizes to accommodate tubing of different diameters, and they are constructed from durable material, such as brass or stainless steel, to offer long-lasting strength.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:38:52','2026-06-05 11:38:52'),(3289,'Saddles & Splices','saddles-splices',3286,'Providing support for interior railing projects like handrails, stair railings, kitchen railings, or foot rails, Saddles and Splices attach securely to vertical posts to help stabilize railings, while adjustable saddles allow pipes and tubing to be set at custom angles. Rail splices provide a solid & secure connection of tubes that maintains structural strength.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:38:55','2026-06-05 11:38:55'),(3290,'End Caps','end-caps-1',3286,'Made of brass or stainless-steel for strength & durability, End Caps provide an elegant finishing touch to interior railing projects including handrails, stair railings, kitchen railings, or foot rails. Railing end caps feature flush and half-ball designs to suit a variety of aesthetic preferences, and they come in a range of sizes to fit pipes and tubing of different diameters.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:38:58','2026-06-05 11:38:58'),(3291,'Flush Fittings','flush-fittings',3286,'Flush Fittings enable the secure, simple connection of tubing in interior architectural railing projects like handrails, stair railings, kitchen railings, or foot rails. Flush railing fittings come in multiple sizes to accept different pipe diameters, and tee, cross, elbow, and angled options allow placement wherever support is needed. Made from durable brass or stainless steel for lasting strength.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:39:01','2026-06-05 11:39:01'),(3292,'Glass Railing Clips & Grips','glass-railing-clips-grips',3286,'Made of stainless steel for strength & corrosion resistance and available in multiple pipe diameters, Glass Railing Clips and Grips allow the secure attachment of glass panels and dividers in glass railing systems. Railing grips with a flat back provide a flush fit along mounting surfaces, while railing clips with a radial back fit snugly along pipes and tubing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:39:06','2026-06-05 11:39:06'),(3293,'Ball Fittings','ball-fittings',3286,'Ball Fittings connect pipe or tubing while providing a decorative touch for interior railing projects like stair railings, kitchen railings, or foot rails. A rounded design adds visual appeal and conceals the tube ends of hand and stair rails, while elbow, tee, and cross options allow versatile placement along the rail. Available in a variety of nominal pipe sizes to fit a range of tube diameters.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:39:10','2026-06-05 11:39:10'),(3294,'Posts','posts',3286,'Posts provide support for pipes and tubing used in stair railings, kitchen railings, or foot rails. Railing posts are available in end post and center post designs to deliver stability where it’s needed, and the nominal pipe size options allow compatibility with a range of tubing diameters. Crafted from durable brass or stainless-steel, the rail posts are built to last.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:39:13','2026-06-05 11:39:13'),(3295,'Mounting Brackets','mounting-brackets',3286,'Boasting durable materials, like brass or stainless steel, to provide strength, Mounting Brackets are designed for interior architectural railing projects, allowing the secure attachment of handrails, stair railings, kitchen railings, or foot rails to a wall or other surface. They are available in multiple sizes to accept different diameters of pipe & tubing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:39:16','2026-06-05 11:39:16'),(3296,'Flanges','flanges-1',3286,'Available in wall-mount and floor-mount options to allow versatile placement, Flanges provide stair railings, kitchen railings, or foot rails with a secure, stable base. They come in a range of sizes to accept pipe and tubing of varying diameters and are crafted from durable materials, like brass or stainless steel, for strength and corrosion resistance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:39:20','2026-06-05 11:39:20'),(3297,'Tubing','tubing',3286,'Tubing for architectural railing projects is designed for the construction of handrails, guard rails, & other safety rails, and comes in a wide range of lengths and diameters to suit a variety of industrial rail systems. It is made from durable materials, such as galvanized steel, stainless steel, brass, or aluminum, to hold strong over time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:39:22','2026-06-05 11:39:22'),(3298,'Walls & Ceilings','walls-ceilings',12,'We offer a diverse selection of products that can cater to any building requirement, whether you\'re constructing a commercial, industrial, or residential building. We also have peel & stick wall tiles along with various ceiling tiles including PVC, vinyl, glue up, & decorative that can enhance the aesthetic appeal of your space. At Global Industrial, we pride ourselves on providing top-quality products from trusted brands to ensure that our customers receive the best value for their investment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:45:53','2026-06-05 11:45:53'),(3299,'Tarps & Sheeting','tarps-sheeting',12,'We offer a comprehensive selection of high-quality tarps and sheeting to meet your building supply needs. Our products are designed to provide reliable protection and coverage for painting projects, on construction sites, and in harsh weather conditions. Browse our wide variety of tarps and sheeting, including hurricane-rated tarps. Some tarps are waterproof, mildew proof, tear resistant, acid resistant & UV treated.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:45:56','2026-06-05 11:45:56'),(3300,'Stairs','stairs-1',12,'Whether you\'re looking to enhance safety, improve accessibility, or optimize space utilization, our comprehensive collection of stairs is designed to meet your diverse requirements. Explore an extensive range of high-quality stair systems, including industrial stairs, modular stairs, mezzanine stairs, and more. With durable construction, superior functionality, and easy installation, our stairs are engineered to withstand rigorous usage in industrial and commercial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:46:02','2026-06-05 11:46:02'),(3301,'Roofing Materials','roofing-materials',12,'Explore our comprehensive range of roofing products, including drains, sealants and adhesives, flashing, and more sourced from trusted brands in the industry. With Global Industrial, you can rest assured that you\'re getting reliable, long-lasting products that will withstand the test of time. Shop with us today and elevate your roofing projects to new heights.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:46:05','2026-06-05 11:46:05'),(3302,'Binding Bars','binding-bars',635,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 11:48:24','2026-06-05 11:48:24'),(3303,'Binding Machines','binding-machines',635,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 11:49:22','2026-06-05 11:49:22'),(3304,'Clipboards','clipboards',635,'Clipboards are essential tools for keeping documents secure and organized. Made from durable materials like plastic or aluminum, clipboards offer a sturdy writing surface that withstands daily use. Designed with a sturdy clip to secure papers to the board. Ideal for professionals, students, or anyone needing a portable solution, clipboards come in different sizes and styles to suit different needs. Clipboards are suitable for classrooms, warehouses, medical facilities, and fieldwork settings where mobility and organization are crucial.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 11:51:35','2026-06-05 11:51:35'),(3305,'Dividers & Tabs','dividers-tabs',635,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 11:52:20','2026-06-05 11:52:20'),(3306,'Report Covers','report-covers',635,'Report covers safeguard important documents from wear, tear, and damage, preserving their integrity and professional appearance. They also elevate the presentation of reports and documents, creating a polished and organized look. Report covers are ideal for presenting business reports, financial statements, project proposals, and school and academic projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 11:55:01','2026-06-05 11:55:01'),(3307,'Roof Flashing','roof-flashing',3301,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:55:33','2026-06-05 11:55:33'),(3308,'Roof Drains','roof-drains',3301,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:55:37','2026-06-05 11:55:37'),(3309,'Concrete Fillers & Patchers','concrete-fillers-patchers-2',3301,'Concrete Fillers and Patchers are essential for seamless and enduring concrete, masonry, and asphalt repair. They are high-quality, easy to apply, and restore and preserve surfaces by filling cracks, holes, and imperfections. Engineered with precision, these products are indispensable for professionals seeking reliable solutions for the repair and maintenance of concrete, masonry, and asphalt surfaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:55:40','2026-06-05 11:55:40'),(3310,'Brushes, Rollers & Trays','brushes-rollers-trays',3301,'Paint brushes, rollers, and tools are essential for achieving a smooth and even finish when applying paint and coatings. Offering includes sprayers, trays, extension poles, bucket grids, and more, to suit different painting needs. They are comfortable to grip and easy to clean. Paint supplies can be used for residential and commercial painting, construction sites, industrial facilities, and home improvement projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:55:44','2026-06-05 11:55:44'),(3311,'Adhesive Caulk & Sealants','adhesive-caulk-sealants-1',3301,'Adhesive Caulk & Sealants are versatile materials used for bonding and sealing various surfaces, offering protection against moisture and environmental factors. These products provide strong adhesion, flexibility, and resistance to weathering. Caulk and sealants are used to seal gaps, joints, and cracks in windows, doors, and building materials. Adhesive Caulk & Sealants are utilized in construction, building maintenance, and DIY projects where sealing and bonding are necessary.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 11:55:47','2026-06-05 11:55:47'),(3312,'Board & Easel Accessories','board-easel-accessories-1',14,'Board and easel accessories enhance the functionality of whiteboards, chalkboards and easels. They are designed to keep the workspace more organized which helps to increase productivity. Board and easel accessories are ideal for any classroom or commercial office space.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 11:56:21','2026-06-05 11:56:21'),(3313,'Josam Roof Drain & Parts','josam-roof-drain-parts',3308,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 12:07:45','2026-06-05 12:07:45'),(3314,'Roof Drains','roof-drains-1',3308,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 12:07:48','2026-06-05 12:07:48'),(3315,'Bulletin Boards','bulletin-boards',14,'Bulletin boards provide a central, organized location for displaying important information for public viewing without damaging walls. Used to post announcements, notices, schedules, company policies, and other messages, Bulletin boards are ideal fixtures in communal areas such as breakrooms, schools, offices, public spaces, and more. Their sturdy frames ensure durability and wall-mounting stability. Bulletin boards have a range of surface options, such as rubber, vinyl, fabric, and self-healing cork that can accommodate tacks and push pins.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 12:09:19','2026-06-05 12:09:19'),(3316,'Calendar Boards','calendar-boards',14,'Designed specifically for use with dry-erase markers that can be quickly erased when it’s time to update the information, Calendar and Planning Boards allow warehouse workers, plant managers, and other industrial employees to keep track of reminders, shift rotations, shipment dates, vacation days, and more. Calendar boards are available in a range of sizes to accommodate a variety of work & schedules and have sturdy frames for durability and secure mounting to a wall.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 12:12:27','2026-06-05 12:12:27'),(3317,'Chalkboards','chalkboards',636,'Display & communicate announcements, schedules, menus, and other pertinent information in offices, schools, warehouses, or restaurants using Specialty & Display Chalkboards that can be erased and reused. Available in a range of sizes and styles, they are crafted from heavy-duty materials for strength & durability, and wall-mounted for placement virtually anywhere around the facility or establishment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 12:15:02','2026-06-05 12:15:02'),(3318,'Dry Erase Boards','dry-erase-boards',636,'Dry erase boards serve as versatile tools for visual communication, instruction, and idea presentation, providing users with the flexibility to erase content effortlessly without liquid assistance. Available in portable, wall-mounted, and free-standing options, whiteboards enable users to effectively communicate and collaborate across diverse environments, including offices and educational spaces, promoting dynamic interactions and seamless sharing of thoughts and ideas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 12:19:01','2026-06-05 12:19:01'),(3319,'Easels','easels',636,'Easels are versatile display stands used for presenting artwork, signage, and presentations in classrooms, offices, and studios. With features like adjustable height and tilt, display easels offer flexibility and visibility, while dry erase and flip chart easels facilitate interactive presentations and brainstorming sessions. Ideal for educators, presenters, and artists, easels provide a convenient and professional platform for showcasing ideas and communicating information effectively.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 12:20:33','2026-06-05 12:20:33'),(3320,'High Profile Machine Guards','high-profile-machine-guards',3240,'High-profile machine guards provide heavy-duty impact protection for racks, loading docks, personnel, and more. Machine Guards are made with welded steel to prevent potential injuries in environments where machinery is present. Guards also include visibility stripes to alert employees to potential hazards that should be avoided.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 12:24:23','2026-06-05 12:24:23'),(3321,'Easels','easels-1',636,'Easels are versatile display stands used for presenting artwork, signage, and presentations in classrooms, offices, and studios. With features like adjustable height and tilt, display easels offer flexibility and visibility, while dry erase and flip chart easels facilitate interactive presentations and brainstorming sessions. Ideal for educators, presenters, and artists, easels provide a convenient and professional platform for showcasing ideas and communicating information effectively.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 12:24:54','2026-06-05 12:24:54'),(3322,'Corner Machine Guards','corner-machine-guards',3240,'Corner machine guards provide a safe and secure barrier around machines and racks, helping to minimize accidents and injuries. Triple elbow corner guards are made with heavy-duty welded steel for years of durability. These safety guards have a scratch-resistant yellow powder coat finish with safety stripes for high visibility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 12:26:27','2026-06-05 12:26:27'),(3323,'Enclosed Boards','enclosed-boards',636,'Enclosed display boards are ideal for displaying messages and other important information in schools, offices, and other commercial settings. Enclosed boards feature locking doors that protect displayed contents from theft, vandalism, and other damage. Various sizes, board materials, and colors are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 12:27:18','2026-06-05 12:27:18'),(3324,'Low Profile Machine Guards','low-profile-machine-guards',3240,'Low-profile machine guards offer protection without blocking the line of sight or access. These strong steel guards are designed to limit access to machines, conveyors, and other hazardous areas. Stripes on guards help increase safety and visibility. Steel guards can either be fixed or removable and are available in various heights.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 12:27:32','2026-06-05 12:27:32'),(3325,'Message Boards & Signs','message-boards-signs',636,'Sidewalk signs and sandwich boards are ideal for cafes, restaurants, retail shops, and event promotion. The signs and boards make it easy to showcase daily specials, upcoming events, or brand messaging to attract foot traffic. The signs are double-sided and are designed to withstand outdoor conditions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 12:29:31','2026-06-05 12:29:31'),(3326,'Master Flash Roof Flashings','master-flash-roof-flashings',3307,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 12:44:18','2026-06-05 12:44:18'),(3327,'Thermoplastic Base No-Calk Roof Flashings','thermoplastic-base-no-calk-roof-flashings',3307,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 12:44:21','2026-06-05 12:44:21'),(3328,'Rain Collars For No-Calk Roof Flashing','rain-collars-for-no-calk-roof-flashing',3307,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 12:44:24','2026-06-05 12:44:24'),(3329,'No-Calk Roof Flashings','no-calk-roof-flashings',3307,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 12:44:27','2026-06-05 12:44:27'),(3330,'Machine Shields','machine-shields-1',3227,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 12:47:24','2026-06-05 12:47:24'),(3331,'Machine Shields for Grinders','machine-shields-for-grinders',846,'Grinder shields are an ideal solution for protecting employees using this machinery. These shields create a protective barrier, guarding workers against flying particles. Constructed with durable and impact-resistant materials, these guards provide long-lasting protection and help enhance safety in various industrial workplaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 12:49:57','2026-06-05 12:49:57'),(3332,'Planning Boards & Overlays','planning-boards-overlays',636,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 13:05:22','2026-06-05 13:05:22'),(3333,'Project & Display Boards','project-display-boards',636,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-05 13:09:37','2026-06-05 13:09:37'),(3334,'Bucket Grids','bucket-grids-2',3310,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 13:18:52','2026-06-05 13:18:52'),(3335,'Extension Poles','extension-poles-1',3310,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 13:18:55','2026-06-05 13:18:55'),(3336,'Paint Sprayers','paint-sprayers-1',3310,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 13:19:01','2026-06-05 13:19:01'),(3337,'Paint Trays','paint-trays-2',3310,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 13:19:08','2026-06-05 13:19:08'),(3338,'Paintbrushes & Pads','paintbrushes-pads-1',3310,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 13:19:15','2026-06-05 13:19:15'),(3339,'Roller Covers','roller-covers-1',3310,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 13:19:21','2026-06-05 13:19:21'),(3340,'Roller Frames','roller-frames-2',3310,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 13:19:27','2026-06-05 13:19:27'),(3341,'Roller Kits','roller-kits-1',3310,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-05 13:19:32','2026-06-05 13:19:32'),(3342,'Treads','treads',3300,'Stair treads are designed to provide an anti-slip surface, reducing the risk of slips, trips, and falls on stairs, especially in high-traffic areas. They also act as a protective layer for the underlying staircase, shielding it from wear and tear caused by foot traffic, impact, and environmental factors. The treads are constructed from durable materials such as rubber, vinyl, or abrasive grit, ensuring long-lasting performance and resistance to wear. They are ideal for commercial buildings, offices, and retail spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 10:31:51','2026-06-08 10:31:51'),(3343,'Staircase Kits','staircase-kits',3300,'Staircase kits are convenient pre-packaged solutions designed to help quickly and easily install stairs in residences, commercial buildings, decks, porches, exterior terrace/veranda, and more. Available in various styles and sizes, staircase kits include all the components needed to build and install a durable staircase. Kits are made with heavy-duty metal materials for long-lasting durability, and are available in a range of colors. Indoor and outdoor staircase kits are available to meet all building needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 10:31:53','2026-06-08 10:31:53'),(3344,'Stair Brackets & Finials','stair-brackets-finials-1',3300,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 10:31:56','2026-06-08 10:31:56'),(3345,'Ekena Stair Brackets','ekena-stair-brackets-1',3344,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 10:33:53','2026-06-08 10:33:53'),(3346,'Ekena Finials','ekena-finials-1',3344,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 10:33:57','2026-06-08 10:33:57'),(3347,'Brass Short Rail Components','brass-short-rail-components-1',3344,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 10:34:01','2026-06-08 10:34:01'),(3348,'Spiral Staircase Kits 1','spiral-staircase-kits-1',3343,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 10:36:00','2026-06-08 10:36:00'),(3349,'Pipe Guards','pipe-guards',1222,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-08 10:37:58','2026-06-08 10:37:58'),(3350,'Bluff Manufacturing Wall Mounted Pipe Guards','bluff-manufacturing-wall-mounted-pipe-guards',3349,'Pipe Guards prevent damage from equipment and vehicles for safe maintenance in commercial areas. Featuring a thick steel build and highly visible safety yellow powder-coat finish, these steel pipe guards fit pipe diameters ranging from 2” to 12”. Standard models are 36\" or 46\" tall wall mounted pipe guards. For pipes not located directly on a wall, a worksheet can be completed for a custom design.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-08 10:39:33','2026-06-08 10:39:33'),(3351,'Grit Surface Aluminum Stair Treads - Standard Sizes','grit-surface-aluminum-stair-treads-standard-sizes-1',3342,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 10:40:34','2026-06-08 10:40:34'),(3352,'M-D Building Stair Treads & Edging','m-d-building-stair-treads-edging-1',3342,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 10:40:37','2026-06-08 10:40:37'),(3353,'Babcock-Davis® Stair Treads With Abrasive, Extruded & Type 319 Aluminum','babcock-davis-stair-treads-with-abrasive-extruded-type-319-aluminum-1',3342,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 10:40:41','2026-06-08 10:40:41'),(3354,'Stair Treads & Floor Tiles','stair-treads-floor-tiles-1',3342,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 10:40:44','2026-06-08 10:40:44'),(3355,'Roppe Stair Treads','roppe-stair-treads-1',3342,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 10:40:49','2026-06-08 10:40:49'),(3356,'Rack Guards & Protectors','rack-guards-protectors',1222,'Rack protectors are high-visibility safety devices designed to prevent damage to storage racking systems in warehouses, distribution centers, and industrial facilities. They feature sturdy construction and a reinforced design to withstand heavy impacts from forklifts, pallet jacks, or other moving equipment, protecting the integrity of the racking structure. Rack protectors come in various designs, including corner guards, floor safety curbs, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-08 10:40:51','2026-06-08 10:40:51'),(3357,'Floor Mounted Pallet Rack Protectors','floor-mounted-pallet-rack-protectors',3356,'Floor mounted pallet rack protectors provide stability and impact defense for pallet racks. By being mounted to the floor, and crafted from heavy duty steel, these protectors will shield your uprights for years to come. Steel post protectors are also available and protect racks and ensure personnel safety. Various colors, thickness options, and heights are available. Hardware included.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-08 10:41:36','2026-06-08 10:41:36'),(3358,'Pallet Rack Frame Protectors','pallet-rack-frame-protectors',3356,'Pallet rack frame protectors help to protect rack legs and uprights from scrape impacts by workplace vehicles. Some models feature an air chamber that is designed to deflect impact energy away from the rack. Protectors are easy to install, and many are bright in color for high visibility. Many sizes and styles are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-08 10:42:40','2026-06-08 10:42:40'),(3359,'Pallet Rack End Protectors','pallet-rack-end-protectors',3356,'Pallet Rack End Protectors secure racks from forklift damage. Made of durable steel, they are designed to absorb impact and ensure safety in distribution, manufacturing, storage, and other industrial environments. Their high-visibility powder coat finish and wrap-around design help prevent damage. These rack protectors include bolts for stability. Available in a variety of colors and dimensions,',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-08 10:43:38','2026-06-08 10:43:38'),(3360,'Surface Protectors','surface-protectors-2',3299,'Surface protectors are essential building supplies that help protect surfaces from wear and tear. They include window film, floor guards, and carpet protector films. Floor protection products can be used to guard different floor surfaces from damage. Carpet protector films are a durable, easy-to-apply film that protects carpets from dirt and wear. Surface protectors are ideal for any commercial or industrial application.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 11:23:01','2026-06-08 11:23:01'),(3361,'Hurricane Tarps','hurricane-tarps',3299,'Hurricane Tarps are essential for protecting property against extreme weather conditions. Hurricane protection fabrics are constructed from weather-resistant materials to deflect hurricane-force winds and prevent pressurization of the home. Ideal for both residential and commercial use, these weather-resistant tarps safeguard against wind, rain, and debris.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 11:23:06','2026-06-08 11:23:06'),(3362,'General Purpose Tarps','general-purpose-tarps',3299,'General-purpose tarps are designed to shield items or surfaces from weather elements, debris, dust, or damage. They are made from heavy-duty, tear-resistant materials and can be quickly deployed for immediate protection. Tarpaulin is used both indoors and outdoors in warehouses, construction sites, and other industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 11:23:09','2026-06-08 11:23:09'),(3363,'Dust Barriers','dust-barriers',3299,'Dust Barriers are flexible material that helps to prevent the spread of dust particles from one area to another by creating a barrier. Whether plastic sheeting or soft fabric material, industrial-strength Dust Barriers create an airtight seal around doorways to ensure the safety of workers. Dust Barriers are on-demand solutions suitable for construction sites, warehouses, renovation projects, laboratories, manufacturing, and healthcare facilities to maintain a clean and safe working environment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 11:23:12','2026-06-08 11:23:12'),(3364,'Drop Cloths','drop-cloths',3299,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 11:23:16','2026-06-08 11:23:16'),(3365,'Debris Safety Netting','debris-safety-netting',3299,'Debris safety netting plays a vital role in ensuring safety on construction sites and in industrial environments, aiming to prevent falling debris, tools, or materials from elevated work areas. These tarps are constructed from durable HDPE material, offering strength and resilience to withstand impacts and exposure to various elements. Widely utilized in construction and infrastructure projects, they serve to enhance safety and protect the surrounding environment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 11:23:19','2026-06-08 11:23:19'),(3366,'Debris Safety Netting','debris-safety-netting-1',3365,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 11:36:14','2026-06-08 11:36:14'),(3367,'Fire Resistant Safety Netting','fire-resistant-safety-netting',3365,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 11:36:19','2026-06-08 11:36:19'),(3368,'Plastic Drop Cloths','plastic-drop-cloths',3364,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 11:44:06','2026-06-08 11:44:06'),(3369,'Canvas Drop Cloths & Runners','canvas-drop-cloths-runners',3364,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 11:44:09','2026-06-08 11:44:09'),(3370,'Light Duty Tarps','light-duty-tarps',3362,'Light-duty tarps are practical solutions for covering and protecting equipment and other items. These tarps are lightweight, tear-resistant, and waterproof, making them great for landscaping and agricultural uses. High-density polyethylene construction makes them UV resistant, allowing them to withstand outdoor use. Available in different sizes and thickness options.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 12:01:32','2026-06-08 12:01:32'),(3371,'Spill Containment Covers','spill-containment-covers',3362,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 12:01:35','2026-06-08 12:01:35'),(3372,'Flame Resistant/Retardant Tarps and Covers','flame-resistantretardant-tarps-and-covers',3362,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 12:01:39','2026-06-08 12:01:39'),(3373,'Medium Duty Tarps','medium-duty-tarps',3362,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 12:01:42','2026-06-08 12:01:42'),(3374,'Construction Washouts','construction-washouts-2',3362,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 12:01:45','2026-06-08 12:01:45'),(3375,'Light Duty Tarps','light-duty-tarps-1',3362,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 12:01:49','2026-06-08 12:01:49'),(3376,'Heavy Duty Tarps','heavy-duty-tarps',3362,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 12:01:52','2026-06-08 12:01:52'),(3377,'Economy Fastener','economy-fastener',3361,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 12:55:38','2026-06-08 12:55:38'),(3378,'Deluxe Fastener','deluxe-fastener',3361,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 12:55:40','2026-06-08 12:55:40'),(3379,'Installation Clip','installation-clip',3361,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 12:55:43','2026-06-08 12:55:43'),(3380,'AstroGuard Hurricane Fabric Protection','astroguard-hurricane-fabric-protection',3361,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 12:55:45','2026-06-08 12:55:45'),(3381,'M-D Building Adhesive Stair Treads, Heavy Duty','m-d-building-adhesive-stair-treads-heavy-duty-1',3360,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 14:12:51','2026-06-08 14:12:51'),(3382,'Ram Board Temporary Floor Protection','ram-board-temporary-floor-protection-2',3360,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 14:12:54','2026-06-08 14:12:54'),(3383,'Finished Floor Guard®','finished-floor-guard-1',3360,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 14:12:57','2026-06-08 14:12:57'),(3384,'Tack Mat Disposable Sheet Mats','tack-mat-disposable-sheet-mats-1',3360,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 14:12:59','2026-06-08 14:12:59'),(3385,'Carpet Protection & Floor Protection Film','carpet-protection-floor-protection-film-1',3360,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 14:13:02','2026-06-08 14:13:02'),(3386,'Poly-Craft Mask® Floor Protection','poly-craft-mask-floor-protection-1',3360,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 14:13:06','2026-06-08 14:13:06'),(3387,'Protective Window Film','protective-window-film-1',3360,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 14:13:09','2026-06-08 14:13:09'),(3388,'PVC Floor & Surface Protection','pvc-floor-surface-protection-2',3360,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 14:13:16','2026-06-08 14:13:16'),(3389,'Wall Tiles','wall-tiles',3298,'Wall tiles are decorative and functional building materials designed for surfacing walls in all kinds of spaces. Available in various patterns, sizes, shapes, colors, and materials, providing versatility for creating customized wall surfaces. Wall tiles are highly durable, easy to clean, and water-resistant, making them suitable for areas with high humidity and moisture. Perfect for bathrooms, kitchens, and showers across residential and commercial spaces alike.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 14:16:28','2026-06-08 14:16:28'),(3390,'Ceiling Tiles','ceiling-tiles',3298,'Ceiling tiles are versatile modular panels crafted from materials like mineral fiber, PVC, or metal, serving essential functions such as noise reduction, insulation, and maintenance accessibility in commercial, educational, medical, and hospitality environments. Lay-in ceiling tiles are engineered with fire-retardant properties, ensuring enhanced safety and compliance with building codes. Heavy duty ceiling tiles are suitable for both commercial and residential use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 14:16:31','2026-06-08 14:16:31'),(3391,'Tin Ceiling Tiles & Crown Molding','tin-ceiling-tiles-crown-molding',3390,'Tin ceiling tiles & crown molding are available in various colors and sizes to suit any room design. Choose from faux ceiling tin tiles and matching trim corners, or shop crown molding trim to cover your existing tiles. Quality craftsmanship ensures a long-lasting product that withstands temperature and humidity changes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 14:19:44','2026-06-08 14:19:44'),(3392,'Glue-Up Ceiling Tiles','glue-up-ceiling-tiles',3390,'Our glue-up ceiling tiles offer a seamless solution for enhancing ceiling surface texture. Available in various colors, dimensions, and patterns, they elevate any decor. Installation is simple with adhesive application, eliminating the need for nails or screws. These ceiling glue-up tiles can be painted to match your walls, providing endless design possibilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 14:19:47','2026-06-08 14:19:47'),(3393,'Genesis Polycarbonate Light Panels','genesis-polycarbonate-light-panels',3390,'Genesis polycarbonate light panels are revolutionary ceiling panels that diffuse light, making them ideal for commercial or residential applications. These ceiling light panels are lightweight, easy to install, and feature a smooth, white finish that will not yellow or corrode. They are made from 100% recyclable materials and come in various sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 14:19:50','2026-06-08 14:19:50'),(3394,'Lay-In Ceiling Tiles','lay-in-ceiling-tiles',3390,'Lay-in ceiling tiles enhance the look of any ceiling while offering easy installation on a suspended grid system. They excel in sound control and fire protection. Lay-in ceiling tiles are suitable for commercial and residential spaces. Color finishes and dimensions vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 14:19:53','2026-06-08 14:19:53'),(3395,'PVC Ceiling Tiles & Grid Framing','pvc-ceiling-tiles-grid-framing',3390,'PVC ceiling tiles and grid framing provide a lightweight, easy-to-install alternative to traditional drop-ceiling systems. They come in a variety of colors, styles, and textures to fit any decor style and offer easy access to pipes and wiring. Quickly enhance the look of any room, office, or store with this durable and cost-effective solution.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 14:19:55','2026-06-08 14:19:55'),(3396,'Mineral Ceiling Tiles & Grid Framing','mineral-ceiling-tiles-grid-framing',3390,'Our premium mineral fiber ceiling tiles and grid framing are ideal for commercial and institutional use. Fire retardant and durable, our mineral ceiling panels come in various colors and styles. The grid framing is available in white and black powder coating to match any setting. Create your desired ceiling design with easy installation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 14:19:58','2026-06-08 14:19:58'),(3397,'Wood Wall Tiles','wood-wall-tiles',3389,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 14:22:38','2026-06-08 14:22:38'),(3398,'Stone Wall Tiles','stone-wall-tiles',3389,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 14:22:41','2026-06-08 14:22:41'),(3399,'Glass Wall Tiles','glass-wall-tiles',3389,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 14:22:44','2026-06-08 14:22:44'),(3400,'Metal Wall Tiles','metal-wall-tiles',3389,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 14:22:47','2026-06-08 14:22:47'),(3401,'Palisade Vinyl Wall Tiles','palisade-vinyl-wall-tiles',3389,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-08 14:22:49','2026-06-08 14:22:49'),(3402,'Safety Swing Gates','safety-swing-gates-1',1222,'Safety swing gates can be added to rails to provide accessibility to equipment while also creating a safer work environment for employees and personnel on manufacturing floors and construction sites. They may be spring-loaded and swing back into place when released, preventing unauthorized entry. Fully adjustable, swing gates can be customized to fit in various spaces. Mezzanine gates provide access to loading docks and other manufacturing areas that are elevated.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-11 09:21:46','2026-06-11 09:21:46'),(3403,'General Purpose Self-Closing Safety Swing Gates','general-purpose-self-closing-safety-swing-gates',3402,'Self-closing safety gates are a great way to protect personnel from hazards in industrial work settings. Crafted from heavy-duty steel or aluminum, these safety swing gates are spring-loaded to swing back into place when released, preventing unauthorized entry. Adjustable Gates allow you to customize your safety needs within your facility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-11 09:22:51','2026-06-11 09:22:51'),(3404,'Mezzanine Safety Swing Gates','mezzanine-safety-swing-gates',3402,'Mezzanine safety gates provide safe access to mezzanine floors, loading docks, and other industrial work areas. These self-closing horizontal gates create a sturdy perimeter around openings and automatically swing closed to prevent falls. Mezzanine gates with EdgeAlert™ systems that flash LED lights and sound an alarm to signal an open door are available. All units meet OSHA requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-11 09:24:13','2026-06-11 09:24:13'),(3405,'Ladder Safety Swing Gates','ladder-safety-swing-gates',3402,'Ladder safety swing gates offer easy access and secure protection on ladders, stairs, and platforms. These industrial ladder safety gates feature an enclosed spring hinge for automatic closing. Made with durable steel, our ladder gates have a highly visible yellow finish and adjustable lengths. All available ladder safety gates are OSHA-compliant and can be mounted on the left or right.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-11 09:24:59','2026-06-11 09:24:59'),(3406,'Safety Barrier Netting','safety-barrier-netting',1222,'Safety barrier netting increases safety by creating a physical barrier to minimize accidents, injuries, or damage. It is easy to install and made of high-strength materials in order to withstand harsh conditions. The mesh design allows for airflow and increased visibility. Safety barrier netting is ideal for construction sites, industrial settings, and manufacturing facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-11 09:26:45','2026-06-11 09:26:45'),(3407,'Portable Safety Netting System','portable-safety-netting-system',3406,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-11 09:27:33','2026-06-11 09:27:33'),(3408,'Loading Dock Netting','loading-dock-netting',3406,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-11 09:28:14','2026-06-11 09:28:14'),(3409,'Chute Netting','chute-netting',3406,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-11 09:28:48','2026-06-11 09:28:48'),(3410,'Bollard Netting','bollard-netting',3406,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-11 09:30:29','2026-06-11 09:30:29'),(3411,'Mezzanine Safety Netting','mezzanine-safety-netting',3406,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-11 09:31:25','2026-06-11 09:31:25'),(3412,'Snow Fencing','snow-fencing',3406,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-11 09:32:02','2026-06-11 09:32:02'),(3413,'Cargo Lift Netting','cargo-lift-netting',3406,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-11 09:32:59','2026-06-11 09:32:59'),(3414,'Topple Barriers','topple-barriers',1222,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-11 09:39:41','2026-06-11 09:39:41'),(3415,'Ideal Warehouse ElephantWall™ Topple Barriers','ideal-warehouse-elephantwall-topple-barriers',3414,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-11 09:40:22','2026-06-11 09:40:22'),(3416,'Wall & Corner Guards','wall-corner-guards',1222,'Wall and corner guards protect wall surfaces from damage caused by impact or abrasion. Bumper guards wrap around corners, mount to surfaces, or fit around pipes for complete protection. They are made from heavy duty materials to ensure years of lasting use. Wall bumper guards are ideal for use in warehouses, manufacturing facilities, and other commercial buildings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-11 09:42:06','2026-06-11 09:42:06'),(3417,'Wedge Anchors','wedge-anchors',6,'Wedge anchors are designed to provide a secure anchor into concrete, brick, and stone surfaces. They are easy to install and are constructed of durable materials for long-lasting dependability. Expanding the wedge anchor allows for strong, permanent installations for concrete foundations and structures in new construction or renovation projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:30:43','2026-06-11 10:30:43'),(3418,'Wall Anchors','wall-anchors',6,'Wall anchors provide additional support and stability when attaching objects to walls, particularly in cases where the wall material may not be strong enough to support the weight or load. Durable drywall anchors prevent damage to the wall and ensure a secure installation. They can be made of metal, plastic, or a combination of materials. Wall anchors are commonly used in construction projects, interior design, and retail or commercial spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:30:47','2026-06-11 10:30:47'),(3419,'Toggle Bolts & Wings','toggle-bolts-wings',6,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:30:50','2026-06-11 10:30:50'),(3420,'T-Anchors','t-anchors',6,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:30:53','2026-06-11 10:30:53'),(3421,'Sleeve Anchors','sleeve-anchors',6,'Sleeve Anchors offer dependable anchoring solutions for concrete or masonry surfaces. Engineered for strength and stability, anchors provide a secure base for fixtures, machinery, or structural elements. Constructed from corrosion-resistant materials such as stainless steel, they ensure long-lasting performance in both indoor and outdoor environments. Sleeve anchors are ideal for contractors, builders, and maintenance professionals in construction, renovation, or industrial projects requiring reliable fastening options.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:30:56','2026-06-11 10:30:56'),(3422,'Screw Anchors','screw-anchors',6,'Screw anchors serve as purpose-built devices intended for insertion into the ground, furnishing stability and support for diverse structures. Suited for deployment in sandy, clayey, and rocky soils, these anchor screws boast ease of installation compared to conventional foundation techniques, minimizing disturbance to the surrounding environment. They are ideal for securing temporary structures, fence installations, playground equipment, and renewable energy projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:31:01','2026-06-11 10:31:01'),(3423,'Pre Expanded Anchors','pre-expanded-anchors',6,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:31:05','2026-06-11 10:31:05'),(3424,'Plastic Anchors','plastic-anchors',6,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:31:10','2026-06-11 10:31:10'),(3425,'Machine Screw Anchors','machine-screw-anchors',6,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:31:14','2026-06-11 10:31:14'),(3426,'Lead Wood Anchors','lead-wood-anchors',6,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:31:17','2026-06-11 10:31:17'),(3427,'Lag Screw Shields','lag-screw-shields',6,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:31:21','2026-06-11 10:31:21'),(3428,'Expansion Anchors','expansion-anchors',6,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:31:24','2026-06-11 10:31:24'),(3429,'Drop In Anchors','drop-in-anchors',6,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:31:29','2026-06-11 10:31:29'),(3430,'Drive Anchors','drive-anchors',6,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:31:37','2026-06-11 10:31:37'),(3431,'Anchor Kits','anchor-kits',6,'Anchor kits are essential for achieving secure fastening in concrete and masonry applications, making them invaluable for construction and DIY projects. These kits include a range of components, such as anchors, bolts, and installation tools, ensuring you have everything needed for reliable installations. Designed for durability and strength, each anchor kit provides stable support for heavy loads and long-lasting performance. With organized packaging for easy access, finding the right anchor for your specific needs is efficient and straightforward.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:31:41','2026-06-11 10:31:41'),(3432,'Adhesive Anchor Injection Systems','adhesive-anchor-injection-systems',7,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:33:25','2026-06-11 10:33:25'),(3433,'Anchor Kits','anchor-kits-1',3431,'Anchor Kits feature a variety of anchors, screws, and essential hardware to securely fasten items to various surfaces. These Anchor Kits ensure reliable support and stability when mounting shelves, hanging artwork, or securing fixtures. Select from a range of anchor sizes and types to meet your specific needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:35:44','2026-06-11 10:35:44'),(3434,'Drywall Anchors','drywall-anchors',3431,'Our Drywall Anchor Kits securely fasten in drywall, offering hassle-free installation. Complete with anchors, screws, and essential hardware, these kits provide reliable holding power and prevent wall damage. Mount shelves, pictures, or decorative items with confidence, as our Drywall Anchor Kits ensure stability and necessary support for your projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:35:47','2026-06-11 10:35:47'),(3435,'Split Drive Anchors','split-drive-anchors',3430,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:37:54','2026-06-11 10:37:54'),(3436,'Nail Anchors','nail-anchors',3430,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:37:58','2026-06-11 10:37:58'),(3437,'Hammer Drive Anchors','hammer-drive-anchors',3430,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:38:01','2026-06-11 10:38:01'),(3438,'Setting Tools for Drop In Anchors','setting-tools-for-drop-in-anchors',3429,'Setting tools for drop-in anchors are durable tools designed to provide secure fastening for overhead installations. Made of durable steel with a zinc finish, these setting tools are used for anchor setting when anchor pins can\'t be reached. Available in various sizes, these tools are ideal for the installation of transformers, ceiling fans, electrical light fixtures, and similar applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:40:01','2026-06-11 10:40:01'),(3439,'Drop In Anchors','drop-in-anchors-1',3429,'Drop-in anchors are designed to secure materials or structures to concrete. Built with steel for durability and corrosion resistance, these anchors are designed for use with heavy-duty materials. Select units are shell-type anchors with internal threading and accommodate handrails, lighting fixtures, piping, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:40:05','2026-06-11 10:40:05'),(3440,'Double Expansion Anchors','double-expansion-anchors',3428,'Double Expansion Anchors are ideal for use in concrete, brick, block, and stone materials. These expansion anchors are made from steel for heavy-duty fastening applications. They feature a corrosion-resistant body and internally threaded anchors for easy removability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:42:12','2026-06-11 10:42:12'),(3441,'Expansion Anchors','expansion-anchors-1',3428,'Expansion anchors effectively attach fixtures to drywall and other surfaces in construction, commercial, DIY, and similar applications. These expansion anchors securely set expansive screw anchors in various materials, regardless of thickness. Made with hardened alloy steel, these anchors come in a range of dimensions to fit your needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:42:16','2026-06-11 10:42:16'),(3442,'Lag Screw Shields','lag-screw-shields-1',3427,'Lag Screw Shields effectively achieve full grip after tightening a lag screw and provide durable fastening solutions. These medium-duty anchors are ideal for use in concrete, brick, and block materials. Constructed from hardened steel with zinc plating, these shields are corrosion-resistant and provide superior holding power.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:44:43','2026-06-11 10:44:43'),(3443,'Lead Wood Anchors','lead-wood-anchors-1',3426,'Lead wood anchors are ideal for anchoring wood to wood, wood to masonry, and other building applications. They feature a lead-filled, malleable body that is easy to install. Lead wood anchors come in various sizes and can be driven flush with the surface for a secure installation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:46:08','2026-06-11 10:46:08'),(3444,'Setting Tools for Machine Screw Anchors','setting-tools-for-machine-screw-anchors',3425,'Setting tools for machine screw anchors are designed to increase the efficiency of installations in construction, commercial, and other settings. Made with steel for long-lasting dependability, these setting tools can be used with machine screws being installed in brick, block, medium-duty concrete, and similar surfaces. Machine screw setting tools are available in various sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:50:32','2026-06-11 10:50:32'),(3445,'Machine Screw Anchors','machine-screw-anchors-1',3425,'Machine Screw Anchors provide secure anchoring for various construction applications. These screw anchors are ideal for use with light to medium-duty concrete, brick, and block materials. They are constructed from steel and are zinc plated for longevity and corrosion resistance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-11 10:50:36','2026-06-11 10:50:36'),(3446,'Fluted Plastic Anchors','fluted-plastic-anchors',3424,'Fluted Plastic Anchors provide easy and secure installation in hollow materials. These plastic anchors are injection-molded with protruding ribs that extend from end to end. Available in various sizes, they are suitable for indoor and outdoor applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 10:19:04','2026-06-12 10:19:04'),(3447,'Conical Plastic Anchors','conical-plastic-anchors',3424,'Conical Plastic Anchors are versatile, economical, and ideal for use in light-duty drywall, concrete, hollow brick, and more. Made of durable high-grade plastic, they are designed to cut threads into base materials. They come in various sizes to suit any job.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 10:19:07','2026-06-12 10:19:07'),(3448,'Ribbed Hollow Wall Plastic Anchors','ribbed-hollow-wall-plastic-anchors',3424,'Ribbed Hollow Wall Plastic Anchors provide a secure hold in hollow wall materials, such as drywall and panel board. They are easily inserted with a screwdriver and feature impact-resistant plastic construction. They come in various sizes and are ideal for light-duty applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 10:19:13','2026-06-12 10:19:13'),(3449,'Ribbed Hollow Wall Plastic Anchors','ribbed-hollow-wall-plastic-anchors-1',3424,'Ribbed Hollow Wall Plastic Anchors provide a secure hold in hollow wall materials, such as drywall and panel board. They are easily inserted with a screwdriver and feature impact-resistant plastic construction. They come in various sizes and are ideal for light-duty applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 10:19:14','2026-06-12 10:19:14'),(3450,'Self-Tapping Concrete Screw Anchors','self-tapping-concrete-screw-anchors',3422,'Self-Tapping Concrete Screw Anchors are ideal for light to medium-duty concrete, block, and brick applications. They feature durable steel construction and various head shapes and styles to suit your needs. These concrete screw anchors can be installed with a power tool and mechanically interlock with the base material.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 10:22:26','2026-06-12 10:22:26'),(3451,'Powers Wedge-Bolt® Screw Anchors','powers-wedge-bolt-screw-anchors',3422,'Powers Wedge-Bolt® Screw Anchors are heavy-duty screw anchors featuring a finished hex head. They are designed for fast, secure installation into high-strength concrete and other durable materials. These screw anchors reduce installation torque, enhance productivity, and are fully removable and vibration-resistant.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 10:22:29','2026-06-12 10:22:29'),(3452,'Concrete Anchors','concrete-anchors',3422,'Concrete Anchors are designed to fasten and support concrete, brick, block, and other heavy materials. They feature corrosion-resistant coating, an induction-hardened tip and are easily reversible and removable. Select units are built with advanced Threadform Technology, providing an alternative to expansion anchors, plugs, and lag shields.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 10:22:32','2026-06-12 10:22:32'),(3453,'Sleeve Expansion Anchors','sleeve-expansion-anchors',3421,'Sleeve expansion anchors are fastening solutions designed to securely anchor objects to concrete, brick, or masonry surfaces. The anchor consists of a sleeve, nut, and washer. The sleeve expands when the nut is tightened, creating a secure grip within the drilled hole. The anchors are ideal for securely mounting fixtures, shelves, brackets, and other objects in construction and building projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 10:31:38','2026-06-12 10:31:38'),(3454,'Sleeve Anchors','sleeve-anchors-1',3421,'Sleeve anchors are sturdy pieces of hardware designed to provide stability during mounting applications in construction, masonry, and similar settings. Made with heavy-duty materials like steel and stainless steel, these anchors come preassembled with a nut and washer and are wrench or pneumatic tool driven. Various size, finish, and head style options are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 10:31:40','2026-06-12 10:31:40'),(3455,'Anchor Kits','anchor-kits-2',3421,'The convenient sleeve anchor kits are designed to easily and securely insert screws into masonry, drywall, and other surfaces. Available in various styles and sizes, these kits include a set of anchors designed to accommodate a range of specific building applications. The number of pieces included and dimensions vary by set.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 10:31:43','2026-06-12 10:31:43'),(3456,'T-Anchors','t-anchors-1',3420,'These T-anchors provide a heavy-duty solution for securing items to walls, ceilings, and floors. Made with durable steel, these anchors feature a large gravity-activated toggle head that helps hold fixtures in place securely. Anchors have a zinc plating finish that ensures superior corrosion resistance and provides enhanced mounting stability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 10:33:24','2026-06-12 10:33:24'),(3457,'Toggle Bolts & Wings','toggle-bolts-wings-1',3419,'Toggle Bolts & Wings provide a secure hold in hollow walls and ceilings. These bolts and wings provide heavy-duty strength and support for plaster, drywall, and other materials. Snap-open action spreads the working load over a greater surface area, and the wings open on the wall backside for increased stability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 10:42:14','2026-06-12 10:42:14'),(3458,'Zip-It® Wallboard Anchors','zip-it-wallboard-anchors',3418,'Zip-It® wallboard anchors are versatile fastening solutions for securely anchoring objects to drywall and other hollow wall materials. They provide a reliable and convenient way to hang items without additional wall supports or studs. The wall anchors are specifically engineered to offer a quick and easy solution for commercial applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 10:47:01','2026-06-12 10:47:01'),(3459,'Hollow Wall Anchors','hollow-wall-anchors',3418,'Hollow Wall Anchors provide reliable support and mounting solutions. Robust steel construction with a zinc finish ensures long-lasting support and durability. Their design makes them ideal for installation in block, wallboard, and other hollow materials. These heavy-duty hollow wall anchors are great for industrial and commercial use. Available in a range of size options.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 10:47:05','2026-06-12 10:47:05'),(3460,'Powers Wall-Dog™ Screw Anchors','powers-wall-dog-screw-anchors',3418,'Powers Wall-Dog™ Screw Anchors provide a secure and versatile way to secure items to drywall. When compared to other screw anchors, Powers Wall-Dog™ anchors can be installed directly into drywall, making for a quick application. Steel construction ensures durability and long-lasting use. Great for use in industrial and commercial environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 10:47:08','2026-06-12 10:47:08'),(3461,'Drywall Anchors','drywall-anchors-1',3418,'Our Drywall Anchor Kits securely fasten in drywall, offering hassle-free installation. Complete with anchors, screws, and essential hardware, these kits provide reliable holding power and prevent wall damage. Mount shelves, pictures, or decorative items with confidence, as our Drywall Anchor Kits ensure stability and necessary support for your projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 10:47:11','2026-06-12 10:47:11'),(3462,'Wedge Anchors - ICC Compliant (ICBO)','wedge-anchors-icc-compliant-icbo',3417,'Wedge Anchors - ICC Compliant are heavy-duty, non-bottom bearing anchors. These anchors are constructed from steel and feature a beveled nail tip and exterior threads for a strong hold in masonry and concrete. They are tamper-proof and corrosion-resistant, providing durable performance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 10:54:24','2026-06-12 10:54:24'),(3463,'Mechanical Wedge Anchors','mechanical-wedge-anchors',3417,'Mechanical Wedge Anchors are quick and easy to install. They provide secure fastening in concrete, block, brick, and stone materials. These wedge anchors are suitable for overhead and vertical applications and come complete and ready to use with nuts and washers.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 10:54:30','2026-06-12 10:54:30'),(3464,'Power-Stud® Wedge Expansion Anchors','power-stud-wedge-expansion-anchors',3417,'Power-Stud® Wedge Expansion Anchors are medium to heavy-duty anchors designed for consistent performance in cracked and uncracked concrete. These anchors are manufactured with a zinc-plated steel body and expansion clip. They are ideal for installation in new construction and renovation projects, and suitable base materials include normal to light-weight concrete and concrete over metal decks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 10:54:33','2026-06-12 10:54:33'),(3465,'Bolts','bolts',5,'Whether you\'re in need of standard or specialty bolts, we have you covered. Explore our comprehensive range of options, including eye bolts, hex tap bolts, carriage bolts, anchor bolts, threaded rods and studs, and more. With an emphasis on durability and performance, our bolts are crafted from premium materials to ensure long-lasting strength and reliability. Trust Global Industrial for all your bolt needs and experience exceptional quality and service.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 11:19:31','2026-06-12 11:19:31'),(3466,'Threaded Rods & Studs','threaded-rods-studs',3465,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 11:40:06','2026-06-12 11:40:06'),(3467,'Structural Bolts','structural-bolts',3465,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 11:40:11','2026-06-12 11:40:11'),(3468,'Square Head Bolts','square-head-bolts',3465,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 11:40:16','2026-06-12 11:40:16'),(3469,'Plow Bolts','plow-bolts',3465,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 11:40:19','2026-06-12 11:40:19'),(3470,'Lag Screws','lag-screws',3465,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 11:40:23','2026-06-12 11:40:23'),(3471,'Hex Tap Bolts','hex-tap-bolts',3465,'Hex Tap Bolts are high-performance bolts designed for secure and durable fastening for construction projects. Built with hexagonal heads, hex bolts offer enhanced grip and torque capabilities, ensuring a reliable connection. They are ideal for structural projects, machinery assembly, or general construction.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 11:40:26','2026-06-12 11:40:26'),(3472,'Hex Bolts','hex-bolts',3465,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 11:40:29','2026-06-12 11:40:29'),(3473,'Hanger Bolts','hanger-bolts',3465,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 11:40:32','2026-06-12 11:40:32'),(3474,'Flange Bolts','flange-bolts',3465,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 11:40:36','2026-06-12 11:40:36'),(3475,'Eye Bolts','eye-bolts',3465,'Eye bolts are strong, reliable fasteners that can be used for anchoring applications, providing a secure point for attaching ropes, cables, or other fasteners to anchor objects to a fixed structure. They are often used for hanging or mounting objects such as lights, signs, and decorations. Made of durable materials such as steel, they can be used in commercial environments, including construction, engineering, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 11:40:40','2026-06-12 11:40:40'),(3476,'Elevator Bolts','elevator-bolts',3465,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 11:40:44','2026-06-12 11:40:44'),(3477,'Clinch Studs','clinch-studs',3465,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 11:40:48','2026-06-12 11:40:48'),(3478,'Carriage Bolts','carriage-bolts',3465,'Carriage bolts feature smooth, domed heads and square necks, preventing rotation during installation. The sturdy construction, threads, and corrosion-resistant finishes, stainless steel carriage bolts provide secure fastening for wood-to-wood and wood-to-metal connections in construction, woodworking, and outdoor projects. Available in various lengths, diameters, finishes, and grades, industrial carriage bolts offer versatility and strength, ensuring dependable performance and long-lasting durability in diverse applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 11:40:52','2026-06-12 11:40:52'),(3479,'Bolt Kits','bolt-kits',3465,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 11:40:54','2026-06-12 11:40:54'),(3480,'Indented Hex','indented-hex',3470,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 11:48:11','2026-06-12 11:48:11'),(3481,'Hex','hex',3470,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 11:48:15','2026-06-12 11:48:15'),(3482,'Closed Eye','closed-eye',3470,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 11:48:18','2026-06-12 11:48:18'),(3483,'Cabinet & Drawer Hardware','cabinet-drawer-hardware',5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 11:50:24','2026-06-12 11:50:24'),(3484,'Pulls, Handles & Knobs','pulls-handles-knobs',3483,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 11:53:25','2026-06-12 11:53:25'),(3485,'Door & Window Hardware','door-window-hardware-1',5,'Browse through our diverse collection of high-quality products to find the perfect hardware for your doors & windows. Our inventory includes roof hatch safety railings & ladders, door closers, door locksets, door thresholds, exit alarm push bars, panic bars, window guards, weather stripping & more. Our products are crafted with precision and designed to withstand the test of time, ensuring long-lasting performance and customer satisfaction.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:02:46','2026-06-12 12:02:46'),(3486,'Window Rollers','window-rollers-1',3485,'Window rollers and guides streamline the window maintenance process, ensuring smooth operation for residential and commercial settings. Engineered with durability and user-friendliness in mind, these products provide reliable performance. Manufactured from high-quality materials, they withstand daily wear and tear for long-lasting use. Whether upgrading existing windows or installing new ones, window rollers and guides offer dependable solutions for industrial and commercial environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:19:02','2026-06-12 12:19:02'),(3487,'Window Operators','window-operators-1',3485,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:19:07','2026-06-12 12:19:07'),(3488,'Window Locks','window-locks-1',3485,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:19:11','2026-06-12 12:19:11'),(3489,'Window Guards','window-guards-1',3485,'Window guards prevent accidental falls by providing a protective barrier for windows, ensuring the safety of people in multi-story buildings. They also act as a deterrent against unauthorized entry and burglary attempts. Window guards are manufactured from steel to ensure durability and resistance to tampering and are ideal for commercial properties, schools, warehouses, and other industrial spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:19:15','2026-06-12 12:19:15'),(3490,'Weather Stripping','weather-stripping-1',3485,'Weather strippings are flexible materials used to seal gaps and prevent air and moisture infiltration around doors, windows, and other openings in buildings. They reduce energy loss, block drafts, dust, insects, and noise, and improve insulation. Weather strippings are easy to install and come in various forms, including adhesive-backed strips, foam tapes, and door sweeps. They are commonly used in residential, commercial, and industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:19:19','2026-06-12 12:19:19'),(3491,'Weather Strip Tape','weather-strip-tape-2',3485,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:19:23','2026-06-12 12:19:23'),(3492,'Viewers','viewers-1',3485,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:19:28','2026-06-12 12:19:28'),(3493,'Tub & Shower Door Hardware','tub-shower-door-hardware-1',3485,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:19:32','2026-06-12 12:19:32'),(3494,'Thresholds','thresholds-1',3485,'Thresholds are strips that are installed at the bottom of doorways to prevent drafts and debris from entering buildings. They have raised lips or seals for weatherproofing and come in different sizes and materials to fit different door widths and flooring types. Thresholds help to improve energy efficiency, enhance safety, and prolong the lifespan of flooring by sealing gaps and preventing water damage to residential and commercial establishments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:19:36','2026-06-12 12:19:36'),(3495,'Sliding Door Hardware','sliding-door-hardware-2',3485,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:19:40','2026-06-12 12:19:40'),(3496,'Roof Hatch Guard Rails','roof-hatch-guard-rails-1',3485,'Roof hatch guard rails are used to ensure safety and OSHA compliance when working on rooftops. They consist of railings, guard rails, ladder safety posts, and ladders to ensure safety and secure access to rooftop workspaces. These safety products will also help protect personnel from falls and provide an ideal rooftop safety solution. Roof hatch guard rails are typically used in construction sites, industrial work settings, and rooftop maintenance areas like HVAC ventilation areas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:19:44','2026-06-12 12:19:44'),(3497,'Plates & Braces','plates-braces-1',3485,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:19:47','2026-06-12 12:19:47'),(3498,'Patio Door Handles','patio-door-handles-2',3485,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:19:52','2026-06-12 12:19:52'),(3499,'Openers','openers-1',3485,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:19:55','2026-06-12 12:19:55'),(3500,'Locksets','locksets-1',3485,'Door locksets are designed to keep any door locked and secure. Deadbolts, digital door locks, and heavy-duty levers are all durable and made for years of reliable use. Locksets can be used on any indoor or outside door to help increase safety. Ideal for any office, home or business.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:20:00','2026-06-12 12:20:00'),(3501,'Letter Slots','letter-slots-1',3485,'Letter slots, also known as mail slots or letter flaps, serve as a convenient and secure means for mail delivery directly into a building or residence. They offer protection against adverse weather conditions, preventing rain, snow, or wind from affecting the delivered mail. Letter slots are constructed with durable materials such as aluminum and galvanized steel, ensuring longevity and resistance to wear over time making them ideal for commercial properties, including offices and businesses.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:20:04','2026-06-12 12:20:04'),(3502,'Hinges','hinges-1',3485,'Hinges are essential mechanical components that enable the controlled rotation or movement of doors, windows, gates, and other objects. They provide a pivot point, allowing for the opening and closing of structures while maintaining stability, durability, and ease of operation. The hinges come in various materials, including aluminum, brass, bronze, and stainless steel. Hinges are commonly used in commercial settings for doors, windows, cabinetry, and industrial equipment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:20:08','2026-06-12 12:20:08'),(3503,'Grilles','grilles-1',3485,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:20:12','2026-06-12 12:20:12'),(3504,'Exit Devices','exit-devices-1',3485,'Exit devices, also known as panic bars or exit bars, serve a vital purpose in commercial and public buildings by facilitating safe and rapid exit during emergencies. Fire-rated exit devices meet fire safety regulations and enhance overall building safety in the event of a fire. They are constructed from durable materials, ensuring the devices withstand the rigors of frequent use and provide long-lasting reliability. They are ideal for commercial buildings, public spaces, and industrial facilities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:20:16','2026-06-12 12:20:16'),(3505,'Door Stops','door-stops-1',3485,'Door stops protect walls and furniture from being damaged by swinging doors and kick downs are used to prop doors open and ensure ease of traffic flow. Cabinet and door stops come in various sizes, materials, and colors, with wall-mounted and floor options available. Heavy-duty door stops are perfect for offices, medical facilities, schools, and other commercial environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:20:21','2026-06-12 12:20:21'),(3506,'Closet Door Hardware','closet-door-hardware-2',3485,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:20:25','2026-06-12 12:20:25'),(3507,'Closers','closers-1',3485,'Door closers are designed to guarantee controlled and seamless door closing, preventing slamming and minimizing wear and tear on the door and its components. With adjustable closing speeds, many closers offer users the ability to regulate the door\'s closing pace. Additionally, the backcheck feature ensures doors do not open too swiftly or forcefully, safeguarding both the door and the closer. These door closers are essential for commercial buildings, offices, and retail spaces, maintaining controlled access and enhancing security.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:20:30','2026-06-12 12:20:30'),(3508,'Closet Door Hardware','closet-door-hardware-3',3506,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:22:06','2026-06-12 12:22:06'),(3509,'Miscellaneous Door Hardware','miscellaneous-door-hardware-3',3505,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:31:04','2026-06-12 12:31:04'),(3510,'Miscellaneous Door Hardware','miscellaneous-door-hardware-4',3505,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:31:07','2026-06-12 12:31:07'),(3511,'Wall & Floor Stops','wall-floor-stops-2',3505,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:31:10','2026-06-12 12:31:10'),(3512,'Wall & Floor Stops','wall-floor-stops-3',3505,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:31:13','2026-06-12 12:31:13'),(3513,'Door Mail Drop Boxes - Commercial & Residential','door-mail-drop-boxes-commercial-residential-1',3501,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:49:01','2026-06-12 12:49:01'),(3514,'Thru-the-Wall Secure Package Drop Vaults','thru-the-wall-secure-package-drop-vaults-1',3501,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:49:05','2026-06-12 12:49:05'),(3515,'Patio Door Handles','patio-door-handles-3',3498,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:51:34','2026-06-12 12:51:34'),(3516,'Miscellaneous Door Hardware','miscellaneous-door-hardware-5',3497,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:56:59','2026-06-12 12:56:59'),(3517,'Repair And Replacement Reinforcement Plates/Braces','repair-and-replacement-reinforcement-platesbraces-1',3497,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:57:03','2026-06-12 12:57:03'),(3518,'Push, Pull, & Filler Plates','push-pull-filler-plates-1',3497,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-12 12:57:06','2026-06-12 12:57:06'),(3519,'Surface Bumper Guards','surface-bumper-guards',3416,'Ensure safety with Surface Bumper Guards to protect walls, corners, and equipment from impact. Designed for commercial, industrial, and security applications, these bumper guards offer a buffer zone for people, machines and objects. The bumper guard is durable and weather resistant, absorbing hard impacts and preventing injury and damage. Available in various mount types, dimensions, and colors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 10:36:05','2026-06-15 10:36:05'),(3520,'Edge Bumper Guards','edge-bumper-guards',3416,'Safeguard surfaces with Global Industrial Edge Bumper Guards. These bumper guards include black and yellow warning markings to help reduce accidents and highlight danger at edges, gaps and obstacles at high-risk corners. Bumper Guards absorb hard impacts and includes adhesive for long-lasting adherence to many different surfaces. Dimensions vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 10:36:59','2026-06-15 10:36:59'),(3521,'Corner Bumper Guards','corner-bumper-guards',3416,'These Corner Bumper Guards serve as a buffer zone, effectively absorbing hard impacts and preventing injuries and damages. Whether it\'s in high-traffic areas, hallways, corridors, or around machinery, forklifts, and shelves, these guards provide a crucial layer of defense. Designed for both indoor and outdoor use, they offer reliable protection in a wide range of environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 10:40:00','2026-06-15 10:40:00'),(3522,'Flat Head Carriage Bolts','flat-head-carriage-bolts',3478,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 10:44:48','2026-06-15 10:44:48'),(3523,'Round Head Carriage Bolts - Grade 5','round-head-carriage-bolts-grade-5',3478,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 10:44:52','2026-06-15 10:44:52'),(3524,'Self Clinching Stud 12 Rib Full Thread 300 Series Stainless Steel','self-clinching-stud-12-rib-full-thread-300-series-stainless-steel',3477,'Self Clinching Studs 12 Rib Full Thread 300 Series Stainless Steel have a secure hold in punched or drilled holes. These Self Clinching Studs are made of durable stainless steel. The 12-rib design provides extra stability, while full-threading allows for secure installation. Available in various package quantities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 10:54:56','2026-06-15 10:54:56'),(3525,'Self Clinching Stud Full Thread Hardened Steel Heat Zinc And Bake','self-clinching-stud-full-thread-hardened-steel-heat-zinc-and-bake',3477,'Self Clinching Studs are made from full thread Hardened Steel with a heat zinc and bake finish. Self-clinching studs press-fit into holes and can be embedded in sheet metal or brackets for a secure hold. This durable and reliable hardened steel is a fastening solution for various applications. Lightweight and affordable, they are perfect for low/medium torque applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 10:55:00','2026-06-15 10:55:00'),(3526,'Elevator Bolts - Zinc','elevator-bolts-zinc',3476,'These elevator bolts are specifically designed to hold together conveyor system canvas belts, secure flooring, and serve as leveling legs in commercial settings. Zinc elevator bolts feature a wide flat head, a shallow conical bearing surface, and a unified thread pitch for durability. The fasteners include a square neck to prevent the bolt from twisting during adjustments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:02:13','2026-06-15 11:02:13'),(3527,'Zinc Plated Steel Eye Bolts','zinc-plated-steel-eye-bolts',3475,'Zinc plated steel eye bolts are reliable for securing loads or creating steadfast connections in demanding industrial environments. The steel eye bolt is made of low carbon steel and has rolled machine threads, making it ideal for various fastening applications. Zinc plated eye bolts have a circular eye design on the non-threaded end, providing exceptional strength to support cable attachments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:12:29','2026-06-15 11:12:29'),(3528,'Long Shank','long-shank',3475,'Long Shank Eye Bolts are designed for heavy-duty anchoring, and are made from drop forged stainless steel for durability and corrosion resistance. These eye bolts feature a variety of shank lengths and diameters, which allows for a more secure attachment. These fully threaded eye bolts are ideal for heavier loads or situations requiring a more secure fixing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:12:31','2026-06-15 11:12:31'),(3529,'316 Stainless Steel Eye Bolts','316-stainless-steel-eye-bolts',3475,'These steel eye bolts are forged with stainless steel and include passivated or electropolished finish. Fully threaded, reliable, and corrosion-resistant, these eye bolts are ideal for versatile applications. Available in various sizes to fit any job, these stainless steel eye bolts come with and without shoulders.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:12:34','2026-06-15 11:12:34'),(3530,'Swing Bolt','swing-bolt',3475,'Swing Bolt Eye Bolts are made from forged, galvanized steel for strength, durability, and weather resistance. Swing bolts feature a pre-assembled lag thread, and a circular eye loop. These eyebolts are ideal for securing lines and other hanging applications. They are suitable for most commercial and light industrial applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:12:37','2026-06-15 11:12:37'),(3531,'Fine Thread Carbon Steel Eye Bolts','fine-thread-carbon-steel-eye-bolts',3475,'Fine Thread Carbon Steel Eye Bolts are high-quality bolts ideal for various applications, such as anchoring for chains or ropes. The drop-forged carbon steel construction ensures durability. A fully threaded design allows for secure fastening. These eye bolts are available in both a plain finish or zinc plated finish for rust resistance. Shank length varies.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:12:40','2026-06-15 11:12:40'),(3532,'Long Shank Carbon Steel Eye Bolts','long-shank-carbon-steel-eye-bolts',3475,'Long Shank Carbon Steel Eye Bolts are a heavy-duty anchoring solution. These eye bolts are made of forged carbon steel for durability. The long shank Eye Bolts are ideal for boat rigging, lifting, tie-downs, and creating top loops. Their long shank construction and higher thread engagement enhance the safety and reliability of installed loads.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:12:43','2026-06-15 11:12:43'),(3533,'8 & 6 TPI Carbon Steel Eye Bolts','8-6-tpi-carbon-steel-eye-bolts',3475,'8 & 6 TPI Carbon Steel Eye Bolts provide heavy-duty anchoring for chain or wire rope to fixed surfaces. Eye Bolts are made from carbon steel to ensure durability and strength. These carbon steel eye bolts come in a variety of sizes for a range of applications, and are fully threaded for secure fastening. Perfect for any job requiring secure anchoring and support.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:12:50','2026-06-15 11:12:50'),(3534,'Shoulder Pattern Nut Eyebolts','shoulder-pattern-nut-eyebolts',3475,'Shoulder pattern Nut Eyebolts are durable steel eyebolts with a galvanized finish for corrosion resistance. Available in standard and custom sizes, they can accommodate heavy loads. Shoulder design allows for flush mounting and surface clearance. Easy to install and secure. These nut eyebolts are great for lifting, rigging, suspending objects, anchoring points, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:12:52','2026-06-15 11:12:52'),(3535,'Zinc Plated Carbon Steel Eye Bolts','zinc-plated-carbon-steel-eye-bolts',3475,'Zinc Plated Carbon Steel Eye Bolts are perfect for heavy-duty anchoring. These eye bolts are extremely durable due to zinc plating for corrosion resistance. Units are fully threaded and available in plain or shoulder patterns. They come in various sizes, ensuring the perfect fit for your needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:12:55','2026-06-15 11:12:55'),(3536,'Galvanized Carbon Steel Eye Bolts','galvanized-carbon-steel-eye-bolts',3475,'These eye bolts are designed for heavy-duty anchoring applications. Made with galvanized carbon steel for superior corrosion resistance, these eye bolts feature an eye shape that forms a tight closed loop for easy attachment. These galvanized carbon steel eye bolts are fully threaded to ensure secure fastening and are available in various sizes with shoulder or plain patterns.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:12:58','2026-06-15 11:12:58'),(3537,'Plain Pattern Nut Eyebolts','plain-pattern-nut-eyebolts',3475,'Our Plain Pattern Nut Eyebolts feature a durable steel construction and a variety of finishes such as hot dip galvanized and passivated/electropolished. Dimensions vary per model, making these eye bolts great for various applications. Other features include a self-locking nut that helps reduce loosening and fatigue failures.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:13:01','2026-06-15 11:13:01'),(3538,'Standard Carbon Steel Eye Bolts','standard-carbon-steel-eye-bolts',3475,'Standard Carbon Steel Eye Bolts are fully threaded with a self-colored finish. Eye bolts are all manufactured from carbon steel and feature a variety of sizes, lengths, and capacities. They are covered in a zinc-plated finish for maximum corrosion resistance. Perfect for rigging and lifting, they are designed to hold heavy loads.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:13:05','2026-06-15 11:13:05'),(3539,'8620 Alloy Steel Eye Bolts','8620-alloy-steel-eye-bolts',3475,'These 8620 alloy steel eye bolts are heavy-duty fasteners that come in various styles and sizes to meet a wide variety of needs. Each bolt is meticulously manufactured with alloy steel and coated with a protective black oxide finish. With their exceptional strength, these bolts are perfect for demanding tasks, ensuring a dependable and steadfast connection for all fastening needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:13:08','2026-06-15 11:13:08'),(3540,'Metric Carbon Steel Eye Bolts','metric-carbon-steel-eye-bolts',3475,'Metric Carbon Steel Eye Bolts have a self-colored finish and are fully threaded for a secure fit. These eye bolts are made from high-grade carbon steel for outstanding durability and strength. Many sizes are available to fit specific load requirements. Ideal for tensioning, suspension, and other rigging applications. Available in metric ISO standards for versatility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:13:11','2026-06-15 11:13:11'),(3541,'Metric Flange Bolts - Class 10.9','metric-flange-bolts-class-109',3474,'These metric flange bolts are high-quality, durable solutions for compressing force over large surface areas in metalworking applications. These Class 10.9 metric flange bolts feature a hexagonal shape, a broad surface area below the unit head, and a bolt nozzle. Lightweight yet sturdy, these flange bolts are made with casted steel for durability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:21:50','2026-06-15 11:21:50'),(3542,'Metric Flange Bolts - Class 8.8','metric-flange-bolts-class-88',3474,'Class 8.8 Metric Flange Bolts are heavy-duty bolts with load-spreading washer-like faces. Ideal for construction, automotive, industrial, and plumbing projects. Metric Flange Bolts are available in zinc or a plain finish for corrosion resistance. They vary in sizes and lengths.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:21:53','2026-06-15 11:21:53'),(3543,'Flange Bolts - Indented Hex Washer - Serrated','flange-bolts-indented-hex-washer-serrated',3474,'Flange Bolts- Indented Hex Washer-Serrated are heavy-duty bolts with a serrated washer head for increased torque and reduced surface damage. These Flange Bolts are made of stainless steel with a zinc finish for corrosion resistance. Ideal for automotive and construction projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:21:56','2026-06-15 11:21:56'),(3544,'Flange Bolts - Hex & 12 Point Head','flange-bolts-hex-12-point-head',3474,'These flange bolts are designed to spread clamping force over large surface areas. Twelve-point flange bolts, or ferry cap screws, feature a compact head with twelve triangular points and can efficiently distribute torque. Available in various sizes, they are reliable, cost-effective, and suitable for industrial applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:21:59','2026-06-15 11:21:59'),(3545,'Open Eye Bolt Machine Screws Thread','open-eye-bolt-machine-screws-thread',3473,'Open Eye Bolt Machine Screws are versatile fasteners designed for quick and easy hanging. Available in multiple sizes and lengths, they feature an open-eye design that allows users to connect a variety of objects. These screws are zinc-plated for rust resistance and double-threaded to offer a secure connection. They\'re great for lifting, suspending, and anchoring objects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:24:38','2026-06-15 11:24:38'),(3546,'Hanger Bolt Fully Threaded','hanger-bolt-fully-threaded',3473,'Fully Threaded Hanger Bolts are durable, versatile, and ideal for hanging objects from wooden structures. Available in stainless steel and zinc finishes, these hanger bolts are used for hanging pipes, signs, furniture, equipment, and electrical wiring. They are easy to install and come in multiple packaging quantities. Diameters and thread pitches vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:24:41','2026-06-15 11:24:41'),(3547,'Hex Machine Bolts','hex-machine-bolts',3472,'Hex Machine Bolts are versatile and reliable fasteners for various applications. They are available in multiple materials, diameters, lengths, and head types. Perfect for repair or construction projects, furniture assembly, machinery assembly, automotive repairs, and other heavy-duty applications. Hex Bolts provide strong fastening results as well as easy installation and removal.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:31:00','2026-06-15 11:31:00'),(3548,'Hex Tap Bolts - Grade A','hex-tap-bolts-grade-a',3471,'Hex Tap Bolts Grade A are heavy-duty bolts used for various applications. Hex Tap Bolts have a hexagonal head and a full-body thread designed for tapping into a pre-tapped hole in one application. Grade A hex bolts are for general-purpose connections requiring moderate strength. Available in flanged, fine, and coarse thread, with a variety of small diameters and lengths.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:35:23','2026-06-15 11:35:23'),(3549,'Metric Hex Tap Bolts','metric-hex-tap-bolts',3471,'Metric Hex Tap Bolts are fasteners with a threaded end and a 6-sided head, used in various applications. Available in multiple sizes and threading styles, metric hex bolts offer a strong, secure solution for different mounting options. All metric tap bolts are made from high-strength materials for maximum durability and are designed for easy installation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:35:25','2026-06-15 11:35:25'),(3550,'Hex Tap Bolts Grade 5','hex-tap-bolts-grade-5',3471,'Hex Tap Bolts Grade 5 are high-grade bolts made from medium carbon steel alloy, plated with zinc and yellow chromate to offer a secure and strong hold. These versatile bolts are ideal for tightening machine parts, automotive components, and other general-purpose applications. Grade 5 hex bolts come in various sizes to fit your job and contain UNC threads.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:35:28','2026-06-15 11:35:28'),(3551,'Hex Tap Bolts','hex-tap-bolts-1',3471,'Hex Tap Bolts are high-quality fastening solutions for industrial applications. Hex Tap Bolts feature a six-sided head for secure wrench engagement and are designed for general purpose and structural bolting. Bolts are available in different sizes and in either a zinc-plated or stainless steel finish. Coarse and fine thread types are available to suit a variety of projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:35:32','2026-06-15 11:35:32'),(3552,'Hex Tap Bolts Grade 8','hex-tap-bolts-grade-8',3471,'Hex Tap Bolts Grade 8 are heavy-duty bolts manufactured to the highest industry standards. Bolts are made of corrosion-resistant grade 8 carbon steel, ideal for tough jobs. These grade 8 hex bolts feature a square, 6-sided head for a secure fit and added strength. Hex Tap Bolts securely fasten any material with both external and internal threads to create strong joints in various applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:35:35','2026-06-15 11:35:35'),(3553,'Closed Eye Screws','closed-eye-screws',3482,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:37:44','2026-06-15 11:37:44'),(3554,'Grade 5 Plow Bolts','grade-5-plow-bolts',3469,'Grade 5 Plow Bolts are flange bolts with a built-in washer face. Plow bolts are used in structural bolted joints and provide fastener strength, preventing the head from splitting timber. These bolts have a larger head and spaced ribs to improve the grip. Grade 5 Plow Bolts are cost-effective for many industrial and commercial projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:39:56','2026-06-15 11:39:56'),(3555,'Grade 8 Plow Bolts','grade-8-plow-bolts',3469,'Grade 8 Plow Bolts are designed for heavy-duty applications and feature larger diameter heads and larger diameters after tapping. Ideal for attaching the plow cutting edge to the plow beam. Grade 8 bolts are made with high-grade heat-treated alloy steel, are zinc-plated for extra corrosion resistance, and meet the ASTM A325 specification.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:40:00','2026-06-15 11:40:00'),(3556,'Square Head Bolts','square-head-bolts-1',3468,'Square Head Bolts are essential for heavy-duty projects. These bolts are designed to be stronger than standard bolts and feature a square-shaped head, which adds protection and makes them easier to grip when installing or removing. Square-headed bolts are great for fastening steel plates and ensuring they stay secure. Bolts are available in various materials and sizes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:43:15','2026-06-15 11:43:15'),(3557,'Hex Structural Bolts','hex-structural-bolts',3467,'Hex structural bolts are heavy-duty fasteners designed to create strong joints. Ideal for industrial settings, these high-quality hex bolts have a hexagonal head and are made from various materials, including stainless steel, carbon steel, and alloy steel. Uniquely designed, these structural hex bolts provide long-lasting performance in high-pressure environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:47:04','2026-06-15 11:47:04'),(3558,'B-7 Alloy','b-7-alloy',3466,'B-7 alloy steel threaded rods and studs are designed for use as anchor bolts, eyebolts, hooks, tie rods, and more in manual and automated assembly. These steel fasteners are made with a pre-tempered and pre-heat-treated process that offers superior dimensional accuracy. They are excellent for high-temperature, high-pressure, and corrosive environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 11:54:09','2026-06-15 11:54:09'),(3559,'Corner Bumper GuardsCorner Bumper Guards','corner-bumper-guardscorner-bumper-guards',3416,'These Corner Bumper Guards serve as a buffer zone, effectively absorbing hard impacts and preventing injuries and damages. Whether it\'s in high-traffic areas, hallways, corridors, or around machinery, forklifts, and shelves, these guards provide a crucial layer of defense. Designed for both indoor and outdoor use, they offer reliable protection in a wide range of environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 11:54:34','2026-06-15 11:54:34'),(3560,'Radius Corner Guards','radius-corner-guards',3416,'Reinforce corner surfaces with Radius Corner Guards. These durable polyurethane foam corner guards offer impact resistance and corrosion resistance. Ideal for commercial properties, corporate buildings, and medical facilities. Corner guards provide impact resistance and furniture corner protection against damage and user injury. Choose various types and mounting options for your specific needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 11:55:47','2026-06-15 11:55:47'),(3561,'Pipe Bumper Guards','pipe-bumper-guards',3416,'Enhance safety by marking pipes and other curved obstacles with Pipe Bumper Guards. A pipe guard offers impact resistance in various applications. With a variety of vibrant colors, our pipe guards provide high visibility for enhanced safety. These pipe guards include mounting accessories for easy installation, and various mount types are available. Dimensions vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 11:56:35','2026-06-15 11:56:35'),(3562,'Corner Guards','corner-guards-1',3416,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 11:57:22','2026-06-15 11:57:22'),(3563,'Wheel Alignment Guides','wheel-alignment-guides',1222,'Wheel alignment guides are designed to safely guide reversing truck trailers into the loading dock to load or unload shipments. They also help to avoid collisions with trailers parked at neighboring docks. They are made with durable steel and are ideal for any commercial loading dock facility. The high visibility yellow color of the wheel alignment guides enhances visibility in low-light conditions, guiding drivers with precision. The guides streamline the alignment process, reducing the risk of accidents and increasing operational efficiency.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 12:00:40','2026-06-15 12:00:40'),(3564,'Ideal Warehouse Loading Dock Wheel Alignment Guides','ideal-warehouse-loading-dock-wheel-alignment-guides',3563,'Designed for installation on both sides of the loading dock approach, Ideal Warehouse Loading Dock Wheel Alignment Guides help truck drivers safely back into loading docks and reduce potential damage to the vehicle or building. They help ensure wheels are in the proper position with a bright yellow coloring that provides clear visibility for increased safety.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 12:01:37','2026-06-15 12:01:37'),(3565,'Vestil Wheel Alignment Curbs','vestil-wheel-alignment-curbs',3563,'Featuring heavy-duty welded steel construction for strength and durability in all environments, Vestil Wheel Alignment Curbs allow truck drivers to properly align their trailers when backing into a loading dock, helping to reduce the risk of damage to buildings and vehicles, with a yellow powder-coat finish that provides protection from the elements and high visibility.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 12:02:33','2026-06-15 12:02:33'),(3566,'Wire Security Rooms & Partitions','wire-security-rooms-partitions',1222,'Wire security rooms are specialized enclosures designed to provide secure and controlled access areas within industrial and commercial settings. They are constructed using durable wire mesh panels that offer strength and visibility, allowing for clear, unobstructed views of items within the enclosure. Wire security rooms are typically used in warehouses, distribution centers, and manufacturing facilities where controlled access areas are needed to safeguard valuable assets, sensitive equipment, or hazardous materials.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 12:07:37','2026-06-15 12:07:37'),(3567,'Preconfigured Wire Security Rooms','preconfigured-wire-security-rooms',3566,'Preconfigured Wire security rooms are specialized enclosures designed to provide secure and controlled access areas within industrial and commercial settings. They are constructed using durable wire mesh panels that offer strength and visibility, allowing for clear, unobstructed views of items within the enclosure. Wire security rooms are typically used in warehouses, distribution centers, and manufacturing facilities where controlled access areas are needed to safeguard valuable assets, sensitive equipment, or hazardous materials.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 12:08:38','2026-06-15 12:08:38'),(3568,'Global Industrial™ Preconfigured Wire Mesh Security Rooms','global-industrial-preconfigured-wire-mesh-security-rooms',3567,'Global Industrial Preconfigured Wire Mesh Security Rooms provide a secure, enclosed space for storage of high-value equipment and inventory. Security rooms are constructed with durable wire mesh panels for maximum visibility and ventilation while still providing a secure barrier against unauthorized access. These rooms are perfect for use in warehouses, factories, and other industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 12:09:27','2026-06-15 12:09:27'),(3569,'Global Industrial™ Preconfigured Wire Mesh Security Rooms','global-industrial-preconfigured-wire-mesh-security-rooms-1',3567,'Global Industrial Preconfigured Wire Mesh Security Rooms provide a secure, enclosed space for storage of high-value equipment and inventory. Security rooms are constructed with durable wire mesh panels for maximum visibility and ventilation while still providing a secure barrier against unauthorized access. These rooms are perfect for use in warehouses, factories, and other industrial settings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 12:10:33','2026-06-15 12:10:33'),(3570,'WireCrafters® Driver Access Security Cages','wirecrafters-driver-access-security-cages',3567,'WireCrafters® Driver Access Security Cages provide industrial companies a space to keep truck drivers, and delivery personnel secluded in one place when entering the warehouse or making a delivery. Made from heavy-duty 10 gauge woven wire, these cages are designed with a variety of locking options so you could rest assured that the valuable assets in your warehouse are safe and secure.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 12:12:15','2026-06-15 12:12:15'),(3571,'RapidWire™ Preconfigured Welded Wire Security Rooms','rapidwire-preconfigured-welded-wire-security-rooms',3567,'With a variety of configurations available, RapidWire™ Preconfigured Welded Wire Security Rooms can be customized to meet the specific needs of any industrial setting. Made of high-quality welded wire mesh panels, and a 3-point locking system for extra security making them ideal for use in warehouses, data centers or any areas where sensitive equipment needs to be secured.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 12:13:15','2026-06-15 12:13:15'),(3572,'WireCrafters® Preconfigured Woven Wire Security Rooms','wirecrafters-preconfigured-woven-wire-security-rooms',3567,'WireCrafters® Preconfigured Woven Wire Security Rooms provide maximum security and visibility for any industrial setting. These security rooms come preconfigured and are easy to assemble, making them perfect for a variety of applications. Designed with durability and dependability in mind, these heavy-duty woven wire mesh panels are the ultimate solution for your security needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 12:15:51','2026-06-15 12:15:51'),(3573,'Wire Partition Hardware','wire-partition-hardware',3566,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 12:16:58','2026-06-15 12:16:58'),(3574,'Global Industrial™ Wire Partition HardwareWire Partition Hardware','global-industrial-wire-partition-hardwarewire-partition-hardware',3573,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 12:17:39','2026-06-15 12:17:39'),(3575,'Husky Rack & Wire™ Partition Panel Hardware','husky-rack-wire-partition-panel-hardware',3573,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 12:18:38','2026-06-15 12:18:38'),(3576,'WireCrafters® RapidWire™ Wire Partition Hardware','wirecrafters-rapidwire-wire-partition-hardware',3573,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 12:19:20','2026-06-15 12:19:20'),(3577,'Wire Partition Systems','wire-partition-systems',3566,'Wire Partition Systems are designed to section off areas in a warehouse, industrial facility, or stockroom to house and secure valuable tools and equipment. Partition systems feature strong, durable heavy-gauge wire mesh construction that provides an unobstructed view and air circulation, and mounting hardware is included to firmly affix the security partition system to the floor for permanent installation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 12:40:40','2026-06-15 12:40:40'),(3578,'Global Industrial™ Wire Mesh Partition System','global-industrial-wire-mesh-partition-system',3577,'Global Industrial wire mesh security partitions allow for unrestricted ventilation and layout flexibility. Adjustable panels allow for easy customization, connecting panels up to 12\" apart. These partitions are easily removable and configurable, offering convenience. Made with 10-gauge wire woven in a 1-1/2\" diamond pattern, floor sockets, nuts, and bolts are included for hassle-free installation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 12:41:39','2026-06-15 12:41:39'),(3579,'WireCrafters® RapidWire™ Woven Wire Partition System','wirecrafters-rapidwire-woven-wire-partition-system',3577,'WireCrafters wire mesh partitions allow you to design a custom durable partition system. Made of steel woven wire with a wet enamel gray finish these wire mesh partition systems are ideal for any industrial or manufacturing space. Wire mesh doors, mounting brackets, and various panel sizes are available to help meet any storage needs. Adjustable panels can be anywhere from 1-11\" to help fill gaps.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 12:42:33','2026-06-15 12:42:33'),(3580,'WireCrafters® RapidWire™ Welded Wire Partition System','wirecrafters-rapidwire-welded-wire-partition-system',3577,'RapidWire welded wire partition panels allow you to build partitions of your desired size. Wire panels are made of sheet metal with a powder gray coating for long lasting durability. Panels can be stacked to wall heights and bolted to posts using standard hand tools. Full line of hinged, double hinged, and sliding doors available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 12:43:30','2026-06-15 12:43:30'),(3581,'Husky Rack & Wire Welded Wire Security Partition System','husky-rack-wire-welded-wire-security-partition-system',3577,'Husky Rack & Wire security cages provide reliable security for areas within your warehouse. From the posts and panels to the interior attachments and easy pin assembly, Husky’s welded wire cages are easy and quick to assemble and modify in the field. Our interior panel-to-posts attachments provide a better level of security than standard (bolted) wire partitions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-15 12:44:27','2026-06-15 12:44:27'),(3582,'Prime-Line Window Guards','prime-line-window-guards-1',3489,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 13:17:55','2026-06-15 13:17:55'),(3583,'RapidWire™ Security Window Guards','rapidwire-security-window-guards-1',3489,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 13:17:57','2026-06-15 13:17:57'),(3584,'Sash Locks','sash-locks-1',3488,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 13:19:09','2026-06-15 13:19:09'),(3585,'Prime-Line Sash Locks - Tilt Latches','prime-line-sash-locks-tilt-latches-1',3488,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 13:19:13','2026-06-15 13:19:13'),(3586,'Fastener & Hardware Kits','fastener-hardware-kits',5,'Whether you\'re in need of screws, bolts, nuts, washers, or other essential fasteners, you\'ll find a wide range of options suitable for various applications. Our diverse inventory caters to different industries and requirements, offering durable and reliable solutions. With Global Industrial, you can trust that our fastener hardware kits will help you achieve optimal performance, efficiency, and safety in your projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-15 13:23:36','2026-06-15 13:23:36'),(3587,'Wood Screw Kits','wood-screw-kits',3586,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:21:59','2026-06-16 10:21:59'),(3588,'Washer Kits','washer-kits',3586,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:22:01','2026-06-16 10:22:01'),(3589,'Threaded Insert Kits','threaded-insert-kits',3586,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:22:05','2026-06-16 10:22:05'),(3590,'Sheet Metal Screw Kits','sheet-metal-screw-kits',3586,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:22:08','2026-06-16 10:22:08'),(3591,'Set Screw Kits','set-screw-kits',3586,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:22:11','2026-06-16 10:22:11'),(3592,'Self Drilling Screw Kits','self-drilling-screw-kits',3586,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:22:14','2026-06-16 10:22:14'),(3593,'Security Fastener Kits','security-fastener-kits',3586,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:22:18','2026-06-16 10:22:18'),(3594,'Security Fastener Kits','security-fastener-kits-1',3586,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:22:18','2026-06-16 10:22:18'),(3595,'Rivet Kits','rivet-kits',3586,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:22:22','2026-06-16 10:22:22'),(3596,'Ring Kits','ring-kits',3586,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:22:25','2026-06-16 10:22:25'),(3597,'Pin Kits','pin-kits',3586,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:22:29','2026-06-16 10:22:29'),(3598,'Nut Kits','nut-kits',3586,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:22:33','2026-06-16 10:22:33'),(3599,'Masonry Screw Kits','masonry-screw-kits',3586,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:22:36','2026-06-16 10:22:36'),(3600,'Maintenance Kits','maintenance-kits',3586,'These kits include essential components such as retaining rings, installation tools, and removal tools, making them perfect for both professionals and DIY enthusiasts. Designed for reliability, each kit ensures secure fastening and easy handling, helping to prevent component failure. With organized packaging for quick access, finding the right part for any project is efficient and hassle-free.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:22:40','2026-06-16 10:22:40'),(3601,'Machine Screw Kits','machine-screw-kits',3586,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:22:44','2026-06-16 10:22:44'),(3602,'Drywall Screw Kits','drywall-screw-kits',3586,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:22:47','2026-06-16 10:22:47'),(3603,'Drywall Screw Kits','drywall-screw-kits-1',3586,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:22:49','2026-06-16 10:22:49'),(3604,'Cap Screw Kits','cap-screw-kits',3586,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:22:52','2026-06-16 10:22:52'),(3605,'Bolt Kits','bolt-kits-1',3586,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:22:55','2026-06-16 10:22:55'),(3606,'Anchor Kits','anchor-kits-3',3586,'Anchor kits are essential for achieving secure fastening in concrete and masonry applications, making them invaluable for construction and DIY projects. These kits include a range of components, such as anchors, bolts, and installation tools, ensuring you have everything needed for reliable installations. Designed for durability and strength, each anchor kit provides stable support for heavy loads and long-lasting performance. With organized packaging for easy access, finding the right anchor for your specific needs is efficient and straightforward.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:23:00','2026-06-16 10:23:00'),(3607,'Anchor Kits','anchor-kits-4',3606,'Anchor Kits feature a variety of anchors, screws, and essential hardware to securely fasten items to various surfaces. These Anchor Kits ensure reliable support and stability when mounting shelves, hanging artwork, or securing fixtures. Select from a range of anchor sizes and types to meet your specific needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:26:02','2026-06-16 10:26:02'),(3608,'Drywall Anchors','drywall-anchors-2',3606,'Our Drywall Anchor Kits securely fasten in drywall, offering hassle-free installation. Complete with anchors, screws, and essential hardware, these kits provide reliable holding power and prevent wall damage. Mount shelves, pictures, or decorative items with confidence, as our Drywall Anchor Kits ensure stability and necessary support for your projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:26:05','2026-06-16 10:26:05'),(3609,'Wood Rocket Kit','wood-rocket-kit',3604,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:29:03','2026-06-16 10:29:03'),(3610,'Multi-Drive Screw Guide Bit Holder','multi-drive-screw-guide-bit-holder',3604,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:29:06','2026-06-16 10:29:06'),(3611,'Wall Plate Screw Kit','wall-plate-screw-kit',3604,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:29:09','2026-06-16 10:29:09'),(3612,'Cap Screw Kits','cap-screw-kits-1',3604,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:29:12','2026-06-16 10:29:12'),(3613,'Drywall Screw Kits','drywall-screw-kits-2',3602,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:31:33','2026-06-16 10:31:33'),(3614,'Stove Bolt Screw Kit','stove-bolt-screw-kit',3601,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:33:49','2026-06-16 10:33:49'),(3615,'Head Machine Screw Kit','head-machine-screw-kit',3601,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:33:52','2026-06-16 10:33:52'),(3616,'Machine Screw Assortment','machine-screw-assortment',3601,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:33:55','2026-06-16 10:33:55'),(3617,'Maintenance Kits','maintenance-kits-1',3600,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 10:35:30','2026-06-16 10:35:30'),(3618,'Masonry Screw Kits','masonry-screw-kits-1'