erials, our combination cable locks resist cutting and theft attempts. With convenient locking mechanisms, these locks offer flexible and adjustable security, ensuring peace of mind in any setting.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 11:36:14','2026-06-16 11:36:14'),(3630,'Gun and Trigger Locks','gun-and-trigger-locks',3626,'Ensure safe firearm storage with reliable Trigger Locks for Guns. Designed to prevent accidental discharge and unauthorized use, these trigger locks provide an additional layer of security. They feature easy installation and user-friendly operation, ensuring gun safety at home or during transport. Enhance your firearm security with accessories like handgun lock boxes and security cabinets.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 11:38:41','2026-06-16 11:38:41'),(3631,'Bicycles U-Locks','bicycles-u-locks',3626,'Ensure the security of your bicycle with our reliable U-Locks. These bicycle U-locks are designed to provide maximum protection against theft and unauthorized access. Constructed from durable materials, they have a high level of resistance to cutting and tampering. With their compact and portable design, these U-Locks are easy to carry and use, making them an essential accessory for cyclists.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 11:39:35','2026-06-16 11:39:35'),(3632,'Jobsite Locks','jobsite-locks',2431,'Jobsite locks provide enhanced security and control over access to construction sites, job trailers, and various jobsite equipment. They are designed to protect valuable tools, materials, and sensitive information, ensuring that only authorized personnel can access designated areas. The locks are ideal for construction sites, job trailers, gate access control, and temporary fencing applications.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 11:41:41','2026-06-16 11:41:41'),(3633,'Garage & Gate Hardware','garage-gate-hardware',5,'Shop a wide selection of replacement hardware to keep garage doors and gates secure. From garage seals and thresholds to locking handles and latches, we have the right components to repair or upgrade your commercial garage doors. Have a gate on your industrial property? Find gate closers and hydraulic hinges to keep gates properly shut. Get fast shipping and competitive prices on all garage door hardware and gate replacement parts at Global Industrial.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 11:41:53','2026-06-16 11:41:53'),(3634,'Gate Closers','gate-closers',3633,'Gate closers automatically close a gate to help increase safety and prevent unauthorized access. They feature a robust construction that can withstand years of use and typically have a tamper-resistant design. Gate closers are ideal for residential properties, commercial establishments, and construction sites.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 11:43:37','2026-06-16 11:43:37'),(3635,'Garage Seals & Thresholds','garage-seals-thresholds',3633,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 11:44:01','2026-06-16 11:44:01'),(3636,'Garage Door Replacement Hardware','garage-door-replacement-hardware',3633,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 11:44:01','2026-06-16 11:44:01'),(3637,'Key Control','key-control',2431,'Key Controls are designed to keep keys organized and secured, including key cabinets, key tags, and key accessories. Key control systems allow authorized personnel to securely store keys when not in use, track key usage and access, and manage key distribution and inventory. Key Controls are integral fixtures in environments where secured storage access and monitoring of multiple keys are essential, including rental management companies, auto body shops, offices, car lots, healthcare facilities, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 11:44:24','2026-06-16 11:44:24'),(3638,'Garage Door Hardware','garage-door-hardware',3636,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 11:45:29','2026-06-16 11:45:29'),(3639,'Garage Door Replacement Parts and Hardware','garage-door-replacement-parts-and-hardware',3635,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 11:46:59','2026-06-16 11:46:59'),(3640,'Garden Gate Closers','garden-gate-closers',3634,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 11:48:16','2026-06-16 11:48:16'),(3641,'Hydraulic Gate Closers','hydraulic-gate-closers',3634,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 11:48:21','2026-06-16 11:48:21'),(3642,'Key Cabinets','key-cabinets',3637,'Key cabinets are secure storage solutions intended specifically for keys. Large capacities can hold multiple keys simultaneously, making key organization easy and convenient. The cabinets are made of materials such as solid steel that ensure durability, while internal locking mechanisms prevent entry by those who are unauthorized. They are available in multiple size and key quantity options, making them ideal for key management in apartment complexes, offices, rental management companies, homes, car lots, body shops, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 11:48:52','2026-06-16 11:48:52'),(3643,'Hook-Style Single Tag Key Cabinets','hook-style-single-tag-key-cabinets',3642,'Hook-style key cabinets provide key organization, security, and storage for commercial, industrial, maintenance needs, and more. Select units include full-length hinged doors and key retaining features to prevent security key removal without locking the cabinet. Most models include 2 keys, key holders, and cross-reference charts. Many different sizes are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 11:50:14','2026-06-16 11:50:14'),(3644,'Electronic Lock Key Safes','electronic-lock-key-safes',3642,'Electronic lock key safes secure & organize keys and valuables behind a battery-powered access cabinet. The removable faceplate reveals a backup key lock in the event of power failure. Most models are wall mountable. Lock key safes are available in many sizes and are made from a variety of durable materials. Dimensions and additional specifications vary.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 11:51:35','2026-06-16 11:51:35'),(3645,'Lockbox For Keys - Key Safe Storage Systems','lockbox-for-keys-key-safe-storage-systems',3642,'Lockbox For Keys - Key Safe Storage Systems provide secure storage of keys, access cards or other personal items. Systems are made from durable metal or steel for maximum security. Resettable dial or push button locks allow thousands of combinations for theft protection. Lockboxes for keys come in various sizes with different lock types.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 11:53:50','2026-06-16 11:53:50'),(3646,'Single Tag Slotted Key Cabinets','single-tag-slotted-key-cabinets',3642,'Single-Tag Slotted Key Cabinets provide an ideal way to store and organize keys safely. Constructed from durable cold rolled steel and finished with a scratch-resistant powder coat, these cabinets are tough and secure. Cabinets feature pre-drilled mounting holes for easy wall installation and include a clear pocket for easy viewing of keys. Available in several sizes and key capacities.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 11:55:12','2026-06-16 11:55:12'),(3647,'Hook-Style Two-Tag Key Cabinets','hook-style-two-tag-key-cabinets',3642,'Hook-Style Two-Tag Key Cabinets provide secure key storage with a built-in numbering system and reinforced eyelet key tags. Made of heavy gauge steel, they come in different styles and sizes, with hundreds of key hooks, lock options, adjustable shelves, a key log sheet, colored key tags, mounting hardware, and multiple lock box keys.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 11:57:20','2026-06-16 11:57:20'),(3648,'Emergency Key Boxes','emergency-key-boxes',3642,'Emergency key boxes are brightly colored and can easily be spotted in an emergency. The keys are easy to obtain by breaking the glass with the attached hammer or unlocking it with the key provided in a non-emergency situation. Boxes are constructed from durable materials and some models feature pre-drilled holes for easy mounting. Various sizes and styles are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 11:58:08','2026-06-16 11:58:08'),(3649,'General Purpose Hardware','general-purpose-hardware',5,'From hooks and magnets to turnbuckles and spacers, we have the hardware you need to assemble, secure, and reinforce various applications. Browse through our inventory to find jack screws, fittings, bodies, assemblies, and more in various materials, including steel, stainless steel, and brass. Whether you\'re a professional contractor, a maintenance technician, or a do-it-yourself enthusiast, Global Industrial is your one-stop shop for all your fastening and hardware needs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 11:58:37','2026-06-16 11:58:37'),(3650,'Drop-In Key Control Boxes','drop-in-key-control-boxes',3642,'Drop in key control boxes are ideal for rental facilities, fleet trucking depots, storage facilities & more. These key control boxes help prevent keys from getting lost or stolen and allow customers or employees to easily drop off keys at any time of the day. The tamper-resistant key box can be mounted to walls, carts or doors with pre-drilled holes. Various styles are available.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 11:59:11','2026-06-16 11:59:11'),(3651,'Florence Key Keepers','florence-key-keepers',3642,'Florence key keepers provide added security and limited access to multi-unit buildings. Key keepers are designed to hold the key to the front door ensuring it stays safe and they are constructed from a heavy gauge corrosion-resistant aluminum for long-lasting durability. Interior dimensions and other measurements vary per model.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 12:00:04','2026-06-16 12:00:04'),(3652,'See Through Key Cabinets','see-through-key-cabinets',3642,'See-through key cabinets feature a space-maximizing design that offers ample storage for keys, badges, and cards. These cabinets provide quick visibility and secure key storage and safety. Various sizes and styles of key cabinets are available. Some models feature pre-drilled holes and include mounting hardware for easy installation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 12:02:13','2026-06-16 12:02:13'),(3653,'Turnbuckles','turnbuckles',3649,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 12:04:19','2026-06-16 12:04:19'),(3654,'Spacers & Standoffs','spacers-standoffs',3649,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 12:04:21','2026-06-16 12:04:21'),(3655,'Magnets','magnets',3649,'Magnets are objects possessing magnetic fields capable of attracting ferrous materials like iron, nickel, or cobalt. They are crafted from durable materials like neodymium or ceramic, providing exceptional strength and dependability, making them ideal for manufacturing, construction, mining, and more. Magnets are used for lifting and handling heavy objects, separating materials in production lines, securing workpieces during machining, or cleaning metal debris from floors or surfaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 12:04:24','2026-06-16 12:04:24'),(3656,'Hooks','hooks',3649,'Hooks provide an easy way to hang clothes, towels, or other items to help keep a space organized. They are easy to install and made from durable materials to ensure long-lasting use. Hooks are commonly used in retail settings, hotels, and any other commercial space.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-16 12:04:27','2026-06-16 12:04:27'),(3657,'Key Accessories','key-accessories',3637,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 12:15:29','2026-06-16 12:15:29'),(3658,'Wire Cable Key Ring','wire-cable-key-ring',3657,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 12:29:41','2026-06-16 12:29:41'),(3659,'Wrist Coil Key Ring','wrist-coil-key-ring',3657,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 12:30:26','2026-06-16 12:30:26'),(3660,'Pull Apart Key Accessory','pull-apart-key-accessory',3657,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 12:31:12','2026-06-16 12:31:12'),(3661,'Carabineer with Split Ring Key Holder','carabineer-with-split-ring-key-holder',3657,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 12:32:25','2026-06-16 12:32:25'),(3662,'Key Tags','key-tags',3637,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 12:33:35','2026-06-16 12:33:35'),(3663,'ID Key Tags','id-key-tags',3662,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 12:34:19','2026-06-16 12:34:19'),(3664,'Key Tags for Hooked Two-Tag Key Cabinets','key-tags-for-hooked-two-tag-key-cabinets',3662,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 12:35:13','2026-06-16 12:35:13'),(3665,'Lockout Tagout Devices','lockout-tagout-devices',2431,'Lockout tagout devices are essential safety and security tools designed to prevent accidental equipment startup or energization during maintenance, repair, or servicing procedures. They feature durable construction, user-friendly design, and highly visible identification. Lockout devices are available in various forms, including lockout hasps, safety tags, lockout padlocks, and more. They are commonly used in industrial settings, manufacturing facilities, construction sites, power plants, and other environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 13:00:31','2026-06-16 13:00:31'),(3666,'Lockout Padlocks','lockout-padlocks',3665,'Lockout padlocks enhance safety and security in industrial and commercial settings. Made with durable materials to withstand demanding environments, safety lockout padlocks provide reliable lockout and tagout solutions to prevent accidents and unauthorized access to machinery, energy sources, and more. Keying options include smart padlocks and padlock sets keyed alike and different.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 13:01:33','2026-06-16 13:01:33'),(3667,'Lockout Kits','lockout-kits',3665,'Lockout Kits are crucial in promoting workplace safety by preventing accidental equipment activation during maintenance or servicing. These kits offer comprehensive solutions that include all the critical lockout devices and tags necessary to isolate machinery and control energy sources effectively. In hazardous workplaces, using lockout kits is essential to prevent accidents and ensure compliance with safety regulations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-16 13:03:55','2026-06-16 13:03:55'),(3668,'U-Shaped and Button Type Magnets','u-shaped-and-button-type-magnets',3655,'U-shaped and Button Type Magnets provide solid magnetic force, making them ideal for applications requiring a secure hold or closure. These magnets feature an iron plate on the magnetic surface to avoid demagnetization and a center hole for mounting. Their shapes and magnetic strength make them suitable for diverse uses, from holding tools and fixtures to magnetic assemblies or fastening systems.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 10:36:45','2026-06-17 10:36:45'),(3669,'Solid Disk-Shaped Raw Magnets','solid-disk-shaped-raw-magnets',3655,'Solid Disk-Shaped Raw Magnets are used for various commercial, industrial, and engineering applications. Raw magnets can have substantially higher adhesive forces depending on the air gap between the magnet and mating component. They feature a temperature resistance of up to 175°F and a durable steel construction for long-lasting dependability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 10:36:48','2026-06-17 10:36:48'),(3670,'Setting Bolt with Magnet','setting-bolt-with-magnet',3655,'Setting bolts with magnets are versatile pieces of hardware used for fastening applications within machinery. With convenient magnets that hold them in place, these setting bolts can be used as workpiece stops in factories, workshops, and more. Setting bolts with magnets are available in a range of thread sizes and diameters. Some include a locking nut to secure the bolt after positioning.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 10:36:52','2026-06-17 10:36:52'),(3671,'Multi-Pole Disc and Round Magnets','multi-pole-disc-and-round-magnets',3655,'Multi-Pole Disc and Round Magnets create strong, consistent magnetic fields across their surface, enabling efficient attachment and holding. These magnets ensure consistent magnetic performance, serving as reliable tools for securely fastening, organizing, or holding materials, making them ideal for manufacturing and other industrial uses.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 10:36:55','2026-06-17 10:36:55'),(3672,'Multi-Pole Rectangular Magnets','multi-pole-rectangular-magnets',3655,'Multi-Pole Rectangular Magnets offer distinctive advantages when compared to traditional magnets. They embed a specific magnetic function that concentrates the magnetic field, enhancing performance when attracted to metal surfaces. From magnetic assemblies to clamping systems or magnetic separation, these multi-pole magnets are ideal for use in manufacturing, construction, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 10:36:59','2026-06-17 10:36:59'),(3673,'Round Neodymium Latch Magnet Kits','round-neodymium-latch-magnet-kits',3655,'Round Neodymium Latch Magnet Kits are crafted specifically to serve as door latches, but can also be used for closures on chests, cabinets, and various other applications. Their compact round shape and strong magnetic force ensure reliable performance, making them ideal for fastening needs in various settings. These latch magnet kits come with all the items needed for easy installation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 10:37:03','2026-06-17 10:37:03'),(3674,'Retaining Magnet Assemblies','retaining-magnet-assemblies',3655,'Retaining Magnet Assemblies are versatile solutions designed for secure and reliable fastening. Constructed with durable materials, these magnet assemblies provide strong magnetic force and enhanced holding power. Suitable for industrial, commercial, or DIY applications, these magnets ensure efficient holding and securing of various items, tools, or equipment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 10:37:06','2026-06-17 10:37:06'),(3675,'Round Base Magnets','round-base-magnets',3655,'Round base magnets are powerful magnets used for attaching lamps, signs, inspection equipment, or indicator gauges. The durable material and strong magnetic force ensure reliable holding power, making them suitable for workshops, warehouses, and more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 10:37:10','2026-06-17 10:37:10'),(3676,'Round Magnets with Hooks','round-magnets-with-hooks',3655,'Round Magnets with Hooks are versatile accessories designed to combine a magnet\'s strength with a hook\'s functionality. They can be easily attached to any magnetic surface and have high weight capacities to hold various items. High-quality construction ensures durability and long-term use. These heavy-duty magnets are great for commercial and residential use.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 10:37:13','2026-06-17 10:37:13'),(3677,'Male Female Standoffs','male-female-standoffs',3654,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 10:45:22','2026-06-17 10:45:22'),(3678,'Jack Screws','jack-screws',3654,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 10:45:26','2026-06-17 10:45:26'),(3679,'Spacers','spacers',3654,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 10:45:29','2026-06-17 10:45:29'),(3680,'Standoffs','standoffs',3654,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 10:45:33','2026-06-17 10:45:33'),(3681,'Round Standoffs','round-standoffs',3680,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 10:47:30','2026-06-17 10:47:30'),(3682,'Hex Standoffs','hex-standoffs',3680,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 10:47:33','2026-06-17 10:47:33'),(3683,'Round Spacers','round-spacers',3679,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 10:48:58','2026-06-17 10:48:58'),(3684,'Hex Jackscrews','hex-jackscrews',3678,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 10:50:53','2026-06-17 10:50:53'),(3685,'Hex Standoffs Male-Female','hex-stand