steners, you can optimize the performance of your machinery and ensure smooth and efficient operations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 11:07:11','2026-06-17 11:07:11'),(3699,'Plungers','plungers-1',3698,'Plungers are tools utilized in plumbing and mechanical tasks to create seals and apply pressure. They feature ergonomic handles and rubber suction cups or flanges that generate a vacuum to dislodge blockages or exert pressure for clamping or indexing needs. Plungers are constructed with sturdy materials and flexible components for sealing on various surfaces. They are widely used for unclogging drains and toilets in both residential and industrial environments.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 11:11:58','2026-06-17 11:11:58'),(3700,'Machine Handles','machine-handles-1',3698,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 11:12:02','2026-06-17 11:12:02'),(3701,'Knobs','knobs-1',3698,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 11:12:07','2026-06-17 11:12:07'),(3702,'Handwheels','handwheels-1',3698,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 11:12:10','2026-06-17 11:12:10'),(3703,'Hand Knobs','hand-knobs-1',3698,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 11:12:15','2026-06-17 11:12:15'),(3704,'Gear Lever Arms','gear-lever-arms-1',3698,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 11:12:18','2026-06-17 11:12:18'),(3705,'Adjustable Clamping Handles','adjustable-clamping-handles-1',3698,'Adjustable clamping handles provide secure gripping during machining applications. Clamping levers are adjustable to fit a variety of hole sizes and shapes and offer a comfortable grip and ergonomic design. They are ideal for quick and easy horizontal and vertical clamping. Available in steel, aluminum, and stainless steel versions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 11:12:21','2026-06-17 11:12:21'),(3706,'Plastic Handles w/ Stainless Components','plastic-handles-w-stainless-components',3705,'Plastic handles with stainless steel components are highly versatile for securely fastening industrial equipment. The handles are lightweight and ergonomically designed for a comfortable grip, while the stainless steel components add strength and resistance to corrosion. These handles are ideal for manufacturing and machinery operations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 11:16:59','2026-06-17 11:16:59'),(3707,'Die Cast Handles w/ Stainless Components','die-cast-handles-w-stainless-components',3705,'Die-cast handles with stainless steel components provide secure and ergonomic grip, making installation easy and ensuring durability in various applications. They are versatile and ideal for use in confined spaces or for specific lever positions. Made of corrosion-resistant materials, they are used in industrial machinery, commercial fixtures, and residential doors or cabinets.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 11:17:02','2026-06-17 11:17:02'),(3708,'Plastic Handles w/ Steel Components','plastic-handles-w-steel-components',3705,'Plastic handles with steel components offer the advantage of adjustable and reliable clamping, making them ideal for industrial parts applications. Adjustable plastic handles are designed to clamp parts in a particular area or lever position. The plastic handles have a rugged construction that integrates the durability of steel for lasting performance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 11:17:05','2026-06-17 11:17:05'),(3709,'Die-Cast Handles w/ Steel Components','die-cast-handles-w-steel-components',3705,'Die-Cast handles with steel components are ideal for clamping industrial parts or putting parts in a particular lever position. The die-cast handles are engineered from high-quality materials and feature the strength of steel components to offer durable performance. Die-cast handles ensure reliable performance under demanding conditions and are ideal for machining and industrial processes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 11:17:08','2026-06-17 11:17:08'),(3710,'Lockout Kits','lockout-kits-1',3665,'Lockout Kits are crucial in promoting workplace safety by preventing accidental equipment activation during maintenance or servicing. These kits offer comprehensive solutions that include all the critical lockout devices and tags necessary to isolate machinery and control energy sources effectively. In hazardous workplaces, using lockout kits is essential to prevent accidents and ensure compliance with safety regulations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-17 11:17:31','2026-06-17 11:17:31'),(3711,'Gear Lever Handles w/ Ball Knob','gear-lever-handles-w-ball-knob',3704,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 11:19:03','2026-06-17 11:19:03'),(3712,'Lockout Devices','lockout-devices',3665,'Lockout devices are essential for any lockout or tagout safety procedures. Affix the devices to any designated equipment, preventing accidental or unauthorized operation. With bright colors and clear warning labels, the lockout devices are easily noticeable, enhancing workplace safety. The lockout devices are available in various sizes to accommodate different equipment types and are suitable for a variety of industrial machinery.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-17 11:19:22','2026-06-17 11:19:22'),(3713,'Lockout Accessories','lockout-accessories',3665,'Lockout Accessories such as group lock boxes, padlock wall racks, tagout cards, and padlock labels are designed to enhance safety measures and complement lockout and tagout devices. Lockout accessories feature durable materials and standardized designs, ensuring effective and standardized lockout procedures. They\'re commonly used in industrial settings to prevent accidents and promote a secure work environment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-17 11:20:30','2026-06-17 11:20:30'),(3714,'Lockout Hasps','lockout-hasps',3665,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-17 11:21:29','2026-06-17 11:21:29'),(3715,'Lockout & Safety Tags','loc