ration mounts, and machinery feet, to provide stability and reduce the impact of vibrations on your machinery. By using our pads and dampers, you can minimize the risk of equipment failure, improve productivity, and increase the lifespan of your machinery.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,100,'2026-06-17 13:27:53','2026-06-17 13:27:53'),(3779,'Bicycle Storage','bicycle-storage',30,'Bicycle storage solutions keep bikes safe and secure when not in use. They come in different forms, ranging from racks and stands to shelters or enclosures. Made of steel or aluminum, they may have locks or cables for added security. Bike storage solutions can be found in various settings, such as residential buildings, commercial properties, schools, universities, parks, and public transportation stations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-17 15:22:29','2026-06-17 15:22:29'),(3780,'Bins, Totes, & Containers','bins-totes-containers-1',30,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-17 15:23:41','2026-06-17 15:23:41'),(3781,'Cabinets','cabinets-1',30,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-17 15:24:33','2026-06-17 15:24:33'),(3782,'Lockers','lockers',30,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-17 15:25:31','2026-06-17 15:25:31'),(3783,'Mailboxes & Drop Boxes','mailboxes-drop-boxes',30,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-17 15:26:42','2026-06-17 15:26:42'),(3784,'Pallet Racks & Components','pallet-racks-components',30,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-17 15:27:31','2026-06-17 15:27:31'),(3785,'Racks','racks-1',30,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-17 15:29:24','2026-06-17 15:29:24'),(3786,'Shelving','shelving-1',30,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-17 15:30:09','2026-06-17 15:30:09'),(3787,'Storage Panels','storage-panels',30,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-17 15:31:44','2026-06-17 15:31:44'),(3788,'Structural Framing','structural-framing',30,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-17 15:33:09','2026-06-17 15:33:09'),(3789,'Structural Framing','structural-framing-1',30,'Structural framing solutions include T-slotted Extrusion Profiles, T-Nuts, Linear Bearings, Button Head Socket Cap Screws, Shaft Mounting Bases and Blocks - all necessary for storage structure stability. Constructed from sturdy materials, components ensure structural durability and long-lasting performance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-17 15:34:48','2026-06-17 15:34:48'),(3790,'Desk Calendars','desk-calendars',637,'Desk calendars are essential tools for staying organized and managing time effectively in both office and home settings. Available in various designs and formats, these calendars offer ample space for notes and appointments, helping you keep track of important dates. Durable and stylish, they enhance your workspace while ensuring that you never miss a deadline.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-18 08:54:34','2026-06-18 08:54:34'),(3791,'Planners','planners',637,'These planners are ideal for professionals, students, and anyone looking to manage their time efficiently. Featuring various layouts, including daily, weekly, and monthly views, they cater to different planning preferences and needs. Appointment books help track meetings, deadlines, and important events while providing space for notes and reminders.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-18 08:55:25','2026-06-18 08:55:25'),(3792,'Wall Calendars','wall-calendars',637,'These calendars are ideal for offices, classrooms, and homes, providing a clear view of important dates and schedules. With various designs, sizes, and layouts, they cater to diverse needs, from simple monthly views to detailed yearly planners. Wall calendars not only help keep track of appointments and deadlines but also serve as functional décor to brighten up any space.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-18 08:56:44','2026-06-18 08:56:44'),(3793,'Audio & Video','audio-video',638,'Audio and video technologies are used for recording, transmitting, and reproducing sound and visual content. Audio equipment includes microphones, speakers, amplifiers, and recording devices, while video equipment comprises of cameras, displays, projectors, and mounts. They have high-definition resolution, clear sound and video quality, compatibility with different formats, and connectivity options such as Bluetooth and Wi-Fi. Audio and video equipment are utilized in schools, conference rooms, broadcast studios, event venues, and public spaces.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,1,0,'2026-06-18 09:02:04','2026-06-18 09:02:04');
